-- Spanish translations of the objective texts (see i18n.lua).
-- Key: the English text of the step. Value: its Spanish text.
-- Names of zones, places, NPCs, monsters and items stay in English.

return {
    ["\"A jewel with a bluish tint, near the bank of a certain river\" is a Siren's Tear: a ??? along the river near (J-9) in North Gustaberg (the Port Bastok exit is closest). Unequip your main and sub weapons to pick it up."] = "\"A jewel with a bluish tint, near the bank of a certain river\" es una Siren's Tear: una ??? junto al río cerca de (J-9) en North Gustaberg (la salida de Port Bastok es la más cercana). Quítate el arma principal y la secundaria para recogerla.",
    ["\"A stone as red as blood, in a land of geysers\" is a Dangruf Stone: Dangruf Wadi (I/J-5)."] = "\"A stone as red as blood, in a land of geysers\" es una Dangruf Stone: Dangruf Wadi (I/J-5).",
    ["\"Golden sand. found only on a certain beach\" is Sunsand: Valkurm Dunes (H-9), only during dust storms. It's the only one sold at the Auction House (Other > Misc.)."] = "\"Golden sand. found only on a certain beach\" es Sunsand: Valkurm Dunes (H-9), solo durante tormentas de polvo. Es el único que se vende en la Auction House (Other > Misc.).",
    ["\"Stone\", the full name of what you're casting (the quotes are not necessary for single words, but will be for \"Stone II\" and onwards)"] = "\"Stone\", el nombre completo de lo que lanzas (las comillas no hacen falta para una sola palabra, pero sí para \"Stone II\" en adelante)",
    ["#8, #11, #14 at the end of the only path; #9 up both stairs, left, left again at the bridge over the water, in the middle (Gargoyles aggro at night near their alcoves); #10 across both bridges, southwest side of the last platform; #12 Sneak, up both stairs, right, past the staircase on the left at (J-7); #13 across the first bridge by the first large pillar on the left."] = "#8, #11, #14 al final del único camino; #9 subiendo ambas escaleras, izquierda, de nuevo izquierda en el puente sobre el agua, en el centro (las Gargoyles atacan de noche cerca de sus nichos); #10 cruzando ambos puentes, lado suroeste de la última plataforma; #12 con Sneak, subiendo ambas escaleras, derecha, pasando la escalera de la izquierda en (J-7); #13 cruzando el primer puente junto a la primera columna grande de la izquierda.",
    ["(I'll be using Playstation's default button mappings throughout when describing controllers. ABXY isn't consistent between Microsoft/Nintendo controllers, so it's the easiest way.)"] = "(En toda la guía uso la asignación de botones por defecto de Playstation para los mandos. ABXY no es igual en los mandos de Microsoft y Nintendo, así que es lo más sencillo.)",
    ["(Optional - but see below...) Now that you're rank 6, you can collect a bunch of new Trusts."] = "(Opcional, pero ver abajo...) Ahora que eres rango 6, puedes conseguir un montón de Trusts nuevos.",
    ["(Optional) If you've completed Trust: San d'Oria, you can also collect the Curilla trust by talking to Curilla in Chateau d'Oraguille (I-9). She's a tank, but not quite as effective as Valaineral."] = "(Opcional) Si has completado Trust: San d'Oria, también puedes conseguir el trust de Curilla hablando con Curilla en Chateau d'Oraguille (I-9). Es tanque, pero no tan eficaz como Valaineral.",
    ["(Optional) If you've completed Trust: Windurst and collected 4x alt=Yagudo Bead Necklaces, go to Nanaa Mihgo in Windurst Woods (J-3) and use the necklaces to complete her quest, Mihgo's Amigo. Afterwards, zone out and/or wait one game day, then talk to her again. If you happen to pick up the Rock Racketeer quest, then talk to her a few more times to trigger the Trust cutscene. She's a Thief, so she provides Treasure Hunter to improve your item drop chances. She also has Despoil to steal items, and any items she steals will be given to you."] = "(Opcional) Si has completado Trust: Windurst y reunido 4x alt=Yagudo Bead Necklaces, ve con Nanaa Mihgo en Windurst Woods (J-3) y usa los collares para completar su quest, Mihgo's Amigo. Después, cambia de zona y/o espera un día de juego y vuelve a hablar con ella. Si coges la quest Rock Racketeer, habla con ella unas cuantas veces más para activar la escena del Trust. Es Thief, así que aporta Treasure Hunter para mejorar tus probabilidades de drop. También tiene Despoil para robar objetos, y te da todo lo que roba.",
    ["(Optional) If your nation is Bastok or San d'Oria, keep any Yagudo Bead Necklaces that drop from Yagudo enemies during your visit to Giddeus. We need 4 of these to unlock a Trust. If you don't get enough now, you can collect more in Castle Oztroja during Mission 4-1."] = "(Opcional) Si tu nación es Bastok o San d'Oria, guarda los Yagudo Bead Necklaces que suelten los enemigos Yagudo durante tu visita a Giddeus. Necesitamos 4 para desbloquear un Trust. Si ahora no consigues suficientes, puedes reunir más en Castle Oztroja durante la Mission 4-1.",
    ["(Optional) If your nation is Windurst, keep any Yagudo Bead Necklaces that drop from Yagudo enemies during your visit to Giddeus. We can turn in 4 of these to unlock a Trust later. If you don't get enough now, you can collect more in Castle Oztroja during Mission 3-1 or 4-1."] = "(Opcional) Si tu nación es Windurst, guarda los Yagudo Bead Necklaces que suelten los enemigos Yagudo durante tu visita a Giddeus. Podemos entregar 4 para desbloquear un Trust más adelante. Si ahora no consigues suficientes, puedes reunir más en Castle Oztroja durante la Mission 3-1 o 4-1.",
    ["(Optional) Speaking of Trusts, complete Trust: Bastok, Trust: San d'Oria, and Trust: Windurst (whichever two you don't have yet) while you're visiting. Each gives you a new Cipher, and unlocks that nation's Trust NPC as someone you can trade your Ciphers to."] = "(Opcional) Hablando de Trusts, completa Trust: Bastok, Trust: San d'Oria y Trust: Windurst (los dos que aún no tengas) durante la visita. Cada uno te da un Cipher nuevo y desbloquea al NPC de Trust de esa nación como alguien al que entregar tus Ciphers.",
    ["(This Trust NPC does nothing but unlock Trusts with the Cipher items. Since there are a lot of Trusts, you should be prepared to come back here once in a while.)"] = "(Este NPC de Trust solo desbloquea Trusts con los objetos Cipher. Como hay muchos Trusts, prepárate para volver aquí de vez en cuando.)",
    ["(This guide will get that down to a single button soon. Ctrl-F for \"macros\" if you can't wait.)"] = "(Esta guía lo dejará pronto en un solo botón. Busca \"macros\" con Ctrl-F si no puedes esperar.)",
    ["(You may not want to spend gil on the level-up key items from the nearby Skipper Moogles, since there's another currency you can use for payment once you reach Adoulin. If you have extra gil, go for it, otherwise wait to use the Adoulin currency, Bayld, to buy the same items from Zenicca.)"] = "(Quizá no quieras gastar gil en los key items de mejora de los Skipper Moogles de al lado, ya que hay otra moneda con la que pagar cuando llegues a Adoulin. Si te sobra gil, adelante; si no, espera a usar la moneda de Adoulin, el Bayld, para comprar los mismos objetos a Zenicca.)",
    ["(a Beastmaster, Dragoon, Puppetmaster, or Summoner's pet)"] = "(la mascota de un Beastmaster, Dragoon, Puppetmaster o Summoner)",
    ["(brings up a subtarget selection arrow to pick a target)"] = "(muestra una flecha de selección secundaria para elegir objetivo)",
    ["(the person in the second slot in the party)."] = "(la persona del segundo puesto del grupo).",
    ["(you, the player)"] = "(tú, el jugador)",
    ["+100% weapon skill up rate"] = "+100% de velocidad de subida de skill de arma",
    ["+30% EXP earned forever"] = "+30% de EXP ganada para siempre",
    [", your current target, who you're casting it on"] = ", tu objetivo actual, sobre quien lo lanzas",
    ["- \"Once per week\" means \"once per IRL week\", which in FFXI rolls over at Japan time midnight on Sunday. (8:00 a.m. (PDT) / 3:00 p.m. (GMT) / 4:00 p.m. (BST)) Whenever someone says \"week\", what they mean is \"Sunday JP 12:01 AM to Saturday JP 11:59 PM\". (This is the same time that Conquest status is calculated, Sparks spending limits are reset, and so on.)"] = "- \"Una vez por semana\" significa una vez por semana real, que en FFXI se reinicia a medianoche del domingo, hora de Japón. (8:00 a.m. (PDT) / 3:00 p.m. (GMT) / 4:00 p.m. (BST)) Cuando alguien dice \"semana\", quiere decir \"del domingo a las 12:01 AM de Japón al sábado a las 11:59 PM de Japón\". (Es el mismo momento en que se calcula el estado de Conquest, se reinician los límites de gasto de Sparks, etc.)",
    ["- (And how many months of it include FFXI.)"] = "- (Y cuántos meses de ella incluyen FFXI.)",
    ["- (But not far from a Home Point.)"] = "- (Pero no lejos de un Home Point.)",
    ["- (This is somehow not a joke. They're heavier, so they can open the door solo.)"] = "- (Aunque parezca mentira, no es broma. Son más pesados, así que pueden abrir la puerta solos.)",
    ["- (even though he already Trusts you.)"] = "- (aunque ya confía en ti.)",
    ["- (or at least enter it.)"] = "- (o al menos entra.)",
    ["- ...and eventually you'd take the ferry to Selbina if you wanted to level in Valkurm Dunes like it's 2004. (Sorry, Windurst players. Just use the faster method in the next paragraph if you do want to go there.)"] = "- ...y al final tomarías el ferry a Selbina si quisieras subir de nivel en Valkurm Dunes como en 2004. (Lo siento, jugadores de Windurst. Si queréis ir allí, usad el método más rápido del párrafo siguiente.)",
    ["- ...for the first of many times."] = "- ...la primera de muchas veces.",
    ["- ...it's high enough 4 now."] = "- ...ya es bastante 4 ahora.",
    ["- ...to Selbina."] = "- ...hasta Selbina.",
    ["- 30 initial slots, can be expanded to 80 slots"] = "- 30 huecos iniciales, ampliables a 80",
    ["- 30 initial slots, expands with your inventory"] = "- 30 huecos iniciales, se amplía con tu inventario",
    ["- 50 initial slots, can be expanded to 80 slots"] = "- 50 huecos iniciales, ampliables a 80",
    ["- 80 slots each, you may purchase more Wardrobes (up to 8 total) for an additional $2 per month"] = "- 80 huecos cada uno; puedes comprar más Wardrobes (hasta 8 en total) por 2 $ más al mes",
    ["- 80 slots, cannot be expanded"] = "- 80 huecos, no se puede ampliar",
    ["- Admittedly, using different zone lines in different directions."] = "- Es verdad que por límites de zona distintos y en direcciones distintas.",
    ["- All gear that you plan to use should be put into a wardrobe as soon as possible!"] = "- ¡Todo el equipo que vayas a usar debería ir a un wardrobe cuanto antes!",
    ["- Alternatively, walk through Ranguemont Pass, located in the NE corner of East Ronfaure, but watch out for the level 80 goblins they added so that people could level here at 75, which nobody ever did."] = "- También puedes cruzar caminando Ranguemont Pass, en la esquina noreste de East Ronfaure, pero cuidado con los goblins de nivel 80 que añadieron para que la gente subiera de nivel aquí a 75, cosa que nadie hizo nunca.",
    ["- And also level it up."] = "- Y súbelo de nivel también.",
    ["- And find yourself level capped."] = "- Y descubre que te has topado con el límite de nivel.",
    ["- And get capped again."] = "- Y vuelve a toparte con el límite.",
    ["- And get capped... again."] = "- Y vuelve a toparte con el límite... otra vez.",
    ["- And swap to a new Job if you want."] = "- Y cambia a un job nuevo si quieres.",
    ["- Assist Channel"] = "- Assist Channel",
    ["- At least this Limit Break's easy."] = "- Al menos este Limit Break es fácil.",
    ["- Autosort ON"] = "- Autosort ON",
    ["- Bastok: Konschtat Highlands, and northeast to"] = "- Bastok: Konschtat Highlands, y al noreste hacia",
    ["- Batallia Downs, which connects to Upper Jeuno"] = "- Batallia Downs, que conecta con Upper Jeuno",
    ["- Brygid thinks it's long overdue."] = "- Brygid cree que ya iba siendo hora.",
    ["- Call Forth an Alter Ego (You can't do this until you're level 5. See below.)"] = "- Call Forth an Alter Ego (no puedes hacerlo hasta nivel 5; ver más abajo.)",
    ["- Clearing Aht Urhgan Mission 12 to progress past RoV 2-7, which is just killing some level 62-65 enemies for a dropped item."] = "- Superar la Aht Urhgan Mission 12 para pasar de la RoV 2-7, que solo consiste en matar algunos enemigos de nivel 62-65 para conseguir un objeto.",
    ["- Clearing CoP 3-2 to progress past RoV 2-2."] = "- Superar la CoP 3-2 para pasar de la RoV 2-2.",
    ["- Complete the quest Open Sesame to obtain this."] = "- Completa la quest Open Sesame para conseguirla.",
    ["- Completing the following Rhapsodies Mission 1-17 (which is just a cutscene) gets you Zeid II, a DPS trust who's typically stronger than any other except Shantotto II. You probably want to use him on your climb to 99, even over Semih Lafihna if necessary."] = "- Completar la siguiente, la Rhapsodies Mission 1-17 (que es solo una escena), te da a Zeid II, un trust de daño normalmente más fuerte que cualquier otro salvo Shantotto II. Seguramente quieras usarlo en tu subida al 99, incluso por encima de Semih Lafihna si hace falta.",
    ["- Congratulations! You now have every Survival Guide that doesn't require expansion mission progress."] = "- ¡Enhorabuena! Ya tienes todas las Survival Guides que no requieren avanzar en misiones de expansión.",
    ["- Continue your story"] = "- Sigue con tu historia",
    ["- Deal 10-20 damage"] = "- Deal 10-20 damage",
    ["- Do the first few missions for your home nation."] = "- Haz las primeras misiones de tu nación.",
    ["- Don't forget the \"Conflict: Caedarva Mire\" RoE objective in the category \"Combat (Aht Urhgan)\", since rapid Chigoe kills make it even better than usual."] = "- No olvides el objetivo de RoE \"Conflict: Caedarva Mire\" de la categoría \"Combat (Aht Urhgan)\", ya que matar Chigoes tan rápido lo hace aún mejor de lo normal.",
    ["- Drop down a hole at (I-5) to a HP at (H-5)."] = "- Déjate caer por un agujero en (I-5) hasta un HP en (H-5).",
    ["- Drop down a hole at (J-9) to a HP at (J-9)."] = "- Déjate caer por un agujero en (J-9) hasta un HP en (J-9).",
    ["- Drop down a hole at (K-6) to a HP at (K-7)."] = "- Déjate caer por un agujero en (K-6) hasta un HP en (K-7).",
    ["- Each of those three zones also has an attached dungeon (Garlaige Citadel, Eldieme Necropolis, and Crawler's Nest) with a Survival Guide inside it near the entrance."] = "- Cada una de esas tres zonas tiene además una mazmorra conectada (Garlaige Citadel, Eldieme Necropolis y Crawler's Nest) con una Survival Guide dentro, cerca de la entrada.",
    ["- Effect OFF"] = "- Effect OFF",
    ["- FFXI has absolutely garbage tutorials."] = "- Los tutoriales de FFXI son malísimos.",
    ["- From this point forward in the guide, I will simply be saying \"use the level 125 Unity warp to Batallia Downs\" rather than repeating the full explanation every time."] = "- A partir de aquí, en la guía diré simplemente \"usa el Unity warp de nivel 125 a Batallia Downs\" en lugar de repetir toda la explicación cada vez.",
    ["- Garlaige Citadel part two - levels 42-50 - ...until you hit about 42, at which point you can drop down the first hole on the left from the entrance, then walk north to the stairs and kill Citadel Bats there. Do not go anywhere else in the basement, because it's all level 60+."] = "- Garlaige Citadel, segunda parte - niveles 42-50 - ...hasta que llegues a 42 aproximadamente; entonces puedes dejarte caer por el primer agujero de la izquierda desde la entrada, caminar al norte hasta las escaleras y matar allí Citadel Bats. No vayas a ningún otro sitio del sótano, porque todo es de nivel 60+.",
    ["- Get a party of NPCs to back you up."] = "- Consigue un grupo de NPCs que te respalde.",
    ["- Grind another currency, and get a good Trust too."] = "- Farmea otra moneda y consigue también un buen Trust.",
    ["- Heal Without Using Magic"] = "- Heal Without Using Magic",
    ["- However - Sauromugue Champaign's maw is actually up on a mesa you can't climb. You have to go through Garlaige Citadel, and it kinda sucks. I'd save that one for later so you only have to make the trip one time - such as during your first Limit Break quest at level 50 (In Defiant Challenge), where you'll be going to that end of the Citadel anyway. Alternatively, you can wait until you've started Wings of the Goddess, so you can use the Maw."] = "- Pero ojo: el maw de Sauromugue Champaign está en realidad sobre una meseta a la que no se puede subir. Tienes que pasar por Garlaige Citadel, y es un fastidio. Yo lo dejaría para más adelante para hacer el viaje una sola vez, por ejemplo durante tu primera quest de Limit Break a nivel 50 (In Defiant Challenge), en la que irás a ese extremo de la Citadel de todos modos. También puedes esperar a haber empezado Wings of the Goddess para poder usar el Maw.",
    ["- If you picked Bastok, select objectives such as:"] = "- Si elegiste Bastok, elige objetivos como:",
    ["- If you picked Windurst, select objectives such as:"] = "- Si elegiste Windurst, elige objetivos como:",
    ["- Interact with a ??? in Garlaige Citadel on map 1 at (G-8) to obtain this. (Not the one in the ceiling.)"] = "- Interactúa con una ??? de Garlaige Citadel en el mapa 1 en (G-8) para conseguirla. (No la del techo.)",
    ["- Iron Eater - After getting Volker, Ayame, and Naji, speak to Iron Eater in the Metalworks at (J-8)."] = "- Iron Eater: tras conseguir a Volker, Ayame y Naji, habla con Iron Eater en Metalworks en (J-8).",
    ["- It's a nice city."] = "- Es una ciudad bonita.",
    ["- Jugner Forest, and northeast to"] = "- Jugner Forest, y al noreste hacia",
    ["- Lesser Colibri are located just outside of Al Zahbi in Wajaom, and slightly north of the Al Zahbi exit in Bhaflau. Colibri are great. They were the developers' gift to melees in 2006 and they haven't changed."] = "- Los Lesser Colibri están justo fuera de Al Zahbi en Wajaom, y un poco al norte de la salida de Al Zahbi en Bhaflau. Los Colibri son geniales. Fueron el regalo de los desarrolladores a los cuerpo a cuerpo en 2006, y no han cambiado.",
    ["- Meriphataud Mountains, and northwest to"] = "- Meriphataud Mountains, y al noroeste hacia",
    ["- Most of this zone is Undead that aggro to both sound and low HP, so watch out... but Valaineral has your back."] = "- Casi toda esta zona son no-muertos que detectan por sonido y por HP bajo, así que cuidado... pero Valaineral te cubre.",
    ["- Multiwindow Horizontal or Vertical as preferred"] = "- Multiwindow Horizontal o Vertical, según prefieras",
    ["- Note that mobs in Escha can spawn Notorious Monsters when killed. You may or may not eat it to Hugemaw Harold. There's a temporary item called a Mollifier that stops this... but it doesn't work when Trusts, rather than players, land the killing blow, which they almost always will at your level. Just part of the cost of doing business, sadly. This will be true for all Escha leveling."] = "- Ten en cuenta que los monstruos de Escha pueden hacer aparecer Notorious Monsters al morir. Puede que te toque comerte a Hugemaw Harold. Hay un objeto temporal llamado Mollifier que lo evita... pero no funciona cuando el golpe final lo dan los Trusts y no los jugadores, que a tu nivel será casi siempre. Es parte del precio, por desgracia. Esto vale para todo lo que subas en Escha.",
    ["- Once you have climbed the entire mountain, look very carefully over the edge to the south to see a teeny tiny little ledge on the west side of the big slope. Slide down and land on it, then go into the tunnel you find there for the final HP. The slide actually rocks, even if I hate the rest of this zone. I'm a sucker for a good fall."] = "- Cuando hayas subido toda la montaña, mira con mucho cuidado por el borde hacia el sur para ver una cornisa diminuta en el lado oeste de la gran pendiente. Deslízate y aterriza en ella, y luego entra en el túnel que encuentres allí para el último HP. El deslizamiento mola de verdad, aunque odie el resto de esta zona. Me pierde una buena caída.",
    ["- Once you're inside, kill Worms, Obdellas, and Crawlers near the entrance - they're higher level than you typically want to target, but not by much. You should be okay."] = "- Una vez dentro, mata Worms, Obdellas y Crawlers cerca de la entrada; son de más nivel del que sueles querer, pero no por mucho. Deberías estar bien.",
    ["- Or don't. It's your life."] = "- O no. Es tu vida.",
    ["- Or select them, hit enter, and select \"Release\"."] = "- O selecciónalo, pulsa Intro y elige \"Release\".",
    ["- Or type \"/refa name\"with their name, for example \"/refa Valaineral\". The name is the one they use when they say a line of dialogue. This removes spaces and II when applicable - for example: Semih Lafihna uses \"SemihLafihna\", Shantotto II uses \"Shantotto\"."] = "- O escribe \"/refa nombre\" con su nombre, por ejemplo \"/refa Valaineral\". El nombre es el que usan al decir una frase. Quita los espacios y el II cuando lo haya; por ejemplo: Semih Lafihna usa \"SemihLafihna\" y Shantotto II usa \"Shantotto\".",
    ["- Pashhow Marshlands, and northeast to"] = "- Pashhow Marshlands, y al noreste hacia",
    ["- Pay Churano-Shurano in Windurst Waters (North) (F-8) 10,000 gil to obtain this."] = "- Paga 10,000 gil a Churano-Shurano en Windurst Waters (North) (F-8) para conseguirlo.",
    ["- Portals in Escha work like Home Points, but cost silt that you earn by killing mobs."] = "- Los portales de Escha funcionan como Home Points, pero cuestan silt, que ganas matando monstruos.",
    ["- Qultada will use the experience-bonus-granting Corsair's Roll whenever you have the buff from the Empress Band, Echad Ring, or other experience-granting items."] = "- Qultada usará el Corsair's Roll, que da bonificación de experiencia, siempre que tengas el buff de la Empress Band, el Echad Ring u otros objetos que den experiencia.",
    ["- Reach level 5."] = "- Llega a nivel 5.",
    ["- Rolanberry Fields, which connects to Lower Jeuno"] = "- Rolanberry Fields, que conecta con Lower Jeuno",
    ["- San d'Oria: La Theine Plateau, and east to"] = "- San d'Oria: La Theine Plateau, y al este hacia",
    ["- Sauromugue Champaign, which connects to Port Jeuno"] = "- Sauromugue Champaign, que conecta con Port Jeuno",
    ["- Select ON to display in the associated window, and OFF to filter from it"] = "- Elige ON para mostrarlos en esa ventana y OFF para filtrarlos",
    ["- Spoils (Bat Wing)"] = "- Spoils (Bat Wing)",
    ["- Spoils (Dark Crystal)"] = "- Spoils (Dark Crystal)",
    ["- Spoils (Earth Crystal)"] = "- Spoils (Earth Crystal)",
    ["- Spoils (Fire Crystal)"] = "- Spoils (Fire Crystal)",
    ["- Spoils (Flint Stone)"] = "- Spoils (Flint Stone)",
    ["- Spoils (Honey)"] = "- Spoils (Honey)",
    ["- Spoils (Ice Crystal)"] = "- Spoils (Ice Crystal)",
    ["- Spoils (Light Crystal)"] = "- Spoils (Light Crystal)",
    ["- Spoils (Lightning Crystal)"] = "- Spoils (Lightning Crystal)",
    ["- Spoils (Lizard Tail)"] = "- Spoils (Lizard Tail)",
    ["- Spoils (Rabbit Hide)"] = "- Spoils (Rabbit Hide)",
    ["- Spoils (Sheepskin)"] = "- Spoils (Sheepskin)",
    ["- Spoils (Water Crystal)"] = "- Spoils (Water Crystal)",
    ["- Spoils (Wind Crystal)"] = "- Spoils (Wind Crystal)",
    ["- Start completing RoE objectives."] = "- Empieza a completar objetivos de RoE.",
    ["- Summon Valaineral and Semih Lafihna and have them clean up with AoE WSes while you attack the Karakuls. This can go so fast it feels like cheating if you're lucky with the Chigoe spawns."] = "- Invoca a Valaineral y Semih Lafihna y deja que acaben con ellos con WS de área mientras atacas a los Karakul. Puede ir tan rápido que parece trampa si tienes suerte con las apariciones de Chigoes.",
    ["- The connected zone of Newton Movalpolos has a Home Point that's a pain to get to and past large numbers of level 70 mobs and requires operating switches and stuff that make you drop Invisible. It can wait."] = "- La zona conectada de Newton Movalpolos tiene un Home Point al que cuesta llegar, pasando junto a muchos monstruos de nivel 70 y teniendo que accionar interruptores y cosas que te quitan Invisible. Puede esperar.",
    ["- The lowest level mobs drop Beastman's Seals, then Kindred's Seals, alt=High Kindred's Crests, and finally alt=Sacred Kindred's Crests."] = "- Los monstruos de menor nivel sueltan Beastman's Seals, luego Kindred's Seals, alt=High Kindred's Crests y por último alt=Sacred Kindred's Crests.",
    ["- There's a path at (H-8) (blocked by ice during Snow weather) to a HP at (H-7)."] = "- Hay un camino en (H-8) (bloqueado por el hielo con clima de nieve) hasta un HP en (H-7).",
    ["- These are Shadowreign Cavernous Maws, not Abyssea, so don't bother touching them yet."] = "- Son Cavernous Maws de Shadowreign, no de Abyssea, así que aún no te molestes en tocarlos.",
    ["- They are so good that I'm not messing with other options here like Robber Crabs and Sand Lizards in Kuftal Tunnel."] = "- Son tan buenos que aquí ni me molesto con otras opciones como los Robber Crabs y Sand Lizards de Kuftal Tunnel.",
    ["- This is a Final Fantasy game, after all."] = "- Al fin y al cabo, esto es un Final Fantasy.",
    ["- This is cheaper than throwing it out and buying a new one! (Also \"recharging\" and \"buying a new one\" share the same weeklong cooldown, so you can't get clever.)"] = "- ¡Es más barato que tirarla y comprar otra! (Además, \"recargar\" y \"comprar otra\" comparten la misma espera semanal, así que no hay truco.)",
    ["- This will depend on which starting city you chose. If you picked San d'Oria, select objectives such as:"] = "- Depende de la ciudad inicial que elegiste. Si elegiste San d'Oria, elige objetivos como:",
    ["- To make your life easier, either farm these as Thief or bring a trust such as Cipher: Lion for Treasure Hunter. Also, don't forget to set some Records of Eminence objectives, such as your chosen zone's Conflict: x, Spoils (Honey), and Spoils (Beehive Chip)"] = "- Para facilitarte la vida, farméalos como Thief o lleva un trust como Cipher: Lion para tener Treasure Hunter. Y no olvides fijar algunos objetivos de Records of Eminence, como el Conflict: x de tu zona, Spoils (Honey) y Spoils (Beehive Chip)",
    ["- Total Damage I"] = "- Total Damage I",
    ["- Total Damage Taken I"] = "- Total Damage Taken I",
    ["- Touch any that you see to unlock them for teleportation."] = "- Toca todos los que veas para desbloquearlos como teletransporte.",
    ["- Under \"Config\" in the main menu."] = "- En \"Config\", en el menú principal.",
    ["- Undertake a FoV Training Regime"] = "- Undertake a FoV Training Regime",
    ["- Unlike the rest of this list, Rainemard is actually surprisingly good. For some reason, his Enspells are really burly - we're talking 200+ damage at level 60 and rising - he doesn't mess around with spells other than Distract to lower evasion, and he learns Savage Blade at the expected level. He might be better than the non-Shantotto2/Semih/Zeid2 DPS you're using if you're at the point where Valaineral can handle solo healing. (See this pre-Shantotto-II level 72-75 data on a new account.)"] = "- A diferencia del resto de la lista, Rainemard es sorprendentemente bueno. Por algún motivo sus Enspells son muy potentes (hablamos de más de 200 de daño a nivel 60, y subiendo), no se entretiene con más hechizos que Distract para bajar la evasión y aprende Savage Blade al nivel esperado. Puede que sea mejor que el atacante que uses que no sea Shantotto2/Semih/Zeid2, si ya estás en el punto en que Valaineral puede con la curación en solitario. (Ver estos datos de nivel 72-75, previos a Shantotto II, en una cuenta nueva.)",
    ["- Vanquish Multiple Enemies I"] = "- Vanquish Multiple Enemies I",
    ["- Vanquish One Enemy"] = "- Vanquish One Enemy",
    ["- Watch out for Peallaidh, who looks identical and spawns 2 Chigoe at a time... but also kills you pretty quickly because it's higher level."] = "- Cuidado con Peallaidh, que parece idéntico y hace aparecer 2 Chigoes a la vez... pero también te mata bastante rápido porque es de más nivel.",
    ["- Weapon Skills I"] = "- Weapon Skills I",
    ["- While this is definitely a one-person camp, I personally really like it."] = "- Aunque desde luego es un campamento para una sola persona, a mí me gusta mucho.",
    ["- Window 1/2 Adjust Width to fit your screen"] = "- Window 1/2 Adjust Width para ajustarlas a tu pantalla",
    ["- Windurst players can use the superior Kupipi from the Windurst Trust Initiation quest, but other players don't get her until Rank 3, likely long after their Unity trust."] = "- Los jugadores de Windurst pueden usar a la mejor Kupipi de la quest Windurst Trust Initiation, pero los demás no la consiguen hasta Rank 3, seguramente mucho después que su trust de Unity.",
    ["- Windurst: Tahrongi Canyon, and northwest to"] = "- Windurst: Tahrongi Canyon, y al noroeste hacia",
    ["- You have to touch them to activate them before you can use them."] = "- Tienes que tocarlos para activarlos antes de poder usarlos.",
    ["- You're going northwest from North Gustaberg..."] = "- Vas al noroeste desde North Gustaberg...",
    ["- east through the Tahrongi Canyon (which has a Survival Guide)..."] = "- al este por Tahrongi Canyon (que tiene una Survival Guide)...",
    ["- north through the Konschtat Highlands (which has a Survival Guide)..."] = "- al norte por Konschtat Highlands (que tiene una Survival Guide)...",
    ["- ok you're done you can leave now"] = "- vale, ya has terminado, puedes irte",
    ["- south through the La Theine Plateau (which has a Survival Guide)..."] = "- al sur por La Theine Plateau (que tiene una Survival Guide)...",
    ["- south through the Valkurm Dunes (which has another Survival Guide)..."] = "- al sur por Valkurm Dunes (que tiene otra Survival Guide)...",
    ["- southeast through the Buburimu Peninsula (which has a Survival Guide)..."] = "- al sureste por Buburimu Peninsula (que tiene una Survival Guide)...",
    ["- to Mhaura"] = "- hasta Mhaura",
    ["-- EPILOGUE --"] = "-- EPÍLOGO --",
    ["-80% teleportation costs at Home Points and Survival Guides"] = "-80% en el coste de teletransporte de Home Points y Survival Guides",
    ["...or, far easier: talk to the Unity Concord NPC in your home city, tell them to \"bring me to a Wanted encounter area\", and select Level 75 > East Sarutabaruta. Then just stroll right into the city."] = "...o, mucho más fácil: habla con el NPC de Unity Concord de tu ciudad, dile \"bring me to a Wanted encounter area\" y elige Level 75 > East Sarutabaruta. Luego entra paseando en la ciudad.",
    ["/equip ring1 \"Warp Ring\""] = "/equip ring1 \"Warp Ring\"",
    ["/item \"Warp Ring\""] = "/item \"Warp Ring\"",
    ["/item (items like Potion or Antidote)"] = "/item (objetos como Potion o Antidote)",
    ["/ja (job abilities like Berserk or Steal)"] = "/ja (habilidades de job como Berserk o Steal)",
    ["/ma \"Stone\""] = "/ma \"Stone\"",
    ["/ma \"Tenzen\""] = "/ma \"Tenzen\"",
    ["/ma \"Valaineral\""] = "/ma \"Valaineral\"",
    ["/ma \"Yoran-Oran (UC)\""] = "/ma \"Yoran-Oran (UC)\"",
    ["/ma for \"use Magic\""] = "/ma de \"usar magia\" (Magic)",
    ["/ra (a Ranged Attack with your equipped ranged weapon)"] = "/ra (un ataque a distancia con el arma a distancia equipada)",
    ["/ws \"Fast Blade\""] = "/ws \"Fast Blade\"",
    ["/ws (weapon skills like Fast Blade or Wasp Sting)."] = "/ws (weapon skills como Fast Blade o Wasp Sting).",
    ["100 gil"] = "100 gil",
    ["150 gil"] = "150 gil",
    ["300 gil"] = "300 gil",
    ["400 gil"] = "400 gil",
    ["560 gil"] = "560 gil",
    ["600 gil"] = "600 gil",
    ["900 gil"] = "900 gil",
    ["??? (D-10)."] = "??? (D-10).",
    ["??? (E-10)."] = "??? (E-10).",
    ["??? (E-11)."] = "??? (E-11).",
    ["??? (E-9)."] = "??? (E-9).",
    ["??? (G-9)."] = "??? (G-9).",
    ["??? (I-8)."] = "??? (I-8).",
    ["??? (J-8)."] = "??? (J-8).",
    ["??? (K-10)."] = "??? (K-10).",
    ["??? (K-11)."] = "??? (K-11).",
    ["??? (L-10)."] = "??? (L-10).",
    ["??? (L-7)."] = "??? (L-7).",
    ["A Kraken (level 37-38) may spawn above the Night Flowers."] = "Un Kraken (nivel 37-38) puede aparecer sobre las Night Flowers.",
    ["A Magicked Steel is found on various Goblin enemies in Oldton Movalpolos. It is advised to farm Goblin Oilman, which seem to have a higher drop rate: use the Proto-Waypoint, drop down the ledge and head west."] = "Un Magicked Steel se encuentra en varios enemigos Goblin de Oldton Movalpolos. Se aconseja farmear Goblin Oilman, que parecen tener una tasa de drop mayor: usa el Proto-Waypoint, déjate caer por la cornisa y ve al oeste.",
    ["A Maul can also be bought from Amulya and Vicious Eye in Metalworks (E-9) for about 12,000-78,000 gil, depending on availability. A Replica Maul comes from the Auction House or a Gusgen Mines Treasure Chest."] = "También se puede comprar un Maul a Amulya y Vicious Eye en Metalworks (E-9) por unos 12,000-78,000 gil, según la disponibilidad. Una Replica Maul se consigue en la Auction House o en un Treasure Chest de Gusgen Mines.",
    ["A Meteorite drops from Crawlers on the Starfall Hillock in West Sarutabaruta (very rare), comes from Colonization Reives in Kamihr Drifts (needs \"Fragmenting\" from Breaking the Ice) or Outer Ra'Kaznar (needs \"Pulverizing\" from Lerene's Lament), or from a Mog Garden Mineral Vein at rank 3."] = "Un Meteorite lo sueltan los Crawlers del Starfall Hillock en West Sarutabaruta (muy raro), se obtiene en las Colonization Reives de Kamihr Drifts (requiere \"Fragmenting\" de Breaking the Ice) o de Outer Ra'Kaznar (requiere \"Pulverizing\" de Lerene's Lament), o de una Mineral Vein del Mog Garden de rango 3.",
    ["A Mistmelt forces Ouryu to land when you fight him, but has no effect in The Savage II."] = "Un Mistmelt obliga a Ouryu a aterrizar cuando luchas contra él, pero no tiene efecto en The Savage II.",
    ["A Poroggo Casanova spawns, assisted by Mikiruru, Mikiluru, Mikirulu, Nikilulu and Mikilulu. They cannot be put to sleep, even with Elemental Seal."] = "Aparece un Poroggo Casanova, ayudado por Mikiruru, Mikiluru, Mikirulu, Nikilulu y Mikilulu. No se les puede dormir, ni siquiera con Elemental Seal.",
    ["A Sprite will at times patrol through the area. It is recommend not to use AoE attacks during the patrol. Elementals can spawn in appropriate weather at this location, but they should only be level 45."] = "A veces patrulla la zona un Sprite. Se recomienda no usar ataques de área mientras pasa. Con el clima adecuado pueden aparecer Elementals aquí, pero solo deberían ser de nivel 45.",
    ["A Spruce Lumber drops from Taurus enemies in Phomiuna Aqueducts; 3 Taurus can be found at (G-6) of Map 1. Enter Phomiuna Aqueducts from Tavnazian Safehold, or use the Survival Guide and head northwest."] = "Un Spruce Lumber lo sueltan enemigos Taurus en Phomiuna Aqueducts; se pueden encontrar 3 Taurus en (G-6) del Map 1. Entra en Phomiuna Aqueducts desde Tavnazian Safehold, o usa la Survival Guide y ve al noroeste.",
    ["A White Mage may instead pull Maat and stay alive for 5 minutes, causing Maat to give up. A Thief may try to steal a Scroll of Instant Warp from Maat; once you steal it, Maat gives up."] = "Un White Mage puede en su lugar atraer a Maat y mantenerse vivo 5 minutos, lo que hace que Maat se rinda. Un Thief puede intentar robarle un Scroll of Instant Warp a Maat; una vez que lo robas, Maat se rinde.",
    ["A confidential report states that corsairs are secretly collecting the remains of shipwrecks on Ilrusi Atoll. Mission orders: demolish the shipwrecks."] = "Un informe confidencial dice que unos corsarios recogen en secreto los restos de naufragios en Ilrusi Atoll. Órdenes de la misión: demoler los naufragios.",
    ["A cutscene plays as you zone in, giving the key item Astral compass."] = "Al entrar se reproduce una escena que te da el key item Astral compass.",
    ["A few notes on Trust mechanics:"] = "Algunas notas sobre la mecánica de los Trusts:",
    ["A fish counts once Katsunaga has it registered as caught by you, so a fish you caught earlier can be replaced with one bought from the Auction House. A Penguin, Seagull or Duck Ring makes the legendary fish much easier to land."] = "Un pez cuenta en cuanto Katsunaga lo tiene registrado como pescado por ti, así que un pez que pescaste antes puede sustituirse por uno comprado en la Auction House. Un Penguin, Seagull o Duck Ring facilita mucho sacar los peces legendarios.",
    ["A higher-level friend running slightly ahead to kill monsters before Ken reaches them makes it easier, but they can't help once Ken has started a fight, and Ken mustn't see them either."] = "Que un amigo de más nivel vaya un poco por delante matando monstruos antes de que Ken llegue a ellos lo facilita, pero no puede ayudar una vez que Ken ha empezado una pelea, y Ken tampoco debe verlo.",
    ["A logistics unit headed to the front lines of the war with the Far East was attacked and its supplies were stolen. The enemy then fled towards Leujaoam Sanctum. Mission orders: retrieve the supplies."] = "Una unidad logística que iba al frente de la guerra con el Far East fue atacada y le robaron los suministros. El enemigo huyó entonces hacia Leujaoam Sanctum. Órdenes de la misión: recuperar los suministros.",
    ["A long-haired marid has been found frozen in the eternal ice of Leujaoam Sanctum. Mission orders: protect the professor. The recommended level is 60."] = "Se ha encontrado un marid de pelo largo congelado en el hielo eterno de Leujaoam Sanctum. Órdenes de la misión: proteger al profesor. El nivel recomendado es 60.",
    ["A puk recently stole a treasure box containing enchanted gems from the royal treasury. The gems were then given to Mamool Ja officers as a reward for duty. Find and retrieve the treasure. Mission orders: recover the treasure."] = "Un puk robó hace poco un cofre del tesoro con gemas encantadas del tesoro real. Las gemas se dieron después a oficiales Mamool Ja como recompensa por su servicio. Encuentra y recupera el tesoro. Órdenes de la misión: recuperar el tesoro.",
    ["A quick way to reach the destination is to take the Survival Guide to Gustav Tunnel, then exit to Valkurm Dunes. If you don't have that Survival Guide, the Unity Warp (level 128) followed by Escape (a /BLM can cast it) puts you right at that exit."] = "Una forma rápida de llegar al destino es usar la Survival Guide de Gustav Tunnel y salir a Valkurm Dunes. Si no tienes esa Survival Guide, el Unity Warp (nivel 128) seguido de Escape (un /BLM puede lanzarlo) te deja justo en esa salida.",
    ["A ship carrying Princess Kadjaya of the Imperial family back from a diplomatic mission to the West has run aground near Lebros Cavern. Mission orders: rescue Princess Kadjaya."] = "Un barco que traía de vuelta a la Princess Kadjaya de la familia Imperial de una misión diplomática en el West ha encallado cerca de Lebros Cavern. Órdenes de la misión: rescatar a la Princess Kadjaya.",
    ["A squad sent to search for the Seagull Phratrie hideout has failed to report. Find any survivors, especially Private Ryaaf, a relative of the Galeserpent General. Mission orders: find the survivors."] = "Un escuadrón enviado a buscar el escondite de la Seagull Phratrie no ha informado. Encuentra a los supervivientes, sobre todo al Private Ryaaf, pariente del Galeserpent General. Órdenes de la misión: encontrar a los supervivientes.",
    ["A suggested route on Map 1: Flame Spout (H-6), then B > C > K > L to the spout at (H-6)/(H-7), then E > H > N to the spout at (I-10). The wiki also suggests the Survival Guide, then K > L > H to the Ash Dragon area."] = "Una ruta sugerida en el mapa 1: Flame Spout (H-6), luego B > C > K > L hasta el surtidor de (H-6)/(H-7), luego E > H > N hasta el surtidor de (I-10). La wiki también sugiere la Survival Guide y luego K > L > H hasta la zona del Ash Dragon.",
    ["A unit of Mamool Ja soldiers is training in assassination techniques. Destroy them before they can become a threat to the Empress. Mission orders: destroy the assassins."] = "Una unidad de soldados Mamool Ja entrena técnicas de asesinato. Destrúyelos antes de que se conviertan en una amenaza para la Empress. Órdenes de la misión: destruir a los asesinos.",
    ["A wrong switch means starting from the beginning. When you try a switch someone may appear: Gentle Tiger (choose \"Leave it to Luto\" or say \"Checking out the Metalworks.\"), Militant Gale (\"Leave it to Miledo\" or \"Waiting for a friend.\"), Pensive Beast (use the Lucky charm) or Salim (any Costume kit costume). A wrong answer gets Luto or Miledo captured: speak with Ferghus, then Folzen. If the same one is captured twice, the quest ends."] = "Un interruptor equivocado obliga a empezar desde el principio. Al probar un interruptor puede aparecer alguien: Gentle Tiger (elige \"Leave it to Luto\" o di \"Checking out the Metalworks.\"), Militant Gale (\"Leave it to Miledo\" o \"Waiting for a friend.\"), Pensive Beast (usa el Lucky charm) o Salim (cualquier disfraz del Costume kit). Una respuesta equivocada hace que capturen a Luto o a Miledo: habla con Ferghus y luego con Folzen. Si capturan dos veces al mismo, la quest termina.",
    ["AF is a set of armor pieces at levels 52, 54, 56, 58, and 60, designed to look like a classic FF version of your specific class and with specific stats (supposedly) designed to go with the job. Of course, these are stats from pieces of mid-level 2004-era equipment, so they'll be obsolete quickly... until you hit 99 and reforge each piece up to five times to bring it up to modern standards. And it's quite the difference! For example:"] = "El AF es un conjunto de piezas de armadura de nivel 52, 54, 56, 58 y 60, diseñado para parecerse a la versión clásica de FF de tu clase y con atributos (supuestamente) pensados para el job. Claro que son atributos de equipo de nivel medio de la era de 2004, así que pronto quedarán obsoletos... hasta que llegues al 99 y reforjes cada pieza hasta cinco veces para ponerla al día. ¡Y la diferencia es enorme! Por ejemplo:",
    ["AHs are labeled on your map, and can be found in Bastok Markets/Bastok Mines, Southern San d'Oria/Port San d'Oria, and Windurst Woods/Windurst Walls."] = "Las AH aparecen en el mapa, y las hay en Bastok Markets/Bastok Mines, Southern San d'Oria/Port San d'Oria y Windurst Woods/Windurst Walls.",
    ["Above ground, go up to the upper level at (E-10) and to the large island at (G-10) to speak with Ge'Fhu Yagudoeye. Four Quadav NMs spawn: two Nickel Quadavs (PLD) and two Magnes Quadavs (BLM), easy solo at 75. Only one player can do this at a time; others wait 3 minutes and spawn them again."] = "En la superficie, sube al nivel superior en (E-10) y a la isla grande de (G-10) para hablar con Ge'Fhu Yagudoeye. Aparecen cuatro NMs Quadav: dos Nickel Quadavs (PLD) y dos Magnes Quadavs (BLM), fáciles en solitario a nivel 75. Solo puede hacerlo un jugador a la vez; los demás esperan 3 minutos y los vuelven a hacer aparecer.",
    ["Abununnu in Lufaise Meadows: rifts at (H-9), (F-8) and (G-7)."] = "Abununnu en Lufaise Meadows: rifts en (H-9), (F-8) y (G-7).",
    ["Abyssea"] = "Abyssea",
    ["Accept his offer to give him 10,000 gil towards his cause. You can then purchase the permanent key item Magicked astrolabe."] = "Acepta su oferta de darle 10,000 gil para su causa. Después puedes comprar el key item permanente Magicked astrolabe.",
    ["Access is unavailable while RoV Mission 1-9 (The Lion's Roar) is active."] = "No hay acceso mientras esté activa la RoV Mission 1-9 (The Lion's Roar).",
    ["Access is unavailable while RoV Mission 1-9 (The Lion's Roar) is active. It can be completed around level 55+ with trusts."] = "No hay acceso mientras esté activa la RoV Mission 1-9 (The Lion's Roar). Se puede completar hacia el nivel 55+ con trusts.",
    ["Acquire Trusts"] = "Consigue Trusts",
    ["Acquire a Hatchet from the Auction House, NPC stores or crafting."] = "Consigue un Hatchet en la Auction House, en tiendas de NPCs o fabricándolo.",
    ["Acquire a Robe and a Bronze Subligar, both easy to find at the Auction House or from some armor merchants."] = "Consigue un Robe y un Bronze Subligar, fáciles de encontrar en la Auction House o en algunos comerciantes de armaduras.",
    ["Acquire a Subjob"] = "Consigue un subjob",
    ["Acquire a Yagudo Drink from the Auction House, or buy one from a Curio Vendor Moogle if you have the appropriate Rhapsody key item."] = "Consigue un Yagudo Drink en la Auction House, o cómpralo a un Curio Vendor Moogle si tienes el key item Rhapsody adecuado.",
    ["Activate the Waypoint at (H-7) in Lower Jeuno to travel to Ulbuka."] = "Activa el Waypoint de (H-7) en Lower Jeuno para viajar a Ulbuka.",
    ["Actually Leveling Up"] = "Subir de nivel de verdad",
    ["Adoulin Mission 1-6 is gated behind a combination of Adoulin fame and imprimaturs spent (you will have to spend at least 11 imprimaturs even with maxed Adoulin fame.) Theoretically, you don't have to fight anything until Adoulin Mission 2-7-1. In practice, there's a lot of sneaking in between and some traveling on foot aided by key items that require level 99. Adoulin has two Home Points in each of Western Adoulin and Eastern Adoulin plus a Survival Guide in Eastern Adoulin close to the second home point."] = "La Adoulin Mission 1-6 requiere una combinación de fama de Adoulin e imprimaturs gastados (tendrás que gastar al menos 11 imprimaturs incluso con la fama de Adoulin al máximo.) En teoría no tienes que luchar contra nada hasta la Adoulin Mission 2-7-1. En la práctica, hay mucho sigilo entre medias y algo de viaje a pie con ayuda de key items que requieren nivel 99. Adoulin tiene dos Home Points en Western Adoulin y otros dos en Eastern Adoulin, además de una Survival Guide en Eastern Adoulin cerca del segundo home point.",
    ["Aello in Ru'Aun Gardens: rifts at (G-5), (I-11) and (J-6)."] = "Aello en Ru'Aun Gardens: rifts en (G-5), (I-11) y (J-6).",
    ["After 20 kills, walk out into Pashhow Marshlands for the cutscene with Ayame that completes the mission. Using Escape skips the cutscene, and with fewer than 20 kills you get a different one."] = "Tras 20 muertes, sal caminando a Pashhow Marshlands para la escena con Ayame que completa la misión. Usar Escape se salta la escena, y con menos de 20 muertes ves otra distinta.",
    ["After Ken despawns, Marin appears at the exit. Speak with her to lift the level cap and receive Ken's escort award."] = "Cuando Ken desaparece, Marin aparece en la salida. Habla con ella para quitar el límite de nivel y recibir el premio por la escolta de Ken.",
    ["After a cutscene the second form starts at once: about 4,000 HP, only AoE attacks and no immunity switching. Use your two-hour abilities and Curaga freely. Winning gives a cutscene and the key item Shadow fragment, and you are returned to the Castle Zvahl Baileys entrance."] = "Tras una escena empieza enseguida la segunda forma: unos 4,000 HP, solo ataques de área y sin cambios de inmunidad. Usa tus habilidades de dos horas y Curaga sin reparos. Ganar da una escena y el key item Shadow fragment, y te devuelve a la entrada de Castle Zvahl Baileys.",
    ["After a game day, examine the Inconspicuous Barrel again for a note telling you to see Octavien."] = "Tras un día de juego, examina de nuevo el Inconspicuous Barrel para encontrar una nota que te dice que veas a Octavien.",
    ["After accepting the quest, talk to Nafiwaa at the Alchemist's Guild in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (G-5). She gives you 5 empty test tube key items."] = "Tras aceptar la quest, habla con Nafiwaa en el Alchemist's Guild de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (G-5). Te da 5 key items de tubos de ensayo vacíos.",
    ["After acquiring Shantotto and Iron Eater, speak to Jamal in Ru'Lude Gardens (H-5) (the house in the back behind Maat) to receive the Bundle of half-inscribed scrolls. This item is required for certain Trusts later, such as the Ark Angels."] = "Tras conseguir a Shantotto e Iron Eater, habla con Jamal en Ru'Lude Gardens (H-5) (la casa del fondo, detrás de Maat) para recibir el Bundle of half-inscribed scrolls. Este objeto es necesario para ciertos Trusts posteriores, como los Ark Angels.",
    ["After all 24, report to Captain Antje (your Flee can have worn off by then)."] = "Tras los 24, informa a Captain Antje (para entonces tu Flee puede haberse acabado).",
    ["After all 3 trials are complete, you are awarded your promotion and the SL Wildcat badge, which gives access to SL Assaults. If you fail any trial, you need to pay the initiation fee of 2 Imperial Mythril Pieces again in order to repeat it."] = "Cuando se completan las 3 pruebas, te conceden el ascenso y el SL Wildcat badge, que da acceso a los SL Assaults. Si fallas alguna prueba, debes pagar de nuevo la cuota de iniciación de 2 Imperial Mythril Pieces para repetirla.",
    ["After all eight dawndrops have been obtained, they combine into the Primal glow."] = "Cuando hayas obtenido las ocho dawndrops, se combinan en el Primal glow.",
    ["After all five fish are accepted, trade the Ebisu Fishing Rod to Irmilant to receive the Ebisu Fishing Rod +1 and the title Exalted Fisherman."] = "Cuando acepte los cinco peces, entrega la Ebisu Fishing Rod a Irmilant para recibir la Ebisu Fishing Rod +1 y el título Exalted Fisherman.",
    ["After all nine, choose the Mark of Seed to continue (or an Azure Key, level 60 coffer reward). You can collect them once per Earth day."] = "Tras los nueve, elige la Mark of Seed para continuar (o una Azure Key, recompensa de cofre de nivel 60). Puedes reunirlos una vez por día real.",
    ["After arriving in the past, examine the other two Maws to open their passages between the past and present."] = "Al llegar al pasado, examina los otros dos Maws para abrir sus pasajes entre el pasado y el presente.",
    ["After both, you receive the key item Count Borel's letter."] = "Tras ambos, recibes el key item Count Borel's letter.",
    ["After cleaning the weapon twice you may choose to complete the quest or continue cleaning. Whether you stop at two cleanings or five, the quest is complete and you receive the CS Wildcat badge, access to CS Assaults, 1 Imperial Mythril Piece and possibly 1 Imperial Gold Piece as well."] = "Tras limpiar el arma dos veces puedes elegir completar la quest o seguir limpiando. Tanto si paras en dos limpiezas como en cinco, la quest queda completa y recibes el CS Wildcat badge, acceso a los CS Assaults, 1 Imperial Mythril Piece y posiblemente 1 Imperial Gold Piece también.",
    ["After completing Missionary Moblin you need to zone out and back in to initiate this quest. Talk to Koblakiq in Oldton Movalpolos (H-11) to begin it. A letter has arrived from Zeelozok asking for an arnica root to be brought to Castle Oztroja, and Koblakiq entrusts the task to you. It is suggested that you have the three beastmen stronghold Survival Guides, as the quest requires traveling between the three strongholds, and that you bring Echo Drops, Holy Water or someone who can cast Cursna."] = "Tras completar Missionary Moblin debes salir de la zona y volver a entrar para iniciar esta quest. Habla con Koblakiq en Oldton Movalpolos (H-11) para empezarla. Ha llegado una carta de Zeelozok pidiendo que se lleve una arnica root a Castle Oztroja, y Koblakiq te confía la tarea. Se sugiere que tengas las tres Survival Guides de las fortalezas de beastmen, ya que la quest requiere viajar entre las tres fortalezas, y que lleves Echo Drops, Holy Water o a alguien que pueda lanzar Cursna.",
    ["After completing The Crimson Trial and reaching level 50 or higher as a Red Mage, speak with Curilla (I-9) in Chateau d'Oraguille to receive the Old pocket watch. San d'Orians need rank 2 to enter the Chateau; players from other nations must be on Mission 2-3 or later. You no longer have to be on Red Mage after starting the quest."] = "Tras completar The Crimson Trial y alcanzar nivel 50 o superior como Red Mage, habla con Curilla (I-9) en Chateau d'Oraguille para recibir el Old pocket watch. Los de San d'Oria necesitan rango 2 para entrar en el Chateau; los jugadores de otras naciones deben estar en la Mission 2-3 o posterior. Tras empezar la quest ya no tienes que ser Red Mage.",
    ["After completing Vanishing Act, zone and wait one Earth minute."] = "Tras completar Vanishing Act, cambia de zona y espera un minuto terrestre.",
    ["After completing it once, you can also trade vices and auras from several Lumoria HNMs to Meret for rewards."] = "Tras completarla una vez, también puedes entregar a Meret vices y auras de varios HNMs de Lumoria a cambio de recompensas.",
    ["After completing this quest, all Mithra in Kazham are repulsed by you, but Opo-opos are attracted to you. The only way to fix this is by completing Personal Hygiene, though it is recommended that you finish The Opo-opo and I first so you can get an Opo-opo Crown."] = "Tras completar esta quest, todos los Mithra de Kazham te rechazan, pero los Opo-opos se sienten atraídos por ti. La única forma de arreglarlo es completar Personal Hygiene, aunque se recomienda terminar antes The Opo-opo and I para conseguir un Opo-opo Crown.",
    ["After defeating Alsha, examine the ??? again for the key item Better Humes and Mannequins."] = "Tras derrotar a Alsha, examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener el key item Better Humes and Mannequins.",
    ["After defeating Bugallug, speak with Rakorok for a cutscene in which you lose the Dawn talisman."] = "Tras derrotar a Bugallug, habla con Rakorok para una escena en la que pierdes el Dawn talisman.",
    ["After defeating Cetus, examine ??? near Witchfire Glen (F-5/H-6 area) again for a cutscene."] = "Tras derrotar a Cetus, examina de nuevo la ??? cerca de Witchfire Glen (zona de F-5/H-6) para una escena.",
    ["After defeating Dabotz's Ghost, examine the pool at (F-5) again."] = "Tras derrotar a Dabotz's Ghost, examina de nuevo el estanque en (F-5).",
    ["After defeating Dark Spark, examine the same torch again for the key item Shadow flames."] = "Tras derrotar a Dark Spark, examina de nuevo la misma antorcha para obtener el key item Shadow flames.",
    ["After defeating Ophiotaurus, examine Undulating Confluence (G-8) again. You are teleported into Escha - Zi'Tah, which completes the mission."] = "Tras derrotar a Ophiotaurus, examina de nuevo la Undulating Confluence (G-8). Te teletransporta a Escha - Zi'Tah, lo que completa la misión.",
    ["After defeating Sturmtiger, examine the ??? again for the key item Ranchuriome's legacy."] = "Tras derrotar a Sturmtiger, examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener el key item Ranchuriome's legacy.",
    ["After defeating Tros, examine the Waters of Oblivion again for a cutscene and your Paper Knife."] = "Tras derrotar a Tros, examina de nuevo las Waters of Oblivion para una escena y tu Paper Knife.",
    ["After defeating Ubume, examine the ??? again for the key item Yomotsu feather."] = "Tras derrotar a Ubume, examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener el key item Yomotsu feather.",
    ["After defeating all three, examine the ??? once more to receive the key item Indigested meat."] = "Tras derrotar a los tres, examina la ??? una vez más para recibir el key item Indigested meat.",
    ["After defeating it, examine the ??? for a cutscene and the key item The Essence of Dance. Open it from your Permanent Key Items menu (just after any Gate Crystals)."] = "Tras derrotarlo, examina la ??? para una escena y el key item The Essence of Dance. Ábrelo desde tu menú de Permanent Key Items (justo después de los Gate Crystals).",
    ["After defeating it, examine the Ergon Locus ??? a third time for a cutscene; the Silver luopan is taken from you."] = "Tras derrotarlo, examina por tercera vez la ??? Ergon Locus para una escena; se te retira el Silver luopan.",
    ["After defeating it, examine the Overgrown Grave again for a cutscene."] = "Tras derrotarlo, examina de nuevo la Overgrown Grave para una escena.",
    ["After defeating the NM, click the Stone Monument once more to complete the quest and receive the Minstrel's Dagger."] = "Tras derrotar al NM, haz clic en el Stone Monument una vez más para completar la quest y recibir la Minstrel's Dagger.",
    ["After defeating them and once their corpses disappear, examine the ??? again for the key item Faded Yomotsu Hirasaka."] = "Tras derrotarlos y cuando sus cuerpos desaparezcan, examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener el key item Faded Yomotsu Hirasaka.",
    ["After defeating them you receive the key item Charred helm."] = "Tras derrotarlos recibes el key item Charred helm.",
    ["After defeating them, examine the ??? again for the Trick box. Both corpses must disappear first."] = "Tras derrotarlas, examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener la Trick box. Antes deben desaparecer ambos cuerpos.",
    ["After each stage you return to the airship deck with HP and MP restored; buff up and click the door for the next stage."] = "Tras cada fase vuelves a la cubierta de la aeronave con HP y MP restaurados; poténciate y pulsa la puerta para la siguiente fase.",
    ["After each win, examine the protocrystal again for its counterseal. If you left before getting it, just come back; you don't refight."] = "Tras cada victoria, examina de nuevo el protocristal para obtener su contrasello. Si te fuiste antes de conseguirlo, vuelve; no hace falta repetir la pelea.",
    ["After finishing all of the cutscenes after Dawn, including Blueblade Fell, walk towards the Palace in Ru'Lude Gardens to begin the cutscene with Esha'ntarl."] = "Tras terminar todas las escenas posteriores a Dawn, incluida Blueblade Fell, camina hacia el Palace de Ru'Lude Gardens para comenzar la escena con Esha'ntarl.",
    ["After giving you the Fewell of your choosing, he no longer offers to craft it and instead encourages you not to give up if you are running low on Fewell."] = "Tras darte el Fewell que elijas, ya no ofrece fabricarlo y en su lugar te anima a no rendirte si te estás quedando sin Fewell.",
    ["After hearing Nenne's story, go into the first house on Watchdog Alley (G-7), go upstairs to a bedroom and examine the diary on the table. Read it up to page 3."] = "Tras oír la historia de Nenne, entra en la primera casa de Watchdog Alley (G-7), sube a un dormitorio y examina el diario de la mesa. Léelo hasta la página 3.",
    ["After installing Seekers of Adoulin, entering one of the three starting nations plays a short cutscene telling you to go to Jeuno. It is optional."] = "Tras instalar Seekers of Adoulin, entrar en una de las tres naciones iniciales reproduce una escena corta que te dice que vayas a Jeuno. Es opcional.",
    ["After joining Salaheem's Sentinels, Alib-Mufalib offers to teleport you to Aht Urhgan Whitegate for 300 gil."] = "Tras unirte a los Salaheem's Sentinels, Alib-Mufalib te ofrece teletransportarte a Aht Urhgan Whitegate por 300 gil.",
    ["After joining Salaheem's Sentinels, speak with Naja Salaheem and show her the invitation card to receive Imperial currency; the more Lure of the Wildcat quests you have completed, the greater the reward."] = "Tras unirte a los Salaheem's Sentinels, habla con Naja Salaheem y muéstrale la invitation card para recibir moneda Imperial; cuantas más quests de Lure of the Wildcat hayas completado, mayor es la recompensa.",
    ["After joining Salaheem's Sentinels, speak with Naja Salaheem with the invitation card to be rewarded with Imperial currency; the more Lure of the Wildcat quests you have completed, the greater the reward."] = "Tras unirte a los Salaheem's Sentinels, habla con Naja Salaheem con la invitation card para recibir moneda Imperial; cuantas más quests de Lure of the Wildcat hayas completado, mayor es la recompensa.",
    ["After joining Salaheem's Sentinels, speak with Naja Salaheem with the invitation card to be rewarded with Imperial currency; the more Lure of the Wildcat quests you have completed, the greater the reward. Alib-Mufalib will also offer to teleport you to Aht Urhgan Whitegate."] = "Tras unirte a los Salaheem's Sentinels, habla con Naja Salaheem con la invitation card para recibir moneda Imperial; cuantas más quests de Lure of the Wildcat hayas completado, mayor es la recompensa. Alib-Mufalib también te ofrecerá teletransportarte a Aht Urhgan Whitegate.",
    ["After just completing Hearts of Mythril, you must zone to flag this quest. You need Bastok fame level 3."] = "Tras completar Hearts of Mythril, debes cambiar de zona para activar esta quest. Necesitas el nivel 3 de fama de Bastok.",
    ["After one nation's quest line, examine any of the three Cavernous Maws outside Jeuno in the past (or a present-day one you have already activated) for a cutscene and the title Cait Sith's Assistant."] = "Tras la serie de quests de una nación, examina cualquiera de los tres Cavernous Maws de fuera de Jeuno en el pasado (o uno del presente que ya hayas activado) para una escena y el título Cait Sith's Assistant.",
    ["After one pair, walk into Southern San d'Oria [S] from East Ronfaure [S] for a cutscene. Arriving by Home Point, Survival Guide or any other warp doesn't work."] = "Tras una pareja, entra caminando en Southern San d'Oria [S] desde East Ronfaure [S] para una escena. Llegar por Home Point, Survival Guide o cualquier otro warp no sirve.",
    ["After receiving the Gilt Glasses, return them to Altiret for your reward."] = "Tras recibir las Gilt Glasses, devuélvelas a Altiret para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["After speaking with Ensetsu, make your way to (H-5)/(H-6) of Eastern Altepa Desert. From this point you can continue on any job. The shortest route to the ??? is to take the Survival Guide to Western Altepa Desert and then zone to Eastern Altepa Desert."] = "Tras hablar con Ensetsu, ve a (H-5)/(H-6) de Eastern Altepa Desert. A partir de aquí puedes continuar con cualquier trabajo. La ruta más corta a la ??? es tomar la Survival Guide a Western Altepa Desert y luego cambiar de zona a Eastern Altepa Desert.",
    ["After that, speak with Ayame again."] = "Después, habla de nuevo con Ayame.",
    ["After that, talk to Brutus at G-7 (down the stairs) to start the quest Chocobo's Wounds. This quest requires you to acquire 4 Gausebit Grass, which are either about 10k gil each on the Auction House or drop from Wadi Hares in Dangruf Wadi (a Bastok area, past South Gustaberg) or Crane Flies in Meriphataud Mountains (on the Windurst path to get to Jeuno, connected to Tahrongi Canyon)."] = "Después, habla con Brutus en G-7 (bajando las escaleras) para empezar la quest Chocobo's Wounds. Esta quest requiere conseguir 4 Gausebit Grass, que cuestan unos 10k gil cada una en la Auction House o las sueltan los Wadi Hares de Dangruf Wadi (una zona de Bastok, pasado South Gustaberg) o los Crane Flies de Meriphataud Mountains (en el camino de Windurst a Jeuno, conectado con Tahrongi Canyon).",
    ["After the Dolls are defeated, examine the door again for a cutscene about failing to find the sword; that is the right one, and you can warp out."] = "Tras derrotar a los Dolls, examina de nuevo la puerta para una escena sobre no encontrar la espada; esa es la correcta, y puedes teletransportarte fuera.",
    ["After the Mammet fight you appear in South Gustaberg near the lighthouse."] = "Tras la pelea con los Mammets apareces en South Gustaberg, cerca del faro.",
    ["After the NM is defeated, check the Hume Bones again to receive a Blue Ribbon."] = "Tras derrotar al NM, revisa de nuevo los Hume Bones para recibir una Blue Ribbon.",
    ["After the NM is defeated, examine the Viscous Liquid for a cutscene."] = "Tras derrotar al NM, examina el Viscous Liquid para una escena.",
    ["After the Qufim Island event, receive six seals."] = "Tras el evento de Qufim Island, recibes seis sellos.",
    ["After the Sahagin are defeated, examine the ??? again for the key item Old trick box. You won't get it until all three, including corpses, have despawned."] = "Tras derrotar a los Sahagin, examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener el key item Old trick box. No lo conseguirás hasta que los tres, cuerpos incluidos, hayan desaparecido.",
    ["After the battle, examine sparkling ??? (F-11) again."] = "Tras la batalla, examina de nuevo la ??? reluciente (F-11).",
    ["After the conversation, zone out, then return and speak with him one last time to complete the quest and receive 10,000 gil."] = "Tras la conversación, sal de la zona, vuelve y habla con él una última vez para completar la quest y recibir 10,000 gil.",
    ["After the cutscene with Guilerme, return to Rosel for your reward: 200 gil if you named the right prince, only 100 gil if you named the wrong one."] = "Tras la escena con Guilerme, vuelve con Rosel por tu recompensa: 200 gil si nombraste al príncipe correcto, solo 100 gil si nombraste al equivocado.",
    ["After the cutscene you are in Kamihr Drifts. Examine the Alpine Trail at (H-5) (Bivouac #3 is closest) for a cutscene."] = "Tras la escena estás en Kamihr Drifts. Examina el Alpine Trail de (H-5) (el Bivouac #3 es el más cercano) para una escena.",
    ["After the cutscene you may commission Corsair Artifact Armor from Leleroon. You may choose the order in which you receive the armor, and you may commission a new piece one Vana'diel day (one Earth hour) after the last piece was completed."] = "Tras la escena puedes encargar Corsair Artifact Armor a Leleroon. Puedes elegir el orden en que recibes la armadura, y puedes encargar una pieza nueva un día de Vana'diel (una hora terrestre) después de terminar la anterior.",
    ["After the cutscene you're in Talacca Cove (others can join via Caedarva Mire Home Point #1)."] = "Tras la escena estás en Talacca Cove (los demás pueden unirse por el Home Point #1 de Caedarva Mire).",
    ["After the cutscene, everyone equips a stage 2+ Prime Weapon (not Duban or Loughnashade; helpers too) and examines the Valhallan Rift (G-7) again to fight Chaos. This is the hardest fight in the storyline; bring other players. Trusts may be resummoned."] = "Tras la escena, todos se equipan una Prime Weapon de fase 2 o superior (no Duban ni Loughnashade; los ayudantes también) y examinan de nuevo la Valhallan Rift (G-7) para luchar contra Chaos. Es la pelea más difícil de la historia; lleva a otros jugadores. Se pueden volver a invocar Trusts.",
    ["After the cutscene, go back to Windurst Woods and speak with Perih Vashai again. A cutscene with the Mithran Tracker sends you to Castle Oztroja to search a pool for an Old Earring."] = "Tras la escena, vuelve a Windurst Woods y habla de nuevo con Perih Vashai. Una escena con el Mithran Tracker te envía a Castle Oztroja a buscar en un estanque un Old Earring.",
    ["After the cutscene, return to Bastok and speak with Carmelo to complete the quest."] = "Tras la escena, vuelve a Bastok y habla con Carmelo para completar la quest.",
    ["After the cutscene, return to Perih Vashai to receive your Sniping Bow."] = "Tras la escena, vuelve con Perih Vashai para recibir tu Sniping Bow.",
    ["After the cutscene, return to Powhatan to complete the quest and receive a Spatha."] = "Tras la escena, vuelve con Powhatan para completar la quest y recibir una Spatha.",
    ["After the cutscene, speak with Andreine in the Celennia Memorial Library for the final cutscene and your reward."] = "Tras la escena, habla con Andreine en la Celennia Memorial Library para la última escena y tu recompensa.",
    ["After the cutscene, speak with Babenn in Bastok Mines (J-6) to complete the quest."] = "Tras la escena, habla con Babenn en Bastok Mines (J-6) para completar la quest.",
    ["After the cutscene, trade a Silk Cloth to Koru-Moru in Windurst Walls (E-7)."] = "Tras la escena, entrega una Silk Cloth a Koru-Moru en Windurst Walls (E-7).",
    ["After the drop the monsters aggro even level 99 characters, so use Sneak. Follow the path south until you come out on the island in Batallia Downs."] = "Tras la caída los monstruos atacan incluso a personajes de nivel 99, así que usa Sneak. Sigue el camino al sur hasta salir a la isla de Batallia Downs.",
    ["After the event ends, head back to Elki and speak to him to complete the quest."] = "Cuando termina el evento, vuelve con Elki y habla con él para completar la quest.",
    ["After the fight, examine Disturbed Dirt (K-9) again for a cutscene. If you zoned first, just examine it again."] = "Tras la pelea, examina de nuevo la Disturbed Dirt (K-9) para una escena. Si cambiaste de zona antes, solo examínala de nuevo.",
    ["After the fight, talk to Ge'Fhu Yagudoeye again for a short cutscene."] = "Tras el combate, habla otra vez con Ge'Fhu Yagudoeye para una escena corta.",
    ["After the final trial is complete, speak to Naja Salaheem to finish the quest and receive the SM Wildcat badge, which gives access to SM Assaults."] = "Tras completar la prueba final, habla con Naja Salaheem para terminar la quest y recibir el SM Wildcat badge, que da acceso a los SM Assaults.",
    ["After the last wall, take the elevator that appears at (H-8) to the bottom. You can't open the map down there: ignore the teleporter pad, go into the T-shaped hallway opposite it and turn left to the Stone Gate into The Shrouded Maw (right is a dead end)."] = "Tras el último muro, toma el ascensor que aparece en (H-8) hasta abajo. Allí no puedes abrir el mapa: ignora la plataforma de teletransporte, entra en el pasillo en forma de T de enfrente y gira a la izquierda hasta la Stone Gate hacia The Shrouded Maw (a la derecha es un callejón sin salida).",
    ["After the opening cutscene, you will find yourself in a random spot somewhere in your chosen city."] = "Tras la escena inicial, aparecerás en un punto al azar de la ciudad que elegiste.",
    ["After the questions, Waoud names the treasure he wants, but won't continue until at least one game day later, and you must zone at least once."] = "Tras las preguntas, Waoud nombra el tesoro que quiere, pero no continúa hasta al menos un día de juego después, y debes cambiar de zona al menos una vez.",
    ["After the questions, go to the western Acolyte Hostel building (K-5) for a cutscene and receive the Thesis on alchemy."] = "Tras las preguntas, ve al edificio oeste del Acolyte Hostel (K-5) para una escena y recibe la Thesis on alchemy.",
    ["After the required Vana'diel day has passed, leave the area and return to Aht Urhgan Whitegate."] = "Cuando haya pasado el día de Vana'diel requerido, sal de la zona y vuelve a Aht Urhgan Whitegate.",
    ["After the required Vana'diel day has passed, return to Aht Urhgan Whitegate."] = "Cuando haya pasado el día de Vana'diel requerido, vuelve a Aht Urhgan Whitegate.",
    ["After the required Vana'diel day has passed, travel to the Shararat Teahouse."] = "Cuando haya pasado el día de Vana'diel requerido, viaja a la Shararat Teahouse.",
    ["After the required time has passed, change zones."] = "Cuando haya pasado el tiempo requerido, cambia de zona.",
    ["After the required transition, travel to Aht Urhgan Whitegate."] = "Tras la transición requerida, viaja a Aht Urhgan Whitegate.",
    ["After the third Promyvion you appear in Lufaise Meadows (K-9) for a cutscene."] = "Tras el tercer Promyvion apareces en Lufaise Meadows (K-9) para una escena.",
    ["After the third spire you appear in Lufaise Meadows (K-9) and Chapter 2 begins."] = "Tras la tercera aguja apareces en Lufaise Meadows (K-9) y empieza el capítulo 2.",
    ["After the wait, check the campfire again and it drops a Galkan Sausage into your inventory, so make sure you have inventory room."] = "Tras la espera, revisa de nuevo la campfire y suelta un Galkan Sausage en tu inventario, así que asegúrate de tener espacio.",
    ["After their bodies disappear, examine the Fountain of Kings again for the key item Drops of Amnio."] = "Cuando desaparezcan sus cuerpos, examina de nuevo la Fountain of Kings para obtener el key item Drops of Amnio.",
    ["After this cutscene you may commission Blue Mage Artifact Armor (Magus Shalwar, Magus Bazubands and Magus Jubbah) from Lathuya, who gives you a Magus order slip and tells you to come back later. You do not have to defeat the Nepionic Soulflayer first."] = "Tras esta escena puedes encargar a Lathuya Blue Mage Artifact Armor (Magus Shalwar, Magus Bazubands y Magus Jubbah); te da una Magus order slip y te dice que vuelvas más tarde. No tienes que derrotar antes al Nepionic Soulflayer.",
    ["After winning all three, ride the geyser up the cliff at J-3 in Dangruf Wadi and follow the path into North Gustaberg (or use the North Gustaberg Geomagnetic Fount). Follow the river east down to the waterfall, staying on the south side."] = "Tras ganar a los tres, sube por el acantilado con el géiser de J-3 en Dangruf Wadi y sigue el camino hasta North Gustaberg (o usa la Geomagnetic Fount de North Gustaberg). Sigue el río al este hasta la cascada, por el lado sur.",
    ["After winning, return and speak with Aurege for your reward. The quest does not appear in your log until it is completed."] = "Tras ganar, vuelve y habla con Aurege por tu recompensa. La quest no aparece en tu log hasta que se completa.",
    ["After winning, wait for the game day to change, zone, and talk to Abquhbah between 15:00 and 17:00 game time to be promoted and receive the FL Wildcat badge, which gives access to FL Assaults."] = "Tras ganar, espera a que cambie el día de juego, cambia de zona y habla con Abquhbah entre las 15:00 y las 17:00 de hora de juego para ascender y recibir la FL Wildcat badge, que da acceso a los FL Assaults.",
    ["After years of quietly defying Imperial rule, the recluse Count Dracula has begun preparations for an assault on Al Zahbi. Infiltrate Leujaoam Sanctum, locate the count and slay him before he can execute his plans. Mission orders: defeat the count."] = "Tras años desafiando en silencio el dominio Imperial, el recluso Count Dracula ha empezado a preparar un ataque contra Al Zahbi. Infíltrate en Leujaoam Sanctum, localiza al conde y mátalo antes de que ejecute sus planes. Órdenes de la misión: derrotar al conde.",
    ["After you have all five Brand key items, speak to Waoud again for the final cutscene to finish the quest and receive the Immortal's Scimitar. You also receive the title Branded by the Five Serpents."] = "Cuando tengas los cinco key items Brand, habla de nuevo con Waoud para la escena final que termina la quest y te da el Immortal's Scimitar. También recibes el título Branded by the Five Serpents.",
    ["After you have defeated Bullheaded Grosvez, touch the ??? again to receive the Red oil."] = "Cuando hayas derrotado a Bullheaded Grosvez, toca la ??? de nuevo para recibir el Red oil.",
    ["Afterwards Katsunaga can show you the list of fish you have caught. It counts toward the 100 species needed for Fish Favors the Bold and the 60 types for Thanks for All the Fish. Only fish that entered your inventory count, not ones regretfully released for lack of space, and only those caught since the June 2015 update."] = "Después Katsunaga puede mostrarte la lista de peces que has pescado. Cuenta para las 100 especies que pide Fish Favors the Bold y los 60 tipos de Thanks for All the Fish. Solo cuentan los peces que entraron en tu inventario, no los que soltaste por falta de espacio, y solo los pescados desde la actualización de junio de 2015.",
    ["Afterwards warp out of the Royal Sepulcher and go to the castle gates for the next mission."] = "Después, teletranspórtate fuera del Royal Sepulcher y ve a las puertas del castillo para la misión siguiente.",
    ["Afterwards you can continue the Rhapsodies mission Tears of the Generals."] = "Después puedes continuar la misión de Rhapsodies Tears of the Generals.",
    ["Afterwards, if you finished Zilart through Awakening, Promathia through Dawn, have the Bundle of half-inscribed scrolls and Cipher: Rainemard, speak with Jamal in Ru'Lude Gardens (H-5) for the Ark Angel Trust objectives."] = "Después, si terminaste Zilart hasta Awakening y Promathia hasta Dawn, y tienes el Bundle of half-inscribed scrolls y Cipher: Rainemard, habla con Jamal en Ru'Lude Gardens (H-5) para los objetivos de Trust de los Ark Angels.",
    ["Afterwards, speak with Antreneau and he gives you a Grilled Hare."] = "Después, habla con Antreneau y te da un Grilled Hare.",
    ["Afterwards, speak with Rigobertine (J-7) twice for the Trust: Ingrid cutscene."] = "Después, habla dos veces con Rigobertine (J-7) para la escena de Trust: Ingrid.",
    ["Afterwards, trading Apururu another Bruised Starfruit gives 1,000 gil."] = "Después, entregar a Apururu otra Bruised Starfruit da 1,000 gil.",
    ["Ailments: Paralyze/Frost Ignis; Silence/Gravity/Choke Gelus; Slow/Petrify/Rasp Flabra; Stun/Shock Tellus; Poison/Drown Sulpor; Addle/Amnesia/Plague/Disease/Burn Unda; Bane/Blind/Bio/Drain Lux; Dia/Sleep/Charm/Holy Tenebrae. Wards: reduce elemental damage Vallation, for the party Valiance, absorb it Liement, enhance resistance Pflug. She also asks which question number you're on, so keep count. You receive the key item \"Secrets of Runic Enhancement\"."] = "Estados: Paralyze/Frost Ignis; Silence/Gravity/Choke Gelus; Slow/Petrify/Rasp Flabra; Stun/Shock Tellus; Poison/Drown Sulpor; Addle/Amnesia/Plague/Disease/Burn Unda; Bane/Blind/Bio/Drain Lux; Dia/Sleep/Charm/Holy Tenebrae. Protecciones: reducir el daño elemental Vallation, para el grupo Valiance, absorberlo Liement, mejorar la resistencia Pflug. También te pregunta en qué número de pregunta vas, así que lleva la cuenta. Recibes el key item \"Secrets of Runic Enhancement\".",
    ["Ajido-Marujido - Speak to Apururu in Windurst Woods at (H-9)."] = "Ajido-Marujido: habla con Apururu en Windurst Woods en (H-9).",
    ["All enemies in the assault aggro Professor Chanoix, as well as any party member without Sneak or with yellow or lower HP."] = "Todos los enemigos del assault atacan al Professor Chanoix, así como a cualquier miembro del grupo sin Sneak o con HP en amarillo o menos.",
    ["All enemies link via Sound."] = "Todos los enemigos se enlazan por sonido.",
    ["All of the Velkks at this camp may be aspired."] = "A todos los Velkks de este campamento se les puede hacer aspir.",
    ["All the required items can also be found at the Auction House, under Others, Misc. 1. The quest gives you the title Black Marketeer and can be repeated."] = "Todos los objetos necesarios también están en la Auction House, en Others, Misc. 1. La quest te da el título Black Marketeer y se puede repetir.",
    ["All three items can be farmed (Sleepshroom from Funguar type enemies, Treant Bulb from Sapling type enemies, and Wild Onion from Goblin Thug enemies or by gardening) or bought at the Auction House. If you buy, avoid Wild Onion, which is a hugely popular item for cooks and always expensive."] = "Los tres objetos se pueden farmear (Sleepshroom de enemigos de tipo Funguar, Treant Bulb de enemigos de tipo Sapling y Wild Onion de enemigos Goblin Thug o con jardinería) o comprar en la Auction House. Si compras, evita el Wild Onion, que es un objeto muy popular entre los cocineros y siempre es caro.",
    ["All three of the ones with Crags (Konschtat Highlands, La Theine Plateau, and Tahrongi Canyon) have a Survival Guide at one of their exits. They also each connect to a nearby dungeon (Gusgen Mines, Ordelle's Caves, and the Maze of Shakhrami) that has a Survival Guide at its entrance."] = "Las tres zonas con Crags (Konschtat Highlands, La Theine Plateau y Tahrongi Canyon) tienen una Survival Guide en una de sus salidas. También conectan cada una con una mazmorra cercana (Gusgen Mines, Ordelle's Caves y Maze of Shakhrami) que tiene una Survival Guide en la entrada.",
    ["All three of the zones adjacent to Jeuno (Sauromugue Champaign, Batallia Downs, and Rolanberry Fields) have a Survival Guide right next to their Cavernous Maw."] = "Las tres zonas junto a Jeuno (Sauromugue Champaign, Batallia Downs y Rolanberry Fields) tienen una Survival Guide justo al lado de su Cavernous Maw.",
    ["All three routes start the same way: to the room at (I/J-7) and back round to (I-9). Path 1 takes the first tunnel counter-clockwise from the cavern she left to map 2, drops at (H-8), turns left and ends at (G-10). Path 2 detours to (F-7) and back to (I-9), then takes the same tunnel and drop, turns right and ends in a small room at (I-7). Path 3 takes the third tunnel to map 3, goes west then south through the tunnel at (G-9) and ends in the room at (G-7)."] = "Las tres rutas empiezan igual: hasta la sala de (I/J-7) y de vuelta rodeando hasta (I-9). La ruta 1 toma el primer túnel en sentido antihorario desde la caverna de la que salió hacia el mapa 2, baja en (H-8), gira a la izquierda y termina en (G-10). La ruta 2 se desvía hasta (F-7) y vuelve a (I-9), luego toma el mismo túnel y la misma bajada, gira a la derecha y termina en una sala pequeña en (I-7). La ruta 3 toma el tercer túnel hacia el mapa 3, va al oeste y luego al sur por el túnel de (G-9) y termina en la sala de (G-7).",
    ["Also at 30, the Job Quests for Paladin, Dark Knight, Beastmaster, Bard, Ranger, Samurai, Ninja, Dragoon, and Summoner open up. Later on you'll have access to a few more Advanced Jobs, but we'll go over those as they come up. If you're interested in one of these, feel free to take some time off and get that to 30 and hey look, your new main job. Have fun!"] = "También a nivel 30 se abren las Job Quests de Paladin, Dark Knight, Beastmaster, Bard, Ranger, Samurai, Ninja, Dragoon y Summoner. Más adelante tendrás acceso a algunos Advanced Jobs más, pero los veremos cuando lleguen. Si te interesa uno de estos, tómate tu tiempo para subirlo a 30 y, mira por dónde, ya tienes nuevo job principal. ¡Diviértete!",
    ["Also, you will need three of a specific monster's drop to complete Rhapsodies mission 1-4, so making this walk lets you farm them along the way."] = "Además, necesitarás tres drops de un monstruo concreto para completar la misión 1-4 de Rhapsodies, así que hacer este camino a pie te permite farmearlos por el camino.",
    ["Alternatively, a Bag of Seeds can come from your Garden Furrow: tell Kuyin Hathdenna to \"look for seeds\" before harvesting it."] = "También puede salir una Bag of Seeds de tu Garden Furrow: dile a Kuyin Hathdenna que \"look for seeds\" antes de cosechar.",
    ["Alternatively, buy a Carnation in Upper Jeuno for 60 gil and trade it to Moari-Kaaori after speaking with him, which skips the trip."] = "Como alternativa, compra una Carnation en Upper Jeuno por 60 gil y entrégasela a Moari-Kaaori tras hablar con él, lo que te ahorra el viaje.",
    ["Alternatively, harvest Harvesting Points with Sickles until the key item drops. This is slow; bring spare Sickles."] = "También puedes recolectar en los Harvesting Points con Sickles hasta que salga el key item. Es lento; lleva Sickles de repuesto.",
    ["Alternatively, trade Harith one of these Recollections, without gil, to receive an item: Recollection of Suffering gives a Hamayumi, Recollection of Anxiety gives a Stone Gorget and Recollection of Animosity gives a Dia Wand. The Recollections of Suffering and Animosity come from Notorious Monsters in Promyvion - Vahzl."] = "Como alternativa, entrega a Harith una de estas Recollections, sin gil, para recibir un objeto: Recollection of Suffering da un Hamayumi, Recollection of Anxiety da un Stone Gorget y Recollection of Animosity da una Dia Wand. Las Recollections of Suffering y Animosity vienen de Notorious Monsters de Promyvion - Vahzl.",
    ["Alternatively, use the Ark Pentasphere at La'Loff Amphitheater and defeat all five Ark Angels in the same battle."] = "Como alternativa, usa la Ark Pentasphere en el La'Loff Amphitheater y derrota a los cinco Ark Angels en la misma batalla.",
    ["Although he does not ask for help, bring him a Slime Oil to solve his problem and obtain your reward, a Scroll of Warp."] = "Aunque no pide ayuda, llévale un Slime Oil para resolver su problema y obtener tu recompensa, un Scroll of Warp.",
    ["Amchuchu (a good tank)"] = "Amchuchu (un buen tanque)",
    ["Among the enemies are Mamool Ja Executioners and Puk Executioners."] = "Entre los enemigos hay Mamool Ja Executioners y Puk Executioners.",
    ["An Easy Limit Break"] = "Un Limit Break fácil",
    ["An Extra-Fine File drops from Fomor enemies in Lufaise Meadows: Fomor Warrior, Fomor Monk, Fomor Dark Knight, Fomor Paladin and Fomor Samurai."] = "Un Extra-Fine File lo sueltan enemigos Fomor en Lufaise Meadows: Fomor Warrior, Fomor Monk, Fomor Dark Knight, Fomor Paladin y Fomor Samurai.",
    ["An Immortals unit also joins in the recovery."] = "Una unidad de Immortals también participa en la recuperación.",
    ["An Ornate Door on the way opens with the nearby weight pad: 1 Galka, any 2 Hume/Elvaan/Mithra, 3 Tarutaru, or any 1 player after completing Open Sesame."] = "Una Ornate Door del camino se abre con la placa de peso cercana: 1 Galka, 2 Hume/Elvaan/Mithra cualesquiera, 3 Tarutaru, o 1 jugador cualquiera tras completar Open Sesame.",
    ["An agent sent to spy on the secret training grounds of the Mamool Ja has been captured. Rescue him before he is interrogated for Imperial secrets. Mission orders: rescue the agent."] = "Un agente enviado a espiar los terrenos secretos de entrenamiento de los Mamool Ja ha sido capturado. Rescátalo antes de que lo interroguen sobre secretos Imperial. Órdenes de la misión: rescatar al agente.",
    ["An imp known as the Black Baron has hit Periqia like a meteor strike, single-handedly defeating 79 Imperial soldiers. Mission orders: eliminate the Black Baron. The recommended level is 60."] = "Un imp conocido como el Black Baron ha golpeado Periqia como un meteorito, derrotando él solo a 79 soldados Imperial. Órdenes de la misión: eliminar al Black Baron. El nivel recomendado es 60.",
    ["Ancient Papyrus: drops from Liches (common), or collect three Ancient papyrus shreds in The Eldieme Necropolis, entering from Batallia Downs (I/J-10). The ??? spots are at (F-7), (F-9) and (H-9), map 1, each in the corner of a room with Liches around a brazier. Don't walk over the square graves: some drop you to a lower level (warp out and come back)."] = "Ancient Papyrus: lo sueltan los Liches (común), o reúne tres Ancient papyrus shreds en The Eldieme Necropolis, entrando desde Batallia Downs (I/J-10). Los puntos ??? están en (F-7), (F-9) y (H-9), mapa 1, cada uno en la esquina de una sala con Liches alrededor de un brasero. No pises las tumbas cuadradas: algunas te dejan caer a un nivel inferior (teletranspórtate fuera y vuelve).",
    ["Ancient Verse of Altepa: zone into the Chamber of Oracles (Quicksand Caves Home Point #1 is quickest). Otherwise enter Quicksand Caves from Western Altepa Desert (D-12) with Sneak, open the weighted door at (I-9) (3 points: Galka 3, Hume/Elvaan/Mithra 2, Tarutaru 1; the Loadstone from Open Sesame opens it solo) and keep left."] = "Ancient Verse of Altepa: entra en la Chamber of Oracles (el Home Point #1 de Quicksand Caves es lo más rápido). Si no, entra en Quicksand Caves desde Western Altepa Desert (D-12) con Sneak, abre la puerta de peso de (I-9) (3 puntos: Galka 3, Hume/Elvaan/Mithra 2, Tarutaru 1; la Loadstone de Open Sesame la abre en solitario) y ve siempre por la izquierda.",
    ["Ancient Verse of Uggalepih: get an Uggalepih Key from the Tonberry Cutters on Map 2 of the Temple of Uggalepih, open the Granite Door with it and examine the ??? at (E-8) on Map 2. Unity Warp (level 125) is quickest; at level 75+ nothing aggroes."] = "Ancient Verse of Uggalepih: consigue una Uggalepih Key de los Tonberry Cutters del mapa 2 del Temple of Uggalepih, abre con ella la Granite Door y examina la ??? de (E-8) en el mapa 2. El Unity Warp (nivel 125) es lo más rápido; a nivel 75+ nada ataca.",
    ["Another useful macro is the basic one to use a weapon skill, which looks like:"] = "Otra macro útil es la básica para usar un weapon skill, que es así:",
    ["Answer \"I have no recollection at all\" to continue, then speak with Jatan-Paratan again; the quest now appears in your quest log."] = "Responde \"I have no recollection at all\" para continuar, luego habla de nuevo con Jatan-Paratan; la quest ya aparece en tu quest log.",
    ["Answer \"Yes\" and then \"That's what I'm here for!\" to receive 10 Imperial Bronze Pieces (\"What am I, a donkey?\" also completes it, but without the coins)."] = "Responde \"Yes\" y luego \"That's what I'm here for!\" para recibir 10 Imperial Bronze Pieces (\"What am I, a donkey?\" también la completa, pero sin las monedas).",
    ["Answer the mandragora questions: Leafed = 4, Black = 4, and Flowered = 5."] = "Responde a las preguntas sobre mandragoras: Leafed = 4, Black = 4 y Flowered = 5.",
    ["Answer the questions in order: Yorcia Weald; Morimar; The Serpentine Labyrinth; Yes it does; Who are \"They\"?; Unleash a feral scream; What are you proposing?"] = "Responde las preguntas en orden: Yorcia Weald; Morimar; The Serpentine Labyrinth; Yes it does; Who are \"They\"?; Unleash a feral scream; What are you proposing?",
    ["Answering all 6 questions correctly also gives you a Vile Elixir. If you already have one you cannot complete the quest: zone out, get rid of it, then come back to continue. With 4 correct answers the quest continues, but you get no Vile Elixir."] = "Responder correctamente las 6 preguntas también te da un Vile Elixir. Si ya tienes uno no puedes completar la quest: sal de la zona, deshazte de él y vuelve para continuar. Con 4 respuestas correctas la quest continúa, pero no recibes Vile Elixir.",
    ["Answers that have worked: One forges for oneself / Absolutely / Burn the scroll / Without hesitation / A chaotic life / Embrace life as a beast / Cut him down / Grant the request / End his pain / Follow your sense of justice. Others report that the third option for every question works too."] = "Respuestas que han funcionado: One forges for oneself / Absolutely / Burn the scroll / Without hesitation / A chaotic life / Embrace life as a beast / Cut him down / Grant the request / End his pain / Follow your sense of justice. Otros dicen que la tercera opción de cada pregunta también funciona.",
    ["Apex Bat/Apex Ironclad"] = "Apex Bat/Apex Ironclad",
    ["Apex Crab"] = "Apex Crab",
    ["Apex Crab/Apex Bats"] = "Apex Crab/Apex Bats",
    ["Apex Crab/Apex Jagil"] = "Apex Crab/Apex Jagil",
    ["Apex Eruca"] = "Apex Eruca",
    ["Apex Idle Drifter"] = "Apex Idle Drifter",
    ["Apex Jagil"] = "Apex Jagil",
    ["Apex Jagil/Apex Toad"] = "Apex Jagil/Apex Toad",
    ["Apex Jagil/Velkk Abyssal/Velkk Junglemancer"] = "Apex Jagil/Velkk Abyssal/Velkk Junglemancer",
    ["Apex Leech/Apex Chapuli"] = "Apex Leech/Apex Chapuli",
    ["Apex Lv125-127"] = "Apex Lv125-127",
    ["Apex Lv128-130"] = "Apex Lv128-130",
    ["Apex Lv128-130, Camp is on the east side"] = "Apex Lv128-130, el campamento está en el lado este",
    ["Apex Lv128-130, Camp is on the west side"] = "Apex Lv128-130, el campamento está en el lado oeste",
    ["Apex Lv128-130, Crab Bowl"] = "Apex Lv128-130, Crab Bowl",
    ["Apex Lv131-133"] = "Apex Lv131-133",
    ["Apex Lv131-133, Camp is on the east side"] = "Apex Lv131-133, el campamento está en el lado este",
    ["Apex Lv134-136, Basement"] = "Apex Lv134-136, sótano",
    ["Apex Lv140-142, Right of Zone Entrance"] = "Apex Lv140-142, a la derecha de la entrada de la zona",
    ["Apex Twitherym/Apex Ironclad"] = "Apex Twitherym/Apex Ironclad",
    ["Apex monsters: fight them in a party with magic bursts or a skillchain with a strong closer. They respawn quickly; none link to each other, but most aggro."] = "Monstruos Apex: lucha contra ellos en grupo con magic bursts o un skillchain con un buen cierre. Reaparecen rápido; ninguno se enlaza con los demás, pero la mayoría ataca.",
    ["Approach Cutter for a cutscene. You end up in Talacca Cove; don't warp away, the next mission is there."] = "Acércate al Cutter para una escena. Acabas en Talacca Cove; no te teletransportes, la misión siguiente es allí.",
    ["Approach Cutter for another cutscene."] = "Acércate al Cutter para otra escena.",
    ["Approach Naja Salaheem (I-10)."] = "Acércate a Naja Salaheem (I-10).",
    ["Approach Naja Salaheem in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10) for a cutscene that begins the quest. If you are repeating this quest, skip this step and go straight to the Imperial Whitegate in the next step. This quest follows Waking the Colossus."] = "Acércate a Naja Salaheem en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10) para una escena que empieza la quest. Si repites esta quest, salta este paso y ve directo a la Imperial Whitegate en el siguiente paso. Esta quest sigue a Waking the Colossus.",
    ["Approach Naja Salaheem in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10) for a cutscene that begins the quest. Imperial researchers are uneasy about curious readings from the chamber where the iron colossus sleeps."] = "Acércate a Naja Salaheem en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10) para una escena que empieza la quest. Los investigadores imperiales están inquietos por unas lecturas extrañas de la cámara donde duerme el coloso de hierro.",
    ["Approach Wegellion in the Scouts' Coalition in Eastern Adoulin (waypoint #2) for a cutscene and the Tintinnabulum."] = "Acércate a Wegellion en la Scouts' Coalition de Eastern Adoulin (waypoint #2) para una escena y el Tintinnabulum.",
    ["Approach the Audience Chamber in the Grand Duke's Palace."] = "Acércate a la Audience Chamber en el Grand Duke's Palace.",
    ["Approach the Castle Adoulin gates in Eastern Adoulin, where Ploh Trishbahk (K-9) stands, for a cutscene."] = "Acércate a las puertas de Castle Adoulin en Eastern Adoulin, donde está Ploh Trishbahk (K-9), para una escena.",
    ["Approach the Castle Adoulin gates in Eastern Adoulin, where Ploh Trishbahk (K-9) stands, for a cutscene. Taking the waypoint to the gates also triggers it."] = "Acércate a las puertas de Castle Adoulin en Eastern Adoulin, donde está Ploh Trishbahk (K-9), para una escena. Tomar el waypoint a las puertas también la activa.",
    ["Approach the Cutter for a cutscene, then examine it to enter the battlefield."] = "Acércate al Cutter para una escena y luego examínalo para entrar en el campo de batalla.",
    ["Approach the Cutter for a cutscene. Examine the Cutter to enter a battlefield against Yazquhl and Gowam."] = "Acércate al Cutter para una escena. Examina el Cutter para entrar en un campo de batalla contra Yazquhl y Gowam.",
    ["Approach the Ergon Locus (Torchbloom) at (J-7)/(K-7), near the Frontier Station Waypoint."] = "Acércate al Ergon Locus (Torchbloom) en (J-7)/(K-7), cerca del Frontier Station Waypoint.",
    ["Approach the Palace in Ru'Lude Gardens for a cutscene."] = "Acércate al palacio de Ru'Lude Gardens para una escena.",
    ["Approach the Palace."] = "Acércate al Palace.",
    ["Apururu gives you the six Dark Mana Orb key items. If you have a Windurst Trust permit, talk to her twice."] = "Apururu te da los seis key items Dark Mana Orb. Si tienes un Windurst Trust permit, habla con ella dos veces.",
    ["Aquila casts tier 3-4 nukes, Sleepga II and Dispelga, has en-spells, and his Altair Bullet is a cone with Paralyze and big knockback. Haudrale casts black magic and has a knockback weapon skill."] = "Aquila lanza nukes de nivel 3-4, Sleepga II y Dispelga, tiene en-spells, y su Altair Bullet es un cono con Paralyze y mucho retroceso. Haudrale lanza magia negra y tiene un weapon skill con retroceso.",
    ["Arciela and Teodor help, and the mission fails if either dies. You can only heal Arciela, so keep Hades off Teodor. Hades' HP bar stays hidden."] = "Arciela y Teodor ayudan, y la misión falla si muere cualquiera de los dos. Solo puedes curar a Arciela, así que mantén a Hades lejos de Teodor. La barra de HP de Hades está oculta.",
    ["Arciela joins once you draw your weapon. She needs healing, and the mission fails if she dies."] = "Arciela se une cuando desenfundas el arma. Necesita curas, y la misión falla si muere.",
    ["Arciela, Darrcuiln, the Noble Warrior and Resolute Leafkins fight with you; the battle is lost if any of them die. You can heal and buff them with Blood Pact: Wards, or with Accession or Curaga cast on one of your Trusts."] = "Arciela, Darrcuiln, el Noble Warrior y los Resolute Leafkins luchan contigo; la batalla se pierde si muere cualquiera de ellos. Puedes curarlos y potenciarlos con Blood Pact: Wards, o con Accession o Curaga lanzados sobre uno de tus Trusts.",
    ["Arcuhbah cycles through all three critters without repeating within each set of three. Fubruhn and Ugrihd signal with emotes: Nod = Beetle (plan 1) or Crab (plan 2), Laugh = Ghost or Beetle, Psych = Crab or Ghost; if you don't know their current plan, pick Beetle, Ghost and Crab respectively."] = "Arcuhbah alterna los tres bichos sin repetir dentro de cada serie de tres. Fubruhn y Ugrihd dan señales con emotes: Nod = Beetle (plan 1) o Crab (plan 2), Laugh = Ghost o Beetle, Psych = Crab o Ghost; si no sabes cuál es su plan actual, elige Beetle, Ghost y Crab respectivamente.",
    ["Around the Pond"] = "Alrededor del estanque",
    ["Around the pond"] = "Alrededor del estanque",
    ["As a Bard of level 40 or higher, speak with Mertaire in the Merry Minstrel's Meadhouse in Lower Jeuno (H-8) to receive the key item Mertaire's bracelet."] = "Como Bard de nivel 40 o superior, habla con Mertaire en el Merry Minstrel's Meadhouse de Lower Jeuno (H-8) para recibir el key item Mertaire's bracelet.",
    ["As a Bard of level 50 or higher, speak with Bki Tbujhja in the Merry Minstrel's Meadhouse in Lower Jeuno (H-8). She asks for a flask of Holy Water."] = "Como Bard de nivel 50 o superior, habla con Bki Tbujhja en el Merry Minstrel's Meadhouse de Lower Jeuno (H-8). Te pide un frasco de Holy Water.",
    ["As a Beastmaster of level 50 or higher, examine the Door: Merchant's House at (G-11) on the upper level behind Greyson in Lower Jeuno (Home Point #1) for a cutscene. From here on any job works."] = "Como Beastmaster de nivel 50 o superior, examina la Door: Merchant's House en (G-11), en el nivel superior detrás de Greyson en Lower Jeuno (Home Point #1), para una escena. A partir de aquí sirve cualquier job.",
    ["As a Dancer of level 40 or higher, speak with Laila in Upper Jeuno (G-7). If she asks about seeing you dance, the quest is active."] = "Como Dancer de nivel 40 o superior, habla con Laila en Upper Jeuno (G-7). Si te pregunta por verte bailar, la quest está activa.",
    ["As a Rune Fencer, speak with Octavien in Eastern Adoulin (I-8) for the key item Runic kinegraver."] = "Como Rune Fencer, habla con Octavien en Eastern Adoulin (I-8) para obtener el key item Runic kinegraver.",
    ["As a White Mage of level 50 or higher, examine the Door: Prince Regent's Rm in Chateau d'Oraguille at (H-8) to start the quest. You must be able to enter Chateau d'Oraguille: San d'Orians need rank 2, players from other nations must be on Mission 2-3 or later."] = "Como White Mage de nivel 50 o superior, examina la Door: Prince Regent's Rm de Chateau d'Oraguille en (H-8) para empezar la quest. Debes poder entrar en Chateau d'Oraguille: los de San d'Oria necesitan rango 2 y los jugadores de otras naciones deben estar en la Mission 2-3 o posterior.",
    ["As a White Mage, level 40 or higher, speak with Narcheral upstairs in the Cathedral in Northern San d'Oria (M-6) to get the quest. You can do the rest of the quest on any job."] = "Como White Mage de nivel 40 o superior, habla con Narcheral arriba en la Cathedral de Northern San d'Oria (M-6) para obtener la quest. El resto de la quest se puede hacer con cualquier trabajo.",
    ["As a job at level 30 or higher, speak with Ratihb in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-12), at the Shararat Teahouse, for a cutscene that begins the quest. This quest requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Como un trabajo de nivel 30 o superior, habla con Ratihb en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-12), en la Shararat Teahouse, para una escena que empieza la quest. Esta quest requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["As you complete objectives, you may unlock access to new ones or higher tiers of previously completed objectives. Always keep an eye out for new objectives to flag."] = "A medida que completes objetivos, puedes desbloquear otros nuevos o niveles superiores de objetivos ya completados. Estate siempre atento a nuevos objetivos que activar.",
    ["As you hit enemies, you will gain combat skill levels, which display in your log with a message like \"Dagger skill rises 0.1 points\". When you get enough, you will automatically unlock weaponskills. A weaponskill spends 1,000 or more TP (up to a maximum of 3,000) to do damage. Some also do other things like restore MP, heal you, or inflict status ailments. Spend your TP as you get it once you have a weapon skill unlocked, since they deal more damage than autoattacks."] = "Al golpear enemigos ganarás niveles de skill de combate, que aparecen en el registro con un mensaje como \"Dagger skill rises 0.1 points\". Cuando tengas suficiente, desbloquearás weaponskills automáticamente. Un weaponskill gasta 1,000 o más de TP (hasta un máximo de 3,000) para hacer daño. Algunos también hacen otras cosas, como recuperar MP, curarte o provocar estados alterados. Gasta tu TP según lo consigas cuando tengas un weapon skill desbloqueado, ya que hacen más daño que los ataques automáticos.",
    ["Ashrakk: go to the southeast part of (H-6) in Yorcia Weald (Frontier Bivouac #1 is closest). Examine the Wavering Flux twice. Morimar must survive. Under 50% Ashrakk summons a Hell-spawned Orthrus, which you can ignore if your damage is high."] = "Ashrakk: ve a la parte sureste de (H-6) en Yorcia Weald (el Frontier Bivouac #1 es el más cercano). Examina el Wavering Flux dos veces. Morimar debe sobrevivir. Por debajo del 50% Ashrakk invoca a un Hell-spawned Orthrus, al que puedes ignorar si tu daño es alto.",
    ["Ask for a divination by selecting \"Gaze away.\" and pay the 1,000 gil. He tells you that your fate lies beyond the gate of nobility. There are other cutscenes possible here, so make sure you have the quest flagged before leaving Aht Urhgan Whitegate."] = "Pide una adivinación eligiendo \"Gaze away.\" y paga los 1,000 gil. Te dice que tu destino está más allá de la puerta de la nobleza. Aquí son posibles otras escenas, así que asegúrate de tener la quest marcada antes de salir de Aht Urhgan Whitegate.",
    ["Ask her \"What does Geosuke recommend?\" and buy the Esthete's Masque, Coat and Hose (30,000 Bayld each, 90,000 total)."] = "Pregúntale \"What does Geosuke recommend?\" y compra la Esthete's Masque, Coat y Hose (30,000 Bayld cada uno, 90,000 en total).",
    ["Ask her about the Frost-encrusted flame gem for the key item Flask of fruiserum."] = "Pregúntale por la Frost-encrusted flame gem para obtener el key item Flask of fruiserum.",
    ["At (G-7), examine the ??? to spawn Stolas, a bird weak to Ice. Defeat it and examine the ??? again for the key item Annals of Truth."] = "En (G-7), examina la ??? para hacer aparecer a Stolas, un pájaro débil a Ice. Derrótalo y examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener el key item Annals of Truth.",
    ["At (H-9) in Nashmau, another cutscene takes place. Choose \"No, let's keep trying!\". If you choose the wrong answer during the cutscene, you need to wait for a new game day before repeating it."] = "En (H-9) de Nashmau tiene lugar otra escena. Elige \"No, let's keep trying!\". Si eliges la respuesta equivocada durante la escena, tendrás que esperar a un nuevo día de juego para repetirla.",
    ["At (I-9) you find two Mythril Seams. Mine the western seam to get a Sharp Stone."] = "En (I-9) encuentras dos Mythril Seams. Mina la veta occidental para obtener una Sharp Stone.",
    ["At 50% damage taken he retreats to the dais with 2 untouchable Moogle White Mages curing him and sends 5 Black Mages (sleepable, killable; -ga III and tier IV nukes). He returns once he's healed or the Black Mages are dead. This repeats; the last time he stays and fights alongside them, the most dangerous phase."] = "Al recibir el 50% de daño se retira al estrado con 2 Moogle White Mages intocables que lo curan y envía a 5 Black Mages (se pueden dormir y matar; -ga III y nukes de nivel IV). Vuelve cuando se ha curado o han muerto los Black Mages. Esto se repite; la última vez se queda y lucha junto a ellos, la fase más peligrosa.",
    ["At 50, you will have to complete In Defiant Challenge, a collectathon of one dropped item or three (much easier) static ???-point items from each of Garlaige Citadel, Eldieme Necropolis, and Crawler's Nest. (The ??? points were added in 2015. Casting the highest lot in your party to get that Ancient Papyrus was a rite of passage in 2005. Just go find those ??? points.)"] = "A nivel 50 tendrás que completar In Defiant Challenge, una recolección de un objeto que suelta un monstruo o de tres objetos de puntos ??? fijos (mucho más fácil) en cada una de Garlaige Citadel, Eldieme Necropolis y Crawler's Nest. (Los puntos ??? se añadieron en 2015. Sacar el lote más alto del grupo para llevarte ese Ancient Papyrus era un rito de paso en 2005. Ve a buscar esos puntos ???.)",
    ["At 8 (\"That was easy\") he runs to the zone line and despawns. Stay behind him, as he faces your way on the way out."] = "En 8 (\"That was easy\") corre al límite de zona y desaparece. Quédate detrás de él, ya que de salida mira hacia ti.",
    ["At Konschtat Highlands, examine Crag of Dem (I-7)."] = "En Konschtat Highlands, examina el Crag of Dem (I-7).",
    ["At La Theine Plateau, examine Crag of Holla (J-8)."] = "En La Theine Plateau, examina el Crag of Holla (J-8).",
    ["At Tahrongi Canyon, examine Crag of Mea (I-6)."] = "En Tahrongi Canyon, examina el Crag of Mea (I-6).",
    ["At each protocrystal, examine it once to use the seal, then again to enter the battlefield (no Trusts; content level about 40, soloable around level 55-60). The weakened Prime avatar only dies after trying Astral Flow five times."] = "En cada protocristal, examínalo una vez para usar el sello y de nuevo para entrar en el campo de batalla (sin Trusts; nivel de contenido 40 aproximadamente, se puede hacer en solitario hacia el nivel 55-60). El avatar Prime debilitado solo muere tras intentar Astral Flow cinco veces.",
    ["At entrance and Banishing Gate #1 (Map 1)"] = "En la entrada y en la Banishing Gate #1 (mapa 1)",
    ["At entrance from Western Altepa Desert."] = "En la entrada desde Western Altepa Desert.",
    ["At last he fishes up The Big One, a Flesh-type monster. Defeat it and Travonce gives you the key item Travonce's Escort Award."] = "Por último pesca The Big One, un monstruo de tipo Flesh. Derrótalo y Travonce te da el key item Travonce's Escort Award.",
    ["At level 61, you can complete Limit Break 4, Riding on the Clouds, to raise your level cap to 70. It just requires talking to some NPCs and turning in four Kindred's Seals."] = "A nivel 61 puedes completar el Limit Break 4, Riding on the Clouds, para subir tu límite de nivel a 70. Solo requiere hablar con algunos NPCs y entregar cuatro Kindred's Seals.",
    ["At level 75: bring Reraise and only raise once everyone is down and the Ark Angels have reset (they share hate); move out of the centre if you're about to die. Put a tank or kiter on each and kill them one by one, keep the pets asleep, and kill TT first (nasty spells). MR charms at least once (Fealty, light resistance, magic evasion help); GK's Meikyo Shisui aims at a Light skillchain (Utsusemi breaks it); stay out of HM's Mijin Gakure range (Barfira doesn't help); EV's Spirits Within can one-shot."] = "A nivel 75: lleva Reraise y solo resucita cuando todos hayan caído y los Ark Angels se hayan reiniciado (comparten el odio); apártate del centro si estás a punto de morir. Pon un tanque o alguien que los pasee con cada uno y mátalos uno a uno, mantén dormidas a las mascotas y mata primero a TT (hechizos peligrosos). MR encanta al menos una vez (Fealty, resistencia a la luz y evasión mágica ayudan); el Meikyo Shisui de GK busca un skillchain de Light (Utsusemi lo rompe); mantente fuera del alcance del Mijin Gakure de HM (Barfira no ayuda); el Spirits Within de EV puede matar de un golpe.",
    ["At level 99, the Bight Uragnite at (K-8) in Ceizak Battlegrounds are good for breaking the latent."] = "A nivel 99, los Bight Uragnite de (K-8) en Ceizak Battlegrounds van bien para romper el latente.",
    ["At max level one tablet is enough: warp to Den of Rancor Home Point #1, exit south via the switch, take Tablet of Hexes: Blight at (H-9) on Map 2, warp back and continue. Below level 99, collect all 16."] = "A nivel máximo basta con una tablilla: teletranspórtate al Home Point #1 de Den of Rancor, sal por el sur con el interruptor, coge la Tablet of Hexes: Blight en (H-9) del mapa 2, vuelve a teletransportarte y continúa. Por debajo de nivel 99, reúne las 16.",
    ["At max level you only need one: warp to Toraimarai Canal Home Point #1 and grab the Dark sap crystal nearby. Below level 99, collect them all; each weakens that element's Astral Flow in the next fight."] = "A nivel máximo solo necesitas uno: teletranspórtate al Home Point #1 de Toraimarai Canal y coge el Dark sap crystal de al lado. Por debajo de nivel 99, recógelos todos; cada uno debilita el Astral Flow de ese elemento en la siguiente pelea.",
    ["At one of them (usually the second, rarely the first) a cutscene asks for \"the Mage's black power\": use Manafont, then examine the ??? again for another cutscene. The rest of the quest can be done on any job."] = "En una de ellas (normalmente la segunda, rara vez la primera) una escena pide \"the Mage's black power\": usa Manafont y examina de nuevo la ??? para otra escena. El resto de la quest puede hacerse con cualquier job.",
    ["At that point trade the Pugil Scales to the tree to receive your Starfall Tear."] = "En ese momento entrega las Pugil Scales al árbol para recibir tu Starfall Tear.",
    ["At the Cloister of Flames protocrystal, defeat Ifrit Prime."] = "En el protocrystal del Cloister of Flames, derrota a Ifrit Prime.",
    ["At the Cloister of Frost protocrystal, defeat Shiva Prime."] = "En el protocrystal del Cloister of Frost, derrota a Shiva Prime.",
    ["At the Cloister of Gales protocrystal, defeat Garuda Prime."] = "En el protocrystal del Cloister of Gales, derrota a Garuda Prime.",
    ["At the Cloister of Storms protocrystal, defeat Ramuh Prime."] = "En el protocrystal del Cloister of Storms, derrota a Ramuh Prime.",
    ["At the Cloister of Tides protocrystal, defeat Leviathan Prime."] = "En el protocrystal del Cloister of Tides, derrota a Leviathan Prime.",
    ["At the Cloister of Tremors protocrystal, defeat Titan Prime."] = "En el protocrystal del Cloister of Tremors, derrota a Titan Prime.",
    ["At the Nyzul Isle Staging Point, examine blank target (the unlit lamp at J-9, next to the Runic Portals) and choose \"Yes\"."] = "En el Nyzul Isle Staging Point, examina el objetivo vacío (la lámpara apagada de J-9, junto a los Runic Portals) y elige \"Yes\".",
    ["At the Nyzul Isle Staging Point, examine blank target for a cutscene."] = "En el Nyzul Isle Staging Point, examina el objetivo vacío para una escena.",
    ["At the end of the cutscene, trade the Dog Collar to Gudav to complete the quest and receive the Map of the Gusgen Mines."] = "Al final de la escena, entrega el Dog Collar a Gudav para completar la quest y recibir el Map of the Gusgen Mines.",
    ["At the end of the starting cutscene you received three key items: Gang whereabouts note, First forged envelope and Second forged envelope. The two envelopes can be done in either order."] = "Al final de la escena inicial recibiste tres key items: Gang whereabouts note, First forged envelope y Second forged envelope. Los dos sobres pueden hacerse en cualquier orden.",
    ["At the end of the tunnel (L-9) there is a ??? you need to examine for another cutscene."] = "Al final del túnel (L-9) hay una ??? que debes examinar para otra escena.",
    ["At this point the quest is completed. If you trade the Lightning Band to the Leypoint in Wajaom Woodlands (G-8), it transforms into an Olduum Ring."] = "En este punto la quest está completada. Si entregas la Lightning Band al Leypoint de Wajaom Woodlands (G-8), se transforma en una Olduum Ring.",
    ["At this point you can begin and make good progress in several different Mission storylines. These will take you to new areas with new currencies, NPCs, foes, and game systems. By no means are you required to start any of these Missions now, you are free to defer them until later if you like. If you just want to level up, head on down to the \"Enough Distractions, Let's Level Up\" section."] = "En este punto puedes empezar y avanzar bastante en varias historias de Missions. Te llevarán a zonas nuevas con monedas, NPCs, enemigos y sistemas de juego nuevos. No estás obligado a empezar ninguna de estas Missions ahora; puedes dejarlas para más adelante si quieres. Si solo quieres subir de nivel, ve a la sección \"Enough Distractions, Let's Level Up\".",
    ["Attohwa Chasm - levels 30-38 - An uncommon choice, but there's never anyone here so it's always full of enemies. Zone in from Maze of Shakhrami and fight your way to the surface through the tunnels, killing all the Worms and Hecteyes on the way (Hecteyes aggro, Worms link.) Once you make it out into the open, you'll have gained a few levels and be able to handle the roaming Antlions and Goblins. Don't go far into the narrow rocky areas, as hidden underground Antlions will ambush you, and watch out for the Scorpions who are stronger than the other enemies in the area."] = "Attohwa Chasm - niveles 30-38 - Una opción poco habitual, pero nunca hay nadie, así que siempre está llena de enemigos. Entra desde Maze of Shakhrami y abre camino hasta la superficie por los túneles, matando todos los Worms y Hecteyes por el camino (los Hecteyes atacan, los Worms se enlazan.) Cuando salgas al exterior habrás ganado algunos niveles y podrás con los Antlions y Goblins errantes. No te adentres en las zonas rocosas estrechas, ya que los Antlions ocultos bajo tierra te emboscarán, y cuidado con los escorpiones, que son más fuertes que el resto de enemigos de la zona.",
    ["Attune it at the Geomagnetic Fount in any one of: Gustav Tunnel (G-10) map 1, Ranguemont Pass (J-10), Yughott Grotto (J-7), King Ranperre's Tomb (K-6), Monastic Cavern (H-10) map 1, Eldieme Necropolis (J-10) map 2, Ordelle's Caves (F-12), Gusgen Mines (G-7) map 3, Dangruf Wadi (E-11), Korroloka Tunnel (G-9) map 4, Palborough Mines (J-8) map 2, Labyrinth of Onzozo (J-5), Maze of Shakhrami (K-9) map 1, Garlaige Citadel (G-8) map 2, Crawlers' Nest (F-7) map 1, Outer Horutoto Ruins (G-7) map 2, Inner Horutoto Ruins (G/H-7) map 2 or Toraimarai Canal (I-6)."] = "Sintonízalo en la Geomagnetic Fount de cualquiera de estas zonas: Gustav Tunnel (G-10) mapa 1, Ranguemont Pass (J-10), Yughott Grotto (J-7), King Ranperre's Tomb (K-6), Monastic Cavern (H-10) mapa 1, Eldieme Necropolis (J-10) mapa 2, Ordelle's Caves (F-12), Gusgen Mines (G-7) mapa 3, Dangruf Wadi (E-11), Korroloka Tunnel (G-9) mapa 4, Palborough Mines (J-8) mapa 2, Labyrinth of Onzozo (J-5), Maze of Shakhrami (K-9) mapa 1, Garlaige Citadel (G-8) mapa 2, Crawlers' Nest (F-7) mapa 1, Outer Horutoto Ruins (G-7) mapa 2, Inner Horutoto Ruins (G/H-7) mapa 2 o Toraimarai Canal (I-6).",
    ["Automatically stacking items in your inventory as you acquire them"] = "Apilar automáticamente los objetos en el inventario al conseguirlos",
    ["Avoid Ghosts, Elementals and Poltergeists"] = "Evita los Ghosts, Elementals y Poltergeists",
    ["Avoid Rams, Elementals and Poltergeists"] = "Evita los Rams, Elementals y Poltergeists",
    ["Avoid Rams, Ghosts, Elementals and Poltergeists"] = "Evita los Rams, Ghosts, Elementals y Poltergeists",
    ["Avoid the level 140 Apex Idle Drifters, Woeful Lamenters and Livid Ragers (true hearing); set up Reraise in case. Clear floors 1 and 2 through the Memory Receptacles as in the first Promyvions."] = "Evita a los Apex Idle Drifters, Woeful Lamenters y Livid Ragers de nivel 140 (true hearing); prepara Reraise por si acaso. Supera los pisos 1 y 2 mediante los Memory Receptacles como en los primeros Promyvions.",
    ["Back in Caedarva Mire (this part is on the Azouph Isle map), use Invisible and find the ??? behind a tree a short way from the zone line, around (K-5)/(K-6). Watch out for Mosshorn rams and Elder Treants."] = "De vuelta en Caedarva Mire (esta parte está en el mapa de Azouph Isle), usa Invisible y busca la ??? detrás de un árbol, a poca distancia del límite de zona, hacia (K-5)/(K-6). Cuidado con los carneros Mosshorn y los Elder Treants.",
    ["Back in Oldton Movalpolos, trade the 11th ash to Brakobrik and choose \"No Thanks\" to receive the key item Old nametag, then speak with Ravorara in Port Bastok again for a cutscene."] = "De vuelta en Oldton Movalpolos, entrega la ceniza número 11 a Brakobrik y elige \"No Thanks\" para recibir el key item Old nametag; luego habla de nuevo con Ravorara en Port Bastok para una escena.",
    ["Back inside, head west, then south to (H-10), then west again past the Granite Door into the Tonberry Kitchen."] = "De vuelta dentro, ve al oeste, luego al sur hasta (H-10) y de nuevo al oeste pasando la Granite Door hasta la Tonberry Kitchen.",
    ["Back to the Grind"] = "De vuelta a subir de nivel",
    ["Bane is inflicted by Lost Soul enemies in The Eldieme Necropolis, and pays 1,200 gil."] = "Bane lo infligen los enemigos Lost Soul en The Eldieme Necropolis, y paga 1,200 gil.",
    ["Base EP at M.Lvl 0 @ 520 points. Approx. 15-16 spawns on level 1"] = "EP base con M.Lvl 0: 520 puntos. Aproximadamente 15-16 apariciones en el nivel 1",
    ["Bastok"] = "Bastok",
    ["Bastok First:"] = "Bastok First:",
    ["Bastok Mission 1-1"] = "Bastok Mission 1-1",
    ["Bastok Mission 1-3 is inside Palborough Mines."] = "La Bastok Mission 1-3 es dentro de Palborough Mines.",
    ["Bastok Mission 2-1 players:"] = "Jugadores de la Bastok Mission 2-1:",
    ["Bastok Mission 2-3"] = "Bastok Mission 2-3",
    ["Bastok Mission 3-1"] = "Bastok Mission 3-1",
    ["Bastok Mission 3-2 (skippable)"] = "Bastok Mission 3-2 (se puede saltar)",
    ["Bastok Mission 3-3"] = "Bastok Mission 3-3",
    ["Bastok Mission 4-1"] = "Bastok Mission 4-1",
    ["Bastok Mission 5-1"] = "Bastok Mission 5-1",
    ["Bastok Mission 5-2"] = "Bastok Mission 5-2",
    ["Bastok Path:"] = "Bastok Path:",
    ["Bastok: Bastok Mines (I-9), Bastok Markets (I-8), or Port Bastok (D-7)."] = "Bastok: Bastok Mines (I-9), Bastok Markets (I-8) o Port Bastok (D-7).",
    ["Bastok: complete Light in the Darkness and Burden of Suspicion."] = "Bastok: completa Light in the Darkness y Burden of Suspicion.",
    ["Bastok: give the letter to Adelbrecht in Bastok Markets [S] (E-9) and complete The Fighting Fourth, then Better Part of Valor and Fires of Discontent."] = "Bastok: entrega la carta a Adelbrecht en Bastok Markets [S] (E-9) y completa The Fighting Fourth, luego Better Part of Valor y Fires of Discontent.",
    ["Bastok: pioneer of the Palborough Mines = Babenn (Bastok Mines, J-6); watching Dalzakk's home = Gwill (Markets, E-11); robes and bronze subligaria = Brygid (Markets, K-9); never as good as her sister = Kaede (Port Bastok, J-5); lost her husband in the mines = Hilda (Port Bastok, E-6); number five doorman = Naji (Metalworks, J-8); \"Silent Mountain\" = Raibaht (Metalworks, G-8); age of magic = Lucius (Metalworks, J-9)."] = "Bastok: pionera de las Palborough Mines = Babenn (Bastok Mines, J-6); vigila la casa de Dalzakk = Gwill (Markets, E-11); túnicas y subligares de bronce = Brygid (Markets, K-9); nunca tan buena como su hermana = Kaede (Port Bastok, J-5); perdió a su marido en las minas = Hilda (Port Bastok, E-6); portero número cinco = Naji (Metalworks, J-8); \"Silent Mountain\" = Raibaht (Metalworks, G-8); era de la magia = Lucius (Metalworks, J-9).",
    ["Batallia Downs: Cavernous Maw (H-5)."] = "Batallia Downs: Cavernous Maw (H-5).",
    ["Batallia Downs: kill Goblins on the west side for the Bowl of bland Goblin salad."] = "Batallia Downs: mata Goblins en el lado oeste para obtener el Bowl of bland Goblin salad.",
    ["Bats Sound"] = "Bats: sonido",
    ["Bats do not link."] = "Los Bats no se enlazan.",
    ["Battle 1, Raubahn: a Blue Mage who reraises twice (three kills), resetting his abilities each time. After every Azure Lore he casts a much stronger Eyes On Me, and his Circle Blade hurts mages. In the third round he's immune to whichever damage type (melee, magic or ranged) you used most; mixing types avoids the immunity."] = "Batalla 1, Raubahn: un Blue Mage que se resucita dos veces (tres muertes), reiniciando sus habilidades cada vez. Tras cada Azure Lore lanza un Eyes On Me mucho más fuerte, y su Circle Blade castiga a los magos. En la tercera ronda es inmune al tipo de daño (cuerpo a cuerpo, magia o distancia) que más hayas usado; mezclar tipos evita la inmunidad.",
    ["Battle 2, Razfahd: a stationary Paladin (Banish IV, Banishga III, Dia III, Holy II). At 50% HP he uses Perfect Defense and is immune to damage for a while."] = "Batalla 2, Razfahd: un Paladin inmóvil (Banish IV, Banishga III, Dia III, Holy II). Al 50% de HP usa Perfect Defense y es inmune al daño durante un rato.",
    ["Battle 2: Amnaf warps one room over and fights again with four Triple Gears (easier to sleep). She gives up at about 25% HP."] = "Batalla 2: Amnaf se teletransporta a la sala de al lado y vuelve a luchar con cuatro Triple Gears (más fáciles de dormir). Se rinde hacia el 25% de HP.",
    ["Battle 3, Alexander: stationary and usually the longest fight. Divine Judgement (1,000+ AoE, clears Utsusemi) comes at 50% and repeatedly after, announced by a line of Omega symbols. Gospel of the Lost heals about 1,000 and removes debuffs (stun it if you can); Draw In pulls the target back if they move too far; Radiant Sacrament and Void of Repentance are AoE and Terror. He also uses Perfect Defense."] = "Batalla 3, Alexander: inmóvil y normalmente la pelea más larga. Divine Judgement (más de 1,000 de daño de área, borra Utsusemi) llega al 50% y después repetidamente, anunciado por una línea de símbolos Omega. Gospel of the Lost cura unos 1,000 y quita los debuffs (aturdelo si puedes); Draw In atrae al objetivo si se aleja demasiado; Radiant Sacrament y Void of Repentance son de área y Terror. También usa Perfect Defense.",
    ["Battle 3: Amnaf alone, transformed into a Soulflayer. Her Sleepga resets hate on everyone it hits. Defeat her for a cutscene that completes the mission."] = "Batalla 3: Amnaf sola, transformada en Soulflayer. Su Sleepga reinicia el odio de todos a los que alcanza. Derrótala para una escena que completa la misión.",
    ["Be careful to do the NPC interactions above: if you skip them, you use up the Giant Shell Bug you get in the next step."] = "Ten cuidado de hacer las interacciones con NPC anteriores: si te las saltas, gastas el Giant Shell Bug que obtienes en el siguiente paso.",
    ["Beach Bunny/Sand Lizard"] = "Beach Bunny/Sand Lizard",
    ["Beadeaux: follow the left wall to (H-7), enter Qulun Dome, open the inner door, and obtain Aurastone."] = "Beadeaux: sigue la pared izquierda hasta (H-7), entra en Qulun Dome, abre la puerta interior y obtén Aurastone.",
    ["Beadeaux: follow the left wall to the tunnel at (H-7), enter Qulun Dome, and obtain the magicite."] = "Beadeaux: sigue la pared izquierda hasta el túnel en (H-7), entra en Qulun Dome y obtén la magicite.",
    ["Before going any further, take a brief detour to do two more Rhapsodies missions to get the \"Rhapsody in White\" key item, which gives, among other benefits:"] = "Antes de seguir, desvíate un momento para hacer dos misiones más de Rhapsodies y conseguir el key item \"Rhapsody in White\", que da, entre otras ventajas:",
    ["Before you go, get an Acidic Humus and a Watermelon per party member. Acidic Humus: Auction House (Others > Misc. 2), or in Abyssea - Tahrongi kill Pachypodiums for an Alkaline Humus and trade it to the ??? on the east side of (H-8) to spawn Gancanagh. Watermelon: Scamplix near Home Point #2 in Rabao (F-7)."] = "Antes de ir, consigue un Acidic Humus y un Watermelon por miembro del grupo. Acidic Humus: Auction House (Others > Misc. 2), o en Abyssea - Tahrongi mata Pachypodiums para obtener un Alkaline Humus y entrégaselo a la ??? del lado este de (H-8) para hacer aparecer a Gancanagh. Watermelon: Scamplix cerca del Home Point #2 de Rabao (F-7).",
    ["Before you go, hit a local Map Vendor to get maps to save yourself some pain, and once you're in there, make sure to hit the Home Points at the end of each, even if that requires a detour for one of them."] = "Antes de ir, pasa por un vendedor de mapas local para conseguir mapas y ahorrarte disgustos, y una vez dentro asegúrate de tocar los Home Points del final de cada una, aunque eso suponga un desvío en alguna.",
    ["Before you go, speak with Lokpix in Eastern Altepa Desert (G-7) and complete the quest Open Sesame for the Loadstone, which lets you use the weight-activated switches alone."] = "Antes de ir, habla con Lokpix en Eastern Altepa Desert (G-7) y completa la quest Open Sesame para obtener la Loadstone, que te permite usar tú solo los interruptores de peso.",
    ["Before you go: get a Hamsi (Wahnid, Aht Urhgan Whitegate (H-11), 1:00-18:00 except Lightsday, only if stocked; the Auction House; or fish it in Whitegate) and a Lamian Fang Key (??? once per game day at (I-7) on Caedarva Mire Map 1, by the pond; you'll need more later). A Thief can use a Skeleton Key or Thief's Tools instead."] = "Antes de ir: consigue un Hamsi (Wahnid, Aht Urhgan Whitegate (H-11), de 1:00 a 18:00 salvo Lightsday, solo si hay existencias; la Auction House; o pescándolo en Whitegate) y una Lamian Fang Key (??? una vez por día de juego en (I-7) del mapa 1 de Caedarva Mire, junto al estanque; necesitarás más luego). Un Thief puede usar en su lugar una Skeleton Key o Thief's Tools.",
    ["Begin harvesting in Wajaom Woodlands with a Sickle (you may need several) to obtain the Rainbow berry."] = "Empieza a recolectar en Wajaom Woodlands con una Sickle (puede que necesites varias) para conseguir la Rainbow berry.",
    ["Begin the Story"] = "Empieza la historia",
    ["Begin this quest by speaking to Waoud in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-10) once your Blue Mage is level 40 and you have completed Aht Urhgan Mission 2. This quest follows An Empty Vessel."] = "Empieza esta quest hablando con Waoud en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-10) cuando tu Blue Mage sea nivel 40 y hayas completado la Aht Urhgan Mission 2. Esta quest sigue a An Empty Vessel.",
    ["Begin your slaughter of giants up and down the corridor to the stairs and back. There is a room on the side with more giants if you have a Delkfutt Key."] = "Empieza a acabar con gigantes arriba y abajo por el pasillo hasta las escaleras y de vuelta. Hay una sala lateral con más gigantes si tienes una Delkfutt Key.",
    ["Beginning at 50 (and every 5 levels after) you have to complete a Limit Break quest to raise your level cap by 5 before you can go higher."] = "A partir del 50 (y cada 5 niveles después) tienes que completar una quest de Limit Break para subir tu límite de nivel en 5 antes de poder seguir.",
    ["Behind the gate, follow the path to the intersection and go north into the large room, clearing the Antica if needed; the ??? is at its northern tip at (I-6)."] = "Tras la puerta, sigue el camino hasta el cruce y ve al norte a la sala grande, despejando a los Antica si hace falta; la ??? está en su extremo norte, en (I-6).",
    ["Being part of a Unity also unlocks access to a daily rotation of Records of Eminence objectives. Some of them are as simple as vanquishing a certain number of enemies while your Unity Leader Trust is summoned, and are easy sources of more Sparks, Accolades, and Experience Points."] = "Pertenecer a una Unity también desbloquea una rotación diaria de objetivos de Records of Eminence. Algunos son tan sencillos como derrotar cierto número de enemigos con el Trust de tu líder de Unity invocado, y son fuentes fáciles de más Sparks, Accolades y Experience Points.",
    ["Better yet, completing all three of the starter nations' quests also unlocks your Mog Safe 2 to store up to 80 more items in. I mention this here, rather than in an earlier section, because the flowers for the three starter city quests can be bought for 120 gil each from Areebah in Upper Jeuno."] = "Mejor aún, completar las quests de las tres naciones iniciales también desbloquea tu Mog Safe 2 para guardar hasta 80 objetos más. Lo menciono aquí y no en una sección anterior porque las flores de las quests de las tres ciudades iniciales se pueden comprar por 120 gil cada una a Areebah en Upper Jeuno.",
    ["Between 13:00 and 16:00 (Vana'diel time), leave the Safehold through the southeast exit into Lufaise Meadows. The first person with the quest to enter gets a short cutscene."] = "Entre las 13:00 y las 16:00 (hora de Vana'diel), sal del Safehold por la salida sureste hacia Lufaise Meadows. La primera persona con la quest que entre ve una escena corta.",
    ["Between 18:00 and 5:00 a ??? appears near the Song Runes. Click it to spawn Marchelute. If another player killed it recently, a few minutes have to pass before it can spawn again."] = "Entre las 18:00 y las 5:00 aparece una ??? cerca de las Song Runes. Púlsala para hacer aparecer a Marchelute. Si otro jugador lo ha matado hace poco, tienen que pasar unos minutos antes de que pueda volver a aparecer.",
    ["Between the Auction House and the RoE rewards, you should be able to fund your Home Point teleportation habit until it becomes 80% cheaper pretty soon."] = "Entre la Auction House y las recompensas de RoE, deberías poder pagarte los teletransportes de Home Point hasta que pronto pasen a costar un 80% menos.",
    ["Beware Goobbue Farmers, and especially the Champion Crawlers."] = "Cuidado con los Goobbue Farmers y, sobre todo, con los Champion Crawlers.",
    ["Beware of Orcish Farkiller enemies on top of the ledge, which can aggro even at level 99, and of Pugil enemies in the river, which aggro by sound to characters near level 30."] = "Cuidado con los enemigos Orcish Farkiller en lo alto de la cornisa, que pueden atacarte incluso a nivel 99, y con los enemigos Pugil del río, que atacan por sonido a personajes cerca de nivel 30.",
    ["Bibiki Bay (F-6) (Survival Guide or Unity Warp level 119): examine the ??? inside the cave to spawn Dalham, a Kraken that attacks more times per round as its HP drops. Examine the ??? again afterwards."] = "Bibiki Bay (F-6) (Survival Guide o Unity Warp de nivel 119): examina la ??? dentro de la cueva para hacer aparecer a Dalham, un Kraken que ataca más veces por ronda a medida que baja su HP. Examina de nuevo la ??? después.",
    ["Bibiki Bay - levels 30-38 - walk through the zone starting at the entrance, fighting Rarabs and Efts and then also Goblins and Birds. Don't go too far."] = "Bibiki Bay - niveles 30-38 - recorre la zona desde la entrada, luchando contra Rarabs y Efts, y luego también Goblins y pájaros. No te alejes demasiado.",
    ["Black Curry can be bought at the Auction House (Food, Meals, Soups)."] = "El Black Curry se puede comprar en la Auction House (Food, Meals, Soups).",
    ["Blanched Mandragora"] = "Blanched Mandragora",
    ["Blank Target (F-8)."] = "Blank Target (F-8).",
    ["Blank Target (H-9)."] = "Blank Target (H-9).",
    ["Blank Target (I-6)."] = "Blank Target (I-6).",
    ["Blank Target (K-6)."] = "Blank Target (K-6).",
    ["Blank Target (K-9)."] = "Blank Target (K-9).",
    ["Blank Target south of the conflux."] = "Blank Target al sur del conflux.",
    ["Blank Target."] = "Blank Target.",
    ["Blest Bones at Zi'Tah (F-7): beige fragment. Only Thunder, Fire, Wind or Light magic (Quick Draw works)."] = "Blest Bones en Zi'Tah (F-7): fragmento beige. Solo magia de Thunder, Fire, Wind o Light (Quick Draw funciona).",
    ["Bloodsucker"] = "Bloodsucker",
    ["Bloodsucker (Notorious Monster) Sound Links"] = "Bloodsucker (Notorious Monster): sonido, se enlaza",
    ["Blue Mage BLU use enemy skills to be able to do almost anything from deal damage to tank to heal - all depending on which specific spells you decide to \"equip\". However, learning spells can be time consuming, and will take you all over the world. They also can deal decent melee damage with Swords, and later on can dual-wield them. Corsair COR is a gambling buffer, playing a quick push-your-luck minigame to give AOE buffs to their party. Bad luck can cause a Bust though, which removes the buff from the party (and debuffs you). They primarily use Guns for ranged attacks, but can wield Daggers and Swords when getting close. Puppetmaster PUP has a customizable Automaton pet that is very cute - and very strong! How you decide to deck out your little buddy determines what they can do - tank, heal, nuke, deal damage, you name it they can do it! The PUP itself can dish out solid damage using Hand-to-Hand weapons as well. Dancer DNC is a flexible and busy job. Managing a unique resource called Finishing Moves, it uses Sambas, Waltzes, Steps, and Jigs to generate free TP, deal big burst damage, debuff enemies, and even heal party members! They almost exclusively dual-wield Daggers. Scholar SCH can flip-flop back and forth between specializing in White and Black magic. It uses a unique resource called Stratagems to power up its large suite of spells in unique ways, and can be either a potent healer or nuker - or both, if your fingers are fast enough. Like other mages, it primarily uses Staves. Geomancer GEO is a support job that can place down \"bubbles\" that provide powerful buffs and debuffs. These Luopan bubbles are technically pets, though there is very little micromanagement required - they're mostly set-and-forget. GEO can also provide fairly powerful AOE nuke spells, which can be buffed by proper positioning! They primarily use one-handed Clubs, and cast magic using Handbells. Rune Fencer RUN is a tank that can imbue itself with elemental runes to resist magic damage and status effects. It has a wide range of job abilities to provide extra defenses or deal damage, all based around what runes you decide to harbor - so you'll need to change up your runes on the fly depending on what you're fighting. Despite the name, they wield Great Swords - though as a tank, don't expect to deal tons of damage."] = "Blue Mage: los BLU usan habilidades de los enemigos para poder hacer casi de todo, desde hacer daño hasta tanquear o curar, según los hechizos concretos que decidas \"equipar\". Sin embargo, aprender hechizos puede llevar tiempo y te hará recorrer todo el mundo. También pueden hacer un daño cuerpo a cuerpo decente con Swords, y más adelante pueden llevar dos. Corsair: COR es un potenciador apostador, que juega un rápido minijuego de arriesgar la suerte para dar buffs de área a su grupo. Pero la mala suerte puede causar un Bust, que quita el buff al grupo (y te debilita a ti). Usan sobre todo Guns para atacar a distancia, pero pueden empuñar Daggers y Swords de cerca. Puppetmaster: PUP tiene una mascota Automaton personalizable que es muy mona, ¡y muy fuerte! Cómo decidas equipar a tu pequeño compañero determina lo que puede hacer: tanquear, curar, nukear, hacer daño, lo que quieras. El propio PUP también puede hacer un daño sólido con armas de Hand-to-Hand. Dancer: DNC es un job flexible y ajetreado. Gestiona un recurso propio llamado Finishing Moves y usa Sambas, Waltzes, Steps y Jigs para generar TP gratis, hacer grandes ráfagas de daño, debilitar enemigos ¡e incluso curar al grupo! Casi siempre usan dos Daggers. Scholar: SCH puede alternar entre especializarse en magia blanca y negra. Usa un recurso propio llamado Stratagems para potenciar de formas únicas su amplio repertorio de hechizos, y puede ser un curandero o un nuker potente, o ambos, si tus dedos son lo bastante rápidos. Como otros magos, usa sobre todo Staves. Geomancer: GEO es un job de apoyo que puede colocar \"burbujas\" que dan buffs y debilitamientos potentes. Estas burbujas Luopan son técnicamente mascotas, aunque requieren muy poco control: casi siempre se ponen y se olvidan. GEO también tiene hechizos de nuke de área bastante potentes, ¡que se potencian con una buena colocación! Usan sobre todo Clubs a una mano y lanzan magia con Handbells. Rune Fencer: RUN es un tanque que puede imbuirse de runas elementales para resistir el daño mágico y los estados alterados. Tiene una amplia gama de habilidades de job para dar defensa extra o hacer daño, todas basadas en las runas que decidas mantener, así que tendrás que cambiar de runas sobre la marcha según contra qué luches. Pese al nombre, usan Great Swords, aunque como tanque no esperes hacer muchísimo daño.",
    ["Board the next airship."] = "Sube a la siguiente airship.",
    ["Board the next airship. Eight passengers who look very similar to the owner appear on board. They share the race, gender and face, and differ in hair and clothing. Some stand in hard-to-see places, such as above the stairs or behind the engine."] = "Sube a la siguiente aeronave. Aparecen a bordo ocho pasajeros muy parecidos al dueño. Comparten raza, sexo y cara, y se diferencian en el pelo y la ropa. Algunos están en sitios difíciles de ver, como encima de las escaleras o detrás del motor.",
    ["Bomb Coal: drops from Explosures, or collect three Bomb coal fragments in Garlaige Citadel, all on map 2 at (I-8), (H-7) and (G-6). First take the Pouch of weighted stones key item from the ??? on the floor at (G-8), map 1, just south of the entrance; undead aggro low HP through Sneak and Invisible."] = "Bomb Coal: lo sueltan los Explosures, o reúne tres Bomb coal fragments en Garlaige Citadel, todos en el mapa 2 en (I-8), (H-7) y (G-6). Primero coge el key item Pouch of weighted stones de la ??? del suelo en (G-8), mapa 1, justo al sur de la entrada; los no-muertos detectan HP bajo a través de Sneak e Invisible.",
    ["Bostaunieux Oubliette - levels 46-50 - warp to the Survival Guide and kill the four nearby bats repeatedly."] = "Bostaunieux Oubliette - niveles 46-50 - teletranspórtate a la Survival Guide y mata una y otra vez los cuatro murciélagos cercanos.",
    ["Bostaunieux Oubliette - levels 50-54 - Survival Guide and the same four bats at the entrance. Again."] = "Bostaunieux Oubliette - niveles 50-54 - Survival Guide y los mismos cuatro murciélagos de la entrada. Otra vez.",
    ["Both players must speak to Halver, and each one receives the same cutscene. The player who started the quest gains the title Royal Wedding Planner as well as Castor's Ring. The player who matches the description gains the title Consort Candidate and Pollux's Ring."] = "Ambos jugadores deben hablar con Halver, y cada uno recibe la misma escena. El jugador que empezó la quest obtiene el título Royal Wedding Planner además de Castor's Ring. El jugador que coincide con la descripción obtiene el título Consort Candidate y Pollux's Ring.",
    ["Boulder Eater/Pygmytoise"] = "Boulder Eater/Pygmytoise",
    ["Break the latent on the Bow of Trials before completing the rest of the quest. The latent is active while you have fewer than 300 Skillchain points accumulated; you know you have enough when it breaks and the weapon's elemental resistances disappear from your active resistances."] = "Rompe el latent del Bow of Trials antes de completar el resto de la quest. El latent está activo mientras tengas menos de 300 puntos de Skillchain acumulados; sabes que tienes suficientes cuando se rompe y las resistencias elementales del arma desaparecen de tus resistencias activas.",
    ["Break the latent on the Club of Trials before doing the rest of the quest. Each skillchain gives trial points: 5 with no skillchain, 7 at level 1, 9 at level 2 and 11 at level 3."] = "Rompe el latent del Club of Trials antes de hacer el resto de la quest. Cada skillchain da trial points: 5 sin skillchain, 7 en nivel 1, 9 en nivel 2 y 11 en nivel 3.",
    ["Break the latent on the Pole of Trials. With it equipped in your main hand, fight enemies rated Extremely Easy Prey or higher and use weapon skills or close skillchains until you accumulate 300 Trial Points: 5 points with no skillchain, 7 at level 1, 9 at level 2 and 11 at level 3."] = "Rompe el latent de la Pole of Trials. Con ella equipada en la mano principal, pelea contra enemigos de nivel Extremely Easy Prey o superior y usa weapon skills o skillchains cercanas hasta acumular 300 Trial Points: 5 puntos sin skillchain, 7 en nivel 1, 9 en nivel 2 y 11 en nivel 3.",
    ["Break the latent on the Spear of Trials before doing the rest of the quest. Each skillchain gives points: 5 with no skillchain, 7 at level 1, 9 at level 2 and 11 at level 3."] = "Rompe el latent de la Spear of Trials antes de hacer el resto de la quest. Cada skillchain da puntos: 5 sin skillchain, 7 en nivel 1, 9 en nivel 2 y 11 en nivel 3.",
    ["Break the level cap"] = "Rompe el límite de nivel",
    ["Bring Baren-Moren Dhalmel Hide x4 so he can repair the cap."] = "Llévale a Baren-Moren Dhalmel Hide x4 para que repare la gorra.",
    ["Bring Calovour a Mistletoe to complete the quest."] = "Llévale a Calovour un Mistletoe para completar la quest.",
    ["Bring Echo Drops and Silent Oil. In Western Altepa Desert, open the Altepa Gate (see the Altepa Gate page). It stays open for 15-30 minutes, so get help lowering the colored columns or have a mule waiting behind it."] = "Lleva Echo Drops y Silent Oil. En Western Altepa Desert, abre la Altepa Gate (consulta la página de la Altepa Gate). Permanece abierta 15-30 minutos, así que busca ayuda para bajar las columnas de colores o deja una mula esperando detrás.",
    ["Bring Invisible or Prism Powder for the level 90 Goblins. In Dangruf Wadi, stand on the geyser at (I-8) to be shot up the ledge, go north-east to a second geyser at (J-3), and follow the path out into North Gustaberg. A Geomagnetic Fount for Middle Lands Investigation is at (D-8), on the north shore near a rock."] = "Lleva Invisible o Prism Powder para los Goblins de nivel 90. En Dangruf Wadi, colócate sobre el géiser de (I-8) para que te lance a la cornisa, ve al noreste hasta un segundo géiser en (J-3) y sigue el camino hasta salir a North Gustaberg. Hay una Geomagnetic Fount para Middle Lands Investigation en (D-8), en la orilla norte junto a una roca.",
    ["Bring Magephaud the 3 gold beastcoins. You receive the permanent key item Tonberry key (Zilart)."] = "Tráele a Magephaud las 3 gold beastcoins. Recibes el key item permanente Tonberry key (Zilart).",
    ["Bring Shamarhaan down to -20% HP and you should win the battle. The quest does not need to be completed for the level limit increase if you have already completed New Worlds Await or better."] = "Baja a Shamarhaan a -20% de HP y deberías ganar la batalla. No hace falta completar la quest para el aumento del límite de nivel si ya has completado New Worlds Await o superior.",
    ["Bring a Doll Gizmo (see the previous mission)."] = "Lleva un Doll Gizmo (ver la misión anterior).",
    ["Bring a Traverser stone and 10,000 Cruor to Qufim Island. Follow the wall northwest from Home Point #1."] = "Lleva una Traverser stone y 10,000 Cruor a Qufim Island. Sigue la pared al noroeste desde el Home Point #1.",
    ["Bring a warp (Warp Ring, Instant Warp): after the next mission you are stranded in Grauberg [S]."] = "Lleva un warp (Warp Ring, Instant Warp): tras la misión siguiente quedas aislado en Grauberg [S].",
    ["Bring him 4 Crawler Eggs (Auction House, Cooking, or from Crawlers) to complete the quest. You receive 3,000 gil and the title Four-Star Purveyor."] = "Llévale 4 Crawler Eggs (Auction House, Cooking o de Crawlers) para completar la quest. Recibes 3,000 gil y el título Four-Star Purveyor.",
    ["Bring him either 4 Eastern Pottery, 4 Northern Fur or 4 Southern Mummy to complete the quest. Eastern Pottery x4 pays 2,000 gil and drops from Clockwork Pods in Garlaige Citadel or Fei'Yin."] = "Tráele 4 Eastern Pottery, 4 Northern Fur o 4 Southern Mummy para completar la quest. Eastern Pottery x4 paga 2,000 gil y lo sueltan los Clockwork Pods de Garlaige Citadel o Fei'Yin.",
    ["Bring the Ashu Talif Captain down to about 20% HP to win. You end up in Nashmau."] = "Baja al Ashu Talif Captain hasta un 20% de HP aproximadamente para ganar. Acabas en Nashmau.",
    ["Bring the Bundle of half-inscribed scrolls to Gentle Tiger (H-6) to obtain Trust: Klara."] = "Lleva el Bundle of half-inscribed scrolls a Gentle Tiger (H-6) para obtener Trust: Klara.",
    ["Bring the Gusgen Clay to Nereus for your reward, 2,160 gil. You can repeat the quest after 8 hours."] = "Lleva la Gusgen Clay a Nereus para tu recompensa, 2,160 gil. Puedes repetir la quest tras 8 horas.",
    ["Bring the Star Spinel to Honoi-Gomoi, who gives you the Star Necklace after a cutscene."] = "Lleva el Star Spinel a Honoi-Gomoi, que te da el Star Necklace tras una escena.",
    ["Bring the Thunder Hammer from Tateeya's Worries."] = "Lleva el Thunder Hammer de Tateeya's Worries.",
    ["Bring the Twinstone Earring back to Gioh Ajihri to receive your reward."] = "Lleva el Twinstone Earring a Gioh Ajihri para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Bring the Weapons order to Alexius in Jugner Forest (I-6), near the lake; you receive the key item Weapons receipt."] = "Lleva el Weapons order a Alexius en Jugner Forest (I-6), cerca del lago; recibes el key item Weapons receipt.",
    ["Bring the item she asks for: Bronze Harness (Warrior, Paladin, Dark Knight, Dragoon, Corsair), Robe (Monk, Bard, Blue Mage), Leather Vest (Thief, Beastmaster, Ranger, Dancer), Tunic (White Mage, Red Mage, Black Mage, Summoner, Puppetmaster) or Kenpogi (Ninja, Samurai). The +1 versions do not work."] = "Trae el objeto que pide: Bronze Harness (Warrior, Paladin, Dark Knight, Dragoon, Corsair), Robe (Monk, Bard, Blue Mage), Leather Vest (Thief, Beastmaster, Ranger, Dancer), Tunic (White Mage, Red Mage, Black Mage, Summoner, Puppetmaster) o Kenpogi (Ninja, Samurai). Las versiones +1 no sirven.",
    ["Bring the ring back to Oswald for your reward, the Amber Earring."] = "Devuelve el anillo a Oswald por tu recompensa, el Amber Earring.",
    ["Bring three Hoptoad (fish off the bridge by Reisenjima Ethereal Ingress #2 with a Fly Lure or Lufaise Fly) and an Eastern Ginger (Reisenjima harvesting with Reaper, 50 Silt from Shiftrix (F-12); Bhaflau Thickets harvesting; or Reisenjima caskets)."] = "Lleva tres Hoptoad (pesca desde el puente junto al Ethereal Ingress #2 de Reisenjima con un Fly Lure o un Lufaise Fly) y un Eastern Ginger (recolección en Reisenjima con Reaper, 50 Silt a Shiftrix (F-12); recolección en Bhaflau Thickets; o cofres de Reisenjima).",
    ["Brutus gives you the key item Map to the Annals of Truth. Bring Sneak and Invisible to the Temple of Uggalepih."] = "Brutus te da el key item Map to the Annals of Truth. Lleva Sneak e Invisible al Temple of Uggalepih.",
    ["Buburimu Peninsula at (F-7)"] = "Buburimu Peninsula en (F-7)",
    ["Buff and summon Trusts, then examine sparkling ??? (F-11) again: Siren spawns immediately."] = "Poténciate e invoca a los Trusts, y luego examina de nuevo la ??? brillante (F-11): Siren aparece al instante.",
    ["Burrower Worm/Colliery Bat/Soot Crab/Veindigger Leech"] = "Burrower Worm/Colliery Bat/Soot Crab/Veindigger Leech",
    ["But let's say you're even lazier. You don't want to hit three macros to summon your Trusts, you only want to hit one."] = "Pero digamos que eres aún más vago. No quieres pulsar tres macros para invocar a tus Trusts, solo una.",
    ["Buy a Cupboard from the furniture shop in Northern San d'Oria (F-8) and put it in your Mog House."] = "Compra un Cupboard en la tienda de muebles de Northern San d'Oria (F-8) y colócalo en tu Mog House.",
    ["Buy a Hatchet (a Trbl. Hatchet doesn't work) and go to The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah. An area off the map in the northern part of (K-10) leads to a block at (L-9); climb the nearby rock to reach the ??? and trade it the Hatchet to spawn Guardian Treant. The level 122 Unity warp (Keeper of Heiligtum) puts you close, at (K-12)."] = "Compra un Hatchet (un Trbl. Hatchet no sirve) y ve a The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah. Una zona fuera del mapa en la parte norte de (K-10) lleva a un bloque en (L-9); trepa por la roca cercana hasta la ??? y entrégale el Hatchet para hacer aparecer a Guardian Treant. El Unity warp de nivel 122 (Keeper of Heiligtum) te deja cerca, en (K-12).",
    ["Buy a Lilac from Areebah at M & P's Market in Upper Jeuno (H-6) for 120 gil; buy two, since a later quest needs one too."] = "Compra un Lilac a Areebah en M & P's Market de Upper Jeuno (H-6) por 120 gil; compra dos, ya que una quest posterior también necesita uno.",
    ["Buy a Pickaxe if you don't have one; Ostalie in Southern San d'Oria (F-8), near Home Point #4, sells them. A Trbl. Pickaxe doesn't work."] = "Compra un Pickaxe si no tienes; Ostalie en Southern San d'Oria (F-8), cerca del Home Point #4, los vende. Un Trbl. Pickaxe no sirve.",
    ["Buy a ticket and board the barge to Central Landing via Emfea Way; it leaves from the docks next to Anguenet at 00:50 every game day. On board, speak with Riche and ask him all five questions; he then takes the blackboard."] = "Compra un billete y sube a la barcaza a Central Landing por Emfea Way; sale de los muelles junto a Anguenet a las 00:50 cada día de juego. A bordo, habla con Riche y hazle las cinco preguntas; después se queda con la pizarra.",
    ["Buy an Oak Pole for 156 Sparks from a Records of Eminence NPC (Equ. Lv. 40-50, page 2): Rolandienne in Southern San d'Oria (G-10), Isakoth in Bastok Markets (E-11), Fhelm Jobeizat in Windurst Woods (J-10) or Eternal Flame in Western Adoulin (H-11). Trade it to Leodarion."] = "Compra un Oak Pole por 156 Sparks a un NPC de Records of Eminence (Equ. Lv. 40-50, página 2): Rolandienne en Southern San d'Oria (G-10), Isakoth en Bastok Markets (E-11), Fhelm Jobeizat en Windurst Woods (J-10) o Eternal Flame en Western Adoulin (H-11). Entrégaselo a Leodarion.",
    ["Buy as many sheep as you can from the markets in Leujaoam. Read all the information given in the assault carefully before you begin."] = "Compra todas las ovejas que puedas en los mercados de Leujaoam. Lee con atención toda la información del assault antes de empezar.",
    ["By \"briefly enter\", I mean \"enter, watch a cutscene, talk to the Conflux Surveyor to get Visitant status, then leave\". Visitant status is essential, otherwise you will be locked out of reentering Abyssea for an hour after you leave. Now you can use Horst (next to Joachim) to teleport back to these Maws for cruor later, once you have cruor. You must talk to Joachim after each cutscene."] = "Con \"entrar brevemente\" me refiero a \"entrar, ver una escena, hablar con el Conflux Surveyor para obtener el estado Visitant y salir\". El estado Visitant es imprescindible; si no, no podrás volver a entrar en Abyssea durante una hora tras salir. Ya puedes usar a Horst (junto a Joachim) para teletransportarte de vuelta a estos Maws por cruor más adelante, cuando tengas cruor. Debes hablar con Joachim tras cada escena.",
    ["By aligning with a selected Unity, you can earn the ability to summon that Unity's leader as a Trust. It's generally agreed upon that the best options to choose from are either Yoran-Oran (UC) or Apururu (UC). They are both excellent healers and can be used all the way up to, and at, item level."] = "Al unirte a una Unity concreta, puedes ganar la capacidad de invocar a su líder como Trust. En general se considera que las mejores opciones son Yoran-Oran (UC) o Apururu (UC). Ambos son curanderos excelentes y sirven hasta el item level, y también en él.",
    ["By completing this quest ten times, the fourth segment of the airship name is unlocked, and it can then be changed from the default, C.I.D."] = "Al completar esta quest diez veces, se desbloquea el cuarto segmento del nombre de la airship, y entonces se puede cambiar del valor por defecto, C.I.D.",
    ["By end of this large section, you should be level 50."] = "Al final de esta gran sección deberías ser nivel 50.",
    ["Caedarva Mire - levels 55-60 - Attacking Wild Karakul at (I-8), but the real kill target is the Chigoes they spawn when they use a TP move."] = "Caedarva Mire - niveles 55-60 - Ataca a los Wild Karakul de (I-8), aunque el verdadero objetivo son los Chigoes que aparecen cuando usan un movimiento de TP.",
    ["Cait Sith Aon, tower at (H-8) (where the Campaign Arbiter warps you): Red Light, Green Light in first person."] = "Cait Sith Aon, torre de (H-8) (donde te deja el warp del Campaign Arbiter): Red Light, Green Light en primera persona.",
    ["Cait Sith Ceithir, tower at (G-9): guide Portia in Red Light, Green Light; if she panics, her next move is slower."] = "Cait Sith Ceithir, torre de (G-9): guía a Portia en Red Light, Green Light; si entra en pánico, su siguiente movimiento es más lento.",
    ["Cait Sith Coig, tower at (J-8): hit her with a blow dart as she moves back and forth."] = "Cait Sith Coig, torre de (J-8): dale con un dardo de cerbatana mientras va de un lado a otro.",
    ["Cait Sith Seachd, tower at (I-7): guide Lilisette in Red Light, Green Light; when she puts her hands on her hips, her next move is two steps. For all three of these games, move when Cait Sith turns her head 45 degrees: her next turn is always away. Unload cutscene-skipping addons first."] = "Cait Sith Seachd, torre de (I-7): guía a Lilisette en Red Light, Green Light; cuando pone las manos en las caderas, su siguiente movimiento son dos pasos. En estos tres juegos, muévete cuando Cait Sith gire la cabeza 45 grados: su siguiente giro siempre es hacia el otro lado. Descarga antes los addons que saltan escenas.",
    ["Cait Sith Tri, tower at (F-7): as a baby chocobo, chirp or wiggle to lure her within a minute, then choose \"Stun!\" when it appears."] = "Cait Sith Tri, torre de (F-7): como cría de chocobo, pía o menéate para atraerla en menos de un minuto y elige \"Stun!\" cuando aparezca.",
    ["Calfcleaving Chapuli"] = "Calfcleaving Chapuli",
    ["Camp at the mouth of the rectangular area."] = "Acampa en la entrada de la zona rectangular.",
    ["Camp at the mouth of the tunnel in the dead end room."] = "Acampa en la entrada del túnel en la sala sin salida.",
    ["Camp is in Map 2. Drop down at (E-8) in Map 1."] = "El campamento está en el mapa 2. Déjate caer en (E-8) en el mapa 1.",
    ["Camp is in the SE Corner of the position."] = "El campamento está en la esquina sureste de la posición.",
    ["Cannau runs west to the door at (H-8); you need a Magicked astrolabe, or a helper at the switch, to get through. Talk to her to stop her and again to make her continue. She draws aggro from almost everything and her low HP draws undead, so stop her, clear her path and cure her."] = "Cannau corre al oeste hasta la puerta de (H-8); necesitas un Magicked astrolabe, o a alguien en el interruptor, para cruzarla. Habla con ella para detenerla y de nuevo para que continúe. Atrae a casi todo, y su HP bajo atrae a los no-muertos, así que detenla, despeja su camino y cúrala.",
    ["Carbuncle leaves at 75% HP for one Celestial avatar, at 50% for two more and at 25% for the last three, coming back after each group is defeated. Then five Carbuncle Primes spawn at once, each able to use Searing Light (repeatedly); defeat all five to win."] = "Carbuncle se va al 75% de HP dejando un avatar Celestial, al 50% dos más y al 25% los tres últimos, y vuelve tras derrotar a cada grupo. Luego aparecen a la vez cinco Carbuncle Primes, cada uno capaz de usar Searing Light (repetidamente); derrota a los cinco para ganar.",
    ["Careful not to pull the Peiste that occasionally spawn in or around the Chapuli spawn area."] = "Ten cuidado de no atraer a los Peiste que a veces aparecen dentro o alrededor de la zona de los Chapuli.",
    ["Carmine Chip: Snow Lizard (65-68), entering at the Beaucedine Glacier tower at (I-7) or (F-7), two floors down (from (F-7), drop at (I-8)); or Frost Lizard (73-77), from the (F-7) tower three floors down (drop at (I-8), then (I-7))."] = "Carmine Chip: Snow Lizard (65-68), entrando por la torre de Beaucedine Glacier en (I-7) o (F-7), dos pisos más abajo (desde (F-7), déjate caer en (I-8)); o Frost Lizard (73-77), desde la torre de (F-7) tres pisos más abajo (déjate caer en (I-8) y luego en (I-7)).",
    ["Carpenters' Landing (enter from Jugner Forest J-8; the Survival Guide is fastest): examine the ??? by the water at (I-9) to spawn the Cryptonberry Executor (NIN), joined shortly by three Cryptonberry Assassins (THF, SMN, BLM) that use their two-hour abilities. Kill the Executor first and fast to avoid Mijin Gakure, then the Summoner, keeping HP high. Examine the ??? again afterwards."] = "Carpenters' Landing (entra desde Jugner Forest J-8; la Survival Guide es lo más rápido): examina la ??? junto al agua en (I-9) para hacer aparecer al Cryptonberry Executor (NIN), al que poco después se unen tres Cryptonberry Assassins (THF, SMN, BLM) que usan sus habilidades de dos horas. Mata primero y rápido al Executor para evitar Mijin Gakure, luego al Summoner, manteniendo el HP alto. Examina de nuevo la ??? después.",
    ["Carry the letter to that city through the Shadowreign zones. San d'Oria: Batallia Downs [S] > north Jugner Forest [S] > Vunkerl Inlet [S] > south Jugner Forest [S] > East Ronfaure [S]. Windurst: Sauromugue Champaign [S] > Meriphataud Mountains [S] > Fort Karugo-Narugo [S] > West Sarutabaruta [S]. Bastok: Rolanberry Fields [S] > Pashhow Marshlands [S] > Grauberg [S] > North Gustaberg [S]."] = "Lleva la carta a esa ciudad por las zonas de Shadowreign. San d'Oria: Batallia Downs [S] > norte de Jugner Forest [S] > Vunkerl Inlet [S] > sur de Jugner Forest [S] > East Ronfaure [S]. Windurst: Sauromugue Champaign [S] > Meriphataud Mountains [S] > Fort Karugo-Narugo [S] > West Sarutabaruta [S]. Bastok: Rolanberry Fields [S] > Pashhow Marshlands [S] > Grauberg [S] > North Gustaberg [S].",
    ["Castle Oztroja (entrance in Meriphataud Mountains, L-8): go to the Brass Door at (I-8). One of the two levers beside it opens the door, the other opens a trap door into a pit. Stand between the levers, pull one and step back at once: if the door opens, run through; if the trap opens, wait for it to close and pull the other lever. If you get \"Target is out of range\", shift your position a little."] = "Castle Oztroja (entrada en Meriphataud Mountains, L-8): ve a la Brass Door de (I-8). Una de las dos palancas de al lado abre la puerta y la otra abre una trampilla a un foso. Colócate entre las palancas, tira de una y retrocede enseguida: si se abre la puerta, crúzala corriendo; si se abre la trampilla, espera a que se cierre y tira de la otra. Si recibes \"Target is out of range\", muévete un poco.",
    ["Castle Zvahl Baileys: follow the one-way path to the first intersection, turn right, go north then west and down a short flight of stairs, turn left and follow the right wall to the next map. There, go to the top right corner and up the stairs, cross to the top left and back down, work into the central courtyard, go back up and through the gate on the right to a long hall with a large staircase."] = "Castle Zvahl Baileys: sigue el camino de un solo sentido hasta el primer cruce, gira a la derecha, ve al norte y luego al oeste y baja un tramo corto de escaleras, gira a la izquierda y sigue la pared derecha hasta el mapa siguiente. Allí, ve a la esquina superior derecha y sube las escaleras, cruza a la esquina superior izquierda y vuelve a bajar, avanza hasta el patio central, vuelve a subir y cruza la puerta de la derecha hasta un largo salón con una gran escalera.",
    ["Castle Zvahl Keep: turn right out of the hallway and pass a few gates (the monsters here detect sight). From the upper level, follow the narrow path to more stairs and the teleporters. Stand in the middle of each one until it activates (this drops Invisible); after four of them, go to the west middle of the new map and through the door into the Throne Room."] = "Castle Zvahl Keep: gira a la derecha al salir del pasillo y pasa varias puertas (aquí los monstruos detectan por vista). Desde el nivel superior, sigue el camino estrecho hasta más escaleras y los teletransportadores. Colócate en el centro de cada uno hasta que se active (esto quita Invisible); tras cuatro de ellos, ve al centro oeste del nuevo mapa y cruza la puerta hacia la Throne Room.",
    ["Catch a Ride"] = "Consigue montura",
    ["Catch the five legendary fish below, in any order, and trade each one to Irmilant:"] = "Pesca los cinco peces legendarios de abajo, en cualquier orden, y entrégale cada uno a Irmilant:",
    ["Cath Palug in The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah: rifts at (E-9), (F-8) and (G-10). The rift at (G-10) is close to the Survival Guide."] = "Cath Palug en The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah: rifts en (E-9), (F-8) y (G-10). El rift de (G-10) está cerca de la Survival Guide.",
    ["Chains of Promathia"] = "Chains of Promathia",
    ["Chamama does not always accept the stone: if she refuses it, get another Smooth Stone and bring it to her. It can be rejected several times in a row."] = "Chamama no siempre acepta la piedra: si la rechaza, consigue otra Smooth Stone y llévasela. Puede rechazarla varias veces seguidas.",
    ["Champion Crawler"] = "Champion Crawler",
    ["Champion Crawlers do not aggro, but do link. Recommended to utilize the Ballista platform with the two NPCs for ranged single pulling."] = "Los Champion Crawlers no atacan, pero se enlazan. Se recomienda usar la plataforma de la Ballista con los dos NPCs para atraerlos de uno en uno a distancia.",
    ["Chances are you are noticing that your inventory space is tight. Fortunately, you have more space available at the start than you might think:"] = "Seguramente estés notando que te falta espacio en el inventario. Por suerte, al principio tienes más espacio del que crees:",
    ["Change to BLM, RDM, SMN, or BLU (it doesn't need to be level 30) and activate Astral Flow, Chainspell, Azure Lore, or Manafont."] = "Cambia a BLM, RDM, SMN o BLU (no hace falta que sea de nivel 30) y activa Astral Flow, Chainspell, Azure Lore o Manafont.",
    ["Change your main job to Ninja (level 20 or above) and speak with Romualdo at (K-9), in the southern Cannonry in Metalworks, to begin the quest. You need Norg fame level 4 and to have completed Ayame and Kaede."] = "Cambia tu trabajo principal a Ninja (nivel 20 o superior) y habla con Romualdo en (K-9), en el Cannonry sur de Metalworks, para empezar la quest. Necesitas el nivel 4 de fama de Norg y haber completado Ayame and Kaede.",
    ["Change zones and return to Kipopo to receive the Repaired Handbag."] = "Cambia de zona y vuelve con Kipopo para recibir el Repaired Handbag.",
    ["Change zones and return to Thierride (F-8) to receive the Angler's Cassoulet reward."] = "Cambia de zona y vuelve con Thierride (F-8) para recibir la recompensa Angler's Cassoulet.",
    ["Change zones and speak with Scarred Shark (G-5) again to receive the Trainee Hammer."] = "Cambia de zona y habla de nuevo con Scarred Shark (G-5) para recibir el Trainee Hammer.",
    ["Chebukkis: speak with Chipmy-Popmy at the Fishing Guild in Port Windurst (C-8) until he mentions Purgonorgo Isle, then go to Purgonorgo Isle (ferry from Bibiki Bay) and examine the ??? Warmachine (H-11) for a cutscene and a random colored drop."] = "Chebukkis: habla con Chipmy-Popmy en el Fishing Guild de Port Windurst (C-8) hasta que mencione Purgonorgo Isle, luego ve a Purgonorgo Isle (ferry desde Bibiki Bay) y examina el ??? Warmachine (H-11) para una escena y un drop de color al azar.",
    ["Check ??? (F-11)."] = "Revisa la ??? (F-11).",
    ["Check ??? (F-5)."] = "Revisa la ??? (F-5).",
    ["Check ??? (G-11)."] = "Revisa la ??? (G-11).",
    ["Check ??? (G-5)."] = "Revisa la ??? (G-5).",
    ["Check ??? (H-11)."] = "Revisa la ??? (H-11).",
    ["Check ??? (H-5)."] = "Revisa la ??? (H-5).",
    ["Check the ??? again after defeating Plague Chigoe to complete the quest and receive the Map of Caedarva Mire."] = "Revisa de nuevo la ??? tras derrotar a Plague Chigoe para completar la quest y recibir el Map of Caedarva Mire.",
    ["Check the ??? among the grass at (I-8) for a cutscene. Plague Chigoe appears when the cutscene ends."] = "Revisa la ??? entre la hierba en (I-8) para una escena. Plague Chigoe aparece cuando termina la escena.",
    ["Check the Blank Target in that room to receive the key item Old ring."] = "Revisa el Blank Target de esa sala para recibir el key item Old ring.",
    ["Check the Bulwark Gate repeatedly until the \"door is firmly sealed\" message appears at least three times."] = "Revisa la Bulwark Gate repetidamente hasta que aparezca el mensaje \"door is firmly sealed\" al menos tres veces.",
    ["Check the Door: Acolyte Hostel (K-5)."] = "Revisa la Door: Acolyte Hostel (K-5).",
    ["Check the acidity tester to confirm that it has changed to the Red acidity tester."] = "Comprueba el acidity tester para confirmar que se ha convertido en el Red acidity tester.",
    ["Check the left-hand Door: Acolyte Hostel (K-5) at (K-5) in Windurst Waters (S), on the ground floor, for a cutscene with the young Ajido-Marujido."] = "Revisa la Door: Acolyte Hostel (K-5) de la izquierda en (K-5) de Windurst Waters (S), en la planta baja, para una escena con el joven Ajido-Marujido.",
    ["Check the mission orders shown when you enter the assault, as they describe the objective."] = "Revisa las órdenes de la misión que se muestran al entrar en el assault, porque describen el objetivo.",
    ["Check the objective of the operation in your mission menu once you have signed up."] = "Consulta el objetivo de la operación en tu menú de misiones cuando te hayas apuntado.",
    ["Choose \"'Strange'? Can you be more specific?\" and then \"Of course they will!\"."] = "Elige \"'Strange'? Can you be more specific?\" y luego \"Of course they will!\".",
    ["Choose \"Ask for forgiveness.\" and then \"I promise.\""] = "Elige \"Ask for forgiveness.\" y luego \"I promise.\"",
    ["Choose \"I just want to see Arciela.\" to receive the Hastily scribbled note."] = "Elige \"I just want to see Arciela.\" para recibir la Hastily scribbled note.",
    ["Choose \"I thought he was a libertine, myself.\" You receive an Ash runic board."] = "Elige \"I thought he was a libertine, myself.\" Recibes una Ash runic board.",
    ["Choose \"Tree Grafting.\""] = "Elige \"Tree Grafting.\"",
    ["Choose \"What happened after that?\"."] = "Elige \"What happened after that?\".",
    ["Choose Aphmau when prompted."] = "Elige Aphmau cuando se te pida.",
    ["Choose a Unity to join: Pieuje, Ayame, Invincible Shield, Apururu, Maat, Aldo, Jakoh Wahcondalo, Naja Salaheem, Flaviria, Sylvie or Yoran-Oran. This completes the quest."] = "Elige una Unity a la que unirte: Pieuje, Ayame, Invincible Shield, Apururu, Maat, Aldo, Jakoh Wahcondalo, Naja Salaheem, Flaviria, Sylvie o Yoran-Oran. Esto completa la quest.",
    ["Choose a reward, then trade the appropriate base item and chip to Yurim. Be careful: you cannot cancel the quest after making your decision. You can repeat the quest."] = "Elige una recompensa y luego entrega a Yurim el objeto base y el chip correspondientes. Ojo: no puedes cancelar la quest después de decidir. Puedes repetir la quest.",
    ["Choose a type from the list and you are given three of that choice, which completes the quest."] = "Elige un tipo de la lista y te dan tres de esa elección, lo que completa la quest.",
    ["Choose an item to help you: Scope (3 switches, reward Silent Oil), Bard's harp (4, Prism Powder), Lead Guardsman's ID (6, Hi-Potion), Snares (8, Hi-Ether; place them at the Cermet Refinery, the Kiln and the Metalworks Replica), Lucky charm (8, Key Ring Belt; use it on Pensive Beast), Pocket watch (8, Hermes Quencher) or Costume kit (10, Icarus Wing; use it to get information and to avoid Salim). The Scope is fastest. The Costume kit only unlocks after you've cleared the first six items and the quest Chameleon Capers."] = "Elige un objeto que te ayude: Scope (3 interruptores, recompensa Silent Oil), Bard's harp (4, Prism Powder), Lead Guardsman's ID (6, Hi-Potion), Snares (8, Hi-Ether; colócalas en la Cermet Refinery, el Kiln y la Metalworks Replica), Lucky charm (8, Key Ring Belt; úsalo con Pensive Beast), Pocket watch (8, Hermes Quencher) o Costume kit (10, Icarus Wing; úsalo para obtener información y evitar a Salim). El Scope es lo más rápido. El Costume kit solo se desbloquea tras superar los seis primeros objetos y la quest Chameleon Capers.",
    ["Choose one of the three rings: Balrahn's Ring, Jalzahn's Ring, or Ulthalam's Ring."] = "Elige uno de los tres anillos: Balrahn's Ring, Jalzahn's Ring o Ulthalam's Ring.",
    ["Choose one training focus for Iroha: Strength, Endurance, or Style."] = "Elige un enfoque de entrenamiento para Iroha: Strength, Endurance o Style.",
    ["Choose the Qufim Island response to continue."] = "Elige la respuesta de Qufim Island para continuar.",
    ["Choose the dialogue option concerning Altana's help when prompted."] = "Elige la opción de diálogo sobre la ayuda de Altana cuando se te pida.",
    ["Choose the second dialogue option."] = "Elige la segunda opción de diálogo.",
    ["Choose the second option, \"What kind of sweets do you like?\"."] = "Elige la segunda opción, \"What kind of sweets do you like?\".",
    ["Choose the third option, \"Her hilt-clutching hands.\""] = "Elige la tercera opción, \"Her hilt-clutching hands.\"",
    ["Choose to descend to zone into Empyreal Paradox."] = "Elige descender para entrar en Empyreal Paradox.",
    ["Choose to take part in Voidwatch operations to receive the key item Hyacinth Stratum Abyssite."] = "Elige participar en las operaciones de Voidwatch para recibir el key item Hyacinth Stratum Abyssite.",
    ["Choose whether to visit Bastok or Windurst first. The two paths can be completed in either order."] = "Elige si visitas primero Bastok o Windurst. Los dos caminos se pueden completar en cualquier orden.",
    ["Choose whether to visit San d'Oria or Windurst first."] = "Elige si visitas primero San d'Oria o Windurst.",
    ["Choose your ring reward."] = "Elige tu recompensa de anillo.",
    ["Clear the area and examine the ??? once ready. Two Tsuchigumo spiders spawn; they can't be slept."] = "Despeja la zona y examina la ??? cuando estés listo. Aparecen dos arañas Tsuchigumo; no se pueden dormir.",
    ["Clear the area and examine the Fountain of Kings to spawn two Kraken NMs, Honor (casts Paralyga and Silencega) and Valor (uses Hundred Fists). They don't link but detect sound, resist Sleep, and can be Blinded and Gravitied. Letting one leave and then defeating the other makes it much easier."] = "Despeja la zona y examina la Fountain of Kings para hacer aparecer dos NMs Kraken, Honor (lanza Paralyga y Silencega) y Valor (usa Hundred Fists). No se enlazan pero detectan por sonido, resisten Sleep, y se les puede aplicar Blind y Gravity. Dejar que uno se vaya y luego derrotar al otro lo hace mucho más fácil.",
    ["Clear the nearby enemies and examine the correct ??? to face two Mokkurkalfi (Golems). You can Sneak-pull them; if you do, wait for the second to despawn before killing the first."] = "Despeja los enemigos cercanos y examina la ??? correcta para enfrentarte a dos Mokkurkalfi (Golems). Puedes atraerlos con Sneak; si lo haces, espera a que desaparezca el segundo antes de matar al primero.",
    ["Click again to enter the battlefield Moment of Truth. Protect Blacktattoo Vedool Ja (BLM), Shadowhand Kajeel Ja (NIN) and Whitetattoo Rahool Ja (WHM), who must not die."] = "Haz clic de nuevo para entrar en el campo de batalla Moment of Truth. Protege a Blacktattoo Vedool Ja (BLM), Shadowhand Kajeel Ja (NIN) y Whitetattoo Rahool Ja (WHM), que no deben morir.",
    ["Click on the ??? around the enemy stronghold. You receive a Commencing intel extraction message, then repeated Gathering intel messages, until you receive Investigation complete!"] = "Haz clic en la ??? que hay alrededor de la fortaleza enemiga. Recibes el mensaje Commencing intel extraction y después mensajes Gathering intel repetidos, hasta que recibes Investigation complete!",
    ["Click on the Withered Petals at (L-6), in the south-east part near the coastal cliffs, between 18:00 and 06:00. After the cutscene you end up in Aht Urhgan Whitegate."] = "Pulsa los Withered Petals en (L-6), en la parte sureste cerca de los acantilados de la costa, entre las 18:00 y las 06:00. Tras la escena acabas en Aht Urhgan Whitegate.",
    ["Click the ??? (not the shining spot labeled \"-\") at the north-east corner of (H-10), on a raised wooden platform on a ship, for a cutscene. If you get a cutscene starting with Zweeha, or one pointing you to a pier to the north-west, keep clicking until you get the one with Wasuhd and Mutihb."] = "Pulsa la ??? (no el punto brillante marcado con \"-\") en la esquina noreste de (H-10), sobre una plataforma de madera elevada de un barco, para una escena. Si ves una escena que empieza con Zweeha, o una que te manda a un muelle al noroeste, sigue pulsando hasta ver la de Wasuhd y Mutihb.",
    ["Click the ??? at (F-5) between 18:00 and 4:00 to spawn two NMs, Giollemitte B Feroun and Skeleton Esquire. Both must be defeated to proceed."] = "Haz clic en la ??? en (F-5) entre las 18:00 y las 4:00 para invocar a dos NMs, Giollemitte B Feroun y Skeleton Esquire. Hay que derrotar a ambos para continuar.",
    ["Click the ??? at the top of the platform to spawn Splinterspine Grukjuk, a Ranger Orc NM, and defeat it."] = "Haz clic en la ??? de lo alto de la plataforma para invocar a Splinterspine Grukjuk, un NM Orc Ranger, y derrótalo.",
    ["Click the ??? to spawn the NMs Lamia No. 27 and Moshdahn."] = "Haz clic en la ??? para invocar a los NMs Lamia No. 27 y Moshdahn.",
    ["Click the ???; the incense always fails to light. If others are also doing the quest, the ??? remains after you click it."] = "Haz clic en la ???; el incienso siempre falla al encenderse. Si otros también hacen la quest, la ??? permanece tras hacer clic.",
    ["Click the Camp Remnants again for a cutscene. FastCS (or a frame rate above 30 FPS) can freeze the end of this cutscene on a black screen; hold Print Screen for a few seconds to break out, or unload FastCS first."] = "Pulsa de nuevo los Camp Remnants para una escena. FastCS (o más de 30 FPS) puede congelar el final de esta escena en una pantalla negra; mantén pulsada Impr Pant unos segundos para salir, o descarga FastCS antes.",
    ["Click the green Unstable Displacement again to enter the battlefield Storms of Fate against Bahamut."] = "Haz clic de nuevo en el Unstable Displacement verde para entrar en el campo de batalla Storms of Fate contra Bahamut.",
    ["Climb Parradamo Tor and reach the Cradle of Rebirth within 12 Vana'diel hours and 30 Vana'diel minutes. Obtain the Mimeo Feather, Second Mimeo Feather, and Third Mimeo Feather."] = "Sube a Parradamo Tor y llega a la Cradle of Rebirth en un máximo de 12 horas y 30 minutos de Vana'diel. Obtén la Mimeo Feather, la Second Mimeo Feather y la Third Mimeo Feather.",
    ["Climb to the 4th floor of your race's tower (the five points of the map): Hume north (Light of Vahzl), Elvaan east (Light of Mea), Mithra west (Light of Dem), Tarutaru southwest (Light of Holla), Galka southeast (Light of Al'Taieu). Any tower's panel progresses the mission, but only your own gives the extra cutscene and title."] = "Sube al 4.º piso de la torre de tu raza (las cinco puntas del mapa): Hume al norte (Light of Vahzl), Elvaan al este (Light of Mea), Mithra al oeste (Light of Dem), Tarutaru al suroeste (Light of Holla), Galka al sureste (Light of Al'Taieu). El panel de cualquier torre hace avanzar la misión, pero solo la tuya da la escena extra y el título.",
    ["Clipper"] = "Clipper",
    ["Clipper/Greater Pugil/Acrophies"] = "Clipper/Greater Pugil/Acrophies",
    ["Colibri reflect magic spells back at the party."] = "Los Colibri devuelven los hechizos al grupo.",
    ["Colibri/Date Eruca/Troll Surveillant/Troll Shieldbearer/Troll Sabreur"] = "Colibri/Date Eruca/Troll Surveillant/Troll Shieldbearer/Troll Sabreur",
    ["Collect Giant Bird Feather x3, which drop from Tabar Beak and Axe Beak enemies in the Meriphataud Mountains and Sauromugue Champaign."] = "Reúne Giant Bird Feather x3, que sueltan enemigos Tabar Beak y Axe Beak en Meriphataud Mountains y Sauromugue Champaign.",
    ["Collect Muddy Bar Tab, which drops from Savanna Rarab in East Sarutabaruta."] = "Reúne Muddy Bar Tab, que cae de Savanna Rarab en East Sarutabaruta.",
    ["Collect Odd Postcard and Damp Envelope, which drop from Canyon Rarab in Tahrongi Canyon."] = "Reúne Odd Postcard y Damp Envelope, que caen de Canyon Rarab en Tahrongi Canyon.",
    ["Collect Torn Epistle, which drops from Savanna Rarab in West Sarutabaruta."] = "Reúne Torn Epistle, que cae de Savanna Rarab en West Sarutabaruta.",
    ["Collect Zeruhn Soot x3, either by defeating the monsters in Zeruhn Mines or by buying it at the Auction House."] = "Reúne Zeruhn Soot x3, derrotando a los monstruos de Zeruhn Mines o comprándola en la Auction House.",
    ["Collect all 12 stone key items, then examine Seed Fragment to receive the Omnis Stone."] = "Reúne los 12 key items de piedra y luego examina el Seed Fragment para recibir la Omnis Stone.",
    ["Collect another Traverser stone from Joachim (H-8) when his timer is up. You can flag the maw quests below during the one-hour lockout, as long as you hold a stone."] = "Recoge otra Traverser stone de Joachim (H-8) cuando acabe su temporizador. Puedes activar las quests de los maws de abajo durante la espera de una hora, siempre que tengas una piedra.",
    ["Collect at least 20 signatures from the knights of Southern San d'Oria [S] (more earns a bonus: 30 Oxblood Orb, 41 Foulard, 81 Angel Skin Orb, 100 Orichalcum Ingot, 120 Molybdenum Ingot)."] = "Reúne al menos 20 firmas de los caballeros de Southern San d'Oria [S] (más da un premio extra: 30 Oxblood Orb, 41 Foulard, 81 Angel Skin Orb, 100 Orichalcum Ingot, 120 Molybdenum Ingot).",
    ["Collect four Large memory fragments."] = "Reúne cuatro Large memory fragments.",
    ["Collect six key items from much harder versions of the six Celestial avatars, one at each avatar's Cloister. Select \"Waking the Beast\" at the battlefield entrance; you don't need the Trial quests active. Up to 18 players, no Trusts."] = "Reúne seis key items de versiones mucho más difíciles de los seis avatares Celestial, uno en el Cloister de cada avatar. Elige \"Waking the Beast\" en la entrada del campo de batalla; no hace falta tener activas las quests Trial. Hasta 18 jugadores, sin Trusts.",
    ["Collect the 7 letters from NPCs in Aht Urhgan Whitegate: Zabahf (F-8) gives the T, Mathlouq (F-5) the U, Ekhu Pesshyadha (H-6) an A, Balakaf (I-5) a D, Matifa (H-9) the other D, Mhasbaf (J-8) the M and Qutiba (K-12) the other A. They start quests of their own, so you may need to speak to them more than once (Ekhu Pesshyadha twice if you have The Die Is Cast)."] = "Reúne las 7 letras de NPCs de Aht Urhgan Whitegate: Zabahf (F-8) da la T, Mathlouq (F-5) la U, Ekhu Pesshyadha (H-6) una A, Balakaf (I-5) una D, Matifa (H-9) la otra D, Mhasbaf (J-8) la M y Qutiba (K-12) la otra A. Empiezan sus propias quests, así que puede que tengas que hablar con ellos más de una vez (dos con Ekhu Pesshyadha si tienes The Die Is Cast).",
    ["Collect the Ranpi-Monpi Specialty, take it to Ranpi-Monpi in Windurst Waters (S) to feed the young lad for a Culinary Knife, and bring the knife back to the present-day Ranpi-Monpi."] = "Recoge la Ranpi-Monpi Specialty, llévasela a Ranpi-Monpi en Windurst Waters (S) para alimentar al chaval a cambio de un Culinary Knife, y lleva el cuchillo al Ranpi-Monpi del presente.",
    ["Collect the nine Seed Afterglows in Fei'Yin within 30 minutes (Earth time); if you run out, zone out and back to restart. They drift within their areas. Suggested route from Home Point #1 (K-8): yellow (big room), green, orange, red, yellow (small room), A, white, cerulean, golden, silver, B, blue."] = "Reúne los nueve Seed Afterglows de Fei'Yin en 30 minutos (tiempo real); si se acaba el tiempo, sal y vuelve a entrar para reiniciar. Se desplazan dentro de sus zonas. Ruta sugerida desde el Home Point #1 (K-8): amarillo (sala grande), verde, naranja, rojo, amarillo (sala pequeña), A, blanco, cerúleo, dorado, plateado, B, azul.",
    ["Collect the nine stones (Surya, Chandra, Mangala, Budha, Brihaspati, Shukra, Shani, Rahu, Ketu) from the ??? marked in green on your map. The marks are random, saved on your PC, and don't clear when collected, so note which you've done. Use \"Change Map\" to plan."] = "Reúne las nueve piedras (Surya, Chandra, Mangala, Budha, Brihaspati, Shukra, Shani, Rahu, Ketu) de las ??? marcadas en verde en tu mapa. Las marcas son aleatorias, se guardan en tu PC y no se borran al recogerlas, así que anota cuáles has hecho. Usa \"Change Map\" para planificar.",
    ["Collect the other seven dawndrops (Blank Targets) in any order; leave the Walk of Echoes one for last, since the next mission is there. Tips: Jugner Forest [S] (I-6) is near the earlier Elegant Footprints, east of the river; La Vaule [S] (K-9) is next to a house; Southern San d'Oria [S] (K-6) is near the Lion Springs Tavern; Beaucedine Glacier [S] (H-9) is down the ramp from the Campaign Arbiter; Xarcabard [S] (F-8) is next to Rally Point: Red; the Throne Room [S] one is mid-walkway on the west side; the Walk of Echoes one is south of the Conflux."] = "Reúne las otras siete dawndrops (Blank Targets) en cualquier orden; deja la del Walk of Echoes para el final, ya que la misión siguiente es allí. Consejos: la de Jugner Forest [S] (I-6) está cerca de las Elegant Footprints de antes, al este del río; la de La Vaule [S] (K-9) está junto a una casa; la de Southern San d'Oria [S] (K-6) está cerca de la Lion Springs Tavern; la de Beaucedine Glacier [S] (H-9) está bajando la rampa desde el Campaign Arbiter; la de Xarcabard [S] (F-8) está junto al Rally Point: Red; la de la Throne Room [S] está a mitad de la pasarela del lado oeste; la del Walk of Echoes está al sur de la Conflux.",
    ["Collect three key items in any order. Ancient Verse of Ro'Maeve: examine the Qu'Hau Spring in Ro'Maeve (H-6) (the Survival Guide is closest)."] = "Reúne tres key items en cualquier orden. Ancient Verse of Ro'Maeve: examina la Qu'Hau Spring de Ro'Maeve (H-6) (la Survival Guide es la más cercana).",
    ["Collect, in this order: the Starblessed scale from the Effigy of Sealing at (I-11), map 1; the Silvery plate at (C-7), map 1 (needed for the elevator at (I-6)); the Moontouched scale from the Effigy of Sealing at (H-2), map 1; and the Sunkissed scale from the Demonic Architrave at (C-8), basement map 2."] = "Reúne, en este orden: la Starblessed scale de la Effigy of Sealing de (I-11), mapa 1; la Silvery plate de (C-7), mapa 1 (necesaria para el ascensor de (I-6)); la Moontouched scale de la Effigy of Sealing de (H-2), mapa 1; y la Sunkissed scale del Demonic Architrave de (C-8), mapa 2 del sótano.",
    ["Combat (Region) > Combat (Zilart 1) > Conflict: Cape Teriggan"] = "Combat (Region) > Combat (Zilart 1) > Conflict: Cape Teriggan",
    ["Combat (Wide Area) > General"] = "Combat (Wide Area) > General",
    ["Combat (Wide Area) > Spoils I"] = "Combat (Wide Area) > Spoils I",
    ["Combat (Wide Area) > Spoils II"] = "Combat (Wide Area) > Spoils II",
    ["Complete 2-1 Missions"] = "Completa las Missions 2-1",
    ["Complete 25 points worth of Assaults as a Chief Sergeant. You need Aht Urhgan fame level 1 and the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack. You also need 3 Imperial Gold Pieces and 6 Imperial Mythril Pieces. You have enrolled in the Salaheem Officer Academy to earn your position in the upper ranks of Salaheem's Sentinels."] = "Completa 25 puntos de Assaults como Chief Sergeant. Necesitas el nivel 1 de fama de Aht Urhgan y el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan. También necesitas 3 Imperial Gold Pieces y 6 Imperial Mythril Pieces. Te has matriculado en la Salaheem Officer Academy para ganarte tu puesto en los rangos altos de Salaheem's Sentinels.",
    ["Complete 25 points worth of Assaults as a Corporal. You need Aht Urhgan fame level 1 and the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack. The perfumier Liliroon has come to Salaheem's Sentinels in search of help, believing it to be a famous detective agency, and President Naja wants you to help collect her reward."] = "Completa 25 puntos de Assaults como Corporal. Necesitas el nivel 1 de fama de Aht Urhgan y el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan. La perfumista Liliroon ha venido a Salaheem's Sentinels en busca de ayuda, creyendo que es una famosa agencia de detectives, y President Naja quiere que ayudes a cobrar su recompensa.",
    ["Complete 25 points worth of Assaults as a Lance Corporal. You need Aht Urhgan fame level 1 and the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack. To track the movements of the Dark Rider, you are given a quartz transmitter to place in his warhorse's hoofprint."] = "Completa 25 puntos de Assaults como Lance Corporal. Necesitas el nivel 1 de fama de Aht Urhgan y el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan. Para seguir los movimientos del Dark Rider, te dan un quartz transmitter para colocarlo en la huella del caballo de guerra.",
    ["Complete 25 points worth of Assaults as a Private First Class. You need Aht Urhgan fame level 1 and the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack. Your task is to find hard evidence that the Dark Rider has truly appeared out of legend and is terrorizing the Empire."] = "Completa 25 puntos de Assaults como Private First Class. Necesitas el nivel 1 de fama de Aht Urhgan y el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan. Tu tarea es encontrar pruebas firmes de que el Dark Rider ha salido realmente de la leyenda y aterroriza al Empire.",
    ["Complete 25 points worth of Assaults as a Private Second Class. You need Aht Urhgan fame level 1 and the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack. President Naja wants you to bring her an Imp Wing."] = "Completa 25 puntos de Assaults como Private Second Class. Necesitas el nivel 1 de fama de Aht Urhgan y el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan. President Naja quiere que le traigas un Imp Wing.",
    ["Complete 25 points worth of Assaults as a Second Lieutenant. You need Aht Urhgan fame level 1, the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack and 5 Imperial Gold Pieces. Your final term at the Salaheem Officer Academy has begun."] = "Completa 25 puntos de Assaults como Second Lieutenant. Necesitas el nivel 1 de fama de Aht Urhgan, el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan y 5 Imperial Gold Pieces. Ha empezado tu último trimestre en la Salaheem Officer Academy.",
    ["Complete 25 points worth of Assaults as a Sergeant Major (5 points for a previously unbeaten Assault, 1 point for one already beaten). You need Aht Urhgan fame level 1 and the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack. Abquhbah asks you to visit the weapon shop in his stead; his heavy sighs have you slightly worried."] = "Completa 25 puntos de Assaults como Sergeant Major (5 puntos por un Assault no superado antes, 1 punto por uno ya superado). Necesitas el nivel 1 de fama de Aht Urhgan y el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan. Abquhbah te pide que visites la tienda de armas en su lugar; sus pesados suspiros te preocupan un poco.",
    ["Complete 25 points worth of Assaults as a Sergeant. You need Aht Urhgan fame level 1 and the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack. You must fulfill your duty as a sergeant by training your subordinates into proper mercenaries. Head to Salaheem's Sentinels in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10) for a cutscene with Naja Salaheem."] = "Completa 25 puntos de Assaults como Sergeant. Necesitas el nivel 1 de fama de Aht Urhgan y el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan. Debes cumplir tu deber de sargento formando a tus subordinados como verdaderos mercenarios. Ve a Salaheem's Sentinels en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10) para una escena con Naja Salaheem.",
    ["Complete 25 points worth of Assaults as a Superior Private (5 points for a previously unbeaten Assault, 1 point for one already beaten). You need Aht Urhgan fame level 1 and the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack. Falzum, your fellow mercenary, has been given the task of creating a batch of mythralline liquid, and as his superior it is your job to teach him how a mercenary carries out his duty. Speak with Abquhbah in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10) for a cutscene that starts the quest."] = "Completa 25 puntos de Assaults como Superior Private (5 puntos por un Assault no superado antes, 1 punto por uno ya superado). Necesitas el nivel 1 de fama de Aht Urhgan y el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan. Falzum, tu compañero mercenario, tiene la tarea de crear un lote de mythralline liquid, y como su superior te toca enseñarle cómo cumple su deber un mercenario. Habla con Abquhbah en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10) para una escena que empieza la quest.",
    ["Complete Brygid the Stylist first. Then speak with Brygid in Bastok Markets (K-9), on any job, while wearing 1 to 5 pieces of original Artifact Armor (not +1 or Reforged) to begin the quest."] = "Completa antes Brygid the Stylist. Después habla con Brygid en Bastok Markets (K-9), con cualquier job, llevando de 1 a 5 piezas de Artifact Armor original (no +1 ni Reforged) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Complete Hat in Hand first, then zone before taking this quest."] = "Completa primero Hat in Hand y luego cambia de zona antes de aceptar esta quest.",
    ["Complete Her Memories: Old Bean, Her Memories: The Faux Pas, and Her Memories: Grave Resolve."] = "Completa Her Memories: Old Bean, Her Memories: The Faux Pas y Her Memories: Grave Resolve.",
    ["Complete Her Memories: Operation Cupid to obtain the third Large Memory Fragment."] = "Completa Her Memories: Operation Cupid para obtener el tercer Large Memory Fragment.",
    ["Complete Seekers of Adoulin through An Aimless Journey."] = "Completa Seekers of Adoulin hasta An Aimless Journey.",
    ["Complete Seekers of Adoulin through Meeting of the Minds."] = "Completa Seekers of Adoulin hasta Meeting of the Minds.",
    ["Complete The Geomagnetron."] = "Completa The Geomagnetron.",
    ["Complete Treasures of Aht Urhgan up to Mission 12, Royal Puppeteer, to continue."] = "Completa Treasures of Aht Urhgan hasta la Mission 12, Royal Puppeteer, para continuar.",
    ["Complete any three of the nine maw quests (defeat the area's Notorious Monster, then leave). Vision: A Goldstruck Gigas (La Theine), To Paste a Peiste (Konschtat), Megadrile Menace (Tahrongi). Scars: The Beast of Bastore (Vunkerl), A Delectable Demon (Misareaux), A Fluttery Fiend (Attohwa). Heroes: A Beaked Blusterer (Altepa), A Man-eating Mite (Uleguerand), An Ulcerous Uragnite (Grauberg)."] = "Completa tres cualesquiera de las nueve quests de los maws (derrota al Notorious Monster de la zona y luego sal). Vision: A Goldstruck Gigas (La Theine), To Paste a Peiste (Konschtat), Megadrile Menace (Tahrongi). Scars: The Beast of Bastore (Vunkerl), A Delectable Demon (Misareaux), A Fluttery Fiend (Attohwa). Heroes: A Beaked Blusterer (Altepa), A Man-eating Mite (Uleguerand), An Ulcerous Uragnite (Grauberg).",
    ["Complete both conversations before zoning into Ru'Lude Gardens."] = "Completa ambas conversaciones antes de entrar en Ru'Lude Gardens.",
    ["Complete both quests by defeating their six Tier I Voidwatch Notorious Monsters (three each) and reporting back to Hildegard and Gushing Spring."] = "Completa ambas quests derrotando a sus seis Notorious Monsters de Voidwatch de Tier I (tres cada una) e informando a Hildegard y Gushing Spring.",
    ["Complete every objective in Fishing (Tenacity) using only Lu Shang's Fishing Rod. Lures that catch several small fish per cast, such as the Sabiki Rig, Rogue Rig and Robber Rig, count each fish toward objectives that need many catches."] = "Completa todos los objetivos de Fishing (Tenacity) usando solo la Lu Shang's Fishing Rod. Los señuelos que pescan varios peces pequeños por lance, como el Sabiki Rig, el Rogue Rig y el Robber Rig, cuentan cada pez para los objetivos que requieren muchas capturas.",
    ["Complete the coronation event."] = "Completa el evento de la coronación.",
    ["Complete the cutscene after winning the battle."] = "Completa la escena tras ganar la batalla.",
    ["Complete the cutscene and note which Enfeeblement Kit you are instructed to create."] = "Completa la escena y anota qué Enfeeblement Kit te piden crear.",
    ["Complete the cutscene inside the library."] = "Completa la escena dentro de la biblioteca.",
    ["Complete the cutscene."] = "Completa la escena.",
    ["Complete the final cutscene."] = "Completa la escena final.",
    ["Complete the final events of the Rhapsodies of Vana'diel story."] = "Completa los eventos finales de la historia de Rhapsodies of Vana'diel.",
    ["Complete the prior quests Chocobo's Wounds and Save My Son. You need to be level 30 or higher."] = "Completa las quests previas Chocobo's Wounds y Save My Son. Debes ser nivel 30 o superior.",
    ["Complete the quests When the Bow Breaks and Fist of the People."] = "Completa las quests When the Bow Breaks y Fist of the People.",
    ["Complete the required battlefield."] = "Completa el campo de batalla requerido.",
    ["Complete the resulting event and receive the Vial of Spectral Scent."] = "Completa el evento resultante y recibe el Vial of Spectral Scent.",
    ["Complete the three objectives in any order."] = "Completa los tres objetivos en cualquier orden.",
    ["Completing Mission 1-3 will raise your Rank to 2, and then you can trade Crystals to the mission guard to fill your Rank bar again. If you have any extra crystals at this point, you might as well sell them - you'll need more once you're Rank 3, but you'll also have killed a bunch of stuff to level along the way, and gil is likely tighter than crystals for you right now."] = "Completar la Mission 1-3 subirá tu Rank a 2, y entonces podrás entregar Crystals al guardia de misiones para volver a llenar tu barra de Rank. Si te sobran cristales a estas alturas, mejor véndelos: necesitarás más cuando seas Rank 3, pero también habrás matado un montón de cosas por el camino al subir de nivel, y seguramente ahora te falte más el gil que los cristales.",
    ["Completing Reap What You Sow is not required to start this quest. It cannot be started while Making the Grade is active."] = "Completar Reap What You Sow no es necesario para empezar esta quest. No se puede empezar mientras Making the Grade esté activa.",
    ["Completing Rhapsodies Mission 1-16 gets you Rhapsody in Azure for +30% exp."] = "Completar la Rhapsodies Mission 1-16 te da Rhapsody in Azure, con +30% de exp.",
    ["Completing it raises your fame in Norg, not in Windurst: 53 completions bring your Norg fame to level 4, enough to start The Sahagin's Stash (Utsusemi: Ichi) and Trial by Water."] = "Completarla sube tu fama en Norg, no en Windurst: 53 completados llevan tu fama de Norg al nivel 4, suficiente para empezar The Sahagin's Stash (Utsusemi: Ichi) y Trial by Water.",
    ["Completing it with a passenger of every race and gender earns the title Very Discerning Individual, and with every character model, Extremely Discerning Individual. The quest is repeatable."] = "Completarla con un pasajero de cada raza y sexo da el título Very Discerning Individual, y con cada modelo de personaje, Extremely Discerning Individual. La quest es repetible.",
    ["Completing that quest involves learning, and casting, your first Trust spell."] = "Completar esa quest consiste en aprender y lanzar tu primer hechizo de Trust.",
    ["Completing the battle raises your level limit to 75 and gives you the title Master of Chance."] = "Completar la batalla sube tu límite de nivel a 75 y te da el título Master of Chance.",
    ["Completing the quest also lets you unlock an Accuracy/Evasion Vorseal. The quest is repeatable."] = "Completar la quest también te permite desbloquear un Vorseal de Accuracy/Evasion. La quest es repetible.",
    ["Completing the quest unlocks your Support Job."] = "Al completar la quest se desbloquea tu Support Job.",
    ["Completing this quest is also one of the requirements to obtain Nanaa Mihgo's Trust."] = "Completar esta quest también es uno de los requisitos para obtener el Trust de Nanaa Mihgo.",
    ["Completion unlocks the ability to purchase Atma of Dread."] = "Al completarla se desbloquea la posibilidad de comprar Atma of Dread.",
    ["Condor"] = "Condor",
    ["Config > Gameplay"] = "Config > Gameplay",
    ["Configure Settings"] = "Ajusta la configuración",
    ["Consult the Artifact Armor page to find your quests."] = "Consulta la página Artifact Armor para encontrar tus quests.",
    ["Continue down the canyon and speak with Equesobillot (F-6)."] = "Sigue bajando por el cañón y habla con Equesobillot (F-6).",
    ["Continue north through the opened route into Monarch Linn."] = "Continúa hacia el norte por la ruta abierta hasta Monarch Linn.",
    ["Continue south around the square hallway to the room with the two Dark Elementals around (H-10)."] = "Continúa al sur rodeando el pasillo cuadrado hasta la sala de los dos Dark Elementals, cerca de (H-10).",
    ["Continue through Riverne until you reach Spatial Displacement."] = "Continúa por Riverne hasta llegar al Spatial Displacement.",
    ["Continue through the Throne Room and examine the Throne Room door for a cutscene."] = "Sigue por la Throne Room y examina la Throne Room door para una escena.",
    ["Continue through the next weighted door at (I-10) and reach (G-11)."] = "Continúa por la siguiente puerta de peso en (I-10) y llega a (G-11).",
    ["Continue through the remaining events with Iroha."] = "Continúa por los eventos restantes con Iroha.",
    ["Continue to (H-8) and examine Cermet Portal."] = "Continúa hasta (H-8) y examina el Cermet Portal.",
    ["Continue to Gate of the Gods and travel toward the Garden of Ru'Hmet."] = "Continúa hasta la Gate of the Gods y viaja hacia el Garden of Ru'Hmet.",
    ["Continue to Map 5 and examine the Waterfall Basin (H-6) at (H-6) for a cutscene."] = "Sigue hasta el mapa 5 y examina la Waterfall Basin (H-6) en (H-6) para una escena.",
    ["Continue to Norg after reaching Rank 6 in your home nation."] = "Continúa hacia Norg tras alcanzar el Rank 6 en tu nación de origen.",
    ["Continue to the Gate: Magical Gizmo at (I-9) and examine it."] = "Continúa hasta la Gate: Magical Gizmo en (I-9) y examínala.",
    ["Continue to the end of the upper walkway at (I-12) to trigger another cutscene."] = "Sigue hasta el final de la pasarela superior en (I-12) para activar otra escena.",
    ["Continue to the escort point at (G-10) on the first map."] = "Continúa hasta el punto de escolta en (G-10) del primer mapa.",
    ["Continue to the escort point at (I-10)."] = "Continúa hasta el punto de escolta en (I-10).",
    ["Continue to the escort point at (L-8) on the second map."] = "Continúa hasta el punto de escolta en (L-8) del segundo mapa.",
    ["Continue to the small room at (G-7) on Map 4 and examine the Gate of Light for a cutscene."] = "Sigue hasta la sala pequeña de (G-7) en el mapa 4 y examina la Gate of Light para una escena.",
    ["Continue your nation's quests: Bastok, Beneath the Mask and What Price Loyalty; San d'Oria, Songbirds in a Snowstorm and Blood of Heroes; Windurst, Sins of the Mothers and Howl from the Heavens."] = "Continúa con las quests de tu nación: Bastok, Beneath the Mask y What Price Loyalty; San d'Oria, Songbirds in a Snowstorm y Blood of Heroes; Windurst, Sins of the Mothers y Howl from the Heavens.",
    ["Continue your nation's quests: Bastok, Quelling the Storm and Honor Under Fire; San d'Oria, The Price of Valor and Bonds That Never Die; Windurst, The Long March North and The Forbidden Path."] = "Continúa con las quests de tu nación: Bastok, Quelling the Storm y Honor Under Fire; San d'Oria, The Price of Valor y Bonds That Never Die; Windurst, The Long March North y The Forbidden Path.",
    ["Continue your nation's quests: Bastok, The Truth Lies Hid and Bonds of Mythril; San d'Oria, Chasing Shadows and Face of the Future; Windurst, Manifest Destiny and At Journey's End."] = "Continúa con las quests de tu nación: Bastok, The Truth Lies Hid y Bonds of Mythril; San d'Oria, Chasing Shadows y Face of the Future; Windurst, Manifest Destiny y At Journey's End.",
    ["Coppercap/Berry Grub"] = "Coppercap/Berry Grub",
    ["Corridor F, sixth floor Seed Afterglow (F-8): Divitia Stone."] = "Pasillo F, Seed Afterglow del sexto piso (F-8): Divitia Stone.",
    ["Crawler's Nest - levels 32-42 - A time-honored camp from 2004. Start at the entrance and proceed forward, killing Hornets in the tunnel, then Crawlers in the tunnel, then Crawlers and Lizards down the drop, then Crawlers and Lizards and Beetles down the tunnels."] = "Crawler's Nest - niveles 32-42 - Un campamento clásico de 2004. Empieza en la entrada y avanza, matando Hornets en el túnel, luego Crawlers en el túnel, luego Crawlers y Lizards bajando la caída, y luego Crawlers, Lizards y Beetles por los túneles.",
    ["Crawlers sleep at night, and do not link."] = "Los Crawlers duermen de noche y no se enlazan.",
    ["Create the Enfeeblement Kit requested during Burgeoning Dread. The required kit is one of Silence, Sleep, Poison, or Blindness."] = "Crea el Enfeeblement Kit pedido durante Burgeoning Dread. El kit requerido es uno de Silence, Sleep, Poison o Blindness.",
    ["Crimson orb, if needed: speak with Sedal-Godjal in Davoi (J-8), just north of that wall, touch the Wall of Banishing at (J-9), and return to him for the White orb. Touch the ponds at (L-9), (I-6) (follow the river upstream), (E-8) and (H-10) in any order; the orb darkens to Pink, Red, Blood, and the fourth makes it a Cursed orb and curses you (Holy Water or Cursna). Return to Sedal-Godjal for the Crimson orb."] = "Crimson orb, si hace falta: habla con Sedal-Godjal en Davoi (J-8), justo al norte de ese muro, toca el Wall of Banishing en (J-9) y vuelve con él para el White orb. Toca los estanques de (L-9), (I-6) (sigue el río aguas arriba), (E-8) y (H-10) en cualquier orden; el orbe se oscurece a Pink, Red, Blood, y el cuarto lo convierte en un Cursed orb y te maldice (Holy Water o Cursna). Vuelve con Sedal-Godjal para el Crimson orb.",
    ["Cross over the Corsair quest ship and down onto land, cross two bridges to the west shore (G-10), then head west to (F-10) and cross two more bridges. The first bridge is the start of Arrapago Reef map 2 (K-11)."] = "Cruza la nave de la quest de Corsair y baja a tierra, cruza dos puentes hasta la orilla oeste (G-10), luego ve al oeste hasta (F-10) y cruza dos puentes más. El primer puente es el comienzo del mapa 2 de Arrapago Reef (K-11).",
    ["Cross the big room, go upstairs and open the door at (J-10) with the Prelate Key."] = "Cruza la sala grande, sube las escaleras y abre la puerta de (J-10) con la Prelate Key.",
    ["Cross the bridge to the east and follow the river east to the base of the waterfall."] = "Cruza el puente hacia el este y sigue el río al este hasta la base de la cascada.",
    ["Cross the empty room and examine the Luminous Convergence for a cutscene."] = "Cruza la sala vacía y examina la Luminous Convergence para una escena.",
    ["Cultivate your Mog Garden"] = "Cultiva tu Mog Garden",
    ["Cyan Chip: Treasure Chest monsters (55-60) on several floors from the (G-9) tower, or the Archaic Chest (80) from the (F-7) tower three floors down, at (I-6) and (G-6)."] = "Cyan Chip: monstruos Treasure Chest (55-60) en varios pisos desde la torre de (G-9), o el Archaic Chest (80) desde la torre de (F-7) tres pisos más abajo, en (I-6) y (G-6).",
    ["D. Shantotto uses high-tier magic and scythe skills (Salvation Scythe: AoE poison and paralysis); Shantotto uses magic and staff skills (Divine Malison: AoE stun, slow, silence, plague)."] = "D. Shantotto usa magia de alto nivel y habilidades de guadaña (Salvation Scythe: veneno y parálisis de área); Shantotto usa magia y habilidades de bastón (Divine Malison: aturdimiento, slow, silencio y plague de área).",
    ["Date Erucas are asleep at night."] = "Los Date Erucas duermen de noche.",
    ["Davoi (G-7): pass through the Wall of Dark Arts, enter Monastic Cavern, and examine the Magicite at (F-6) to obtain the magicite."] = "Davoi (G-7): cruza el Wall of Dark Arts, entra en el Monastic Cavern y examina la Magicite de (F-6) para obtener la magicita.",
    ["Davoi: travel to (G-7), avoid or defeat the Orcs, use Sneak if needed, and pass through the Wall of Dark Arts into Monastic Cavern, then examine the Magicite at (F-6) to obtain Optistone."] = "Davoi: viaja a (G-7), evita o derrota a los Orcs, usa Sneak si hace falta, y cruza el Wall of Dark Arts hacia el Monastic Cavern; luego examina la Magicite de (F-6) para obtener la Optistone.",
    ["Deal about 3,700 damage to Sverdheid (about 4,000 HP) and she surrenders, giving you the key item Enlightened Endeavor. If you fail, wait a game day for another Ephemeral Endeavor, or pay Octavien 50,000 gil, 5,000 Bayld or 10 Beastmen's Seals."] = "Haz unos 3,700 de daño a Sverdheid (unos 4,000 HP) y se rinde, dándote el key item Enlightened Endeavor. Si fallas, espera un día de juego para otro Ephemeral Endeavor, o paga a Octavien 50,000 gil, 5,000 Bayld o 10 Beastmen's Seals.",
    ["Deeds of Heroism"] = "Deeds of Heroism",
    ["Defeat 1 Sapphire Quadav and 10 Sapphirine Quadavs. Kill about six Sapphirines first, because killing the Sapphire Quadav scatters the rest."] = "Derrota a 1 Sapphire Quadav y 10 Sapphirine Quadavs. Mata primero a unos seis Sapphirines, porque matar al Sapphire Quadav dispersa al resto.",
    ["Defeat 100 monsters with the Chaosbringer equipped. The killing blow must be a normal hit (weapon skill kills do not count), monsters do not have to give experience, and Trusts can take your kills, so leave them out. The sword keeps its count through zoning and logging out, but there is no counter. If you drop it, return to Palborough Mines and ride the boat back to Zeruhn Mines; the count resets to zero."] = "Derrota 100 monstruos con la Chaosbringer equipada. El golpe final debe ser un golpe normal (las muertes con weapon skill no cuentan), los monstruos no tienen que dar experiencia, y los Trusts pueden quitarte las muertes, así que no los uses. La espada conserva la cuenta al cambiar de zona y al desconectarte, pero no hay contador. Si la tiras, vuelve a Palborough Mines y toma el bote de vuelta a Zeruhn Mines; la cuenta vuelve a cero.",
    ["Defeat 11 Obstreperous Panopts in Reisenjima; many spawn around (F-11), just north of Ethereal Ingress #1. The area is full of other aggressive monsters."] = "Derrota a 11 Obstreperous Panopts en Reisenjima; muchos aparecen alrededor de (F-11), justo al norte del Ethereal Ingress #1. La zona está llena de otros monstruos agresivos.",
    ["Defeat 2 Bloodwing Deathrainers (BLM), 4 Bloodwing Maimers (WAR), the bugard Gherrmoga and Kingslayer Doggvdegg (PLD). Excenmille assists, but if he dies you lose, so don't let him run in alone. Killing Doggvdegg ends the fight (he may use Invincible). If you lose, wait a game day for another Vial from the Animal Spoor."] = "Derrota a 2 Bloodwing Deathrainers (BLM), 4 Bloodwing Maimers (WAR), el bugard Gherrmoga y Kingslayer Doggvdegg (PLD). Excenmille ayuda, pero si muere pierdes, así que no dejes que se lance solo. Matar a Doggvdegg termina la pelea (puede usar Invincible). Si pierdes, espera un día de juego para obtener otro Vial del Animal Spoor.",
    ["Defeat 20 Copper Quadavs. Kills by anyone in your party count, and they don't have to be done in one go. There are 7 in the entry area before the tunnel and 3 more in the tunnel by the first afflictor. If Valaineral's Uriel Blade kills several at once, the extra kills don't count."] = "Derrota 20 Copper Quadavs. Cuentan las muertes de cualquiera de tu grupo, y no tienen que hacerse de una vez. Hay 7 en la zona de entrada antes del túnel y 3 más en el túnel junto al primer afflictor. Si la Uriel Blade de Valaineral mata a varios a la vez, las muertes extra no cuentan.",
    ["Defeat 3 Perfervid Narakas that spawn near Ethereal Ingress #6 between 20:00 and 04:00 (Vana'diel time)."] = "Derrota a 3 Perfervid Narakas que aparecen cerca del Ethereal Ingress #6 entre las 20:00 y las 04:00 (hora de Vana'diel).",
    ["Defeat Altedour I Tavnazia, one of the strongest AF NMs, for a Tavnazian Mask. If someone else just fought it, trading the Bell gives \"You find nothing.\" for a few minutes before you can spawn it again."] = "Derrota a Altedour I Tavnazia, uno de los NMs de AF más fuertes, para obtener una Tavnazian Mask. Si alguien acaba de luchar contra él, entregar la Bell da \"You find nothing.\" durante unos minutos antes de poder hacerlo aparecer de nuevo.",
    ["Defeat Amphitrite in Abyssea - Grauberg."] = "Derrota a Amphitrite en Abyssea - Grauberg.",
    ["Defeat Ancient Bombs in Oldton Movalpolos for Hoary Bomb Ash (at least 1 each, up to 3 with Treasure Hunter). You need 11."] = "Derrota Ancient Bombs en Oldton Movalpolos para obtener Hoary Bomb Ash (al menos 1 cada una, hasta 3 con Treasure Hunter). Necesitas 11.",
    ["Defeat Ancient Vessel."] = "Derrota a Ancient Vessel.",
    ["Defeat Arch Ahriman and its temporary ally doppelgangers in Everbloom Hollow."] = "Derrota a Arch Ahriman y a sus dobles aliados temporales en Everbloom Hollow.",
    ["Defeat Ark Angel HM, Ark Angel TT, Ark Angel MR, Ark Angel EV, and Ark Angel GK."] = "Derrota a Ark Angel HM, Ark Angel TT, Ark Angel MR, Ark Angel EV y Ark Angel GK.",
    ["Defeat Balamor. If you lose or disconnect, zone out and back in for another Most curious curio."] = "Derrota a Balamor. Si pierdes o te desconectas, sal y vuelve a entrar para obtener otro Most curious curio.",
    ["Defeat Bennu in Abyssea - Altepa."] = "Derrota a Bennu en Abyssea - Altepa.",
    ["Defeat Bismarck at one of its planar rifts on Purgonorgo Isle: (F-9), (J-9) or (I-10)."] = "Derrota a Bismarck en uno de sus planar rifts de Purgonorgo Isle: (F-9), (J-9) o (I-10).",
    ["Defeat Blind Moby for the Glocolite. Everyone in the party needs their own, and the ??? can be used again after 3 minutes."] = "Derrota a Blind Moby para obtener la Glocolite. Cada miembro del grupo necesita la suya, y la ??? se puede volver a usar tras 3 minutos.",
    ["Defeat Bugaboo, then examine the altar again for a cutscene."] = "Derrota a Bugaboo y examina de nuevo el altar para una escena.",
    ["Defeat Bukki, then click the ??? again to get the Bag of gold pieces and complete this part of the quest."] = "Derrota a Bukki y luego haz clic de nuevo en la ??? para conseguir la Bag of gold pieces y completar esta parte de la quest.",
    ["Defeat Caedarva Toad, then examine the ??? again for a cutscene."] = "Derrota a Caedarva Toad y examina de nuevo la ??? para una escena.",
    ["Defeat Cait Sith Ceithir, a Black Mage. Mewing Lullaby sleeps everyone and resets TP; Eerie Eye inflicts Amnesia and Silence; Level ? Holy rolls dice for 150 to 1,500+ AoE damage (or nothing). He summons Atomos, whose Soul Vacuum drains about 50 from all your stats and passes them to Cait Sith."] = "Derrota a Cait Sith Ceithir, un Black Mage. Mewing Lullaby duerme a todos y reinicia el TP; Eerie Eye provoca Amnesia y Silence; Level ? Holy tira dados para hacer de 150 a más de 1,500 de daño de área (o nada). Invoca a Atomos, cuyo Soul Vacuum te quita unos 50 de todos los atributos y se los pasa a Cait Sith.",
    ["Defeat Chandelier for the Chandelier Coal. If it self-destructs, the ??? returns after 10 minutes; you only have to redo all the ??? if you leave the zone."] = "Derrota a Chandelier para obtener el Chandelier Coal. Si se autodestruye, la ??? vuelve tras 10 minutos; solo tienes que repetir todas las ??? si sales de la zona.",
    ["Defeat Cirein-croin in Abyssea - Misareaux."] = "Derrota a Cirein-croin en Abyssea - Misareaux.",
    ["Defeat Climbpix Highrise for a Grapnel. At the tower at I/J-7, take off all your equipment and trade the Grapnel to the ??? for a cutscene and the key item First signed forged envelope."] = "Derrota a Climbpix Highrise para obtener un Grapnel. En la torre de I/J-7, quítate todo el equipo y entrega el Grapnel a la ??? para una escena y el key item First signed forged envelope.",
    ["Defeat Decurio I-III, then examine the ??? again to receive the Altepa polishing stone."] = "Derrota a Decurio I-III y luego examina de nuevo la ??? para recibir la Altepa polishing stone.",
    ["Defeat Diabolos Prime to receive the key item Whisper of dreams."] = "Derrota a Diabolos Prime para recibir el key item Whisper of dreams.",
    ["Defeat Diabolos."] = "Derrota a Diabolos.",
    ["Defeat Drakeweaver Hageel Ja (PLD), Riftweaver Pomaal Ja (BLU), Fistweaver Mufaal Ja (MNK), about 60,000 HP each, and Glyphweaver Sikool Ja (BLM, about 100,000 HP; Thunder V/VI, Thundaja, Stun). All use their SP abilities and can be slept and silenced. Sikool Ja stays at 1% until you break his weapon: weapon skill while he is swinging or just after."] = "Derrota a Drakeweaver Hageel Ja (PLD), Riftweaver Pomaal Ja (BLU), Fistweaver Mufaal Ja (MNK), unos 60,000 HP cada uno, y Glyphweaver Sikool Ja (BLM, unos 100,000 HP; Thunder V/VI, Thundaja, Stun). Todos usan sus habilidades SP y se pueden dormir y silenciar. Sikool Ja se queda al 1% hasta que rompas su arma: usa un weapon skill mientras golpea o justo después.",
    ["Defeat Enagakure, keep at least one inventory slot free, and wait until the ferry docks in Selbina."] = "Derrota a Enagakure, deja al menos un hueco libre en el inventario y espera a que el ferry atraque en Selbina.",
    ["Defeat Fenrir Prime to receive the key item Whisper of the moon."] = "Derrota a Fenrir Prime para recibir el key item Whisper of the moon.",
    ["Defeat Firedrakes and obtain two Giant Scales."] = "Derrota a Firedrakes y obtén dos Giant Scales.",
    ["Defeat Forger for the Bomb Steel. If you die or lose the Bomb Steel, Aeka gives you another Oriental Steel for a Darksteel Ore. For multiple people, wait 4 minutes between Forger spawns."] = "Derrota a Forger para obtener el Bomb Steel. Si mueres o pierdes el Bomb Steel, Aeka te da otro Oriental Steel a cambio de un Darksteel Ore. Para varias personas, espera 4 minutos entre apariciones de Forger.",
    ["Defeat Galarhigg (watch out for Petro Eyes). You move on to the next mission right after."] = "Derrota a Galarhigg (cuidado con Petro Eyes). Pasas a la misión siguiente justo después.",
    ["Defeat Garuda Prime to complete the quest. Clarsach Call is wind-elemental and gets absorbed, so do not use it."] = "Derrota a Garuda Prime para completar la quest. Clarsach Call es de elemento viento y se absorbe, así que no la uses.",
    ["Defeat Garuda Prime to receive the key item Whisper of gales."] = "Derrota a Garuda Prime para recibir el key item Whisper of gales.",
    ["Defeat Gerwitz's Axe and it drops Gerwitz's Axe. Head south up the ramp (D on the wiki maps). At (H-11/12) drop down the hole (the southeast hole), then go east to reach map 3 (E on the wiki maps)."] = "Derrota a Gerwitz's Axe y suelta Gerwitz's Axe. Ve al sur subiendo la rampa (D en los mapas de la wiki). En (H-11/12) déjate caer por el agujero (el agujero sureste), luego ve al este para llegar al mapa 3 (E en los mapas de la wiki).",
    ["Defeat Gerwitz's Soul, then head for La Theine Plateau at (G-10) on the same map. You receive your reward after the cutscene. All party members in the zone receive credit for the defeat of Gerwitz's Soul, even if they are too far away to gain experience."] = "Derrota a Gerwitz's Soul y luego dirígete a La Theine Plateau en (G-10) del mismo mapa. Recibes tu recompensa tras la escena. Todos los miembros del grupo en la zona reciben crédito por la derrota de Gerwitz's Soul, aunque estén demasiado lejos para ganar experiencia.",
    ["Defeat Gigaplasm. It splits into 2 Macroplasms, each of those into 2 Microplasms, and each of those into 2 Nanoplasms, with less HP every time. Slimes resist melee, so bring casters, keep the rest asleep and finish one branch at a time. Don't feed them TP (Fluid Spread hurts)."] = "Derrota a Gigaplasm. Se divide en 2 Macroplasms, cada uno de ellos en 2 Microplasms y cada uno de esos en 2 Nanoplasms, con menos HP cada vez. Los Slimes resisten el cuerpo a cuerpo, así que lleva magos, mantén dormidos a los demás y acaba con una rama cada vez. No les des TP (Fluid Spread duele).",
    ["Defeat Glyryvilu, then check the ??? again to receive the key item Caliginous Blade."] = "Derrota a Glyryvilu y luego revisa de nuevo la ??? para recibir el key item Caliginous Blade.",
    ["Defeat Grav'iton (THF: Perfect Dodge, Everyone's Rancor, can't be slept), Molyb'iton (BLM: Manafont) and Tungs'iton (SMN: Astral Flow). Kill Grav'iton first while the other two are slept and silenced, then the Black Mage, then the Summoner quickly before Astral Flow. Winning gives a cutscene and the key item Dark fragment."] = "Derrota a Grav'iton (THF: Perfect Dodge, Everyone's Rancor, no se le puede dormir), Molyb'iton (BLM: Manafont) y Tungs'iton (SMN: Astral Flow). Mata primero a Grav'iton mientras los otros dos están dormidos y silenciados, luego al Black Mage y después al Summoner rápido, antes de Astral Flow. Ganar da una escena y el key item Dark fragment.",
    ["Defeat Guardian Treant, then trade the Sacred Sprig to the ??? for the Sacred Branch. For multiple people, only one kill is needed, but the Treant takes at least 10 minutes to respawn, so everyone should trade their Sprig before leaving."] = "Derrota a Guardian Treant y entrega el Sacred Sprig a la ??? para obtener el Sacred Branch. Para varias personas basta con una muerte, pero el Treant tarda al menos 10 minutos en reaparecer, así que todos deberían entregar su Sprig antes de irse.",
    ["Defeat Ifrit Prime to complete the quest."] = "Derrota a Ifrit Prime para completar la quest.",
    ["Defeat Ifrit Prime to receive the key item Whisper of flames."] = "Derrota a Ifrit Prime para recibir el key item Whisper of flames.",
    ["Defeat Iratham in Abyssea - Tahrongi (title: Iratham Capturer)."] = "Derrota a Iratham en Abyssea - Tahrongi (título: Iratham Capturer).",
    ["Defeat Itzpapalotl in Abyssea - Attohwa."] = "Derrota a Itzpapalotl en Abyssea - Attohwa.",
    ["Defeat Ix'ghrah."] = "Derrota a Ix'ghrah.",
    ["Defeat Kam'lanaut (about 10,000 HP, immune to Sleep and Silence; buffs wear off on entering, Trusts allowed). Great Wheel does AoE damage and resets hate; Light Blade hits one target very hard but has a charge time, can be stunned and is blocked by Utsusemi. He casts Silencega, Dispelga and Slowga, and his Elemental Blade gives him an en-spell that makes him absorb that element, so dispel it or switch nukes."] = "Derrota a Kam'lanaut (unos 10,000 HP, inmune a Sleep y Silence; los buffs se pierden al entrar, se permiten Trusts). Great Wheel hace daño de área y reinicia el odio; Light Blade golpea muy fuerte a un objetivo pero tiene tiempo de carga, se puede aturdir y Utsusemi lo bloquea. Lanza Silencega, Dispelga y Slowga, y su Elemental Blade le da un en-spell que le hace absorber ese elemento, así que disípalo o cambia de nukes.",
    ["Defeat Khimaira 13. Dreadstorm (AoE, Terror), Thunderstrike (AoE, Stun) and Tourbillion (AoE, knockback) remove Utsusemi; Tenebrous Mist resets your TP."] = "Derrota a Khimaira 13. Dreadstorm (área, Terror), Thunderstrike (área, Stun) y Tourbillion (área, retroceso) quitan Utsusemi; Tenebrous Mist reinicia tu TP.",
    ["Defeat Kutharei in Abyssea - Misareaux (Kutharei Unhorser)."] = "Derrota a Kutharei en Abyssea - Misareaux (Kutharei Unhorser).",
    ["Defeat Lancelord Gaheel Ja, a Paladin (Flash, Holy, Cures). Clobber and Blazing Angon are AoE. While Granite Skin is up, attacks from the front do nothing, so hit him from behind until it wears off."] = "Derrota a Lancelord Gaheel Ja, un Paladin (Flash, Holy, curas). Clobber y Blazing Angon son de área. Mientras dura Granite Skin, los ataques de frente no hacen nada, así que golpéalo por detrás hasta que se pase.",
    ["Defeat Leviathan Prime to complete the quest. Only Carbuncle may be used for this battle; Siren can also be used, but that seems unintended."] = "Derrota a Leviathan Prime para completar la quest. Solo se puede usar a Carbuncle en este combate; Siren también se puede usar, pero parece no intencionado.",
    ["Defeat Leviathan Prime to receive the key item Whisper of tides."] = "Derrota a Leviathan Prime para recibir el key item Whisper of tides.",
    ["Defeat Lightning Gremlin and Thunder Gremlin, both Arcana. Lightning Gremlin's attacks drain TP and Thunder Gremlin's drain MP; both resist sleep. If the cutscene after the fight stalls, unload any cutscene-skipping addon until it continues."] = "Derrota a Lightning Gremlin y Thunder Gremlin, ambos Arcana. Los ataques de Lightning Gremlin drenan TP y los de Thunder Gremlin MP; ambos resisten el sueño. Si la escena tras la pelea se atasca, descarga cualquier addon que salte escenas hasta que continúe.",
    ["Defeat Lost Soul, then examine the Iron Door again for a cutscene with Imutira and the key item Wheel lock trigger."] = "Derrota a Lost Soul y examina de nuevo la Iron Door para una escena con Imutira y el key item Wheel lock trigger.",
    ["Defeat Marauder Dvogzog, a level 67 Monk Orc with about 16,000 HP that can use Hundred Fists."] = "Derrota a Marauder Dvogzog, un Orc Monk de nivel 67 con unos 16,000 HP que puede usar Hundred Fists.",
    ["Defeat Marquis Amon, a scythe-wielding BLM demon with tier III -ga spells. His weapon skill draws everyone in, removes shadows and inflicts Doom; wear the Sanctus Rosary to block it, or stun it."] = "Derrota a Marquis Amon, un demonio BLM con guadaña que usa hechizos -ga de nivel III. Su weapon skill atrae a todos, elimina las sombras y provoca Doom; lleva el Sanctus Rosary para bloquearlo, o aturdelo.",
    ["Defeat Metus. It uses Promathia's moves (Bastion of Twilight, Wheel of Impregnability, Infernal Deliverance, Empty Salvation), Osmotic Wave and Censure, and casts Meteor. Trusts are allowed."] = "Derrota a Metus. Usa los movimientos de Promathia (Bastion of Twilight, Wheel of Impregnability, Infernal Deliverance, Empty Salvation), Osmotic Wave y Censure, y lanza Meteor. Se permiten Trusts.",
    ["Defeat Nunyunuwi, then examine Stone Door (H-8) again."] = "Derrota a Nunyunuwi y luego examina de nuevo la Stone Door (H-8).",
    ["Defeat Ogmios, a Manticore."] = "Derrota a Ogmios, una Manticore.",
    ["Defeat Old Professor Mariselle (it warps around the room) and the two Mariselle's Pupils."] = "Derrota a Old Professor Mariselle (se teletransporta por la sala) y a los dos Mariselle's Pupils.",
    ["Defeat Omega."] = "Derrota a Omega.",
    ["Defeat Ophiotaurus. Calling for Help is allowed. Level 40-50 is recommended solo with Trusts."] = "Derrota a Ophiotaurus. Se permite Calling for Help. Se recomienda nivel 40-50 en solitario con Trusts.",
    ["Defeat Orcish Bloodletter and examine Compressed Snow (H-10) a third time to complete the quest."] = "Derrota a Orcish Bloodletter y examina la Compressed Snow (H-10) por tercera vez para completar la quest.",
    ["Defeat Orna, which makes the other two despawn, and touch the Cermet Door again."] = "Derrota a Orna, lo que hace desaparecer a los otros dos, y toca de nuevo la Cermet Door.",
    ["Defeat Ouryu."] = "Derrota a Ouryu.",
    ["Defeat Overgrown Ivy, then speak with Guilloud (H-10) again before leaving Carpenters' Landing."] = "Derrota a Overgrown Ivy y luego habla de nuevo con Guilloud (H-10) antes de salir de Carpenters' Landing.",
    ["Defeat Plague Chigoe, which has a 75% Triple Attack rate."] = "Derrota a Plague Chigoe, que tiene un 75% de probabilidad de Triple Attack.",
    ["Defeat Polevik, then examine the Stalagmite again for the key item Ordelle whetstone."] = "Derrota a Polevik y examina de nuevo la Stalagmite para obtener el key item Ordelle whetstone.",
    ["Defeat Ponderer."] = "Derrota a Ponderer.",
    ["Defeat Procreator, Cumulator, and Agonizer."] = "Derrota a Procreator, Cumulator y Agonizer.",
    ["Defeat Promathia (two forms; you can rest between them). Prishe and Selh'teus fight with you. Prishe can be healed and raised. Selh'teus heals himself, and his Luminous Lance stuns Promathia; if he is KO'd, you lose at once, as you do if the whole party falls. Promathia has low evasion and is immune to Stun."] = "Derrota a Promathia (dos formas; puedes descansar entre ellas). Prishe y Selh'teus luchan contigo. A Prishe se la puede curar y resucitar. Selh'teus se cura solo, y su Luminous Lance aturde a Promathia; si cae, pierdes al instante, igual que si cae todo el grupo. Promathia tiene poca evasión y es inmune a Stun.",
    ["Defeat Raja in Abyssea - Grauberg (Raja Regicide)."] = "Derrota a Raja en Abyssea - Grauberg (Raja Regicide).",
    ["Defeat Ramuh Prime to complete the quest. Only Carbuncle may be used for this battle; Siren can also be used, but that seems unintended."] = "Derrota a Ramuh Prime para completar la quest. Solo se puede usar a Carbuncle en este combate; Siren también se puede usar, pero parece no intencionado.",
    ["Defeat Ramuh Prime to receive the key item Whisper of storms."] = "Derrota a Ramuh Prime para recibir el key item Whisper of storms.",
    ["Defeat Rani in Abyssea - Altepa (Rani Decrowner)."] = "Derrota a Rani en Abyssea - Altepa (Rani Decrowner).",
    ["Defeat Raubahn to complete the quest and raise your level cap to 75. You receive the title Master of Ambition. This quest does not need to be completed for the level limit increase if you have already completed New Worlds Await."] = "Derrota a Raubahn para completar la quest y subir tu límite de nivel a 75. Recibes el título Master of Ambition. Esta quest no hace falta completarla para el aumento de límite de nivel si ya completaste New Worlds Await.",
    ["Defeat Resheph in Abyssea - Uleguerand."] = "Derrota a Resheph en Abyssea - Uleguerand.",
    ["Defeat Sabotender Enamorado."] = "Derrota a Sabotender Enamorado.",
    ["Defeat Savanna Rarab in West Sarutabaruta until one drops a Torn Epistle."] = "Derrota a Savanna Rarab en West Sarutabaruta hasta que uno suelte una Torn Epistle.",
    ["Defeat Searcher and Black Dragon."] = "Derrota a Searcher y a Black Dragon.",
    ["Defeat Sedna in Abyssea - Vunkerl."] = "Derrota a Sedna en Abyssea - Vunkerl.",
    ["Defeat Seed Yagudo (WHM; Phantasmal Dance: AoE damage, knockback, bind), Seed Quadav (RDM; Feather Maelstrom: Amnesia and Bio), Seed Orc (WAR; Thunderous Yowl: AoE Curse and Plague) and Seed Goblin (THF; teleports behind people, stacks Sneak/Trick Attack, Saucepan replaces your food with -10 all stats for about 30 minutes)."] = "Derrota a Seed Yagudo (WHM; Phantasmal Dance: daño de área, retroceso, bind), Seed Quadav (RDM; Feather Maelstrom: Amnesia y Bio), Seed Orc (WAR; Thunderous Yowl: Curse y Plague de área) y Seed Goblin (THF; se teletransporta detrás de la gente, encadena Sneak/Trick Attack, y Saucepan sustituye tu comida por -10 a todos los atributos durante unos 30 minutos).",
    ["Defeat Shiva Prime to complete the quest."] = "Derrota a Shiva Prime para completar la quest.",
    ["Defeat Shiva Prime to receive the key item Whisper of frost."] = "Derrota a Shiva Prime para recibir el key item Whisper of frost.",
    ["Defeat Sippoy in Abyssea - Vunkerl (Sippoy Capturer)."] = "Derrota a Sippoy en Abyssea - Vunkerl (Sippoy Capturer).",
    ["Defeat Siren within about 15 minutes or she despawns. Her Entice charms in a cone in front of her and dismisses your Trusts if it hits you, so let a Trust tank and stand behind her. She absorbs wind damage, including Detonation, Fragmentation and Light skillchains; watch Trusts like Shantotto II."] = "Derrota a Siren en unos 15 minutos o desaparece. Su Entice encanta en un cono delante de ella y despide a tus Trusts si te alcanza, así que deja que un Trust tanquee y colócate detrás de ella. Absorbe el daño de viento, incluidos los skillchains de Detonation, Fragmentation y Light; vigila a Trusts como Shantotto II.",
    ["Defeat Solicitor."] = "Derrota a Solicitor.",
    ["Defeat Tenzen (level 70, about 15,000 HP) and his three helpers (RNG, BLM, WHM, level 67). If he lands all his weapon skills during Meikyo Shisui he creates the level 4 skillchain Cosmic Elucidation and ejects you, so interrupt or burst him down."] = "Derrota a Tenzen (nivel 70, unos 15,000 HP) y a sus tres ayudantes (RNG, BLM, WHM, nivel 67). Si acierta todos sus weapon skills durante Meikyo Shisui, crea el skillchain de nivel 4 Cosmic Elucidation y te expulsa, así que interrúmpelo o acaba con él rápido.",
    ["Defeat Titan Prime to complete the quest."] = "Derrota a Titan Prime para completar la quest.",
    ["Defeat Titan Prime to receive the key item Whisper of tremors."] = "Derrota a Titan Prime para recibir el key item Whisper of tremors.",
    ["Defeat Twilotak, a Dark Knight who uses Blood Weapon repeatedly. The 3 Moblin Wisewomen and 3 Moblin Clergymen only buff him and don't need to be killed. A cutscene returns your 10,000 gil."] = "Derrota a Twilotak, un Dark Knight que usa Blood Weapon repetidamente. Las 3 Moblin Wisewomen y los 3 Moblin Clergymen solo lo potencian y no hace falta matarlos. Una escena te devuelve tus 10,000 gil.",
    ["Defeat Ultima."] = "Derrota a Ultima.",
    ["Defeat Vaa Huja the Erudite and examine the ??? again for the key item Darksteel Formula. Optional: back in Metalworks, Mighty Fist has some extra dialogue."] = "Derrota a Vaa Huja the Erudite y examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener el key item Darksteel Formula. Opcional: de vuelta en Metalworks, Mighty Fist tiene algo de diálogo extra.",
    ["Defeat War Lynx (about 7,000 HP, sleepable, resists Thunder; face away to avoid many of its TP moves)."] = "Derrota al War Lynx (unos 7,000 HP, se puede dormir, resiste Thunder; date la vuelta para evitar muchos de sus movimientos de TP).",
    ["Defeat Warder Thalia, Warder Aglaia and Warder Euphrosyne. They can be slept and fought one at a time, though they start resisting Sleep; all three must die."] = "Derrota a Warder Thalia, Warder Aglaia y Warder Euphrosyne. Se pueden dormir y combatir de uno en uno, aunque empiezan a resistir Sleep; hay que matar a las tres.",
    ["Defeat Yaanei in Abyssea - Attohwa (Yaanei Crasher)."] = "Derrota a Yaanei en Abyssea - Attohwa (Yaanei Crasher).",
    ["Defeat Yagudo Abbots until a Yagudo Holy Water drops. In Castle Oztroja they are behind the Brass Door at (G-8) on Map 3; the lever combination is behind the secret door at (I-10) on the same map. Castle Zvahl Keep also has a few at (G-9) and (G-10) on Map 2, 1-7 levels lower."] = "Derrota Yagudo Abbots hasta que suelten un Yagudo Holy Water. En Castle Oztroja están tras la Brass Door de (G-8) en el mapa 3; la combinación de palancas está tras la puerta secreta de (I-10) del mismo mapa. Castle Zvahl Keep también tiene algunos en (G-9) y (G-10) del mapa 2, de 1 a 7 niveles menos.",
    ["Defeat Yagudo near the fortification in Sauromugue Champaign (S) around (K-9) until you obtain a 108-Knot Quipu."] = "Derrota a Yagudos cerca de la fortificación en Sauromugue Champaign (S), cerca de (K-9), hasta obtener una 108-Knot Quipu.",
    ["Defeat Zhuu Buxu the Silent twice to obtain two Parana Shields."] = "Derrota dos veces a Zhuu Buxu the Silent para obtener dos Parana Shields.",
    ["Defeat all 15 Leujaoam Worms in the area. They are aggressive and link, and they can use Earth-based magic depending on the level cap of the assault."] = "Derrota a los 15 Leujaoam Worms de la zona. Son agresivos y se enlazan, y pueden usar magia Earth-based según el tope de nivel del assault.",
    ["Defeat all Quadavs; the battle ends when Adelheid reaches the turret."] = "Derrota a todos los Quadavs; la batalla termina cuando Adelheid llega a la torreta.",
    ["Defeat all five opponents, return to Cid (H-8), then travel to Newton Movalpolos and obtain a Gold Key."] = "Derrota a los cinco oponentes, vuelve con Cid (H-8), luego viaja a Newton Movalpolos y obtén una Gold Key.",
    ["Defeat all four imps in the central room on Map 3, after the cutscene (any killed before it have to respawn and die again)."] = "Derrota a los cuatro imps de la sala central del mapa 3, tras la escena (los que mates antes tienen que reaparecer y volver a morir).",
    ["Defeat all six caturae and earn each title. You can kill them before this quest starts; Zuah Lepahnyu in Port Jeuno (J-8) tells you which titles you have, and you don't need to set them."] = "Derrota a los seis caturae y consigue cada título. Puedes matarlos antes de que empiece esta quest; Zuah Lepahnyu en Port Jeuno (J-8) te dice qué títulos tienes, y no hace falta ponértelos.",
    ["Defeat all three Antica."] = "Derrota a los tres Antica.",
    ["Defeat all three Skeletons."] = "Derrota a los tres Skeletons.",
    ["Defeat all three for a treasure chest with your reward, which varies, and the title Disciple of Justice. You can repeat the quest once per Conquest Tally."] = "Derrota a los tres para obtener un cofre con tu recompensa, que varía, y el título Disciple of Justice. Puedes repetir la quest una vez por Conquest Tally.",
    ["Defeat all three, then examine the same sarcophagus for a cutscene and the key item Star ring (tarnished). Others doing the quest can trade their Holy Water to that sarcophagus after the fight for their own cutscene."] = "Derrota a los tres y examina el mismo sarcófago para una escena y el key item Star ring (tarnished). Otros que hagan la quest pueden entregar su Holy Water a ese sarcófago tras la pelea para su propia escena.",
    ["Defeat both Cardian NMs."] = "Derrota a ambos Cardian NMs.",
    ["Defeat both, then examine the Hide Flap again to receive the Sword grip material. It moves to a random nearby spot (possibly the same one) after each check; if several people are doing the quest, the NMs take 5 minutes to become available again."] = "Derrota a ambos y examina de nuevo la Hide Flap para recibir el Sword grip material. Tras cada examen se mueve a un punto cercano al azar (puede ser el mismo); si varias personas hacen la quest, los NMs tardan 5 minutos en volver a estar disponibles.",
    ["Defeat both, then examine the same target again to receive the Figure of Leviathan."] = "Derrota a ambos y luego examina de nuevo el mismo objetivo para recibir la Figure of Leviathan.",
    ["Defeat four Ix'zdei: two large ones (RDM) and two small ones (BLM). All are immune to Silence and resist Sleep heavily (Elemental Seal needed). A low-HP pot may flee to its spawn point and regenerate to full in a few seconds; Stun or weapon skills can stop it. If you die, do so by the south door and wait for the pots to reset before Reraising."] = "Derrota a cuatro Ix'zdei: dos grandes (RDM) y dos pequeños (BLM). Todos son inmunes a Silence y resisten mucho Sleep (hace falta Elemental Seal). Un pot con poco HP puede huir a su punto de aparición y regenerarse por completo en pocos segundos; Stun o los weapon skills pueden impedirlo. Si mueres, hazlo junto a la puerta sur y espera a que los pots se reinicien antes de usar Reraise.",
    ["Defeat four Yagudo NMs that use their two-hour abilities: Nuu Kofu the Gentle (WHM), Chaa Paqa the Profound (SMN), Buu Xolo the Bloodfaced (SAM) and Juu Zeni the Poisonmist (NIN). They can be slept; fight WHM, SMN, SAM, then NIN, pulling the White Mage away so Benediction doesn't wake the others. Winning gives the key item Balga champion certificate."] = "Derrota a cuatro NMs Yagudo que usan sus habilidades de dos horas: Nuu Kofu the Gentle (WHM), Chaa Paqa the Profound (SMN), Buu Xolo the Bloodfaced (SAM) y Juu Zeni the Poisonmist (NIN). Se pueden dormir; lucha contra WHM, SMN, SAM y luego NIN, apartando al White Mage para que Benediction no despierte a los demás. Ganar da el key item Balga champion certificate.",
    ["Defeat or evade the Orcs and examine the Sarcophagus."] = "Derrota o esquiva a los Orcs y examina el Sarcophagus.",
    ["Defeat six waves of five Seed Mandragoras (30 total). They're very weak; one hit or an AoE kills them."] = "Derrota seis oleadas de cinco Seed Mandragoras (30 en total). Son muy débiles; un golpe o un ataque de área los mata.",
    ["Defeat the Cloud of Darkness."] = "Derrota a la Cloud of Darkness.",
    ["Defeat the Custom Cardians. You get 500 experience, a Ripe starfruit and a Peach coral key. Redeem it at the red treasure coffer in Tenshodo HQ, Lower Jeuno (J-8)."] = "Derrota a los Custom Cardians. Recibes 500 de experiencia, una Ripe starfruit y una Peach coral key. Canjéala en el cofre rojo del cuartel del Tenshodo, Lower Jeuno (J-8).",
    ["Defeat the Dread Dragon."] = "Derrota al Dread Dragon.",
    ["Defeat the Guardian Statue for a Nail Puller, and trade it to the same Oaken Box for a cutscene."] = "Derrota a la Guardian Statue para obtener un Nail Puller y entrégalo a la misma Oaken Box para una escena.",
    ["Defeat the K23H1-LAMIA gathered at (H-9) (up to 10; true sight, they link, can be slept; every attack poisons, and Venomous Tail poisons hard). After a random number are down, the battle ends. Trusts are allowed."] = "Derrota a las K23H1-LAMIA reunidas en (H-9) (hasta 10; true sight, se enlazan, se pueden dormir; todos sus ataques envenenan, y Venomous Tail envenena fuerte). Tras derrotar a un número aleatorio, la batalla termina. Se permiten Trusts.",
    ["Defeat the Minotaur. Its Mortal Ray inflicts Doom on whoever stands in front of it facing it, so turn away quickly; Holy Water or Cursna may remove Doom (Trusts Mihli Aliapoh, Kupipi and Apururu cast Cursna). There is no cutscene, so leave before it respawns."] = "Derrota al Minotaur. Su Mortal Ray provoca Doom a quien esté delante mirándolo, así que date la vuelta rápido; Holy Water o Cursna pueden quitar Doom (los Trusts Mihli Aliapoh, Kupipi y Apururu lanzan Cursna). No hay escena, así que vete antes de que reaparezca.",
    ["Defeat the Mokkurkalfi and find the ??? again (it may have moved). You won't have to fight again unless you zone or die."] = "Derrota a los Mokkurkalfi y vuelve a encontrar la ??? (puede haberse movido). No tendrás que volver a luchar salvo que cambies de zona o mueras.",
    ["Defeat the NM Ahtu on the island to obtain an Engraved Key. Optional: the Stone Monument for An Explorer's Footsteps is also here."] = "Derrota al NM Ahtu en la isla para obtener una Engraved Key. Opcional: el Stone Monument de An Explorer's Footsteps también está aquí.",
    ["Defeat the NM to receive a Silkworm Egg."] = "Derrota al NM para recibir un Silkworm Egg.",
    ["Defeat the NM, then check the frame for the Ripped \"Final Fantasy\" painting. In a party, there is a 10-minute wait before the NM can be spawned again."] = "Derrota al NM y revisa el marco para obtener el Ripped \"Final Fantasy\" painting. En grupo, hay que esperar 10 minutos antes de poder hacer aparecer de nuevo al NM.",
    ["Defeat the NMs and select the ??? again to obtain the Tiny wristlet."] = "Derrota a los NMs y selecciona la ??? de nuevo para obtener el Tiny wristlet.",
    ["Defeat the NMs, and zone out of Behemoth's Dominion back into Qufim to receive a cutscene and the reward for completing the quest."] = "Derrota a los NMs y sal de Behemoth's Dominion de vuelta a Qufim para recibir una escena y la recompensa por completar la quest.",
    ["Defeat the NMs, then check the ??? again."] = "Derrota a los NMs y luego revisa de nuevo la ???.",
    ["Defeat the Notorious Monster Amphitrite in Abyssea - Grauberg. Like most Abyssea NMs it is spawned with pop items; see the zone's spawn chart on BG-Wiki."] = "Derrota al Notorious Monster Amphitrite en Abyssea - Grauberg. Como la mayoría de los NMs de Abyssea, aparece con objetos de invocación; consulta la tabla de apariciones de la zona en BG-Wiki.",
    ["Defeat the Notorious Monster Bennu in Abyssea - Altepa. Like most Abyssea NMs it is spawned with pop items; see the zone's spawn chart on BG-Wiki."] = "Derrota al Notorious Monster Bennu en Abyssea - Altepa. Como la mayoría de los NMs de Abyssea, aparece con objetos de invocación; consulta la tabla de apariciones de la zona en BG-Wiki.",
    ["Defeat the Notorious Monster Briareus in Abyssea - La Theine. Like most Abyssea NMs it is spawned with pop items; see the zone's spawn chart on BG-Wiki."] = "Derrota al Notorious Monster Briareus en Abyssea - La Theine. Como la mayoría de los NMs de Abyssea, aparece con objetos de invocación; consulta la tabla de apariciones de la zona en BG-Wiki.",
    ["Defeat the Notorious Monster Cirein-croin in Abyssea - Misareaux. Like most Abyssea NMs it is spawned with pop items; see the zone's spawn chart on BG-Wiki."] = "Derrota al Notorious Monster Cirein-croin en Abyssea - Misareaux. Como la mayoría de los NMs de Abyssea, aparece con objetos de invocación; consulta la tabla de apariciones de la zona en BG-Wiki.",
    ["Defeat the Notorious Monster Glavoid in Abyssea - Tahrongi. Like most Abyssea NMs it is spawned with pop items; see the zone's spawn chart on BG-Wiki."] = "Derrota al Notorious Monster Glavoid en Abyssea - Tahrongi. Como la mayoría de los NMs de Abyssea, aparece con objetos de invocación; consulta la tabla de apariciones de la zona en BG-Wiki.",
    ["Defeat the Notorious Monster Itzpapalotl in Abyssea - Attohwa. Like most Abyssea NMs it is spawned with pop items; see the zone's spawn chart on BG-Wiki."] = "Derrota al Notorious Monster Itzpapalotl en Abyssea - Attohwa. Como la mayoría de los NMs de Abyssea, aparece con objetos de invocación; consulta la tabla de apariciones de la zona en BG-Wiki.",
    ["Defeat the Notorious Monster Kukulkan in Abyssea - Konschtat. Like most Abyssea NMs it is spawned with pop items; see the zone's spawn chart on BG-Wiki. Be prepared: its Terror, Petrify, Poison and Curse can kill even level 99 players. Solo, bring a couple of offensive magic Trusts (they keep casting while you are terrorized) and buy HP Boost from the Cruor Prospector."] = "Derrota al Notorious Monster Kukulkan en Abyssea - Konschtat. Como la mayoría de los NMs de Abyssea, aparece con objetos de invocación; consulta la tabla de apariciones de la zona en BG-Wiki. Prepárate: su Terror, Petrify, Poison y Curse pueden matar incluso a jugadores de nivel 99. En solitario, lleva un par de Trusts de magia ofensiva (siguen lanzando mientras estás aterrorizado) y compra HP Boost al Cruor Prospector.",
    ["Defeat the Notorious Monster Resheph in Abyssea - Uleguerand. Like most Abyssea NMs it is spawned with pop items; see the zone's spawn chart on BG-Wiki."] = "Derrota al Notorious Monster Resheph en Abyssea - Uleguerand. Como la mayoría de los NMs de Abyssea, aparece con objetos de invocación; consulta la tabla de apariciones de la zona en BG-Wiki.",
    ["Defeat the Notorious Monster Sedna in Abyssea - Vunkerl. Like most Abyssea NMs it is spawned with pop items; see the zone's spawn chart on BG-Wiki."] = "Derrota al Notorious Monster Sedna en Abyssea - Vunkerl. Como la mayoría de los NMs de Abyssea, aparece con objetos de invocación; consulta la tabla de apariciones de la zona en BG-Wiki.",
    ["Defeat the Propagator, then examine the Memory Flux again for a cutscene. Don't examine the Flux while the NM is up: you'll be stuck in a cutscene while it hits you. After each flux cutscene, the Stone Door in Pso'Xja offers a teleport straight back to that flux."] = "Derrota al Propagator y examina de nuevo el Memory Flux para una escena. No examines el Flux mientras el NM esté fuera: te quedarás atrapado en una escena mientras te golpea. Tras cada escena de flux, la Stone Door de Pso'Xja ofrece un teletransporte directo de vuelta a ese flux.",
    ["Defeat the Seed Crystal (about 25,000 HP, strong physical and magic defense). It attacks with ranged AoE magic, casts the -ga III spells, and Draws In whoever has hate. Seed of Nihility resets everyone's ability timers (including SP abilities), Seed of Deference charms, Seed of Deception makes a Seed Thrall copy of a player, and Seed of Judgment is a heavy knockback AoE."] = "Derrota al Seed Crystal (unos 25,000 HP, gran defensa física y mágica). Ataca con magia de área a distancia, lanza los hechizos -ga III y usa Draw In con quien tenga el odio. Seed of Nihility reinicia los temporizadores de habilidades de todos (incluidas las habilidades SP), Seed of Deference encanta, Seed of Deception crea una copia Seed Thrall de un jugador y Seed of Judgment es un ataque de área con mucho retroceso.",
    ["Defeat the Shadow Lord in your nation's Rank 5-2 mission (San d'Oria: The Shadow Lord; Bastok: Xarcabard, Land of Truths; Windurst: The Shadow Awaits)."] = "Derrota al Shadow Lord en la misión de Rank 5-2 de tu nación (San d'Oria: The Shadow Lord; Bastok: Xarcabard, Land of Truths; Windurst: The Shadow Awaits).",
    ["Defeat the Soulflayer, then examine the blank spot again for a cutscene, your Magus Keffiyeh and the title Paragon of Blue Mage Excellence. If you zone before that cutscene, you have to fight it again."] = "Derrota al Soulflayer y examina de nuevo el punto vacío para una escena, tu Magus Keffiyeh y el título Paragon of Blue Mage Excellence. Si cambias de zona antes de esa escena, tienes que volver a luchar.",
    ["Defeat the Wyvern to receive your reward and the ability to become a Dragoon."] = "Derrota al Wyvern para recibir tu recompensa y la posibilidad de ser Dragoon.",
    ["Defeat the eight Tarutaru clones (Boulders, Torrents, Gusts, Flames, Glaciers, Sparks, Lights, Shadows). Each casts spells of its element and, around 50% HP, summons its avatar for one Astral Flow."] = "Derrota a los ocho clones Tarutaru (Boulders, Torrents, Gusts, Flames, Glaciers, Sparks, Lights, Shadows). Cada uno lanza hechizos de su elemento y, hacia el 50% de HP, invoca a su avatar para un Astral Flow.",
    ["Defeat the first group, then continue to the second battle with Prince Trion. Defeat Warlord Rojgnoj, Rojgnoj's Left Hand, and Rojgnoj's Right Hand."] = "Derrota al primer grupo y continúa con la segunda batalla contra Prince Trion. Derrota a Warlord Rojgnoj, Rojgnoj's Left Hand y Rojgnoj's Right Hand.",
    ["Defeat the four Hinge Oils in the room (they respawn after 16 minutes; all four must be dead to enter)."] = "Derrota a los cuatro Hinge Oils de la sala (reaparecen tras 16 minutos; los cuatro deben estar muertos para entrar).",
    ["Defeat the four Spitewardens: a Monk (Hundred Fists, Forlorn Strike); a Paladin (Invincible, Banishga) that shares hate with the third; a Dancer that heals, removes debuffs like Gravity and has a Doom gaze (turn away); and one using your weapon type and its weapon skills, with Essence Jack at low HP. When kiting with Gravity, kill the Dancer first."] = "Derrota a los cuatro Spitewardens: un Monk (Hundred Fists, Forlorn Strike); un Paladin (Invincible, Banishga) que comparte el odio con el tercero; un Dancer que cura, quita debuffs como Gravity y tiene una mirada de Doom (date la vuelta); y uno que usa tu tipo de arma y sus weapon skills, con Essence Jack con poco HP. Si los paseas con Gravity, mata primero al Dancer.",
    ["Defeat the four Voidwatch Notorious Monsters of the Promathia areas at their planar rifts:"] = "Derrota a los cuatro Notorious Monsters de Voidwatch de las zonas de Promathia en sus planar rifts:",
    ["Defeat the humanoid opponent (Trusts allowed). He uses sword weapon skills and double attacks, randomly resets one player's enmity, and around 50% uses Mighty Strikes and gains Temblor Blade (AoE petrify). Magic draws a lot of enmity. If you lose, ask Gentle Tiger for another Commander's endorsement."] = "Derrota al oponente humanoide (se permiten Trusts). Usa weapon skills de espada y ataque doble, reinicia al azar la enmistad de un jugador y, hacia el 50%, usa Mighty Strikes y gana Temblor Blade (petrificación de área). La magia genera mucha enmistad. Si pierdes, pide a Gentle Tiger otro Commander's endorsement.",
    ["Defeat the six avatar primes to collect their whispers. Do not give the whispers to the NPCs who grant access to those battles, or you will lose them."] = "Derrota a los seis avatar primes para reunir sus whispers. No entregues los whispers a los NPCs que dan acceso a esas batallas, o los perderás.",
    ["Defeat the three Mammet-19 Epsilon."] = "Derrota a los tres Mammet-19 Epsilon.",
    ["Defeat the three Orcs: Fodderchief Vokdek (WAR), Strongarm Zodvad (RNG) and Sureshot Snatgat (RNG). Up to 6 people who are on or past this mission can enter; the battlefield removes level restrictions and Trusts, so summon your Trusts again after entering. Winning gives the key item Orcish hut key."] = "Derrota a los tres Orcs: Fodderchief Vokdek (WAR), Strongarm Zodvad (RNG) y Sureshot Snatgat (RNG). Pueden entrar hasta 6 personas que estén en esta misión o más allá; el campo de batalla quita las restricciones de nivel y los Trusts, así que vuelve a invocar tus Trusts tras entrar. Ganar da el key item Orcish hut key.",
    ["Defeat the three Ru'aern."] = "Derrota a los tres Ru'aern.",
    ["Defeat the three Tier I Voidwatch Notorious Monsters of the Elshimo region at their planar rifts:"] = "Derrota a los tres Notorious Monsters de Voidwatch de Tier I de la región de Elshimo en sus planar rifts:",
    ["Defeat the three Tier I Voidwatch Notorious Monsters of the Zepwell region at their planar rifts:"] = "Derrota a los tres Notorious Monsters de Voidwatch de Tier I de la región de Zepwell en sus planar rifts:",
    ["Defeat the three Tier II Voidwatch Notorious Monsters of the Li'Telor region at their planar rifts:"] = "Derrota a los tres Notorious Monsters de Voidwatch de Tier II de la región de Li'Telor en sus planar rifts:",
    ["Defeat the three Tier III Voidwatch Notorious Monsters of the Tu'Lia region at their planar rifts:"] = "Derrota a los tres Notorious Monsters de Voidwatch de Tier III de la región de Tu'Lia en sus planar rifts:",
    ["Defeat the two level 62 Manticore NMs, Western Sphinx and Eastern Sphinx (about 7,000 HP each, immune to Sleep and Lullaby). Only one has to die, but you can't get the key item until the other is dead or has lost interest in you."] = "Derrota a los dos NMs Manticore de nivel 62, Western Sphinx y Eastern Sphinx (unos 7,000 HP cada uno, inmunes a Sleep y Lullaby). Solo hay que matar a uno, pero no puedes obtener el key item hasta que el otro muera o pierda el interés en ti.",
    ["Defeat them, then find where the Hide Flap moved to (it jumps to another hut nearby whenever anyone searches one) and examine it for the key item San d'Orian martial arts scroll. Each player has to trigger the NMs once; after a scroll is taken there is a few minutes' cooldown."] = "Derrótalos, busca adónde se ha movido la Hide Flap (salta a otra choza cercana cada vez que alguien registra una) y examínala para obtener el key item San d'Orian martial arts scroll. Cada jugador tiene que hacer aparecer los NMs una vez; tras coger un pergamino hay unos minutos de espera.",
    ["Defeating Nanaa Mihgo wins. You get a Red coral key and a cutscene. Redeem it at the red treasure coffer in Tenshodo HQ, Lower Jeuno (J-8)."] = "Derrotar a Nanaa Mihgo da la victoria. Recibes una Red coral key y una escena. Canjéala en el cofre rojo del cuartel del Tenshodo, Lower Jeuno (J-8).",
    ["Deliver it to Orn at (F-10), in the Rarab Tail Hostelry room above the Timbre Timbers Tavern."] = "Entrégaselo a Orn en (F-10), en la habitación del Rarab Tail Hostelry sobre la Timbre Timbers Tavern.",
    ["Deliver the Auction Parcel to Apstaule, who is upstairs (H-10)."] = "Entrega el Auction Parcel a Apstaule, que está arriba (H-10).",
    ["Deliver the Clump of Animal Hair to Engelhart (K-10) at the Music Shop in Bastok Markets (S) (K-10). You don't need to be allied to Bastok."] = "Entrega el Clump of Animal Hair a Engelhart (K-10) en la tienda de música de Bastok Markets (S) (K-10). No hace falta estar aliado con Bastok.",
    ["Deliver the Cold medicine to Abeaule for your reward, 2,100 gil."] = "Entrega la Cold medicine a Abeaule para recibir tu recompensa, 2,100 gil.",
    ["Deliver the Magic Shop Parcel to Regine (J-8)."] = "Entrega el Magic Shop Parcel a Regine (J-8).",
    ["Deliver the Note from Ipupu to Hariga-Origa to complete the quest and receive your rewards."] = "Entrega la Note from Ipupu a Hariga-Origa para completar la quest y recibir tus recompensas.",
    ["Deliver the Pub Parcel to Thierride (G-7)."] = "Entrega el Pub Parcel a Thierride (G-7).",
    ["Deliver the dish to Valgeir in Selbina (I-9); he gives you a Popoto to take back."] = "Entrega el plato a Valgeir en Selbina (I-9); te da una Popoto para que la lleves de vuelta.",
    ["Deliver the envelope to Lathuya in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (F-8), on the second floor inside the stall."] = "Entrega el sobre a Lathuya en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (F-8), en el segundo piso dentro del puesto.",
    ["Deliver the notification to Hae Jakkya at (I-12) in Windurst Woods."] = "Entrega la notificación a Hae Jakkya en (I-12) de Windurst Woods.",
    ["Deliver the package to the blue-clad Immortal beside the Runic Portal first: touching the portal sends you straight back to Whitegate."] = "Entrega primero el paquete al Immortal vestido de azul junto al Runic Portal: tocar el portal te devuelve directamente a Whitegate.",
    ["Deliver the pizza to Valgeir in Selbina (I-9)."] = "Entrega la pizza a Valgeir en Selbina (I-9).",
    ["Delkfutt's Tower is one of the quickest areas to level up rapidly."] = "Delkfutt's Tower es una de las zonas más rápidas para subir de nivel.",
    ["Den of Rancor: Regret (E-5), Strife (H-6), Dolor (J-9), Agony (E-10), Rancor (F-11), Rage (K-11), Despair (J-13) on Map 1; Death (L-13) and Blight (H-9) on Map 2; Penury (F-9) on Map 3."] = "Den of Rancor: Regret (E-5), Strife (H-6), Dolor (J-9), Agony (E-10), Rancor (F-11), Rage (K-11), Despair (J-13) en el mapa 1; Death (L-13) y Blight (H-9) en el mapa 2; Penury (F-9) en el mapa 3.",
    ["Depending on your character's progress, you may get the Savage Blade quest and The General's Secret first."] = "Según el progreso de tu personaje, puede que obtengas primero la quest Savage Blade y The General's Secret.",
    ["Depthswalker Crab/Barnacle Crab"] = "Depthswalker Crab/Barnacle Crab",
    ["Description"] = "Descripción",
    ["Destrier Beret and Chocobo Shirt"] = "Destrier Beret y Chocobo Shirt",
    ["Determine the correct herb color from the current time: Red/Sandy 00:00-07:59, Blue/Bastok 08:00-15:59, Green/Windurst 16:00-23:59."] = "Determina el color correcto de la hierba según la hora actual: Red/Sandy 00:00-07:59, Blue/Bastok 08:00-15:59, Green/Windurst 16:00-23:59.",
    ["Dhokmak: go to (K-11) in Cirdas Caverns (west tunnel from Yorcia Weald's Frontier Station, or the Enigmatic Device waypoint). Examine the Wavering Flux for a cutscene, then again to enter. You fight Dhokmak and 3 Malignant Acuex with Darrcuiln, who must survive."] = "Dhokmak: ve a (K-11) en Cirdas Caverns (túnel oeste desde la Frontier Station de Yorcia Weald, o el waypoint del Enigmatic Device). Examina el Wavering Flux para una escena, y de nuevo para entrar. Luchas contra Dhokmak y 3 Malignant Acuex con Darrcuiln, que debe sobrevivir.",
    ["Diederik has lost a painting ordered by a customer. Choose either to ask Angelica for a new painting, or to delay the buyer, Umberto, while a new one is made. Both paths need the same two things."] = "Diederik ha perdido un cuadro encargado por un cliente. Elige entre pedir a Angelica un cuadro nuevo o retrasar al comprador, Umberto, mientras se hace uno nuevo. Ambos caminos necesitan las mismas dos cosas.",
    ["Dig until you find the Moldy, worm-eaten chest. Its spot changes if you leave the zone."] = "Excava hasta encontrar el Moldy, worm-eaten chest. Su ubicación cambia si sales de la zona.",
    ["Do not use the northern Ergon Locus ???; it is not the correct target."] = "No uses el Ergon Locus ??? del norte; no es el objetivo correcto.",
    ["Doing 2-3 will require you to visit the two starter cities that you didn't start in. Again, you can either use the Unity Concord NPCs or walk:"] = "Hacer la 2-3 te obligará a visitar las dos ciudades iniciales en las que no empezaste. De nuevo, puedes usar los NPCs de Unity Concord o ir caminando:",
    ["Don't forget Signet... except for the areas where you should. See below."] = "No olvides Signet... salvo en las zonas donde no toca. Ver abajo.",
    ["Don't forget to hit the Home Point outside the Throne Room in Castle Zvahl Keep, because it's a long walk and you'll have to come back a few times for other missions."] = "No olvides tocar el Home Point de fuera de la Throne Room en Castle Zvahl Keep, porque es un camino largo y tendrás que volver varias veces por otras misiones.",
    ["Don't spend all your Accolades! You can also use them to warp to zones, even ones you haven't been to yet, and it's really convenient. That said, blow some if you need a little walking-around money."] = "¡No gastes todas tus Accolades! También puedes usarlas para teletransportarte a zonas, incluso a las que aún no has ido, y es muy práctico. Dicho esto, gasta algunas si necesitas algo de dinero.",
    ["Don't warp away afterwards: the next mission is in Yuhtunga Jungle, and the Survival Guide at (M-3) or Escape puts you close."] = "No te teletransportes después: la misión siguiente es en Yuhtunga Jungle, y la Survival Guide de (M-3) o Escape te dejan cerca.",
    ["Don't warp out: head south from the Cutter into Caedarva Mire for the next mission."] = "No te teletransportes fuera: ve al sur desde el Cutter a Caedarva Mire para la misión siguiente.",
    ["Don't worry about failing the quest the first time, you can repeat it as many times as you like until completion, and even get offered a lower difficulty after the first failure."] = "No te preocupes por fallar la quest la primera vez; puedes repetirla tantas veces como quieras hasta completarla, e incluso te ofrecen una dificultad menor tras el primer fallo.",
    ["Drachenlizard"] = "Drachenlizard",
    ["Drachenlizards do not aggro, but do link."] = "Los Drachenlizards no atacan, pero se enlazan.",
    ["Dragon's Tabernacle: at the Cape Teriggan seafront, with a Shrimp Lure."] = "Dragon's Tabernacle: en la costa de Cape Teriggan, con un Shrimp Lure.",
    ["Drill Sergeant Rongelouts repeats a 4-round cycle: the same critter every other round and the other two alternating in between (e.g. Crab, Ghost, Beetle, Ghost). Below 4 points he cheats back up to 4, so bring him to 4, tie three times, then win once to knock him out. Against Koja Salaheem (a single round), choose Beetle."] = "Drill Sergeant Rongelouts repite un ciclo de 4 rondas: el mismo bicho una ronda sí y otra no, y los otros dos alternándose entre medias (p. ej. Crab, Ghost, Beetle, Ghost). Por debajo de 4 puntos hace trampa y vuelve a 4, así que déjalo en 4, empata tres veces y gana una vez para noquearlo. Contra Koja Salaheem (una sola ronda), elige Beetle.",
    ["Drive away the rabbits: kill the enemies before the vegetation is consumed."] = "Ahuyenta a los conejos: mata a los enemigos antes de que se consuma la vegetación.",
    ["Drop down the first hole at (H-8)."] = "Déjate caer por el primer agujero de (H-8).",
    ["Drop down the hole at (E-11) and go to the Fountain of Kings at (G-14)."] = "Déjate caer por el agujero de (E-11) y ve a la Fountain of Kings en (G-14).",
    ["Drop down, use the center teleporter, and examine Displaced Block to complete the quest and receive the reward."] = "Déjate caer, usa el teletransportador central y examina el Displaced Block para completar la quest y recibir la recompensa.",
    ["Droplet ??? locations: #2, #5 at the end of the only path, next to the door (not the one in front of the portal); #3 up the first staircase by the pillar on the right; #4 across the bridge between the two large pillars on the left; #6 southern (G-6), past and under the second staircase on the bridge with the closed door; #7 (F-5), left of the second bridge."] = "Ubicación de las ??? de gotas: #2, #5 al final del único camino, junto a la puerta (no la de delante del portal); #3 subiendo la primera escalera junto a la columna de la derecha; #4 cruzando el puente entre las dos columnas grandes de la izquierda; #6 sur de (G-6), pasada y bajo la segunda escalera, en el puente con la puerta cerrada; #7 (F-5), a la izquierda del segundo puente.",
    ["During Campaign, speak with Erik (H-7) to obtain the left map piece."] = "Durante Campaign, habla con Erik (H-7) para obtener la pieza de mapa izquierda.",
    ["During a previous mission to eradicate the Undead Swarm presence from Periqia, the Imperial forces had to abandon several Mark-II automatons when they retreated. Mission orders: retrieve the Mark-IIs."] = "Durante una misión anterior para erradicar la presencia del Undead Swarm en Periqia, las fuerzas Imperial tuvieron que abandonar varios autómatas Mark-II al retirarse. Órdenes de la misión: recuperar los Mark-IIs.",
    ["During the cutscene you are asked to agree with one of the three NPCs. Whoever you pick decides your title, but it does not affect the quest. After the cutscene you can continue on any job."] = "Durante la escena te piden estar de acuerdo con uno de los tres NPCs. Quien elijas decide tu título, pero no afecta a la quest. Tras la escena puedes continuar con cualquier trabajo.",
    ["During this quest the Plasma rock key item is mentioned, but it is actually not obtainable."] = "Durante esta quest se menciona el key item Plasma rock, pero en realidad no se puede conseguir.",
    ["Duriumshell"] = "Duriumshell",
    ["Each Nation's 2-1 Mission will ask you to travel through one of the following areas, so go ahead and accept the associated Mission. Don't bother heading back to turn it in right away, our destination of Selbina or Mhaura is more pressing. Once you do make it back to turn in, you will be left with a choice. All Nation 2-2 Missions can be skipped, so it's up to you if you want to do so. None are particularly difficult, nor do any of them have much actual story involved. Either way, we are going to put off Mission 2-3 until a bit later."] = "La Mission 2-1 de cada nación te pedirá viajar por una de las siguientes zonas, así que acepta la Mission correspondiente. No te molestes en volver a entregarla enseguida; nuestro destino, Selbina o Mhaura, es más urgente. Cuando vuelvas a entregarla, tendrás que elegir. Todas las Missions 2-2 de nación se pueden saltar, así que tú decides si lo haces. Ninguna es especialmente difícil ni tiene mucha historia. En cualquier caso, dejaremos la Mission 2-3 para un poco más adelante.",
    ["Each Orb the battle starter holds removes one immunity from the Custom Cardians: Swords = slashing, Batons = blunt, Cups = piercing, Coins = magic. Holding 1-2 Orbs means 15 Cardians, 3 means 10, all 4 means 5. Only the starter's Orbs count, and everyone's are used up."] = "Cada Orb que tenga quien inicia la batalla quita una inmunidad a los Custom Cardians: Swords = cortante, Batons = contundente, Cups = perforante, Coins = magia. Con 1-2 Orbs hay 15 Cardians, con 3 hay 10 y con los 4 hay 5. Solo cuentan los Orbs de quien la inicia, y se gastan los de todos.",
    ["Each Promyvion has 4 floors. To go up, defeat a Memory Receptacle; only one per floor opens the Memory Stream, so if none appears, try another (Widescan helps). Clear the Strays first, and stand with your back to a pillar against its Empty Seed knockback. Sneak and Invisible don't work: everything has true sight or true sound."] = "Cada Promyvion tiene 4 pisos. Para subir, derrota un Memory Receptacle; solo uno por piso abre el Memory Stream, así que si no aparece ninguno, prueba otro (Widescan ayuda). Despeja antes a los Strays y colócate de espaldas a una columna para su retroceso de Empty Seed. Sneak e Invisible no funcionan: todo tiene true sight o true sound.",
    ["Each blast's smoke shows where the next operative is. The first is south of Antje and the circuit runs counter-clockwise. The Tigers don't remove Flee."] = "El humo de cada explosión indica dónde está el siguiente operativo. El primero está al sur de Antje y el circuito va en sentido antihorario. Los Tigers no quitan Flee.",
    ["Each dig gives a direction and a hint of distance, from coldest to hottest: favored by moogles (freezing), enjoy traversing (very cold), to a moogle's liking (cold), been through this way (warm), frequents this spot (hot), digging in the immediate vicinity (very hot: you're on top of it)."] = "Cada excavación da una dirección y una pista de distancia, de más frío a más caliente: favored by moogles (helado), enjoy traversing (muy frío), to a moogle's liking (frío), been through this way (templado), frequents this spot (caliente), digging in the immediate vicinity (muy caliente: estás encima).",
    ["Each job's Testimony (Warrior's Testimony, Monk's Testimony, etc.) drops from specific monsters; see the item's wiki page for where. A Testimony can be used up to three times before it tears."] = "El Testimony de cada job (Warrior's Testimony, Monk's Testimony, etc.) lo sueltan monstruos concretos; consulta la página del objeto en la wiki para saber dónde. Un Testimony puede usarse hasta tres veces antes de romperse.",
    ["Each member earns 1 Rank-Up Point for a successful assault. The first time you complete that assault you earn 5 Rank-Up Points in total."] = "Cada miembro gana 1 Rank-Up Point por un assault superado. La primera vez que completas ese assault ganas 5 Rank-Up Points en total.",
    ["Each party member trades an Ahriman Tears to Tarnotik to be taken to Mine Shaft #2716 (or use the Newton Movalpolos Home Point). Examine the Shaft Entrance twice and agree both times to start a 30-minute battle for up to 6 people. There's no level cap, and Trusts can't be used."] = "Cada miembro del grupo entrega unas Ahriman Tears a Tarnotik para que lo lleve a Mine Shaft #2716 (o usa el Home Point de Newton Movalpolos). Examina la Shaft Entrance dos veces y acepta ambas para empezar una batalla de 30 minutos para hasta 6 personas. No hay límite de nivel y no se pueden usar Trusts.",
    ["Each rewards the players with a piece of customizable augmented gear. All of them are very niche, however. Beastmasters will enjoy the Call Beast recast reduction on Mirke Wardecors, Corsairs will enjoy the Phantom Roll recast reduction from Desultor Tassets, and Dancers will enjoy the Waltz recast reduction from Anwig Salade. Again, these are all very minor benefits. The stories themselves are considered non-canon, and more of a \"what if...?\" scenario for various storylines."] = "Cada una recompensa con una pieza de equipo aumentado personalizable. Pero todas son muy de nicho. A los Beastmasters les gustará la reducción de recarga de Call Beast de las Mirke Wardecors, a los Corsairs la de Phantom Roll de las Desultor Tassets y a los Dancers la de Waltz de la Anwig Salade. De nuevo, son ventajas muy menores. Las historias en sí se consideran no canónicas, más bien un escenario de \"¿y si...?\" de varias historias.",
    ["Each wash gives you a random amount of gold dust grains, generally between 3 and 11. Repeat examining the Riverbed and the washing steps until you have at least 20 grains, which gives you the key item Ampoule of gold dust."] = "Cada lavado te da una cantidad aleatoria de granos de polvo de oro, generalmente entre 3 y 11. Repite el examen del Riverbed y los pasos de lavado hasta tener al menos 20 granos, lo que te da el key item Ampoule of gold dust.",
    ["Early Advanced Jobs"] = "Primeros jobs avanzados",
    ["Earth route: the Unity Warp (level 125) to Western Altepa Desert puts you on a rock above a crevasse; walk into it, turn right at the fork to the Ruby Column (press it down if it's up), go through the open door near the end and out into the square crevasse, turn left through the first open door, and head south-west to the headstone at (H-8)/(H-9). Otherwise enter Quicksand Caves at Western Altepa (J-9), drop down the sandpit at (K-6) on map 3 and follow the path back out."] = "Ruta de tierra: el Unity Warp (nivel 125) a Western Altepa Desert te deja sobre una roca encima de una grieta; entra en ella, gira a la derecha en la bifurcación hasta la Ruby Column (púlsala si está levantada), cruza la puerta abierta cerca del final y sal a la grieta cuadrada, gira a la izquierda por la primera puerta abierta y ve al suroeste hasta la lápida de (H-8)/(H-9). Si no, entra en Quicksand Caves por Western Altepa (J-9), déjate caer por el foso de arena de (K-6) en el mapa 3 y sigue el camino de vuelta al exterior.",
    ["Easiest at low level: Outer Horutoto Ruins, entered from the tower at (H-3) in East Sarutabaruta. Go left down the hall to (G-7); the fount is behind the farthest southwest Stone Door. Monsters there are level 1-4. At high level, Gustav Tunnel is seconds from Unity Warp (level 128)."] = "Lo más fácil a nivel bajo: Outer Horutoto Ruins, entrando por la torre de (H-3) en East Sarutabaruta. Ve a la izquierda por el pasillo hasta (G-7); la fount está tras la Stone Door más al suroeste. Los monstruos son de nivel 1-4. A nivel alto, Gustav Tunnel está a segundos del Unity Warp (nivel 128).",
    ["East Sarutabaruta, just outside Windurst, connects to the Inner Horutoto Ruins via a staircase in the visible tower on the map at J-7 (among other places.) There's a Guide at that entrance."] = "East Sarutabaruta, justo fuera de Windurst, conecta con Inner Horutoto Ruins por una escalera en la torre visible en el mapa en J-7 (entre otros sitios). Hay una Guide en esa entrada.",
    ["East Side: 40-50"] = "Lado este: 40-50",
    ["Eastern Altepa Desert - levels 34-40 - exit from Rabao and proceed forward. Start with Worms and Spiders, then add Beetles and Dhalmels as you level."] = "Eastern Altepa Desert - niveles 34-40 - sal de Rabao y avanza. Empieza con Worms y arañas, y añade Beetles y Dhalmels según subas.",
    ["Echion gains Ice Spikes (up to 500 per hit, stronger after each SP ability; reduce with Barblizzard, Carols or magic evasion), uses Mighty Strikes and Hundred Fists more than once, Daunting Hurl (Terror), and below 50% Colossal Slam (AoE knockback and Zombie)."] = "Echion gana Ice Spikes (hasta 500 por golpe, más fuertes tras cada habilidad SP; redúcelos con Barblizzard, Carols o evasión mágica), usa Mighty Strikes y Hundred Fists más de una vez, Daunting Hurl (Terror) y, por debajo del 50%, Colossal Slam (retroceso de área y Zombie).",
    ["Eddy shows you a picture of an NPC that you must memorize."] = "Eddy te muestra una imagen de un NPC que debes memorizar.",
    ["Either defeat all four, or pull one and let the others despawn before you defeat it; otherwise the door gives no cutscene."] = "Derrota a los cuatro, o atrae a uno y deja que los demás desaparezcan antes de derrotarlo; si no, la puerta no da escena.",
    ["Eldieme Necropolis - levels 40-50 - warp to the Survival Guide, start with the nearby Hounds and Skeletons, then go further in and move up to Ghosts and Shades as well."] = "Eldieme Necropolis - niveles 40-50 - teletranspórtate a la Survival Guide, empieza con los Hounds y Skeletons cercanos y luego adéntrate y pasa también a Ghosts y Shades.",
    ["Eldieme route: go in, turn left past the ghosts and follow the hallway. If the path left at the Hellhounds is blocked, go north into the grave room, examine the East Plate behind the Gravestone to open it, and come back (a Magicked astrolabe, 10,000 gil from Churano-Shurano in Windurst Waters (F-8), opens the gates for good). Take care at the lever: the lone bomb nearby aggroes by sight and magic."] = "Ruta de Eldieme: entra, gira a la izquierda pasando los fantasmas y sigue el pasillo. Si el camino a la izquierda de los Hellhounds está bloqueado, ve al norte a la sala de tumbas, examina la East Plate detrás de la Gravestone para abrirlo y vuelve (un Magicked astrolabe, 10,000 gil a Churano-Shurano en Windurst Waters (F-8), abre las puertas para siempre). Cuidado en la palanca: la bomba solitaria de al lado detecta por vista y por magia.",
    ["Elemental Magic"] = "Elemental: magia",
    ["Emhi Tchaoryo sends you to the Quartermaster at (F-9) in Windurst Waters (S). Obtain the supplies that he requests, either by gathering them or by buying them at the Auction House, and hand them over."] = "Emhi Tchaoryo te envía al Quartermaster at (F-9) in Windurst Waters (S). Consigue los suministros que pide, ya sea recolectándolos o comprándolos en la Auction House, y entrégaselos.",
    ["Endless crab spawns."] = "Aparecen cangrejos sin parar.",
    ["Endurance: a Serving of Zaru Soba (15,000 gil)."] = "Resistencia: una Serving of Zaru Soba (15,000 gil).",
    ["Enemies do not aggro or link, but will use a 30 second sleep AoE attack."] = "Los enemigos no atacan ni se enlazan, pero usan un ataque de área que duerme 30 segundos.",
    ["Enough Distractions, Let's Level Up"] = "Basta de distracciones, a subir de nivel",
    ["Enter Aht Urhgan Whitegate."] = "Entra en Aht Urhgan Whitegate.",
    ["Enter Alzadaal Undersea Ruins."] = "Entra en Alzadaal Undersea Ruins.",
    ["Enter Arrapago Reef map 1 from Caedarva Mire (I-6). Use the Lamian Fang Key on the Iron Gate at (J-10), then go immediately west on the small map to another Iron Gate, which opens from behind."] = "Entra en el mapa 1 de Arrapago Reef desde Caedarva Mire (I-6). Usa la Lamian Fang Key en la Iron Gate de (J-10) y ve enseguida al oeste en el mapa pequeño hasta otra Iron Gate, que se abre desde detrás.",
    ["Enter Aydeewa Subterrane at entrance 8, Wajaom Woodlands (E-10). Follow the left wall without dropping down, leave by exit 7 at (J-8), and continue past the first ledge into the open area (raptors or spiders mean you went wrong)."] = "Entra en Aydeewa Subterrane por la entrada 8, Wajaom Woodlands (E-10). Sigue la pared izquierda sin dejarte caer, sal por la salida 7 de (J-8) y continúa pasada la primera cornisa hasta la zona abierta (si ves raptores o arañas, te has equivocado).",
    ["Enter Aydeewa Subterrane from Bhaflau Thickets (G-7) (the Voidwatch warp is fastest) and go to the pond platform at (H-9) for a cutscene. Choose to take his hand: if you refuse every time, the whole quest resets and you have to start over."] = "Entra en Aydeewa Subterrane desde Bhaflau Thickets (G-7) (el warp de Voidwatch es lo más rápido) y ve a la plataforma del estanque en (H-9) para una escena. Elige tomar su mano: si te niegas todas las veces, la quest entera se reinicia y tienes que empezar de nuevo.",
    ["Enter Aydeewa Subterrane from Wajaom Woodlands (I-10). This is the same entrance next to the Aydeewa Subterrane Survival Guide."] = "Entra en Aydeewa Subterrane desde Wajaom Woodlands (I-10). Es la misma entrada junto a la Survival Guide de Aydeewa Subterrane.",
    ["Enter Aydeewa Subterrane through the cave at (I-7) in Bhaflau Thickets."] = "Entra en Aydeewa Subterrane por la cueva en (I-7) de Bhaflau Thickets.",
    ["Enter Bastok Markets (S) from North Gustaberg (S) and obtain the Silvermine Key."] = "Entra en Bastok Markets (S) desde North Gustaberg (S) y obtén la Silvermine Key.",
    ["Enter Bastok Markets (S) from North Gustaberg (S)."] = "Entra en Bastok Markets (S) desde North Gustaberg (S).",
    ["Enter Batallia Downs (S) from Beaucedine Glacier (S)."] = "Entra en Batallia Downs (S) desde Beaucedine Glacier (S).",
    ["Enter Batallia Downs (S) from Jugner Forest (S)."] = "Entra en Batallia Downs (S) desde Jugner Forest (S).",
    ["Enter Batallia Downs (S) from Rolanberry Fields (S) to receive the Large Memory Fragment."] = "Entra en Batallia Downs (S) desde Rolanberry Fields (S) para recibir el Large Memory Fragment.",
    ["Enter Beadeaux (S)."] = "Entra en Beadeaux (S).",
    ["Enter Beaucedine Glacier (S) and examine Colossal Footprint (I-7) behind the tower."] = "Entra en Beaucedine Glacier (S) y examina la Colossal Footprint (I-7) detrás de la torre.",
    ["Enter Beaucedine Glacier [S]."] = "Entra en Beaucedine Glacier [S].",
    ["Enter Boneyard Gully in Attohwa Chasm and defeat Shikaree X, Shikaree Y, and Shikaree Z."] = "Entra en Boneyard Gully en Attohwa Chasm y derrota a Shikaree X, Shikaree Y y Shikaree Z.",
    ["Enter Bostaunieux Oubliette from Chateau d'Oraguille (I-8)."] = "Entra en Bostaunieux Oubliette desde Chateau d'Oraguille (I-8).",
    ["Enter Carpenters' Landing from the Jugner Forest (E-6) entrance and examine the ??? at (F-9) to spawn the NM Para. At low health it makes copies of itself, so kill it fast."] = "Entra en Carpenters' Landing por la entrada de Jugner Forest (E-6) y examina la ??? en (F-9) para hacer aparecer al NM Para. Con poca vida crea copias de sí mismo, así que mátalo rápido.",
    ["Enter Carpenters' Landing from the entrance in Jugner Forest (J-8); the Carpenters' Landing Survival Guide puts you right next to Anguenet."] = "Entra en Carpenters' Landing por la entrada de Jugner Forest (J-8); la Survival Guide de Carpenters' Landing te deja justo al lado de Anguenet.",
    ["Enter Castle Zvahl Baileys (S) from Castle Zvahl Keep (S)."] = "Entra en Castle Zvahl Baileys (S) desde Castle Zvahl Keep (S).",
    ["Enter Castle Zvahl Baileys (S)."] = "Entra en Castle Zvahl Baileys (S).",
    ["Enter Castle Zvahl Baileys [S] (its Survival Guide is fastest) for a cutscene."] = "Entra en Castle Zvahl Baileys [S] (su Survival Guide es lo más rápido) para una escena.",
    ["Enter Castle Zvahl Baileys [S] for a cutscene; touch its Survival Guide if you don't have it."] = "Entra en Castle Zvahl Baileys [S] para una escena; toca su Survival Guide si no la tienes.",
    ["Enter Ceizak Battlegrounds (Lower Jeuno or Adoulin waypoint, a connected zone, or its Home Point)."] = "Entra en Ceizak Battlegrounds (waypoint de Lower Jeuno o de Adoulin, una zona conectada o su Home Point).",
    ["Enter Chateau d'Oraguille for a cutscene."] = "Entra en Chateau d'Oraguille para una escena.",
    ["Enter Chateau d'Oraguille from Northern San d'Oria (I-6) (Home Point #2 is closest)."] = "Entra en Chateau d'Oraguille desde Northern San d'Oria (I-6) (el Home Point #2 es el más cercano).",
    ["Enter Dangruf Wadi from South Gustaberg at (D-9)."] = "Entra en Dangruf Wadi desde South Gustaberg en (D-9).",
    ["Enter Dynamis - Xarcabard and touch the four Twinkling Presence spots: northwest (I-9) among the demons; east (H-7) on the right cliff above the ramp; north-middle (F-7) above the Uleguerand Range exit; northwest corner of (G-10). You get the Suffering, Anguished, Rancorous and Determined psyche."] = "Entra en Dynamis - Xarcabard y toca los cuatro puntos Twinkling Presence: noroeste (I-9) entre los demonios; este (H-7) en el acantilado derecho sobre la rampa; centro-norte (F-7) sobre la salida a Uleguerand Range; esquina noroeste de (G-10). Recibes las psyches Suffering, Anguished, Rancorous y Determined.",
    ["Enter East Sarutabaruta or West Sarutabaruta through one of Windurst's gates."] = "Entra en East Sarutabaruta o West Sarutabaruta por una de las puertas de Windurst.",
    ["Enter Escha - Ru'Aun."] = "Entra en Escha - Ru'Aun.",
    ["Enter Full Moon Fountain from Toraimarai Canal Map 1 (Toraimarai Canal Home Point #1 is closest) for a cutscene that completes the mission."] = "Entra en Full Moon Fountain desde el mapa 1 de Toraimarai Canal (el Home Point #1 de Toraimarai Canal es el más cercano) para una escena que completa la misión.",
    ["Enter Giddeus from West Sarutabaruta at (F-8), then drop through the hole at (G-8) and head north to (G/H-7)."] = "Entra en Giddeus desde West Sarutabaruta en (F-8), luego déjate caer por el agujero en (G-8) y ve al norte hasta (G/H-7).",
    ["Enter Gilgamesh's room and speak with him at (K-8)."] = "Entra en la habitación de Gilgamesh y habla con él en (K-8).",
    ["Enter Gusgen Mines from Konschtat Highlands (or use the Survival Guide). Use Sneak or Silent Oil unless the monsters check as easy prey or too weak. To reach the pond at (J-7): right (east) at the first three-way intersection, left (north) at the next one, right (east) at the fork, then right (east) again."] = "Entra en Gusgen Mines desde Konschtat Highlands (o usa la Survival Guide). Usa Sneak o Silent Oil salvo que los monstruos se consideren easy prey o too weak. Para llegar al estanque de (J-7): derecha (este) en el primer cruce de tres caminos, izquierda (norte) en el siguiente, derecha (este) en la bifurcación y de nuevo derecha (este).",
    ["Enter Heavens Tower and speak with Kupipi in the Clerical Chamber to receive the Dark Key."] = "Entra en Heavens Tower y habla con Kupipi en la Clerical Chamber para recibir la Dark Key.",
    ["Enter Heavens Tower and speak with Kupipi in the Clerical Chamber to receive the Shield Offering."] = "Entra en Heavens Tower y habla con Kupipi en la Clerical Chamber para recibir la Shield Offering.",
    ["Enter Heavens Tower and speak with Kupipi through the Clerical Chamber door."] = "Entra en Heavens Tower y habla con Kupipi a través de la puerta de la Clerical Chamber.",
    ["Enter Horlais Peak and complete the required battlefield."] = "Entra en Horlais Peak y completa el campo de batalla requerido.",
    ["Enter Ifrit's Cauldron from Yhoator Jungle (I-5). Quick routes: Ifrit's Cauldron Home Point #1 then Escape and re-enter, Unity Warp (level 122) to Yhoator Jungle, the Elshimo Uplands outpost warp or the Survival Guide."] = "Entra en Ifrit's Cauldron desde Yhoator Jungle (I-5). Rutas rápidas: el Home Point #1 de Ifrit's Cauldron y luego Escape y volver a entrar, el Unity Warp (nivel 122) a Yhoator Jungle, el warp del puesto avanzado de Elshimo Uplands o la Survival Guide.",
    ["Enter Inner Horutoto Ruins through the Lily Tower in East Sarutabaruta (J-7). In the southwest room with an Ancient Magical Gizmo, go through the Cracked Wall at (G-9) to Map 2 and make your way to (G-8). The monsters there are level 90+ and can detect low HP, so use Sneak and Invisible and stay above 75% HP."] = "Entra en Inner Horutoto Ruins por la Lily Tower de East Sarutabaruta (J-7). En la sala suroeste con un Ancient Magical Gizmo, cruza la Cracked Wall de (G-9) al mapa 2 y avanza hasta (G-8). Los monstruos de allí son de nivel 90+ y pueden detectar HP bajo, así que usa Sneak e Invisible y mantente por encima del 75% de HP.",
    ["Enter Inner Horutoto Ruins through the tower at East Sarutabaruta (J-7) (the Survival Guide's tower) and get past the Three Mage Gate."] = "Entra en Inner Horutoto Ruins por la torre de East Sarutabaruta (J-7) (la torre de la Survival Guide) y cruza la Three Mage Gate.",
    ["Enter Kamihr Drifts for a cutscene. Arriving from Woh Gates, by Home Point or by waypoint all work. Bivouac #2 is closest to the next mission's spot."] = "Entra en Kamihr Drifts para una escena. Sirve llegar desde Woh Gates, por Home Point o por waypoint. El Bivouac #2 es el más cercano al punto de la misión siguiente.",
    ["Enter King Ranperre's Tomb from East Ronfaure at (H-11) and hunt Ding Bats at night for Orcish Mail Scales."] = "Entra en King Ranperre's Tomb desde East Ronfaure en (H-11) y caza Ding Bats de noche para conseguir Orcish Mail Scales.",
    ["Enter Kuftal Tunnel from Western Altepa Desert (H-4), or use the Kuftal Tunnel Survival Guide, and stay on Map 1."] = "Entra en Kuftal Tunnel desde Western Altepa Desert (H-4), o usa la Survival Guide de Kuftal Tunnel, y quédate en el mapa 1.",
    ["Enter Leafallia (Blockaded Path at (G-11) in Kamihr Drifts, or the Home Point) for a cutscene."] = "Entra en Leafallia (Blockaded Path de (G-11) en Kamihr Drifts, o el Home Point) para una escena.",
    ["Enter Leafallia through the Blockaded Path at (G-11) in Kamihr Drifts, or warp to the Leafallia Home Point."] = "Entra en Leafallia por el Blockaded Path de (G-11) en Kamihr Drifts, o teletranspórtate al Home Point de Leafallia.",
    ["Enter Lower Delkfutt's Tower in Qufim Island."] = "Entra en Lower Delkfutt's Tower en Qufim Island.",
    ["Enter Lower Delkfutt's Tower, examine the Cermet Door at (H-5), defeat Disaster Idol, and examine the Cermet Door again."] = "Entra en Lower Delkfutt's Tower, examina la Cermet Door en (H-5), derrota a Disaster Idol y examina de nuevo la Cermet Door.",
    ["Enter Mamook from (D-12) in Wajaom Woodlands and click on a nearby ???, which is right next to the Survival Guide. Using the Mamook Survival Guide puts you at the correct entrance."] = "Entra en Mamook desde (D-12) en Wajaom Woodlands y haz clic en una ??? cercana, que está justo al lado de la Survival Guide. Usar la Survival Guide de Mamook te deja en la entrada correcta.",
    ["Enter Middle Delkfutt's Tower, either climbing up from Lower Delkfutt's Tower or down from the Upper Delkfutt's Tower Home Point. Use the teleporter at (J-6) on the 7th floor; it takes you to a closed circular chamber on the 6th floor with a ???."] = "Entra en Middle Delkfutt's Tower, subiendo desde Lower Delkfutt's Tower o bajando desde el Home Point de Upper Delkfutt's Tower. Usa el teletransportador de (J-6) en el piso 7; te lleva a una cámara circular cerrada en el piso 6 con una ???.",
    ["Enter Mine Shaft #2716 for a cutscene (Snow Lily to Tarnotik, the Newton Movalpolos Home Point, or 10,000 gil to Twinkbrix)."] = "Entra en Mine Shaft #2716 para una escena (Snow Lily a Tarnotik, el Home Point de Newton Movalpolos o 10,000 gil a Twinkbrix).",
    ["Enter Monastic Cavern from the Davoi (H-11) entrance and touch the Ritual Site on the (H-9)/(H-10) border to fight an Orcish Bewitcher (BLM/DRK, about 30,000 HP, Manafont from 90% HP). You get the Orcish battle plan when it dies."] = "Entra en el Monastic Cavern por la entrada de Davoi (H-11) y toca el Ritual Site en el límite entre (H-9) y (H-10) para luchar contra un Orcish Bewitcher (BLM/DRK, unos 30,000 HP, Manafont a partir del 90% de HP). Recibes el Orcish battle plan cuando muere.",
    ["Enter Naja's office in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10) to start the quest."] = "Entra en la oficina de Naja en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Enter Neptune's Spire and examine Neptune's Spire Inn door (J-8)."] = "Entra en Neptune's Spire y examina Neptune's Spire Inn door (J-8).",
    ["Enter Neptune's Spire in Lower Jeuno and speak with Aldo (J-8) to receive the Silver Bell."] = "Entra en Neptune's Spire en Lower Jeuno y habla con Aldo (J-8) para recibir la Silver Bell.",
    ["Enter Norg and speak with Gilgamesh (L-8)."] = "Entra en Norg y habla con Gilgamesh (L-8).",
    ["Enter Norg."] = "Entra en Norg.",
    ["Enter Oaken Door (L-8) for a cutscene with Gilgamesh. If you get a cutscene with Iroha for another mission instead, enter the door again afterwards."] = "Entra por la Oaken Door (L-8) para una escena con Gilgamesh. Si en su lugar ves una escena con Iroha de otra misión, vuelve a entrar por la puerta después.",
    ["Enter Oaken Door (L-8) in Norg."] = "Entra en la Oaken Door (L-8) en Norg.",
    ["Enter Oldton Movalpolos again through the (K-6) entrance while wearing the Goblin Coif for a cutscene and the Goblin Recommendation Letter."] = "Entra de nuevo en Oldton Movalpolos por la entrada de (K-6) llevando el Goblin Coif para una escena y la Goblin Recommendation Letter.",
    ["Enter Ordelle's Caves and follow the left wall to Ruillont (G-3) by the pond."] = "Entra en Ordelle's Caves y sigue la pared izquierda hasta Ruillont (G-3), junto al estanque.",
    ["Enter Ordelle's Caves from the (F-7) entrance in La Theine Plateau; the Survival Guide and Voidwatch (San d'Oria region) warps take you right there."] = "Entra en Ordelle's Caves por la entrada de (F-7) en La Theine Plateau; los warps de la Survival Guide y de Voidwatch (región de San d'Oria) te dejan justo allí.",
    ["Enter Ordelle's Caves from the entrance in La Theine Plateau (F-7), which puts you on map 2. Taking the Survival Guide to Ordelle's Caves is the fastest route."] = "Entra en Ordelle's Caves por la entrada de La Theine Plateau (F-7), que te deja en el mapa 2. Llevar la Survival Guide a Ordelle's Caves es la ruta más rápida.",
    ["Enter Outer Horutoto Ruins from West Sarutabaruta (F-11) and kill Cardians for one or more Orbs (Swords, Cups, Batons, Coins)."] = "Entra en Outer Horutoto Ruins desde West Sarutabaruta (F-11) y mata Cardians para conseguir uno o más Orbs (Swords, Cups, Batons, Coins).",
    ["Enter Outer Horutoto Ruins through the southwestern tower (Dahlia Tower) in West Sarutabaruta (F-11); you arrive on Map 4."] = "Entra en Outer Horutoto Ruins por la torre suroeste (Dahlia Tower) de West Sarutabaruta (F-11); llegas al mapa 4.",
    ["Enter Outer Horutoto Ruins through the tower in West Sarutabaruta (F-4) (the Voidwatch warp or the Geomagnetic Fount is closest) and go through the Cracked Wall at (I-6)."] = "Entra en Outer Horutoto Ruins por la torre de West Sarutabaruta (F-4) (el warp de Voidwatch o la Geomagnetic Fount es lo más cercano) y cruza la Cracked Wall de (I-6).",
    ["Enter Outer Ra'Kaznar through the Liseran Door at (F-8) in Kamihr Drifts (or the Enigmatic Device waypoint if unlocked). To break the Amaranth Barriers, first do the quest Lerene's Lament: Lerene at (N-7) wants 2 Ancestral Cloth from the Shunned enemies at (K-7)/(K-8)."] = "Entra en Outer Ra'Kaznar por la Liseran Door de (F-8) en Kamihr Drifts (o por el waypoint del Enigmatic Device si está desbloqueado). Para romper las Amaranth Barriers, haz antes la quest Lerene's Lament: Lerene, en (N-7), quiere 2 Ancestral Cloth de los enemigos Shunned de (K-7)/(K-8).",
    ["Enter Pashhow Marshlands (S) from Grauberg (S) for a cutscene (Grauberg (S) Survival Guide, or the Atmacite Refiner's warp)."] = "Entra en Pashhow Marshlands (S) desde Grauberg (S) para una escena (Survival Guide de Grauberg (S) o el warp del Atmacite Refiner).",
    ["Enter Periqia through the Runic Seal just west of where you arrive."] = "Entra en Periqia por el Runic Seal justo al oeste de donde llegas.",
    ["Enter Port Jeuno."] = "Entra en Port Jeuno.",
    ["Enter Promyvion-Vahzl."] = "Entra en Promyvion-Vahzl.",
    ["Enter Pso'Xja from the Nue Tower at (F-7) in Beaucedine Glacier for a cutscene (the Home Point won't work for this)."] = "Entra en Pso'Xja por la Nue Tower de (F-7) en Beaucedine Glacier para una escena (el Home Point no sirve para esto).",
    ["Enter Pso'Xja through the tower at (J-8) in Beaucedine Glacier, pass through the sixteen Stone Doors, descend the elevator, and examine the Avatar Gate."] = "Entra en Pso'Xja por la torre en (J-8) de Beaucedine Glacier, atraviesa las dieciséis Stone Doors, baja en el ascensor y examina la Avatar Gate.",
    ["Enter Quicksand Caves at the Western Altepa Desert (D-12) entrance (the Quicksand Caves Proto-Waypoint puts you on the right map; don't fall). From (K-8) on Map 5, go through D to Map 6 and touch the ??? at (H-8) to fight two Spelunking Sabotenders (MNK; 1,000 Needles), two Sand Lizards and two Sand Tarantulas (WAR). They resist Sleep and Petrify; use Trusts."] = "Entra en Quicksand Caves por la entrada de Western Altepa Desert (D-12) (el Proto-Waypoint de Quicksand Caves te deja en el mapa correcto; no te caigas). Desde (K-8) en el mapa 5, cruza D al mapa 6 y toca la ??? de (H-8) para luchar contra dos Spelunking Sabotenders (MNK; 1,000 Needles), dos Sand Lizards y dos Sand Tarantulas (WAR). Resisten Sleep y Petrify; usa Trusts.",
    ["Enter Quicksand Caves from Western Altepa Desert at (G-5)."] = "Entra en Quicksand Caves desde Western Altepa Desert en (G-5).",
    ["Enter Rala Waterways for a cutscene. The Western Adoulin (F-5) entrance, near the Adoulin Waterfront waypoint, is closest."] = "Entra en Rala Waterways para una escena. La entrada de Western Adoulin (F-5), cerca del waypoint de Adoulin Waterfront, es la más cercana.",
    ["Enter Rala Waterways from Eastern Adoulin (F-7) (waypoint #4 or Home Point #1). You arrive at (K-5), close to two of the three points."] = "Entra en Rala Waterways desde Eastern Adoulin (F-7) (waypoint #4 o Home Point #1). Llegas a (K-5), cerca de dos de los tres puntos.",
    ["Enter Rala Waterways from Eastern Adoulin (F-7) for a cutscene with Arciela."] = "Entra en Rala Waterways desde Eastern Adoulin (F-7) para una escena con Arciela.",
    ["Enter Rala Waterways from Eastern Adoulin (F-7), by waypoints #1 and #4."] = "Entra en Rala Waterways desde Eastern Adoulin (F-7), junto a los waypoints #1 y #4.",
    ["Enter Rala Waterways from Western Adoulin (I-12) near the Residential Area (waypoint #6 Rent-a-Room or Home Point #2 are closest)."] = "Entra en Rala Waterways desde Western Adoulin (I-12), cerca de la zona residencial (el waypoint #6 Rent-a-Room o el Home Point #2 son los más cercanos).",
    ["Enter Rala Waterways from Western Adoulin (I-12), near the Rent-a-Room waypoint and Home Point #2."] = "Entra en Rala Waterways desde Western Adoulin (I-12), cerca del waypoint de Rent-a-Room y el Home Point #2.",
    ["Enter Rala Waterways from Western Adoulin at (F-5)."] = "Entra en Rala Waterways desde Western Adoulin en (F-5).",
    ["Enter Riverne - Site #B01 and head to the island at (J-6). As you leave the spatial distortion onto the island, three goblin NMs spawn: Book Browser Bokabraq (BLM), Chemical Cook Chemachiq (WHM) and Spell Spitter Spilospok (WAR). Defeat them."] = "Entra en Riverne - Site #B01 y ve a la isla de (J-6). Al salir de la distorsión espacial a la isla aparecen tres NMs goblin: Book Browser Bokabraq (BLM), Chemical Cook Chemachiq (WHM) y Spell Spitter Spilospok (WAR). Derrótalos.",
    ["Enter Sealion's Den."] = "Entra en Sealion's Den.",
    ["Enter Selbina or Mhaura."] = "Entra en Selbina o Mhaura.",
    ["Enter Shrine of Ru'Avitau from Ru'Aun Gardens at (I-6)."] = "Entra en el Shrine of Ru'Avitau desde Ru'Aun Gardens en (I-6).",
    ["Enter Southern San d'Oria (S) from East Ronfaure (S) on foot (not mounted) to meet Pattna-Ottna. If you get a message about Rhapsodies of Vana'diel being blocked, exit and re-enter on foot."] = "Entra a pie (sin montura) en Southern San d'Oria (S) desde East Ronfaure (S) para conocer a Pattna-Ottna. Si recibes un mensaje de que Rhapsodies of Vana'diel está bloqueado, sal y vuelve a entrar a pie.",
    ["Enter Southern San d'Oria (S) from East Ronfaure (S)."] = "Entra en Southern San d'Oria (S) desde East Ronfaure (S).",
    ["Enter Southern San d'Oria [S] by walking from East Ronfaure [S]."] = "Entra en Southern San d'Oria [S] caminando desde East Ronfaure [S].",
    ["Enter Southern San d'Oria from East Ronfaure."] = "Entra en Southern San d'Oria desde East Ronfaure.",
    ["Enter Talacca Cove from Caedarva Mire map 1 (E-9), outside Nashmau's west exit (Caedarva Mire Home Point #1 is right at the zone line)."] = "Entra en Talacca Cove desde el mapa 1 de Caedarva Mire (E-9), fuera de la salida oeste de Nashmau (el Home Point #1 de Caedarva Mire está justo en el límite de zona).",
    ["Enter Tavnazian Safehold."] = "Entra en Tavnazian Safehold.",
    ["Enter Tenshodo Headquarters and speak with Aldo (J-8)."] = "Entra en el cuartel del Tenshodo y habla con Aldo (J-8).",
    ["Enter The Boyahda Tree from The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah (K-12) or (J-12). On map 1, go to (A-7) to climb to map 2, and go behind the waterfall at (I-11) to the hidden entrance to the Cloister of Storms. The Boyahda Tree Home Point #1 is best; the Unity Warp puts you on map 2 a short run from it (monsters aggro even at 99)."] = "Entra en The Boyahda Tree desde The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah (K-12) o (J-12). En el mapa 1, ve a (A-7) para subir al mapa 2, y ve detrás de la cascada de (I-11) hasta la entrada oculta del Cloister of Storms. Lo mejor es el Home Point #1 de The Boyahda Tree; el Unity Warp te deja en el mapa 2 a poca distancia corriendo (los monstruos atacan incluso a nivel 99).",
    ["Enter The Eldieme Necropolis (S) through the Crypt Door beside Thorben (J-10)."] = "Entra en The Eldieme Necropolis (S) por la Crypt Door junto a Thorben (J-10).",
    ["Enter The Eldieme Necropolis from Batallia Downs (I-10) for a cutscene with the Mithran Tracker (any job). The Survival Guide lands at this entrance but doesn't trigger it: zone out and back in."] = "Entra en The Eldieme Necropolis desde Batallia Downs (I-10) para una escena con el Mithran Tracker (cualquier job). La Survival Guide te deja en esta entrada pero no la activa: sal y vuelve a entrar.",
    ["Enter The Eldieme Necropolis from the (F-5) entrance in Batallia Downs, reached by zoning in from Beaucedine Glacier (the Voidwatch or Unity Warp to Beaucedine Glacier, or the Lycopodium teleport in Batallia Downs, are quick)."] = "Entra en The Eldieme Necropolis por la entrada de (F-5) en Batallia Downs, a la que se llega entrando desde Beaucedine Glacier (el Voidwatch o el Unity Warp a Beaucedine Glacier, o el teletransporte del Lycopodium de Batallia Downs, son rápidos).",
    ["Enter The Eldieme Necropolis from the (F-5) entrance in Batallia Downs, reached through Beaucedine Glacier (quickest: the Voidwatch or Unity Warp to Beaucedine Glacier, or the Lycopodium teleport in Batallia Downs if you have it). Go to the room with five unbroken sarcophagi at (D-4)."] = "Entra en The Eldieme Necropolis por la entrada de (F-5) en Batallia Downs, a la que se llega por Beaucedine Glacier (lo más rápido: el Voidwatch o el Unity Warp a Beaucedine Glacier, o el teletransporte del Lycopodium de Batallia Downs si lo tienes). Ve a la sala con cinco sarcófagos intactos en (D-4).",
    ["Enter The Heir to the Light battlefield. The first battle consists of Death Clan Destroyer, Yukvok of Clan Death, three Worgbut of Clan Death, three Rallbrog of Clan Death, and three Vangknok of Clan Death."] = "Entra en el campo de batalla The Heir to the Light. La primera batalla consta de Death Clan Destroyer, Yukvok of Clan Death, tres Worgbut of Clan Death, tres Rallbrog of Clan Death y tres Vangknok of Clan Death.",
    ["Enter The Shrine of Ru'Avitau from the (H-9) entrance in Ru'Aun Gardens (the Survival Guide puts you on the way; Home Point #5 is also close). You need to have completed Zilart Mission 13. Completing this quest also counts as completing Zilart Mission 14."] = "Entra en The Shrine of Ru'Avitau por la entrada de (H-9) en Ru'Aun Gardens (la Survival Guide te deja de camino; el Home Point #5 también está cerca). Debes haber completado la Zilart Mission 13. Completar esta quest también cuenta como completar la Zilart Mission 14.",
    ["Enter Throne Room (S) and examine the Throne Room door."] = "Entra en el Throne Room (S) y examina la Throne Room door.",
    ["Enter Walahra Temple and talk to Nadeey for a cutscene."] = "Entra en el Walahra Temple y habla con Nadeey para una escena.",
    ["Enter Waughroon Shrine and complete the Rank 2 Final Mission against Seeker and Dark Dragon."] = "Entra en Waughroon Shrine y completa la Rank 2 Final Mission contra Seeker y Dark Dragon.",
    ["Enter Waughroon Shrine and complete the required battlefield."] = "Entra en Waughroon Shrine y completa el campo de batalla requerido.",
    ["Enter Waughroon Shrine through the top floor of Palborough Mines for a cutscene (Domenic's teleport also works; Home Point warp is fastest)."] = "Entra en Waughroon Shrine por el último piso de Palborough Mines para una escena (el teletransporte de Domenic también sirve; el warp de Home Point es lo más rápido).",
    ["Enter Western Adoulin from Ceizak Battlegrounds."] = "Entra en Western Adoulin desde Ceizak Battlegrounds.",
    ["Enter Windurst Waters (S) and obtain the Inky Black Yagudo Feather."] = "Entra en Windurst Waters (S) y obtén la Inky Black Yagudo Feather.",
    ["Enter Woh Gates from any entrance for a cutscene. From Kamihr Drifts, the entrance at (K-11) by the Frontier Station is closest; from town, use Marjami Ravine waypoint #4 and walk northwest."] = "Entra en Woh Gates por cualquier entrada para una escena. Desde Kamihr Drifts, la entrada de (K-11) junto a la Frontier Station es la más cercana; desde la ciudad, usa el waypoint #4 de Marjami Ravine y camina al noroeste.",
    ["Enter Xarcabard (S) from Beaucedine Glacier (S)."] = "Entra en Xarcabard (S) desde Beaucedine Glacier (S).",
    ["Enter Yorcia Weald for a cutscene. Arriving by waypoint or Home Point also works."] = "Entra en Yorcia Weald para una escena. Llegar por waypoint o Home Point también sirve.",
    ["Enter Zeruhn Mines from Bastok Mines at (D-7)."] = "Entra en Zeruhn Mines desde Bastok Mines en (D-7).",
    ["Enter Zeruhn Mines from Bastok Mines."] = "Entra en Zeruhn Mines desde Bastok Mines.",
    ["Enter an area adjoining a Mog House in San d'Oria, Bastok, or Windurst."] = "Entra en una zona contigua a un Mog House en San d'Oria, Bastok o Windurst.",
    ["Enter from Western Adoulin (K-8) under the Big Bridge."] = "Entra desde Western Adoulin (K-8), bajo el Big Bridge.",
    ["Enter the Altar Room in Castle Oztroja for a cutscene with Hooknox that starts the quest (go past the left/right switch gate with the trap door, to (G-7) onto another map, turn right and go straight back into the castle, then to (G-10)). You need to be level 60 or higher. If you turn it down, you can't start it again until the next Conquest Tally."] = "Entra en la Altar Room de Castle Oztroja para una escena con Hooknox que empieza la quest (pasa la puerta de palancas izquierda/derecha con la trampilla, ve a (G-7) hacia otro mapa, gira a la derecha y vuelve recto al castillo, luego a (G-10)). Necesitas ser de nivel 60 o superior. Si la rechazas, no podrás volver a empezarla hasta el siguiente Conquest Tally.",
    ["Enter the Ancient Vows battlefield."] = "Entra en el campo de batalla Ancient Vows.",
    ["Enter the Celennia Memorial Library and speak with Andreine for a cutscene and the key item Suffering Sacchariferous."] = "Entra en la Celennia Memorial Library y habla con Andreine para una escena y el key item Suffering Sacchariferous.",
    ["Enter the Celennia Memorial Library for a cutscene."] = "Entra en la Celennia Memorial Library para una escena.",
    ["Enter the Celennia Memorial Library."] = "Entra en la Celennia Memorial Library.",
    ["Enter the Chamber of Passage in Whitegate (K-8) and take the Runic Portal to the Nyzul Isle Staging Point. If you haven't unlocked it, trade an Imperial Silver Piece to Kamih Mapokhalam in Bhaflau Thickets (F-6) and walk in through the Alzadaal Undersea Ruins."] = "Entra en la Chamber of Passage de Whitegate (K-8) y toma el Runic Portal al Nyzul Isle Staging Point. Si no lo has desbloqueado, entrega una Imperial Silver Piece a Kamih Mapokhalam en Bhaflau Thickets (F-6) y entra caminando por Alzadaal Undersea Ruins.",
    ["Enter the Garden of Ru'Hmet."] = "Entra en el Garden of Ru'Hmet.",
    ["Enter the Grand Palace of Hu'Xzoi."] = "Entra en el Grand Palace of Hu'Xzoi.",
    ["Enter the Great Hall and receive the King's request for a Dreamrose."] = "Entra en el Great Hall y recibe la petición del King de una Dreamrose.",
    ["Enter the Hall of Transference through the Shattered Telepoint at any Crag for a cutscene."] = "Entra en el Hall of Transference por el Shattered Telepoint de cualquier Crag para una escena.",
    ["Enter the Hall of Transference through the Shattered Telepoint."] = "Entra en el Hall of Transference por el Shattered Telepoint.",
    ["Enter the Hall of the Gods from Ro'Maeve through the Hall of the Gods entrance for a cutscene. The Ro'Maeve Survival Guide puts you right outside at (H-6)."] = "Entra en Hall of the Gods desde Ro'Maeve por la entrada de Hall of the Gods para una escena. La Survival Guide de Ro'Maeve te deja justo fuera, en (H-6).",
    ["Enter the Maze of Shakhrami from Tahrongi Canyon (K-5); the Survival Guide puts you at its entrance. Many monsters detect sound and the Goblins detect sight, so keep Sneak and Invisible up at low level."] = "Entra en Maze of Shakhrami desde Tahrongi Canyon (K-5); la Survival Guide te deja en su entrada. Muchos monstruos detectan por sonido y los Goblins por vista, así que mantén Sneak e Invisible si eres de nivel bajo.",
    ["Enter the Metalworks and speak with Cid (H-8) on the second floor."] = "Entra en el Metalworks y habla con Cid (H-8) en el segundo piso.",
    ["Enter the Monastic Cavern again while wearing the Orc Helm for a cutscene and the key item Communication from Tzee Xicu."] = "Entra de nuevo en el Monastic Cavern llevando el Orc Helm para una escena y el key item Communication from Tzee Xicu.",
    ["Enter the Papal Chambers on the top floor of the Cathedral in Northern San d'Oria."] = "Entra en las Papal Chambers del último piso de la Cathedral en Northern San d'Oria.",
    ["Enter the Phomiuna Aqueducts through Sewer Entrance (I-7) in Tavnazian Safehold."] = "Entra en Phomiuna Aqueducts por la Sewer Entrance (I-7) en Tavnazian Safehold.",
    ["Enter the Qulun Dome at (H-7) again while wearing the Quadav Barbut for a cutscene and the key item Orcish Seeker Bats."] = "Entra de nuevo en Qulun Dome por (H-7) llevando el Quadav Barbut para una escena y el key item Orcish Seeker Bats.",
    ["Enter the Salaheem's Sentinels office in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10) and trade Abquhbah 5 Imperial Gold Pieces. Wait for the game day to change, zone, and talk to Abquhbah to start the first trial. Between trials you again wait for the next game day and zone; if you fail one, you can retry the next Earth minute at no extra cost."] = "Entra en la oficina de Salaheem's Sentinels en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10) y entrega a Abquhbah 5 Imperial Gold Pieces. Espera a que cambie el día de juego, cambia de zona y habla con Abquhbah para empezar la primera prueba. Entre pruebas vuelves a esperar al siguiente día de juego y a cambiar de zona; si fallas una, puedes reintentarla al minuto real siguiente sin coste extra.",
    ["Enter the Shararat Teahouse in Aht Urhgan Whitegate for a cutscene."] = "Entra en la Shararat Teahouse de Aht Urhgan Whitegate para una escena.",
    ["Enter the Shrine of Ru'Avitau."] = "Entra en el Shrine of Ru'Avitau.",
    ["Enter the Temple of Uggalepih from Yhoator Jungle (J-11) for a cutscene. Unity Warp (level 122) to Yhoator Jungle lands at Bloodlet Spring; head south to (J-11)."] = "Entra en el Temple of Uggalepih desde Yhoator Jungle (J-11) para una escena. El Unity Warp (nivel 122) a Yhoator Jungle te deja en Bloodlet Spring; ve al sur hasta (J-11).",
    ["Enter the Temple of Uggalepih from Yhoator Jungle (J-12), getting a Paintbrush of souls if you don't have one. Leave by the (F-5) exit of the first map (the Survival Guide is there), follow the left wall in Yhoator Jungle back into the Temple, and continue to (I-7)."] = "Entra en el Temple of Uggalepih desde Yhoator Jungle (J-12), consiguiendo un Paintbrush of souls si no tienes uno. Sal por la salida (F-5) del primer mapa (allí está la Survival Guide), sigue la pared izquierda en Yhoator Jungle de vuelta al Temple y continúa hasta (I-7).",
    ["Enter the Vestal Chamber at the top of Heavens Tower."] = "Entra en la Vestal Chamber en lo alto de Heavens Tower.",
    ["Enter the Walahra Temple in Aht Urhgan Whitegate for a cutscene."] = "Entra en el Walahra Temple de Aht Urhgan Whitegate para una escena.",
    ["Enter the Walahra Temple in Whitegate (K-8) for a cutscene."] = "Entra en el Walahra Temple de Whitegate (K-8) para una escena.",
    ["Enter the Walk of Echoes for a cutscene. Easiest: use your Lightsworm on the glowing blue ??? next to the Cavernous Maw in Batallia Downs, Rolanberry Fields or Sauromugue Champaign (present or past). Also: the Veridical Conflux in Grauberg [S] (F-5) after WotG Mission 46, or in Pashhow Marshlands [S] (J-9) after the Voidwatch quest Glimmer of Hope."] = "Entra en el Walk of Echoes para una escena. Lo más fácil: usa tu Lightsworm en la ??? azul brillante junto al Cavernous Maw de Batallia Downs, Rolanberry Fields o Sauromugue Champaign (presente o pasado). También: la Veridical Conflux de Grauberg [S] (F-5) tras la misión 46 de WotG, o la de Pashhow Marshlands [S] (J-9) tras la quest de Voidwatch Glimmer of Hope.",
    ["Enter the Walk of Echoes. After Wings of the Goddess Mission 45 (Time Slips Away) use the Veridical Conflux in Pashhow Marshlands [S] (J-9) or Grauberg [S] (F-5). Otherwise use your Lightsworm on the glowing ??? next to the Cavernous Maw in Batallia Downs (H-5), Rolanberry Fields (H-6) or Sauromugue Champaign (K-9)."] = "Entra en el Walk of Echoes. Tras la Wings of the Goddess Mission 45 (Time Slips Away), usa la Veridical Conflux de Pashhow Marshlands [S] (J-9) o de Grauberg [S] (F-5). Si no, usa tu Lightsworm en la ??? brillante junto al Cavernous Maw de Batallia Downs (H-5), Rolanberry Fields (H-6) o Sauromugue Champaign (K-9).",
    ["Enter the assault area. A timer starts and the party is told the time limit, which is 15 minutes."] = "Entra en la zona del assault. Se activa un temporizador y se informa al grupo del límite de tiempo, que es de 15 minutos.",
    ["Enter the assault area. A timer starts and the party is told the time limit, which is 30 minutes."] = "Entra en la zona del assault. Se activa un temporizador y se informa al grupo del límite de tiempo, que es de 30 minutos.",
    ["Enter the battle and defeat the Disjoined One within 15 minutes. It is easy with five Trusts; Iroha reraises herself 15 seconds after falling, as often as needed."] = "Entra en la batalla y derrota al Disjoined One en 15 minutos. Es fácil con cinco Trusts; Iroha se resucita 15 segundos después de caer, tantas veces como haga falta.",
    ["Enter the battlefield \"Where Two Paths Converge\" against Zeid. Phase 1 is a straight fight; his AoE weapon skill can put you to sleep, so Poison Potions help. At about 65% HP a cutscene brings in Volker."] = "Entra en el campo de batalla \"Where Two Paths Converge\" contra Zeid. La fase 1 es una pelea directa; su weapon skill de área puede dormirte, así que las Poison Potions ayudan. Hacia el 65% de HP una escena trae a Volker.",
    ["Enter the battlefield against three Antica NMs: Centurio V-III (PLD, Invincible), Triarius V-VIII (BLM, Manafont) and Princeps V-XI (RNG, Eagle Eye Shot). Open with Sleepga, keep the Paladin and Black Mage silenced, kill the Paladin first (he rebuffs and wakes the others), then the Black Mage, then the Ranger. Winning moves you into another part of the Chamber of Oracles, starting the next mission."] = "Entra en el campo de batalla contra tres NMs Antica: Centurio V-III (PLD, Invincible), Triarius V-VIII (BLM, Manafont) y Princeps V-XI (RNG, Eagle Eye Shot). Empieza con Sleepga, mantén silenciados al Paladin y al Black Mage, mata primero al Paladin (vuelve a potenciarse y despierta a los demás), luego al Black Mage y después al Ranger. Ganar te lleva a otra parte de la Chamber of Oracles y empieza la misión siguiente.",
    ["Enter the battlefield against three level 68 Orcs and two Warmachines: Darokbok of Clan Reaper (PLD), Derakbak of Clan Wolf (DRG), Jagidbod of Clan Reaper (RNG), Wolf Clan Warmachine and Reaper Clan Warmachine. Open with Sleepga II (Elemental Seal helps), kill the Warmachines first, then the Paladin, the Dragoon and its wyvern, and the Ranger last."] = "Entra en el campo de batalla contra tres Orcs de nivel 68 y dos Warmachines: Darokbok of Clan Reaper (PLD), Derakbak of Clan Wolf (DRG), Jagidbod of Clan Reaper (RNG), Wolf Clan Warmachine y Reaper Clan Warmachine. Empieza con Sleepga II (Elemental Seal ayuda), mata primero a las Warmachines, luego al Paladin, al Dragoon y su wyvern, y al Ranger el último.",
    ["Enter the battlefield and defeat the five Mammet-22 Zeta."] = "Entra en el campo de batalla y derrota a los cinco Mammet-22 Zeta.",
    ["Enter the caves at (F-8) or (I-8), behind where you left the offering in Windurst Mission 1-3, go down to the lower level and the storage room at (G-6), and examine the altar for the key item Off Offering."] = "Entra en las cuevas de (F-8) o (I-8), detrás de donde dejaste la ofrenda en la Windurst Mission 1-3, baja al nivel inferior y al almacén de (G-6), y examina el altar para obtener el key item Off Offering.",
    ["Enter the hallway in the southern part of (G-7)/(H-7) that contains the Toad's Footprints and click one for another cutscene. Check them a second time for a fight."] = "Entra en el pasillo de la parte sur de (G-7)/(H-7) que contiene las Toad's Footprints y haz clic en una para otra escena. Revísalas una segunda vez para un combate.",
    ["Enter the opened passage and examine Wooden Gate (G-8) again."] = "Entra en el pasaje abierto y examina de nuevo la Wooden Gate (G-8).",
    ["Enter the palace in Ru'Lude Gardens for a cutscene."] = "Entra en el palacio de Ru'Lude Gardens para una escena.",
    ["Enter the room and speak with Despachiaire (K-10)."] = "Entra en la sala y habla con Despachiaire (K-10).",
    ["Enter the tower (Outer Horutoto Ruins) and examine the pedestals to place the Mana Orbs. The Cracked Walls along the north and south sides hide rooms with two more pedestals."] = "Entra en la torre (Outer Horutoto Ruins) y examina los pedestales para colocar los Mana Orbs. Las Cracked Walls de los lados norte y sur esconden salas con dos pedestales más.",
    ["Enter through the Chamber of Passage and reach the Nyzul Isle Staging Point."] = "Entra por la Chamber of Passage y llega al Nyzul Isle Staging Point.",
    ["Enter your home nation Mog House and speak with Moogle."] = "Entra en el Mog House de tu nación de origen y habla con el Moogle.",
    ["Enter your home nation after reaching level 3."] = "Entra en tu nación de origen tras alcanzar el nivel 3.",
    ["Entering Lower Jeuno specifically gives you a cutscene starting the A Crystalline Prophecy missions. You may elect to opt out of this Mission line and resume it at a later time. It, along with A Shantotto Ascension and A Moogle Kupo d'Etat are side-stories which are not canon to the other Mission lines. The rewards for these Missions provide some very niche augmented gear which isn't really a priority at this time."] = "Entrar en Lower Jeuno en concreto te da una escena que empieza las misiones de A Crystalline Prophecy. Puedes optar por no hacer esta serie y retomarla más adelante. Esta, junto con A Shantotto Ascension y A Moogle Kupo d'Etat, son historias secundarias que no forman parte del canon de las demás series de Missions. Sus recompensas son equipo aumentado muy de nicho que ahora no es prioritario.",
    ["Entering is enough; you don't need visitant status. Leave right away without spending the stone: you then only wait one hour to enter again. If you spend the stone, you must wait about 20 hours for a new one before you can continue the story."] = "Basta con entrar; no necesitas el estado de visitante. Sal enseguida sin gastar la piedra: así solo esperas una hora para volver a entrar. Si gastas la piedra, debes esperar unas 20 horas a una nueva antes de poder seguir con la historia.",
    ["Entering the garden each day adds 1 star to your GPS crystal. Try to save up 15 stars to buy the Shimmering invitation, which adds an Ephemeral Moogle (the guy that lets you store crystals) to the garden."] = "Entrar en el jardín cada día añade 1 estrella a tu GPS crystal. Intenta ahorrar 15 estrellas para comprar la Shimmering invitation, que añade al jardín un Ephemeral Moogle (el que te guarda los cristales).",
    ["Entry requires Rhapsodies of Vana'diel Mission 1-1 or later."] = "La entrada requiere la Rhapsodies of Vana'diel Mission 1-1 o posterior.",
    ["Equip either a Maul or a Replica Maul. A Maul can be bought at the Auction House, dropped by Garnet Quadav enemies in Rolanberry Fields and Beadeaux, or bought for 228 Sparks of Eminence from A.M.A.N representatives."] = "Equipa un Maul o un Replica Maul. Un Maul se puede comprar en la Auction House, lo sueltan enemigos Garnet Quadav en Rolanberry Fields y Beadeaux, o se compra por 228 Sparks of Eminence a los representantes de A.M.A.N.",
    ["Equip it and examine Heroes' Gambit (J-9) at (J-9) in Xarcabard (Unity Warp level 125 is close) for a cutscene."] = "Equípala y examina el Heroes' Gambit (J-9) en (J-9) de Xarcabard (el Unity Warp de nivel 125 está cerca) para una escena.",
    ["Equip the Shell Shield."] = "Equipa el Shell Shield.",
    ["Equip the Soultrapper (ranged) and Blank Soul Plates (ammo), then use it on each target from your inventory or with /item \"Soultrapper\" <t>. It can't be used under Sneak or Invisible, and sometimes fails; just retry."] = "Equipa el Soultrapper (a distancia) y las Blank Soul Plates (munición) y úsalo con cada objetivo desde el inventario o con /item \"Soultrapper\" <t>. No se puede usar con Sneak o Invisible, y a veces falla; vuelve a intentarlo.",
    ["Equip the Thunder Hammer as your main weapon and walk up to the untargetable Marolith at (G-9) for a cutscene and the Aeropearl."] = "Equipa el Thunder Hammer como arma principal y acércate al Marolith que no se puede seleccionar en (G-9) para una escena y la Aeropearl.",
    ["Escha - Zi'Tah - levels 45-50 - see the above note! You will lock yourself out of this mission if you begin RoV 1-7."] = "Escha - Zi'Tah - niveles 45-50 - ¡ver la nota de arriba! Te bloquearás esta zona si empiezas la RoV 1-7.",
    ["Escha - Zi'Tah - levels 50-55 - Worms, Obdellas, and Crawlers near the entrance. Again."] = "Escha - Zi'Tah - niveles 50-55 - Worms, Obdellas y Crawlers cerca de la entrada. Otra vez.",
    ["Escha - Zi'Tah - levels 55-60 - Worms and Crawlers right next to the entrance first, then Dhalmels, Coeurls, and Weapons by portal #2 to the north."] = "Escha - Zi'Tah - niveles 55-60 - Primero Worms y Crawlers justo al lado de la entrada, y luego Dhalmels, Coeurls y Weapons junto al portal #2, al norte.",
    ["Eschan Dhalmel/Eschan Coeurl/Eschan Weapon"] = "Eschan Dhalmel/Eschan Coeurl/Eschan Weapon",
    ["Eschan Snapweed/Eschan Wasp/Eschan Goobbue"] = "Eschan Snapweed/Eschan Wasp/Eschan Goobbue",
    ["Eschan Sorceror/Eschan Corse/Eschan Vulture"] = "Eschan Sorceror/Eschan Corse/Eschan Vulture",
    ["Eschan Worm/Eschan Crawler"] = "Eschan Worm/Eschan Crawler",
    ["Eschan Zdei"] = "Eschan Zdei",
    ["Escort Olavia to the end point, and she presents you with a Completion certificate. Every member of the party or alliance must speak to her when she stops, or they will not get a completion."] = "Escolta a Olavia hasta el punto final, y te entrega un Completion certificate. Todos los miembros del grupo o alianza deben hablar con ella cuando se detenga, o no obtendrán la finalización.",
    ["Escort Travonce. On the bridge he fishes up at least one Notorious Monster; defeat it. He then heads to the sea (defeat any Orcs on the way), where he fishes up more NMs, and finally to a lake to the north, where he fishes up three more. Defeat them all. Possible NMs: Asrai, Abhac, Vu-Murt, Petrocrab, Cetic Parasite, Ferrocrab and Nakki."] = "Escolta a Travonce. En el puente pesca al menos un Notorious Monster; derrótalo. Luego va hacia el mar (derrota a los Orcs que haya por el camino), donde pesca más NMs, y por último a un lago al norte, donde pesca tres más. Derrótalos a todos. NMs posibles: Asrai, Abhac, Vu-Murt, Petrocrab, Cetic Parasite, Ferrocrab y Nakki.",
    ["Escort the Quasilumin from (J-8) to the transporter at (L-7)."] = "Escolta al Quasilumin desde (J-8) hasta el transportador en (L-7).",
    ["Even past Passing Glory, in some Aht Urhgan missions Aphmau is away (for example Sweets for the Soul and Puppet in Peril). Progress to one where she is in town."] = "Incluso pasada Passing Glory, en algunas misiones de Aht Urhgan Aphmau no está (por ejemplo Sweets for the Soul y Puppet in Peril). Avanza hasta una en la que esté en la ciudad.",
    ["Eventually just go after Cockatrice full time."] = "Con el tiempo, ve solo a por las Cockatrice.",
    ["Every party member needs an Ephramadian gold coin (from Jazaraat's Headstone, Caedarva Mire E-10) to enter."] = "Cada miembro del grupo necesita una Ephramadian gold coin (de la Jazaraat's Headstone, Caedarva Mire E-10) para entrar.",
    ["Every player who participates in the final fight receives a Carbuncle's Pole. All other quest rewards are dropped at random at the end of the Carbuncle Prime battle."] = "Todo jugador que participe en el combate final recibe una Carbuncle's Pole. Las demás recompensas de la quest caen al azar al final de la batalla contra Carbuncle Prime.",
    ["Everyone gets two Ratstail Explosives (carry up to 3) to blow open dead-end walls at their ???, and jars of Firesand for the colored detonators. Defeated Goblin Reavers leave a ??? with more explosives."] = "Todos reciben dos Ratstail Explosives (se pueden llevar hasta 3) para volar las paredes sin salida en su ???, y tarros de Firesand para los detonadores de colores. Los Goblin Reavers derrotados dejan una ??? con más explosivos.",
    ["Everyone in the party needs a Pso'Xja pass: trade Ghebi Damomohe any colored chip and she gives the pass and 500 gil. Get chips from the monsters in Pso'Xja via Beaucedine Glacier: the Diremites in the first room from the (H-8) entrance drop Gray Chips (the Beaucedine Survival Guide is closest), the Nue entrance (F-7) is the best farm, and the Mimics past the (G-9) entrance often drop Cyan Chips."] = "Todos los del grupo necesitan un Pso'Xja pass: entrega a Ghebi Damomohe cualquier chip de color y te da el pase y 500 gil. Consigue chips de los monstruos de Pso'Xja por Beaucedine Glacier: los Diremites de la primera sala desde la entrada de (H-8) sueltan Gray Chips (la Survival Guide de Beaucedine es la más cercana), la entrada del Nue (F-7) es el mejor sitio para farmear, y los Mimics pasada la entrada de (G-9) sueltan a menudo Cyan Chips.",
    ["Everyone on the mission examines the ??? again for the key item Reliquiarium key."] = "Todos los que estén en la misión examinan de nuevo la ??? para obtener el key item Reliquiarium key.",
    ["Everything in the caves detects sound, so use Sneak. Go to Western Altepa Desert (Unity Warp level 125 puts you at I-7), take the tunnel at (C/D-11) on the south side, and go down the ramp to enter Quicksand Caves at (D-12)."] = "Todo en las cuevas detecta por sonido, así que usa Sneak. Ve a Western Altepa Desert (el Unity Warp de nivel 125 te deja en I-7), toma el túnel de (C/D-11) en el lado sur y baja la rampa para entrar en Quicksand Caves por (D-12).",
    ["Everything takes extra damage but has very high HP. Win for the Angel skin key and Oxblood key. If you lose, restart A Challenge! from the Lonely Evergreen in Beaucedine Glacier."] = "Todo recibe daño extra pero tiene muchísimo HP. Gana para obtener la Angel skin key y la Oxblood key. Si pierdes, reinicia A Challenge! desde el Lonely Evergreen de Beaucedine Glacier.",
    ["Examine ??? (E-8) to face Marauder Dvogzog."] = "Examina la ??? (E-8) para enfrentarte a Marauder Dvogzog.",
    ["Examine ??? (F-9) in Vunkerl Inlet (S) to obtain the Piece of Kionite."] = "Examina la ??? (F-9) en Vunkerl Inlet (S) para obtener el Piece of Kionite.",
    ["Examine ??? (G-11) to face Triarius IV-XIV, Princeps IV-XLV, and Centurio IV-VII."] = "Examina la ??? (G-11) para enfrentarte a Triarius IV-XIV, Princeps IV-XLV y Centurio IV-VII.",
    ["Examine ??? (G-6) again to obtain Miraclesalt."] = "Examina de nuevo la ??? (G-6) para obtener Miraclesalt.",
    ["Examine ??? (G-6) to face Gigaplasm."] = "Examina la ??? (G-6) para enfrentarte a Gigaplasm.",
    ["Examine ??? (G-8) again to receive the Altepa moonpebble. Do not zone first, or you will have to fight both Sphinxes again."] = "Examina de nuevo la ??? (G-8) para recibir la Altepa moonpebble. No cambies de zona antes, o tendrás que volver a luchar contra ambas Sphinx.",
    ["Examine ??? (H-10) again to battle Cobraclaw Buchzvotch and defeat him."] = "Examina de nuevo la ??? (H-10) para luchar contra Cobraclaw Buchzvotch y derrótalo.",
    ["Examine ??? (H-10) once more after the battle."] = "Examina la ??? (H-10) una vez más tras la batalla.",
    ["Examine ??? (I-9) again after the battle."] = "Examina de nuevo la ??? (I-9) tras la batalla.",
    ["Examine ??? at Portal #15 (H-12) again to fight Balamor. He spams Last Laugh, a cone Drain, so mages should stand far back."] = "Examina de nuevo la ??? del Portal #15 (H-12) para luchar contra Balamor. Usa sin parar Last Laugh, un Drain en cono, así que los magos deben quedarse bien atrás.",
    ["Examine ??? at Portal #15 (H-12) again."] = "Examina de nuevo la ??? en el Portal #15 (H-12).",
    ["Examine ??? in the southwest room (G-9) again to face Gargouille Warden (resists magic, stuns with its melee); defeat it and examine the ??? again to obtain the Zvahl Passkey."] = "Examina de nuevo la ??? de la sala suroeste (G-9) para enfrentarte al Gargouille Warden (resiste la magia, aturde con sus golpes); derrótalo y examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener la Zvahl Passkey.",
    ["Examine ??? in the southwest room (G-9) on Map 3."] = "Examina la ??? de la sala suroeste (G-9) del mapa 3.",
    ["Examine ??? near Witchfire Glen (F-5/H-6 area) in the Grauberg (S) cave (entrance at the south-east corner of (H-5); the Survival Guide is fastest) to complete the quest."] = "Examina la ??? cerca de Witchfire Glen (zona de F-5/H-6) en la cueva de Grauberg (S) (entrada en la esquina sureste de (H-5); la Survival Guide es lo más rápido) para completar la quest.",
    ["Examine ??? near Witchfire Glen (F-5/H-6 area), the blue glowing ??? northeast of the Veridical Conflux (not the one right beside it), to spawn Cetus. It gains Dread Spikes after Aetheric Pull."] = "Examina la ??? cerca de Witchfire Glen (zona de F-5/H-6), la ??? azul brillante al noreste de la Veridical Conflux (no la que está justo al lado), para hacer aparecer a Cetus. Gana Dread Spikes tras Aetheric Pull.",
    ["Examine ??? near the landing area again to obtain the Scrap of Papyrus."] = "Examina de nuevo la ??? cerca de la zona de aterrizaje para obtener el Scrap of Papyrus.",
    ["Examine ??? on the south bank of the pond (J-8) to obtain the Lost Document."] = "Examina la ??? de la orilla sur del estanque (J-8) para obtener el Lost Document.",
    ["Examine Animal Spoor (J-9) again to obtain the Vial of Military Prism Powder key item."] = "Examina de nuevo el Animal Spoor (J-9) para obtener el key item Vial of Military Prism Powder.",
    ["Examine Animal Spoor (J-9) in Xarcabard (S) and register the Home Point at (H-9)."] = "Examina el Animal Spoor (J-9) en Xarcabard (S) y registra el Home Point en (H-9).",
    ["Examine Backfilled Pit (F-8)."] = "Examina el Backfilled Pit (F-8).",
    ["Examine Barricade (E-7) in North Gustaberg (S)."] = "Examina la Barricade (E-7) en North Gustaberg (S).",
    ["Examine Beastman Ensign (J-7)."] = "Examina el Beastman Ensign (J-7).",
    ["Examine Before Delkfutt's Tower again for a cutscene."] = "Examina de nuevo Before Delkfutt's Tower para una escena.",
    ["Examine Bibliomaniac's Lair (I-10) again for a cutscene and the Liber Daemonium."] = "Examina de nuevo el Bibliomaniac's Lair (I-10) para una escena y el Liber Daemonium.",
    ["Examine Bibliomaniac's Lair (I-10): the fight starts at once against Brash Gramk-Droog (WAR), a Velkk Defiler (DRK) and a Velkk Inquisitor (RDM). All can be slept and silenced."] = "Examina el Bibliomaniac's Lair (I-10): la pelea empieza al instante contra Brash Gramk-Droog (WAR), un Velkk Defiler (DRK) y un Velkk Inquisitor (RDM). Todos se pueden dormir y silenciar.",
    ["Examine Blank Target beside Erik beside Erik (H-7) and choose \"Into the fire\" to return to Batallia Downs (S)."] = "Examina el Blank Target junto a Erik (H-7) y elige \"Into the fire\" para volver a Batallia Downs (S).",
    ["Examine Cavernous Maw (E-4) while you have a Traverser stone. The Survival Guide in West Ronfaure is close."] = "Examina el Cavernous Maw (E-4) teniendo una Traverser stone. La Survival Guide de West Ronfaure está cerca.",
    ["Examine Cavernous Maw (F-7) while you have a Traverser stone. You get a cutscene with Reinhard. The Survival Guide in Buburimu Peninsula is close."] = "Examina el Cavernous Maw (F-7) teniendo una Traverser stone. Ves una escena con Reinhard. La Survival Guide de Buburimu Peninsula está cerca.",
    ["Examine Cavernous Maw (G-6) while you have a Traverser stone. It is in the northeast part of the map. You get a cutscene with Rurukaka."] = "Examina el Cavernous Maw (G-6) teniendo una Traverser stone. Está en la parte noreste del mapa. Ves una escena con Rurukaka.",
    ["Examine Cavernous Maw (H-12) while you have a Traverser stone. Unity Wanted Battle (level 99) to Tahrongi Canyon is close."] = "Examina el Cavernous Maw (H-12) teniendo una Traverser stone. La Unity Wanted Battle (nivel 99) a Tahrongi Canyon está cerca.",
    ["Examine Cavernous Maw (H-5) in Batallia Downs (H-5) to complete the quest and receive the Griffon Ring. The maw must already be unlocked in the past; with a full inventory, examine the ??? by the maw in Batallia Downs (S) later."] = "Examina el Cavernous Maw (H-5) de Batallia Downs (H-5) para completar la quest y recibir el Griffon Ring. El maw ya debe estar desbloqueado en el pasado; con el inventario lleno, examina después la ??? junto al maw en Batallia Downs (S).",
    ["Examine Cavernous Maw (H-8) while you have a Traverser stone. You get a cutscene with Alberic. The Survival Guide in Xarcabard is close."] = "Examina el Cavernous Maw (H-8) teniendo una Traverser stone. Ves una escena con Alberic. La Survival Guide de Xarcabard está cerca.",
    ["Examine Cavernous Maw (I-12) while you have a Traverser stone. The Survival Guide in North Gustaberg is close."] = "Examina el Cavernous Maw (I-12) teniendo una Traverser stone. La Survival Guide de North Gustaberg está cerca.",
    ["Examine Cavernous Maw (I-9) while you have a Traverser stone. You get a cutscene with Kuchi Eyjhann. The Survival Guide in Valkurm Dunes is close."] = "Examina el Cavernous Maw (I-9) teniendo una Traverser stone. Ves una escena con Kuchi Eyjhann. La Survival Guide de Valkurm Dunes está cerca.",
    ["Examine Cavernous Maw (J-10) while you have a Traverser stone. You get a cutscene with Orgis. Home Point #1 in Bastok Mines is close."] = "Examina el Cavernous Maw (J-10) teniendo una Traverser stone. Ves una escena con Orgis. El Home Point #1 de Bastok Mines está cerca.",
    ["Examine Cavernous Maw (J-8) while you have a Traverser stone. You get a cutscene with Kuchi Eyjhann. The Survival Guide in Jugner Forest is close."] = "Examina el Cavernous Maw (J-8) teniendo una Traverser stone. Ves una escena con Kuchi Eyjhann. La Survival Guide de Jugner Forest está cerca.",
    ["Examine Cermet Grate in the Hall of the Gods right in front of you for a cutscene."] = "Examina la Cermet Grate de Hall of the Gods, justo delante de ti, para una escena.",
    ["Examine Cermet Headstone in Behemoth's Dominion (G-9), defeat Legendary Weapon and Ancient Weapon, then examine it again to obtain the Lightning fragment."] = "Examina el Cermet Headstone en Behemoth's Dominion (G-9), derrota a Legendary Weapon y Ancient Weapon, y luego examínalo de nuevo para obtener el Lightning fragment.",
    ["Examine Cermet Headstone in Cape Terrigan (H-5), defeat Axesarion the Wanderer, then examine it again to obtain the Wind fragment."] = "Examina el Cermet Headstone en Cape Terrigan (H-5), derrota a Axesarion the Wanderer y luego examínalo de nuevo para obtener el Wind fragment.",
    ["Examine Cermet Headstone in La Theine Plateau (G-11) to obtain the Water fragment."] = "Examina el Cermet Headstone en La Theine Plateau (G-11) para obtener el Water fragment.",
    ["Examine Cermet Headstone in Western Altepa Desert (H-8) to obtain the Earth fragment."] = "Examina el Cermet Headstone en Western Altepa Desert (H-8) para obtener el Earth fragment.",
    ["Examine Cermet Headstone in Yuhtunga Jungle (L-6/7), defeat Carthi and Tipha, then examine it again to obtain the Fire fragment."] = "Examina el Cermet Headstone en Yuhtunga Jungle (L-6/7), derrota a Carthi y Tipha, y luego examínalo de nuevo para obtener el Fire fragment.",
    ["Examine Cermet Headstone in the Sanctuary of Zi'Tah (I-7), defeat Doomed Pilgrims, then examine it again to obtain the Light fragment."] = "Examina el Cermet Headstone en el Sanctuary of Zi'Tah (I-7), derrota a Doomed Pilgrims y luego examínalo de nuevo para obtener el Light fragment.",
    ["Examine Cloister of Frost in Fei'Yin to obtain the Ice fragment."] = "Examina el Cloister of Frost en Fei'Yin para obtener el Ice fragment.",
    ["Examine Compact Footprint (H-8) again."] = "Examina de nuevo la Compact Footprint (H-8).",
    ["Examine Compact Footprint (H-8)."] = "Examina la Compact Footprint (H-8).",
    ["Examine Compressed Snow (H-10) near the tower, then examine it again to face Orcish Bloodletter."] = "Examina la Compressed Snow (H-10) cerca de la torre y examínala de nuevo para enfrentarte a Orcish Bloodletter.",
    ["Examine Corroded Door (F-5) to enter the battlefield."] = "Examina la Corroded Door (F-5) para entrar en el campo de batalla.",
    ["Examine Craggy Pillar #1."] = "Examina el Craggy Pillar #1.",
    ["Examine Craggy Pillar #2."] = "Examina el Craggy Pillar #2.",
    ["Examine Craggy Pillar #3."] = "Examina el Craggy Pillar #3.",
    ["Examine Craggy Pillar #4."] = "Examina el Craggy Pillar #4.",
    ["Examine Decorative Bronze Gate for a cutscene, then again to enter the battlefield."] = "Examina la Decorative Bronze Gate para una escena, y de nuevo para entrar en el campo de batalla.",
    ["Examine Dilapidated Gate again."] = "Examina de nuevo la Dilapidated Gate.",
    ["Examine Dilapidated Gate around (F-7)."] = "Examina la Dilapidated Gate cerca de (F-7).",
    ["Examine Dilapidated Gate at (I-11)."] = "Examina la Dilapidated Gate en (I-11).",
    ["Examine Dilapidated Gate."] = "Examina la Dilapidated Gate.",
    ["Examine Disturbed Dirt (K-9) again to spawn the Gloom Phantom. You have 15 minutes. It has about 30,000 HP and uses Blood Weapon and Brazen Rush."] = "Examina de nuevo la Disturbed Dirt (K-9) para hacer aparecer al Gloom Phantom. Tienes 15 minutos. Tiene unos 30,000 HP y usa Blood Weapon y Brazen Rush.",
    ["Examine Disturbed Dirt (K-9) at (K-9) for a cutscene."] = "Examina la Disturbed Dirt (K-9) en (K-9) para una escena.",
    ["Examine Door: Acolyte Hostel (K-5) at (K-4) on the north map: second floor, right side of the left building."] = "Examina la Door: Acolyte Hostel (K-5) en (K-4) del mapa norte: segundo piso, lado derecho del edificio de la izquierda.",
    ["Examine Door: Boarding House (H-9) in Eastern Adoulin, near the Statue of the Goddess waypoint (#3), for a very long cutscene."] = "Examina la Door: Boarding House (H-9) de Eastern Adoulin, cerca del waypoint de Statue of the Goddess (#3), para una escena muy larga.",
    ["Examine Dreamrose (G-7) again to receive the Dreamrose."] = "Examina de nuevo la Dreamrose (G-7) para recibir la Dreamrose.",
    ["Examine Ebon Panel twice to obtain the race-specific key item."] = "Examina el Ebon Panel dos veces para obtener el key item específico de tu raza.",
    ["Examine Ensorcelled Door (B-10) at Ro'Maeve (B-10), southwest corner. There's no cutscene; you're told about a hexagonal depression."] = "Examina la Ensorcelled Door (B-10) de Ro'Maeve (B-10), en la esquina suroeste. No hay escena; se te habla de una depresión hexagonal.",
    ["Examine Entry Gate for the final cutscene."] = "Examina la Entry Gate para la última escena.",
    ["Examine Ergon Locus (Torchbloom) (J-7/K-7)."] = "Examina el Ergon Locus (Torchbloom) (J-7/K-7).",
    ["Examine Ergon Locus ??? (I-8, southern location) in Yorcia Weald for Yorcia's tear. Enter (I-8) from the west; a wall that sometimes blocks the path opens at 21:00. Standing on the Suspicious Place, face northeast and the ??? is straight ahead."] = "Examina la Ergon Locus ??? (I-8, punto sur) de Yorcia Weald para obtener la Yorcia's tear. Entra en (I-8) desde el oeste; una pared que a veces bloquea el camino se abre a las 21:00. De pie sobre el Suspicious Place, mira al noreste y la ??? está justo delante.",
    ["Examine Etched Rock (K-9) in Reisenjima (by Ethereal Ingress #6 and the Sanctorium entrance) for a cutscene."] = "Examina la Etched Rock (K-9) de Reisenjima (junto al Ethereal Ingress #6 y la entrada del Sanctorium) para una escena.",
    ["Examine Etched Rock (K-9) in Reisenjima for a cutscene."] = "Examina la Etched Rock (K-9) de Reisenjima para una escena.",
    ["Examine Excavated Snow to your right to enter, and speak with Antje to begin. In a party, only one person should do it: others getting Flee cancels your own, and one win counts for everyone."] = "Examina la Excavated Snow de tu derecha para entrar y habla con Antje para empezar. En grupo, solo debería hacerlo una persona: que otros reciban Flee cancela el tuyo, y una victoria cuenta para todos.",
    ["Examine Felled Trees (G-7) in western (G-7) (Recall-Jugner, or north then north-west from the Survival Guide)."] = "Examina los Felled Trees (G-7) en el oeste de (G-7) (Recall-Jugner, o al norte y luego al noroeste desde la Survival Guide).",
    ["Examine Fey Blossoms (F-5) again to receive the key item."] = "Examina de nuevo los Fey Blossoms (F-5) para recibir el key item.",
    ["Examine Final Survey Point (G-10) again after the fight for a cutscene."] = "Examina de nuevo el Final Survey Point (G-10) tras la pelea para una escena.",
    ["Examine Final Survey Point (G-10) again to fight Missabikong (Marolith, about 150,000 HP). It has Shock Spikes, uses Mighty Strikes and AoE moves at low HP, absorbs Thunder (including Light skillchains), and is weak to Darkness and blunt damage."] = "Examina de nuevo el Final Survey Point (G-10) para luchar contra Missabikong (Marolith, unos 150,000 HP). Tiene Shock Spikes, usa Mighty Strikes y movimientos de área con poco HP, absorbe Thunder (incluidos los skillchains de Light) y es débil a Darkness y al daño contundente.",
    ["Examine Fontis Xanira (H-8/H-9 border) to obtain the Vial of untainted holy water."] = "Examina la Fontis Xanira (límite entre H-8/H-9) para obtener el Vial of untainted holy water.",
    ["Examine Forbidding Portal (I-7) to enter the battlefield."] = "Examina el Forbidding Portal (I-7) para entrar en el campo de batalla.",
    ["Examine Forbidding Portal (I-7), then examine it again to enter battle."] = "Examina el Forbidding Portal (I-7), luego examínalo de nuevo para entrar en la batalla.",
    ["Examine Fresh Snowmelt (H-5) again to face NM Menechme and defeat it with Excenmille within 30 minutes."] = "Examina de nuevo la Fresh Snowmelt (H-5) para enfrentarte al NM Menechme y derrótalo con Excenmille en 30 minutos.",
    ["Examine Fresh Snowmelt (H-5) one final time to complete the quest and receive the reward."] = "Examina la Fresh Snowmelt (H-5) una última vez para completar la quest y recibir la recompensa.",
    ["Examine Fresh Snowmelt (H-5)."] = "Examina la Fresh Snowmelt (H-5).",
    ["Examine Gilgamesh's Oaken Door (K-8) in Norg multiple times."] = "Examina varias veces la Gilgamesh's Oaken Door (K-8) en Norg.",
    ["Examine Gilgamesh's Oaken Door (K-8)."] = "Examina la Gilgamesh's Oaken Door (K-8).",
    ["Examine Heavy Stone Door (H-8) again and enter the chamber."] = "Examina de nuevo la Heavy Stone Door (H-8) y entra en la cámara.",
    ["Examine Heroes' Gambit (J-9) at (J-9) in Xarcabard for a cutscene."] = "Examina el Heroes' Gambit (J-9) en (J-9) de Xarcabard para una escena.",
    ["Examine Humus-rich Earth (E-6) again to obtain Cernunnos Resin."] = "Examina de nuevo la Humus-rich Earth (E-6) para obtener Cernunnos Resin.",
    ["Examine Hut Door (G-9) again after the battle."] = "Examina de nuevo la Hut Door (G-9) tras la batalla.",
    ["Examine Imperial Gate Door at (L-8) in Whitegate for the coronation cutscene."] = "Examina la Imperial Gate Door de (L-8) en Whitegate para la escena de la coronación.",
    ["Examine Imperial Gate Door."] = "Examina la Imperial Gate Door.",
    ["Examine Imperial Whitegate (L-9) at the Palace Door."] = "Examina la Imperial Whitegate (L-9) en la Palace Door.",
    ["Examine Inconspicuous Barrel (C-6) to obtain the Founder king's orb."] = "Examina el Inconspicuous Barrel (C-6) para obtener el Founder king's orb.",
    ["Examine Iron Gate for a cutscene, then again to enter \"The Warrior's Path\". Buff inside, and note you can't leave until you win or lose."] = "Examina la Iron Gate para una escena, y de nuevo para entrar en \"The Warrior's Path\". Poténciate dentro, y ten en cuenta que no puedes salir hasta ganar o perder.",
    ["Examine Iron Gate."] = "Examina la Iron Gate.",
    ["Examine Jazaratt's Headstone at (E-10) for a cutscene."] = "Examina la Jazaratt's Headstone en (E-10) para una escena.",
    ["Examine Large Apparatus when entering a Promyvion for the first time."] = "Examina el Large Apparatus al entrar en una Promyvion por primera vez.",
    ["Examine Lion Springs Tavern door (K-6) in Southern San d'Oria [S] (K-6) for a cutscene and the key item Wedding invitation."] = "Examina la Lion Springs Tavern door (K-6) de Southern San d'Oria [S] (K-6) para una escena y el key item Wedding invitation.",
    ["Examine Lion Springs Tavern door (K-6) in Southern San d'Oria [S] (K-6) for a cutscene that starts the mission."] = "Examina la Lion Springs Tavern door (K-6) de Southern San d'Oria [S] (K-6) para una escena que empieza la misión.",
    ["Examine Lion Springs Tavern door (K-6) in Southern San d'Oria [S] (K-6) for a cutscene."] = "Examina la Lion Springs Tavern door (K-6) de Southern San d'Oria [S] (K-6) para una escena.",
    ["Examine Lion Springs Tavern door (K-6) in Southern San d'Oria [S] (K-6) for a cutscene. If it's locked, you still need to walk in from East Ronfaure [S] to finish Cait Sith, or finish the nation quests."] = "Examina la Lion Springs Tavern door (K-6) de Southern San d'Oria [S] (K-6) para una escena. Si está cerrada, aún tienes que entrar caminando desde East Ronfaure [S] para terminar Cait Sith, o terminar las quests de nación.",
    ["Examine Lion Springs Tavern door (K-6)."] = "Examina la Lion Springs Tavern door (K-6).",
    ["Examine Marble Bridge (F-7) again and choose one of the final ring rewards: Rajas, Sattva, or Tamas."] = "Examina de nuevo el Marble Bridge (F-7) y elige una de las recompensas finales de anillo: Rajas, Sattva o Tamas.",
    ["Examine Marble Bridge (F-7)."] = "Examina el Marble Bridge (F-7).",
    ["Examine Memento Circle and enter the battlefield \"Darkness Named\". Buffs wear off when you enter."] = "Examina el Memento Circle y entra en el campo de batalla \"Darkness Named\". Los buffs desaparecen al entrar.",
    ["Examine Memory Flux."] = "Examina el Memory Flux.",
    ["Examine Metallic Hodgepodge (F-9) in Jugner Forest, at the base of a tree near the (F-9)/(G-9) border."] = "Examina el Metallic Hodgepodge (F-9) de Jugner Forest, al pie de un árbol cerca del límite entre (F-9) y (G-9).",
    ["Examine Mine Shaft #2716."] = "Examina la Mine Shaft #2716.",
    ["Examine Monument on Zegham Hill (J-7) on Zegham Hill in North Gustaberg (S): climb in around (I-8), go counter-clockwise on the second level to the ramp at (J-8), then clockwise to the last ramp at the top of (J-7)."] = "Examina el Monument on Zegham Hill (J-7) en Zegham Hill, North Gustaberg (S): sube hacia (I-8), ve en sentido antihorario por el segundo nivel hasta la rampa de (J-8) y luego en sentido horario hasta la última rampa en lo alto de (J-7).",
    ["Examine Neptune's Spire Inn door (J-8) in Lower Jeuno to speak with Aldo."] = "Examina la Neptune's Spire Inn door (J-8) en Lower Jeuno para hablar con Aldo.",
    ["Examine Oaken Door (K-8) in Norg again."] = "Examina de nuevo la Oaken Door (K-8) en Norg.",
    ["Examine Oaken Door (K-8) in Norg."] = "Examina la Oaken Door (K-8) en Norg.",
    ["Examine Oaken Door (K-8)."] = "Examina la Oaken Door (K-8).",
    ["Examine Ornamental Door for a cutscene, then again and choose \"Puppet in Peril\"."] = "Examina la Ornamental Door para una escena, y de nuevo para elegir \"Puppet in Peril\".",
    ["Examine Ornate Door north of the Veridical Conflux."] = "Examina la Ornate Door al norte del Veridical Conflux.",
    ["Examine Particle Gate at (H-8)."] = "Examina el Particle Gate en (H-8).",
    ["Examine Particle Gate for a cutscene, then again to enter the battlefield."] = "Examina la Particle Gate para una escena, y de nuevo para entrar en el campo de batalla.",
    ["Examine Peculiar Glint (G-7) at (G-7) for a cutscene and the key item Distress signal flare."] = "Examina el Peculiar Glint (G-7) en (G-7) para una escena y el key item Distress signal flare.",
    ["Examine Perversion's Refuge (H-9) again for a cutscene and Iapetus."] = "Examina de nuevo el Perversion's Refuge (H-9) para una escena e Iapetus.",
    ["Examine Perversion's Refuge (H-9) again to fight the Mind-warped Scorpion (about 50,000 HP, drain on hit)."] = "Examina de nuevo el Perversion's Refuge (H-9) para luchar contra el Mind-warped Scorpion (unos 50,000 HP, drena al golpear).",
    ["Examine Perversion's Refuge (H-9) at (H-9) on Map 3, north of Palborough Mines Home Point #1, for a cutscene."] = "Examina el Perversion's Refuge (H-9) en (H-9) del mapa 3, al norte del Home Point #1 de Palborough Mines, para una escena.",
    ["Examine Qe'Iov Gate, then examine it again to enter the battlefield."] = "Examina la Qe'Iov Gate y luego examínala de nuevo para entrar en el campo de batalla.",
    ["Examine Quadav Inquest (I-9) again after the fight for the final cutscene and your reward."] = "Examina de nuevo la Quadav Inquest (I-9) tras la pelea para la última escena y tu recompensa.",
    ["Examine Quadav Inquest (I-9) again to fight Do'Bho Venomtail (BLM, about 30,000 HP, Manafont, poison on hit), Old Quadav (WAR), Brass Quadav (DRK) and Copper Quadav (THF), about 25,000 HP each."] = "Examina de nuevo la Quadav Inquest (I-9) para luchar contra Do'Bho Venomtail (BLM, unos 30,000 HP, Manafont, envenena al golpear), Old Quadav (WAR), Brass Quadav (DRK) y Copper Quadav (THF), unos 25,000 HP cada uno.",
    ["Examine Rally Point: Blue (H-8) at the northwest corner of (H-8) for the key item Alchemical signal flare (once per game day)."] = "Examina el Rally Point: Blue (H-8) en la esquina noroeste de (H-8) para obtener el key item Alchemical signal flare (una vez por día de juego).",
    ["Examine Rally Point: Green (G-9) at (G-9) for a cutscene and the key item Magelight signal flare."] = "Examina el Rally Point: Green (G-9) en (G-9) para una escena y el key item Magelight signal flare.",
    ["Examine Rally Point: Red (F-8) at (F-8) for a cutscene."] = "Examina el Rally Point: Red (F-8) en (F-8) para una escena.",
    ["Examine Rally Point: Red (F-8) at (F-8), next to the sparkling spot."] = "Examina el Rally Point: Red (F-8) en (F-8), junto al punto brillante.",
    ["Examine Rally Point: Red (F-8) in Xarcabard [S] (F-8) for a cutscene."] = "Examina el Rally Point: Red (F-8) de Xarcabard [S] (F-8) para una escena.",
    ["Examine Rally Point: Red (F-8) in Xarcabard [S] (F-8)."] = "Examina el Rally Point: Red (F-8) de Xarcabard [S] (F-8).",
    ["Examine Regal Pawprints (H-7) just past where you drop to warp straight into Ruhotz Silvermines for the battle (30 minutes)."] = "Examina las Regal Pawprints (H-7) justo después de la caída para teletransportarte directamente a Ruhotz Silvermines para la batalla (30 minutos).",
    ["Examine Regal Pawprints (H-9) again."] = "Examina de nuevo las Regal Pawprints (H-9).",
    ["Examine Regal Pawprints (H-9) behind the tree near the bottom of the ramp from the Campaign Arbiter for a cutscene."] = "Examina las Regal Pawprints (H-9) detrás del árbol cerca del pie de la rampa desde el Campaign Arbiter para una escena.",
    ["Examine Rock Slab right in front of you to enter the battlefield (30 minutes)."] = "Examina la Rock Slab justo delante de ti para entrar en el campo de batalla (30 minutos).",
    ["Examine Rocky Perch (G-10) at the lake at least three times to obtain the Goliath Worm items."] = "Examina el Rocky Perch (G-10) en el lago al menos tres veces para obtener los objetos Goliath Worm.",
    ["Examine Rubious Crystal (D-10)."] = "Examina el Rubious Crystal (D-10).",
    ["Examine Rubious Crystal (H-13)."] = "Examina el Rubious Crystal (H-13).",
    ["Examine Rubious Crystal (L-10)."] = "Examina el Rubious Crystal (L-10).",
    ["Examine Runic Seal at (I-9) to enter the battlefield: three battles in 45 minutes, Trusts allowed."] = "Examina el Runic Seal de (I-9) para entrar en el campo de batalla: tres batallas en 45 minutos, se permiten Trusts.",
    ["Examine Runic Seal at (I-9), across the room, to enter the battlefield \"Path of Darkness\". Trusts are allowed."] = "Examina el Runic Seal de (I-9), al otro lado de la sala, para entrar en el campo de batalla \"Path of Darkness\". Se permiten Trusts.",
    ["Examine Sainene (N-7)."] = "Examina Sainene (N-7).",
    ["Examine Sanctorium crystal again to enter the battlefield."] = "Examina de nuevo el Sanctorium crystal para entrar en el campo de batalla.",
    ["Examine Sanctorium crystal."] = "Examina el Sanctorium crystal.",
    ["Examine Savage Scars (H-13) again for a cutscene and the Lock of golden hair."] = "Examina de nuevo las Savage Scars (H-13) para una escena y el Lock of golden hair.",
    ["Examine Savage Scars (H-13) again to fight the Returned Soulflayer (BLU, about 100,000 HP). You have 15 minutes. Under Azure Lore and Unbridled Learning it spams Water Bomb, Yawn (sleepga), Gates of Hades and more; a strong RDM can silence it. Mind Purge strips a player's buffs."] = "Examina de nuevo las Savage Scars (H-13) para luchar contra el Returned Soulflayer (BLU, unos 100,000 HP). Tienes 15 minutos. Con Azure Lore y Unbridled Learning usa sin parar Water Bomb, Yawn (sleepga), Gates of Hades y más; un RDM fuerte puede silenciarlo. Mind Purge quita los buffs de un jugador.",
    ["Examine Savage Scars (I-6) again for a cutscene."] = "Examina de nuevo las Savage Scars (I-6) para una escena.",
    ["Examine Savage Scars (I-6) again to fight the Arisen Soulflayer and three Descended Winebibbers (all must die; watch for Fluid Toss). You have 15 minutes. Uran-Mafran (BLM) helps; you lose if he's KO'd, and you can cure him."] = "Examina de nuevo las Savage Scars (I-6) para luchar contra el Arisen Soulflayer y tres Descended Winebibbers (hay que matarlos a todos; cuidado con Fluid Toss). Tienes 15 minutos. Uran-Mafran (BLM) ayuda; pierdes si cae, y puedes curarlo.",
    ["Examine Scrape Mark (G-9) again to enter the Face of the Future battlefield."] = "Examina de nuevo la Scrape Mark (G-9) para entrar en el campo de batalla Face of the Future.",
    ["Examine Sewer Entrance (I-7) to enter the Phomiuna Aqueducts."] = "Examina la Sewer Entrance (I-7) para entrar en Phomiuna Aqueducts.",
    ["Examine Shimmering Pondweed (G-6) in the north-west corner of (G-6) in Pashhow Marshlands (S) to complete the quest and receive the reward."] = "Examina el Shimmering Pondweed (G-6) en la esquina noroeste de (G-6) en Pashhow Marshlands (S) para completar la quest y recibir la recompensa.",
    ["Examine Spell-worked Snow just southeast of it to enter the battlefield."] = "Examina la Spell-worked Snow justo al sureste para entrar en el campo de batalla.",
    ["Examine Stalagmite (D-9) again after the fight for a cutscene."] = "Examina de nuevo la Stalagmite (D-9) tras la pelea para una escena.",
    ["Examine Stalagmite (D-9) again to fight Gloom Phantom (WAR/DRK), Magh Bihu (RDM) and Dazbog (PLD). You have 15 minutes. Each has about 30,000 HP and its job's SP ability. If they focus one target they skillchain and magic burst (Fire IV, Water IV); AA TT can sleep the meeble and mandragora."] = "Examina de nuevo la Stalagmite (D-9) para luchar contra Gloom Phantom (WAR/DRK), Magh Bihu (RDM) y Dazbog (PLD). Tienes 15 minutos. Cada uno tiene unos 30,000 HP y la habilidad SP de su job. Si se centran en un objetivo hacen skillchains y magic burst (Fire IV, Water IV); AA TT puede dormir al meeble y a la mandrágora.",
    ["Examine Stone Circle ??? (G-6) between 18:00 and 05:00 (Vana'diel time) for a cutscene. This completes the quest and starts An Officer and a Pirate."] = "Examina la Stone Circle ??? (G-6) entre las 18:00 y las 05:00 (hora de Vana'diel) para una escena. Esto completa la quest y empieza An Officer and a Pirate.",
    ["Examine Stone Circle ??? (G-6)."] = "Examina la ??? del Stone Circle (G-6).",
    ["Examine Stonehoused Adit (E-9) again to begin the battle."] = "Examina de nuevo el Stonehoused Adit (E-9) para comenzar la batalla.",
    ["Examine Stout Weir (D-8) to receive a Broken fuse."] = "Examina el Stout Weir (D-8) para recibir un Broken fuse.",
    ["Examine Sunken Footprint (H-6/H-7) up the northwest ramp."] = "Examina la Sunken Footprint (H-6/H-7) subiendo por la rampa noroeste.",
    ["Examine Sunrise Beacon (J-4) to obtain the Piece of a stone wall."] = "Examina el Sunrise Beacon (J-4) para obtener el Piece of a stone wall.",
    ["Examine Sunrise Beacon (J-4)."] = "Examina el Sunrise Beacon (J-4).",
    ["Examine Survey Point (K-7) on Map 2 for a cutscene."] = "Examina el Survey Point (K-7) del mapa 2 para una escena.",
    ["Examine Tombstone (H/I-10)."] = "Examina la Tombstone (H/I-10).",
    ["Examine Transcendental Radiance (F-7) and choose \"Proceed\" to spend 10,000 Cruor for a Crimson traverser stone."] = "Examina la Transcendental Radiance (F-7) y elige \"Proceed\" para gastar 10,000 Cruor a cambio de una Crimson traverser stone.",
    ["Examine Transcendental Radiance again after the battle for a long cutscene."] = "Examina de nuevo la Transcendental Radiance tras la batalla para una escena larga.",
    ["Examine Transcendental Radiance in Empyreal Paradox and enter \"The Winds of Time\"."] = "Examina la Transcendental Radiance de Empyreal Paradox y entra en \"The Winds of Time\".",
    ["Examine Transcendental Radiance once more to enter the battle against Sempurne."] = "Examina la Transcendental Radiance una vez más para entrar en la batalla contra Sempurne.",
    ["Examine Transcendental Radiance."] = "Examina la Transcendental Radiance.",
    ["Examine Underbrush (F-13), then examine it again to face Madthrasher Zradbodd."] = "Examina el Underbrush (F-13) y examínalo de nuevo para enfrentarte a Madthrasher Zradbodd.",
    ["Examine Underpass Hatch (J-9/K-9) in Batallia Downs [S] (J-9/K-9), on the rampart inside a tower, for a cutscene."] = "Examina la Underpass Hatch (J-9/K-9) de Batallia Downs [S] (J-9/K-9), en la muralla dentro de una torre, para una escena.",
    ["Examine Undulating Confluence (G-5) and enter Escha - Ru'Aun."] = "Examina el Undulating Confluence (G-5) y entra en Escha - Ru'Aun.",
    ["Examine Undulating Confluence (G-5) and the nearby sparkling ???."] = "Examina el Undulating Confluence (G-5) y la ??? reluciente cercana.",
    ["Examine Undulating Confluence (G-5) in Misareaux Coast for a cutscene. The Home Point takes you right to it."] = "Examina la Undulating Confluence (G-5) de Misareaux Coast para una escena. El Home Point te lleva justo allí.",
    ["Examine Undulating Confluence (G-8)."] = "Examina el Undulating Confluence (G-8).",
    ["Examine Veridical Conflux (F-5) at Witchfire Glen in Grauberg [S] (F-5) for a cutscene. Use the Grauberg [S] Survival Guide or Campaign Arbiter warp and go northwest. With the Voidwatch quest Glimmer of Hope done, you can also enter the Walk of Echoes from Pashhow Marshlands [S] (J-9) and use its center Conflux."] = "Examina la Veridical Conflux (F-5) en Witchfire Glen, Grauberg [S] (F-5), para una escena. Usa la Survival Guide de Grauberg [S] o el warp del Campaign Arbiter y ve al noroeste. Con la quest de Voidwatch Glimmer of Hope hecha, también puedes entrar en el Walk of Echoes desde Pashhow Marshlands [S] (J-9) y usar su Conflux central.",
    ["Examine Veridical Conflux (F-5) in Grauberg [S] (F-5) for a cutscene that takes you into the Walk of Echoes. If you got your last dawndrop inside the Walk, step out first and examine it from Grauberg."] = "Examina la Veridical Conflux (F-5) de Grauberg [S] (F-5) para una escena que te lleva al Walk of Echoes. Si conseguiste tu última dawndrop dentro del Walk, sal primero y examínala desde Grauberg.",
    ["Examine Veridical Conflux (F-5) in Grauberg [S] (F-5) for a cutscene."] = "Examina la Veridical Conflux (F-5) de Grauberg [S] (F-5) para una escena.",
    ["Examine Veridical Conflux (F-5) to enter the Walk of Echoes."] = "Examina el Veridical Conflux (F-5) para entrar en el Walk of Echoes.",
    ["Examine Veridical Conflux (F-5)."] = "Examina el Veridical Conflux (F-5).",
    ["Examine Walnut Door (K-7) (the north one, with Parelbriaux outside; the south Walnut Door at (K-9) doesn't work) for a cutscene and the Mysterious amulet."] = "Examina la Walnut Door (K-7) (la del norte, con Parelbriaux fuera; la Walnut Door del sur en (K-9) no sirve) para una escena y el Mysterious amulet.",
    ["Examine Walnut Door (K-7)."] = "Examina la Walnut Door (K-7).",
    ["Examine Walnut Door (K-9) on the south side of the top floor. The other Walnut Door at (K-7) is the wrong one."] = "Examina la Walnut Door (K-9) en el lado sur del último piso. La otra Walnut Door, en (K-7), es la equivocada.",
    ["Examine Waterways Overlook (I-6)."] = "Examina el Waterways Overlook (I-6).",
    ["Examine Wheel Rut (I-9) again to complete the quest and receive the Ram Staff."] = "Examina de nuevo el Wheel Rut (I-9) para completar la quest y recibir el Ram Staff.",
    ["Examine Wheel Rut (I-9) in the dead-end tunnel to the south."] = "Examina el Wheel Rut (I-9) en el túnel sin salida al sur.",
    ["Examine Wooden Ladder for a cutscene with Nag'molada, then climb up. If you only see yourself climbing, go back and make sure the Minotaur kill counted."] = "Examina la Wooden Ladder para una escena con Nag'molada y luego sube. Si solo te ves subiendo, vuelve y asegúrate de que la muerte del Minotaur contó.",
    ["Examine a ??? that spawns randomly in Yhoator Jungle. Once you find it, the Empty Barrel turns into a Barrel of Opo-opo brew."] = "Examina una ??? que aparece al azar en Yhoator Jungle. Cuando la encuentres, el Empty Barrel se convierte en un Barrel of Opo-opo brew.",
    ["Examine a Shattered Telepoint at one of the three Crags."] = "Examina un Shattered Telepoint en uno de los tres Crags.",
    ["Examine a Shattered Telepoint at the Crag of Holla, Dem, or Mea."] = "Examina un Shattered Telepoint en el Crag of Holla, Dem o Mea.",
    ["Examine all eight sections of Chamber of Oracles to place the eight fragments."] = "Examina las ocho secciones de la Chamber of Oracles para colocar los ocho fragmentos.",
    ["Examine any Cavernous Maw while carrying a Traverser stone: La Theine Plateau (E-4), Konschtat Highlands (I-12), Tahrongi Canyon (H-12), Jugner Forest (J-8), Valkurm Dunes (I-9), Buburimu Peninsula (F-7, near the Survival Guide), Xarcabard (H-8), North Gustaberg (G-6) or South Gustaberg (J-10)."] = "Examina cualquier Cavernous Maw llevando una Traverser stone: La Theine Plateau (E-4), Konschtat Highlands (I-12), Tahrongi Canyon (H-12), Jugner Forest (J-8), Valkurm Dunes (I-9), Buburimu Peninsula (F-7, cerca de la Survival Guide), Xarcabard (H-8), North Gustaberg (G-6) o South Gustaberg (J-10).",
    ["Examine blank target at (F-8/G-8) for a cutscene that completes the mission."] = "Examina el objetivo vacío de (F-8/G-8) para una escena que completa la misión.",
    ["Examine blank target at (F-8/G-8), the same spot as Teahouse Tumult, for a cutscene that completes the mission."] = "Examina el objetivo vacío de (F-8/G-8), el mismo punto que en Teahouse Tumult, para una escena que completa la misión.",
    ["Examine blue warp ??? exit to leave the battlefield."] = "Examina la ??? de warp azul de salida para abandonar el campo de batalla.",
    ["Examine dead-end target (J-7)."] = "Examina el objetivo del callejón sin salida (J-7).",
    ["Examine each of the three Rubious Crystals to spawn three Ru'aern NMs, defeat them and examine the crystal again for a cutscene. The Auroral Updrafts at (E-8) and (L-8) take you back to (H-12) to save running, but count as zoning (buffs and Trusts are lost). If others just used a crystal, it says \"nothing of interest\" for up to two minutes."] = "Examina cada uno de los tres Rubious Crystals para hacer aparecer tres NMs Ru'aern, derrótalos y examina de nuevo el cristal para una escena. Los Auroral Updrafts de (E-8) y (L-8) te devuelven a (H-12) para ahorrar camino, pero cuentan como cambio de zona (se pierden los buffs y los Trusts). Si otros acaban de usar un cristal, dice \"nothing of interest\" durante hasta dos minutos.",
    ["Examine glowing ??? near the Augural Conveyor (B-6) near the room's entrance for a cutscene."] = "Examina la ??? brillante cerca del Augural Conveyor (B-6), junto a la entrada de la sala, para una escena.",
    ["Examine glowing ??? near the Augural Conveyor (B-6)."] = "Examina la ??? brillante cerca del Augural Conveyor (B-6).",
    ["Examine it again and place the jar of Firesand."] = "Examínalo de nuevo y coloca el jar of Firesand.",
    ["Examine it again to enter Escha - Ru'Aun for another cutscene."] = "Examínala de nuevo para entrar en Escha - Ru'Aun para otra escena.",
    ["Examine it again to enter Everbloom Hollow (up to 6; the leader needs the Underpass hatch key). Trusts are allowed and nothing inside can be slept."] = "Examínala de nuevo para entrar en Everbloom Hollow (hasta 6; el líder necesita la Underpass hatch key). Se permiten Trusts y no se puede dormir a nada de dentro.",
    ["Examine it again to enter the battle against Galarhigg."] = "Examínalo de nuevo para entrar en la batalla contra Galarhigg.",
    ["Examine it again to enter the battlefield against Count Bifrons and four Orcs."] = "Examínalo de nuevo para entrar en el campo de batalla contra Count Bifrons y cuatro Orcs.",
    ["Examine it again to fight Echion (Gigas WAR, about 200,000 HP; Trusts allowed). The Destiny Destroyers help; you lose if any of them falls, and you can't heal them."] = "Examínalo de nuevo para luchar contra Echion (Gigas WAR, unos 200,000 HP; se permiten Trusts). Los Destiny Destroyers ayudan; pierdes si cae cualquiera de ellos, y no puedes curarlos.",
    ["Examine it again to fight Sa'Jho Shieldbreaker (PLD), Enkelados (BST) with three Saplings, and Sharpshot Luttdrutt (RNG, spawns up on the ledge). You have 15 minutes. All but the Saplings resist sleep. Enkelados may Charm if you kill his Saplings first."] = "Examínalo de nuevo para luchar contra Sa'Jho Shieldbreaker (PLD), Enkelados (BST) con tres Saplings y Sharpshot Luttdrutt (RNG, aparece arriba en la cornisa). Tienes 15 minutos. Todos salvo los Saplings resisten el sueño. Enkelados puede usar Charm si matas antes a sus Saplings.",
    ["Examine it again to obtain the Reinforced Cermet."] = "Examínala de nuevo para obtener el Reinforced Cermet.",
    ["Examine it again to spawn Count Halphas and four Dark Demons."] = "Examínalas de nuevo para invocar a Count Halphas y a cuatro Dark Demons.",
    ["Examine it again to spawn the Fomor NM Jazaraat, and defeat it."] = "Examínala de nuevo para hacer aparecer al NM Fomor Jazaraat y derrótalo.",
    ["Examine it for a cutscene. You arrive in the past at a random one of the three Maws, whichever you entered."] = "Examínalo para una escena. Llegas al pasado a uno cualquiera de los tres Maws, sea cual sea por el que entraste.",
    ["Examine one of the Cavernous Maws for a cutscene; each zone's Survival Guide puts you right beside it. Unload cutscene-skipping addons first: they can disconnect you here."] = "Examina uno de los Cavernous Maws para una escena; la Survival Guide de cada zona te deja justo al lado. Descarga antes los addons que saltan escenas: aquí pueden desconectarte.",
    ["Examine one of the Cavernous Maws for a cutscene; each zone's Survival Guide puts you right beside it:"] = "Examina uno de los Cavernous Maws para una escena; la Survival Guide de cada zona te deja justo al lado:",
    ["Examine one of the three Cavernous Maws:"] = "Examina uno de los tres Cavernous Maws:",
    ["Examine sparkling ??? (F-11) in Yuhtunga Jungle for a cutscene."] = "Examina la ??? brillante (F-11) de Yuhtunga Jungle para una escena.",
    ["Examine sparkling ??? (J-12) at the edge of the lake in Sea Serpent Grotto for a cutscene."] = "Examina la ??? brillante (J-12) a orillas del lago de Sea Serpent Grotto para una escena.",
    ["Examine the ??? (D-11) in the northeast corner of (D-11), on the upper level by Crawlers' Nest (Unity Warp level 125 lands there), to spawn Chuglix Berrypaws, and defeat it for Seedspall Caerulum."] = "Examina la ??? (D-11) en la esquina noreste de (D-11), en el nivel superior junto a Crawlers' Nest (el Unity Warp de nivel 125 te deja allí), para hacer aparecer a Chuglix Berrypaws, y derrótalo para obtener la Seedspall Caerulum.",
    ["Examine the ??? (F-5) in the middle of (F-5), on the upper level connected to Beaucedine Glacier, to spawn Vegnix Greenthumb, and defeat it for Seedspall Roseum. Reach it via a Lycopodium warp at (F-5), or the Beaucedine Glacier Survival Guide then the (H-11) connection."] = "Examina la ??? (F-5) en el centro de (F-5), en el nivel superior conectado con Beaucedine Glacier, para hacer aparecer a Vegnix Greenthumb, y derrótalo para obtener la Seedspall Roseum. Llega con un warp de Lycopodium en (F-5), o con la Survival Guide de Beaucedine Glacier y luego la conexión de (H-11).",
    ["Examine the ??? (G-6) again for a cutscene."] = "Examina de nuevo la ??? (G-6) para una escena.",
    ["Examine the ??? (G-6) on Qufim Island (G-6) to start the battle."] = "Examina la ??? (G-6) de Qufim Island (G-6) para empezar la batalla.",
    ["Examine the ??? (G-6) on Qufim Island (G-6) with all three Seedspalls for a cutscene."] = "Examina la ??? (G-6) de Qufim Island (G-6) con las tres Seedspalls para una escena.",
    ["Examine the ??? (G-8) on the west side of the square, between three glowing rocks, to spawn Western Sphinx and Eastern Sphinx."] = "Examina la ??? (G-8) del lado oeste de la plaza, entre tres rocas brillantes, para hacer aparecer a Western Sphinx y Eastern Sphinx.",
    ["Examine the ??? (I-9) at the (I/J-9/10) intersection, near the Survival Guide, to spawn Dribblix Greasemaw, and defeat it for Seedspall Viridis."] = "Examina la ??? (I-9) en el cruce de (I/J-9/10), cerca de la Survival Guide, para hacer aparecer a Dribblix Greasemaw, y derrótalo para obtener la Seedspall Viridis.",
    ["Examine the ??? again after about a minute to obtain the Warlock's Boots. Zoning is not required."] = "Examina de nuevo la ??? tras un minuto aproximadamente para obtener las Warlock's Boots. No hace falta cambiar de zona.",
    ["Examine the ??? again after defeating the Nasus."] = "Examina de nuevo la ??? tras derrotar a los Nasus.",
    ["Examine the ??? again for a cutscene and a Regal Die. Return to Lower Jeuno and trade the Regal Die to Sniggnix for the key item Second signed forged envelope."] = "Examina de nuevo la ??? para una escena y un Regal Die. Vuelve a Lower Jeuno y entrega el Regal Die a Sniggnix para obtener el key item Second signed forged envelope.",
    ["Examine the ??? again for a cutscene and your reward. Optional: Ceraulian has an extra cutscene and Rahal some extra dialogue afterwards."] = "Examina de nuevo la ??? para una escena y tu recompensa. Opcional: después, Ceraulian tiene una escena extra y Rahal algo de diálogo extra.",
    ["Examine the ??? again for another cutscene."] = "Examina de nuevo la ??? para otra escena.",
    ["Examine the ??? again for the key item Zeelozok's earplug, and return to Koblakiq to complete the quest and receive the Goblin Grenade."] = "Examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener el key item Zeelozok's earplug y vuelve con Koblakiq para completar la quest y recibir la Goblin Grenade.",
    ["Examine the ??? again to exchange the Antique amulet for the Cathedral medallion, then return to Rouva."] = "Examina de nuevo la ??? para cambiar el Antique amulet por el Cathedral medallion y vuelve con Rouva.",
    ["Examine the ??? again to make Fingerfilcher Dradzad, an Orc warrior NM, appear, and defeat it. It is immune to sleep."] = "Examina de nuevo la ??? para hacer aparecer a Fingerfilcher Dradzad, un NM guerrero Orc, y derrótalo. Es inmune al sueño.",
    ["Examine the ??? again to receive the key item Ancient San d'Orian tablet. If you fall off the ledge, you have to come back through the Oubliette and fight the NM again."] = "Examina de nuevo la ??? para recibir el key item Ancient San d'Orian tablet. Si te caes de la cornisa, tendrás que volver por el Oubliette y luchar de nuevo contra el NM.",
    ["Examine the ??? again to spawn Migratory Hippogryph. If you zone after the first examine, you have to examine it again as a Dancer, so plan to fight it on Dancer."] = "Examina de nuevo la ??? para hacer aparecer a Migratory Hippogryph. Si cambias de zona tras el primer examen, tienes que volver a examinarla como Dancer, así que prepárate para luchar como Dancer.",
    ["Examine the ??? again to spawn the mannequin NM Alsha. It casts Silence, Paralyze and sometimes Cure III on you; below about 20% it casts Fire II on itself, and if it kills itself you must zone and try again, since you have to land the final blow."] = "Examina de nuevo la ??? para hacer aparecer al NM maniquí Alsha. Te lanza Silence, Paralyze y a veces Cure III; por debajo del 20% aproximadamente se lanza Fire II a sí mismo, y si se mata solo debes cambiar de zona y volver a intentarlo, ya que tienes que dar tú el golpe final.",
    ["Examine the ??? and choose to extract the piece of wood; it falls off the cliff. Everyone in the party must examine this ??? (anyone who misses it can still do it after the fight)."] = "Examina la ??? y elige sacar el trozo de madera; cae por el acantilado. Todos los del grupo deben examinar esta ??? (quien no lo haga puede hacerlo después de la pelea).",
    ["Examine the ??? at (F-10) on the first map, in a hidden area at (F-9), with the wyvern out to spawn Cleuvarion M Resoaix and Rompaulion S Citalle. Only Rompaulion has to be defeated; a level 60 party of Trusts can handle it."] = "Examina la ??? en (F-10) del primer mapa, en una zona oculta en (F-9), con el wyvern fuera para hacer aparecer a Cleuvarion M Resoaix y Rompaulion S Citalle. Solo hay que derrotar a Rompaulion; un grupo de Trusts de nivel 60 puede con él.",
    ["Examine the ??? at (G-8) in the south-west corner, behind the shack. There are two ??? close together; the right one says \"You have found the location of the seal\" and then \"You place a Seal of banishing on it.\""] = "Examina la ??? en (G-8), en la esquina suroeste, detrás de la cabaña. Hay dos ??? muy juntas; la de la derecha dice \"You have found the location of the seal\" y luego \"You place a Seal of banishing on it.\"",
    ["Examine the ??? at (J-9), east of the Grauberg Guntower."] = "Examina la ??? en (J-9), al este de la Grauberg Guntower.",
    ["Examine the ??? at the north-east corner of (G-9) to spawn Necroplasm. Trusts are allowed. It may not be targetable with Tab while it sits on the stalagmite, so move away to pull it off. Defeat it and examine the ??? again for the key item Indigested stalagmite."] = "Examina la ??? de la esquina noreste de (G-9) para hacer aparecer a Necroplasm. Se permiten Trusts. Puede que no se pueda seleccionar con Tab mientras está sobre la estalagmita, así que aléjate para sacarlo de ahí. Derrótalo y examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener el key item Indigested stalagmite.",
    ["Examine the ??? beside the Veridical Conflux to return to the Walk of Echoes for a cutscene, then warp back to town."] = "Examina la ??? junto a la Veridical Conflux para volver al Walk of Echoes para una escena, y luego teletranspórtate a la ciudad.",
    ["Examine the ??? for the final cutscene and your Puppetry Churidars."] = "Examina la ??? para la última escena y tus Puppetry Churidars.",
    ["Examine the ??? in Arrapago Reef (H-10) for a cutscene, as a Corsair of level 40 or higher. You are asked a question; the answer is Maze of Shakhrami, but a wrong guess is fine."] = "Examina la ??? en Arrapago Reef (H-10) para una escena, como Corsair de nivel 40 o superior. Se te hace una pregunta; la respuesta es Maze of Shakhrami, pero fallar no importa.",
    ["Examine the ??? in Arrapago Reef (H-10), map 1, for a cutscene. You need to be a Corsair of level 50 or higher, and a Lamian Fang Key is required to reach this point."] = "Examina la ??? en Arrapago Reef (H-10), mapa 1, para una escena. Debes ser Corsair de nivel 50 o superior, y hace falta una Lamian Fang Key para llegar a este punto.",
    ["Examine the ??? in Eastern Altepa Desert, in the lower part of (H-8), to spawn Decurio I-III. The Survival Guide warp puts you very near; Teleport-Altep is another good option."] = "Examina la ??? en Eastern Altepa Desert, en la parte baja de (H-8), para invocar a Decurio I-III. El warp de la Survival Guide te deja muy cerca; Teleport-Altep es otra buena opción.",
    ["Examine the ??? in Labyrinth of Onzozo (F-8) to spawn the NM Ubume, a level 60-65 Bard bird that loves Horde Lullaby. The Survival Guide lands you at (G-11), near the Buburimu Peninsula zone line; walking in from Buburimu Peninsula also works."] = "Examina la ??? en Labyrinth of Onzozo (F-8) para hacer aparecer al NM Ubume, un pájaro Bard de nivel 60-65 al que le encanta Horde Lullaby. La Survival Guide te deja en (G-11), cerca del límite de zona de Buburimu Peninsula; entrar caminando desde Buburimu Peninsula también sirve.",
    ["Examine the ??? in Valkurm Dunes at (B-7) between 18:00 and 4:00 to spawn Doman (Fomor) and Onryo (Ghost), both around level 52. The Survival Guide to Gustav Tunnel lands you just outside (B-7)."] = "Examina la ??? de Valkurm Dunes en (B-7) entre las 18:00 y las 4:00 para hacer aparecer a Doman (Fomor) y Onryo (Ghost), ambos de nivel 52 aproximadamente. La Survival Guide a Gustav Tunnel te deja justo fuera de (B-7).",
    ["Examine the ??? in the Stone Circle (G-6) in La Theine Plateau for a cutscene (Unity Warp level 99, Survival Guide or Teleport-Holla)."] = "Examina la ??? del Stone Circle (G-6) de La Theine Plateau para una escena (Unity Warp de nivel 99, Survival Guide o Teleport-Holla).",
    ["Examine the ??? in the waterfall area at (G-6) to obtain the Ornate Package."] = "Examina la ??? en la zona de la cascada en (G-6) para obtener el Ornate Package.",
    ["Examine the ??? inside the room to spawn the NM Yagudo Muralist along with your Adventuring Fellow. Defeat it, speak with your Fellow, then examine the ??? again to obtain the key item. Another player must wait 3 minutes before spawning the NM again."] = "Examina la ??? de dentro de la sala para hacer aparecer al NM Yagudo Muralist junto con tu Adventuring Fellow. Derrótalo, habla con tu Fellow y examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener el key item. Otro jugador debe esperar 3 minutos antes de volver a hacer aparecer al NM.",
    ["Examine the ??? next to Undulating Confluence (G-5) again for another cutscene."] = "Examina de nuevo la ??? junto a la Undulating Confluence (G-5) para otra escena.",
    ["Examine the ??? on a tree at (H-6) in Jugner Forest for a cutscene."] = "Examina la ??? de un árbol en (H-6) de Jugner Forest para una escena.",
    ["Examine the ??? on the back side of the boarded-up tower window."] = "Examina la ??? en la parte de atrás de la ventana tapiada de la torre.",
    ["Examine the ??? on the ground floor of the Temple of the Goddess (G-8) (take the elevator). If you zone at any time after this, you have to start over with Salim."] = "Examina la ??? de la planta baja del Temple of the Goddess (G-8) (toma el ascensor). Si cambias de zona en cualquier momento tras esto, tienes que volver a empezar con Salim.",
    ["Examine the ??? on the south side of the oasis to spawn Maharaja, a tiger. Defeat it and examine the ??? again for the key item Annals of Truth."] = "Examina la ??? del lado sur del oasis para hacer aparecer a Maharaja, un tigre. Derrótalo y examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener el key item Annals of Truth.",
    ["Examine the ??? on the table to obtain the Firepower Case."] = "Examina la ??? de la mesa para obtener el Firepower Case.",
    ["Examine the ??? on the west side of the island at (I-11), at the cliff's edge, to spawn the NM Sturmtiger."] = "Examina la ??? del lado oeste de la isla en (I-11), al borde del acantilado, para hacer aparecer al NM Sturmtiger.",
    ["Examine the ??? once more for a cutscene that completes the quest and gives your reward."] = "Examina la ??? una vez más para una escena que completa la quest y te da la recompensa.",
    ["Examine the ??? there to spawn Gambilox Wanderling and defeat it. It respawns after 3 minutes for other party members; if the ??? only says it smells like a Goblin, wait a few minutes."] = "Examina allí la ??? para hacer aparecer a Gambilox Wanderling y derrótalo. Reaparece tras 3 minutos para otros miembros del grupo; si la ??? solo dice que huele a Goblin, espera unos minutos.",
    ["Examine the ??? to get the Stalactite dew."] = "Examina la ??? para obtener el Stalactite dew.",
    ["Examine the ??? to spawn Baronial Bat, weak to Wind and Light. Defeat it and examine the ??? again for the key item Annals of Truth."] = "Examina la ??? para hacer aparecer a Baronial Bat, débil a Wind y Light. Derrótalo y examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener el key item Annals of Truth.",
    ["Examine the ??? to spawn Beet Leafhopper, a fly weak to Ice. Defeat it and examine the ??? again for the key item Annals of Truth."] = "Examina la ??? para hacer aparecer a Beet Leafhopper, una mosca débil a Ice. Derrótala y examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener el key item Annals of Truth.",
    ["Examine the ??? to spawn Bodach, a skeleton weak to Fire and Light. Defeat it and examine the ??? again for the key item Annals of Truth."] = "Examina la ??? para hacer aparecer a Bodach, un esqueleto débil a Fire y Light. Derrótalo y examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener el key item Annals of Truth.",
    ["Examine the ??? to spawn Cailleach Bheur, a Black Mage skeleton weak to Fire and Light. Defeat it and examine the ??? again for the key item Annals of Truth."] = "Examina la ??? para hacer aparecer a Cailleach Bheur, un esqueleto Black Mage débil a Fire y Light. Derrótalo y examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener el key item Annals of Truth.",
    ["Examine the ??? to spawn Girtablulu, a scorpion weak to Ice and Light. Defeat it and examine the ??? again for the Annals of Truth."] = "Examina la ??? para hacer aparecer a Girtablulu, un escorpión débil a Ice y Light. Derrótalo y examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener los Annals of Truth.",
    ["Examine the ??? to spawn Greenman, a treant weak to Fire and Dark. Defeat it and examine the ??? again for the key item Annals of Truth."] = "Examina la ??? para hacer aparecer a Greenman, un treant débil a Fire y Dark. Derrótalo y examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener el key item Annals of Truth.",
    ["Examine the ??? to spawn Kettenkaefer, a beetle weak to Ice and Light. Defeat it and examine the ??? again for the key item Annals of Truth."] = "Examina la ??? para hacer aparecer a Kettenkaefer, un escarabajo débil a Ice y Light. Derrótalo y examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener el key item Annals of Truth.",
    ["Examine the ??? to spawn Megapod Megalops, a crab weak to Ice and Lightning. Defeat it and examine the ??? again for the key item Annals of Truth."] = "Examina la ??? para hacer aparecer a Megapod Megalops, un cangrejo débil a Ice y Lightning. Derrótalo y examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener el key item Annals of Truth.",
    ["Examine the ??? to spawn Mokumokuren, a hecteyes. Defeat it and examine the ??? again for the key item Annals of Truth."] = "Examina la ??? para hacer aparecer a Mokumokuren, un hecteyes. Derrótalo y examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener el key item Annals of Truth.",
    ["Examine the ??? to spawn Water Leaper, a pugil weak to Ice and Lightning. Defeat it and examine the ??? again for the key item Annals of Truth."] = "Examina la ??? para hacer aparecer a Water Leaper, un pugil débil a Ice y Lightning. Derrótalo y examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener el key item Annals of Truth.",
    ["Examine the ???."] = "Examina la ???.",
    ["Examine the Acid-eaten Door in Mount Zhayolm (I-9) for a short cutscene, then trade it 3 Slabs of Plumbago for the lightning cell."] = "Examina la Acid-eaten Door en Mount Zhayolm (I-9) para una escena corta y luego entrégale 3 Slabs of Plumbago para obtener la célula de rayo.",
    ["Examine the Aged Stump (H-8) for a cutscene, the Sky blue pome and the Sun yellow pome."] = "Examina el Aged Stump (H-8) para una escena, el Sky blue pome y el Sun yellow pome.",
    ["Examine the Aged Stump (H-8) in Leafallia for a cutscene."] = "Examina el Aged Stump (H-8) de Leafallia para una escena.",
    ["Examine the Alpine Trail at (H-5) in Kamihr Drifts (Bivouac #3 or Home Point #1 are quickest) for a cutscene."] = "Examina el Alpine Trail de (H-5) en Kamihr Drifts (el Bivouac #3 o el Home Point #1 son lo más rápido) para una escena.",
    ["Examine the Alpine Trail at (H-5) in Kamihr Drifts for a cutscene. Bivouac #3 is closest (take the northern tunnel and follow the left wall north); the Home Point is also near. Turn FastCS off: it disconnects you here (the mission still counts when you log back in). It takes you to Mount Kamihr."] = "Examina el Alpine Trail de (H-5) en Kamihr Drifts para una escena. El Bivouac #3 es el más cercano (toma el túnel norte y sigue la pared izquierda hacia el norte); el Home Point también está cerca. Desactiva FastCS: aquí te desconecta (la misión cuenta igualmente al volver a entrar). Te lleva a Mount Kamihr.",
    ["Examine the Antiquated Sluice Gate to enter the battle. If you lose, you need a new crank from the Storage Container."] = "Examina la Antiquated Sluice Gate para entrar en la batalla. Si pierdes, necesitas una nueva manivela del Storage Container.",
    ["Examine the Aspirant's Grounds (K-7) at (K-7), Ethereal Ingress #6, for a cutscene and the Aspirant's canteen."] = "Examina los Aspirant's Grounds (K-7) en (K-7), Ethereal Ingress #6, para una escena y la Aspirant's canteen.",
    ["Examine the Audience Chamber door."] = "Examina la puerta de la Audience Chamber.",
    ["Examine the Audience Chamber in Ru'Lude Gardens (H-6). Then, in any order, get approval letters from Halver in Chateau d'Oraguille (I-9) (San d'Orian approval letter), Iron Eater in Metalworks (J-8) (Bastokan approval letter) and Kupipi in Heavens Tower (Windurstian approval letter)."] = "Examina la Audience Chamber en Ru'Lude Gardens (H-6). Luego, en cualquier orden, consigue cartas de aprobación de Halver en Chateau d'Oraguille (I-9) (San d'Orian approval letter), de Iron Eater en Metalworks (J-8) (Bastokan approval letter) y de Kupipi en Heavens Tower (Windurstian approval letter).",
    ["Examine the Audience Chamber to receive the Letter to Aldo."] = "Examina la Audience Chamber para recibir la Letter to Aldo.",
    ["Examine the Audience Chamber."] = "Examina la Audience Chamber.",
    ["Examine the Augural Conveyor (B-6), near the Western Adoulin Waterfront (F-5) entrance, and choose \"The Charlatan\" to go straight into the battle."] = "Examina el Augural Conveyor (B-6), cerca de la entrada del Waterfront de Western Adoulin (F-5), y elige \"The Charlatan\" para ir directamente a la batalla.",
    ["Examine the Babbling Brook (F-5) again to fight Reikuu (about 90,000 HP). You have 15 minutes. Gessho helps and must survive (he can win even if your party falls). Both make clones; hitting the real Reikuu with a weapon skill or AoE staggers him and removes his clones. His Mijin Gakure can deal over 2,000 even in DT gear."] = "Examina de nuevo el Babbling Brook (F-5) para luchar contra Reikuu (unos 90,000 HP). Tienes 15 minutos. Gessho ayuda y debe sobrevivir (puede ganar aunque caiga tu grupo). Ambos crean clones; golpear al Reikuu real con un weapon skill o un ataque de área lo aturde y le quita los clones. Su Mijin Gakure puede hacer más de 2,000 incluso con equipo de DT.",
    ["Examine the Babbling Brook (F-5) again to fight Zhuu Buxu (about 125,000 HP, Mijin Gakure). You have 15 minutes. It uses the Omen queue; Trusts allowed. Nii Aquu helps and must stay alive. A cutscene follows."] = "Examina de nuevo el Babbling Brook (F-5) para luchar contra Zhuu Buxu (unos 125,000 HP, Mijin Gakure). Tienes 15 minutos. Usa la cola de Omen; se permiten Trusts. Nii Aquu ayuda y debe seguir con vida. Después hay una escena.",
    ["Examine the Babbling Brook (F-5) at (F-5), Ingress #4, for a cutscene."] = "Examina el Babbling Brook (F-5) en (F-5), Ingress #4, para una escena.",
    ["Examine the Babbling Brook (F-5) in the river at (F-5), Ethereal Ingress #4, for a cutscene."] = "Examina el Babbling Brook (F-5) del río en (F-5), Ethereal Ingress #4, para una escena.",
    ["Examine the Beastmen's Banner (F-8) while wearing the barbut to spawn the Diamond Quadav (WHM) and six other Quadav NMs. Only the Diamond Quadav has to be defeated; the others then disappear. It can use Benediction, which heals and wakes the NMs around it."] = "Examina el Beastmen's Banner (F-8) llevando el barbut para hacer aparecer al Diamond Quadav (WHM) y otros seis NMs Quadav. Solo hay que derrotar al Diamond Quadav; los demás desaparecen entonces. Puede usar Benediction, que cura y despierta a los NMs de alrededor.",
    ["Examine the Beastmen's Banner again while wearing the barbut for a cutscene, then trade the Quadav Barbut to it to receive Da'Vhu's Barbut."] = "Examina de nuevo el Beastmen's Banner llevando el barbut para una escena y luego entrégale el Quadav Barbut para recibir el Da'Vhu's Barbut.",
    ["Examine the Blank Target in East Ronfaure [S] (H-7, northwest corner of the square) for a cutscene and the key item Ronfaure dawndrop."] = "Examina el Blank Target de East Ronfaure [S] (H-7, esquina noroeste de la cuadrícula) para una escena y el key item Ronfaure dawndrop.",
    ["Examine the Blockaded Path at (G-11), almost (F-11), in Kamihr Drifts to enter Leafallia. Bivouac #2 is closest; it is southeast of the Hollowed Pathway from Soul Siphon."] = "Examina el Blockaded Path de (G-11), casi en (F-11), de Kamihr Drifts para entrar en Leafallia. El Bivouac #2 es el más cercano; está al sureste del Hollowed Pathway de Soul Siphon.",
    ["Examine the Bulwark Gate again."] = "Examina de nuevo la Bulwark Gate.",
    ["Examine the Bulwark Gate in Sauromugue Champaign (S) at (E-6) again."] = "Examina de nuevo la Bulwark Gate en Sauromugue Champaign (S) en (E-6).",
    ["Examine the Bulwark Gate in Sauromugue Champaign (S) at (E-6); the Atmacite Refiner's Voidwatch warp or the Campaign Arbiter warp is closest."] = "Examina la Bulwark Gate de Sauromugue Champaign (S) en (E-6); el warp de Voidwatch del Atmacite Refiner o el warp del Campaign Arbiter es lo más cercano.",
    ["Examine the Bulwark Gate in Sauromugue Champaign [S] (E-6) for a cutscene."] = "Examina la Bulwark Gate de Sauromugue Champaign [S] (E-6) para una escena.",
    ["Examine the Bulwark Gate in Sauromugue Champaign [S] (E-6/F-6) for a cutscene. Fastest: the past Atmacite Refiner warp; otherwise your nation's Campaign Arbiter warp and ride northwest, or the Rolanberry Fields Survival Guide and the Voidwatch passage beside it."] = "Examina la Bulwark Gate de Sauromugue Champaign [S] (E-6/F-6) para una escena. Lo más rápido: el warp del Atmacite Refiner del pasado; si no, el warp del Campaign Arbiter de tu nación y cabalgar al noroeste, o la Survival Guide de Rolanberry Fields y el pasaje de Voidwatch de al lado.",
    ["Examine the Bulwark Gate in Sauromugue Champaign [S] (F-6) for a cutscene with the survivors of Operation Snowstorm. Fastest is an Atmacite Refiner's Voidwatch warp from a past city; otherwise the Rolanberry Fields Survival Guide through the Maw."] = "Examina la Bulwark Gate de Sauromugue Champaign [S] (F-6) para una escena con los supervivientes de la Operation Snowstorm. Lo más rápido es un warp de Voidwatch del Atmacite Refiner desde una ciudad del pasado; si no, la Survival Guide de Rolanberry Fields cruzando el Maw.",
    ["Examine the Bulwark Gate in Sauromugue Champaign [S] (F-6) for a cutscene. The Sauromugue Champaign [S] Voidwatch warp puts you right there; otherwise take the Rolanberry Fields Survival Guide through the Maw and walk."] = "Examina la Bulwark Gate de Sauromugue Champaign [S] (F-6) para una escena. El warp de Voidwatch de Sauromugue Champaign [S] te deja justo allí; si no, toma la Survival Guide de Rolanberry Fields, cruza el Maw y camina.",
    ["Examine the Burning Circle at Qu'Bia Arena for a cutscene, then again to enter the battlefield. Trusts are allowed."] = "Examina el Burning Circle de Qu'Bia Arena para una escena, y de nuevo para entrar en el campo de batalla. Se permiten Trusts.",
    ["Examine the Burning Circle to enter the BCNM \"The Rank 5 Mission\". You only need to defeat Archlich Taber'quoan, a Black Mage who casts Sleepga II and Freeze and may use Manafont. He starts with two Ancient Sorcerers, and Ancient Warriors run in from the hallway to help; the skeletons have little HP and take extra damage from blunt weapons. Winning gives a cutscene and the key item Burnt seal."] = "Examina el Burning Circle para entrar en el BCNM \"The Rank 5 Mission\". Solo tienes que derrotar a Archlich Taber'quoan, un Black Mage que lanza Sleepga II y Freeze y puede usar Manafont. Empieza con dos Ancient Sorcerers, y los Ancient Warriors llegan corriendo del pasillo para ayudar; los esqueletos tienen poco HP y reciben daño extra de las armas contundentes. Ganar da una escena y el key item Burnt seal.",
    ["Examine the Burning Circle to enter the battlefield \"On My Way\" (6 people, no level cap, no experience loss, buffs removed, Trusts allowed). You face four Quadavs that each use their two-hour ability: Sa'Nha Soulsaver (WHM), Go'Bha Slaughterer (DRK), Ku'Jhu Graniteskin (WAR) and Da'Shu Knightslayer (RDM). Sleep them and fight one at a time, pulling the White Mage first, down to the bottom of the ramp, so Benediction doesn't wake the others."] = "Examina el Burning Circle para entrar en el campo de batalla \"On My Way\" (6 personas, sin límite de nivel, sin pérdida de experiencia, se quitan los buffs, se permiten Trusts). Te enfrentas a cuatro Quadavs que usan cada uno su habilidad de dos horas: Sa'Nha Soulsaver (WHM), Go'Bha Slaughterer (DRK), Ku'Jhu Graniteskin (WAR) y Da'Shu Knightslayer (RDM). Duérmelos y lucha de uno en uno, atrayendo primero al White Mage hasta el pie de la rampa, para que Benediction no despierte a los demás.",
    ["Examine the Cermet Portal again."] = "Examina de nuevo el Cermet Portal.",
    ["Examine the Cracked Wall again (several times if needed) for a cutscene and the key item Orastery ring."] = "Examina de nuevo la Cracked Wall (varias veces si hace falta) para una escena y el key item Orastery ring.",
    ["Examine the Cracked Wall at (G-8) to spawn Queen of Coins and Queen of Swords."] = "Examina la Cracked Wall en (G-8) para invocar a Queen of Coins y Queen of Swords.",
    ["Examine the Cracked Wall at (I-8)."] = "Examina la Cracked Wall en (I-8).",
    ["Examine the Crawling Cave at (F-11) in Kamihr Drifts for a long cutscene and the Aureate ball of fur. You don't fight Kumhau here."] = "Examina la Crawling Cave de (F-11) en Kamihr Drifts para una escena larga y el Aureate ball of fur. Aquí no luchas contra Kumhau.",
    ["Examine the Cryptexphere (F-6) while wearing the helm to spawn the Orcish Overlord and six other Orc NMs. Only the Orcish Overlord has to be defeated; the others then disappear."] = "Examina la Cryptexphere (F-6) llevando el casco para hacer aparecer al Orcish Overlord y otros seis NMs Orc. Solo hay que derrotar al Orcish Overlord; los demás desaparecen entonces.",
    ["Examine the Cryptexphere again while wearing the helm for a cutscene, then trade the Orc Helm to it to receive Gadzradd's Helm."] = "Examina de nuevo la Cryptexphere llevando el casco para una escena y luego entrégale el Orc Helm para recibir el Gadzradd's Helm.",
    ["Examine the Crystalline Field at (H-11) in Al'Taieu for a brief cutscene. The Auroral Updraft at (H-12) (red pillar of light) takes you to Sealion's Den, and Sueleen there sends you back."] = "Examina el Crystalline Field de (H-11) en Al'Taieu para una escena breve. El Auroral Updraft de (H-12) (columna de luz roja) te lleva a Sealion's Den, y Sueleen allí te devuelve.",
    ["Examine the Darkened Crevice (G-8) again to enter \"The Gates\" battle against waves of Umbrils. It starts after about a minute, so buff and call Trusts."] = "Examina de nuevo la Darkened Crevice (G-8) para entrar en la batalla \"The Gates\" contra oleadas de Umbrils. Empieza tras un minuto aproximadamente, así que poténciate y llama a los Trusts.",
    ["Examine the Darkened Crevice (G-8) in Woh Gates, just inside the tunnel before the downward slope at the (G-7)/(G-8) border, for a cutscene and the Tuft of golden fur (the battle's entry item)."] = "Examina la Darkened Crevice (G-8) de Woh Gates, justo dentro del túnel antes de la pendiente de bajada en el límite entre (G-7) y (G-8), para una escena y el Tuft of golden fur (el objeto de entrada a la batalla).",
    ["Examine the Dilapidated Gate in Misareaux Coast (F-7) for a cutscene. The Unity warp puts you right in front of this gate."] = "Examina la Dilapidated Gate en Misareaux Coast (F-7) para una escena. El warp de Unity te deja justo delante de esta puerta.",
    ["Examine the Dimensional Portal at the Crag of Holla, Dem or Mea and choose Reisenjima. You get a cutscene on arrival."] = "Examina el Dimensional Portal del Crag of Holla, Dem o Mea y elige Reisenjima. Al llegar ves una escena.",
    ["Examine the Disturbed Earth again after the fight for a cutscene."] = "Examina de nuevo la Disturbed Earth tras la pelea para una escena.",
    ["Examine the Disturbed Earth again to fight a Yagudo Vicar (WHM), Yagudo Centurion (BLM) and two Yagudo Underlings (NIN, MNK). You have 15 minutes. Each has about 30,000 HP and its SP ability. King of Spades (PLD) helps you and you lose if he dies; they all go for him first. AA TT's Sleepga works."] = "Examina de nuevo la Disturbed Earth para luchar contra un Yagudo Vicar (WHM), un Yagudo Centurion (BLM) y dos Yagudo Underlings (NIN, MNK). Tienes 15 minutos. Cada uno tiene unos 30,000 HP y su habilidad SP. King of Spades (PLD) te ayuda y pierdes si muere; todos van primero a por él. El Sleepga de AA TT funciona.",
    ["Examine the Door: Merchant's House in Lower Jeuno (G-11) again for another cutscene."] = "Examina de nuevo la Door: Merchant's House en Lower Jeuno (G-11) para otra escena.",
    ["Examine the Door: Merchant's House in Lower Jeuno for a cutscene and your rewards."] = "Examina la Door: Merchant's House en Lower Jeuno para una escena y tus recompensas.",
    ["Examine the Egg Discovery Site again for a cutscene."] = "Examina de nuevo el Egg Discovery Site para una escena.",
    ["Examine the Egg Discovery Site at (F-9) for a cutscene. Noillurie must not be away on a Campaign operation; the site tells you if she is."] = "Examina el Egg Discovery Site de (F-9) para una escena. Noillurie no debe estar fuera en una operación de Campaign; el lugar te dice si lo está.",
    ["Examine the Elegant Footprints in Jugner Forest [S] (I-6), by the tree stump near the H-6/I-6 border just over the makeshift bridge from East Ronfaure [S] (the East Ronfaure [S] Survival Guide is closest)."] = "Examina las Elegant Footprints de Jugner Forest [S] (I-6), junto al tocón cerca del límite entre H-6 e I-6, justo pasado el puente improvisado desde East Ronfaure [S] (la Survival Guide de East Ronfaure [S] es la más cercana).",
    ["Examine the Entrance: Coliseum at (M-6) in Rala Waterways to fight Teodor."] = "Examina la Entrance: Coliseum de (M-6) en Rala Waterways para luchar contra Teodor.",
    ["Examine the Ergon Locus ??? again to spawn Deranged Ameretat (about 75,000 HP). It uses Sweet Breath and Bad Breath, and below 50% Extremely Bad Breath, which it skips while an enfeebling Indi- or Geo- effect is up. It has very high magic evasion and resists nearly all enfeebles, including Stun; ranged Trusts such as Apururu, Semih Lafihna or Tenzen II work well."] = "Examina de nuevo la ??? Ergon Locus para hacer aparecer a Deranged Ameretat (unos 75,000 HP). Usa Sweet Breath y Bad Breath, y por debajo del 50% Extremely Bad Breath, que no usa mientras haya activo un efecto Indi- o Geo- de debilitamiento. Tiene una evasión mágica muy alta y resiste casi todos los debilitamientos, incluido Stun; los Trusts a distancia como Apururu, Semih Lafihna o Tenzen II funcionan bien.",
    ["Examine the Fossil Rock at (F-8) on map 2 to spawn the NM Ichorous Ire, which drops a Burnite Shell."] = "Examina la Fossil Rock en (F-8) del mapa 2 para invocar al NM Ichorous Ire, que suelta una Burnite Shell.",
    ["Examine the Galka Statue again."] = "Examina de nuevo la Galka Statue.",
    ["Examine the Gate of Darkness (south-eastern door, I-7) on Map 4 of Inner Horutoto Ruins for a cutscene. Fastest is the Toraimarai Canal Survival Guide and back through the canal (or the Priming Gate in Windurst Walls H-3); entering through the Ruins means passing the Three Mage Gate."] = "Examina la Gate of Darkness (puerta sureste, I-7) en el mapa 4 de Inner Horutoto Ruins para una escena. Lo más rápido es la Survival Guide de Toraimarai Canal y volver por el canal (o la Priming Gate de Windurst Walls H-3); entrar por las Ruins obliga a pasar la Three Mage Gate.",
    ["Examine the Gate: Magical Gizmo again for a cutscene. If you see \"A mysterious force is interfering\", wait until the NMs have fully despawned and try again."] = "Examina de nuevo la Gate: Magical Gizmo para una escena. Si ves \"A mysterious force is interfering\", espera a que los NMs hayan desaparecido del todo y vuelve a intentarlo.",
    ["Examine the Glowing Pebbles at (I-5) for a cutscene, then, on Dancer, trade them the Yagudo Glue for another."] = "Examina los Glowing Pebbles en (I-5) para una escena y luego, como Dancer, entrégales el Yagudo Glue para otra.",
    ["Examine the Gravestone at (H-8) to obtain the middle map piece."] = "Examina la Gravestone en (H-8) para obtener la pieza de mapa central.",
    ["Examine the Great Hall behind Halver."] = "Examina el Great Hall detrás de Halver.",
    ["Examine the Great Hall."] = "Examina el Great Hall.",
    ["Examine the Heavy Stone Door to face Corrupted Soffeil, Corrupted Yorgos, and Corrupted Ulbrig."] = "Examina la Heavy Stone Door para enfrentarte a Corrupted Soffeil, Corrupted Yorgos y Corrupted Ulbrig.",
    ["Examine the Heroic Footprints at (H-8) in Leafallia, by a tree across the stream behind the Aged Stump, for a long cutscene."] = "Examina las Heroic Footprints de (H-8) en Leafallia, junto a un árbol al otro lado del arroyo detrás del Aged Stump, para una escena larga.",
    ["Examine the Hollowed Pathway again to enter the Stonewalled battle. Solo with Trusts is fine; there is a 30-minute limit and buffs other than food wear off."] = "Examina de nuevo el Hollowed Pathway para entrar en la batalla Stonewalled. En solitario con Trusts sirve; hay un límite de 30 minutos y los buffs que no sean de comida desaparecen.",
    ["Examine the Hollowed Pathway in the southwest corner of (G-11) in Kamihr Drifts and choose \"Proceed\" for a cutscene. This does not start the battle yet."] = "Examina el Hollowed Pathway de la esquina suroeste de (G-11) en Kamihr Drifts y elige \"Proceed\" para una escena. Esto aún no empieza la batalla.",
    ["Examine the Hut Door to enter the battlefield."] = "Examina la Hut Door para entrar en el campo de batalla.",
    ["Examine the Imperial Whitegate (L-8/9) in Aht Urhgan Whitegate while Aphmau is in town."] = "Examina la Imperial Whitegate (L-8/9) de Aht Urhgan Whitegate mientras Aphmau esté en la ciudad.",
    ["Examine the Imperial Whitegate (L-9) in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (L-9), Home Point #2, for a cutscene."] = "Examina la Imperial Whitegate (L-9) de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (L-9), Home Point #2, para una escena.",
    ["Examine the Imperial Whitegate in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (L-8) for a cutscene. Other cutscenes can play first, so keep examining it until this quest shows as active in your log. From here you no longer need to be on Blue Mage."] = "Examina la Imperial Whitegate en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (L-8) para una escena. Pueden salir otras escenas antes, así que sigue examinándola hasta que esta quest aparezca activa en tu registro. A partir de aquí ya no necesitas ser Blue Mage.",
    ["Examine the Imperial Whitegate in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (L-8/9) to receive the key item Imperial missive. The quest now appears under Aht Urhgan: Current Quests."] = "Examina la Imperial Whitegate en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (L-8/9) para recibir el key item Imperial missive. La quest aparece ahora en Aht Urhgan: Current Quests.",
    ["Examine the Imperial Whitegate in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (L-8/9) to receive the key item Present for Megomak."] = "Examina la Imperial Whitegate en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (L-8/9) para recibir el key item Present for Megomak.",
    ["Examine the Imperial Whitegate in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (L-8/9)."] = "Examina la Imperial Whitegate en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (L-8/9).",
    ["Examine the Inconspicuous Barrel in Western Adoulin (I-4) for a cutscene; it takes the Rune saber and the gem."] = "Examina el Inconspicuous Barrel de Western Adoulin (I-4) para una escena; se queda con el Rune saber y la gema.",
    ["Examine the Inconspicuous Barrel in Western Adoulin (I-4), near the Adoulin Waterfront waypoint, to hand over the Secrets of Runic Enhancement."] = "Examina el Inconspicuous Barrel de Western Adoulin (I-4), cerca del waypoint de Adoulin Waterfront, para entregar los Secrets of Runic Enhancement.",
    ["Examine the Inconspicuous Door (H-8) in Upper Jeuno (H-8), across from Durable Shields for a cutscene."] = "Examina la Inconspicuous Door (H-8) de Upper Jeuno (H-8), frente a Durable Shields, para una escena.",
    ["Examine the Inconspicuous Door (H-8) in Upper Jeuno (H-8), across from Durable Shields once per key item (three cutscenes)."] = "Examina la Inconspicuous Door (H-8) de Upper Jeuno (H-8), frente a Durable Shields, una vez por key item (tres escenas).",
    ["Examine the Indescript Markings along the north edge of (E-11) in Pashhow Marshlands (S), by the wall, for the key item Unaddressed sealed letter. The Recall-Pashh telepoint and the Survival Guide put you at the south end of the map, a short walk west."] = "Examina las Indescript Markings del borde norte de (E-11) en Pashhow Marshlands (S), junto a la pared, para obtener el key item Unaddressed sealed letter. El telepunto Recall-Pashh y la Survival Guide te dejan en el extremo sur del mapa, a poca distancia al oeste.",
    ["Examine the Indescript Markings on the cave wall to enter the battlefield in Ruhotz Silvermines. The party leader must have the quest; up to 6 can enter, Trusts are allowed, 30 minute limit."] = "Examina las Indescript Markings de la pared de la cueva para entrar en el campo de batalla de Ruhotz Silvermines. El líder del grupo debe tener la quest; pueden entrar hasta 6, se permiten Trusts, límite de 30 minutos.",
    ["Examine the Indescript Markings on the ledge in the south-east corner of (J-7) in Sauromugue Champaign (S), near a ???, for a cutscene and the key item Ulbrecht's mortarboard. They disappear during dust (earth) weather."] = "Examina las Indescript Markings de la cornisa de la esquina sureste de (J-7) en Sauromugue Champaign (S), cerca de una ???, para una escena y el key item Ulbrecht's mortarboard. Desaparecen con clima de polvo (tierra).",
    ["Examine the Iron Box again while wearing the coif for a cutscene, then trade the Goblin Coif to it to receive Choplix's Coif."] = "Examina de nuevo la Iron Box llevando la cofia para una escena y luego entrégale el Goblin Coif para recibir el Choplix's Coif.",
    ["Examine the Leypoint (G-8) in Wajaom Woodlands (G-8) for a cutscene (Olduum Ring, Survival Guide or Unity Warp level 125)."] = "Examina el Leypoint (G-8) de Wajaom Woodlands (G-8) para una escena (Olduum Ring, Survival Guide o Unity Warp de nivel 125).",
    ["Examine the Library Book on the east wall of the Optistery in Windurst Waters North (G-7)."] = "Examina el Library Book de la pared este de la Optistery en Windurst Waters North (G-7).",
    ["Examine the Mahogany Door again and enter Project: Shantottofication. Tablets are used on entry; a full set gives +150 to elemental resistances and all stats, triple HP and MP, and a Reraise without Weakness. Soloable in item level 119 gear with Trusts."] = "Examina de nuevo la Mahogany Door y entra en Project: Shantottofication. Las tablillas se usan al entrar; un juego completo da +150 a las resistencias elementales y a todos los atributos, el triple de HP y MP, y un Reraise sin Weakness. Se puede hacer en solitario con equipo de item level 119 y Trusts.",
    ["Examine the Mahogany Door at (G-8) for a cutscene."] = "Examina la Mahogany Door de (G-8) para una escena.",
    ["Examine the Mahogany Door at (G-8) to confirm the Windurst Woods scoop."] = "Examina la Mahogany Door en (G-8) para confirmar la Windurst Woods scoop.",
    ["Examine the Mahogany Door for a cutscene."] = "Examina la Mahogany Door para una escena.",
    ["Examine the Memory Flux again."] = "Examina de nuevo el Memory Flux.",
    ["Examine the Memory Flux."] = "Examina el Memory Flux.",
    ["Examine the Mine Shaft #2716 entrance again and choose \"To Movalpolos!\" to fight Gloom Phantom, Awoken Vampyr Jarl, Awoken Ariri Samariri (can use Death) and Awoken Hildesvini. Trusts allowed; Jabbos can tank one (he engages when you draw your weapon). A cutscene and your reward follow."] = "Examina de nuevo la entrada de Mine Shaft #2716 y elige \"To Movalpolos!\" para luchar contra Gloom Phantom, Awoken Vampyr Jarl, Awoken Ariri Samariri (puede usar Death) y Awoken Hildesvini. Se permiten Trusts; Jabbos puede tanquear a uno (entra en combate cuando desenfundas). Después hay una escena y tu recompensa.",
    ["Examine the Molten Rift again to spawn Staumarth and defeat it (any job; the Apex Efts nearby don't aggro). It resists everything but Thunder and uses Spectral Floe and Scouring Spate. If you lose, just examine the Rift again; no new Ifritite needed. You receive the key item Frost-encrusted flame gem."] = "Examina de nuevo la Molten Rift para hacer aparecer a Staumarth y derrótalo (cualquier job; los Apex Efts de alrededor no atacan). Resiste todo menos Thunder y usa Spectral Floe y Scouring Spate. Si pierdes, examina de nuevo la Rift; no hace falta otra Ifritite. Recibes el key item Frost-encrusted flame gem.",
    ["Examine the Moogle Meeting (H-10) spot again to fight Spikehelm Argok (Orc DRK), Tethys (Gigas MNK), Garmatur the Merciless (Troll RDM) and Antican Curule Aedillis (BLM). Trusts allowed; all can be slept and silenced. A cutscene and your reward follow."] = "Examina de nuevo el punto Moogle Meeting (H-10) para luchar contra Spikehelm Argok (Orc DRK), Tethys (Gigas MNK), Garmatur the Merciless (Troll RDM) y Antican Curule Aedillis (BLM). Se permiten Trusts; todos se pueden dormir y silenciar. Después hay una escena y tu recompensa.",
    ["Examine the Moon Spiral again (with at least one sap) and enter the Battaru Royale battlefield. Trusts allowed."] = "Examina de nuevo la Moon Spiral (con al menos una savia) y entra en el campo de batalla Battaru Royale. Se permiten Trusts.",
    ["Examine the Mossy Stump in the lower right of (F-7) for a cutscene, then again to enter a battlefield against a Young Behemoth."] = "Examina el Mossy Stump de la parte inferior derecha de (F-7) para una escena, y de nuevo para entrar en un campo de batalla contra un Young Behemoth.",
    ["Examine the Night Flowers down the ramp in Qufim Island (F-8) between 21:30 and 4:00 for a cutscene."] = "Examina las Night Flowers por la rampa de Qufim Island (F-8) entre las 21:30 y las 4:00 para una escena.",
    ["Examine the Odyssean Passage and enter it for a cutscene that completes the quest. You can now take part in Monstrosity."] = "Examina el Odyssean Passage y entra para una escena que completa la quest. Ya puedes participar en Monstrosity.",
    ["Examine the Old Toolbox at the intersection of (H-7) and (H-8) to receive the key item Old toolbox."] = "Examina el Old Toolbox en la intersección de (H-7) y (H-8) para recibir el key item Old toolbox.",
    ["Examine the Ominous Postern in Ra'Kaznar Turris to fight Hades (first form) with Arciela. The mission fails if she dies. Drawing your weapon starts the fight."] = "Examina el Ominous Postern de Ra'Kaznar Turris para luchar contra Hades (primera forma) con Arciela. La misión falla si muere. Desenfundar el arma empieza la pelea.",
    ["Examine the Ominous Postern in Ra'Kaznar Turris to fight Hades (second form). Drawing your weapon starts the fight."] = "Examina el Ominous Postern de Ra'Kaznar Turris para luchar contra Hades (segunda forma). Desenfundar el arma empieza la pelea.",
    ["Examine the Optistery door in Windurst Waters (S) (F-8); they ask for a Vellum (Leathercraft or Auction House) and a Lynx Pelt."] = "Examina la Optistery door en Windurst Waters (S) (F-8); piden un Vellum (Leathercraft o Auction House) y una Lynx Pelt.",
    ["Examine the Ornamental Door again to enter the battlefield (Trusts allowed)."] = "Examina de nuevo la Ornamental Door para entrar en el campo de batalla (se permiten Trusts).",
    ["Examine the Ornamental Door for a cutscene."] = "Examina la Ornamental Door para una escena.",
    ["Examine the Ornate Door again to enter the battlefield."] = "Examina de nuevo la Ornate Door para entrar en el campo de batalla.",
    ["Examine the Outcropping (F-10) again for the final cutscene. The final cutscene often freezes under Ashita or Windower, even at the default frame rate. The mission still counts: disconnect and log back in. The Goblin Footprint at (K-6)/(K-7) replays it if you trade it an item or gil (returned)."] = "Examina de nuevo el Outcropping (F-10) para la última escena. La última escena suele congelarse con Ashita o Windower, incluso con los FPS por defecto. La misión cuenta igualmente: desconéctate y vuelve a entrar. La Goblin Footprint de (K-6)/(K-7) la vuelve a reproducir si le entregas un objeto o gil (te lo devuelve).",
    ["Examine the Outcropping (F-10) at (F-10) in Gustav Tunnel again to start the fight; the Black book is used up, so you need another if you lose."] = "Examina de nuevo el Outcropping (F-10) en (F-10) de Gustav Tunnel para empezar la pelea; el Black book se gasta, así que necesitarás otro si pierdes.",
    ["Examine the Overgrown Grave again to spawn Ancestral Rage (about 70,000 HP). It has very high physical damage reduction (Monk's Formless Strikes doesn't work on it) and uses high-tier Earth and Dark magic, Sleepga II, area Drain and Aspir, Entomb (Petrify, Slow, hate reset) and Tenebral Crush (Defense Down). Repose and Lullaby can sleep it."] = "Examina de nuevo la Overgrown Grave para hacer aparecer a Ancestral Rage (unos 70,000 HP). Tiene una reducción de daño físico muy alta (las Formless Strikes de Monk no funcionan con él) y usa magia de Earth y Dark de alto nivel, Sleepga II, Drain y Aspir de área, Entomb (Petrify, Slow, reinicio del odio) y Tenebral Crush (Defense Down). Repose y Lullaby pueden dormirlo.",
    ["Examine the Point of Interest again after the fight for a cutscene."] = "Examina de nuevo el Point of Interest tras la pelea para una escena.",
    ["Examine the Point of Interest again to fight Slackjawed Mukdrom (WAR, about 50,000 HP, repeated Mighty Strikes, drain on hit)."] = "Examina de nuevo el Point of Interest para luchar contra Slackjawed Mukdrom (WAR, unos 50,000 HP, Mighty Strikes repetido, drena al golpear).",
    ["Examine the Primordial Convergence again for a cutscene and your reward. If you lose, Dabnorrin sells another Vessel of summoning for 5,000 Bayld, 10 Beastmen's Seals or 50,000 gil."] = "Examina de nuevo la Primordial Convergence para una escena y tu recompensa. Si pierdes, Dabnorrin vende otro Vessel of summoning por 5,000 Bayld, 10 Beastmen's Seals o 50,000 gil.",
    ["Examine the Prince's Royal Room (G/H-7) again to unlock Trust: Trion."] = "Examina de nuevo la Prince's Royal Room (G/H-7) para desbloquear Trust: Trion.",
    ["Examine the Prince's Royal Room (G/H-7)."] = "Examina la Prince's Royal Room (G/H-7).",
    ["Examine the Qu'Hau Spring in Ro'Maeve (H-6) for a cutscene; the Ro'Maeve Survival Guide is fastest."] = "Examina la Qu'Hau Spring de Ro'Maeve (H-6) para una escena; la Survival Guide de Ro'Maeve es lo más rápido.",
    ["Examine the Quadav Inquest (I-9) at (I-9) for a cutscene."] = "Examina la Quadav Inquest (I-9) en (I-9) para una escena.",
    ["Examine the Regal Pawprints (G-9) on the high ground southwest of the Campaign Arbiter, on the same level (don't go to the tower or down the ramp), for a cutscene."] = "Examina las Regal Pawprints (G-9) en el terreno elevado al suroeste del Campaign Arbiter, al mismo nivel (no vayas a la torre ni bajes la rampa), para una escena.",
    ["Examine the Reinforced Gateway."] = "Examina el Reinforced Gateway.",
    ["Examine the Riverbed, choose a portion (sizable, moderate or small) and then how to wash (vigorously, thoroughly or gently), washing away as much sediment as you can without losing gold dust. Results are random, but \"A sizable portion\", \"Wash vigorously\", \"Wash thoroughly\" and then \"Wash gently\" over and over usually works until \"Wash carefully to extract gold\" appears; choose it."] = "Examina el Riverbed, elige una porción (sizable, moderate o small) y luego cómo lavar (vigorously, thoroughly o gently), quitando todo el sedimento posible sin perder polvo de oro. Los resultados son aleatorios, pero \"A sizable portion\", \"Wash vigorously\", \"Wash thoroughly\" y luego \"Wash gently\" una y otra vez suele funcionar hasta que aparece \"Wash carefully to extract gold\"; elígelo.",
    ["Examine the Rubious Crystal again."] = "Examina de nuevo el Rubious Crystal.",
    ["Examine the Rune of Release before the time limit runs out, or the mission fails even if all the objectives were met. Then speak with Rytaal in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10) to finalize the mission and hand back the Assault Orders."] = "Examina la Rune of Release antes de que se acabe el tiempo, o la misión falla aunque se hayan cumplido todos los objetivos. Después habla con Rytaal en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10) para cerrar la misión y devolver las Assault Orders.",
    ["Examine the Runic Seal in Alzadaal Undersea Ruins (I-8/9) to start the battle against Alexander; Trusts can't be used. He can spawn up to three Alexander Images, and at low HP uses Divine Judgment, dealing high damage to everyone in range."] = "Examina el Runic Seal en Alzadaal Undersea Ruins (I-8/9) para empezar la batalla contra Alexander; no se pueden usar Trusts. Puede hacer aparecer hasta tres Alexander Images y, con HP bajo, usa Divine Judgment, que causa mucho daño a todos los que estén en su alcance.",
    ["Examine the Runic Seal in Alzadaal Undersea Ruins (I-8/9) to start the battle against Alexander; Trusts can't be used. He can spawn up to three Alexander Images, and at low HP uses Divine Judgment, dealing high damage to everyone in range. The fight is aimed at level 75."] = "Examina el Runic Seal en Alzadaal Undersea Ruins (I-8/9) para empezar la batalla contra Alexander; no se pueden usar Trusts. Puede hacer aparecer hasta tres Alexander Images y, con HP bajo, usa Divine Judgment, que causa mucho daño a todos los que estén en su alcance. La pelea está pensada para nivel 75.",
    ["Examine the Sanctorium crystal in the Reisenjima Sanctorium for a cutscene."] = "Examina el Sanctorium crystal en el Reisenjima Sanctorium para una escena.",
    ["Examine the Sarcophagus at (I-9) to obtain the right map piece."] = "Examina el Sarcophagus en (I-9) para obtener la pieza de mapa derecha.",
    ["Examine the Secluded Spot again after the fight for a cutscene."] = "Examina de nuevo el Secluded Spot tras la pelea para una escena.",
    ["Examine the Secluded Spot again to fight Chepelle (BST). She starts with a tiger and calls a sheep at 75% and a hare at 50% (they don't need to die and can be slept), uses Familiar from 60% HP every minute, resists damage heavily, and favors Detonation and Distortion axe skillchains."] = "Examina de nuevo el Secluded Spot para luchar contra Chepelle (BST). Empieza con un tigre y llama a una oveja al 75% y a una liebre al 50% (no hace falta matarlas y se pueden dormir), usa Familiar a partir del 60% de HP cada minuto, resiste mucho el daño y prefiere skillchains de hacha de Detonation y Distortion.",
    ["Examine the Secluded Spot in West Sarutabaruta (J-8), south of the Tower behind the tree, for a cutscene. Windurst Waters Home Point #1 is closest."] = "Examina el Secluded Spot de West Sarutabaruta (J-8), al sur de la torre, detrás del árbol, para una escena. El Home Point #1 de Windurst Waters es el más cercano.",
    ["Examine the Seed Fragment (F-7) on the tenth floor."] = "Examina el Seed Fragment (F-7) del décimo piso.",
    ["Examine the Seed Fragment (G-6) on the fourth floor."] = "Examina el Seed Fragment (G-6) del cuarto piso.",
    ["Examine the Seed Fragment in each tower section to get a level 30 cap; only then can you collect that section's Seed Afterglows (stone key items). No Trusts, people outside the cap can't heal you, and you lose no experience if you die. Sprinter's Shoes (reapply after each cap) or a Destrier Beret help; bring Prism Powder and Silent Oil for the Dolls and Elementals."] = "Examina el Seed Fragment de cada sección de la torre para obtener un límite de nivel 30; solo entonces puedes reunir los Seed Afterglows de esa sección (key items de piedra). No hay Trusts, quien no tenga el límite no puede curarte y no pierdes experiencia si mueres. Las Sprinter's Shoes (vuelve a ponértelas tras cada límite) o una Destrier Beret ayudan; lleva Prism Powder y Silent Oil para los Dolls y los Elementals.",
    ["Examine the Shadowy Pillar (J-8) at Castle Zvahl Baileys (J-8)."] = "Examina el Shadowy Pillar (J-8) de Castle Zvahl Baileys (J-8).",
    ["Examine the Shattered Telepoint at the Crag of Holla, Dem or Mea to enter the Hall of Transference for a cutscene."] = "Examina el Shattered Telepoint del Crag of Holla, Dem o Mea para entrar en el Hall of Transference para una escena.",
    ["Examine the Shattered Telepoint."] = "Examina el Shattered Telepoint.",
    ["Examine the Shimmering Circle in the Chamber of Oracles (Quicksand Caves Home Point #1) and enter the battlefield. Trusts allowed."] = "Examina el Shimmering Circle de la Chamber of Oracles (Home Point #1 de Quicksand Caves) y entra en el campo de batalla. Se permiten Trusts.",
    ["Examine the Sluice Gate (C-6) and go to the hideout behind it."] = "Examina la Sluice Gate (C-6) y ve al escondite que hay detrás.",
    ["Examine the Spatial Displacement around (D-6)."] = "Examina el Spatial Displacement cerca de (D-6).",
    ["Examine the Spatial Displacement to enter the Ouryu battlefield."] = "Examina el Spatial Displacement para entrar en el campo de batalla Ouryu.",
    ["Examine the Stalagmite (D-9) at (D-9) on Map 1 (the first map, bottom level; skip the upper path) for a cutscene."] = "Examina la Stalagmite (D-9) en (D-9) del mapa 1 (el primer mapa, nivel inferior; sáltate el camino de arriba) para una escena.",
    ["Examine the Stalagmite in the circular room at (H-10) on map 2 to spawn Polevik, an Earth Elemental. Don't fall down the hole in this room."] = "Examina la Stalagmite de la sala circular de (H-10) en el mapa 2 para hacer aparecer a Polevik, un Earth Elemental. No caigas por el agujero de esta sala.",
    ["Examine the Stone Door to enter Promyvion-Vahzl."] = "Examina la Stone Door para entrar en Promyvion-Vahzl.",
    ["Examine the Stone Door to face the Golem Nunyunuwi: only about 3,800 HP but around 100 HP/tick Regen, so burst it down."] = "Examina la Stone Door para enfrentarte al Golem Nunyunuwi: solo unos 3,800 HP pero un Regen de unos 100 HP por tick, así que acaba con él rápido.",
    ["Examine the Stone Lid while wearing the headgear to spawn the Yagudo Avatar with Duu Masa the Onecut, Fee Jugu the Ramfist, Goo Pake the Bloodhound, Kee Taw the Nightingale, Laa Yaku the Austere and Poo Yozo the Babbler. Only the Yagudo Avatar must be defeated; the others then despawn. Examine the Stone Lid again, wearing the headgear, for a cutscene."] = "Examina la Stone Lid llevando el tocado para hacer aparecer al Yagudo Avatar con Duu Masa the Onecut, Fee Jugu the Ramfist, Goo Pake the Bloodhound, Kee Taw the Nightingale, Laa Yaku the Austere y Poo Yozo the Babbler. Solo hay que derrotar al Yagudo Avatar; los demás desaparecen entonces. Examina de nuevo la Stone Lid, llevando el tocado, para una escena.",
    ["Examine the Suspicious Overgrowth (H-6) at (H-6), between Ingress #3 and #5, for a cutscene, then trade it the three Hoptoad and the Eastern Ginger for another."] = "Examina el Suspicious Overgrowth (H-6) en (H-6), entre los Ingress #3 y #5, para una escena, y luego entrégale los tres Hoptoad y el Eastern Ginger para otra.",
    ["Examine the Tenshodo Treasure Coffer (J-8) in Tenshodo HQ, Lower Jeuno (J-8), and use the Angel skin key: Champion's Galea, Anwig Salade or Selenian Cap."] = "Examina el Tenshodo Treasure Coffer (J-8) en el cuartel del Tenshodo, Lower Jeuno (J-8), y usa la Angel skin key: Champion's Galea, Anwig Salade o Selenian Cap.",
    ["Examine the Tenshodo Treasure Coffer (J-8) in Tenshodo HQ, Lower Jeuno, and choose Nuevo Coselete, Mirke Wardecors or Royal Redingote."] = "Examina el Tenshodo Treasure Coffer (J-8) en el cuartel del Tenshodo, Lower Jeuno, y elige Nuevo Coselete, Mirke Wardecors o Royal Redingote.",
    ["Examine the Throne Room door again to enter battle. The humanoid opponent uses sword weapon skills plus Temblor Blade (AoE petrify) and Darkling Blade (knockback and curse); Zeid assists, and if he falls you lose."] = "Examina de nuevo la Throne Room door para entrar en combate. El oponente humanoide usa weapon skills de espada además de Temblor Blade (petrificación de área) y Darkling Blade (retroceso y maldición); Zeid ayuda, y si cae pierdes.",
    ["Examine the Throne Room door again to fight an Orcish Warchief (PLD; Blind aura), Yagudo Inquisitor (SAM; Addle aura) and Topaz Quadav (WHM; Slow aura). Each uses its SP ability and is easy to sleep and silence; auras end when the owner dies. Magh Bihu and Dazbog help once you draw your weapon."] = "Examina de nuevo la Throne Room door para luchar contra un Orcish Warchief (PLD; aura de Blind), un Yagudo Inquisitor (SAM; aura de Addle) y un Topaz Quadav (WHM; aura de Slow). Cada uno usa su habilidad SP y es fácil de dormir y silenciar; las auras terminan cuando muere su dueño. Magh Bihu y Dazbog ayudan cuando desenfundas el arma.",
    ["Examine the Throne Room door for a cutscene, then examine it again and choose \"The Shadow Lord Battle\". In his first form he switches between physical and magic immunity: rest MP while he is immune to magic (he uses Dark Nova and black magic then) and stop melee while he is immune to physical attacks (Giga Slash, Kick Back, Umbra Smash)."] = "Examina la Throne Room door para una escena, y de nuevo para elegir \"The Shadow Lord Battle\". En su primera forma alterna entre inmunidad física y mágica: recupera MP mientras es inmune a la magia (entonces usa Dark Nova y magia negra) y deja de atacar cuerpo a cuerpo mientras es inmune a los ataques físicos (Giga Slash, Kick Back, Umbra Smash).",
    ["Examine the Throne Room door in Castle Zvahl Keep to enter the battlefield. Trusts allowed."] = "Examina la Throne Room door de Castle Zvahl Keep para entrar en el campo de batalla. Se permiten Trusts.",
    ["Examine the Throne Room door to enter the battlefield against Aquila and Haudrale."] = "Examina la Throne Room door para entrar en el campo de batalla contra Aquila y Haudrale.",
    ["Examine the Tiger Bones in the cave to spawn the Old Sabertooth, and watch it die naturally, which takes about three Earth minutes. Don't fight or otherwise disturb it, or you won't get the key item."] = "Examina los Tiger Bones de la cueva para hacer aparecer al Old Sabertooth y míralo morir de forma natural, lo que tarda unos tres minutos reales. No luches contra él ni lo molestes, o no conseguirás el key item.",
    ["Examine the Tome of Magic on the floor near the desk and the skull on a chair for a cutscene."] = "Examina el Tome of Magic del suelo cerca del escritorio y la calavera de una silla para una escena.",
    ["Examine the Transcendental Radiance again to enter the Dawn battlefield."] = "Examina de nuevo la Transcendental Radiance para entrar en el campo de batalla Dawn.",
    ["Examine the Transcendental Radiance again to enter the battlefield, and defeat Eald'narche and Kam'lanaut."] = "Examina de nuevo la Transcendental Radiance para entrar en el campo de batalla y derrota a Eald'narche y Kam'lanaut.",
    ["Examine the Transcendental Radiance in Abyssea - Empyreal Paradox for a short cutscene, then examine it again to enter the battlefield against Shinryu."] = "Examina la Transcendental Radiance de Abyssea - Empyreal Paradox para una escena corta, y de nuevo para entrar en el campo de batalla contra Shinryu.",
    ["Examine the Valhallan Rift (G-7) across from the Home Point in Castle Zvahl Keep (G-7) for a cutscene. After this you may switch to any job."] = "Examina la Valhallan Rift (G-7) frente al Home Point de Castle Zvahl Keep (G-7) para una escena. Después de esto puedes cambiar a cualquier job.",
    ["Examine the Valhallan Rift (G-7) again to fight Chaos (RDM/DRK). You have 15 minutes. The Destiny Destroyers help and are very sturdy; you lose if any of them falls. Keep Reraise up. Chaos's strong dispel strips buffs and pieces of gear; Manafont clears his debuffs. Any weapon can hurt him here."] = "Examina de nuevo la Valhallan Rift (G-7) para luchar contra Chaos (RDM/DRK). Tienes 15 minutos. Los Destiny Destroyers ayudan y son muy resistentes; pierdes si cae cualquiera de ellos. Mantén Reraise. El fuerte disipar de Chaos quita buffs y piezas de equipo; Manafont le quita los debuffs. Aquí cualquier arma le hace daño.",
    ["Examine the Valhallan Rift (G-7) again to fight Garazu-Horeizu (BLM/RDM). Buffs are removed on entry; Trusts allowed; the Destiny Destroyers help. He uses staff weapon skills, Chainspell -ga IV nukes and clones of your group; only he needs to die."] = "Examina de nuevo la Valhallan Rift (G-7) para luchar contra Garazu-Horeizu (BLM/RDM). Los buffs se quitan al entrar; se permiten Trusts; los Destiny Destroyers ayudan. Usa weapon skills de bastón, nukes -ga IV con Chainspell y clones de tu grupo; solo hay que matarlo a él.",
    ["Examine the Valhallan Rift (G-7) at (G-7) in Castle Zvahl Keep (Throne Room Home Point) for a cutscene."] = "Examina la Valhallan Rift (G-7) en (G-7) de Castle Zvahl Keep (Home Point de la Throne Room) para una escena.",
    ["Examine the Veridical Conflux again."] = "Examina de nuevo el Veridical Conflux.",
    ["Examine the Veridical Conflux for a cutscene. Instead of warping away while you wait, you can zone into the Walk of Echoes through the Conflux and come back."] = "Examina la Veridical Conflux para una escena. En lugar de teletransportarte mientras esperas, puedes entrar en el Walk of Echoes por la Conflux y volver.",
    ["Examine the Vestal Chamber door at the top of Heavens Tower for a cutscene and the key item Letter to the ambassador."] = "Examina la puerta de la Vestal Chamber en lo alto de Heavens Tower para una escena y el key item Letter to the ambassador.",
    ["Examine the Vestal Chamber door at the top of Heavens Tower for a cutscene, the key item Holy One's invitation and the title Hero on Behalf of Windurst."] = "Examina la puerta de la Vestal Chamber en lo alto de Heavens Tower para una escena, el key item Holy One's invitation y el título Hero on Behalf of Windurst.",
    ["Examine the Vestal Chamber door at the top of Heavens Tower to start the mission and receive the key item New Fei'Yin seal."] = "Examina la puerta de la Vestal Chamber en lo alto de Heavens Tower para empezar la misión y recibir el key item New Fei'Yin seal.",
    ["Examine the Vexing Sniffles again for a cutscene."] = "Examina de nuevo los Vexing Sniffles para una escena.",
    ["Examine the Vexing Sniffles again to fight Gloom Phantom (WAR/DRK), Magh Bihu (MNK) and Dazbog (PLD), about 60,000 HP each. Mnejing helps and must stay alive. You get the Pure white ampoule."] = "Examina de nuevo los Vexing Sniffles para luchar contra Gloom Phantom (WAR/DRK), Magh Bihu (MNK) y Dazbog (PLD), unos 60,000 HP cada uno. Mnejing ayuda y debe seguir con vida. Recibes la Pure white ampoule.",
    ["Examine the Viscous Liquid again to spawn the NM Mamool Ja."] = "Examina de nuevo el Viscous Liquid para invocar al NM Mamool Ja.",
    ["Examine the Weathered Boat again for a cutscene and the Deluxe Carbine."] = "Examina de nuevo el Weathered Boat para una escena y la Deluxe Carbine.",
    ["Examine the Weathered Boat on the beach at (F-9) for a cutscene. The NM Rohemolipaud, an Elvaan Ranger, appears. After about 1,400 damage, or once the fight has gone on long enough, he uses Camouflage and the fight ends. Each party member who needs the quest must start the fight separately."] = "Examina el Weathered Boat de la playa en (F-9) para una escena. Aparece el NM Rohemolipaud, un Ranger Elvaan. Tras unos 1,400 de daño, o cuando la pelea dura lo suficiente, usa Camouflage y la pelea termina. Cada miembro del grupo que necesite la quest debe empezar la pelea por separado.",
    ["Examine the Weathered Gravestone up the hill in present-day Batallia Downs (I-10) for a cutscene (The Eldieme Necropolis Survival Guide, then walk outside). If you only see \"You see the weathered gravestone\", another mission or quest is taking priority."] = "Examina la Weathered Gravestone en lo alto de la colina de la Batallia Downs del presente (I-10) para una escena (Survival Guide de The Eldieme Necropolis y luego sal caminando). Si solo ves \"You see the weathered gravestone\", otra misión o quest tiene prioridad.",
    ["Examine the Web of Recollections and enter \"Desires of Emptiness\"; buff inside. If the cutscene stops with an addon or high frame rate, set the frame rate back to 30."] = "Examina la Web of Recollections y entra en \"Desires of Emptiness\"; poténciate dentro. Si la escena se detiene con un addon o con muchos FPS, vuelve a 30 FPS.",
    ["Examine the Worn Chest (F-6) again for a cutscene and the Strange doll. If you zoned first, you can come back without fighting again."] = "Examina de nuevo el Worn Chest (F-6) para una escena y la Strange doll. Si cambiaste de zona antes, puedes volver sin luchar de nuevo.",
    ["Examine the Worn Chest (F-6): there is no cutscene, and a Yagudo Lookout (SAM, about 30,000 HP) attacks you from behind. You have 15 minutes. It uses Meikyo Shisui around 66% HP and Yaegasumi around 33%."] = "Examina el Worn Chest (F-6): no hay escena, y un Yagudo Lookout (SAM, unos 30,000 HP) te ataca por la espalda. Tienes 15 minutos. Usa Meikyo Shisui hacia el 66% de HP y Yaegasumi hacia el 33%.",
    ["Examine the Yahse Wildflower in Yahse Hunting Grounds (K-7) for the key item Yahse wildflower petal."] = "Examina la Yahse Wildflower de Yahse Hunting Grounds (K-7) para obtener el key item Yahse wildflower petal.",
    ["Examine the blank target at the Nyzul Isle Staging Point in Alzadaal Undersea Ruins (J-8/9) for a cutscene."] = "Examina el objetivo vacío del Nyzul Isle Staging Point en Alzadaal Undersea Ruins (J-8/9) para una escena.",
    ["Examine the blue ??? at the top of the stairs."] = "Examina la ??? azul en lo alto de las escaleras.",
    ["Examine the door on the lower level of Bastok Mines (J-6), near the Alchemy Guild. It must be closed when you examine it; if another player has it open, the cutscene doesn't trigger."] = "Examina la puerta del nivel inferior de Bastok Mines (J-6), cerca del Alchemy Guild. Debe estar cerrada cuando la examines; si otro jugador la tiene abierta, la escena no se activa.",
    ["Examine the door to Prince Trion's room (Door: Prince Royal's Rm) at Chateau d'Oraguille (H-7) while you are a Paladin, for a cutscene. If you were a Paladin when you finished A Boy's Dream, you already had it. Check your active quests: you should see Under Oath. The rest of the quest can be completed as any job."] = "Examina la puerta de la habitación de Prince Trion (Door: Prince Royal's Rm) en Chateau d'Oraguille (H-7) siendo Paladin, para una escena. Si eras Paladin cuando terminaste A Boy's Dream, ya la viste. Revisa tus quests activas: deberías ver Under Oath. El resto de la quest puede completarse con cualquier job.",
    ["Examine the door to the Prince's Royal Room (G/H-7), the northern door of the Central Garden, for a cutscene."] = "Examina la puerta de la Prince's Royal Room (G/H-7), la puerta norte del Central Garden, para una escena.",
    ["Examine the east Particle Gate at (H-8) for a cutscene that completes the mission. Touch the Home Point nearby for later missions."] = "Examina la Particle Gate del este en (H-8) para una escena que completa la misión. Toca el Home Point cercano para las misiones posteriores.",
    ["Examine the glowing Before Castle Zvahl spot at (D-7), where the Dynamis Lord fight is, for a cutscene and Raebrimm's memento. You're moved out of Dynamis."] = "Examina el punto brillante Before Castle Zvahl de (D-7), donde es la pelea del Dynamis Lord, para una escena y el Raebrimm's memento. Te sacan de Dynamis.",
    ["Examine the green Unstable Displacement in the northwest section of Riverne - Site #B01 (E-7) for a cutscene. You can warp and use the Home Point to get there, or farm one Giant Scale to get to (E-7) the long way."] = "Examina el Unstable Displacement verde en la sección noroeste de Riverne - Site #B01 (E-7) para una escena. Puedes teletransportarte y usar el Home Point para llegar, o farmear una Giant Scale para llegar a (E-7) por el camino largo.",
    ["Examine the headstone a third time for the Ephramadian gold coin. Everyone joining the next two battles needs one, including players who have already finished them; they only need to touch the headstone."] = "Examina la lápida una tercera vez para obtener la Ephramadian gold coin. Todos los que participen en las dos batallas siguientes necesitan una, incluidos los que ya las terminaron; solo tienen que tocar la lápida.",
    ["Examine the key item Carrier pigeon letter (permanent key items) from The Stars of Ifrit. You receive it before the end of that quest, so you don't need to complete The Stars of Ifrit first."] = "Examina el key item Carrier pigeon letter (permanent key items) de The Stars of Ifrit. Lo recibes antes del final de esa quest, así que no hace falta completar The Stars of Ifrit primero.",
    ["Examine the lower ??? again for a cutscene and the key item Old piece of wood."] = "Examina de nuevo la ??? de abajo para una escena y el key item Old piece of wood.",
    ["Examine the nearby Test of Talents for a cutscene."] = "Examina el Test of Talents cercano para una escena.",
    ["Examine the pools on map 2 of Fei'Yin, located at (H-8), (H-5) and lastly (F-5). They are the little green marks on the map. Home Point #2, just outside the Cloister of Frost, is the closest warp."] = "Examina los estanques del mapa 2 de Fei'Yin, situados en (H-8), (H-5) y por último (F-5). Son las pequeñas marcas verdes del mapa. El Home Point #2, justo fuera del Cloister of Frost, es el warp más cercano.",
    ["Examine the sarcophagus again for a cutscene and your Beast Trousers."] = "Examina de nuevo el sarcófago para una escena y tus Beast Trousers.",
    ["Examine the second Cracked Wall at (J-8)."] = "Examina la segunda Cracked Wall en (J-8).",
    ["Examine the seven required Cermet Headstones in any order (the Dark fragment came from Grav'iton in The Temple of Uggalepih). Stand close and check that you really got each key item: from too far away the game says \"You need to move closer\", which looks similar at a glance. Grab the Cloister Home Points on the way."] = "Examina las siete Cermet Headstones necesarias en cualquier orden (el Dark fragment lo obtuviste de Grav'iton en The Temple of Uggalepih). Colócate cerca y comprueba que de verdad recibes cada key item: desde demasiado lejos el juego dice \"You need to move closer\", que a simple vista se parece. Consigue de paso los Home Points de los Cloisters.",
    ["Examine the shimmering light."] = "Examina la luz brillante.",
    ["Examine the shining ??? at Eschan Portal #15 (H-12) for a cutscene. If you lose track, a new droplet from the start lets you pay silt to use portals you've already unlocked."] = "Examina la ??? brillante del Eschan Portal #15 (H-12) para una escena. Si pierdes la cuenta, una nueva gota desde el inicio te permite pagar silt para usar los portales ya desbloqueados.",
    ["Examine the southern Rhinostery door in Windurst Waters (S)."] = "Examina la puerta sur del Rhinostery en Windurst Waters (S).",
    ["Examine the sparkling ??? beside a Cavernous Maw in Batallia Downs, Rolanberry Fields, or Sauromugue Champaign."] = "Examina la ??? reluciente junto a un Cavernous Maw en Batallia Downs, Rolanberry Fields o Sauromugue Champaign.",
    ["Examine the three ??? from Steamed Rams: (H-8) in a dirt hole just north-east of the fort, (I-8) at the base of the waterfall (north-west corner), and (J-7) just south of a tree (north-west corner)."] = "Examina las tres ??? de Steamed Rams: (H-8) en un hoyo de tierra justo al noreste del fuerte, (I-8) en la base de la cascada (esquina noroeste) y (J-7) justo al sur de un árbol (esquina noroeste).",
    ["Examine the tombstone inside to receive the Ancient San d'Orian Book."] = "Examina la tombstone del interior para recibir el Ancient San d'Orian Book.",
    ["Examine the two doors to the Princes' quarters if you want to hear their additional dialogue."] = "Examina las dos puertas de los aposentos de los Princes si quieres oír su diálogo adicional.",
    ["Examine the unnamed target on a manhole cover at (L-7) in Mount Zhayolm for a cutscene that begins the quest. This quest requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack. Zurtermor has dropped his precious pickaxe into a crevasse."] = "Examina el objetivo sin nombre de una tapa de alcantarilla en (L-7) de Mount Zhayolm para una escena que empieza la quest. Esta quest requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan. Zurtermor ha dejado caer su valioso pico en una grieta.",
    ["Examine them again to enter the Everbloom Hollow maze. You have 30 minutes, with warnings at 10, 5 and 1 minutes. If you fail, get another Aroma bug from Naoi's Regal Pawprints at (H-10)."] = "Examínalas de nuevo para entrar en el laberinto de Everbloom Hollow. Tienes 30 minutos, con avisos a los 10, 5 y 1 minutos. Si fallas, consigue otro Aroma bug de las Regal Pawprints de Naoi en (H-10).",
    ["Examining a maw starts that area's quest and unlocks teleporting to that maw for 200 Cruor from the Abyssea maw teleport NPCs."] = "Examinar un maw empieza la quest de esa zona y desbloquea el teletransporte a ese maw por 200 Cruor con los NPCs de teletransporte a los maws de Abyssea.",
    ["Examining the ??? spawns two Pudding NMs; defeat them and examine it again for the key item Indigested ore. Trusts are allowed, and buffs (songs, rolls, Indi-bubbles) cast before the level restriction carry over."] = "Examinar la ??? hace aparecer dos NMs Pudding; derrótalos y examínala de nuevo para obtener el key item Indigested ore. Se permiten Trusts, y los buffs (canciones, rolls, burbujas Indi) lanzados antes de la restricción de nivel se mantienen.",
    ["Exit Norg into Sea Serpent Grotto. Head south until you reach the fork at (H-6) and go east. Turn south at (J-5), head east at (J-10), and turn east at (K-12)."] = "Sal de Norg a Sea Serpent Grotto. Ve al sur hasta la bifurcación de (H-6) y ve al este. Gira al sur en (J-5), ve al este en (J-10) y gira al este en (K-12).",
    ["Exit Norg into Sea Serpent Grotto. Once there, head south until you reach (H-7) and go west from there."] = "Sal de Norg a Sea Serpent Grotto. Una vez allí, ve al sur hasta (H-7) y desde allí ve al oeste.",
    ["Exit Norg, re-enter, and speak with Jaucribaix to receive the key item Yomotsu Hirasaka."] = "Sal de Norg, vuelve a entrar y habla con Jaucribaix para recibir el key item Yomotsu Hirasaka.",
    ["Exit Sealion's Den and examine the Phomiuna Aqueducts entrance on the bottom floor."] = "Sal de Sealion's Den y examina la entrada de Phomiuna Aqueducts en el piso inferior.",
    ["Exit east to Caedarva Mire and go to (I-10). Check the ??? on the east side of the pond for a cutscene."] = "Sal hacia el este a Caedarva Mire y ve a (I-10). Revisa la ??? en el lado este del estanque para una escena.",
    ["Exit the dock, then talk to Blandine again."] = "Sal del muelle y vuelve a hablar con Blandine.",
    ["Exit the fortress and examine ??? (I-9), then examine it again to face War Lynx."] = "Sal de la fortaleza y examina la ??? (I-9), luego examínala de nuevo para enfrentarte a War Lynx.",
    ["Exit through the Particle Gate at the south side of the room, choose \"Leave the Garden of Ru'Hmet\" and \"Yes\" to return to the Grand Palace."] = "Sal por la Particle Gate del lado sur de la sala, elige \"Leave the Garden of Ru'Hmet\" y \"Yes\" para volver al Grand Palace.",
    ["Exoray Mold: drops from Exorays (uncommon), or collect three Exoray mold crumbs in Crawlers' Nest. Run past the crawlers and bees, up the hill, drop into the \"sack room\" and head south-south-west (not the south-south-east dead end): ??? on the path from (I-10), map 1, towards map 3, and another further along at (I-6), map 3. Use Sneak around the Exorays."] = "Exoray Mold: lo sueltan los Exorays (poco común), o reúne tres Exoray mold crumbs en Crawlers' Nest. Pasa corriendo junto a los crawlers y las abejas, sube la colina, déjate caer a la \"sala de los sacos\" y ve al sur-suroeste (no al callejón sin salida del sur-sureste): ??? en el camino de (I-10), mapa 1, hacia el mapa 3, y otra más adelante en (I-6), mapa 3. Usa Sneak cerca de los Exorays.",
    ["FFXI is an old game. Combat is slow at the best of times, and level 1 is nowhere near the best of times. You just auto-attack until you get your combat skill level high enough to learn a weaponskill. And then you auto-attack enough to fill your TP bar to 1000 to spend it all on a single use of that weaponskill... and then repeat."] = "FFXI es un juego antiguo. El combate es lento incluso en el mejor de los casos, y el nivel 1 no es ni de lejos el mejor caso. Solo atacas automáticamente hasta que tu skill de combate sube lo suficiente para aprender un weaponskill. Y entonces atacas automáticamente hasta llenar la barra de TP a 1000 para gastarlo todo en un solo uso de ese weaponskill... y vuelta a empezar.",
    ["Fall off the path to the one below at (H-8) and continue north. Follow the path until you find the ??? at (H-3). Interacting with it gives you a Sea serpent statue."] = "Déjate caer del camino al de abajo en (H-8) y sigue al norte. Sigue el camino hasta encontrar la ??? en (H-3). Al interactuar con ella recibes una Sea serpent statue.",
    ["Famous biologist Professor Clavauert is researching apkallu on Ilrusi Atoll. The more discoveries he makes in Aht Urhgan, the more likely he is to join the Empire. Assist him by capturing apkallu. Mission orders: capture the apkallu."] = "El famoso biólogo Professor Clavauert investiga a los apkallu en Ilrusi Atoll. Cuantos más descubrimientos haga en Aht Urhgan, más probable es que se una al Empire. Ayúdale capturando apkallu. Órdenes de la misión: capturar a los apkallu.",
    ["Farm Topaz Quadav enemies until you obtain a Quadav Mage Blood. Only one is needed if you are doing this with a group."] = "Farmea enemigos Topaz Quadav hasta obtener una Quadav Mage Blood. Solo hace falta una si lo haces en grupo.",
    ["Farm six Fat Worm Meat (Rare/Ex) from Boulder Eaters in Gustav Tunnel Map 2 (J-6); Unity Warp (level 128) puts you on that map. Treasure Hunter helps."] = "Farmea seis Fat Worm Meat (Rare/Ex) de los Boulder Eaters del mapa 2 de Gustav Tunnel (J-6); el Unity Warp (nivel 128) te deja en ese mapa. Treasure Hunter ayuda.",
    ["Farming tips: Huge Wasps are densest around the Crag of Dem in Konschtat Highlands (12-15 spawns; they respawn by the time you finish a lap). Use Wide Scan to find Wasps or Pygmaioi."] = "Consejos para farmear: los Huge Wasps abundan sobre todo alrededor del Crag of Dem en Konschtat Highlands (12-15 apariciones; reaparecen cuando terminas una vuelta). Usa Wide Scan para encontrar Wasps o Pygmaioi.",
    ["Fast Travel - Home Points and Survival Guides"] = "Viaje rápido: Home Points y Survival Guides",
    ["Faster travel alternative: While I genuinely do recommend making this trip on foot - partially because the lowest-level mob in Valkurm Dunes is level 11, so it may be rough to continue leveling there without some intermediate killing in the areas between - you can get there faster by using a \"Unity Warp\"."] = "Alternativa de viaje más rápida: aunque de verdad recomiendo hacer este viaje a pie (en parte porque el monstruo de menos nivel de Valkurm Dunes es de nivel 11, así que puede costar seguir subiendo allí sin matar algo en las zonas intermedias), puedes llegar más rápido con un \"Unity Warp\".",
    ["Fastest: The Boyahda Tree Home Point or Unity Warp puts you on map 2; run to (G-10) and go south into the tunnel to map 3, then continue south to the ??? at (J-8)."] = "Lo más rápido: el Home Point o el Unity Warp de The Boyahda Tree te deja en el mapa 2; corre hasta (G-10) y ve al sur por el túnel hasta el mapa 3, y sigue al sur hasta la ??? en (J-8).",
    ["Fastest: if you have the Den of Rancor Home Point #1, warp there and walk into the Sacrificial Chamber. Anyone who has finished this mission can also warp there and open the door for you; reach it with Unity Warp (level 128) to the Den of Rancor and skip the lanterns entirely."] = "Lo más rápido: si tienes el Home Point #1 de Den of Rancor, teletranspórtate allí y camina hasta la Sacrificial Chamber. Quien haya terminado esta misión también puede teletransportarse allí y abrirte la puerta; llega con el Unity Warp (nivel 128) a Den of Rancor y sáltate los farolillos por completo.",
    ["Fastest: take Ifrit's Cauldron Home Point #1 to map 7, run south and then north to drop off the lip at (J-4), then go south to transition M at (J-8) onto map 6, and north to the ???."] = "Lo más rápido: toma el Home Point #1 de Ifrit's Cauldron al mapa 7, corre al sur y luego al norte para dejarte caer del borde en (J-4), luego ve al sur hasta la transición M de (J-8) al mapa 6 y al norte hasta la ???.",
    ["Fastest: the Proto-Waypoint warp to North Gustaberg puts you almost at the Waterfall Base (walk east and over the bridge to the north)."] = "Lo más rápido: el warp de Proto-Waypoint a North Gustaberg te deja casi en la Waterfall Base (camina al este y cruza el puente hacia el norte).",
    ["Fastest: the Unity Warp (level 122) puts you in the Oubliette past the drop; head east through connection B to the ??? at (I-8). Otherwise, with Silent Oil, go to the Chateau d'Oraguille, take the eastern door of the entry hall and follow the path north into the Oubliette. Inside, go south to (H-7/8), then west to (E-7/8) and drop down; head south, then west, turning south whenever you have to, until (F-9), then go east along the path to the ??? at (I-8)."] = "Lo más rápido: el Unity Warp (nivel 122) te deja en el Oubliette pasada la caída; ve al este por la conexión B hasta la ??? en (I-8). Si no, con Silent Oil, ve al Chateau d'Oraguille, toma la puerta este del vestíbulo y sigue el camino al norte hasta el Oubliette. Dentro, ve al sur hasta (H-7/8), luego al oeste hasta (E-7/8) y déjate caer; ve al sur y luego al oeste, girando al sur cuando sea necesario, hasta (F-9), y después al este por el camino hasta la ??? en (I-8).",
    ["Fastest: the Unity Warp (level 128) puts you in the tunnel leading to the NM, with a Grounds Tome nearby for Sneak and Invisible; head north hugging the east wall to the ??? near the (I-9)/(J-9) intersection. Otherwise, with Silent Oil and Prism Powder, follow the path to (G-9) and take the western tunnel, go east at its fork, and from the large room take the eastern tunnel at (I-8) to the ??? at (I-9), map 2."] = "Lo más rápido: el Unity Warp (nivel 128) te deja en el túnel que lleva al NM, con un Grounds Tome cerca para Sneak e Invisible; ve al norte pegado a la pared este hasta la ??? cerca del cruce de (I-9)/(J-9). Si no, con Silent Oil y Prism Powder, sigue el camino hasta (G-9) y toma el túnel oeste, ve al este en su bifurcación y, desde la sala grande, toma el túnel este de (I-8) hasta la ??? en (I-9), mapa 2.",
    ["Fastest: the Unity Warp (level 128) to Den of Rancor puts you on the ledge at (G-12); drop down the east side and walk south-east to the ??? at (I-13). Den of Rancor Home Point #1 also puts you on the right map."] = "Lo más rápido: el Unity Warp (nivel 128) a Den of Rancor te deja en la cornisa de (G-12); déjate caer por el lado este y camina al sureste hasta la ??? en (I-13). El Home Point #1 de Den of Rancor también te deja en el mapa correcto.",
    ["Fastest: the Unity Warp to Cape Teriggan (level 128) brings you to (H-7); the Cloister of Gales Home Point (F-5) and the Survival Guide at the Outpost (G-8) also work. Otherwise, with Silent Oil and Prism Powder, go through Kuftal Tunnel: from (I-7) head north without taking any branches; at (I-4) the tunnel loops south into a larger space, so curve straight back north-west and exit into Cape Teriggan."] = "Lo más rápido: el Unity Warp a Cape Teriggan (nivel 128) te lleva a (H-7); el Home Point del Cloister of Gales (F-5) y la Survival Guide del Outpost (G-8) también sirven. Si no, con Silent Oil y Prism Powder, ve por Kuftal Tunnel: desde (I-7) ve al norte sin tomar desvíos; en (I-4) el túnel gira al sur hacia un espacio mayor, así que tuerce enseguida de vuelta al noroeste y sal a Cape Teriggan.",
    ["Feed the chocobo standing next to Osker by trading it one Gausebit Grass. You can feed it once every real-life minute (counted from :00, not from your last try). The command /item \"Gausebit Grass\" <t> speeds this up; stand closer to the chocobo than to Osker so F8 retargets it."] = "Alimenta al chocobo que está junto a Osker entregándole una Gausebit Grass. Puedes alimentarlo una vez por minuto real (contado desde :00, no desde tu último intento). El comando /item \"Gausebit Grass\" <t> lo agiliza; colócate más cerca del chocobo que de Osker para que F8 lo vuelva a seleccionar.",
    ["Fight Gessho, a Ninja who warps around the arena (often followed by a TP move), uses Ninjutsu, ranged attacks and Mijin Gakure. Happobarai (AoE, Stun) and Shibaraku (AoE, knockback) are blocked by shadows; Hane Fubuki poisons."] = "Lucha contra Gessho, un Ninja que se teletransporta por la arena (a menudo seguido de un movimiento de TP), usa Ninjutsu, ataques a distancia y Mijin Gakure. Happobarai (área, Stun) y Shibaraku (área, retroceso) se bloquean con sombras; Hane Fubuki envenena.",
    ["Fight Nanaa Mihgo (dagger skills; King Cobra Clamp is a cone with Paralyze, Stun and Poison; twice calls Bopa Greso or Cha Lebagta) with a Goblin Repossessor (THF), Intimidator (WAR) and Enforcer (RDM). Everything can be slept: sleep Nanaa while you clear the Goblins."] = "Lucha contra Nanaa Mihgo (habilidades de daga; King Cobra Clamp es un cono con Paralyze, Stun y Poison; llama dos veces a Bopa Greso o Cha Lebagta) con un Goblin Repossessor (THF), Intimidator (WAR) y Enforcer (RDM). Todos se pueden dormir: duerme a Nanaa mientras acabas con los Goblins.",
    ["Fight Schultz and his Crimson Grimoire. You win when Schultz is down to about 20% HP; the Grimoire does not have to be defeated. Engage quickly, since both buff themselves if left alone, and neither can be slept reliably. If you are not using Trusts or are undergeared, defeat the Grimoire first, as it has much less HP."] = "Lucha contra Schultz y su Crimson Grimoire. Ganas cuando Schultz baja a un 20% de HP aproximadamente; no hace falta derrotar al Grimoire. Ataca rápido, ya que ambos se potencian si los dejas, y ninguno se puede dormir con fiabilidad. Si no usas Trusts o vas con poco equipo, derrota primero al Grimoire, que tiene mucho menos HP.",
    ["Fight Ulbrecht, a level 67 Scholar with about 12,000 HP who casts tier III nukes, Sleep, Drain, Aspir, Dispel and cures. He is immune to Silence but not to Bind, Gravity or Sleep, and uses Tabula Rasa at about 50%. The fight ends when he drops below 20%. If you lose, trade Erlene (J-8) a Sheet of Vellum for a new Porting magic transcript."] = "Lucha contra Ulbrecht, un Scholar de nivel 67 con unos 12,000 HP que lanza nukes de nivel III, Sleep, Drain, Aspir, Dispel y curas. Es inmune a Silence pero no a Bind, Gravity ni Sleep, y usa Tabula Rasa hacia el 50%. La pelea termina cuando baja del 20%. Si pierdes, entrega a Erlene (J-8) una Sheet of Vellum para obtener un nuevo Porting magic transcript.",
    ["Fight Valkeng. It starts as a Harlequin Frame (Dia II, Slapstick) and every 30 seconds switches by the damage it has taken most: melee makes it Valoredge (fast, accurate, very high physical damage reduction), ranged makes it Sharpshot (ranged attacks every 5 seconds, low physical defense), magic makes it Stormwaker (elemental magic every 10 seconds, very high magic defense). Mixing damage types helps. After the fight, your answer in the cutscene doesn't matter."] = "Lucha contra Valkeng. Empieza como Harlequin Frame (Dia II, Slapstick) y cada 30 segundos cambia según el tipo de daño que más haya recibido: cuerpo a cuerpo lo convierte en Valoredge (rápido, preciso, reducción de daño físico muy alta), a distancia en Sharpshot (ataques a distancia cada 5 segundos, defensa física baja), y la magia en Stormwaker (magia elemental cada 10 segundos, defensa mágica muy alta). Mezclar tipos de daño ayuda. Tras la pelea, tu respuesta en la escena da igual.",
    ["Fight the three NMs in any order. If you zone before examining the spot again after a fight, the fight resets."] = "Lucha contra los tres NMs en cualquier orden. Si cambias de zona antes de examinar de nuevo el punto tras una pelea, la pelea se reinicia.",
    ["Figure out what you're doing with your life."] = "Decide qué haces con tu vida.",
    ["Fill each test tube at its Mythralline Wellspring (the ??? at each pond), in any order. Enter Wajaom Woodlands through the Ironbound Gate at (H-10) and Bhaflau Thickets through the Ironbound Gate at (H-7)."] = "Llena cada tubo de ensayo en su Mythralline Wellspring (la ??? de cada estanque), en cualquier orden. Entra en Wajaom Woodlands por la Ironbound Gate de (H-10) y en Bhaflau Thickets por la Ironbound Gate de (H-7).",
    ["Final cutscene: if you have killed Fenrir after reaching Windurst Rank 10, you have the Dark Mana Orb among your temporary key items. Zone, then speak with Kohlo-Lakolo again with that key item for a final, concluding cutscene."] = "Escena final: si has matado a Fenrir tras alcanzar el Windurst Rank 10, tienes la Dark Mana Orb entre tus key items temporales. Cambia de zona y luego habla de nuevo con Kohlo-Lakolo con ese key item para una escena final de cierre.",
    ["Finally, enter the southern Eldieme Necropolis entrance from Batallia Downs at (I-10)."] = "Por último, entra por la entrada sur de Eldieme Necropolis desde Batallia Downs en (I-10).",
    ["Finally, it's time to leave town! As you attempt to walk out the gate, a Tutorial NPC will stop you and give you a quest line that eventually provides some excellent rewards, including a Warp Ring and an Echad Ring."] = "¡Por fin es hora de salir de la ciudad! Al intentar cruzar la puerta, un NPC tutorial te detendrá y te dará una serie de quests que acaban dando recompensas excelentes, como un Warp Ring y un Echad Ring.",
    ["Finally, return to Kubhe Ijyuhla to complete the quest. She rewards you with an Imperial Bronze Piece."] = "Por último, vuelve con Kubhe Ijyuhla para completar la quest. Te recompensa con una Imperial Bronze Piece.",
    ["Finally, speak with Alois in the conference room of the President's Office in Metalworks (J-8) to complete the quest and receive the Fukuro."] = "Por último, habla con Alois en la sala de conferencias de la President's Office en Metalworks (J-8) para completar la quest y recibir el Fukuro.",
    ["Finally, speak with Saliyahf at (G-7) for your reward, 3 Imperial Bronze Pieces, and to finish the quest."] = "Por último, habla con Saliyahf en (G-7) por tu recompensa, 3 Imperial Bronze Pieces, y para terminar la quest.",
    ["Finally, the Unity system allows transportation to areas which are home to Unity Wanted battles. The fights themselves are level 75-140 content, but the Warp system is available as soon as you join a Unity. This will allow you to instantly to travel to areas you haven't been to yet, which is incredibly useful to streamline traveling and will be mentioned frequently later in this guide."] = "Por último, el sistema de Unity permite viajar a las zonas de las batallas Unity Wanted. Las peleas en sí son contenido de nivel 75-140, pero el sistema de Warp está disponible en cuanto te unes a una Unity. Te permitirá viajar al instante a zonas en las que aún no has estado, lo que es utilísimo para agilizar los viajes y se mencionará a menudo más adelante en esta guía.",
    ["Find Munahda's package at a targetable spot in Al Zahbi; it moves after another player finds it. Possible spots: (G-7) in the water, (G-8) at the entrance to the south tunnel, (I-10) in the chocobo alley, (J-7) behind Kahah Hobichai, (I-5) Flameserpent Square, (H-9) in the tunnel from Galeserpent Square to the chocobo alley, and (J-9) Galeserpent Square."] = "Busca el paquete de Munahda en un punto seleccionable de Al Zahbi; se mueve cuando otro jugador lo encuentra. Puntos posibles: (G-7) en el agua, (G-8) en la entrada del túnel sur, (I-10) en el callejón de los chocobos, (J-7) detrás de Kahah Hobichai, (I-5) Flameserpent Square, (H-9) en el túnel de Galeserpent Square al callejón de los chocobos, y (J-9) Galeserpent Square.",
    ["Find Varchet in Southern San d'Oria at (L-6), right next to the fountains. You need to gamble against him; each attempt costs 5 gil, so keep trying until you win. You can still gamble with him after the quest is complete."] = "Encuentra a Varchet en Southern San d'Oria en (L-6), justo al lado de las fuentes. Tienes que apostar contra él; cada intento cuesta 5 gil, así que sigue intentándolo hasta ganar. Puedes seguir apostando con él después de completar la quest.",
    ["Find Zantaviat just inside Davoi."] = "Encuentra a Zantaviat nada más entrar en Davoi.",
    ["Find a Warhorse Hoofprint and examine it for the key item Dark Rider hoofprint. It shows up on widescan and can be in Bhaflau Thickets, Caedarva Mire, Mount Zhayolm or Wajaom Woodlands."] = "Busca una Warhorse Hoofprint y examínala para obtener el key item Dark Rider hoofprint. Aparece en el widescan y puede estar en Bhaflau Thickets, Caedarva Mire, Mount Zhayolm o Wajaom Woodlands.",
    ["Find a player who matches the description and make a party with them. Then return to Halver while in the same party as the match. Having a female character in the party does not force Halver to ask for that character; the choice is random."] = "Encuentra a un jugador que coincida con la descripción y forma grupo con él. Luego vuelve con Halver estando en el mismo grupo que esa persona. Tener un personaje femenino en el grupo no obliga a Halver a pedir ese personaje; la elección es aleatoria.",
    ["Find an NPC who tells you the switch order without talking to others who call the guards on your Mithra and Tarutaru friends. Folzen (ground floor, Galka kid by the Blacksmiths' Guild) tells you the number of switches; Darha (ground floor, Galka near Home Point #2), Helmut (ground floor, old Hume near Home Point #2), Hungry Wolf (upper floor, Craftsmen's Eatery, south of Cid's Lab) and Striking Snake (upper floor, Gunpowder Room, north of Cid's Lab) give the order, which can differ. Costume kit pieces: Knitted hat for Folzen, Spectacles for Helmut, Heels for the others."] = "Busca un NPC que te diga el orden de los interruptores sin hablar con otros que llaman a los guardias contra tus amigos Mithra y Tarutaru. Folzen (planta baja, niño Galka junto al Blacksmiths' Guild) te dice el número de interruptores; Darha (planta baja, Galka cerca del Home Point #2), Helmut (planta baja, Hume anciano cerca del Home Point #2), Hungry Wolf (planta superior, Craftsmen's Eatery, al sur del Cid's Lab) y Striking Snake (planta superior, Gunpowder Room, al norte del Cid's Lab) te dan el orden, que puede variar. Piezas del Costume kit: Knitted hat para Folzen, Spectacles para Helmut, Heels para los demás.",
    ["Find and open the Treasure Coffer in Kuftal Tunnel to obtain the Large trick box."] = "Busca y abre el Treasure Coffer de Kuftal Tunnel para obtener la Large trick box.",
    ["Find his father, Exoroche, in Southern San d'Oria at (K-7) in Helbort's Blade."] = "Encuentra a su padre, Exoroche, en Southern San d'Oria en (K-7), en Helbort's Blade.",
    ["Find the ??? at the southwest corner of (H-10) in the middle of the valley and trade it your Pickaxe for a cutscene and your reward, the Rogue's Poulaines. Other types of pickaxe do not work."] = "Busca la ??? en la esquina suroeste de (H-10), en medio del valle, y entrégale tu Pickaxe para una escena y tu recompensa, las Rogue's Poulaines. Otros tipos de pico no sirven.",
    ["Find the ??? hidden beneath the stairs on the southern boat at (H-10) to receive the key item Antique automaton. This is not the ??? used for the Corsair quest, and you don't need a Lamian Fang Key to reach it."] = "Busca la ??? escondida bajo las escaleras del barco del sur en (H-10) para recibir el key item Antique automaton. No es la ??? de la quest de Corsair, y no necesitas una Lamian Fang Key para llegar.",
    ["Find the ??? in Dangruf Wadi to get a Dangruf Stone. The monsters around the ??? are level 90 to 95; only the Goblins are aggressive, and they can be avoided with just Invisible since they do not have pets. You lose Invisible when riding the geyser at (I-8) in Dangruf Wadi, so Field Support from the Grounds Tome will fail."] = "Encuentra la ??? en Dangruf Wadi para conseguir una Dangruf Stone. Los monstruos alrededor de la ??? son de nivel 90 a 95; solo los Goblins son agresivos, y se pueden evitar con solo Invisible ya que no tienen mascotas. Pierdes Invisible al montar el geyser en (I-8) de Dangruf Wadi, así que el Field Support del Grounds Tome fallará.",
    ["Find the Gate: Magical Gizmo and examine it to spawn four Jack Cardians: Jack of Batons (BLM), Jack of Coins (RDM), Jack of Cups (WHM) and Jack of Swords (PLD). They detect magic, so keep mages back; they don't link with each other but do link with other Cardians in the area."] = "Busca la Gate: Magical Gizmo y examínala para hacer aparecer cuatro Jack Cardians: Jack of Batons (BLM), Jack of Coins (RDM), Jack of Cups (WHM) y Jack of Swords (PLD). Detectan la magia, así que los magos deben quedarse atrás; no se enlazan entre sí pero sí con otros Cardians de la zona.",
    ["Find the Warhorse Hoofprint and click on it to place the Quartz transmitter. The Warhorse Hoofprint is visible on Widescan and is found in four different zones: Bhaflau Thickets, Caedarva Mire, Mount Zhayolm and Wajaom Woodlands."] = "Busca la Warhorse Hoofprint y haz clic en ella para colocar el Quartz transmitter. La Warhorse Hoofprint es visible con Widescan y se encuentra en cuatro zonas distintas: Bhaflau Thickets, Caedarva Mire, Mount Zhayolm y Wajaom Woodlands.",
    ["Find the cave at (E-7) in Xarcabard and examine the ???: after a cutscene a Koenigstiger appears. Defeat it. Everyone needs their own cutscene and kill; it respawns in about 3 minutes."] = "Busca la cueva de (E-7) en Xarcabard y examina la ???: tras una escena aparece un Koenigstiger. Derrótalo. Cada uno necesita su propia escena y su propia muerte; reaparece en unos 3 minutos.",
    ["Find the piece of the old floorplans in the Sacrarium and bring it back to Nivorajean for your reward, the Map of the Sacrarium."] = "Encuentra el trozo de los planos antiguos en Sacrarium y llévaselo a Nivorajean por tu recompensa, el Map of the Sacrarium.",
    ["Finding Other Players"] = "Encontrar a otros jugadores",
    ["Finish Mission 5-2 and finish the game's storyline"] = "Termina la Mission 5-2 y la historia del juego",
    ["Finishing this mission also lets you continue the Rhapsodies mission The Crucible."] = "Terminar esta misión también te permite continuar la misión de Rhapsodies The Crucible.",
    ["Fired Urn at Ro'Maeve (K-9)/(K-10): purple fragment. Only slashing damage hurts it."] = "Fired Urn en Ro'Maeve (K-9)/(K-10): fragmento morado. Solo le hace daño el daño cortante.",
    ["First Rubious Crystal:"] = "Primer Rubious Crystal:",
    ["First Steps Forward"] = "Primeros pasos",
    ["First enter any Promyvion area, and return to Harith in the Grand Duke's house in Ru'Lude Gardens (H-5) without erasing your memory at the Large Apparatus."] = "Primero entra en cualquier zona de Promyvion y vuelve con Harith a la casa del Grand Duke en Ru'Lude Gardens (H-5) sin borrar tu memoria en el Large Apparatus.",
    ["First envelope: in Sauromugue Champaign, examine the ??? at the towers (G-6, G/H-8, I/J-7, J/K-8, K-9 and I-9/10) until Climbpix Highrise appears; the tower is random. The right spots say it is impossible to climb the wall with bare hands. The I-9/10 tower is reached with the Survival Guide, the Voidwatch warp, the Cavernous Maw in Sauromugue Champaign (S), or through the third Banishing Gate of Garlaige Citadel."] = "Primer sobre: en Sauromugue Champaign, examina la ??? de las torres (G-6, G/H-8, I/J-7, J/K-8, K-9 e I-9/10) hasta que aparezca Climbpix Highrise; la torre es aleatoria. Los puntos correctos dicen que es imposible escalar la pared con las manos desnudas. A la torre de I-9/10 se llega con la Survival Guide, el warp de Voidwatch, el Cavernous Maw de Sauromugue Champaign (S) o por la tercera Banishing Gate de Garlaige Citadel.",
    ["First examine the Gate of the Gods next to the Home Point for a cutscene; without it you can't reach floors 3-4."] = "Primero examina la Gate of the Gods junto al Home Point para una escena; sin ella no puedes llegar a los pisos 3-4.",
    ["First floor Seed Afterglow (J-10): Amicitia Stone."] = "Seed Afterglow del primer piso (J-10): Amicitia Stone.",
    ["First form: Lilith's melee hits everyone around her with knockback, one weapon skill dispels, and she casts AoE enfeebles, Comet and (low HP) Meteor. Under Trance she uses Fatal Attraction, a charm gaze; turn away. After she falls you return to the entrance to rest and rebuff."] = "Primera forma: los golpes de Lilith alcanzan a todos los que la rodean con retroceso, uno de sus weapon skills disipa, y lanza debilitamientos de área, Comet y (con poco HP) Meteor. Con Trance usa Fatal Attraction, una mirada de encantamiento; date la vuelta. Cuando cae vuelves a la entrada para descansar y potenciarte.",
    ["First go to the second floor of the house at (G-7) in Southern San d'Oria and read the diary there until you have read up to Page 4. This quest requires the Chains of Promathia pack, and follows A Squire's Test II."] = "Primero ve al segundo piso de la casa en (G-7) de Southern San d'Oria y lee el diario hasta llegar a la Page 4. Esta quest requiere el pack Chains of Promathia y sigue a A Squire's Test II.",
    ["First goblin, Saltvix (Rock Salt): at the ??? in the western part of the room at G-7 (the ??? is in F-7)."] = "Primer goblin, Saltvix (Rock Salt): en la ??? de la parte oeste de la sala de G-7 (la ??? está en F-7).",
    ["First head to Rabao and talk to Rudolfo (J-7). You need to have completed Promathia Mission 2-1 and have the Chains of Promathia pack. A young cargo hauler named Sanctia has suddenly left Rabao, and Zoriboh wants you to find her; she has probably headed for Norg to board a ship bound for the Tavnazian Marquisate."] = "Primero ve a Rabao y habla con Rudolfo (J-7). Debes haber completado Promathia Mission 2-1 y tener el pack Chains of Promathia. Una joven transportista llamada Sanctia se ha ido de pronto de Rabao, y Zoriboh quiere que la encuentres; probablemente se ha dirigido a Norg para embarcar en un barco con destino al Tavnazian Marquisate.",
    ["First of all, don't forget Signet."] = "Lo primero, no olvides Signet.",
    ["First start Voidwatch Ops: Border Crossing with Kieran in Norg and receive the key item Ashen Stratum Abyssite."] = "Empieza primero Voidwatch Ops: Border Crossing con Kieran en Norg y recibe el key item Ashen Stratum Abyssite.",
    ["First time: within 24 game hours (1 Earth hour), defeat at least 30 monsters in Tahrongi Canyon. When repeating the mission, the area is Buburimu Peninsula and you have 48 game hours (2 Earth hours)."] = "La primera vez: en 24 horas de juego (1 hora real), derrota al menos 30 monstruos en Tahrongi Canyon. Al repetir la misión, la zona es Buburimu Peninsula y tienes 48 horas de juego (2 horas reales).",
    ["First, buy a map of Norg from either Lombaria in Selbina or Ludwig in Mhaura. Then talk to Pacomart in Selbina or Tonasav (I-9 in Mhaura) and let them take you to Norg, the secret city of pirates. Examine the Oaken Door at K-8 twice, watching a cutscene each time, and get your Rhapsody KI. Be sure to hit both of the Home Points and the single Survival Guide while you're here - it will be much more challenging to return to Norg later on without these fast travel options."] = "Primero, compra un mapa de Norg a Lombaria en Selbina o a Ludwig en Mhaura. Luego habla con Pacomart en Selbina o con Tonasav (I-9 en Mhaura) para que te lleven a Norg, la ciudad secreta de los piratas. Examina dos veces la Oaken Door de K-8, viendo una escena cada vez, y consigue tu KI Rhapsody. Asegúrate de tocar los dos Home Points y la única Survival Guide mientras estás aquí; será mucho más difícil volver a Norg más tarde sin estas opciones de viaje rápido.",
    ["First, enter the Shrine through entrance A at (H-8) in Ru'Aun Gardens, go east then north to the room with two Monoliths at (H-10), and make sure the east Monolith is active; it opens the yellow doors."] = "Primero, entra en el Shrine por la entrada A de (H-8) en Ru'Aun Gardens, ve al este y luego al norte hasta la sala con dos Monoliths en (H-10), y asegúrate de que el Monolith del este esté activo; abre las puertas amarillas.",
    ["First, travel to Cape Teriggan and reach the Valley of Sorrows entrance at (J-8). Then examine ??? (I-8) to receive the Figure of Titan."] = "Primero, viaja a Cape Teriggan y llega a la entrada de Valley of Sorrows en (J-8). Luego examina la ??? (I-8) para recibir la Figure of Titan.",
    ["First, you must complete the Open Sesame quest in Eastern Altepa Desert (G-7) to obtain Loadstone, which is required to unlock the door later. And then take the Survival Guide to Western Altepa Desert. You're going to want to have bought the map (or have it open in a browser) for this one - continue heading southwest through the winding zone to get to a hidden underground entrance to Quicksand Caves in the southwest of Western Altepa Desert at (D-12), via a tunnel at (C-11)/(D-11). The Home Point is right there."] = "Primero debes completar la quest Open Sesame en Eastern Altepa Desert (G-7) para obtener la Loadstone, necesaria para abrir la puerta más adelante. Luego toma la Survival Guide a Western Altepa Desert. Para esta te conviene haber comprado el mapa (o tenerlo abierto en el navegador): sigue al suroeste por la sinuosa zona hasta una entrada subterránea oculta a Quicksand Caves en el suroeste de Western Altepa Desert, en (D-12), por un túnel en (C-11)/(D-11). El Home Point está justo allí.",
    ["First: complete Her Memories: Old Bean, Her Memories: The Faux Pas and Her Memories: Grave Resolve, then Her Memories: Homecoming Queen."] = "Primero: completa Her Memories: Old Bean, Her Memories: The Faux Pas y Her Memories: Grave Resolve, y luego Her Memories: Homecoming Queen.",
    ["Fish a Ripped Cap out of the water and trade it to Paytah."] = "Pesca una Ripped Cap del agua y entrégala a Paytah.",
    ["Fish for Paladin Lobster at (G-10), Scutum Crab at (J-7), and Lance Fish at (H-9)."] = "Pesca Paladin Lobster en (G-10), Scutum Crab en (J-7) y Lance Fish en (H-9).",
    ["Fish in Castle Oztroja with a rod used for catching big fish, using the Giant Shell Bug as bait. Bring more than one Giant Shell Bug."] = "Pesca en Castle Oztroja con una caña para pescar peces grandes, usando el Giant Shell Bug como cebo. Lleva más de un Giant Shell Bug.",
    ["Fish up 60 different types of fish, with any rod. Fish caught before the quest count, and Katsunaga in Mhaura (H-9) can tell you how many you have. If you already have 60, Jourdenaux moves on to the next step."] = "Pesca 60 tipos de peces distintos, con cualquier caña. Los peces pescados antes de la quest cuentan, y Katsunaga en Mhaura (H-9) te puede decir cuántos tienes. Si ya tienes 60, Jourdenaux pasa al siguiente paso.",
    ["Fish up the Hydrogauge in Al Zahbi, Aht Urhgan Whitegate, Nashmau or on the Nashmau - Al Zahbi ferry, with any rod and bait (it gives the normal item message). A big-fish rod such as the S.H. Fishing Rod with Insect Balls in Whitegate works well, since few fish there get in the way."] = "Pesca el Hydrogauge en Al Zahbi, Aht Urhgan Whitegate, Nashmau o en el ferry Nashmau - Al Zahbi, con cualquier caña y cebo (da el mensaje normal de objeto). Una caña para peces grandes como la S.H. Fishing Rod con Insect Balls en Whitegate va bien, ya que allí hay pocos peces que estorben.",
    ["Fishing tip: with a Lu Shang's Fishing Rod you can do this at fishing skill 32. Fishing in Nashmau with Minnow, Sinking Minnow and Crayfish Balls eventually gives 4 of the 5 fish, and the Istavrit can be fished in Talacca Cove with a Sinking Minnow. You can also catch 4 of the 5 in Talacca Cove and the Istiridye in Nashmau."] = "Consejo de pesca: con una Lu Shang's Fishing Rod puedes hacerlo con habilidad de pesca 32. Pescando en Nashmau con Minnow, Sinking Minnow y Crayfish Balls acabas consiguiendo 4 de los 5 pescados, y el Istavrit se puede pescar en Talacca Cove con un Sinking Minnow. También puedes pescar 4 de los 5 en Talacca Cove y el Istiridye en Nashmau.",
    ["Five More Levels"] = "Cinco niveles más",
    ["Fjalar in Attohwa Chasm: rifts at (I-9), (K-7) and (K-10)."] = "Fjalar en Attohwa Chasm: rifts en (I-9), (K-7) y (K-10).",
    ["Floor 1: password #1 is in the room at (H-9). At the Brass Door at (I-8), pull a lever and run back (50% chance of a trap door); try the other lever if needed. The stairs at (J-8) lead to map 2."] = "Piso 1: la contraseña n.º 1 está en la sala de (H-9). En la Brass Door de (I-8), tira de una palanca y vuelve corriendo (50% de probabilidad de trampilla); prueba la otra palanca si hace falta. Las escaleras de (J-8) llevan al mapa 2.",
    ["Floor 2: turn right at the first intersection and run west to (G-7) (map 6), then north to map 7 for password #2 at (H-9). Back at the first intersection, go south to the fork at (H-10) and turn left; a hidden door in the east wall at (I-10) shows the lever pattern. Password #3 is in the room at the north-west corner of (I-8). Open the Brass Door at (G-8) with the levers; beyond it, enemies get tougher. Continue to (G-9) and map 3."] = "Piso 2: gira a la derecha en el primer cruce y corre al oeste hasta (G-7) (mapa 6), luego al norte al mapa 7 para la contraseña n.º 2 en (H-9). De vuelta en el primer cruce, ve al sur hasta la bifurcación de (H-10) y gira a la izquierda; una puerta oculta en la pared este en (I-10) muestra el patrón de palancas. La contraseña n.º 3 está en la sala de la esquina noroeste de (I-8). Abre la Brass Door de (G-8) con las palancas; más allá, los enemigos son más duros. Continúa hasta (G-9) y el mapa 3.",
    ["Floor 3: follow the path up the stairs to (H-11), avoiding the leech pool (they aggro by sound)."] = "Piso 3: sigue el camino escaleras arriba hasta (H-11), evitando el estanque de sanguijuelas (detectan por sonido).",
    ["Floor 4: light any torch in the corner rooms at (G-7), (G-8), (H-7) or (H-8) to open the Brass Door at (H-7) and run through before it closes (Reraise helps; a Thief can Hide). Enter the three passwords at the Brass Statue in any order, with proper capitalization; a wrong one is reported immediately. Release your Trusts first, or they may not fall with you (/returntrust all, or relog)."] = "Piso 4: enciende cualquier antorcha de las salas de las esquinas en (G-7), (G-8), (H-7) o (H-8) para abrir la Brass Door de (H-7) y cruza corriendo antes de que se cierre (Reraise ayuda; un Thief puede usar Hide). Introduce las tres contraseñas en la Brass Statue en cualquier orden, con las mayúsculas correctas; una incorrecta se avisa al instante. Despide antes a tus Trusts, o puede que no caigan contigo (/returntrust all, o reconecta).",
    ["Focus on Velociraptors early as they are weaker."] = "Céntrate al principio en los Velociraptors, que son más débiles.",
    ["Follow the Gate Guard's instructions and return to Prince Trion in Prince's Royal Room (G/H-7)."] = "Sigue las instrucciones del Gate Guard y vuelve con Prince Trion en la Prince's Royal Room (G/H-7).",
    ["Follow the hallway to the next Stone Door."] = "Sigue el pasillo hasta la siguiente Stone Door.",
    ["Follow the path north to (I-8), then stand on the geyser in the southeastern corner until it carries you onto the ledge."] = "Sigue el camino al norte hasta (I-8), luego colócate sobre el géiser de la esquina sureste hasta que te lleve a la cornisa.",
    ["Follow the path to the far end and examine Etched Rock (K-9) for a cutscene. From now on you can pick up the Ethereal Ingress teleports; #3 and #4 in the northwest are the only real detours."] = "Sigue el camino hasta el otro extremo y examina la Etched Rock (K-9) para una escena. A partir de ahora puedes recoger los teletransportes Ethereal Ingress; los #3 y #4 del noroeste son los únicos desvíos de verdad.",
    ["Follow the path without dropping down until you reach Stone Door (H-8)."] = "Sigue el camino sin dejarte caer hasta llegar a la Stone Door (H-8).",
    ["Follow the right wall to the door at (H-9) (the monsters here are much higher level) and light the Torch to pass through. Head south and turn right to another Brass Door and open it; the zone line is just past it, so run if you have aggro."] = "Sigue la pared derecha hasta la puerta de (H-9) (aquí los monstruos son de nivel mucho más alto) y enciende la Torch para pasar. Ve al sur y gira a la derecha hasta otra Brass Door y ábrela; el límite de zona está justo detrás, así que corre si te persiguen.",
    ["Follow the right wall until the path turns north, then take the left path at the three-way intersection to reach the bridge."] = "Sigue la pared derecha hasta que el camino gire al norte, luego toma el camino de la izquierda en la intersección de tres vías para llegar al puente.",
    ["Follow the route to the transporter at (G-12)."] = "Sigue la ruta hasta el transportador en (G-12).",
    ["Follow the surface path south past the Mute at (F-9), under the bridge and past the second Afflictor, then east around the giant smokestacks at (G-9)/(H-9). When it's raining, a ??? appears near the base of the smokestacks; examine it for the key item Corrupted dirt."] = "Sigue el camino de superficie al sur pasando a The Mute en (F-9), bajo el puente y pasando al segundo Afflictor, y luego al este rodeando las enormes chimeneas de (G-9)/(H-9). Cuando llueve aparece una ??? cerca de la base de las chimeneas; examínala para obtener el key item Corrupted dirt.",
    ["Follow the trail: examine the ??? next to Noam (G-9, second floor) to receive the Shaded Cruse, then the ??? up the ramp to the north (G-7), the one by the open doors on the left (G-8), the one in the hallway (H-8), and the last one in the bottom right corner of (H-8)."] = "Sigue el rastro: examina la ??? junto a Noam (G-9, segundo piso) para recibir el Shaded Cruse, luego la ??? subiendo la rampa al norte (G-7), la de junto a las puertas abiertas a la izquierda (G-8), la del pasillo (H-8) y la última en la esquina inferior derecha de (H-8).",
    ["Fomors Sound"] = "Fomors: sonido",
    ["Fomors appear at night. (20:00 - 04:00)"] = "Los Fomors aparecen de noche. (20:00 - 04:00)",
    ["Font color adjustment"] = "Ajuste del color de la letra",
    ["Font colors"] = "Colores de la letra",
    ["For Cipher: Abquhbah, speak with Abquhbah after the home nation cutscene (you must be past Aht Urhgan Mission 3, President Salaheem)."] = "Para Cipher: Abquhbah, habla con Abquhbah tras la escena de tu nación (debes haber pasado la Aht Urhgan Mission 3, President Salaheem).",
    ["For San d'Oria, it's Selbina > La Theine Plateau > West Ronfaure > San d'Oria, or the level 75 Unity Warp to East Ronfaure. And for Bastok, it's Selbina > Konschtat Highlands > North Gustaberg > South Gustaberg > Bastok, or the level 75 Unity Warp to South Gustaberg."] = "Para San d'Oria es Selbina > La Theine Plateau > West Ronfaure > San d'Oria, o el Unity Warp de nivel 75 a East Ronfaure. Y para Bastok es Selbina > Konschtat Highlands > North Gustaberg > South Gustaberg > Bastok, o el Unity Warp de nivel 75 a South Gustaberg.",
    ["For The Curious Case of Melvien you can get the Gladiatorial Writ of Summons from any of the Suspicious NPCs (choose Belligerency). If you only want it for the Mog Garden, return the writ afterwards, or you stay flagged for Belligerency in its zones."] = "Para The Curious Case of Melvien puedes conseguir el Gladiatorial Writ of Summons de cualquiera de los NPCs Suspicious (elige Belligerency). Si solo lo quieres para el Mog Garden, devuelve el writ después, o seguirás marcado para Belligerency en sus zonas.",
    ["For example, to get to Windurst, you have to either:"] = "Por ejemplo, para llegar a Windurst tienes que:",
    ["For now, you're limited to three active at once, but you will eventually get two Rhapsody key items from Rhapsodies of Vana'diel missions that give an additional Trust slot each for a full party of six."] = "Por ahora estás limitado a tres activos a la vez, pero acabarás consiguiendo dos key items Rhapsody en las misiones de Rhapsodies of Vana'diel que dan un hueco de Trust más cada uno, para un grupo completo de seis.",
    ["For now, your Trust setup should be:"] = "Por ahora, tu configuración de Trusts debería ser:",
    ["For the battle you need an Imperial Silver Piece, Remnants Permit or Captain Wildcat badge; the area can only be reached this way. Take the Home Point to Caedarva Mire, or go west out of Nashmau, then go to (E-11) and speak with Nasheefa to enter the Alzadaal Undersea Ruins."] = "Para la batalla necesitas una Imperial Silver Piece, un Remnants Permit o una Captain Wildcat badge; solo se puede llegar a la zona así. Toma el Home Point a Caedarva Mire, o sal de Nashmau por el oeste, luego ve a (E-11) y habla con Nasheefa para entrar en Alzadaal Undersea Ruins.",
    ["For the higher-level Quadavs: go north to the big room at (G-7), cross to (H-7) and head south, right at the split then left, down to (H-9). Follow the bends through the round room to the elevator in the middle and pull its lever to ride up to the second floor. Watch out for the NM Zi'Ghi Boneeater, and do not take the boat at (H-8) on that floor: it leaves you in Zeruhn Mines behind a gate you cannot pass back through."] = "Para los Quadavs de más nivel: ve al norte a la sala grande de (G-7), cruza a (H-7) y ve al sur, a la derecha en la bifurcación y luego a la izquierda, hasta (H-9). Sigue las curvas por la sala redonda hasta el ascensor del centro y tira de su palanca para subir al segundo piso. Cuidado con el NM Zi'Ghi Boneeater, y no tomes el bote de (H-8) en ese piso: te deja en Zeruhn Mines detrás de una puerta que no puedes volver a cruzar.",
    ["For the last crumb, go back to the sack room and take the north-west tunnel (not the scorpion dead end), through the green glow and up the hill into a new sack room, take the west-south-west tunnel, turn right at the ledge (don't drop) and left into the dead-end room: ??? at (G-10), map 2, among the Exorays."] = "Para la última miga, vuelve a la sala de los sacos y toma el túnel del noroeste (no el callejón sin salida de los escorpiones), atraviesa el brillo verde y sube la colina hasta otra sala de sacos, toma el túnel oeste-suroeste, gira a la derecha en la cornisa (no te dejes caer) y a la izquierda hacia la sala sin salida: ??? en (G-10), mapa 2, entre los Exorays.",
    ["For the repeat you also need a Light Ore: trade it to the Qu'Hau Spring during a full moon between 18:00 and 06:00 for the key item Moonlight ore (each player needs their own, and only after accepting the quest). A used Ark Pentasphere doesn't work again, so trade a new Illuminink and Parchment separately; if you trade all three together you only get the Moonlight ore."] = "Para repetirla también necesitas un Light Ore: entrégalo a la Qu'Hau Spring durante la luna llena entre las 18:00 y las 06:00 para obtener el key item Moonlight ore (cada jugador necesita el suyo, y solo tras aceptar la quest). Una Ark Pentasphere usada no vuelve a servir, así que entrega por separado un nuevo Illuminink y un Parchment; si entregas los tres juntos solo obtienes el Moonlight ore.",
    ["For the subsequent Limit Break quests, you become eligible to begin them when you're one level past the former cap. This means you can start LB2, Atop the Highest Mountains, as early as 51 or wait until you're capped at 55. It's a pretty quick one - just pick up three items from ??? spots in Xarcabard."] = "Las quests de Limit Break siguientes puedes empezarlas cuando estás un nivel por encima del límite anterior. Así que puedes empezar la LB2, Atop the Highest Mountains, ya a nivel 51 o esperar a toparte con el límite de 55. Es bastante rápida: solo hay que recoger tres objetos de puntos ??? en Xarcabard.",
    ["Form a party of two, yourself and one other player, with the same allegiance, then speak with him again to complete the quest."] = "Forma un grupo de dos, tú y otro jugador, con la misma allegiance, y luego habla de nuevo con él para completar la quest.",
    ["Form a party of two, yourself and one other player, with the same job, then speak with him again to complete the quest."] = "Forma un grupo de dos, tú y otro jugador, con el mismo trabajo, y luego habla de nuevo con él para completar la quest.",
    ["Form a party of two, yourself and one other player, with the same race, then speak with him again to complete the quest."] = "Forma un grupo de dos, tú y otro jugador, con la misma raza, y luego habla de nuevo con él para completar la quest.",
    ["Form a party with at least two people who are level 40 or lower. Trusts and Adventuring Fellows don't count, but Level Sync works."] = "Forma un grupo con al menos dos personas de nivel 40 o inferior. Los Trusts y los Adventuring Fellows no cuentan, pero Level Sync sí funciona.",
    ["Four camps at the mouths of the tunnels connecting to the Leech/Chapuli room."] = "Cuatro campamentos en las entradas de los túneles que conectan con la sala de Leech/Chapuli.",
    ["Fourth floor Seed Afterglow (H-10): Sanctitas Stone."] = "Seed Afterglow del cuarto piso (H-10): Sanctitas Stone.",
    ["Fourth, from the nation you're allied with in the past: Her Memories: Carnelian Footfalls (San d'Oria), Azure Footfalls (Bastok) or Verdure Footfalls (Windurst)."] = "Cuarto, de la nación con la que estás aliado en el pasado: Her Memories: Carnelian Footfalls (San d'Oria), Azure Footfalls (Bastok) o Verdure Footfalls (Windurst).",
    ["From Kamihr Drifts: drop down at (I-5) and again at (H-6), then cross the big room. From Marjami Ravine: follow the left wall to skip the reive at (H-9); you still need to clear the one at (H-7)."] = "Desde Kamihr Drifts: déjate caer en (I-5) y de nuevo en (H-6), y cruza la sala grande. Desde Marjami Ravine: sigue la pared izquierda para evitar la reive de (H-9); aún tienes que despejar la de (H-7).",
    ["From Sea Serpent Grotto, Escape or a short walk takes you out to Yuhtunga Jungle. From Norg, rent a chocobo from Marilleune (H-9). From elsewhere, Unity Wanted Battle (level 119) to Yuhtunga Jungle is close."] = "Desde Sea Serpent Grotto, Escape o un paseo corto te sacan a Yuhtunga Jungle. Desde Norg, alquila un chocobo a Marilleune (H-9). Desde otros sitios, la Unity Wanted Battle (nivel 119) a Yuhtunga Jungle está cerca.",
    ["From Yhoator Jungle, follow the path to the T-intersection, head north and exit the Temple. Faster: the Voidwatch warp puts you outside the Temple (exit 1, map 1), and the Survival Guide warp inside it (exit 2); from either, follow the left wall to the granite door at (J-7), go through and on to (K-3) to exit the Temple (exit 4)."] = "Desde Yhoator Jungle, sigue el camino hasta el cruce en T, ve al norte y sal del Temple. Más rápido: el warp de Voidwatch te deja fuera del Temple (salida 1, mapa 1) y el warp de la Survival Guide dentro (salida 2); desde cualquiera de los dos, sigue la pared izquierda hasta la puerta de granito en (J-7), crúzala y continúa hasta (K-3) para salir del Temple (salida 4).",
    ["From here head west all the way until you reach the camp."] = "Desde aquí ve al oeste hasta llegar al campamento.",
    ["From here head west, once at (G-12) head north (another reive spawns in the way) to (G-8) and take the elevator."] = "Desde aquí ve al oeste y, al llegar a (G-12), ve al norte (aparece otra reive en el camino) hasta (G-8) y toma el ascensor.",
    ["From here on you can be any job. At this point you can commission Dhima Polevhia to craft three Artifact pieces."] = "A partir de aquí puedes ir con cualquier job. En este punto puedes encargar a Dhima Polevhia que fabrique tres piezas de Artifact.",
    ["From here proceed west again (another reive spawns in the way...), follow the map to (D-5)."] = "Desde aquí sigue de nuevo al oeste (aparece otra reive en el camino...) y sigue el mapa hasta (D-5).",
    ["From the Fei'Yin entrance go east to (K-8) on map 1 and open the Cermet Portal between the two Dolls to enter Qu'Bia Arena. All your buffs wear off when you enter, so plan accordingly."] = "Desde la entrada de Fei'Yin ve al este hasta (K-8) en el mapa 1 y abre el Cermet Portal entre los dos Dolls para entrar en Qu'Bia Arena. Todos tus buffs desaparecen al entrar, así que planifícalo.",
    ["From the Fly Agaric room, take the southwest passage (to Point C, G-6/H-6) to reach map 2, and proceed to the large room at (G-7)."] = "Desde la sala de los Fly Agaric, toma el pasaje suroeste (hacia Point C, G-6/H-6) para llegar al mapa 2 y avanza hasta la sala grande en (G-7).",
    ["From the Temple of Uggalepih's main entrance, take every right turn to exit at (F-5), then hug the left wall in Yhoator Jungle to re-enter the temple at (H-11)."] = "Desde la entrada principal del Temple of Uggalepih, toma todos los giros a la derecha para salir por (F-5), luego pégate a la pared izquierda en Yhoator Jungle para volver a entrar en el templo por (H-11).",
    ["From there go west and south as you can until you come to the tunnel at (F-8) that leads back to the surface; you pass one Afflictor that curses you as you proceed."] = "Desde allí ve al oeste y al sur según puedas hasta llegar al túnel en (F-8) que vuelve a la superficie; pasas junto a un Afflictor que te maldice al avanzar.",
    ["From there head south and you will go into a cave that leads down. Take it down until it exits at (H-7) on the lower map."] = "Desde allí ve al sur y entrarás en una cueva que baja. Bájala hasta que salga en (H-7) del mapa inferior.",
    ["From there, head north to (F-7) (the little westward protrusion) and take a path not shown at the map to eventually reach the Home Point outside the Cloister of Gales."] = "Desde ahí, ve al norte hasta (F-7) (el pequeño saliente hacia el oeste) y toma un camino que no aparece en el mapa para llegar por fin al Home Point de fuera del Cloister of Gales.",
    ["From there, head west through a tunnel, then north to a westward tunnel at (H-8), then slightly west to a northward tunnel in (G-8), then north to the Ifrit's Cauldron zone line at (G-5). There's a Survival Guide just inside this entrance to the Cauldron."] = "Desde ahí, ve al oeste por un túnel, luego al norte hasta un túnel hacia el oeste en (H-8), luego un poco al oeste hasta un túnel hacia el norte en (G-8), y luego al norte hasta el límite de zona de Ifrit's Cauldron en (G-5). Hay una Survival Guide justo al pasar esta entrada al Cauldron.",
    ["Funnel Bats/Werebat"] = "Funnel Bats/Werebat",
    ["Garlaige Citadel - levels 32-42 - Another classic. Start with Bats and Beetles near the entrance, then Skeletons slightly further in, then \"everything that moves upstairs\". Don't fall down a hole..."] = "Garlaige Citadel - niveles 32-42 - Otro clásico. Empieza con Bats y Beetles cerca de la entrada, luego Skeletons un poco más adentro, y luego \"todo lo que se mueva arriba\". No te caigas por un agujero...",
    ["Garlaige route: go south and east through the first Banishing Gate, run round the outside of the square room to the east, down the stairs and hug the left wall to a wide room: ??? at (I-8). Go north-west to the next room: ??? at (H-7). Continue north, turn left down a hallway, and past the third Banishing Gate the last ??? is on your right in the first room at (G-6). Don't fall in the holes in the floor."] = "Ruta de Garlaige: ve al sur y al este por la primera Banishing Gate, rodea por fuera la sala cuadrada del este, baja las escaleras y pégate a la pared izquierda hasta una sala amplia: ??? en (I-8). Ve al noroeste a la sala siguiente: ??? en (H-7). Sigue al norte, gira a la izquierda por un pasillo y, pasada la tercera Banishing Gate, la última ??? está a tu derecha en la primera sala, en (G-6). No caigas por los agujeros del suelo.",
    ["Gather all 5 pieces, a Mannequin Body, Feet, Hands, Head and Legs, and trade them to Fyi Chalmwoh. They can also be bought from player bazaars."] = "Reúne las 5 piezas, Mannequin Body, Feet, Hands, Head y Legs, y entrégaselas a Fyi Chalmwoh. También se pueden comprar en bazares de jugadores.",
    ["Gather at the far side of the Throne Room, then examine the door to enter the battlefield \"The Shadow Lord Battle\". In his first form he switches between physical and magic immunity: rest MP while he is immune to magic (he uses Dark Nova and black magic then) and stop melee while he is immune to physical attacks (Giga Slash, Kick Back, Umbra Smash)."] = "Reuníos en el otro extremo de la Throne Room y examinad la puerta para entrar en el campo de batalla \"The Shadow Lord Battle\". En su primera forma alterna entre inmunidad física y mágica: recupera MP mientras es inmune a la magia (entonces usa Dark Nova y magia negra) y deja de atacar cuerpo a cuerpo mientras es inmune a los ataques físicos (Giga Slash, Kick Back, Umbra Smash).",
    ["Gather those items and trade them to Amaura to receive the key item Cold medicine."] = "Reúne esos objetos y entrégaselos a Amaura para recibir el key item Cold medicine.",
    ["General Afkaam is to inspect Leujaoam Sanctum. Mission orders: remove all threats. The recommended level is 50."] = "General Afkaam va a inspeccionar Leujaoam Sanctum. Órdenes de la misión: eliminar todas las amenazas. El nivel recomendado es 50.",
    ["Generally you roam the zone, but the camps listed there are historical."] = "Por lo general se recorre la zona, pero los campamentos indicados son los de siempre.",
    ["Generals Karazahm and Umarid of the Imperial Army's Arrapago division have disappeared from camp headquarters while on a mission on Sharug Isle. Mission orders: locate the generals."] = "Los Generals Karazahm y Umarid de la división Arrapago del Imperial Army han desaparecido del cuartel del campamento durante una misión en Sharug Isle. Órdenes de la misión: localizar a los generales.",
    ["Gessho gives up at about 15% HP; a cutscene completes the mission."] = "Gessho se rinde hacia el 15% de HP; una escena completa la misión.",
    ["Gessho helps you after a minute or two (the fight goes on if he falls), and Trusts are allowed. First come five Ashu Talif Crew (2 RNG, 2 RDM, 1 COR; they resist Sleep without Elemental Seal, Lullaby works at high item level), then four more along with the Ashu Talif Captain."] = "Gessho te ayuda tras uno o dos minutos (la pelea sigue si cae), y se permiten Trusts. Primero llegan cinco Ashu Talif Crew (2 RNG, 2 RDM, 1 COR; resisten Sleep sin Elemental Seal, Lullaby funciona con item level alto) y luego cuatro más junto con el Ashu Talif Captain.",
    ["Get 3 Slabs of Plumbago from the Auction House, from Trolls in Mount Zhayolm or by mining. Examine the Acid-eaten Door at the north-west corner of (I-9) in Mount Zhayolm, past the Gates of Halvung near the Halvung Staging Point (opening those gates needs a Cast metal plate), for Megomak's shopping list."] = "Consigue 3 Slabs of Plumbago en la Auction House, de los Trolls de Mount Zhayolm o minando. Examina la Acid-eaten Door de la esquina noroeste de (I-9) en Mount Zhayolm, pasadas las Gates of Halvung cerca del Halvung Staging Point (abrir esas puertas requiere una Cast metal plate), para obtener la lista de la compra de Megomak.",
    ["Get Seedspall Astrum from Yagudo in Meriphataud Mountains around (K-8) (Castle Oztroja Survival Guide)."] = "Consigue la Seedspall Astrum de los Yagudo de Meriphataud Mountains alrededor de (K-8) (Survival Guide de Castle Oztroja).",
    ["Get Seedspall Luna from Quadav in Pashhow Marshlands around (K-10) (Beadeaux Survival Guide)."] = "Consigue la Seedspall Luna de los Quadav de Pashhow Marshlands alrededor de (K-10) (Survival Guide de Beadeaux).",
    ["Get Seedspall Lux from Orcs in Jugner Forest around (G-11) (Davoi Survival Guide is closest)."] = "Consigue la Seedspall Lux de los Orcs de Jugner Forest alrededor de (G-11) (la Survival Guide de Davoi es la más cercana).",
    ["Get Signet before you go, because you will also be leveling up along the way and it has a really long duration."] = "Consigue Signet antes de ir, porque también subirás de nivel por el camino y dura muchísimo.",
    ["Get a Block of Yagudo Glue from Yagudo Pipers, Lutenists, Chanters, Conductors or Drummers in a Shadowreign zone; Castle Oztroja (S), via the Meriphataud Mountains (S) Survival Guide, is easiest."] = "Consigue un Block of Yagudo Glue de los Yagudo Pipers, Lutenists, Chanters, Conductors o Drummers de una zona de Shadowreign; Castle Oztroja (S), mediante la Survival Guide de Meriphataud Mountains (S), es lo más fácil.",
    ["Get a Kuftal Coffer Key in Kuftal Tunnel, or buy one from the Curio Vendor Moogle. Quickest: the Survival Guide from Vollbow, or the Unity Warp (level 125) to Kuftal Tunnel."] = "Consigue una Kuftal Coffer Key en Kuftal Tunnel, o compra una al Curio Vendor Moogle. Lo más rápido: la Survival Guide desde Vollbow, o el Unity Warp (nivel 125) a Kuftal Tunnel.",
    ["Get a Lamian Fang Key. Free once per game day: in Caedarva Mire map 1, examine the ??? west of the southern pool at (I-7). From the Arrapago Reef Survival Guide, zone out to Caedarva Mire at (I-6) and walk south; on foot, take Nashmau's north exit into Caedarva Mire. The key also drops from Lamiae and Draugers in Arrapago Reef (about 16 minute respawn, 5 possible ones before the gate), but the free one is easier."] = "Consigue una Lamian Fang Key. Gratis una vez por día de juego: en el mapa 1 de Caedarva Mire, examina la ??? al oeste del estanque sur en (I-7). Desde la Survival Guide de Arrapago Reef, sal a Caedarva Mire por (I-6) y camina al sur; a pie, toma la salida norte de Nashmau hacia Caedarva Mire. La llave también la sueltan las Lamiae y los Draugers de Arrapago Reef (reaparecen cada 16 minutos aproximadamente, 5 posibles antes de la puerta), pero la gratuita es más fácil.",
    ["Get a Lamian Fang Key: from the ??? near a pond a short way from the Arrapago Reef entrance at (I-6) in Caedarva Mire (beware of the green swamp water there), from Lamia and Draugar inside the reef, or pick the Iron Gate's lock as a Thief. The Survival Guide to Arrapago Reef is the quickest start: zone out to fetch the key and come back in from (I-6)."] = "Consigue una Lamian Fang Key: de la ??? junto a un estanque, a poca distancia de la entrada de Arrapago Reef en (I-6) de Caedarva Mire (cuidado con el agua verde de la ciénaga), de las Lamia y los Draugar dentro del arrecife, o forzando la cerradura de la Iron Gate como Thief. La Survival Guide a Arrapago Reef es el inicio más rápido: sal para buscar la llave y vuelve a entrar por (I-6).",
    ["Get a Pickaxe from the Auction House or a merchant; Numa (E-7), in the shop down the stairs in front of the Steaming Sheep, sells them."] = "Consigue un Pickaxe en la Auction House o de un mercader; Numa (E-7), en la tienda bajando las escaleras frente al Steaming Sheep, los vende.",
    ["Get a Pickaxe. If you have the La Theine Plateau Proto-Waypoint, you can warp to the valley and skip the cave route below, but zone into Ordelle's Caves and back out first or you will not be able to trade the pickaxe."] = "Consigue un Pickaxe. Si tienes el Proto-Waypoint de La Theine Plateau, puedes teletransportarte al valle y saltarte la ruta por la cueva de abajo, pero entra en Ordelle's Caves y vuelve a salir antes, o no podrás entregar el pico.",
    ["Get a Prelate Key from the Tonberry Stabbers on Maps 3/4 of the Temple of Uggalepih (Tonberry Choppers in Yhoator Jungle and Tonberry Slashers in the Den of Rancor also drop it). Only one person needs one: once someone is past the door, they can open it for the rest."] = "Consigue una Prelate Key de los Tonberry Stabbers de los mapas 3/4 del Temple of Uggalepih (también la sueltan los Tonberry Choppers de Yhoator Jungle y los Tonberry Slashers de Den of Rancor). Solo hace falta una persona con llave: cuando alguien cruza la puerta, puede abrirla al resto.",
    ["Get a pair of Moccasins: buy them at the Auction House, get them as a drop from various enemies, or craft them (Leathercraft level 59)."] = "Consigue un par de Moccasins: cómpralos en la Auction House, consíguelos como drop de varios enemigos o fabrícalos (Leathercraft nivel 59).",
    ["Get a recommendation letter from an Allied fortress near Jeuno. Your choice only affects Allied Notes prices and where Retrace sends you; you can do every nation's quests either way."] = "Consigue una carta de recomendación en una fortaleza aliada cerca de Jeuno. Tu elección solo afecta a los precios en Allied Notes y a adónde te envía Retrace; puedes hacer las quests de todas las naciones igualmente.",
    ["Get an Aht Urhgan boarding permit from the Tenshodo. If you already have one, this mission completes automatically."] = "Consigue un pase de embarque a Aht Urhgan en el Tenshodo. Si ya tienes uno, esta misión se completa automáticamente.",
    ["Get an Orcish Armor Plate from Orcs in Yughott Grotto."] = "Consigue una Orcish Armor Plate de los Orcs de Yughott Grotto.",
    ["Get another Lamian Fang Key and go back to the ??? on the ship at (H-10), Arrapago Reef Map 1 (Arrapago Reef Survival Guide)."] = "Consigue otra Lamian Fang Key y vuelve a la ??? del barco en (H-10), mapa 1 de Arrapago Reef (Survival Guide de Arrapago Reef).",
    ["Get one from the Auction House (Food > Ingredients), or trade a Rolanberry (Crawler's Nest NM chain, or the Auction House) to Pellio in Rolanberry Fields (F-11) for a 50/50 White or Ripe White Rolanberry. Pellio only accepts it after Kupipi's request. The Crawler's Nest Survival Guide is closest."] = "Consigue una en la Auction House (Food > Ingredients), o entrega una Rolanberry (cadena de NMs de Crawler's Nest, o la Auction House) a Pellio en Rolanberry Fields (F-11) para obtener al 50% una White o una Ripe White Rolanberry. Pellio solo la acepta tras el encargo de Kupipi. La Survival Guide de Crawler's Nest es la más cercana.",
    ["Get six fragment key items from NMs (everyone in the party gets one when it drops; high rate but not guaranteed; Treasure Hunter doesn't help). Each NM despawns 5 minutes after being engaged and respawns 2 minutes later. Each one only takes one kind of damage, so pick Trusts accordingly."] = "Consigue seis key items de fragmento de NMs (todos los del grupo reciben uno cuando cae; probabilidad alta pero no segura; Treasure Hunter no ayuda). Cada NM desaparece 5 minutos después de entrar en combate y reaparece 2 minutos más tarde. Cada uno solo recibe un tipo de daño, así que elige los Trusts en consecuencia.",
    ["Get stylish"] = "Ponte con estilo",
    ["Get the Lynx Pelt from the ??? in Castle Oztroja (S) at (G-8) on the first floor, then trade the Vellum to the Optistery door for a cutscene."] = "Consigue la Lynx Pelt de la ??? de Castle Oztroja (S) en (G-8), en el primer piso, y luego entrega el Vellum a la Optistery door para una escena.",
    ["Get the Opal Silk and Saber Shoot by trading Liks and Gugrusauruses to Zaldon in Selbina (about a 0.5% chance each)."] = "Consigue la Opal Silk y el Saber Shoot entregando Liks y Gugrusauruses a Zaldon en Selbina (alrededor del 0.5% cada uno).",
    ["Get the Waterway facility crank from the Storage Container (H-6) in Rala Waterways. From town, the Western Adoulin (K-8) entrance by the Big Bridge waypoint is closest; Sneak is enough."] = "Consigue la Waterway facility crank del Storage Container (H-6) de Rala Waterways. Desde la ciudad, la entrada de Western Adoulin (K-8) junto al waypoint del Big Bridge es la más cercana; basta con Sneak.",
    ["Get two cutscenes in the Alzadaal Undersea Ruins: take the Runic Portal to the Nyzul Isle Staging Point and use the north exit. Step on the north-east teleporter at (H-8) (toward Silver Sea Remnants), take the east teleporter in the next room, then the west one. Arriving at (H-9), walk toward the exit for the first cutscene."] = "Consigue dos escenas en Alzadaal Undersea Ruins: toma el Runic Portal al Nyzul Isle Staging Point y usa la salida norte. Pisa el teletransportador noreste de (H-8) (hacia Silver Sea Remnants), toma el teletransportador este de la sala siguiente y luego el oeste. Al llegar a (H-9), camina hacia la salida para la primera escena.",
    ["Ghost Sound"] = "Ghost: sonido",
    ["Ghost and Skeleton Sound"] = "Ghost y Skeleton: sonido",
    ["Ghost and Skeletons Sound"] = "Ghost y Skeletons: sonido",
    ["Gigas"] = "Gigas",
    ["Gigas Sight Links"] = "Gigas: vista, se enlazan",
    ["Give the Goblin Grenadier (H-8) the digit (up to two extra hints allowed) for the Pocket mogbomb, plus 5 minutes of Flee if you used no hints."] = "Da al Goblin Grenadier (H-8) el dígito (se permiten hasta dos pistas extra) para obtener el Pocket mogbomb, más 5 minutos de Flee si no usaste pistas.",
    ["Give the Purple Ribbon to Kerutoto in the northern Rhinostery building in Windurst Waters South (J-8) for 3,600 gil."] = "Entrega la Purple Ribbon a Kerutoto en el edificio norte de la Rhinostery en Windurst Waters South (J-8) por 3,600 gil.",
    ["Give the flower to Moari-Kaaori to receive your reward: an Iron Sword the first time and 400 gil on later completions."] = "Entrega la flor a Moari-Kaaori para recibir tu recompensa: una Iron Sword la primera vez y 400 gil en las siguientes.",
    ["Gnoletrap"] = "Gnoletrap",
    ["Go around the left side of the lake in the large room to the ??? at its north-west corner, on a rock near the tunnel going west (not by the water). Examine it for a cutscene and the key item Forgotten hexagun."] = "Rodea por la izquierda el lago de la sala grande hasta la ??? de su esquina noroeste, sobre una roca cerca del túnel que va al oeste (no junto al agua). Examínala para una escena y el key item Forgotten hexagun.",
    ["Go back and defeat the Goblin Reaver, then examine the ??? it leaves once per explosive until you have three."] = "Vuelve atrás y derrota al Goblin Reaver, y examina la ??? que deja una vez por explosivo hasta tener tres.",
    ["Go back and speak with Balasiel to receive your reward."] = "Vuelve y habla con Balasiel para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Go back and speak with Brutus to receive your reward, the Decimation weapon skill."] = "Vuelve y habla con Brutus para recibir tu recompensa, el weapon skill Decimation.",
    ["Go back and speak with Cid to receive your reward, the Detonator weapon skill."] = "Vuelve y habla con Cid para recibir tu recompensa, el weapon skill Detonator.",
    ["Go back and speak with Curilla to receive your reward."] = "Vuelve y habla con Curilla para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Go back and speak with Deraquien."] = "Vuelve y habla con Deraquien.",
    ["Go back and speak with Gumbah to receive your reward, the Ground Strike weapon skill."] = "Vuelve y habla con Gumbah para recibir tu recompensa, el weapon skill Ground Strike.",
    ["Go back and speak with Iron Eater to receive your reward, the Steel Cyclone weapon skill."] = "Vuelve y habla con Iron Eater para recibir tu recompensa, el weapon skill Steel Cyclone.",
    ["Go back and speak with Jaucribaix to receive your reward, the weapon skill Tachi: Kasha."] = "Vuelve y habla con Jaucribaix para recibir tu recompensa, el weapon skill Tachi: Kasha.",
    ["Go back and speak with Kuroido-Moido to receive your reward, the Black Halo weapon skill."] = "Vuelve y habla con Kuroido-Moido para recibir tu recompensa, el weapon skill Black Halo.",
    ["Go back and speak with Novalmauge to receive your reward."] = "Vuelve y habla con Novalmauge para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Go back and speak with Oggbi to receive your Temple Gaiters."] = "Vuelve y habla con Oggbi para recibir tus Temple Gaiters.",
    ["Go back and speak with Oggbi to receive your reward."] = "Vuelve y habla con Oggbi para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Go back and speak with Perih Vashai to receive your reward, the Empyreal Arrow weapon skill."] = "Vuelve y habla con Perih Vashai para recibir tu recompensa, el weapon skill Empyreal Arrow.",
    ["Go back and speak with Ryoma to receive your reward, the weapon skill Blade: Ku."] = "Vuelve y habla con Ryoma para recibir tu recompensa, el weapon skill Blade: Ku.",
    ["Go back and speak with Shantotto to receive your reward, the Retribution weapon skill."] = "Vuelve a hablar con Shantotto para recibir tu recompensa, el weapon skill Retribution.",
    ["Go back down the stairs to the main room and one more flight to the lowest level of the Safehold."] = "Baja de nuevo las escaleras a la sala principal y un tramo más hasta el nivel más bajo del Safehold.",
    ["Go back out through the keyhole door. Old Professor Mariselle spawns from a random ??? on a desk in one of the six classrooms (three north, three south); try each one. Only players on this mission can spawn it. Clear the room's Fomors first: spawning drops Sneak."] = "Vuelve a salir por la puerta de las cerraduras. Old Professor Mariselle aparece en una ??? al azar sobre un pupitre de una de las seis aulas (tres al norte, tres al sur); prueba cada una. Solo pueden hacerlo aparecer los jugadores que estén en esta misión. Despeja antes los Fomors de la sala: hacerlo aparecer quita Sneak.",
    ["Go back out to Caedarva Mire and examine the Vexing Sniffles at (E-10), in the graveyard, for a cutscene."] = "Vuelve a salir a Caedarva Mire y examina los Vexing Sniffles de (E-10), en el cementerio, para una escena.",
    ["Go back outside and kill stuff with your new party! You'll marvel at the difference in kill speed with Valaineral! Also, the other Trusts are there too."] = "¡Vuelve fuera y mata cosas con tu nuevo grupo! ¡Te asombrará la diferencia de velocidad con Valaineral! Y los demás Trusts también están ahí.",
    ["Go back through the door and south past Loutille and Duchille, through the Heavy Iron Gate (Slimes and Bats aggro, so bring Sneak or Silent Oil), then south and west towards the square section and the Storeroom Door at (G-7)."] = "Vuelve a cruzar la puerta y ve al sur pasando a Loutille y Duchille, cruza la Heavy Iron Gate (los Slimes y los murciélagos atacan, así que lleva Sneak o Silent Oil), luego al sur y al oeste hacia la sección cuadrada y la Storeroom Door de (G-7).",
    ["Go back to Gantineux, who gives you the key item Gantineux's letter and tells you to deliver it to Eperdur."] = "Vuelve con Gantineux, que te da el key item Gantineux's letter y te dice que se la entregues a Eperdur.",
    ["Go back to Imasuke, who tells you to find someone who can translate the ring."] = "Vuelve con Imasuke, que te dice que busques a alguien que pueda traducir el anillo.",
    ["Go back to Iruki-Waraki in Aht Urhgan Whitegate to receive your Turbo Animator."] = "Vuelve con Iruki-Waraki en Aht Urhgan Whitegate para recibir tu Turbo Animator.",
    ["Go back to Kazham and talk to Etteh Sulaej."] = "Vuelve a Kazham y habla con Etteh Sulaej.",
    ["Go back to Ru'Aun Gardens and enter the Shrine of Ru'Avitau through any entrance (or warp to its Home Point) for a cutscene. The (I-6) entrance, near Ru'Aun Gardens Home Point #1, is handiest for the next mission."] = "Vuelve a Ru'Aun Gardens y entra en el Shrine of Ru'Avitau por cualquier entrada (o teletranspórtate a su Home Point) para una escena. La entrada de (I-6), cerca del Home Point #1 de Ru'Aun Gardens, es la más práctica para la misión siguiente.",
    ["Go back to Wahid and trade the Siren's Tear to complete the quest and receive 150 gil. If you are doing this quest for a Vana'Bout objective and have already completed it once, you do not need to speak to Wahid again to start it."] = "Vuelve con Wahid y entrega la Siren's Tear para completar la quest y recibir 150 gil. Si haces esta quest para un objetivo de Vana'Bout y ya la completaste una vez, no necesitas hablar de nuevo con Wahid para empezarla.",
    ["Go back to Windurst Woods and speak with Nanaa Mihgo. The correct answer is \"Blank\", but any answer progresses the quest."] = "Vuelve a Windurst Woods y habla con Nanaa Mihgo. La respuesta correcta es \"Blank\", pero cualquier respuesta hace avanzar la quest.",
    ["Go back to the Tavnazian Safehold and talk to Enaremand again for your reward, the Mannequin Pumps."] = "Vuelve a Tavnazian Safehold y habla de nuevo con Enaremand por tu recompensa, el Mannequin Pumps.",
    ["Go down the hallway and examine the Shimmering Circle for the last cutscene."] = "Baja por el pasillo y examina el Shimmering Circle para la última escena.",
    ["Go left through the north door, down the hallway into the first room (its Fomors link). Circle right around the bookshelves to the ??? in the southwest corner; it opens a one-way door on the south side. The ??? straight ahead on the east wall is a trap that drops you out."] = "Ve a la izquierda por la puerta norte, baja el pasillo hasta la primera sala (sus Fomors se enlazan). Rodea por la derecha las estanterías hasta la ??? de la esquina suroeste; abre una puerta de un solo sentido en el lado sur. La ??? justo delante, en la pared este, es una trampa que te saca fuera.",
    ["Go north and descend the stairs to Celestial Nexus (H-9)."] = "Ve al norte y baja las escaleras hasta Celestial Nexus (H-9).",
    ["Go north from the Beaucedine Glacier [S] Campaign Arbiter to (H-7) and walk into the hole in the ground in the bottom right of the square."] = "Ve al norte desde el Campaign Arbiter de Beaucedine Glacier [S] hasta (H-7) y entra en el agujero del suelo en la parte inferior derecha de la cuadrícula.",
    ["Go north to the Acolyte Hostel (K-6) and interact with each of the six doors on the ground floor to play Quiz de Vana'diel. Answer a question correctly, then go to another door, until you have 4 to 6 correct answers."] = "Ve al norte hasta el Acolyte Hostel (K-6) e interactúa con cada una de las seis puertas de la planta baja para jugar a Quiz de Vana'diel. Responde correctamente una pregunta y luego ve a otra puerta, hasta tener de 4 a 6 respuestas correctas.",
    ["Go northeast along the slightly hidden path and examine Savage Scars (I-6) at (I-6), beside the Engraved Tablet, for a cutscene. Summon Trusts first."] = "Ve al noreste por el camino algo escondido y examina las Savage Scars (I-6) en (I-6), junto a la Engraved Tablet, para una escena. Invoca antes a los Trusts.",
    ["Go northeast up the stairs at (H-8) and examine the Marble Door at the top to enter the Animastery."] = "Ve al noreste subiendo las escaleras de (H-8) y examina la Marble Door de arriba para entrar en la Animastery.",
    ["Go outside and summon Valaineral to complete that objective, unlocking another objective to summon another Trust, and continue until you have the Joachim Trust and no Alter Ego objectives left."] = "Sal fuera e invoca a Valaineral para completar ese objetivo, lo que desbloquea otro objetivo para invocar otro Trust, y sigue hasta tener el Trust de Joachim y no quedar objetivos de Alter Ego.",
    ["Go past the Silver Door at (N-14): examine the door three times and trade it a Silver Beastcoin to get through. You keep the Silver Beastcoin."] = "Pasa la Silver Door de (N-14): examina la puerta tres veces y entrégale una Silver Beastcoin para pasar. Te quedas con la Silver Beastcoin.",
    ["Go south to the dead end at (C-6) and examine the Sluice Gate (C-6). Enter the four-letter password in capitals: the initials of the four order leaders marked in the library's History book (HGSI)."] = "Ve al sur hasta el callejón sin salida de (C-6) y examina la Sluice Gate (C-6). Introduce la contraseña de cuatro letras en mayúsculas: las iniciales de los cuatro líderes de orden marcados en el libro History de la biblioteca (HGSI).",
    ["Go through Banishing Gate #1 at (I-9) on map 1, then Banishing Gate #2 at (H-10) on map 2."] = "Atraviesa la Banishing Gate #1 en (I-9) del mapa 1 y luego la Banishing Gate #2 en (H-10) del mapa 2.",
    ["Go through Banishing Gate #1 to Map 2: examine the ??? west of the intersection at (F-9), then the one across the hall to the east at (F/G-9), then go back toward the gate for the one at (G-8/9), and round the edge of the large room (avoid the holes in the middle) to the one at (G-7)."] = "Cruza la Banishing Gate #1 al mapa 2: examina la ??? al oeste del cruce en (F-9), luego la del otro lado del pasillo al este en (F/G-9), vuelve hacia la puerta para la de (G-8/9) y rodea el borde de la sala grande (evita los agujeros del centro) hasta la de (G-7).",
    ["Go through Castle Zvahl Baileys [S] and Castle Zvahl Keep [S] (Castle Zvahl Keep [S] Home Point #1 if you have it) and zone into the Throne Room [S] for a cutscene."] = "Cruza Castle Zvahl Baileys [S] y Castle Zvahl Keep [S] (el Home Point #1 de Castle Zvahl Keep [S] si lo tienes) y entra en la Throne Room [S] para una escena.",
    ["Go through the Portcullis and check Door: House (M-8) to complete the quest and receive the reward."] = "Cruza el Portcullis y revisa la Door: House (M-8) para completar la quest y recibir la recompensa.",
    ["Go through the weight door at (H-8) (one Galka, two Humes/Elvaan/Mithra, three Tarutaru, or a Loadstone) and examine the ??? (G-11) at the statue for a cutscene."] = "Cruza la puerta de peso de (H-8) (un Galka, dos Hume/Elvaan/Mithra, tres Tarutaru o una Loadstone) y examina la ??? (G-11) junto a la estatua para una escena.",
    ["Go to (D-4) and examine the north-east sarcophagus (clear the room first if you are low level) to spawn two tigers, Taifun and Trombe, and a hound, Sturm. Only Sturm has to be defeated, and the tigers can be charmed to help you."] = "Ve a (D-4) y examina el sarcófago del noreste (limpia antes la sala si eres de nivel bajo) para hacer aparecer dos tigres, Taifun y Trombe, y un sabueso, Sturm. Solo hay que derrotar a Sturm, y los tigres se pueden encantar para que te ayuden.",
    ["Go to (E-9) and down the ramp at D (aggressive Chigoes) to Map 5, and examine Survey Point (F-8) for a cutscene."] = "Ve a (E-9) y baja la rampa D (Chigoes agresivos) hasta el mapa 5, y examina el Survey Point (F-8) para una escena.",
    ["Go to (G-6) and examine the Pellucid Afflusion next to the pond for a cutscene and Rosulatia's pome. A bush at the (G-5/6)-(H-5/6) corner sometimes rises and blocks the path for a few minutes."] = "Ve a (G-6) y examina la Pellucid Afflusion junto al estanque para una escena y el Rosulatia's pome. Un arbusto en la esquina de (G-5/6)-(H-5/6) a veces se levanta y bloquea el camino durante unos minutos.",
    ["Go to (G-6) on Map 1 to drop to Map 2, then examine the Fossil Rocks until you get the key item Lapis coral. There are 14 on Map 2: 4 in the room at (H-5), 2 at (I-7), 6 in the large room at (F-7)/(G-7)/(G-8) including one at (F-8), and 2 at (I-8)."] = "Ve a (G-6) en el mapa 1 para bajar al mapa 2 y examina las Fossil Rocks hasta obtener el key item Lapis coral. Hay 14 en el mapa 2: 4 en la sala de (H-5), 2 en (I-7), 6 en la sala grande de (F-7)/(G-7)/(G-8), incluida una en (F-8), y 2 en (I-8).",
    ["Go to (G-8) and examine the Iron Box while wearing the coif to spawn the Goblin Preceptor (RDM) with Grimoire Guru Grimogek, Dread Dealing Dredodak and four Bugbear Portermen. Only the Goblin Preceptor has to be defeated; the others then disappear."] = "Ve a (G-8) y examina la Iron Box llevando la cofia para hacer aparecer al Goblin Preceptor (RDM) con Grimoire Guru Grimogek, Dread Dealing Dredodak y cuatro Bugbear Portermen. Solo hay que derrotar al Goblin Preceptor; los demás desaparecen entonces.",
    ["Go to (G-8) on the first map of the Temple of Uggalepih and hang the picture at the Stone Picture Frame, on the south wall of the Paintbrush Room, to spawn the Golem NM Trompe L'Oeil. The Temple of Uggalepih Survival Guide warp puts you a short distance from the Stone Frame."] = "Ve a (G-8) del primer mapa del Temple of Uggalepih y cuelga el cuadro en el Stone Picture Frame, en la pared sur de la Paintbrush Room, para invocar al NM Golem Trompe L'Oeil. El warp de la Survival Guide del Temple of Uggalepih te deja a poca distancia del Stone Frame.",
    ["Go to (G-9) and examine the Gravestone for another cutscene. The Magicked astrolabe lets you get there solo."] = "Ve a (G-9) y examina la Gravestone para otra escena. El Magicked astrolabe te permite llegar tú solo.",
    ["Go to (G-9) in Aht Urhgan Whitegate and talk to Eunheem."] = "Ve a (G-9) en Aht Urhgan Whitegate y habla con Eunheem.",
    ["Go to (H-5) and zone into the Hall of the Gods. Run through the hallway and examine the Cermet Grate twice; the next mission starts."] = "Ve a (H-5) y entra en Hall of the Gods. Recorre el pasillo y examina la Cermet Grate dos veces; empieza la misión siguiente.",
    ["Go to (H-8) on map 1 to reach map 2."] = "Ve a (H-8) del mapa 1 para llegar al mapa 2.",
    ["Go to (I-10) on map 2 and examine the ??? to spawn three Wyrmfly (Fly NMs)."] = "Ve a (I-10) del mapa 2 y examina la ??? para invocar a tres Wyrmfly (Fly NMs).",
    ["Go to (I-5) in Jugner Forest (S), near the Batallia Downs (S) zone line (Survival Guide there, the Cavernous Maw, or Recall-Jugner). Examine the glowing pebbles spot by the shore for a cutscene and the key item Stardust pebble. It doesn't actually glow: target around (I-5) and watch the target names."] = "Ve a (I-5) en Jugner Forest (S), cerca del límite de zona de Batallia Downs (S) (allí hay Survival Guide, el Cavernous Maw o Recall-Jugner). Examina el punto de los guijarros brillantes junto a la orilla para una escena y el key item Stardust pebble. En realidad no brilla: apunta alrededor de (I-5) y fíjate en los nombres de objetivo.",
    ["Go to (I-5) in Port Bastok and speak with Ensetsu."] = "Ve a (I-5) de Port Bastok y habla con Ensetsu.",
    ["Go to (I-6) and examine the ??? on a tree stump for a cutscene."] = "Ve a (I-6) y examina la ??? de un tocón para una escena.",
    ["Go to (J-6) up to the 12th floor, then to (F-10) and take the teleporter into Stellar Fulcrum at the top of Delkfutt's Tower for a cutscene. Upper Delkfutt's Tower Home Point #1 is right by this teleporter for later visits."] = "Ve a (J-6) para subir al piso 12, luego a (F-10) y toma el teletransportador a Stellar Fulcrum, en lo alto de Delkfutt's Tower, para una escena. El Home Point #1 de Upper Delkfutt's Tower está justo junto a este teletransportador para visitas posteriores.",
    ["Go to (J-8) and examine the ??? that is not glowing (there are two side by side) for a cutscene that spawns Magic Sludge, a Dark Elemental NM. It is highly resistant to physical damage and somewhat to magic. Only the person who started the cutscene gets credit, and another can only be spawned 3 minutes after it dies."] = "Ve a (J-8) y examina la ??? que no brilla (hay dos una al lado de otra) para una escena que hace aparecer a Magic Sludge, un NM Dark Elemental. Es muy resistente al daño físico y algo a la magia. Solo quien inició la escena obtiene el crédito, y no se puede hacer aparecer otro hasta 3 minutos después de que muera.",
    ["Go to (K-9) in Behemoth's Dominion and examine the ??? to spawn three Goblin NMs: Doglix Muttsnout (Lv.58 WHM), Moxnix Nightgoggle (Lv.58 RNG) and Picklix Longindex (Lv.60 THF). All three use Bomb Toss often. They can be spawned once per game day (\"It is too blurry to read\" means wait), and the fight can be done on any job once the quest is active."] = "Ve a (K-9) en Behemoth's Dominion y examina la ??? para hacer aparecer tres NMs Goblin: Doglix Muttsnout (Lv.58 WHM), Moxnix Nightgoggle (Lv.58 RNG) y Picklix Longindex (Lv.60 THF). Los tres usan Bomb Toss a menudo. Se pueden hacer aparecer una vez por día de juego (\"It is too blurry to read\" significa que hay que esperar), y la pelea puede hacerse con cualquier job una vez activa la quest.",
    ["Go to (N-10), the far southeast corner, and examine the Royal Sepulcher for a cutscene."] = "Ve a (N-10), la esquina sureste del todo, y examina el Royal Sepulcher para una escena.",
    ["Go to Arrapago Reef (H-10), map 1, and examine the ??? (the same one as in Luck of the Draw) for a cutscene. You end up in the right area after finishing Against All Odds."] = "Ve a Arrapago Reef (H-10), mapa 1, y examina la ??? (la misma que en Luck of the Draw) para una escena. Acabas en la zona correcta tras terminar Against All Odds.",
    ["Go to Arrapago Reef Map 1 (the Arrapago Reef Survival Guide is easiest) and examine the ??? at the northeast corner of (H-10), at the center of the ship's bow just left of the glowing target, for a cutscene that mentions the Pteraketos. On foot: enter from Caedarva Mire (I-6), trade a key to the Iron Gate at (J-10), and hug the left wall."] = "Ve al mapa 1 de Arrapago Reef (la Survival Guide de Arrapago Reef es lo más fácil) y examina la ??? de la esquina noreste de (H-10), en el centro de la proa del barco justo a la izquierda del objetivo brillante, para una escena que menciona al Pteraketos. A pie: entra desde Caedarva Mire (I-6), entrega una llave a la Iron Gate de (J-10) y pégate a la pared izquierda.",
    ["Go to Arrapago Reef Map 3 and trade the Hamsi to the Apkallu Guide (F-7) for a cutscene. The Caedarva Mire Survival Guide and the cave east is quickest; without it, walk via Map 2 (B), Map 3 (C) and gate E at (F-9) (needs a key) and zone at (F-6) to unlock it."] = "Ve al mapa 3 de Arrapago Reef y entrega el Hamsi al Apkallu Guide (F-7) para una escena. Lo más rápido es la Survival Guide de Caedarva Mire y la cueva del este; sin ella, camina por el mapa 2 (B), el mapa 3 (C) y la puerta E de (F-9) (requiere llave) y cambia de zona en (F-6) para desbloquearla.",
    ["Go to Arrapago Reef. Use the Arrapago Reef Survival Guide to get there quickly; if you do not have it, you can get it by walking from Nashmau or take the long way using the Azouph Isle Staging Point from Aht Urhgan Whitegate. You need a Lamian Fang Key to get to the ???."] = "Ve a Arrapago Reef. Usa la Survival Guide de Arrapago Reef para llegar rápido; si no la tienes, puedes conseguirla andando desde Nashmau o tomar el camino largo con el Azouph Isle Staging Point desde Aht Urhgan Whitegate. Necesitas una Lamian Fang Key para llegar a la ???.",
    ["Go to Attohwa Chasm with a few Sickles (Trailblazer Sickles don't work) and harvest the glowing Harvesting Point at (H-8) for the Solidago flower. Only that point works. Unity Warp (level 125) is quickest: turn around and follow the tunnel."] = "Ve a Attohwa Chasm con algunas Sickles (las Trailblazer Sickles no sirven) y recolecta en el Harvesting Point brillante de (H-8) para obtener la Solidago flower. Solo sirve ese punto. El Unity Warp (nivel 125) es lo más rápido: date la vuelta y sigue el túnel.",
    ["Go to Aydeewa Subterrane: its Survival Guide, Unity Warp (level 125) to Wajaom Woodlands (the zone line is right behind you), or the Wajaom Woodlands (G-7) entrance."] = "Ve a Aydeewa Subterrane: su Survival Guide, el Unity Warp (nivel 125) a Wajaom Woodlands (el límite de zona está justo detrás de ti) o la entrada de Wajaom Woodlands (G-7).",
    ["Go to Balga's Dais in Giddeus (Giddeus Home Point #1 is closest) and enter the battlefield \"Saintly Invitation\". Only players on or past this mission can enter."] = "Ve a Balga's Dais en Giddeus (el Home Point #1 de Giddeus es el más cercano) y entra en el campo de batalla \"Saintly Invitation\". Solo pueden entrar los jugadores que estén en esta misión o más allá.",
    ["Go to Balrahn Way for another cutscene. When presented an option, choose \"Where have you been\"."] = "Ve a Balrahn Way para otra escena. Cuando te den una opción, elige \"Where have you been\".",
    ["Go to Bastok Markets (Home Point #1) and look for Michea at (F-10), upstairs inside Brunhilde the Armorer's shop."] = "Ve a Bastok Markets (Home Point #1) y busca a Michea en (F-10), arriba dentro de la tienda de Brunhilde the Armorer.",
    ["Go to Bastok Markets (S) and speak with Raginmund near Harmodio's Music Shop (L-10)."] = "Ve a Bastok Markets (S) y habla con Raginmund cerca de Harmodio's Music Shop (L-10).",
    ["Go to Bastok Markets and speak with Shamarhaan at (F-9) for a cutscene and the key item Valkeng's memory chip. He asks you to retrieve an item from Mount Zhayolm."] = "Ve a Bastok Markets y habla con Shamarhaan en (F-9) para una escena y el key item Valkeng's memory chip. Te pide recuperar un objeto de Mount Zhayolm.",
    ["Go to Bastok Metalworks and speak with Naji (J-8) in front of the President's Office for a cutscene. You may need to speak with him several times to get the right cutscene."] = "Ve a Bastok Metalworks y habla con Naji (J-8) frente al President's Office para una escena. Puede que tengas que hablar con él varias veces para ver la escena correcta.",
    ["Go to Bastok Metalworks and speak with Naji (J-8) in front of the President's Office to begin the embassy mission."] = "Ve a Bastok Metalworks y habla con Naji (J-8) frente al President's Office para empezar la misión de embajada.",
    ["Go to Bastok Metalworks and speak with Naji (J-8) in front of the President's Office."] = "Ve a Bastok Metalworks y habla con Naji (J-8) frente al President's Office.",
    ["Go to Bastok Mines and speak with Pavvke in his residence on the lower level (I-7) for a cutscene that completes the quest and gives you your reward."] = "Ve a Bastok Mines y habla con Pavvke en su residencia del nivel inferior (I-7) para una escena que completa la quest y te da tu recompensa.",
    ["Go to Bastok Mines and speak with Virnage at (I-5) for a cutscene. Agree to his proposal and you receive the Dawn talisman."] = "Ve a Bastok Mines y habla con Virnage en (I-5) para una escena. Acepta su propuesta y recibes el Dawn talisman.",
    ["Go to Beadeaux and get a cutscene on entering. The Survival Guide inside Beadeaux is closest; Unity Warp (level 122) goes to Pashhow Marshlands."] = "Ve a Beadeaux y obtén una escena al entrar. La Survival Guide de dentro de Beadeaux es la más cercana; el Unity Warp (nivel 122) va a Pashhow Marshlands.",
    ["Go to Beadeaux and open a Treasure Coffer with a Beadeaux Coffer Key, or pick the lock as a Thief. The Curio Vendor Moogle sells the key. You don't need to be on White Mage for this; you receive the key item Old gauntlets."] = "Ve a Beadeaux y abre un Treasure Coffer con una Beadeaux Coffer Key, o fuerza la cerradura como Thief. El Curio Vendor Moogle vende la llave. No necesitas ser White Mage para esto; recibes el key item Old gauntlets.",
    ["Go to Beadeaux and proceed to one of the sets of machines. You need to visit an Afflictor, which curses whoever comes near it unless they are currently silenced, and a Mute, which silences whoever touches it. So get cursed first by coming near the Afflictor, then touch the Mute to become silenced."] = "Ve a Beadeaux y dirígete a uno de los conjuntos de máquinas. Debes visitar un Afflictor, que maldice a quien se acerque a menos que esté silenciado, y un Mute, que silencia a quien lo toque. Así que primero maldícete acercándote al Afflictor y luego toca el Mute para quedar silenciado.",
    ["Go to Beadeaux and steal from Garnet Quadav, Silver Quadav, Zircon Quadav and Bronze Quadav until you obtain the Quadav Stew."] = "Ve a Beadeaux y roba a Garnet Quadav, Silver Quadav, Zircon Quadav y Bronze Quadav hasta obtener el Quadav Stew.",
    ["Go to Beaucedine Glacier (Survival Guide is quickest) and touch the Ferric Stench at (H-8), east of the tower, to fight an Orcish Atlatl (WAR), Orcish Axeman (BST), Orcish Praetor (WAR) and Harnessed Smilodon (WAR). You get the Carmine Swallows' map afterwards."] = "Ve a Beaucedine Glacier (la Survival Guide es lo más rápido) y toca el Ferric Stench de (H-8), al este de la torre, para luchar contra un Orcish Atlatl (WAR), un Orcish Axeman (BST), un Orcish Praetor (WAR) y un Harnessed Smilodon (WAR). Después recibes el Carmine Swallows' map.",
    ["Go to Beaucedine Glacier (Survival Guide) and examine the Lonely Evergreen (G-7) in the center (G-7) for a cutscene."] = "Ve a Beaucedine Glacier (Survival Guide) y examina el Lonely Evergreen (G-7) del centro (G-7) para una escena.",
    ["Go to Bibiki Bay and take the Manaclipper to Purgonorgo Isle (Map 2), or use the Voidwatch teleport, which is the fastest way."] = "Ve a Bibiki Bay y toma el Manaclipper a Purgonorgo Isle (mapa 2), o usa el teletransporte de Voidwatch, que es lo más rápido.",
    ["Go to Bibiki Bay and take the Manaclipper to Purgonorgo Isle. Buy a ticket from Tswe Panipahr, and ask Fheli Lapatzuo (H-7) at the docks which boat is the right one. If you have Bismarck access, the Voidwatch teleport also works."] = "Ve a Bibiki Bay y toma el Manaclipper a Purgonorgo Isle. Compra un billete a Tswe Panipahr y pregunta a Fheli Lapatzuo (H-7) en los muelles qué barco es el correcto. Si tienes acceso a Bismarck, el teletransporte de Voidwatch también sirve.",
    ["Go to Bibiki Bay and take the Manaclipper tour to Purgonorgo Isle."] = "Ve a Bibiki Bay y toma el tour del Manaclipper a Purgonorgo Isle.",
    ["Go to Boneyard Gully through Attohwa Chasm, which you enter from the Maze of Shakhrami. Cross the bridge to the east side, go into the caves at (I-8) and follow the tunnel up to the surface at (F-7); the next tunnel at (F-6) leads to Boneyard Gully (the Attohwa Chasm Home Point is just before it)."] = "Ve a Boneyard Gully pasando por Attohwa Chasm, a la que se entra desde Maze of Shakhrami. Cruza el puente al lado este, entra en las cuevas de (I-8) y sigue el túnel hasta la superficie en (F-7); el siguiente túnel, en (F-6), lleva a Boneyard Gully (el Home Point de Attohwa Chasm está justo antes).",
    ["Go to Bostaunieux Oubliette from the Chateau. Stay on the top floor (don't drop into the pit at (E-7)/(E-8)) and touch the Frigid Confluence at (H-9) to fight Trion (about 25,000 HP, very high defense, Invincible as early as 75% HP). The fight ends with a cutscene."] = "Ve a Bostaunieux Oubliette desde el Chateau. Quédate en el piso superior (no te dejes caer al foso de (E-7)/(E-8)) y toca la Frigid Confluence de (H-9) para luchar contra Trion (unos 25,000 HP, defensa muy alta, Invincible desde el 75% de HP). La pelea termina con una escena.",
    ["Go to Caedarva Mire Map 4 (Hediva Isle): Unity Warp (level 135, needs Captain rank or a Remnants Permit), or the Runic Portal to the Nyzul Isle Staging Point, then teleporter D, then teleporter J on your left, then north."] = "Ve al mapa 4 de Caedarva Mire (Hediva Isle): Unity Warp (nivel 135, requiere rango Captain o un Remnants Permit), o el Runic Portal al Nyzul Isle Staging Point, luego el teletransportador D, luego el teletransportador J a tu izquierda y después al norte.",
    ["Go to Caedarva Mire from the west exit of Nashmau (or Caedarva Mire Home Point #1, just northwest of it)."] = "Ve a Caedarva Mire por la salida oeste de Nashmau (o el Home Point #1 de Caedarva Mire, justo al noroeste).",
    ["Go to Carpenters' Landing, entering from Jugner Forest (J-8) (the Carpenters' Landing Survival Guide puts you one square east). At (I-10), touch the ??? on a red mushroom near the south-west corner to spawn the Orc NM Bullheaded Grosvez."] = "Ve a Carpenters' Landing, entrando desde Jugner Forest (J-8) (la Survival Guide de Carpenters' Landing te deja una casilla al este). En (I-10), toca la ??? de una seta roja cerca de la esquina suroeste para hacer aparecer al NM Orc Bullheaded Grosvez.",
    ["Go to Castle Oztroja (I-8, first map) and drop through the trap door for a cutscene. Stand between the two levers there and pull one: one opens the door and the other the trap door, and they swap randomly. You must pull the lever yourself; others on the mission should stand back and each pull it after the trap door closes."] = "Ve a Castle Oztroja (I-8, primer mapa) y déjate caer por la trampilla para una escena. Colócate entre las dos palancas de allí y tira de una: una abre la puerta y la otra la trampilla, y se intercambian al azar. Debes tirar tú de la palanca; los demás que estén en la misión deben apartarse y tirar cada uno cuando se cierre la trampilla.",
    ["Go to Castle Oztroja (the Survival Guide puts you at the main entrance). Through the first Brass Door (I-8), stand between the two levers and pull one: one opens the door, the other a trap door, and they swap daily. Go upstairs to Map 2."] = "Ve a Castle Oztroja (la Survival Guide te deja en la entrada principal). Tras la primera Brass Door (I-8), colócate entre las dos palancas y tira de una: una abre la puerta y la otra una trampilla, y se intercambian cada día. Sube al mapa 2.",
    ["Go to Castle Oztroja and defeat the Yagudo Parasite in the pond on the third floor (H-9) for a Parasite Skin."] = "Ve a Castle Oztroja y derrota al Yagudo Parasite en el estanque del tercer piso (H-9) para obtener una Parasite Skin.",
    ["Go to Castle Oztroja and head to the door at (I-8) on the first map."] = "Ve a Castle Oztroja y dirígete a la puerta en (I-8) del primer mapa.",
    ["Go to Castle Zvahl Baileys and defeat Demon Generals, Magistrates, Chancellors or Commanders for a Whine Cellar Key. They are at the bottom of the four corner areas of Map 3; fall from Map 2 to get there. If Borghertz's Sorcerous Hands is still unfinished, take it up to its Castle Zvahl Baileys part to save a trip."] = "Ve a Castle Zvahl Baileys y derrota Demon Generals, Magistrates, Chancellors o Commanders para obtener una Whine Cellar Key. Están al fondo de las cuatro zonas de las esquinas del mapa 3; déjate caer desde el mapa 2 para llegar. Si Borghertz's Sorcerous Hands sigue sin terminar, avánzala hasta su parte de Castle Zvahl Baileys para ahorrarte un viaje.",
    ["Go to Castle Zvahl Baileys and open a Treasure Coffer with a Zvahl Coffer Key, or pick the lock as a Thief. The Curio Vendor Moogle sells the key. You don't need to be on Bard for this; you receive the key item Old gauntlets."] = "Ve a Castle Zvahl Baileys y abre un Treasure Coffer con una Zvahl Coffer Key, o fuerza la cerradura como Thief. El Curio Vendor Moogle vende la llave. No necesitas ser Bard para esto; recibes el key item Old gauntlets.",
    ["Go to Castle Zvahl Keep (Throne Room Home Point) and examine the Throne Room door for a cutscene."] = "Ve a Castle Zvahl Keep (Home Point de la Throne Room) y examina la Throne Room door para una escena.",
    ["Go to Chateau d'Oraguille and examine Trion's door (Prince Royal's Room, H-7) to receive the Gallant Leggings."] = "Ve a Chateau d'Oraguille y examina la puerta de Trion (Prince Royal's Room, H-7) para recibir las Gallant Leggings.",
    ["Go to Chateau d'Oraguille and speak with Halver. If you have just cleared The Voracious Resurgence, you will have to rezone after the cutscene and speak with him again."] = "Ve a Chateau d'Oraguille y habla con Halver. Si acabas de completar The Voracious Resurgence, tendrás que cambiar de zona tras la escena y hablar de nuevo con él.",
    ["Go to Chateau d'Oraguille and walk toward the garden (F-8) for a cutscene."] = "Ve a Chateau d'Oraguille y camina hacia el jardín (F-8) para una escena.",
    ["Go to Cirdas Caverns (M-8/9) and examine the Overgrown Grave for a cutscene (Augural Conveyor, or the Yorcia Weald Frontier Station; clear any Colonization Reive in the way)."] = "Ve a Cirdas Caverns (M-8/9) y examina la Overgrown Grave para una escena (Augural Conveyor, o la Frontier Station de Yorcia Weald; despeja cualquier Colonization Reive que bloquee el camino).",
    ["Go to Crawlers' Nest and open a Treasure Coffer with a Nest Coffer Key, or pick the lock as a Thief. The Curio Vendor Moogle sells the key. You don't need to be on Beastmaster for this; you receive the key item Old gauntlets."] = "Ve a Crawlers' Nest y abre un Treasure Coffer con una Nest Coffer Key, o fuerza la cerradura como Thief. El Curio Vendor Moogle vende la llave. No necesitas ser Beastmaster para esto; recibes el key item Old gauntlets.",
    ["Go to Crawlers' Nest and open a Treasure Coffer with a Nest Coffer Key, or pick the lock as a Thief. The Curio Vendor Moogle sells the key. You don't need to be on Monk for this; you receive the key item Old gauntlets."] = "Ve a Crawlers' Nest y abre un Treasure Coffer con una Nest Coffer Key, o fuerza la cerradura como Thief. El Curio Vendor Moogle vende la llave. No necesitas ser Monk para esto; recibes el key item Old gauntlets.",
    ["Go to Davoi (the Proto-Waypoint or Survival Guide is fastest) and enter Monastic Cavern by entrance 2 at (H-11). Leave it by exit 4 at (I-8), follow the road west around the hill to a wooden elevator and pull its lever to reach the monastery."] = "Ve a Davoi (el Proto-Waypoint o la Survival Guide es lo más rápido) y entra en el Monastic Cavern por la entrada 2 de (H-11). Sal por la salida 4 de (I-8), sigue el camino al oeste rodeando la colina hasta un ascensor de madera y tira de su palanca para llegar al monasterio.",
    ["Go to Davoi and defeat Purpleflash Brukdok (BLM) at (E-9)/(F-9) to obtain a Davoi Storage Key. It drops one key and respawns after about 10 minutes; each Red Mage doing the quest needs a key. To get there, enter the creek from the broken bridge at (I-8) or the ramp at (J-10), take the west fork at (I-9) and follow it to the ramp out at (D-8). Bring Sneak and Invisible; some enemies on the way aggro even at level 99."] = "Ve a Davoi y derrota a Purpleflash Brukdok (BLM) en (E-9)/(F-9) para obtener una Davoi Storage Key. Suelta una llave y reaparece tras unos 10 minutos; cada Red Mage que haga la quest necesita una llave. Para llegar, entra en el arroyo desde el puente roto de (I-8) o la rampa de (J-10), toma el ramal oeste en (I-9) y síguelo hasta la rampa de salida en (D-8). Lleva Sneak e Invisible; algunos enemigos del camino atacan incluso a nivel 99.",
    ["Go to Davoi and examine the Hide Flap at (K-9)/(K-10) to spawn Barakbok and Gavotvut."] = "Ve a Davoi y examina la Hide Flap en (K-9)/(K-10) para hacer aparecer a Barakbok y Gavotvut.",
    ["Go to Davoi and speak with Quemaricond (H-7), who paces between (G-7) and (H-7), for a cutscene. The Proto-Waypoint or the Davoi Survival Guide is quickest."] = "Ve a Davoi y habla con Quemaricond (H-7), que va y viene entre (G-7) y (H-7), para una escena. El Proto-Waypoint o la Survival Guide de Davoi es lo más rápido.",
    ["Go to Davoi, enter the Monastic Cavern and open a Treasure Coffer with a Davoi Coffer Key, or pick the lock as a Thief. The Curio Vendor Moogle sells the key. You don't need to be on Thief for this; you receive the key item Old gauntlets."] = "Ve a Davoi, entra en el Monastic Cavern y abre un Treasure Coffer con una Davoi Coffer Key, o fuerza la cerradura como Thief. El Curio Vendor Moogle vende la llave. No necesitas ser Thief para esto; recibes el key item Old gauntlets.",
    ["Go to East Sarutabaruta (J-11) and speak with Pore-Ohre at the entrance of Marguerite Tower for the key item Southeastern star charm; without it you can't energize the orbs."] = "Ve a East Sarutabaruta (J-11) y habla con Pore-Ohre en la entrada de Marguerite Tower para obtener el key item Southeastern star charm; sin él no puedes cargar los orbes.",
    ["Go to East Sarutabaruta (J-8), the northeast corner south of the Tower near the canyon wall, and examine the Disturbed Earth for a cutscene. Unity Warp (level 99) to East Sarutabaruta, or the Inner Horutoto Ruins Survival Guide, is quickest."] = "Ve a East Sarutabaruta (J-8), la esquina noreste al sur de la torre cerca de la pared del cañón, y examina la Disturbed Earth para una escena. El Unity Warp (nivel 99) a East Sarutabaruta, o la Survival Guide de Inner Horutoto Ruins, es lo más rápido.",
    ["Go to Eldieme Necropolis and defeat Dark Stalker enemies until a Tavnazia Bell drops. There are 4 spawn points near the Hume Bones from the drop at (G-8) in the center of map 2, and 4 more at the B and C drops on map 1."] = "Ve a Eldieme Necropolis y derrota enemigos Dark Stalker hasta que suelten una Tavnazia Bell. Hay 4 puntos de aparición cerca de los Hume Bones de la caída en (G-8), en el centro del mapa 2, y otros 4 en las caídas B y C del mapa 1.",
    ["Go to Fei'Yin Map 2 and trade the Doll Gizmo to Talos, a pile of doll parts in front of a door south down the hall at (H-6) from Capricious Cassie's room, for a cutscene. It doesn't show on Wide Scan. Fei'Yin Home Point #2 (Cloister of Frost) is closest."] = "Ve al mapa 2 de Fei'Yin y entrega el Doll Gizmo a Talos, un montón de piezas de muñeco delante de una puerta al sur, bajando el pasillo en (H-6) desde la sala de Capricious Cassie, para una escena. No aparece en Wide Scan. El Home Point #2 de Fei'Yin (Cloister of Frost) es el más cercano.",
    ["Go to Fei'Yin and defeat Miser Murphy for an Antique Coin. He appears at (H-8) on map 1 if the quest is active, with a 10 minute respawn."] = "Ve a Fei'Yin y derrota a Miser Murphy para obtener una Antique Coin. Aparece en (H-8) del mapa 1 si la quest está activa, y reaparece cada 10 minutos.",
    ["Go to Fei'Yin, in the northeast corner of Beaucedine Glacier, for a cutscene with Zeid. Home Point #1 in Fei'Yin puts you right by Qu'Bia Arena; Unity Warp (level 128) puts you at the Fei'Yin entrance. Most monsters here detect by sound, a few by spellcasting. If you are low level, bring Trusts or a party of level 50+ players."] = "Ve a Fei'Yin, en la esquina noreste de Beaucedine Glacier, para una escena con Zeid. El Home Point #1 de Fei'Yin te deja justo al lado de Qu'Bia Arena; el Unity Warp (nivel 128) te deja en la entrada de Fei'Yin. La mayoría de los monstruos de aquí detectan por sonido, y algunos por lanzar hechizos. Si eres de nivel bajo, lleva Trusts o un grupo de jugadores de nivel 50+.",
    ["Go to Full Moon Fountain (Toraimarai Canal Home Point #1) for a two-part battlefield. If you use an addon that skips cutscenes (Enternity, FastCS) or run at 60 FPS, turn it off for this fight. Part 1: four Ace Cardians; Sleepga them and kill Ace of Batons (BLM), Ace of Swords (PLD), then Ace of Coins (RDM), and rest before the last one, Ace of Cups (WHM)."] = "Ve a Full Moon Fountain (Home Point #1 de Toraimarai Canal) para un campo de batalla en dos partes. Si usas un addon que salta escenas (Enternity, FastCS) o juegas a 60 FPS, desactívalo para esta pelea. Parte 1: cuatro Ace Cardians; duérmelos con Sleepga y mata a Ace of Batons (BLM), Ace of Swords (PLD) y luego Ace of Coins (RDM), y descansa antes del último, Ace of Cups (WHM).",
    ["Go to Full Moon Fountain and examine the Moon Spiral with at least one sap for a cutscene."] = "Ve a Full Moon Fountain y examina la Moon Spiral con al menos una savia para una escena.",
    ["Go to Garlaige Citadel and open a Treasure Coffer with a Garlaige Coffer Key, or pick the lock as a Thief. The Curio Vendor Moogle sells the key. You don't need to be on Black Mage for this; you receive the key item Old gauntlets."] = "Ve a Garlaige Citadel y abre un Treasure Coffer con una Garlaige Coffer Key, o fuerza la cerradura como Thief. El Curio Vendor Moogle vende la llave. No necesitas ser Black Mage para esto; recibes el key item Old gauntlets.",
    ["Go to Garlaige Citadel and open a Treasure Coffer with a Garlaige Coffer Key, or pick the lock as a Thief. The Curio Vendor Moogle sells the key. You don't need to be on Ranger for this; you receive the key item Old gauntlets."] = "Ve a Garlaige Citadel y abre un Treasure Coffer con una Garlaige Coffer Key, o fuerza la cerradura como Thief. El Curio Vendor Moogle vende la llave. No necesitas ser Ranger para esto; recibes el key item Old gauntlets.",
    ["Go to Garlaige Citadel through the main entrance (the Survival Guide is easiest). You must examine several ??? in the ceiling in a set order, choosing \"Yes\" to use the Bomb incense each time. First-person view and locking on make them easier to target."] = "Ve a Garlaige Citadel por la entrada principal (la Survival Guide es lo más fácil). Debes examinar varias ??? del techo en un orden fijo, eligiendo \"Yes\" para usar el Bomb incense cada vez. La vista en primera persona y fijar el objetivo facilitan seleccionarlas.",
    ["Go to Garlaige Citadel, pass the first Banishing Gate to Map 2 and examine the Oaken Box in the first room on the left (G-8) to spawn the Guardian Statue. If it says something feels wrong but nothing happens, remove Sneak."] = "Ve a Garlaige Citadel, pasa la primera Banishing Gate hasta el mapa 2 y examina la Oaken Box de la primera sala a la izquierda (G-8) para hacer aparecer la Guardian Statue. Si dice que algo no va bien pero no pasa nada, quítate Sneak.",
    ["Go to Garlaige Citadel."] = "Ve a Garlaige Citadel.",
    ["Go to Garlaige Citadel. As soon as you zone in you get a cutscene, after which the NPC Wanzo-Unzozo appears. You can summon Trusts, but zoning in with an Adventuring Fellow makes the escort NPC disappear."] = "Ve a Garlaige Citadel. En cuanto entras en la zona recibes una escena, tras la cual aparece el NPC Wanzo-Unzozo. Puedes invocar Trusts, pero entrar con un Adventuring Fellow hace desaparecer al NPC escoltado.",
    ["Go to Ghelsba Outpost and enter the battlefield at the Hut Door (F-10/G-10); Domenic in Lower Jeuno is the quickest way there. Only people who have reached this point in the quest, or who have already completed it, may enter the battlefield. You fight a level ~40 Wyvern NM, and Trusts can't be summoned."] = "Ve a Ghelsba Outpost y entra en el campo de batalla por la Hut Door (F-10/G-10); Domenic en Lower Jeuno es la forma más rápida de llegar. Solo pueden entrar quienes hayan llegado a este punto de la quest o ya la hayan completado. Luchas contra un NM Wyvern de nivel ~40 y no se pueden invocar Trusts.",
    ["Go to Ghelsba Outpost, entered from West Ronfaure (E-4) (a map is 600 gil from Elesca in Northern San d'Oria (I-8) or Violitte in Southern San d'Oria (G-10))."] = "Ve a Ghelsba Outpost, por la entrada de West Ronfaure (E-4) (un mapa cuesta 600 gil a Elesca en Northern San d'Oria (I-8) o a Violitte en Southern San d'Oria (G-10)).",
    ["Go to Giddeus and speak with Quu Bokye, then trade a Silver Beastcoin to receive \"Art for Everyone\"."] = "Ve a Giddeus y habla con Quu Bokye, luego entrega una Silver Beastcoin para recibir \"Art for Everyone\".",
    ["Go to Giddeus, drop down at E on Map 1, and enter the storage room on Map 2 at (F-6). Click the door, not the Yagudo guard."] = "Ve a Giddeus, déjate caer por E en el mapa 1 y entra en el almacén del mapa 2 en (F-6). Pulsa la puerta, no al guardia Yagudo.",
    ["Go to Grauberg (S) and, as a Dancer, examine the ??? in Witchfire Glen at (F-5) for a cutscene. It is in the middle of three closely packed trees just north-west of the Veridical Conflux; quickest is a Lightsworm at any Cavernous Maw to the Walk of Echoes, then out by the conflux."] = "Ve a Grauberg (S) y, como Dancer, examina la ??? de Witchfire Glen en (F-5) para una escena. Está en medio de tres árboles muy juntos, justo al noroeste de la Veridical Conflux; lo más rápido es un Lightsworm en cualquier Cavernous Maw hasta el Walk of Echoes y salir por la conflux.",
    ["Go to Gusgen Mines Map 4 (where Juggler Hecatomb spawns) and speak with Hedrov (H-7) behind the shed in the middle of the room at (H-7) for a cutscene. From the Survival Guide go to exit A, keep left and take tunnel G; or tunnels B and E, then Drop H on Map 3."] = "Ve al mapa 4 de Gusgen Mines (donde aparece Juggler Hecatomb) y habla con Hedrov (H-7), detrás del cobertizo del centro de la sala en (H-7), para una escena. Desde la Survival Guide ve a la salida A, mantente a la izquierda y toma el túnel G; o los túneles B y E, y luego la caída H del mapa 3.",
    ["Go to Gusgen Mines and trade the Chaosbringer to the ??? at (J-7) on map 1 to receive your reward, the Deathbringer. It is the same ??? used in Bastok Mission 3-2 to spawn the NM Blind Moby."] = "Ve a Gusgen Mines y entrega el Chaosbringer a la ??? en (J-7) del mapa 1 para recibir tu recompensa, el Deathbringer. Es la misma ??? que se usa en la Bastok Mission 3-2 para invocar al NM Blind Moby.",
    ["Go to Gustav Tunnel and examine the Outcropping (F-10) at (F-10) for a cutscene. The Gustav Tunnel Survival Guide is at the other end; Unity Warp (level 128) to Cape Teriggan can be faster."] = "Ve a Gustav Tunnel y examina el Outcropping (F-10) en (F-10) para una escena. La Survival Guide de Gustav Tunnel está en el otro extremo; el Unity Warp (nivel 128) a Cape Teriggan puede ser más rápido.",
    ["Go to Hazhalm Testing Grounds in Caedarva Mire (Caedarva Mire Home Point #1) and examine the Entry Gate for a cutscene."] = "Ve a Hazhalm Testing Grounds en Caedarva Mire (Home Point #1 de Caedarva Mire) y examina la Entry Gate para una escena.",
    ["Go to Heavens Tower and speak with Kupipi. If this is not your first Trust quest, you are finished here and receive the key item Windurst Trust permit."] = "Ve a Heavens Tower y habla con Kupipi. Si no es tu primera quest de Trust, terminas aquí y recibes el key item Windurst Trust permit.",
    ["Go to Ifrit's Cauldron (Unity Warp level 125) with several Pickaxes (Ostalie, Southern San d'Oria (E-9)). Mine for the Ember-encrusted orichalcum; the correct point rotates among Map 5 (G-8), Map 3 (J-7), Map 3 (F-7), Map 4 (F-7), Map 1 (F-9), Map 1 (G-8) and Map 7 (I-10), and gives the key item on the first swing. A point that gives items is the wrong one."] = "Ve a Ifrit's Cauldron (Unity Warp de nivel 125) con varios Pickaxes (Ostalie, Southern San d'Oria (E-9)). Mina para obtener el Ember-encrusted orichalcum; el punto correcto rota entre mapa 5 (G-8), mapa 3 (J-7), mapa 3 (F-7), mapa 4 (F-7), mapa 1 (F-9), mapa 1 (G-8) y mapa 7 (I-10), y da el key item al primer golpe. Un punto que da objetos es el equivocado.",
    ["Go to Ifrit's Cauldron (quickest: the Unity Warp (level 122) to Yhoator Jungle, then hug the right wall; or the Elshimo Uplands Outpost warp or Survival Guide) and open a Treasure Coffer with a Cauldron Coffer Key, or pick the lock as a Thief. The Curio Vendor Moogle sells the key. You don't need to be on Ninja for this; you receive the key item Old gauntlets."] = "Ve a Ifrit's Cauldron (lo más rápido: el Unity Warp (nivel 122) a Yhoator Jungle y luego pegado a la pared derecha; o el warp del Elshimo Uplands Outpost o la Survival Guide) y abre un Treasure Coffer con una Cauldron Coffer Key, o fuerza la cerradura como Thief. El Curio Vendor Moogle vende la llave. No necesitas ser Ninja para esto; recibes el key item Old gauntlets.",
    ["Go to Jeuno"] = "Ve a Jeuno",
    ["Go to King Ranperre's Tomb (I-10) on the first map."] = "Ve a King Ranperre's Tomb (I-10) en el primer mapa.",
    ["Go to Korroloka Tunnel through Zeruhn Mines (the Zeruhn Mines Survival Guide is quickest)."] = "Ve a Korroloka Tunnel por Zeruhn Mines (la Survival Guide de Zeruhn Mines es lo más rápido).",
    ["Go to Kuftal Tunnel (coffers spawn at (H-7) and (H-6) on Map 1 and (K-11), (G-9), (H-9), (J-7), (J-8), (I-4), (F-6) and (D-9) on Map 2) and open a Treasure Coffer with a Kuftal Coffer Key, or pick the lock as a Thief. The Curio Vendor Moogle sells the key. You don't need to be on Samurai for this; you receive the key item Old gauntlets."] = "Ve a Kuftal Tunnel (los cofres aparecen en (H-7) y (H-6) del mapa 1 y en (K-11), (G-9), (H-9), (J-7), (J-8), (I-4), (F-6) y (D-9) del mapa 2) y abre un Treasure Coffer con una Kuftal Coffer Key, o fuerza la cerradura como Thief. El Curio Vendor Moogle vende la llave. No necesitas ser Samurai para esto; recibes el key item Old gauntlets.",
    ["Go to La Theine Plateau (G-6) and trade the Carbuncle's Ruby to the ??? for a cutscene that completes the quest."] = "Ve a La Theine Plateau (G-6) y entrega el Carbuncle's Ruby a la ??? para una escena que completa la quest.",
    ["Go to La Theine Plateau and speak with Narvecaint (F-7) at the entrance to Ordelle's Caves for another cutscene (the Ordelle's Caves Voidwatch warp puts you right next to him)."] = "Ve a La Theine Plateau y habla con Narvecaint (F-7) en la entrada de Ordelle's Caves para otra escena (el warp de Voidwatch de Ordelle's Caves te deja justo a su lado).",
    ["Go to Leafallia and examine the Odyssean Passage for a cutscene."] = "Ve a Leafallia y examina el Odyssean Passage para una escena.",
    ["Go to Leafallia and examine the Odyssean Passage for a cutscene. (Optional: Andreine hints at Oshasha's whereabouts.)"] = "Ve a Leafallia y examina el Odyssean Passage para una escena. (Opcional: Andreine da pistas de dónde está Oshasha.)",
    ["Go to Lower Delkfutt's Tower (entrance at Qufim Island F-6) and examine the Cermet Door at (E-8) on Map 1 to enter the basement. If you have a Delkfutt Key item, trade it to the door for the key item Delkfutt key. Without one, a party member who has the key can take you through, or you must get one from the top of the tower."] = "Ve a Lower Delkfutt's Tower (entrada en Qufim Island F-6) y examina la Cermet Door de (E-8) en el mapa 1 para entrar en el sótano. Si tienes el objeto Delkfutt Key, entrégaselo a la puerta para obtener el key item Delkfutt key. Si no, un miembro del grupo que tenga la llave puede hacerte pasar, o debes conseguir una en lo alto de la torre.",
    ["Go to Lower Jeuno (G-10) and speak with Yatniel on the top floor. He asks for Quake Grenade x4: trade them to him for a clue. You can skip this and still get the Bomb incense, but you must turn in the Quake Grenades to clear the key item from Nanaa Mihgo, or she will not let you finish the quest."] = "Ve a Lower Jeuno (G-10) y habla con Yatniel en el último piso. Te pide Quake Grenade x4: entrégaselas para obtener una pista. Puedes saltártelo y aun así conseguir el Bomb incense, pero debes entregar las Quake Grenades para quitar el key item de Nanaa Mihgo, o no te dejará terminar la quest.",
    ["Go to Lower Jeuno and speak with Harnek inside the Tenshodo at (J-7) for a cutscene. You receive the key item Tenshodo envelope."] = "Ve a Lower Jeuno y habla con Harnek dentro del Tenshodo en (J-7) para una escena. Recibes el key item Tenshodo envelope.",
    ["Go to Lower Jeuno and speak with Ruslan (I-8) in the Merry Minstrel tavern."] = "Ve a Lower Jeuno y habla con Ruslan (I-8) en la taberna Merry Minstrel.",
    ["Go to Lufaise Meadows and walk into Blueblade Fell (J-6) past the first barrel on the ground for the final cutscene (Unity Warp level 119 or 125 is fastest). Afterwards the quests Requiem of Sin and Storms of Fate become available."] = "Ve a Lufaise Meadows y entra caminando en Blueblade Fell (J-6) pasando el primer barril del suelo para la última escena (el Unity Warp de nivel 119 o 125 es lo más rápido). Después quedan disponibles las quests Requiem of Sin y Storms of Fate.",
    ["Go to Marjami Ravine: from Waypoint #2 head southeast, take the tunnel by the small watchtower at (J-9)/(J-10), and at the tent enter the cave on the left and climb the vine to Bibliomaniac's Lair (I-10) at (I-10), in front of the Seat of Gramk-Droog."] = "Ve a Marjami Ravine: desde el Waypoint #2 ve al sureste, toma el túnel junto a la pequeña torre de vigilancia de (J-9)/(J-10) y, en la tienda, entra en la cueva de la izquierda y sube por la enredadera hasta el Bibliomaniac's Lair (I-10) en (I-10), delante del Seat of Gramk-Droog.",
    ["Go to Mhaura (H-8) and speak with Hagain in one of the upstairs rooms of the Sailor's Stay to receive the key item Bomb incense."] = "Ve a Mhaura (H-8) y habla con Hagain en una de las habitaciones de arriba del Sailor's Stay para recibir el key item Bomb incense.",
    ["Go to Mhaura and speak with Kotan-Purutan at (I-9), near the ferry ticket area, after 18:00 Vana'diel time to obtain a Small bag."] = "Ve a Mhaura y habla con Kotan-Purutan en (I-9), cerca de la zona de billetes del ferry, después de las 18:00 hora de Vana'diel para obtener una Small bag.",
    ["Go to Mhaura and speak with Ripapa (I-9) to obtain a Lightning Pendulum."] = "Ve a Mhaura y habla con Ripapa (I-9) para obtener un Lightning Pendulum.",
    ["Go to Mhaura and talk with Fyi Chalmwoh at (G-8)."] = "Ve a Mhaura y habla con Fyi Chalmwoh en (G-8).",
    ["Go to Mine Shaft #2716 (trade Tarnotik a Snow Lily, the Newton Movalpolos Home Point, or Twinkbrix at (E-13) for 10,000 gil) and examine the Mine Shaft #2716 entrance for a cutscene."] = "Ve a Mine Shaft #2716 (entrega una Snow Lily a Tarnotik, usa el Home Point de Newton Movalpolos o paga 10,000 gil a Twinkbrix en (E-13)) y examina la entrada de Mine Shaft #2716 para una escena.",
    ["Go to Misareaux Coast (G-4) (Home Point #1 is close) and examine the Iron Gate for a cutscene and to enter the Sacrarium. Be ready to recast Sneak often; at level 60+ Trusts make this easy solo. Watch your Fomor Hate."] = "Ve a Misareaux Coast (G-4) (el Home Point #1 está cerca) y examina la Iron Gate para una escena y para entrar en el Sacrarium. Prepárate para relanzar Sneak a menudo; a nivel 60+ los Trusts lo hacen fácil en solitario. Vigila tu Fomor Hate.",
    ["Go to Misareaux Coast and examine the ??? at (I-6), near the end of the river, for the Mire incense."] = "Ve a Misareaux Coast y examina la ??? en (I-6), cerca del final del río, para obtener el Mire incense.",
    ["Go to Morimar Basalt Fields (J-8), Bivouac #1, and speak with Dabnorrin to receive the key item Vessel of summoning."] = "Ve a Morimar Basalt Fields (J-8), Bivouac #1, y habla con Dabnorrin para recibir el key item Vessel of summoning.",
    ["Go to Mount Zhayolm via the Halvung Staging Point. You need the Cast metal plate key item to open the Gates of Halvung at (J-7)."] = "Ve a Mount Zhayolm por el Halvung Staging Point. Necesitas el key item Cast metal plate para abrir las Gates of Halvung de (J-7).",
    ["Go to Norg (K-8) and trade all three foods to Comitolus for a cutscene that sends you to the Rhinostery researchers in Beaucedine Glacier."] = "Ve a Norg (K-8) y entrega las tres comidas a Comitolus para una escena que te envía a los investigadores de la Rhinostery en Beaucedine Glacier.",
    ["Go to Northern San d'Oria and speak with Eperdur (M-7) upstairs in the Cathedral to complete the quest and receive a Scroll of Teleport-Mea."] = "Ve a Northern San d'Oria y habla con Eperdur (M-7) arriba en la Cathedral para completar la quest y recibir un Scroll of Teleport-Mea.",
    ["Go to Oldton Movalpolos and speak with Brakobrik at (K-10). The closest warp is the Proto-Waypoint to the Geomagnetic Fount at (K-11), if you have it."] = "Ve a Oldton Movalpolos y habla con Brakobrik en (K-10). El warp más cercano es el Proto-Waypoint al Geomagnetic Fount en (K-11), si lo tienes.",
    ["Go to Oldton Movalpolos and speak with Rakorok at (K-10) (the Proto-Waypoint at the Geomagnetic Fount (K-11) is closest). This spawns the NM Bugallug, which must be defeated. It has around 5,000 HP and uses the standard Bugbear attacks (Earthshock, Heavy Whisk, Flying Hip Press, etc.)."] = "Ve a Oldton Movalpolos y habla con Rakorok en (K-10) (el Proto-Waypoint de la Geomagnetic Fount (K-11) es el más cercano). Esto hace aparecer al NM Bugallug, al que hay que derrotar. Tiene unos 5,000 HP y usa los ataques habituales de Bugbear (Earthshock, Heavy Whisk, Flying Hip Press, etc.).",
    ["Go to Oldton Movalpolos for a cutscene upon zoning."] = "Ve a Oldton Movalpolos para una escena al entrar en la zona.",
    ["Go to Ondieulix (I-7, second floor, near Home Point #1) for your reward, the Gramary Cape."] = "Ve con Ondieulix (I-7, segundo piso, cerca del Home Point #1) para tu recompensa, la Gramary Cape.",
    ["Go to Ordelle's Caves and obtain an Ordelle Chest Key from the monsters inside. Certain monsters in the cave drop it; to reach that area take path D on map 1, drop into the southeastern hole shown on map 2, then take path E. The high-level monsters Buds Bunny, Swagger Spruce and Targe Beetle do not aggro."] = "Ve a Ordelle's Caves y obtén una Ordelle Chest Key de los monstruos del interior. Ciertos monstruos de la cueva la sueltan; para llegar a esa zona toma el camino D del mapa 1, déjate caer por el agujero sureste que aparece en el mapa 2 y luego toma el camino E. Los monstruos de nivel alto Buds Bunny, Swagger Spruce y Targe Beetle no atacan.",
    ["Go to Ordelle's Caves. You can use the Abyssea La Theine Plateau warp and enter from La Theine Plateau (H-7), or the Survival Guide if you have picked it up."] = "Ve a Ordelle's Caves. Puedes usar el Abyssea La Theine Plateau warp y entrar desde La Theine Plateau (H-7), o la Survival Guide si la has conseguido.",
    ["Go to Outer Ra'Kaznar (waypoint) and the Shrouded Workroom at (K-3) on the upper floor (Map 1). Don't touch the roots at (J-3); they send you back to the entrance. Watch for Umbrils. Examine it for a cutscene."] = "Ve a Outer Ra'Kaznar (waypoint) y al Shrouded Workroom de (K-3) en el piso superior (mapa 1). No toques las raíces de (J-3); te devuelven a la entrada. Cuidado con los Umbrils. Examínalo para una escena.",
    ["Go to Palborough Mines and work your way to the top floor (Home Point #1 is very close; Domenic's teleport to Waughroon Shrine also lands next to it). Examine the ??? at (G-10) in a dead-end room to spawn Ni'Ghu Nestfender, and defeat it for a Mottled Quadav Egg. It can be spawned again 3 minutes later."] = "Ve a Palborough Mines y abre camino hasta el piso superior (el Home Point #1 está muy cerca; el teletransporte de Domenic a Waughroon Shrine también te deja al lado). Examina la ??? en (G-10), en una sala sin salida, para hacer aparecer a Ni'Ghu Nestfender, y derrótalo para obtener un Mottled Quadav Egg. Se puede volver a hacer aparecer 3 minutos después.",
    ["Go to Phomiuna Aqueducts, find a Wooden Ladder at (C-9) on the second map, and climb the ladder for a cutscene."] = "Ve a Phomiuna Aqueducts, busca una Wooden Ladder en (C-9) del segundo mapa y sube la escalera para una escena.",
    ["Go to Phomiuna Aqueducts. Map 1: climb the ladder at (F-6), follow the path and turn right at the T intersection. Map 2: go to (M-8) and climb the ladder; the Iron Gate at (J-6) needs a Bronze Key, or a Thief with several Thief's Tools."] = "Ve a Phomiuna Aqueducts. Mapa 1: sube por la escalera de (F-6), sigue el camino y gira a la derecha en el cruce en T. Mapa 2: ve a (M-8) y sube por la escalera; la Iron Gate de (J-6) necesita una Bronze Key, o un Thief con varias Thief's Tools.",
    ["Go to Port Bastok and speak with Ravorara at (E-7), outside the Steaming Sheep Restaurant, for a cutscene. If Fallen Comrades is active, finish it first."] = "Ve a Port Bastok y habla con Ravorara en (E-7), fuera del Steaming Sheep Restaurant, para una escena. Si Fallen Comrades está activa, termínala primero.",
    ["Go to Pso'Xja Home Point #1. Alternatively, travel to Beaucedine Glacier (H-8) and enter Pso'Xja; the Beaucedine Glacier Survival Guide brings you to (H-9), just south of the entrance."] = "Ve al Home Point #1 de Pso'Xja. Como alternativa, viaja a Beaucedine Glacier (H-8) y entra en Pso'Xja; la Survival Guide de Beaucedine Glacier te lleva a (H-9), justo al sur de la entrada.",
    ["Go to Queen Leaute's Garden at (F-7), west of the Central Garden, for a cutscene."] = "Ve al jardín de la reina Leaute en (F-7), al oeste del Central Garden, para una escena.",
    ["Go to Qufim Island (Survival Guide) and examine Before Delkfutt's Tower at (G-6), by the Lower Delkfutt's Tower entrance, for a cutscene."] = "Ve a Qufim Island (Survival Guide) y examina Before Delkfutt's Tower en (G-6), junto a la entrada de Lower Delkfutt's Tower, para una escena.",
    ["Go to Quicksand Caves Map 2: the entrance at Eastern Altepa Desert (H-10), just east of its Survival Guide, puts you there. Unity Warp (level 125) to Quicksand Caves puts you on Map 1 at (J-5); walk south then west to (F-10) to reach Map 2."] = "Ve al mapa 2 de Quicksand Caves: la entrada de Eastern Altepa Desert (H-10), justo al este de su Survival Guide, te deja allí. El Unity Warp (nivel 125) a Quicksand Caves te deja en el mapa 1 en (J-5); camina al sur y luego al oeste hasta (F-10) para llegar al mapa 2.",
    ["Go to Rabao and speak with Agado-Pugado (G-9) to receive a Wind Pendulum."] = "Ve a Rabao y habla con Agado-Pugado (G-9) para recibir un Wind Pendulum.",
    ["Go to Rala Waterways (M-6), entering from Eastern Adoulin (F-7). Speak with Yeggha Dolashi and examine the door behind her to enter Rala Waterways (U)."] = "Ve a Rala Waterways (M-6), entrando desde Eastern Adoulin (F-7). Habla con Yeggha Dolashi y examina la puerta de detrás de ella para entrar en Rala Waterways (U).",
    ["Go to Ranguemont Pass (Survival Guide, or East Ronfaure (K-4)) and touch the Vicious Claw Marks at (J-8) to fight a Harnessed Smilodon (WAR, about 35,000 HP, Mighty Strikes)."] = "Ve a Ranguemont Pass (Survival Guide, o East Ronfaure (K-4)) y toca las Vicious Claw Marks de (J-8) para luchar contra un Harnessed Smilodon (WAR, unos 35,000 HP, Mighty Strikes).",
    ["Go to Ranpi-Monpi in the northern part of Windurst Waters (D-9) and trade him Woozyshroom x3 to receive the key item Ranpi-Monpi's special stew."] = "Ve a Ranpi-Monpi en la parte norte de Windurst Waters (D-9) y entrégale Woozyshroom x3 para recibir el key item Ranpi-Monpi's special stew.",
    ["Go to Ru'Lude Gardens and approach the Palace doors for a cutscene."] = "Ve a Ru'Lude Gardens y acércate a las puertas del palacio para una escena.",
    ["Go to Ru'Lude Gardens and approach the palace for a cutscene at (H-7)."] = "Ve a Ru'Lude Gardens y acércate al palacio para una escena en (H-7).",
    ["Go to Sea Serpent Grotto (Norg is closest) and examine the Shady Sconce (C-8) for a cutscene. Examine it twice if it doesn't register."] = "Ve a Sea Serpent Grotto (Norg es lo más cercano) y examina el Shady Sconce (C-8) para una escena. Examínalo dos veces si no responde.",
    ["Go to Sea Serpent Grotto. Quickest is the Unity Warp (level 125) to Map 4 (L-5), in front of the Gold Door: open it, go north along the left wall to the Mythril Door, examine it until it mentions mythril dust and trade it a Mythril Beastcoin. The Proto-Waypoint to (J-5) on Map 3 also puts you behind the Mythril Door. Open a Treasure Coffer there with a Grotto Coffer Key, or pick the lock as a Thief. The Curio Vendor Moogle sells the key. You don't need to be on Summoner for this; you receive the key item Old gauntlets."] = "Ve a Sea Serpent Grotto. Lo más rápido es el Unity Warp (nivel 125) al mapa 4 (L-5), frente a la Gold Door: ábrela, ve al norte por la pared izquierda hasta la Mythril Door, examínala hasta que mencione polvo de mithril y entrégale una Mythril Beastcoin. El Proto-Waypoint a (J-5) en el mapa 3 también te deja detrás de la Mythril Door. Abre allí un Treasure Coffer con una Grotto Coffer Key, o fuerza la cerradura como Thief. El Curio Vendor Moogle vende la llave. No necesitas ser Summoner para esto; recibes el key item Old gauntlets.",
    ["Go to Sealion's Den, at the bottom of the stone ramps near Tavnazian Safehold Home Point #2, for a cutscene on entering."] = "Ve a Sealion's Den, al pie de las rampas de piedra cerca del Home Point #2 de Tavnazian Safehold, para una escena al entrar.",
    ["Go to Shararat Teahouse at (K-12) in Aht Urhgan Whitegate for a cutscene."] = "Ve a la Shararat Teahouse de (K-12) en Aht Urhgan Whitegate para una escena.",
    ["Go to Southern San d'Oria (G-6) and speak with Amaura. She needs certain ingredients to brew the medicine and gives you Amaura's formula, which lists them: 1 Insect Wing, 1 Malboro Vine and 1 Zinc Ore."] = "Ve a Southern San d'Oria (G-6) y habla con Amaura. Necesita ciertos ingredientes para preparar la medicina y te da Amaura's formula, que los enumera: 1 Insect Wing, 1 Malboro Vine y 1 Zinc Ore.",
    ["Go to Southern San d'Oria and speak with Hae Jakhya (G-9) to receive the overdue library book, \"A Song of Love\". She is on top of the wall, so take the passage at (F-8) to get up there."] = "Ve a Southern San d'Oria y habla con Hae Jakhya (G-9) para recibir el libro atrasado de la biblioteca, \"A Song of Love\". Está encima del muro, así que toma el pasaje en (F-8) para subir.",
    ["Go to Southern San d'Oria and speak with Sharzalion in the Lion Springs Tavern (K-6)."] = "Ve a Southern San d'Oria y habla con Sharzalion en la Lion Springs Tavern (K-6).",
    ["Go to Tahrongi Canyon (F-6) and examine the Tahrongi Cacti there to get a Tahrongi Cactus."] = "Ve a Tahrongi Canyon (F-6) y examina los Tahrongi Cacti de allí para conseguir un Tahrongi Cactus.",
    ["Go to Talacca Cove; its entrance is next to the Caedarva Mire Home Point (or take the west exit from Nashmau). Examine the Rock Slab to the north-west for a cutscene and the battlefield: up to 6 people, 30 minutes, Trusts allowed."] = "Ve a Talacca Cove; su entrada está junto al Home Point de Caedarva Mire (o toma la salida oeste de Nashmau). Examina la Rock Slab del noroeste para una escena y el campo de batalla: hasta 6 personas, 30 minutos, se permiten Trusts.",
    ["Go to The Boyahda Tree Map 1 (F-4), the spot entered from (E-4) with a single Mandragora Warden (F-4) (Proto-Waypoint is closest; or the Cloister Home Point and exit F; or Unity Warp level 135), and ask about Magh Bihu."] = "Ve al mapa 1 de The Boyahda Tree (F-4), el lugar al que se entra desde (E-4) con un único Mandragora Warden (F-4) (el Proto-Waypoint es lo más cercano; o el Home Point del Cloister y la salida F; o el Unity Warp de nivel 135), y pregunta por Magh Bihu.",
    ["Go to The Boyahda Tree and open a Treasure Coffer with a Boyahda Coffer Key, or pick the lock as a Thief. The Curio Vendor Moogle sells the key. You don't need to be on Dragoon for this; you receive the key item Old gauntlets."] = "Ve a The Boyahda Tree y abre un Treasure Coffer con una Boyahda Coffer Key, o fuerza la cerradura como Thief. El Curio Vendor Moogle vende la llave. No necesitas ser Dragoon para esto; recibes el key item Old gauntlets.",
    ["Go to The Boyahda Tree, Map 1 bottom floor, and check the three Muggy Air spots at (D-5), (H-6) and (H-9); only the one with a white glow is active. The Proto-Waypoint puts you at (D-4); Unity Warp (level 125) also works (turn around to reach Map 1)."] = "Ve a The Boyahda Tree, planta baja del mapa 1, y revisa los tres puntos de Muggy Air en (D-5), (H-6) y (H-9); solo está activo el que tiene un brillo blanco. El Proto-Waypoint te deja en (D-4); el Unity Warp (nivel 125) también sirve (date la vuelta para llegar al mapa 1).",
    ["Go to The Eldieme Necropolis (the Magicked astrolabe, 10,000 gil from Churano-Shurano in Windurst Waters (F-8), lets you open its doors solo) and open a Treasure Coffer with an Eldieme Coffer Key, or pick the lock as a Thief. The Curio Vendor Moogle sells the key. You don't need to be on Dark Knight for this; you receive the key item Old gauntlets."] = "Ve a The Eldieme Necropolis (el Magicked astrolabe, 10,000 gil a Churano-Shurano en Windurst Waters (F-8), te permite abrir sus puertas tú solo) y abre un Treasure Coffer con una Eldieme Coffer Key, o fuerza la cerradura como Thief. El Curio Vendor Moogle vende la llave. No necesitas ser Dark Knight para esto; recibes el key item Old gauntlets.",
    ["Go to The Eldieme Necropolis (the Magicked astrolabe, 10,000 gil from Churano-Shurano in Windurst Waters (F-8), lets you open its doors solo) and open a Treasure Coffer with an Eldieme Coffer Key, or pick the lock as a Thief. The Curio Vendor Moogle sells the key. You don't need to be on Paladin for this; you receive the key item Old gauntlets."] = "Ve a The Eldieme Necropolis (el Magicked astrolabe, 10,000 gil a Churano-Shurano en Windurst Waters (F-8), te permite abrir sus puertas tú solo) y abre un Treasure Coffer con una Eldieme Coffer Key, o fuerza la cerradura como Thief. El Curio Vendor Moogle vende la llave. No necesitas ser Paladin para esto; recibes el key item Old gauntlets.",
    ["Go to The Eldieme Necropolis (the Magicked astrolabe, 10,000 gil from Churano-Shurano in Windurst Waters (F-8), lets you open its doors solo) and open a Treasure Coffer with an Eldieme Coffer Key, or pick the lock as a Thief. The Curio Vendor Moogle sells the key. You don't need to be on Red Mage for this; you receive the key item Old gauntlets."] = "Ve a The Eldieme Necropolis (el Magicked astrolabe, 10,000 gil a Churano-Shurano en Windurst Waters (F-8), te permite abrir sus puertas tú solo) y abre un Treasure Coffer con una Eldieme Coffer Key, o fuerza la cerradura como Thief. El Curio Vendor Moogle vende la llave. No necesitas ser Red Mage para esto; recibes el key item Old gauntlets.",
    ["Go to The Eldieme Necropolis (the Magicked astrolabe, 10,000 gil from Churano-Shurano in Windurst Waters (F-8), lets you open its doors solo) and open a Treasure Coffer with an Eldieme Coffer Key. The coffer may be in the north-west part of map 2 (exit 7), on a ledge normally reached from Beaucedine Glacier via Batallia Downs; examining the Lycopodium in Batallia Downs (S) unlocks a Sparkling Light shortcut to it, or pick the lock as a Thief. The Curio Vendor Moogle sells the key. You don't need to be on Warrior for this; you receive the key item Old gauntlets."] = "Ve a The Eldieme Necropolis (el Magicked astrolabe, 10,000 gil a Churano-Shurano en Windurst Waters (F-8), te permite abrir sus puertas tú solo) y abre un Treasure Coffer con una Eldieme Coffer Key. El cofre puede estar en la parte noroeste del mapa 2 (salida 7), en una cornisa a la que normalmente se llega desde Beaucedine Glacier pasando por Batallia Downs; examinar el Lycopodium de Batallia Downs (S) desbloquea un atajo de Sparkling Light hasta allí, o fuerza la cerradura como Thief. El Curio Vendor Moogle vende la llave. No necesitas ser Warrior para esto; recibes el key item Old gauntlets.",
    ["Go to The Eldieme Necropolis and look for a ??? that spawns in one of four locations. It can be reached via Beaucedine Glacier, the Lycopodium warps or the Unity warp to the zone."] = "Ve a The Eldieme Necropolis y busca una ??? que aparece en una de cuatro ubicaciones. Se puede llegar por Beaucedine Glacier, los warps de Lycopodium o el Unity warp a la zona.",
    ["Go to The Eldieme Necropolis from Batallia Downs (J-10), or by Survival Guide. You need a Magicked astrolabe or a friend on the switches. Go straight to the intersection at (J-8), turn left and follow the path west to Titan's Gate at (G-8), go north through it and step on the square of bones to fall to map 2 (L-10). Go east to the Hume Bones at (M-10)."] = "Ve a The Eldieme Necropolis desde Batallia Downs (J-10) o con la Survival Guide. Necesitas un Magicked astrolabe o un amigo en los interruptores. Ve directo al cruce de (J-8), gira a la izquierda y sigue el camino al oeste hasta Titan's Gate en (G-8), crúzala hacia el norte y pisa el cuadro de huesos para caer al mapa 2 (L-10). Ve al este hasta los Hume Bones en (M-10).",
    ["Go to Toraimarai Canal Map 2 (G-8). Quickest: through the Priming Gate in Windurst Walls (I-3) with the Rhinostery certificate, right at the bottom of the stairs, into the water and keep turning left to some stairs, go up, then south, east and north to (G-8). Toraimarai Canal Home Point #1 also works."] = "Ve al mapa 2 de Toraimarai Canal (G-8). Lo más rápido: por la Priming Gate de Windurst Walls (I-3) con el Rhinostery certificate, a la derecha al pie de las escaleras, al agua y sigue girando a la izquierda hasta unas escaleras, sube, y luego al sur, al este y al norte hasta (G-8). El Home Point #1 de Toraimarai Canal también sirve.",
    ["Go to Toraimarai Canal and open a Coffer there to obtain the Joker card. Various enemies in the zone drop the Toraimarai Coffer Key, or you can buy one from the Curio Vendor Moogle for 5,000 gil."] = "Ve a Toraimarai Canal y abre un Coffer allí para obtener la Joker card. Varios enemigos de la zona sueltan la Toraimarai Coffer Key, o puedes comprar una al Curio Vendor Moogle por 5,000 gil.",
    ["Go to Toraimarai Canal on Black Mage (Manafont is needed) and examine the two ??? on Map 1. Stand right in front of each one; from too far away or the other side of the grate you only get a message that you cannot examine further."] = "Ve a Toraimarai Canal como Black Mage (hace falta Manafont) y examina las dos ??? del mapa 1. Colócate justo delante de cada una; desde demasiado lejos o desde el otro lado de la reja solo recibes un mensaje de que no puedes examinar más.",
    ["Go to Upper Jeuno. If you don't already have the Map of the Jeuno area, talk to Rusese inside the shop at H-6 and buy it. It's a prerequisite for the mount quest for some reason. Grab Home Point #3 while you're here."] = "Ve a Upper Jeuno. Si aún no tienes el Map of the Jeuno area, habla con Rusese dentro de la tienda de H-6 y cómpralo. Por algún motivo es un requisito de la quest de la montura. Toca el Home Point #3 ya que estás aquí.",
    ["Go to Wajaom Woodlands (C-8) to enter Halvung. Go to (H-11) and examine the ??? to acquire a Lilac ribbon. The fastest way is the Wajaom Woodlands Survival Guide."] = "Ve a Wajaom Woodlands (C-8) para entrar en Halvung. Ve a (H-11) y examina la ??? para conseguir una Lilac ribbon. La forma más rápida es la Survival Guide de Wajaom Woodlands.",
    ["Go to Wajaom Woodlands (H-13) (Unity Warp level 125, or the Aydeewa Subterrane Survival Guide) and examine the glowing Savage Scars (H-13) behind the Engraved Tablet for a cutscene."] = "Ve a Wajaom Woodlands (H-13) (Unity Warp de nivel 125, o la Survival Guide de Aydeewa Subterrane) y examina las Savage Scars (H-13) brillantes detrás de la Engraved Tablet para una escena.",
    ["Go to Weighted Door (I-9) and stand on the weight pad to open it (Galka 3 points, Hume/Elvaan/Mithra 2, Tarutaru 1; 3 needed). You still have to stand on the pad even with the Loadstone."] = "Ve a la Weighted Door (I-9) y súbete a la placa de peso para abrirla (Galka 3 puntos, Hume/Elvaan/Mithra 2, Tarutaru 1; hacen falta 3). Aun con la Loadstone tienes que subirte a la placa.",
    ["Go to West Sarutabaruta and defeat Crawler enemies there until one drops a Meteorite."] = "Ve a West Sarutabaruta y derrota allí a enemigos Crawler hasta que uno suelte un Meteorite.",
    ["Go to Windurst Walls (G-3) and check the door of the House of the Hero."] = "Ve a Windurst Walls (G-3) y revisa la puerta de la House of the Hero.",
    ["Go to Windurst Walls (G-3) and examine the door of the House of the Hero for a cutscene."] = "Ve a Windurst Walls (G-3) y examina la puerta de la House of the Hero para una escena.",
    ["Go to Windurst Waters South (a short walk away, or use Home Point #3) and speak with Honoi-Gomoi (E-7) for a cutscene. He is upstairs in his house, reached by a back stairway."] = "Ve a Windurst Waters South (a poca distancia, o usa el Home Point #3) y habla con Honoi-Gomoi (E-7) para una escena. Está arriba en su casa, a la que se llega por una escalera trasera.",
    ["Go to Windurst Waters and speak with Chamama at (F-10) (Home Point #4). She asks for Saruta Cotton x4 to make a Fake moustache."] = "Ve a Windurst Waters y habla con Chamama en (F-10) (Home Point #4). Pide Saruta Cotton x4 para hacer un Fake moustache.",
    ["Go to a Gate Sentry in an area that your nation controls and speak with him. A Reinforcement appears and follows you. Escort it to the outpost of that zone."] = "Ve a un Gate Sentry de una zona que controle tu nación y habla con él. Aparece un Reinforcement que te sigue. Escóltalo hasta el puesto avanzado de esa zona.",
    ["Go to any Crag (Holla, Dem or Mea) and examine the Dimensional Portal for a cutscene."] = "Ve a cualquier Crag (Holla, Dem o Mea) y examina el Dimensional Portal para una escena.",
    ["Go to any Telepoint and trade a synthesis crystal to receive a Faded Crystal."] = "Ve a cualquier Telepoint y entrega un synthesis crystal para recibir un Faded Crystal.",
    ["Go to one of these Ergon Loci: Flourishing Island, Ceizak Battlegrounds (K-10, Frontier Station); Bud of the Swarm, Ceizak Battlegrounds (I-8, Bivouac #2); Immutable Boulder, Yahse Hunting Grounds (F-6, Bivouac #2). You get the message \"You are assaulted by an uncanny sensation.\""] = "Ve a uno de estos Ergon Loci: Flourishing Island, Ceizak Battlegrounds (K-10, Frontier Station); Bud of the Swarm, Ceizak Battlegrounds (I-8, Bivouac #2); Immutable Boulder, Yahse Hunting Grounds (F-6, Bivouac #2). Recibes el mensaje \"You are assaulted by an uncanny sensation.\"",
    ["Go to the (G-5) entrance of Quicksand Caves in Western Altepa Desert (Kuftal Tunnel Survival Guide and exit, or Unity Warp level 125 to Kuftal Tunnel and Escape)."] = "Ve a la entrada (G-5) de Quicksand Caves en Western Altepa Desert (Survival Guide de Kuftal Tunnel y salir, o Unity Warp de nivel 125 a Kuftal Tunnel y Escape).",
    ["Go to the Airship Docks in Western Adoulin (H-4, waypoint #8) for a cutscene."] = "Ve a los Airship Docks de Western Adoulin (H-4, waypoint #8) para una escena.",
    ["Go to the Augural Conveyor room in Rala Waterways (B-6) and examine the Conveyor to unlock it if you haven't. From the Western Adoulin (F-5) entrance, head east along the path and enter (B-6) from (C-7)."] = "Ve a la sala del Augural Conveyor de Rala Waterways (B-6) y examina el Conveyor para desbloquearlo si no lo has hecho. Desde la entrada de Western Adoulin (F-5), ve al este por el camino y entra en (B-6) desde (C-7).",
    ["Go to the Azouph Isle Staging Point in Caedarva Mire (K-9). Assault Orders do not let you travel to Runic Portals you have not already visited."] = "Ve al Azouph Isle Staging Point en Caedarva Mire (K-9). Las Assault Orders no te dejan viajar a Runic Portals que no hayas visitado ya.",
    ["Go to the Boat Docks at (H-8), board one of the boats and interact with the Dock Lever for a cutscene with Zeid. Make sure you have a free inventory space: at the end you receive the Chaosbringer."] = "Ve a los Boat Docks de (H-8), sube a uno de los botes y usa la Dock Lever para una escena con Zeid. Asegúrate de tener un hueco libre en el inventario: al final recibes la Chaosbringer.",
    ["Go to the Cathedral in Northern San d'Oria and speak with Pagisalis in the basement (the stairs are on the left as you enter). He asks for a Velvet Cloth: trade him one to receive the Old boots in exchange for the Old pocket watch."] = "Ve a la Cathedral de Northern San d'Oria y habla con Pagisalis en el sótano (las escaleras están a la izquierda al entrar). Te pide una Velvet Cloth: entrégale una para recibir las Old boots a cambio del Old pocket watch.",
    ["Go to the Celennia Memorial Library at (F-10) in Eastern Adoulin and talk to Eppel-Treppel to go inside."] = "Ve a la Celennia Memorial Library en (F-10) de Eastern Adoulin y habla con Eppel-Treppel para entrar.",
    ["Go to the Chamber of Oracles and examine the Shimmering Circle for a cutscene. From the Goblin: weight pad at (I-9), west to the pad at (H-7), drop down the hole in the next room, then (D-4). The pads need a Galka, a Loadstone, 2 Hume/Elvaan/Mithra or 3 Tarutaru (Trusts don't count). Unlock Home Point #1 outside."] = "Ve a la Chamber of Oracles y examina el Shimmering Circle para una escena. Desde el Goblin: placa de peso en (I-9), al oeste hasta la placa de (H-7), déjate caer por el agujero de la sala siguiente y luego a (D-4). Las placas necesitan un Galka, una Loadstone, 2 Hume/Elvaan/Mithra o 3 Tarutaru (los Trusts no cuentan). Desbloquea el Home Point #1 de fuera.",
    ["Go to the Cloister of Frost in Fei'Yin (Home Point #2 is closest). On a first visit, enter Fei'Yin from Beaucedine Glacier (J-4) (or the Unity warp), go downstairs at (G-9) on map 1, and zone into the Cloister at (I-5) on map 2."] = "Ve al Cloister of Frost en Fei'Yin (el Home Point #2 es el más cercano). En una primera visita, entra en Fei'Yin desde Beaucedine Glacier (J-4) (o con el Unity warp), baja las escaleras de (G-9) en el mapa 1 y entra en el Cloister por (I-5) en el mapa 2.",
    ["Go to the Cutter at (H-8) on Map 5 of Arrapago Reef (Arrapago Ring; or Caedarva Mire Survival Guide and south via the G-8 zone line; or Dvucca Isle Staging Point and the F-9 entrance)."] = "Ve al Cutter de (H-8) en el mapa 5 de Arrapago Reef (Arrapago Ring; o la Survival Guide de Caedarva Mire y al sur por el límite de zona de G-8; o el Dvucca Isle Staging Point y la entrada de F-9).",
    ["Go to the Cutter at (H-8) on Map 5 of Arrapago Reef. Fastest is the Arrapago Ring (100 Imperial Standing accolades), if you have been there before. Otherwise take the Caedarva Mire Survival Guide and go south into Arrapago Reef at (G-8) (not the G-6 zone line right next to the guide), then south to the Cutter; or take the Dvucca Isle Staging Point and go west to the (F-9) entrance, paying its fee."] = "Ve al Cutter de (H-8) en el mapa 5 de Arrapago Reef. Lo más rápido es el Arrapago Ring (100 accolades de Imperial Standing), si ya has estado allí. Si no, toma la Survival Guide de Caedarva Mire y ve al sur a Arrapago Reef por (G-8) (no por el límite de zona de G-6 justo al lado de la guía), y luego al sur hasta el Cutter; o toma el Dvucca Isle Staging Point y ve al oeste hasta la entrada de (F-9), pagando su tarifa.",
    ["Go to the Cutter at (H-8) on Map 5 of Arrapago Reef: the Arrapago Ring is fastest; or the Caedarva Mire Survival Guide and south into Arrapago Reef at (G-8) (not G-6); or the Dvucca Isle Staging Point and west to the (F-9) entrance (fee)."] = "Ve al Cutter de (H-8) en el mapa 5 de Arrapago Reef: el Arrapago Ring es lo más rápido; o la Survival Guide de Caedarva Mire y al sur a Arrapago Reef por (G-8) (no G-6); o el Dvucca Isle Staging Point y al oeste hasta la entrada de (F-9) (con tarifa).",
    ["Go to the Dvucca Isle Staging Point in Caedarva Mire (I-9). Assault Orders do not let you travel to Runic Portals you have not already visited."] = "Ve al Dvucca Isle Staging Point en Caedarva Mire (I-9). Las Assault Orders no te dejan viajar a Runic Portals que no hayas visitado ya.",
    ["Go to the Dvucca Isle Staging Point in Caedarva Mire (south from the Cutter into Caedarva Mire puts you close)."] = "Ve al Dvucca Isle Staging Point en Caedarva Mire (ir al sur desde el Cutter a Caedarva Mire te deja cerca).",
    ["Go to the Empyreal Paradox and examine the Transcendental Radiance for a cutscene. With the Home Point Lumoria > The Garden of Ru'Hmet > #1, zone out to the Grand Palace of Hu'Xzoi, warp there and descend."] = "Ve al Empyreal Paradox y examina la Transcendental Radiance para una escena. Con el Home Point Lumoria > The Garden of Ru'Hmet > #1, sal al Grand Palace of Hu'Xzoi, teletranspórtate allí y desciende.",
    ["Go to the Firebloom Tree Roots in Yuhtunga Jungle (H-9), northeast of the Survival Guide and the Outpost. Examine the roots on each side of the tree to obtain the Northern, Eastern, Southern and Western Vine. The Western Vine is in the tunnel. No hatchet is needed."] = "Ve a las Firebloom Tree Roots de Yuhtunga Jungle (H-9), al noreste de la Survival Guide y el Outpost. Examina las raíces de cada lado del árbol para obtener la Northern, Eastern, Southern y Western Vine. La Western Vine está en el túnel. No hace falta hacha.",
    ["Go to the Frontier Station in Morimar Basalt Fields (K-10) and speak with Vestavius."] = "Ve a la Frontier Station de Morimar Basalt Fields (K-10) y habla con Vestavius.",
    ["Go to the Full Moon Fountain. It helps to home point at Toraimarai Canal #1 beforehand, or you can warp to Toraimarai Canal with the Survival Guide."] = "Ve a la Full Moon Fountain. Ayuda registrar el home point en Toraimarai Canal #1 antes, o puedes teletransportarte a Toraimarai Canal con la Survival Guide.",
    ["Go to the Giwahb Watchtower in Wajaom Woodlands (F-5) and trade the Frayed Arrow to the door for a cutscene that completes the quest and gives you 500 Imperial Standing."] = "Ve a la Giwahb Watchtower en Wajaom Woodlands (F-5) y entrega la Frayed Arrow a la puerta para una escena que completa la quest y te da 500 Imperial Standing.",
    ["Go to the Halvung Staging Point inside Mount Zhayolm. Assault Orders do not let you travel to Runic Portals you have not already visited."] = "Ve al Halvung Staging Point dentro de Mount Zhayolm. Las Assault Orders no te dejan viajar a Runic Portals que no hayas visitado ya.",
    ["Go to the House of the Hero in Windurst Walls (G-3) and examine its door for a cutscene."] = "Ve a la House of the Hero en Windurst Walls (G-3) y examina su puerta para una escena.",
    ["Go to the Ilrusi Atoll Staging Point in Arrapago Reef (G-5). Assault Orders do not let you travel to Runic Portals you have not already visited."] = "Ve al Ilrusi Atoll Staging Point en Arrapago Reef (G-5). Las Assault Orders no te dejan viajar a Runic Portals que no hayas visitado ya.",
    ["Go to the Iron Gate at (G-8) on Map 2 (from the Minotaur, up the ladder at (K-5) and drop at (G-6)); don't fall into the water at (G-8). Open it with a Bronze Key from the Fomors, or a Thief can trade a Skeleton Key or Thief's Tools."] = "Ve a la Iron Gate de (G-8) en el mapa 2 (desde el Minotaur, sube la escalera de (K-5) y déjate caer en (G-6)); no caigas al agua en (G-8). Ábrela con una Bronze Key de los Fomors, o un Thief puede entregar una Skeleton Key o Thief's Tools.",
    ["Go to the Jade Sepulcher via Bhaflau Thickets Map 2 (Home Point #1, or the Mamool Ja Staging Point and head north)."] = "Ve a Jade Sepulcher por el mapa 2 de Bhaflau Thickets (Home Point #1, o el Mamool Ja Staging Point y al norte).",
    ["Go to the Jade Sepulcher: Bhaflau Thickets Home Point #1 is closest. Otherwise take the Mamool Ja Staging Point and head north to the zone line at (I-9) with Sneak and Invisible (or a mount)."] = "Ve a Jade Sepulcher: el Home Point #1 de Bhaflau Thickets es el más cercano. Si no, toma el Mamool Ja Staging Point y ve al norte hasta el límite de zona de (I-9) con Sneak e Invisible (o una montura).",
    ["Go to the Leypoint in Wajaom Woodlands (G-8) and trade the Rusty Medal for a cutscene that completes the quest and gives you 500 Imperial Standing."] = "Ve al Leypoint de Wajaom Woodlands (G-8) y entrega la Rusty Medal para una escena que completa la quest y te da 500 Imperial Standing.",
    ["Go to the Mamool Ja Staging Point inside Bhaflau Thickets. Assault Orders do not let you travel to Runic Portals you have not already visited."] = "Ve al Mamool Ja Staging Point dentro de Bhaflau Thickets. Las Assault Orders no te dejan viajar a Runic Portals que no hayas visitado ya.",
    ["Go to the Maze of Shakhrami and defeat Wight enemies to obtain a Rusty Key."] = "Ve a Maze of Shakhrami y derrota a enemigos Wight para obtener una Rusty Key.",
    ["Go to the Maze of Shakhrami and speak with Ahko Mhalijikhari (C-9) to receive the level cap status. The level cap is 25, Trust magic is usable and buffs do not wear off."] = "Ve a Maze of Shakhrami y habla con Ahko Mhalijikhari (C-9) para recibir el estado de límite de nivel. El límite es 25, la Trust magic se puede usar y los buffs no desaparecen.",
    ["Go to the Maze of Shakhrami and trade a Pickaxe to an Excavation Point to receive a Wyvern Egg. Fossil Rocks are unrelated to this quest."] = "Ve a Maze of Shakhrami y entrega un Pickaxe a un Excavation Point para recibir un Wyvern Egg. Las Fossil Rocks no tienen relación con esta quest.",
    ["Go to the Maze of Shakhrami."] = "Ve a Maze of Shakhrami.",
    ["Go to the Metalworks in Bastok and speak with Vladinek (H-8), in the Craftsmen's Eatery on the upper floor, for a long cutscene."] = "Ve a Metalworks en Bastok y habla con Vladinek (H-8), en la Craftsmen's Eatery del piso superior, para una escena larga.",
    ["Go to the Moogle Meeting (H-10) spot in La Theine Plateau, reached through Ordelle's Caves Map 3: from the Survival Guide go to B, take path D on Map 1, and on Map 2 drop down the southeast hole at (H-11). The Proto-Waypoint is quicker. Examine it for a cutscene."] = "Ve al punto Moogle Meeting (H-10) de La Theine Plateau, al que se llega por el mapa 3 de Ordelle's Caves: desde la Survival Guide ve a B, toma el camino D en el mapa 1 y, en el mapa 2, déjate caer por el agujero sureste de (H-11). El Proto-Waypoint es más rápido. Examínalo para una escena.",
    ["Go to the Nyzul Isle Staging Point in Alzadaal Undersea Ruins. Assault Orders do not let you travel to Runic Portals you have not already visited."] = "Ve al Nyzul Isle Staging Point en Alzadaal Undersea Ruins. Las Assault Orders no te dejan viajar a Runic Portals que no hayas visitado ya.",
    ["Go to the Reisenjima Sanctorium (Dimensional Portal at any Crag; or, after Chains of Promathia, the Garden of Ru'Hmet Home Point, the elevator down, and the Dimensional Portal in Empyreal Paradox) for a cutscene."] = "Ve al Reisenjima Sanctorium (Dimensional Portal de cualquier Crag; o, tras Chains of Promathia, el Home Point de The Garden of Ru'Hmet, el ascensor de bajada y el Dimensional Portal de Empyreal Paradox) para una escena.",
    ["Go to the Riverbed in Grauberg (S) (F-13); the campaign warp to Grauberg is fastest."] = "Ve al Riverbed de Grauberg (S) (F-13); el warp de campaña a Grauberg es lo más rápido.",
    ["Go to the Shararat Teahouse (J-12) for another cutscene."] = "Ve a la Shararat Teahouse (J-12) para otra escena.",
    ["Go to the Shararat Teahouse (K-12) for a cutscene and answer: pick all three topics, then \"Raillefal's secret\", then \"A San d'Orian prince\", then \"Prince Trion\"."] = "Ve a la Shararat Teahouse (K-12) para una escena y responde: elige los tres temas, luego \"Raillefal's secret\", después \"A San d'Orian prince\" y luego \"Prince Trion\".",
    ["Go to the Shararat Teahouse (K-12), on the upper level, and talk to either Ulamaal or Qutiba for another cutscene."] = "Ve a la Shararat Teahouse (K-12), en el nivel superior, y habla con Ulamaal o con Qutiba para otra escena.",
    ["Go to the Shararat Teahouse in Whitegate (K-11) for a cutscene and the key item Raillefal's note. Your answers don't matter; you also get an Imperial Silver Piece."] = "Ve a la Shararat Teahouse de Whitegate (K-11) para una escena y el key item Raillefal's note. Tus respuestas dan igual; también recibes una Imperial Silver Piece.",
    ["Go to the Tavnazian Safehold and speak with Quelveuiat (I-10), on the first floor near the Altar of the Dawn, for a cutscene."] = "Ve a Tavnazian Safehold y habla con Quelveuiat (I-10), en el primer piso cerca del Altar of the Dawn, para una escena.",
    ["Go to the Temple of Uggalepih (the Survival Guide is quickest) with at least one Dragoon whose wyvern is out; the NMs don't spawn without it. Everyone else can be on any job and still gets the reward."] = "Ve al Temple of Uggalepih (la Survival Guide es lo más rápido) con al menos un Dragoon con su wyvern fuera; los NMs no aparecen sin ella. Los demás pueden ir con cualquier job y aun así reciben la recompensa.",
    ["Go to the Temple of Uggalepih: take the Yhoator Jungle outpost warp, Unity Warp or Survival Guide, run to the Bloodlet Spring entrance of the Den of Rancor (J-7), and follow the right wall to zone into the Temple on Map 3."] = "Ve al Temple of Uggalepih: toma el warp del puesto avanzado de Yhoator Jungle, el Unity Warp o la Survival Guide, corre a la entrada de Bloodlet Spring de Den of Rancor (J-7) y sigue la pared derecha hasta entrar en el Temple en el mapa 3.",
    ["Go to the Throne Room in Castle Zvahl Keep (Home Point #1 is closest). Buffs wear off when you enter the battlefield, so buff inside."] = "Ve a la Throne Room de Castle Zvahl Keep (el Home Point #1 es el más cercano). Los buffs desaparecen al entrar en el campo de batalla, así que poténciate dentro.",
    ["Go to the Throne Room in Castle Zvahl Keep for a cutscene at the door, then trade the Scholar's Testimony to the door to start the fight. All buffs are lost on entry and your support job is disabled; Trust magic is allowed if you have the key item Rhapsody in Umber."] = "Ve a la Throne Room de Castle Zvahl Keep para una escena en la puerta y luego entrega el Scholar's Testimony a la puerta para empezar la pelea. Pierdes todos los buffs al entrar y tu support job queda desactivado; se permite la Trust magic si tienes el key item Rhapsody in Umber.",
    ["Go to the Twinkle Tree near the Starfall Hillock in West Sarutabaruta (I-6), a rounded tree with a blue firefly-like glow at night."] = "Ve al Twinkle Tree cerca del Starfall Hillock en West Sarutabaruta (I-6), un árbol redondeado con un brillo azul como de luciérnagas por la noche.",
    ["Go to the Western Adoulin Waterfront (waypoint #9) and examine the Port Storage door at (J-4) for a cutscene."] = "Ve al Waterfront de Western Adoulin (waypoint #9) y examina la puerta del Port Storage en (J-4) para una escena.",
    ["Go to the airship dock in Port Bastok (Home Point #3 is closest) and walk up to Departures Entrance (F-7) at (F-7) for a cutscene. It's outside the building, you don't need a pass, and it's easy to run past the trigger spot."] = "Ve al muelle de aeronaves de Port Bastok (el Home Point #3 es el más cercano) y acércate a la Departures Entrance (F-7) en (F-7) para una escena. Está fuera del edificio, no necesitas pase y es fácil pasar de largo el punto que la activa.",
    ["Go to the base of the waterfall at (F-4) in Misareaux Coast and examine the ??? for a cutscene."] = "Ve a la base de la cascada de (F-4) en Misareaux Coast y examina la ??? para una escena.",
    ["Go to the basement of Crawlers' Nest and obtain a Bag of Seeds, which drops from a Fire Elemental or a Water Elemental. The Elementals only appear during fire or water weather, which Crawlers' Nest shares with Rolanberry Fields (ask Appollonia in Upper Jeuno (G-6) for the forecast). They spawn in the \"donut room\" with the Strange Apparatus on Map 3: from the entrance go west until you drop into the central hub (I/J-9), then south through passage B at (J-10) to Map 3, and west to the room's entrance at (H-8)."] = "Ve al sótano de Crawlers' Nest y consigue una Bag of Seeds, que suelta un Fire Elemental o un Water Elemental. Los Elementals solo aparecen con clima de fuego o de agua, que Crawlers' Nest comparte con Rolanberry Fields (pide el pronóstico a Appollonia en Upper Jeuno (G-6)). Aparecen en la \"sala del dónut\" con el Strange Apparatus del mapa 3: desde la entrada ve al oeste hasta caer al centro (I/J-9), luego al sur por el pasaje B de (J-10) al mapa 3 y al oeste hasta la entrada de la sala en (H-8).",
    ["Go to the cave at (D-8) in Konschtat Highlands and trade the Oriental Steel to the ??? inside to spawn Forger, a level ~33 Bomb NM. The level 99 Unity warp (Sleepy Mabel) puts you close, at (G-7)."] = "Ve a la cueva de (D-8) en Konschtat Highlands y entrega el Oriental Steel a la ??? de dentro para hacer aparecer a Forger, un NM Bomb de nivel ~33. El Unity warp de nivel 99 (Sleepy Mabel) te deja cerca, en (G-7).",
    ["Go to the central area of the first floor. You can't reach the elevator directly: go around east, north, then west to come at it from the other side. Four spinning Qn'zdei guard each side; the doors stay open while they sit on their pedestals. They only see (true sight) from the side with the large blue eye and can't be slept, so hug the wall to pass; if a door shuts, kill them and wait for the 5-minute respawn."] = "Ve a la zona central del primer piso. No puedes llegar al ascensor directamente: rodea por el este, el norte y luego el oeste para llegar por el otro lado. Cuatro Qn'zdei giratorios vigilan cada lado; las puertas siguen abiertas mientras están sobre sus pedestales. Solo ven (true sight) desde el lado del gran ojo azul y no se pueden dormir, así que pégate a la pared para pasar; si se cierra una puerta, mátalos y espera a que reaparezcan a los 5 minutos.",
    ["Go to the crag nearest your home nation and examine the Ergon Locus ??? beneath the stairs up to the Telepoint for the key item Fistful of homeland soil: San d'Oria, La Theine Plateau (K-8); Bastok, Konschtat Highlands; Windurst, Tahrongi Canyon (I-6)."] = "Ve al crag más cercano a tu nación y examina la ??? Ergon Locus bajo las escaleras que suben al Telepoint para obtener el key item Fistful of homeland soil: San d'Oria, La Theine Plateau (K-8); Bastok, Konschtat Highlands; Windurst, Tahrongi Canyon (I-6).",
    ["Go to the dead end at (E-10) in Davoi and examine the Disused Well to receive the Knight's soul. To get there, follow the river west from (J-10), then head south after reaching (D-8)."] = "Ve al callejón sin salida en (E-10) de Davoi y examina el Disused Well para recibir el Knight's soul. Para llegar, sigue el río al oeste desde (J-10) y luego ve al sur al llegar a (D-8).",
    ["Go to the lower level of Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-10) to trigger a cutscene, near the NPC Hajaom."] = "Ve al nivel inferior de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-10) para activar una escena, cerca del NPC Hajaom.",
    ["Go to the oasis in Western Altepa Desert at (E-9), in the south-west. The Unity Warp (level 125) gets you closest; the Rabao or Quicksand Caves #1 Home Points, the Survival Guide and the Voidwatch warp also work."] = "Ve al oasis de Western Altepa Desert en (E-9), al suroeste. El Unity Warp (nivel 125) es lo que más te acerca; los Home Points de Rabao o Quicksand Caves #1, la Survival Guide y el warp de Voidwatch también sirven.",
    ["Go to the pond at (E-5) and defeat Evil Weapon enemies until you get a Pinch of Glittersand. High-level Goblins (88+) are on the way; lower-level Rangers should go around them or use Invisible."] = "Ve al estanque de (E-5) y derrota enemigos Evil Weapon hasta conseguir un Pinch of Glittersand. Hay Goblins de nivel alto (88+) en el camino; los Rangers de nivel más bajo deberían rodearlos o usar Invisible.",
    ["Go to the pond at (G-6) on Map 2 of Gustav Tunnel. Unity Warp (level 128) puts you just south of it; the Survival Guide goes to Map 1. Everything nearby aggroes, so others can wait at (H-7), which is safe."] = "Ve al estanque de (G-6) en el mapa 2 de Gustav Tunnel. El Unity Warp (nivel 128) te deja justo al sur; la Survival Guide va al mapa 1. Todo lo de alrededor ataca, así que los demás pueden esperar en (H-7), que es seguro.",
    ["Go to the same spot in present-day Jugner Forest (Norvallen outpost warp or Survival Guide) and examine the Humus-rich Earth for a cutscene, then again to spawn Cernunnos, a Treant (Protect IV, Shell IV, Stone IV, Stonega III)."] = "Ve al mismo punto de la Jugner Forest del presente (warp del puesto avanzado de Norvallen o Survival Guide) y examina la Humus-rich Earth para una escena, y de nuevo para hacer aparecer a Cernunnos, un Treant (Protect IV, Shell IV, Stone IV, Stonega III).",
    ["Go to the secret Quicksand Caves entrance in Western Altepa Desert (C/D-11), the same one as in Through the Quicksand Caves, but this time you go to the other side of the map. Shortcuts: the Rabao Proto-Waypoint to Quicksand Caves, or Quicksand Caves Home Point #1 then east to exit 5 (H-4), drop off the ledge into the desert crevasse (D-10), and go south to the entrance."] = "Ve a la entrada secreta de Quicksand Caves en Western Altepa Desert (C/D-11), la misma que en Through the Quicksand Caves, pero esta vez vas al otro lado del mapa. Atajos: el Proto-Waypoint de Rabao a Quicksand Caves, o el Home Point #1 de Quicksand Caves y luego al este hasta la salida 5 (H-4), déjate caer de la cornisa a la grieta del desierto (D-10) y ve al sur hasta la entrada.",
    ["Go to the stone circle in La Theine Plateau. Unity Warp (level 99) to La Theine Plateau is the fastest way."] = "Ve al círculo de piedras de La Theine Plateau. El Unity Warp (nivel 99) a La Theine Plateau es lo más rápido.",
    ["Go to the three spots on the treasure map in Yuhtunga Jungle, (F-7), (H-10) and (I-12), and examine the Blue Rafflesia at each for a Rafflesia Nectar."] = "Ve a los tres puntos del mapa del tesoro en Yuhtunga Jungle, (F-7), (H-10) y (I-12), y examina la Blue Rafflesia de cada uno para obtener un Rafflesia Nectar.",
    ["Go to the tower at Beaucedine Glacier (I-7) and speak with Torino-Samarino twice, choosing the first option, for the temporary key item Shantotto's new spell."] = "Ve a la torre de Beaucedine Glacier (I-7) y habla dos veces con Torino-Samarino, eligiendo la primera opción, para obtener el key item temporal Shantotto's new spell.",
    ["Go to west at the intersection at the beginning of the zone the Gigas are there you can head SW into the staircase at (F-9), it heads to the Second Floor with more Gigas you can camp here safely and chain and farm Gigas and other Monsters here safely and avoid getting aggro'd and links."] = "Ve al oeste en el cruce del principio de la zona, donde están los Gigas; puedes ir al suroeste hasta la escalera de (F-9), que sube al segundo piso con más Gigas. Ahí puedes acampar con seguridad, encadenar y farmear Gigas y otros monstruos, y evitar que te ataquen o se enlacen.",
    ["Go upstairs and examine the Audience Chamber."] = "Sube las escaleras y examina la Audience Chamber.",
    ["Go upstairs and follow the left wall to the room at (J-9) and defeat Bonze Marberry for a Cursed Key. It drops 2 keys per kill and respawns every 5 minutes; everyone needs one, and it won't drop if you already have one. It uses Everyone's Rancor, so reset your Tonberry Hate first if it is high and you are low level."] = "Sube las escaleras y sigue la pared izquierda hasta la sala de (J-9), y derrota a Bonze Marberry para obtener una Cursed Key. Suelta 2 llaves por muerte y reaparece cada 5 minutos; todos necesitan una, y no la suelta si ya tienes una. Usa Everyone's Rancor, así que reinicia antes tu Tonberry Hate si es alto y eres de nivel bajo.",
    ["Go upstairs to Map 2 and head to (G-7), which leads out to a courtyard (Map 6). Head north, without falling off, to the hallway entrance at (I-7) into Map 7."] = "Sube al mapa 2 y ve a (G-7), que sale a un patio (mapa 6). Ve al norte, sin caerte, hasta la entrada del pasillo de (I-7) hacia el mapa 7.",
    ["Go west again and drop down hole H at the end of the path. You may meet the NM Juggler Hecatomb here (a Records of Eminence target)."] = "Ve de nuevo al oeste y déjate caer por el agujero H al final del camino. Puede que te encuentres aquí con el NM Juggler Hecatomb (un objetivo de Records of Eminence).",
    ["Goals"] = "Objetivos",
    ["Goblin Sight"] = "Goblin: vista",
    ["Goblins Sight Links"] = "Goblins: vista, se enlazan",
    ["Goblins in each zone below drop a food key item (about 5-10%; expect dozens of kills). In a party, one random member on or past this mission gets it, anywhere in the zone. You must hold the food when the NM dies to get its Seedspall."] = "Los Goblins de cada zona de abajo sueltan un key item de comida (alrededor del 5-10%; cuenta con decenas de muertes). En grupo, lo recibe un miembro al azar que esté en esta misión o más allá, en cualquier punto de la zona. Debes tener la comida cuando muera el NM para obtener su Seedspall.",
    ["Going Outside"] = "Salir de la ciudad",
    ["Going further and completing Rhapsodies Mission 2-13 grants Rhapsody in Crimson for another +30% exp and your fifth and final Trust slot. This requires:"] = "Avanzar más y completar la Rhapsodies Mission 2-13 te da Rhapsody in Crimson, con otro +30% de exp y tu quinto y último hueco de Trust. Requiere:",
    ["Going to Adoulin"] = "Ir a Adoulin",
    ["Gorget + chip, plus Yovra Organs: Red 10 Phuabo/5 Xzomit/1 Yovra, Yellow 10 Xzomit/5 Aern/1, Blue 10 Aern/5 Hpemde/1, Green 10 Phuabo/5 Hpemde/1, Clear 10 Phuabo/5 Aern/1, Purple 10 Xzomit/5 Hpemde/1, White 7 Aern/3 Phuabo/3 Hpemde/2 Yovra, Black 7 Hpemde/3 Phuabo/3 Aern/2 Yovra."] = "Gorget + chip, más Yovra Organs: Red 10 Phuabo/5 Xzomit/1 Yovra, Yellow 10 Xzomit/5 Aern/1, Blue 10 Aern/5 Hpemde/1, Green 10 Phuabo/5 Hpemde/1, Clear 10 Phuabo/5 Aern/1, Purple 10 Xzomit/5 Hpemde/1, White 7 Aern/3 Phuabo/3 Hpemde/2 Yovra, Black 7 Hpemde/3 Phuabo/3 Aern/2 Yovra.",
    ["Gray Chip: Diremite (42-48) on many maps; Diremite Assaulter (57-59) from the (F-7) tower two floors down (drop at (I-8)), or across the first map from the (H-8) tower; Diremite Stalker (63-68) from the (G-9) tower two floors down (drop in the lower right of (H-9), then the long hallway on the right); Diremite Dominator (74-77) from the (F-7) tower three floors down."] = "Gray Chip: Diremite (42-48) en muchos mapas; Diremite Assaulter (57-59) desde la torre de (F-7) dos pisos más abajo (déjate caer en (I-8)), o cruzando el primer mapa desde la torre de (H-8); Diremite Stalker (63-68) desde la torre de (G-9) dos pisos más abajo (déjate caer en la parte inferior derecha de (H-9) y luego el pasillo largo de la derecha); Diremite Dominator (74-77) desde la torre de (F-7) tres pisos más abajo.",
    ["Grin shows you a picture of an NPC that you must memorize."] = "Grin te muestra una imagen de un NPC que debes memorizar.",
    ["Guide and protect Professor Clavauert B Chanoix to the room at (J-5) or (G-9)."] = "Guía y protege al Professor Clavauert B Chanoix hasta la sala de (J-5) o (G-9).",
    ["Guilberien asks for one of: 5 Eft Skins, 4 Manticore Hair, a Buffalo Horn, a Manticore Leather or a Buffalo Leather. Which one depends on your bond with Arciela (Buffalo Horn means the lowest)."] = "Guilberien pide uno de estos: 5 Eft Skins, 4 Manticore Hair, un Buffalo Horn, una Manticore Leather o una Buffalo Leather. Cuál depende de tu vínculo con Arciela (Buffalo Horn significa el más bajo).",
    ["Guslam cannot repair the gauntlets. If this is your first artifact armor from these quests, speak with Deadly Minnow inside the Durable Shields shop, then go to the Tenshodo in Lower Jeuno, speak with Yin Pocanakhu (J-8) and trade him 1,000 gil."] = "Guslam no puede reparar los guanteletes. Si es tu primera armadura de artefacto de estas quests, habla con Deadly Minnow dentro de la tienda Durable Shields, luego ve al Tenshodo de Lower Jeuno, habla con Yin Pocanakhu (J-8) y entrégale 1,000 gil.",
    ["Gustav Tunnel - levels 44-50 - Survival Guide warp to the entrance and kill everything in sight"] = "Gustav Tunnel - niveles 44-50 - teletranspórtate con la Survival Guide a la entrada y mata todo lo que veas",
    ["H-Cells closer to the south entrances/exits. Lower half of I-8."] = "Cuadrículas H más cerca de las entradas y salidas del sur. Mitad inferior de I-8.",
    ["Habaneros can be bought at the Auction House (Food, Ingredients) or from regional vendors, grown from Herb Seeds in your Mog Garden, or farmed from Mantrap enemies in Misareaux Coast."] = "Los Habaneros se pueden comprar en la Auction House (Food, Ingredients) o a vendedores regionales, cultivarse con Herb Seeds en tu Mog Garden o farmearse de enemigos Mantrap en Misareaux Coast.",
    ["Hand out the 15 Magicmart Flyers, only to townsfolk and not to adventurers. While the quest is active, when you come close to an NPC who should get a flyer, a message in /say tells you that the NPC looks over curiously for a moment."] = "Reparte los 15 Magicmart Flyers, solo a los habitantes del pueblo y no a aventureros. Mientras la quest está activa, cuando te acercas a un NPC que debe recibir un folleto, un mensaje en /say te indica que el NPC mira con curiosidad por un momento.",
    ["Harvest a Savory lamb roast in Giddeus or West Sarutabaruta."] = "Recolecta un Savory lamb roast en Giddeus o West Sarutabaruta.",
    ["Harvest at the ??? at (E-5) to obtain the Blazing Pepper."] = "Cosecha en la ??? en (E-5) para obtener el Blazing Pepper.",
    ["Haunt Sound"] = "Haunt: sonido",
    ["Having Windurst Mission 2-1 active prevents you from starting this quest. Nanaa Mihgo is involved in several quests and missions, so you may have to speak with her several times to trigger the cutscene that starts it."] = "Tener activa la Windurst Mission 2-1 te impide empezar esta quest. Nanaa Mihgo participa en varias quests y misiones, así que puede que tengas que hablar con ella varias veces para activar la escena que la inicia.",
    ["He also accepts a Snobby Letter. In total the quest pays between 120 and 5,500 gil, depending on the item."] = "También acepta una Snobby Letter. En total la quest paga entre 120 y 5,500 gil, según el objeto.",
    ["He asks for a few items from this list: Chocobo Bedding, Counterfeit Gil, Dart, Eastern Paper, Fernan's Diaries, Goblin Bread, Goblin Doll, Goblin Mushpot, Goblin Pie, Kaiserin Cosmetics, Kongou Inaho, My First Magic Kit, Naphille Pochette, Nyumomo Doll, Shuriken, Silver Obi, Snoll Gelato, Sphene Earring, Tonosama Rice Ball, Turquoise Ring."] = "Pide algunos objetos de esta lista: Chocobo Bedding, Counterfeit Gil, Dart, Eastern Paper, Fernan's Diaries, Goblin Bread, Goblin Doll, Goblin Mushpot, Goblin Pie, Kaiserin Cosmetics, Kongou Inaho, My First Magic Kit, Naphille Pochette, Nyumomo Doll, Shuriken, Silver Obi, Snoll Gelato, Sphene Earring, Tonosama Rice Ball, Turquoise Ring.",
    ["He asks for one of three items: a Rabbit Hide, a Lizard Tail or a Two-Leaf Mandragora Bud. The Bog Bunnies just north of him drop Rabbit Hides."] = "Te pide uno de tres objetos: una Rabbit Hide, una Lizard Tail o un Two-Leaf Mandragora Bud. Los Bog Bunnies justo al norte de él sueltan Rabbit Hides.",
    ["He asks you to arrange a meeting with the thief in Nashmau. Head to Nashmau and seek out Dnegan at (H-6), on the second floor. Do not choose \"Ask about the automaton.\" (that ends the cutscene and costs a game day); choose either of the other first dialogue options to continue."] = "Te pide concertar una reunión con el ladrón en Nashmau. Ve a Nashmau y busca a Dnegan en (H-6), en el segundo piso. No elijas \"Ask about the automaton.\" (termina la escena y cuesta un día de juego); elige cualquiera de las otras primeras opciones de diálogo para continuar.",
    ["He asks you to go to Nashmau and search for the culprit. Once in Nashmau, proceed to (H-6) (second floor) and speak with Dnegan, who saw a Puppetmaster recently and lost his gil pouch in Caedarva Mire."] = "Te pide ir a Nashmau a buscar al culpable. En Nashmau, ve a (H-6) (segundo piso) y habla con Dnegan, que vio hace poco a un Puppetmaster y perdió su bolsa de gil en Caedarva Mire.",
    ["He offers a divination for 1,000 gil and asks ten questions. Upon success, Waoud mentions seeing all five serpent symbols; if he mentions only one, you can try again the next game day."] = "Ofrece una adivinación por 1,000 gil y hace diez preguntas. Si sale bien, Waoud dice haber visto los cinco símbolos de serpiente; si solo menciona uno, puedes volver a intentarlo al día de juego siguiente.",
    ["He periodically summons 3-6 clones (about 2,000 HP each, immune to Sleep, gone after about 20 seconds) that can Mijin Gakure together with him, so spread out or kill them quickly."] = "De vez en cuando invoca de 3 a 6 clones (unos 2,000 HP cada uno, inmunes a Sleep, desaparecen tras unos 20 segundos) que pueden usar Mijin Gakure junto con él, así que separaos o matadlos rápido.",
    ["He sends you to three people, in any order. Fuepepe is in the east Aurastery building in Windurst Waters (North) (L-6); you may need to speak with him several times, as he repeats unrelated text before the line that continues the quest."] = "Te envía a ver a tres personas, en cualquier orden. Fuepepe está en el edificio este de la Aurastery en Windurst Waters (North) (L-6); puede que tengas que hablar con él varias veces, ya que repite texto sin relación antes de la frase que continúa la quest.",
    ["He surrenders below 10%. He deals steady area damage and uses Dread Spikes, which will kill melee attackers if not dispelled. He resists Sanguine Blade."] = "Se rinde por debajo del 10%. Hace daño de área constante y usa Dread Spikes, que matará a los atacantes cuerpo a cuerpo si no se disipa. Resiste Sanguine Blade.",
    ["Head SW into the staircase at (G-9)."] = "Ve al suroeste hasta la escalera de (G-9).",
    ["Head back into whichever of Selbina/Mhaura you were at and grind up to level 20 in Valkurm Dunes or Buburimu Peninsula. Now you're good to move on to brighter pastures - the Grand Duchy of Jeuno awaits!"] = "Vuelve a Selbina o Mhaura, donde estuvieras, y sube hasta nivel 20 en Valkurm Dunes o Buburimu Peninsula. Ya puedes ir a pastos más verdes: ¡el Gran Ducado de Jeuno te espera!",
    ["Head back to Chateau d'Oraguille and speak with Prince Trion for your reward."] = "Vuelve a Chateau d'Oraguille y habla con Prince Trion para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Head back to Horatius to trade the Dangruf Stone and receive your reward, 400 gil."] = "Vuelve con Horatius para entregar la Dangruf Stone y recibir tu recompensa, 400 gil.",
    ["Head back to Kubhe Ijyuhla, who started the quest, for another cutscene."] = "Vuelve con Kubhe Ijyuhla, que empezó la quest, para otra escena.",
    ["Head back to Norg and speak with Ryoma to complete the quest and receive your reward, Anju and Zushio."] = "Vuelve a Norg y habla con Ryoma para completar la quest y recibir tu recompensa, Anju y Zushio.",
    ["Head back to Oldton Movalpolos and speak with Koblakiq to complete the quest and receive your Jaguar Mantle."] = "Vuelve a Oldton Movalpolos y habla con Koblakiq para completar la quest y recibir tu Jaguar Mantle.",
    ["Head back to the Stone Monument in Riverne - Site #A01 and check it for a cutscene. Examine it again to spawn the NM Arcane Phantasm."] = "Vuelve al Stone Monument de Riverne - Site #A01 y revísalo para una escena. Examínalo de nuevo para invocar al NM Arcane Phantasm.",
    ["Head down the staircase to the Cermet Door, Summon Trusts and open the door."] = "Baja la escalera hasta la Cermet Door, invoca a los Trusts y abre la puerta.",
    ["Head east from Bivouac #2 to the north-west corner of (J-6) in Morimar Basalt Fields and examine the Ergon Locus ??? south of the giant rock (it doesn't sparkle) for a cutscene and the key item Silver luopan. Party members helping without the key item get a one-time Bayld reward that grows with the party size."] = "Ve al este desde el Bivouac #2 hasta la esquina noroeste de (J-6) en Morimar Basalt Fields y examina la ??? Ergon Locus al sur de la roca gigante (no brilla) para una escena y el key item Silver luopan. Los miembros del grupo que ayuden sin el key item reciben una recompensa única de Bayld que aumenta con el tamaño del grupo.",
    ["Head north a short way and examine the Blank Target at (G/H-11) for a cutscene, then again for how to get an Ark Pentasphere. You must flag it there, or you get no credit and need another Ark Pentasphere. Divine Might now appears in your Outlands quests log."] = "Ve un poco al norte y examina el Blank Target de (G/H-11) para una escena, y de nuevo para saber cómo conseguir una Ark Pentasphere. Debes activarlo allí, o no obtendrás crédito y necesitarás otra Ark Pentasphere. Divine Might aparece ya en tu registro de quests de Outlands.",
    ["Head north up the ramp, then take the first left and continue west-northwest toward (H-10)."] = "Ve al norte subiendo la rampa, luego toma la primera a la izquierda y continúa al oeste-noroeste hacia (H-10).",
    ["Head north, down the stairs, and hit the lever to go through the middle door at (H-6). Then north again, down the stairs, and hit the lever for the left door this time."] = "Ve al norte, baja las escaleras y golpea la palanca para pasar por la puerta del medio en (H-6). Luego al norte de nuevo, baja las escaleras y golpea la palanca de la puerta izquierda esta vez.",
    ["Head northeast through Ceizak Battlegrounds to Western Adoulin (K-7). You can use mounts here."] = "Ve al noreste por Ceizak Battlegrounds hasta Western Adoulin (K-7). Aquí puedes usar monturas.",
    ["Head northwest to (E-8) and check the Viscous Liquid for a cutscene."] = "Ve al noroeste hasta (E-8) y revisa el Viscous Liquid para una escena.",
    ["Head south and zone into Al'Taieu for a cutscene that completes the mission."] = "Ve al sur y entra en Al'Taieu para una escena que completa la misión.",
    ["Head south to enter a large square room and trade Gerwitz's Sword to the ??? at (H-10) to spawn Gerwitz's Soul."] = "Ve al sur para entrar en una gran sala cuadrada y entrega Gerwitz's Sword a la ??? en (H-10) para invocar a Gerwitz's Soul.",
    ["Head south to the cave at (E-8) and examine the ??? there for another cutscene, then examine it again for 99 Ice Arrows."] = "Ve al sur hasta la cueva de (E-8) y examina allí la ??? para otra escena, y examínala de nuevo para obtener 99 Ice Arrows.",
    ["Head south to zone out of Mount Zhayolm, then zone back in."] = "Ve al sur para salir de Mount Zhayolm y vuelve a entrar.",
    ["Head south, then hug the west wall to Survey Point near (I-9)/(J-9) for a cutscene. Unlock the Aydeewa Survival Guide now if you haven't."] = "Ve al sur y pégate a la pared oeste hasta el Survey Point cerca de (I-9)/(J-9) para una escena. Desbloquea ahora la Survival Guide de Aydeewa si no la tienes.",
    ["Head southwest to exit F (Map 3), drop down and go south to (G-10). A short cutscene plays at the stairs; then examine Final Survey Point (G-10) (again, if the cutscene didn't play because of Sneak or Invisible)."] = "Ve al suroeste hasta la salida F (mapa 3), déjate caer y ve al sur hasta (G-10). En las escaleras se reproduce una escena corta; luego examina el Final Survey Point (G-10) (de nuevo, si la escena no salió por llevar Sneak o Invisible).",
    ["Head straight back and enter through the Iron-framed Oak Door at G-6 on the far left. Worms do not link. Set RoE Conflict: Gusgen Mines for giggles."] = "Ve recto hacia el fondo y entra por la Iron-framed Oak Door de G-6, a la izquierda del todo. Los gusanos no se enlazan. Fija el RoE Conflict: Gusgen Mines de paso.",
    ["Head to (B-8), the Secret Beach, in Valkurm Dunes. The Survival Guide teleport to Gustav Tunnel, then walking out, leaves you right next to the spawn point."] = "Ve a (B-8), la Secret Beach, en Valkurm Dunes. El teletransporte de la Survival Guide a Gustav Tunnel, y luego salir caminando, te deja justo al lado del punto de aparición.",
    ["Head to (G-8) in Wajaom Woodlands and trade the Hydrogauge to the Leypoint (an Olduum Ring or the Survival Guide gets you close). Wait one minute, then examine the Leypoint again."] = "Ve a (G-8) en Wajaom Woodlands y entrega el Hydrogauge al Leypoint (un Olduum Ring o la Survival Guide te dejan cerca). Espera un minuto y examina de nuevo el Leypoint.",
    ["Head to (H-6) to find a ???. It is on the top floor; do not go down the stairs. It is advised to clear the area around the ???."] = "Ve a (H-6) para encontrar una ???. Está en el piso superior; no bajes las escaleras. Se aconseja eliminar a los enemigos de alrededor de la ???.",
    ["Head to (I-8) and trade the Quadav Charm to the Jail Door, on the ground floor, for a cutscene and a Trader's sack."] = "Ve a (I-8) y entrega el Quadav Charm a la Jail Door, en la planta baja, para una escena y un Trader's sack.",
    ["Head to (K-6); the entrance is at (J-6) and leads to an area not shown on the map. Examine the Primordial Convergence from the south or west to spawn Burgeoning Flames, a Fire Elemental."] = "Ve a (K-6); la entrada está en (J-6) y lleva a una zona que no aparece en el mapa. Examina la Primordial Convergence desde el sur o el oeste para hacer aparecer a Burgeoning Flames, un Fire Elemental.",
    ["Head to Aht Urhgan Whitegate and talk to Iruki-Waraki (K-9, top floor)."] = "Ve a Aht Urhgan Whitegate y habla con Iruki-Waraki (K-9, piso superior).",
    ["Head to Beadeaux and kill a De'Vyu Headhunter to obtain a Quadav Charm."] = "Ve a Beadeaux y mata a un De'Vyu Headhunter para obtener un Quadav Charm.",
    ["Head to Boneyard Gully (Attohwa Chasm Home Point #1 is fastest) and select \"Tango with a Tracker\" at the Dark Miasma to enter a battlefield."] = "Ve a Boneyard Gully (el Home Point #1 de Attohwa Chasm es lo más rápido) y elige \"Tango with a Tracker\" en el Dark Miasma para entrar en un campo de batalla.",
    ["Head to Boneyard Gully and select \"Requiem of Sin\" at the Dark Miasma to enter a battlefield."] = "Ve a Boneyard Gully y elige \"Requiem of Sin\" en el Dark Miasma para entrar en un campo de batalla.",
    ["Head to Caedarva Mire and click the ??? at (K-8)."] = "Ve a Caedarva Mire y haz clic en la ??? en (K-8).",
    ["Head to Castle Oztroja and go to the Brass Door at (I-8)."] = "Ve a Castle Oztroja y dirígete a la Brass Door en (I-8).",
    ["Head to Castle Zvahl Baileys and fight Blood Demons and Demon Generals until you obtain a Demon Pen."] = "Ve a Castle Zvahl Baileys y lucha contra Blood Demons y Demon Generals hasta que obtengas una Demon Pen.",
    ["Head to Chateau d'Oraguille and speak with Chalvatot at (F-7) to receive the Moon ring."] = "Ve a Chateau d'Oraguille y habla con Chalvatot en (F-7) para recibir el Moon ring.",
    ["Head to Crawlers' Nest and open a Treasure Chest with a Nest Chest Key to obtain the key item Crawler blood. The chest has a 3 minute respawn time."] = "Ve a Crawlers' Nest y abre un Treasure Chest con una Nest Chest Key para obtener el key item Crawler blood. El cofre reaparece a los 3 minutos.",
    ["Head to Eldieme Necropolis from Batallia Downs (I-10). As soon as you zone in you receive a cutscene, after which the NPC Cannau appears. You can summon Trusts, but zoning in with an Adventuring Fellow makes the escort NPC disappear."] = "Ve a Eldieme Necropolis desde Batallia Downs (I-10). En cuanto entras en la zona recibes una escena, tras la cual aparece el NPC Cannau. Puedes invocar Trusts, pero entrar con un Adventuring Fellow hace desaparecer al NPC escoltado.",
    ["Head to Gusgen Mines and speak with Degga (H-9). Your level will be restricted to 25."] = "Ve a Gusgen Mines y habla con Degga (H-9). Tu nivel quedará limitado a 25.",
    ["Head to Horlais Peak by going through Yughott Grotto."] = "Ve a Horlais Peak pasando por Yughott Grotto.",
    ["Head to Ifrit's Cauldron using the entrance from (G-6) in Yhoator Jungle. The Survival Guide can also bring you there."] = "Ve a Ifrit's Cauldron por la entrada de (G-6) en Yhoator Jungle. La Survival Guide también te puede llevar.",
    ["Head to Jade Sepulcher and click the battlefield entrance (Ornamental Door) for a cutscene. The Home Point #1 warp from Aht Urhgan Whitegate to Bhaflau Thickets makes this fast."] = "Ve a Jade Sepulcher y haz clic en la entrada del campo de batalla (Ornamental Door) para una escena. El warp del Home Point #1 de Aht Urhgan Whitegate a Bhaflau Thickets lo hace rápido.",
    ["Head to Jugner Forest through King Ranperre's Tomb. If you have access to the Proto-Waypoint, it is the fastest way to reach the location."] = "Ve a Jugner Forest por King Ranperre's Tomb. Si tienes acceso al Proto-Waypoint, es la forma más rápida de llegar al lugar.",
    ["Head to Korroloka Tunnel and fill the flask at four Giant Clams: (F-10) on map 1 as you enter from Zeruhn Mines, (K-6) on map 3, (G-11) on map 5 and (I-10) on map 2. Washu's flask turns into a Flask of clam water."] = "Ve a Korroloka Tunnel y llena el frasco en cuatro Giant Clams: (F-10) en el mapa 1 al entrar desde Zeruhn Mines, (K-6) en el mapa 3, (G-11) en el mapa 5 e (I-10) en el mapa 2. El Washu's flask se convierte en un Flask of clam water.",
    ["Head to Kuftal Tunnel and examine the ??? just inside the entrance for a cutscene; the whole party must be close by, or you see nothing out of the ordinary. The Survival Guide is right at this entrance; otherwise a chocobo from Rabao gets you across the desert. The only monsters near the ??? are Sand Lizards, which don't aggro."] = "Ve a Kuftal Tunnel y examina la ??? justo al pasar la entrada para una escena; todo el grupo debe estar cerca, o no verás nada fuera de lo normal. La Survival Guide está justo en esta entrada; si no, un chocobo desde Rabao te lleva por el desierto. Los únicos monstruos cerca de la ??? son Sand Lizards, que no atacan.",
    ["Head to La Theine Plateau and check the Chocobo Tracks at the far northwest corner of (E-5), just south of the sliver of map in (E-4)."] = "Ve a La Theine Plateau y revisa las Chocobo Tracks en la esquina noroeste de (E-5), justo al sur del trocito de mapa en (E-4).",
    ["Head to Mamook using the (E-12) entrance in Wajaom Woodlands."] = "Ve a Mamook por la entrada (E-12) de Wajaom Woodlands.",
    ["Head to Metalworks, Home Point #1 (J-8), and speak with Naji."] = "Ve a Metalworks, Home Point #1 (J-8), y habla con Naji.",
    ["Head to Mount Zhayolm and click on the Sprightly Footsteps at (L-7) between 18:00 and 06:00. The Voidwatch teleport takes you to the exact location; casting Escape from inside Halvung puts you at (L-7), just north of it. Starting after 05:00 may not leave you time for the next cutscene before the hour changes."] = "Ve a Mount Zhayolm y pulsa los Sprightly Footsteps en (L-7) entre las 18:00 y las 06:00. El teletransporte de Voidwatch te lleva al lugar exacto; lanzar Escape dentro de Halvung te deja en (L-7), justo al norte. Si empiezas después de las 05:00, puede que no te dé tiempo a la siguiente escena antes de que cambie la hora.",
    ["Head to Norg and talk to Sohyon (J-8). Then talk to Washu to receive the key item Washu's flask."] = "Ve a Norg y habla con Sohyon (J-8). Luego habla con Washu para recibir el key item Washu's flask.",
    ["Head to Northern San d'Oria and speak with Mulaujeant at (E-5), on the second floor near the Blacksmithing Guild."] = "Ve a Northern San d'Oria y habla con Mulaujeant en (E-5), en el segundo piso cerca del Blacksmithing Guild.",
    ["Head to Oldton Movalpolos and defeat Moblin Ashman and Moblin Gurneyman enemies until one drops a Moblin Hotrok. Alternatively, go to Newton Movalpolos and defeat Moblin Groundman enemies."] = "Ve a Oldton Movalpolos y derrota a enemigos Moblin Ashman y Moblin Gurneyman hasta que uno suelte un Moblin Hotrok. Como alternativa, ve a Newton Movalpolos y derrota a enemigos Moblin Groundman.",
    ["Head to Port Jeuno and go down the stairs near the Mog House (not the ones leading up to Lower Jeuno.) You should see a NPC named Oboro at the bottom, possibly with a crowd of AFK players selling items in their Bazaars nearby. Ignore him completely until you're level 99 and go through the doorway to zone into Qufim Island."] = "Ve a Port Jeuno y baja las escaleras cerca de la Mog House (no las que suben a Lower Jeuno). Abajo verás un NPC llamado Oboro, quizá con un montón de jugadores AFK vendiendo objetos en sus Bazaars. Ignóralo por completo hasta el nivel 99 y cruza la puerta para entrar en Qufim Island.",
    ["Head to Qufim Island and kill Dancing Weapon enemies until you obtain a Kaiser Sword. Kaiser Swords can also sometimes be found at the Auction House."] = "Ve a Qufim Island y mata enemigos Dancing Weapon hasta conseguir una Kaiser Sword. A veces también se pueden encontrar Kaiser Swords en la Auction House.",
    ["Head to Rabao and talk to Zoriboh (F-6) to complete the quest and receive your reward, the Venerer Ring and 4,000 gil."] = "Ve a Rabao y habla con Zoriboh (F-6) para completar la quest y recibir tu recompensa, el Venerer Ring y 4,000 gil.",
    ["Head to Salaheem's Sentinels in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10) for a cutscene with Abquhbah, who redirects you to Hagakoff at (K-10)."] = "Ve a Salaheem's Sentinels en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10) para una escena con Abquhbah, que te redirige a Hagakoff en (K-10).",
    ["Head to Southern San d'Oria and speak with Sharzalion, and then with Daggao, who is in the bar as well. Optional: Curilla has extra dialogue at this point."] = "Ve a Southern San d'Oria y habla con Sharzalion y luego con Daggao, que también está en el bar. Opcional: Curilla tiene diálogo extra en este punto.",
    ["Head to Uleguerand Range. At (F-9) a slope leads all the way down to the zone entrance: slide down the southern slope (the one you see as you zone in) and aim for the ledge on your left; if you miss it, climb back up and try again. On the ledge, go into the hole to the ???."] = "Ve a Uleguerand Range. En (F-9) una pendiente baja hasta la entrada de la zona: deslízate por la pendiente sur (la que ves al entrar) y apunta a la cornisa de tu izquierda; si fallas, vuelve a subir e inténtalo otra vez. En la cornisa, entra en el agujero hasta la ???.",
    ["Head to Upper Jeuno and speak with Brutus at (G-7). This quest starts the first time you speak to him, together with Chocobo's Wounds."] = "Ve a Upper Jeuno y habla con Brutus en (G-7). Esta quest empieza la primera vez que le hablas, junto con Chocobo's Wounds.",
    ["Head to Wajaom Woodlands (D-9) and zone into Aydeewa Subterrane. Reach (G-10) on map 3 for a cutscene."] = "Ve a Wajaom Woodlands (D-9) y entra en Aydeewa Subterrane. Llega a (G-10) del mapa 3 para una escena.",
    ["Head to Wajaom Woodlands (K-7) and check the ??? at night (after 20:00 game time) for a cutscene."] = "Ve a Wajaom Woodlands (K-7) y revisa la ??? de noche (después de las 20:00 hora del juego) para una escena.",
    ["Head to West Ronfaure and look for Esca inside a tower at (F-6). She demands evidence."] = "Ve a West Ronfaure y busca a Esca dentro de una torre en (F-6). Te exige pruebas.",
    ["Head to the (G/H-10) boundary and exit into Wajaom Woodlands through the Ironbound Gate. As you zone, you watch a cutscene."] = "Ve al límite (G/H-10) y sal a Wajaom Woodlands por la Ironbound Gate. Al cambiar de zona, ves una escena.",
    ["Head to the Alchemy Guild at (G-5) for a cutscene."] = "Ve al Alchemy Guild en (G-5) para una escena.",
    ["Head to the Ashu Talif cutter in Arrapago Reef. Quickest: the Arrapago Ring (100 Imperial Standing accolades) teleports you in front of it, or from the Caedarva Mire Survival Guide go west out of the tunnel, then south into Arrapago Reef right beside it. Otherwise travel to the Dvucca Isle Staging Point and leave it, which puts you in Caedarva Mire (Map 2)."] = "Ve al cúter Ashu Talif en Arrapago Reef. Lo más rápido: el Arrapago Ring (100 accolades de Imperial Standing) te teletransporta frente a él, o desde la Survival Guide de Caedarva Mire sal del túnel hacia el oeste y luego al sur a Arrapago Reef, justo a su lado. Si no, viaja al Dvucca Isle Staging Point y sal, lo que te deja en Caedarva Mire (mapa 2).",
    ["Head to the Dilapidated Gate in Misareaux Coast at (F-7)."] = "Dirígete a la Dilapidated Gate en Misareaux Coast, en (F-7).",
    ["Head to the island in Batallia Downs (J-11). The only way to get there is through The Eldieme Necropolis: enter it from (I-10) in Batallia Downs. The Survival Guide puts you in the correct part of the Eldieme for this quest."] = "Ve a la isla de Batallia Downs (J-11). La única forma de llegar es por The Eldieme Necropolis: entra desde (I-10) en Batallia Downs. La Survival Guide te deja en la parte correcta de la Eldieme para esta quest.",
    ["Head to the island in Batallia Downs at (I-11). The only way there is through The Eldieme Necropolis: enter at (I-10) in Batallia Downs (or use the Survival Guide), hug the south side to the large room at (G-9) (you need someone to work the gates, or the Magicked astrolabe), drop through the grave at its center (point D) to map 2, then take point E to map 3 and follow the path south back out to Batallia Downs. Enemies in this section aggro by sound even at level 99."] = "Ve a la isla de Batallia Downs en (I-11). Solo se llega a través de The Eldieme Necropolis: entra por (I-10) en Batallia Downs (o usa la Survival Guide), pégate al lado sur hasta la sala grande de (G-9) (necesitas a alguien que accione las puertas, o el Magicked astrolabe), déjate caer por la tumba de su centro (punto D) al mapa 2, luego toma el punto E al mapa 3 y sigue el camino al sur de vuelta a Batallia Downs. Los enemigos de esta sección detectan por sonido incluso a nivel 99.",
    ["Head to the monument at the top of Zegham Hill in North Gustaberg (J-7). Fastest: the Oldton Movalpolos Survival Guide, then exit to North Gustaberg and climb from the middle of (I-6). Or use the Port Bastok exit near Home Point #1 and climb from the patch of trees at the (H-8)/(I-8) border."] = "Ve al monumento de la cima de Zegham Hill en North Gustaberg (J-7). Lo más rápido: la Survival Guide de Oldton Movalpolos, luego sal a North Gustaberg y sube desde el centro de (I-6). O usa la salida de Port Bastok cerca del Home Point #1 y sube desde el grupo de árboles en el límite entre (H-8) e (I-8).",
    ["Head to the room at (H-9) and mine in it until you find one of three key items: Electrocell, Electropot or Electrolocomotive. This is the same room where you finish the Blue Mage flag quest."] = "Ve a la sala en (H-9) y mina en ella hasta encontrar uno de tres key items: Electrocell, Electropot o Electrolocomotive. Es la misma sala donde terminas la quest de flag de Blue Mage.",
    ["Head to the western part of the zone (Map 5): from the Survival Guide go west on Map 2 and slide down drop point D; from (G-7) go south."] = "Ve a la parte oeste de la zona (mapa 5): desde la Survival Guide ve al oeste en el mapa 2 y déjate caer por el punto D; desde (G-7) ve al sur.",
    ["Head towards Sea Serpent Grotto; you get another cutscene shortly before you reach the zone line."] = "Dirígete a Sea Serpent Grotto; verás otra escena poco antes de llegar a la línea de zona.",
    ["Head up to the third floor of the safehold and examine the ??? behind the pillar at (K-9), near the Walnut Door (maybe twice). You obtain the Alabaster hairpin."] = "Sube al tercer piso del refugio y examina la ??? detrás de la columna de (K-9), cerca de la Walnut Door (quizá dos veces). Obtienes el Alabaster hairpin.",
    ["Head west to (F-9) and zone into Arrapago Reef through entrance 3. Head north to (H-8) to find the Cutter."] = "Ve al oeste hasta (F-9) y entra en Arrapago Reef por la entrada 3. Ve al norte hasta (H-8) para encontrar el Cutter.",
    ["Head west to Tavnazian Safehold; its entrance is at (F-10). Orcs, Gigas and Bugards attack below about level 45; a mount avoids them all."] = "Ve al oeste a Tavnazian Safehold; su entrada está en (F-10). Los Orcs, Gigas y Bugards atacan por debajo de nivel 45 aproximadamente; una montura los evita a todos.",
    ["Help the chocobo leave when prompted."] = "Ayuda al chocobo a marcharse cuando se te pida.",
    ["Hieronymus sends you to the Quartermaster at (H-9) in Bastok Markets (S). Obtain the supplies that he requests, either by gathering them or by buying them at the Auction House, and hand them over."] = "Hieronymus te envía al Quartermaster at (H-9) in Bastok Markets (S). Consigue los suministros que pide, ya sea recolectándolos o comprándolos en la Auction House, y entrégaselos.",
    ["Hill Lizard/Goblins"] = "Hill Lizard/Goblins",
    ["Holey Horror at Zi'Tah (H-8): green fragment. Only piercing melee damage (Daken works, ranged doesn't)."] = "Holey Horror en Zi'Tah (H-8): fragmento verde. Solo daño perforante cuerpo a cuerpo (Daken funciona, a distancia no).",
    ["Holy Moly in Yuhtunga Jungle: rifts at (F-11), (G-6) and (J-7)."] = "Holy Moly en Yuhtunga Jungle: rifts en (F-11), (G-6) y (J-7).",
    ["Home Points and Survival Guides"] = "Home Points y Survival Guides",
    ["Honestly, I haven't got much to say here. Push through to 75 and you'll hit the level cap that lasted longest in FFXI's early history."] = "Sinceramente, no tengo mucho que decir aquí. Sigue hasta el 75 y llegarás al límite de nivel que más duró en los primeros años de FFXI.",
    ["Hounds Sound"] = "Hounds: sonido",
    ["Hug the right wall until you get back to the elevator and head back down."] = "Pégate a la pared derecha hasta volver al ascensor y vuelve a bajar.",
    ["Hug the wall left to (K-13), a reive spawns in the way."] = "Pégate a la pared izquierda hasta (K-13); en el camino aparece una reive.",
    ["Hunt Orcish Fodders in East or West Ronfaure for an Orcish Axe."] = "Caza Orcish Fodders en East o West Ronfaure para conseguir un Orcish Axe.",
    ["Huu Xalmo the Savage drops the Xalmo Feather. Trade the feather to Ayame for your Temple Hose."] = "Huu Xalmo the Savage suelta la Xalmo Feather. Entrega la pluma a Ayame por tus Temple Hose.",
    ["If Besieged has captured a mission NPC, free them first."] = "Si Besieged ha capturado a un NPC de la misión, libéralo primero.",
    ["If Gilgamesh directs you to Jakoh Wahcondalo, speak with Jakoh Wahcondalo (J-9) in Kazham."] = "Si Gilgamesh te envía con Jakoh Wahcondalo, habla con Jakoh Wahcondalo (J-9) en Kazham.",
    ["If Iron Eater doesn't give the cutscene, talk to him again; if you have started the quest The Weight of Your Limits, you may have to change jobs first."] = "Si Iron Eater no te da la escena, vuelve a hablar con él; si has empezado la quest The Weight of Your Limits, puede que tengas que cambiar de job antes.",
    ["If Levil has nothing new, talk to Masad again to make sure you saw the Teodor cutscene, then try Levil again."] = "Si Levil no tiene nada nuevo, vuelve a hablar con Masad para asegurarte de haber visto la escena de Teodor y luego prueba de nuevo con Levil.",
    ["If Ploh says the princess awaits you in the Celennia Memorial Library, finish the Rhapsodies mission Solemnity first."] = "Si Ploh dice que la princesa te espera en la Celennia Memorial Library, termina antes la misión de Rhapsodies Solemnity.",
    ["If Suldiran is taken prisoner during Besieged, this quest is unavailable until he is rescued. This quest requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Si Suldiran es hecho prisionero durante Besieged, esta quest no está disponible hasta que sea rescatado. Esta quest requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["If Tenzen is busy in a Promathia mission (for example you are on Dawn without its final cutscenes), you can't continue until he is free; then examine the Resume Point in Empyreal Paradox."] = "Si Tenzen está ocupado en una misión de Promathia (por ejemplo, estás en Dawn sin sus escenas finales), no puedes continuar hasta que quede libre; entonces examina el Resume Point de Empyreal Paradox.",
    ["If Teodor hasn't been introduced in the quest Flavors of Our Lives yet: talk to Berghent at (J-9) near the Big Bridge, then Masad in the Mummers' Coalition, and wait until the next game day."] = "Si Teodor aún no ha aparecido en la quest Flavors of Our Lives: habla con Berghent en (J-9), cerca del Big Bridge, luego con Masad en la Mummers' Coalition, y espera al siguiente día de juego.",
    ["If Wings of the Goddess has not been started, receive Lightsworm here."] = "Si Wings of the Goddess no se ha empezado, recibe Lightsworm aquí.",
    ["If Wings of the Goddess is complete, examine the sparkling ??? beside a Cavernous Maw in Batallia Downs, Rolanberry Fields, or Sauromugue Champaign."] = "Si Wings of the Goddess está completo, examina la ??? reluciente junto a un Cavernous Maw en Batallia Downs, Rolanberry Fields o Sauromugue Champaign.",
    ["If Wings of the Goddess is incomplete, progress to at least In the Name of the Father and zone into Southern San d'Oria (S)."] = "Si Wings of the Goddess está incompleto, avanza al menos hasta In the Name of the Father y entra en Southern San d'Oria (S).",
    ["If Zayhi-Bauhi speaks normally instead of coughing, speak with Kalupa-Tawalupa and Rutango-Botango in front of him to receive the quest."] = "Si Zayhi-Bauhi habla con normalidad en lugar de toser, habla con Kalupa-Tawalupa y Rutango-Botango delante de él para recibir la quest.",
    ["If he mentions a chocobo running off, that's the wrong quest (Chocobo on the Loose!). Talk to him a couple more times until he prompts you to say \"Nope, never!\"."] = "Si menciona un chocobo que se ha escapado, esa es la quest equivocada (Chocobo on the Loose!). Habla con él un par de veces más hasta que te pida decir \"Nope, never!\".",
    ["If nothing advances you to Sacrifice, check the Mystic Retriever in Southern San d'Oria [S] (M-6)."] = "Si nada te hace avanzar a Sacrifice, revisa el Mystic Retriever de Southern San d'Oria [S] (M-6).",
    ["If the Southern San d'Oria (S) event does not occur, first examine the sparkling ??? beside a present-day Cavernous Maw."] = "Si no se produce el evento de Southern San d'Oria (S), examina primero la ??? reluciente junto a un Cavernous Maw actual.",
    ["If the end of the cutscene freezes, lower your frame rate to 30 fps. If you drop the ring or Councilor's gear, Ploh returns one piece per game day; to swap rings, trade her yours with 300,000 bayld."] = "Si el final de la escena se congela, baja los FPS a 30. Si tiras el anillo o el equipo de Councilor, Ploh te devuelve una pieza por día de juego; para cambiar de anillo, entrégale el tuyo con 300,000 bayld.",
    ["If the opening dialogue does not occur, proceed to the Captain's Chamber and speak with Gilgamesh (L-8) there."] = "Si no se produce el diálogo inicial, ve a la Captain's Chamber y habla allí con Gilgamesh (L-8).",
    ["If the opening event does not occur, examine a Tales' Beginning at one of those locations."] = "Si no se produce el evento inicial, examina un Tales' Beginning en una de esas ubicaciones.",
    ["If the quest Class Reunion is active, finish it first: you cannot start this quest until it is complete."] = "Si la quest Class Reunion está activa, termínala primero: no puedes empezar esta quest hasta completarla.",
    ["If the relevant rank missions were already completed, speak with Halver at Chateau d'Oraguille (I-9) for Cipher: Halver's Alter Ego."] = "Si las rank missions relevantes ya estaban completadas, habla con Halver en Chateau d'Oraguille (I-9) para Cipher: Halver's Alter Ego.",
    ["If the relevant rank missions were already completed, speak with Kupipi in Heavens Tower for Cipher: Semih's Alter Ego."] = "Si las rank missions relevantes ya estaban completadas, habla con Kupipi en Heavens Tower para Cipher: Semih's Alter Ego.",
    ["If the rod does not drop, rezone without touching the Hume Bones and repeat the quest from the beginning for another chance."] = "Si la vara no cae, cambia de zona sin tocar los Hume Bones y repite la quest desde el principio para otra oportunidad.",
    ["If the yellow Seed Afterglow is not at its usual location, check the circular room around (H-9)/(I-9)."] = "Si el Seed Afterglow amarillo no está en su sitio habitual, revisa la sala circular cerca de (H-9)/(I-9).",
    ["If there is weather when you attempt the quest, you have to wait for it to clear up to find the ???."] = "Si hay clima cuando intentas la quest, tienes que esperar a que despeje para encontrar la ???.",
    ["If this is not your first Trust quest, you are finished with the quest at this point and receive the Bastok Trust permit."] = "Si no es tu primera quest de Trust, terminas la quest en este punto y recibes el Bastok Trust permit.",
    ["If this is your first Magicite mission, speak with Paya-Sabya."] = "Si es tu primera misión de Magicite, habla con Paya-Sabya.",
    ["If this is your first Trust quest, you must use the Trust spell Kupipi in West Sarutabaruta or East Sarutabaruta, then return to Kupipi to receive the Windurst Trust permit."] = "Si es tu primera quest de Trust, debes usar el hechizo de Trust Kupipi en West Sarutabaruta o East Sarutabaruta, y luego volver con Kupipi para recibir el Windurst Trust permit.",
    ["If this is your first Trust quest, you must use the Trust spell Naji in South Gustaberg or North Gustaberg. After that, return to Naji to receive the Bastok Trust permit."] = "Si es tu primera quest de Trust, debes usar el hechizo de Trust Naji en South Gustaberg o North Gustaberg. Después, vuelve con Naji para recibir el Bastok Trust permit.",
    ["If this is your first time heading to Xarcabard, you may use the Unity level 125 warp to Xarcabard."] = "Si es la primera vez que vas a Xarcabard, puedes usar el warp de Unity de nivel 125 a Xarcabard.",
    ["If you answer all the questions correctly, you are sent after a Tahrongi Cactus."] = "Si respondes bien todas las preguntas, te envían a buscar un Tahrongi Cactus.",
    ["If you are doing this quest for a Vana'Bout objective and have already completed it once, you do not need to speak with Tapoh Lihzeh again: just trade her the items."] = "Si haces esta quest para un objetivo de Vana'Bout y ya la completaste una vez, no necesitas hablar de nuevo con Tapoh Lihzeh: solo entrégale los objetos.",
    ["If you are low level and not using Trusts, bring a party of level 65+. Mages need Echo Drops: all three bosses' Jamming Wave silences. Quicksand Caves Home Point #1 or the Quicksand Caves Proto-Waypoint (drop down and keep west) gets you to the Chamber of Oracles quickly."] = "Si eres de nivel bajo y no usas Trusts, lleva un grupo de nivel 65+. Los magos necesitan Echo Drops: el Jamming Wave de los tres jefes silencia. El Home Point #1 de Quicksand Caves o su Proto-Waypoint (déjate caer y sigue al oeste) te llevan rápido a la Chamber of Oracles.",
    ["If you are low level, bring a party or Trusts, and Silent Oil for Sneak."] = "Si eres de nivel bajo, lleva un grupo o Trusts, y Silent Oil para Sneak.",
    ["If you are low level, bring a party or Trusts; a Black Mage or Bard to sleep the enemies helps. Only players on or past this mission can enter."] = "Si eres de nivel bajo, lleva un grupo o Trusts; un Black Mage o un Bard que duerma a los enemigos ayuda. Solo pueden entrar los jugadores que estén en esta misión o más allá.",
    ["If you are on Royal Puppeteer or later but not finished: return to your home nation for a cutscene; you skip ahead to Aphmau's Light."] = "Si estás en Royal Puppeteer o más allá pero sin terminar: vuelve a tu nación para una escena; saltas a Aphmau's Light.",
    ["If you are on the mission The Horutoto Ruins Experiment, complete it first. If you are on Saintly Invitation, finish the fight against the Yagudo first, or the quest will not start."] = "Si estás en la misión The Horutoto Ruins Experiment, complétala primero. Si estás en Saintly Invitation, termina primero la pelea contra los Yagudo, o la quest no empezará.",
    ["If you are repeating this mission, or skipped it and ranked past it: instead, trade Zubaba 3 Rusty Daggers (Auction House, or from the Wendigos past the Three Mage Gate)."] = "Si repites esta misión, o te la saltaste y subiste de rango: en su lugar, entrega a Zubaba 3 Rusty Daggers (Auction House, o de los Wendigos pasada la Three Mage Gate).",
    ["If you are, now is the time to check the Monthly Records of Eminence objectives. Each of these four objectives rewards 10 Deeds of Heroism, which earn you rewards from the A.M.A.N. Validators located in each starting city. You'll also obtain a Trust Primer for each completed Objective, providing up to 80 alter ego points per month to be used to boost Trust stats."] = "Si es así, es momento de revisar los objetivos mensuales de Records of Eminence. Cada uno de estos cuatro objetivos da 10 Deeds of Heroism, que te permiten conseguir recompensas de los A.M.A.N. Validators de cada ciudad inicial. También obtendrás un Trust Primer por cada objetivo completado, con hasta 80 puntos de alter ego al mes para mejorar las estadísticas de los Trusts.",
    ["If you called for help during the battle, wait about one minute and examine the target again."] = "Si pediste ayuda durante la batalla, espera aproximadamente un minuto y examina de nuevo el objetivo.",
    ["If you choose correctly, you are given 500 gil. If you choose incorrectly, you fail the quest."] = "Si eliges bien, te dan 500 gil. Si eliges mal, fallas la quest.",
    ["If you choose correctly, you receive 500 gil. If you choose incorrectly, you fail the quest."] = "Si eliges bien, recibes 500 gil. Si eliges mal, fallas la quest.",
    ["If you chose the wrong earring or want a different one, drop your earring and proceed to the Empyreal Paradox (it must be dropped before you zone into the Empyreal Paradox). The fastest way is the Home Point warp: Lumoria, The Garden of Ru'Hmet, #1, and descend."] = "Si elegiste el pendiente equivocado o quieres uno distinto, suelta tu pendiente y ve al Empyreal Paradox (debe soltarse antes de entrar en la zona Empyreal Paradox). La forma más rápida es el warp del Home Point: Lumoria, The Garden of Ru'Hmet, #1, y descender.",
    ["If you chose to postpone, the mission shows as \"To Start ASA..\"; use the Tales' Beginning book at Windurst Walls (C-6)/(D-6) to start it."] = "Si elegiste posponerla, la misión aparece como \"To Start ASA..\"; usa el libro Tales' Beginning de Windurst Walls (C-6)/(D-6) para empezarla.",
    ["If you did not originally watch the extra scene for completing An Empty Vessel, you need to speak to him again after zoning. Choose \"Gaze away\", then \"I have\" in the cutscene (\"..\" doesn't start the quest and means waiting a game day to try again). The quest log says you have the quest from Raubahn, even though Waoud acts as your contact."] = "Si no viste en su momento la escena extra por completar An Empty Vessel, tienes que volver a hablar con él tras cambiar de zona. Elige \"Gaze away\" y luego \"I have\" en la escena (\"..\" no empieza la quest y obliga a esperar un día de juego para volver a intentarlo). El registro de quests dice que tienes la quest de Raubahn, aunque Waoud hace de contacto.",
    ["If you didn't already, go complete Rhapsodies Mission 1-9 by checking the entrance to Escha - Zi'Tah right next to the Home Point in Qufim Island defeating the enemy that spawns there."] = "Si aún no lo has hecho, completa la Rhapsodies Mission 1-9 revisando la entrada a Escha - Zi'Tah, justo al lado del Home Point de Qufim Island, y derrotando al enemigo que aparece allí.",
    ["If you do not examine the Tiger Bones soon enough after its death, you must examine them again and watch it die naturally once more."] = "Si no examinas los Tiger Bones lo bastante pronto tras su muerte, debes examinarlos de nuevo y mirar cómo muere de forma natural otra vez.",
    ["If you do not have a Delkfutt Key, climb the tower normally until you reach the 10th floor."] = "Si no tienes una Delkfutt Key, sube la torre normalmente hasta llegar al piso 10.",
    ["If you do not have access to the Home Point, see this for a walkthrough to the top, but beware it is a long trek."] = "Si no tienes acceso al Home Point, consulta esto para un recorrido hasta arriba, pero cuidado: es un camino largo.",
    ["If you do not read the note: proceed to Zeruhn Mines and locate Zelman at (I-8). He tells you that he is busy and to tell Tami. Return to Tami for your reward of 10 gil. You can then repeat the quest."] = "Si no lees la nota: ve a Zeruhn Mines y localiza a Zelman en (I-8). Te dice que está ocupado y que se lo digas a Tami. Vuelve con Tami por tu recompensa de 10 gil. Después puedes repetir la quest.",
    ["If you don't have Kindred's Seals, but do have Beastmen's Seals, you can trade them all to Shami in Port Jeuno at (H-8) to store them, then talk to the completely different NPC Shemo right next to Shami to exchange one variety of Seal for another."] = "Si no tienes Kindred's Seals pero sí Beastmen's Seals, puedes entregárselos todos a Shami en Port Jeuno en (H-8) para guardarlos, y luego hablar con Shemo, un NPC totalmente distinto justo al lado de Shami, para cambiar un tipo de Seal por otro.",
    ["If you don't have it yet, speak with Darcia (H-7) and choose \"I would like to apply!\" for the Geomagnetron and a list of founts."] = "Si aún no lo tienes, habla con Darcia (H-7) y elige \"I would like to apply!\" para obtener el Geomagnetron y una lista de founts.",
    ["If you don't unequip your weapons, the tear isn't collected and the ??? moves somewhere else."] = "Si no te quitas las armas, la lágrima no se recoge y la ??? se mueve a otro sitio.",
    ["If you don't use Trusts and are level 55-60, bring a full party. Castle Zvahl is on the far west side of Xarcabard (D-7/8); Castle Zvahl Keep Home Point #1 takes you closest."] = "Si no usas Trusts y eres de nivel 55-60, lleva un grupo completo. Castle Zvahl está en el extremo oeste de Xarcabard (D-7/8); el Home Point #1 de Castle Zvahl Keep es lo que más te acerca.",
    ["If you drop the Carbuncle's Ruby before completing the quest, you do not lose progress; simply obtain another one."] = "Si sueltas el Carbuncle's Ruby antes de completar la quest, no pierdes progreso; simplemente consigue otro.",
    ["If you drop your Olduum Ring, speak to Dkhaaya to repeat the quest."] = "Si tiras tu Olduum Ring, habla con Dkhaaya para repetir la quest.",
    ["If you end up in the wrong section from Batallia Downs, leave and come back, or use another entrance. Don't use the Xarcabard [S] entrance."] = "Si desde Batallia Downs acabas en la sección equivocada, sal y vuelve, o usa otra entrada. No uses la entrada de Xarcabard [S].",
    ["If you entered from La Theine Plateau (H-7) you arrive on map 1 (K-3): head to (I-5), a room with Fly Agaric enemies. If you used the Survival Guide you arrive on map 2 (G-2): go to map 1 (Point A, G-4), then to (I-5)."] = "Si entraste desde La Theine Plateau (H-7) llegas al mapa 1 (K-3): ve a (I-5), una sala con enemigos Fly Agaric. Si usaste la Survival Guide llegas al mapa 2 (G-2): ve al mapa 1 (Point A, G-4) y luego a (I-5).",
    ["If you entered the Hall of the Gods from Ru'Aun Gardens, return to Ro'Maeve and enter the Hall of the Gods again."] = "Si entraste en la Hall of the Gods desde Ru'Aun Gardens, vuelve a Ro'Maeve y entra de nuevo en la Hall of the Gods.",
    ["If you fail, Nahshib gives another permit after one game day. Players who already finished it don't need a permit to help."] = "Si fallas, Nahshib te da otro permiso tras un día de juego. Los jugadores que ya la terminaron no necesitan permiso para ayudar.",
    ["If you fail, get another Umbra bug from the Regal Pawprints under the tree root at (H-10), once per game day."] = "Si fallas, consigue otro Umbra bug de las Regal Pawprints bajo la raíz del árbol en (H-10), una vez por día de juego.",
    ["If you fail, get another key item from Rodin-Comidin in Whitegate and try again."] = "Si fallas, consigue otro key item de Rodin-Comidin en Whitegate y vuelve a intentarlo.",
    ["If you fail, return to the Stone Circle in La Theine Plateau at (G-6) and obtain another Breath of the avatars."] = "Si fallas, vuelve al Stone Circle en La Theine Plateau, en (G-6), y obtén otro Breath of the avatars.",
    ["If you fail, zone, wait a game day and get a new Silvermine Key from Solitary Ant in North Gustaberg (S) (J-9)."] = "Si fallas, cambia de zona, espera un día de juego y consigue una nueva Silvermine Key de Solitary Ant en North Gustaberg (S) (J-9).",
    ["If you finished all Aht Urhgan missions: examine Imperial Whitegate (L-9) for a cutscene. You skip ahead to Reunited, receive Cipher: Nashmeira II and can view all Aht Urhgan cutscenes. (A cutscene in your home nation is optional.)"] = "Si terminaste todas las misiones de Aht Urhgan: examina la Imperial Whitegate (L-9) para una escena. Saltas a Reunited, recibes Cipher: Nashmeira II y puedes ver todas las escenas de Aht Urhgan. (Una escena en tu nación es opcional.)",
    ["If you finished the previous mission through Divine Might and haven't chosen your earring yet, pick it up first (or enter the Shrine from the (H-9) entrance to move your log on)."] = "Si terminaste la misión anterior mediante Divine Might y aún no has elegido tu pendiente, recógelo primero (o entra en el Shrine por la entrada de (H-9) para que avance tu registro).",
    ["If you forget how far you are, talk to the Opo-opos on the list: those already given the right item say \"Opopopopo!\" and bow. Wide scan lists them in the right order if you can get all 10 in one scan."] = "Si olvidas por dónde vas, habla con los Opo-opos de la lista: los que ya recibieron el objeto correcto dicen \"Opopopopo!\" y hacen una reverencia. El widescan los muestra en el orden correcto si consigues los 10 en un mismo escaneo.",
    ["If you get \"Event skipped\" from aggro while mining, check your Temporary Key Items; you may have it anyway."] = "Si recibes \"Event skipped\" porque te atacan mientras minas, revisa tus Temporary Key Items; puede que lo tengas igualmente.",
    ["If you get a cutscene about a Shikaree tracker, that is for Tango with a Tracker: go talk to Despachiaire at (K-10), behind a Walnut Door, then return to Parelbriaux and talk to him twice more for a cutscene with Chemioue."] = "Si ves una escena sobre un rastreador Shikaree, es de Tango with a Tracker: habla con Despachiaire en (K-10), tras una Walnut Door, y luego vuelve con Parelbriaux y habla con él dos veces más para una escena con Chemioue.",
    ["If you get the A Moogle Kupo d'Etat cutscene instead, speak to him again. If an item that gives weekly conquest rewards (such as an Aurum Coffer) is in your layout, you may need to remove it to trigger the quest."] = "Si en su lugar ves la escena de A Moogle Kupo d'Etat, vuelve a hablar con él. Si tienes en la distribución un objeto que da recompensas semanales de conquest (como un Aurum Coffer), puede que tengas que quitarlo para activar la quest.",
    ["If you get the message \"Someone has been digging here\", you forgot to speak to Curilla after trading the Velvet Cloth."] = "Si recibes el mensaje \"Someone has been digging here\", olvidaste hablar con Curilla tras entregar la Velvet Cloth.",
    ["If you have a Delkfutt Key, go to (E-8), pass through the Cermet Door, and continue to the next Cermet Door at (J-8)."] = "Si tienes una Delkfutt Key, ve a (E-8), atraviesa la Cermet Door y continúa hasta la siguiente Cermet Door en (J-8).",
    ["If you have any other Borghertz's Hands quest active, you must complete that one before you can start this quest."] = "Si tienes activa cualquier otra quest de Borghertz's Hands, debes completarla antes de poder empezar esta quest.",
    ["If you have attuned to them, the Runic Portal at (L-7) in Whitegate is quickest: 200 Imperial Standing per warp (one Copper Voucher gives the 1,000 for all five), free under Assault orders for that area or at rank Captain."] = "Si te has sintonizado con ellos, el Runic Portal de (L-7) en Whitegate es lo más rápido: 200 Imperial Standing por warp (un Copper Voucher da los 1,000 de los cinco), gratis con órdenes de Assault para esa zona o con rango Captain.",
    ["If you have been completing Rhapsodies of Vana'diel Missions, it's recommend you take the \"advanced\" path: Trading Coffer Keys, which you can purchase from the Curio Moogle for 5,000 Gil if you have the \"Rhapsody in Umber\"."] = "Si has ido completando las Missions de Rhapsodies of Vana'diel, se recomienda el camino \"avanzado\": entregar Coffer Keys, que puedes comprar al Curio Moogle por 5,000 Gil si tienes \"Rhapsody in Umber\".",
    ["If you have just completed Blue Ribbon Blues, zone first."] = "Si acabas de completar Blue Ribbon Blues, cambia de zona primero.",
    ["If you have just completed Teak Me to the Stars, you must zone before starting this quest. You need Bastok fame level 4."] = "Si acabas de completar Teak Me to the Stars, debes cambiar de zona antes de empezar esta quest. Necesitas el nivel 4 de fama de Bastok.",
    ["If you have not returned the item before the airship lands, you keep it and must give it back to Swift before you can take the quest again."] = "Si no has devuelto el objeto antes de que aterrice la aeronave, te lo quedas y debes devolvérselo a Swift antes de poder volver a aceptar la quest.",
    ["If you have not yet completed the quest The Rumor, you can speak to Novalmauge a second time to accept it. You no longer need to complete The Rumor before advancing the job quest."] = "Si aún no has completado la quest The Rumor, puedes hablar una segunda vez con Novalmauge para aceptarla. Ya no necesitas completar The Rumor antes de avanzar la quest de trabajo.",
    ["If you have not yet gained access to Aht Urhgan Whitegate through the quest The Road to Aht Urhgan, you may trade your Testimony afterwards under the advanced path option and complete the quest."] = "Si aún no has accedido a Aht Urhgan Whitegate mediante la quest The Road to Aht Urhgan, puedes entregar tu Testimony después en la opción de camino avanzado y completar la quest.",
    ["If you haven't started Aht Urhgan, you move on to The Endless Sky and wait there."] = "Si no has empezado Aht Urhgan, pasas a The Endless Sky y esperas allí.",
    ["If you just finished Ghosts of the Past, you must zone before beginning this quest. You must be on Monk."] = "Si acabas de terminar Ghosts of the Past, debes cambiar de zona antes de empezar esta quest. Debes ser Monk.",
    ["If you lack the key to the door then see this for a walkthrough to the top, but beware it is a long trek. You will have to make it at some point though so it isn't time lost."] = "Si no tienes la llave de la puerta, consulta esto para un recorrido hasta arriba, pero cuidado: es un camino largo. De todos modos tendrás que hacerlo en algún momento, así que no es tiempo perdido.",
    ["If you leave Grauberg (S), you lose any gold dust you have acquired and have to start over."] = "Si sales de Grauberg (S), pierdes el polvo de oro que hayas conseguido y tendrás que empezar de nuevo.",
    ["If you lose the Purple Ribbon, you must wait until the next Conquest Tally to get it back. If several party members need the quest, wait 5 minutes after the defeat between each spawn."] = "Si pierdes la Purple Ribbon, debes esperar al siguiente Conquest Tally para recuperarla. Si varios miembros del grupo necesitan la quest, espera 5 minutos tras la derrota entre cada aparición.",
    ["If you lose the Well Water, touch the tombstone in King Ranperre's Tomb to receive a Tomb Waterskin, then trade it to the water well in Southern San d'Oria (F-6) to get a new Well Water."] = "Si pierdes el Well Water, toca la tombstone de King Ranperre's Tomb para recibir un Tomb Waterskin y entrégalo al water well de Southern San d'Oria (F-6) para obtener un Well Water nuevo.",
    ["If you lose, get a new Tuft of golden fur from the Large Animal Track at the (J-8)/(K-8) border near the Yorcia Weald exit."] = "Si pierdes, consigue un nuevo Tuft of golden fur del Large Animal Track en el límite entre (J-8) y (K-8), cerca de la salida a Yorcia Weald.",
    ["If you lose, re-enter Ra'Kaznar Inner Court for another Awakened crystallized psyche. Winning ends with you in Ceizak Battlegrounds."] = "Si pierdes, vuelve a entrar en Ra'Kaznar Inner Court para obtener otro Awakened crystallized psyche. Al ganar acabas en Ceizak Battlegrounds.",
    ["If you lose, speak with Masad twice to try again."] = "Si pierdes, habla con Masad dos veces para intentarlo de nuevo.",
    ["If you lose, wait until the next game day and re-enter Rala Waterways; your Blank ash runic board turns back into an Ash runic board."] = "Si pierdes, espera al siguiente día de juego y vuelve a entrar en Rala Waterways; tu Blank ash runic board vuelve a ser una Ash runic board.",
    ["If you lose, you need another Punch Bug."] = "Si pierdes, necesitas otro Punch Bug.",
    ["If you need the recipe, speak with Kuroido-Moido (E-7) in Port Windurst, or with Faulpie in Southern San d'Oria or Abd-al-Raziq in Bastok Mines."] = "Si necesitas la receta, habla con Kuroido-Moido (E-7) en Port Windurst, con Faulpie en Southern San d'Oria o con Abd-al-Raziq en Bastok Mines.",
    ["If you need to re-apply the scent for The Opo-opo and I, you can check the three Rafflesia flowers in Yuhtunga Jungle once per game day until you get the scent back."] = "Si necesitas volver a ponerte el olor para The Opo-opo and I, puedes revisar las tres flores Rafflesia de Yuhtunga Jungle una vez por día de juego hasta recuperarlo.",
    ["If you picked a job with spells, combat is different... but only because you can also cast your single starting spell, until you run out of MP and have to sit down for half a minute to regenerate it."] = "Si elegiste un job con hechizos, el combate es distinto... pero solo porque también puedes lanzar tu único hechizo inicial, hasta quedarte sin MP y tener que sentarte medio minuto a recuperarlo.",
    ["If you postponed the story, examine Tales' Beginning (G-9) in Lower Jeuno to start it."] = "Si pospusiste la historia, examina Tales' Beginning (G-9) en Lower Jeuno para empezarla.",
    ["If you read the note: proceed to Zeruhn Mines and locate Zelman at (I-8), then go to the Bat's Lair Inn at (H-5) in Bastok Mines and buy a Meat Jerky from Griselda."] = "Si lees la nota: ve a Zeruhn Mines y localiza a Zelman en (I-8), luego ve al Bat's Lair Inn en (H-5) de Bastok Mines y compra un Meat Jerky a Griselda.",
    ["If you say yes, he asks you to get the floor plans back from the Orcs: Orcish Serjeants in Fort Ghelsba, Davoi and Yughott Grotto can drop the Castle Floor Plans. You can flag the next quest by fame alone, but this one is only marked complete once you turn in the plans."] = "Si dices que sí, te pide recuperar los planos de manos de los Orcs: los Orcish Serjeants de Fort Ghelsba, Davoi y Yughott Grotto pueden soltar los Castle Floor Plans. Puedes activar la siguiente quest solo con fama, pero esta solo se marca como completada al entregar los planos.",
    ["If you spoke to Apururu in that cutscene instead, return to the Manustery in Windurst Woods (Home Point #3)."] = "Si en esa escena hablaste en cambio con Apururu, vuelve a la Manustery de Windurst Woods (Home Point #3).",
    ["If you spoke to Joker during the previous cutscene, return to the House of the Hero for your reward."] = "Si hablaste con Joker durante la escena anterior, vuelve a la House of the Hero por tu recompensa.",
    ["If you still need the Yagudo Torch, speak with Paya-Sabya at (I-8) in Upper Jeuno, then speak with Muckvix at (H-9) in Lower Jeuno."] = "Si aún necesitas la Yagudo Torch, habla con Paya-Sabya en (I-8) en Upper Jeuno, luego habla con Muckvix en (H-9) en Lower Jeuno.",
    ["If you trade her the wrong flower, such as one meant for the other two Mog House exit quests, she keeps it and you will have to get another."] = "Si le entregas la flor equivocada, como una destinada a las otras dos quests de salida del Mog House, se la queda y tendrás que conseguir otra.",
    ["If you trade her the wrong flower, such as one meant for the other two Mog House exit quests, she takes it and you will have to get another."] = "Si le entregas la flor equivocada, como una destinada a las otras dos quests de salida del Mog House, se la queda y tendrás que conseguir otra.",
    ["If you want the classic 2005 FFXI experience, walk instead! Buy some Silent Oil and Prism Powder from the Curio Vendor Moogle in your hometown. You can use these to cast self-targeted Sneak and Invisible. We had those in 2005, and they were always recommended for stuff like this, so it's not cheating."] = "Si quieres la experiencia clásica de FFXI de 2005, ¡ve caminando! Compra Silent Oil y Prism Powder al Curio Vendor Moogle de tu ciudad. Con ellos puedes lanzarte Sneak e Invisible a ti mismo. En 2005 ya los teníamos y siempre se recomendaban para cosas así, así que no es trampa.",
    ["If you want to use a modern convenience, talking to the Unity Concord NPC in your home city and selecting \"bring me to a Wanted Encounter area\", Level 125 > Batallia Downs will plant you right next to a wall with a gate in it. Go through the gate and walk directly into the city of Jeuno!"] = "Si quieres usar una comodidad moderna, habla con el NPC de Unity Concord de tu ciudad y elige \"bring me to a Wanted Encounter area\", Level 125 > Batallia Downs, que te deja justo al lado de una muralla con una puerta. ¡Cruza la puerta y entra directamente en la ciudad de Jeuno!",
    ["If you warp out or die before unlocking another Maw, Survival Guide or Home Point in the past, you must go back through the Maw of the zone you landed in. A Maw does nothing in the present until you have activated it from the past."] = "Si te teletransportas fuera o mueres antes de desbloquear otro Maw, Survival Guide o Home Point en el pasado, tendrás que volver por el Maw de la zona donde llegaste. Un Maw no hace nada en el presente hasta que lo has activado desde el pasado.",
    ["If you'd rather unlock this later, then trading him your Testimony item after completing your level 75 limit break quest (Shattering Stars) is also an option."] = "Si prefieres desbloquearlo más adelante, también puedes entregarle tu objeto Testimony tras completar la quest de limit break de nivel 75 (Shattering Stars).",
    ["If you're going to Mhaura, you need three alt=Mandragora Dewdrops, dropped from Pygmaioi in Tahrongi. (By \"going to\", I mean \"setting foot in first\". That locks you into needing this item, rather than the other one.)"] = "Si vas a Mhaura, necesitas tres alt=Mandragora Dewdrops, que sueltan los Pygmaioi de Tahrongi. (Con \"ir a\" me refiero a \"pisar primero\". Eso te obliga a necesitar este objeto y no el otro.)",
    ["If you're going to Selbina, you need three Bee Pollen, dropped from Huge Wasps in either Konschtat (near the Crag, the better spot to farm these) or La Theine (in many of the valleys, though they mostly require going through Ordelle's Caves to get down there)."] = "Si vas a Selbina, necesitas tres Bee Pollen, que sueltan los Huge Wasps de Konschtat (cerca del Crag, el mejor sitio para farmearlos) o de La Theine (en muchos de los valles, aunque casi todos requieren pasar por Ordelle's Caves para bajar).",
    ["If you're interested in going on a bit of a world tour to explore and gather fast travel options, this section is for you. Otherwise, feel free to skip ahead. In general for these trips, you want to be mounted in every zone you can be to avoid aggro. If you can't be mounted, break out the Silent Oil and Prism Powder."] = "Si te interesa hacer una pequeña vuelta al mundo para explorar y conseguir opciones de viaje rápido, esta sección es para ti. Si no, sáltala sin problema. En general, en estos viajes conviene ir en montura en todas las zonas en las que se pueda para evitar que te ataquen. Si no puedes ir montado, saca el Silent Oil y el Prism Powder.",
    ["If you're not level 18 yet, head back outside and grind until you are. Now talk to Naillina in Selbina or Numi Adaligo in Mhaura and finish their Mission to receive \"Gilgamesh's Introductory Letter\", which you then give to another NPC - either Isacio in Selbina or Vera in Mhaura by talking to them twice. Now you have your subjob! (Wide Scan also works on NPCs, in case you're having any trouble finding them.)"] = "Si aún no eres nivel 18, vuelve fuera y sube hasta serlo. Luego habla con Naillina en Selbina o con Numi Adaligo en Mhaura y termina su Mission para recibir la \"Gilgamesh's Introductory Letter\", que luego das a otro NPC, Isacio en Selbina o Vera en Mhaura, hablando con él dos veces. ¡Ya tienes subjob! (Wide Scan también funciona con NPCs, por si te cuesta encontrarlos.)",
    ["If you're struggling for space, most of the fish and plants and such can just be sold to the moogle in the garden."] = "Si te falta espacio, la mayoría de los peces, plantas y demás se pueden vender al moogle del jardín.",
    ["If you're told an event in Champion of the Dawn blocks you, enter from Xarcabard [S] to get that quest's cutscene first. Collecting its three Breath of dawn may be enough; otherwise finish it and A Forbidden Reunion."] = "Si se te dice que un evento de Champion of the Dawn te bloquea, entra desde Xarcabard [S] para ver antes la escena de esa quest. Puede bastar con reunir sus tres Breath of dawn; si no, termínala junto con A Forbidden Reunion.",
    ["If you're walking, teleport back to a Survival Guide you touched earlier and continue onwards via one of these routes:"] = "Si vas a pie, teletranspórtate a una Survival Guide que hayas tocado antes y sigue por una de estas rutas:",
    ["If your Windurst fame is level 4 or higher, you are assigned Let Sleeping Dogs Lie instead, and you cannot start this quest until you complete that one."] = "Si tu fama de Windurst es nivel 4 o superior, te asignan Let Sleeping Dogs Lie en su lugar, y no puedes empezar esta quest hasta completar aquella.",
    ["If your inventory was full earlier, get Cipher: Iroha from the Mystic Retriever in Reisenjima first, or the cutscene won't play."] = "Si antes tenías el inventario lleno, consigue primero Cipher: Iroha del Mystic Retriever de Reisenjima, o la escena no se reproducirá.",
    ["If your support job is not unlocked you get Gilgamesh's introductory letter instead of a Copper Voucher. At level 18 or higher, speak with Isacio in Selbina (G-10) or Vera in Mhaura (G-10) twice to unlock your support job."] = "Si no tienes desbloqueado el support job, recibes la carta de presentación de Gilgamesh en lugar de un Copper Voucher. A nivel 18 o superior, habla dos veces con Isacio en Selbina (G-10) o con Vera en Mhaura (G-10) para desbloquear tu support job.",
    ["Igsli in Bastok Markets (E-11)"] = "Igsli en Bastok Markets (E-11)",
    ["Ildebrann in Ifrit's Cauldron: rifts on Map 3 at (F-9), and on Map 5 at (F-9) and (I-6). The closest teleport is the Unity Warp (level 125) to Map 5."] = "Ildebrann en Ifrit's Cauldron: rifts en el mapa 3 en (F-9), y en el mapa 5 en (F-9) e (I-6). El teletransporte más cercano es el Unity Warp (nivel 125) al mapa 5.",
    ["Important Note on Experience Gain"] = "Nota importante sobre la experiencia",
    ["In Alzadaal Undersea Ruins, kill Qiqirns until Panaiveriyamman (WAR Acrolith, about 150,000 HP) appears; summon Trusts first. It resists magic (especially Dark) but is weak to Water. Everyone in the party gets the Man-made solution."] = "En Alzadaal Undersea Ruins, mata Qiqirns hasta que aparezca Panaiveriyamman (Acrolith WAR, unos 150,000 HP); invoca antes a los Trusts. Resiste la magia (sobre todo Dark) pero es débil a Water. Todos los del grupo reciben la Man-made solution.",
    ["In Arrapago Reef you arrive at (I-11). With Sneak and Invisible (Silent Oil and Prism Powder, or a Dancer subjob), go to the Iron Gate at (J-10) and trade it the Lamian Fang Key."] = "En Arrapago Reef llegas a (I-11). Con Sneak e Invisible (Silent Oil y Prism Powder, o Dancer como support job), ve a la Iron Gate de (J-10) y entrégale la Lamian Fang Key.",
    ["In Bastok Markets: Horatius (I-9), Arawn (J-10), Harmodios (K-10), Pavel (E-11) and Ken (E-10)."] = "En Bastok Markets: Horatius (I-9), Arawn (J-10), Harmodios (K-10), Pavel (E-11) y Ken (E-10).",
    ["In Beadeaux, go down at (H-7) into the tunnels and out at (F-8). The Afflictors curse anyone nearby (Cursna or Holy Water) unless you're silenced: touch The Mute in the north of (G-7) first (Echo Drops or Silena remove the silence)."] = "En Beadeaux, baja en (H-7) a los túneles y sal por (F-8). Los Afflictors maldicen a cualquiera que esté cerca (Cursna o Holy Water) salvo que estés silenciado: toca antes a The Mute en el norte de (G-7) (Echo Drops o Silena quitan el silencio).",
    ["In Bibiki Bay - Purgonorgo Isle, fish up a Lancet Jagil (Minnows seem to work as bait) and defeat it until one drops a Cleanly Snapped Rod."] = "En Bibiki Bay - Purgonorgo Isle, pesca un Lancet Jagil (los Minnows parecen servir como cebo) y derrótalo hasta que uno suelte una Cleanly Snapped Rod.",
    ["In Buburimu Peninsula, go to the beach just west of Mhaura via the ramp at (H-9), head to its south-west corner and into the water; a tunnel leads to the next beach. Examine the Song Runes there at (G-9) for a cutscene."] = "En Buburimu Peninsula, ve a la playa justo al oeste de Mhaura por la rampa de (H-9), dirígete a su esquina suroeste y entra en el agua; un túnel lleva a la playa siguiente. Examina allí las Song Runes en (G-9) para una escena.",
    ["In Castle Oztroja, go through the Brass Door at (I-8) on Map 1 (watch out for the trapdoor lever), take exit (F) at (G-7) on Map 2, then (I) to Map 7, and fish in the pond in the middle of the big square room at (H-8)/(H-9). Fishing skill is not needed; a Clothespole or a Composite Fishing Rod works well."] = "En Castle Oztroja, cruza la Brass Door de (I-8) en el mapa 1 (cuidado con la palanca de la trampilla), toma la salida (F) en (G-7) del mapa 2, luego la (I) al mapa 7, y pesca en el estanque del centro de la gran sala cuadrada de (H-8)/(H-9). No hace falta skill de pesca; una Clothespole o una Composite Fishing Rod funcionan bien.",
    ["In Castle Zvahl Baileys, examine the ??? at (I-8), behind the gate where Dark Spark spawns, to spawn Marquis Andrealphus with 2 Demon Bannerets and 2 Demon Secretaries (sleepable). Nearby demons link. Only the Marquis must die; the extras then die too. He can Escape whoever has hate back to Xarcabard, unless only one party member is left in the zone or you're solo."] = "En Castle Zvahl Baileys, examina la ??? de (I-8), detrás de la puerta donde aparece Dark Spark, para hacer aparecer a Marquis Andrealphus con 2 Demon Bannerets y 2 Demon Secretaries (se pueden dormir). Los demonios cercanos se enlazan. Solo hay que matar al Marquis; los demás mueren entonces también. Puede usar Escape para mandar a Xarcabard a quien tenga el odio, salvo que solo quede un miembro del grupo en la zona o vayas solo.",
    ["In Castle Zvahl Keep (S), locate Rikke at (G-7) northwest, Rakke at (G-10) southwest, and Rokke at (H-10) southeast."] = "En Castle Zvahl Keep (S), localiza a Rikke en (G-7) al noroeste, a Rakke en (G-10) al suroeste y a Rokke en (H-10) al sureste.",
    ["In Ceizak Battlegrounds, examine the Signs of Struggle at the (I-7)/(J-8) intersection, southwest of the Frontier Station. Follow the wall from the station into the narrow path just before the Bight Uragnite; it is by a tree near some Twigtrip Lapinions."] = "En Ceizak Battlegrounds, examina las Signs of Struggle en el cruce de (I-7)/(J-8), al suroeste de la Frontier Station. Sigue la pared desde la estación hasta el camino estrecho justo antes del Bight Uragnite; están junto a un árbol cerca de unos Twigtrip Lapinions.",
    ["In Cirdas Caverns (M-8/9), examine the Overgrown Grave on the ground, to the right of the Ergon Locus, for a cutscene. The Augural Conveyor to Cirdas Caverns is quickest, otherwise the Yorcia Weald Frontier Station; a Colonization Reive at (M-8) may block the way."] = "En Cirdas Caverns (M-8/9), examina la Overgrown Grave del suelo, a la derecha del Ergon Locus, para una escena. El Augural Conveyor a Cirdas Caverns es lo más rápido; si no, la Frontier Station de Yorcia Weald; una Colonization Reive en (M-8) puede bloquear el paso.",
    ["In Crawlers' Nest, trade the right berry to the baskets in the circular rooms. Each trade has a chance to spawn an NM crawler at one of the room's exits; it walks to the basket and then attacks you, and always drops the upgraded berry. Bring several stacks for the higher tiers."] = "En Crawlers' Nest, entrega la baya correcta a las cestas de las salas circulares. Cada entrega tiene una probabilidad de hacer aparecer un NM crawler en una de las salidas de la sala; camina hasta la cesta y luego te ataca, y siempre suelta la baya mejorada. Lleva varios montones para los niveles más altos.",
    ["In Dangruf Wadi, beat three more Goblins at dice, in order. Trade each one their favorite item before every roll; it is used up win or lose, and losing makes the next game easier."] = "En Dangruf Wadi, gana a los dados a tres Goblins más, en orden. Entrega a cada uno su objeto favorito antes de cada tirada; se gasta ganes o pierdas, y perder hace más fácil la siguiente partida.",
    ["In Dangruf Wadi, the ??? is at the (I-5)/(J-5) boundary during sunny weather (the default, with no weather icon). Choose the option to check the area to receive the Dangruf Stone."] = "En Dangruf Wadi, la ??? está en el límite entre (I-5) y (J-5) con clima soleado (el normal, sin icono de clima). Elige la opción de registrar la zona para recibir la Dangruf Stone.",
    ["In Davoi, examine the Village Well at (G-9) to spawn Three-eyed Prozpuz (RNG) and One-eyed Gwajboj (PLD). Gwajboj drops the Well Weight; only one drops per fight, so each extra Paladin waits 3 minutes for another fight."] = "En Davoi, examina el Village Well de (G-9) para hacer aparecer a Three-eyed Prozpuz (RNG) y One-eyed Gwajboj (PLD). Gwajboj suelta el Well Weight; solo cae uno por pelea, así que cada Paladin adicional espera 3 minutos para otra pelea.",
    ["In Davoi, find the Hide Flap on one of the huts around (F-7)/(G-7) and examine it to spawn Deloknok (PLD) and Bilopdop (MNK)."] = "En Davoi, busca la Hide Flap en una de las chozas de (F-7)/(G-7) y examínala para hacer aparecer a Deloknok (PLD) y Bilopdop (MNK).",
    ["In Davoi, trade the Treasury Gold to the ??? at (J-11) to spawn Hematic Cyst. Defeat it and examine the ??? again for a cutscene."] = "En Davoi, entrega el Treasury Gold a la ??? en (J-11) para hacer aparecer a Hematic Cyst. Derrótalo y examina de nuevo la ??? para una escena.",
    ["In East Ronfaure (S), examine three ??? in any order: the Charred Propeller in a dirt hole in the south-east corner of (H-8), the Oxidized Plate at the (I-8) waterfall where the river splits, and the Piece of Shattered Lumber in a bush by a tree in the north-west corner of (J-7)."] = "En East Ronfaure (S), examina tres ??? en cualquier orden: el Charred Propeller en un hoyo de tierra en la esquina sureste de (H-8), la Oxidized Plate en la cascada de (I-8) donde se divide el río, y la Piece of Shattered Lumber en un arbusto junto a un árbol en la esquina noroeste de (J-7).",
    ["In Escha - Ru'Aun, get an Eschan Droplet from the ??? on the left by Dremi at the entrance, then use the Eschan Portal. At each new island, find its ??? for another droplet and take the next portal, up to Portal #15."] = "En Escha - Ru'Aun, consigue un Eschan Droplet de la ??? de la izquierda junto a Dremi en la entrada y luego usa el Eschan Portal. En cada isla nueva, busca su ??? para otra gota y toma el portal siguiente, hasta el Portal #15.",
    ["In Fei'Yin (Home Point #2 is fastest), go to the basement (map 2) at (F-6) and examine the north-western Cermet Door for a cutscene with Rukususu. If you kill too many monsters while carrying the spell, it breaks into Shantotto's ex-spell; get another from Torino-Samarino."] = "En Fei'Yin (el Home Point #2 es lo más rápido), ve al sótano (mapa 2) en (F-6) y examina la Cermet Door del noroeste para una escena con Rukususu. Si matas demasiados monstruos llevando el hechizo, se rompe y se convierte en Shantotto's ex-spell; consigue otro de Torino-Samarino.",
    ["In Fei'Yin, defeat Shadows until one drops Treasury Gold (one per party is enough)."] = "En Fei'Yin, derrota Shadows hasta que uno suelte Treasury Gold (con uno por grupo basta).",
    ["In Foret de Hennetiel, go to the secret beach at (J-11), south of Bivouac #2, and examine the Bloodstained Glove on the shoreline for a cutscene."] = "En Foret de Hennetiel, ve a la playa secreta de (J-11), al sur del Bivouac #2, y examina el Bloodstained Glove de la orilla para una escena.",
    ["In Grauberg (S), enter the cave opposite the waterfall on the (E-10)/(F-10) line and examine the shimmering light on the ground. The entrance is on dry land; if you reach the waterfall you've gone too far and have to go back around. The Campaign Arbiter warp from a Shadowreign city lands closest."] = "En Grauberg (S), entra en la cueva frente a la cascada en la línea entre (E-10) y (F-10) y examina la luz brillante del suelo. La entrada está en tierra firme; si llegas a la cascada te has pasado y tienes que dar la vuelta. El warp del Campaign Arbiter desde una ciudad de Shadowreign te deja lo más cerca.",
    ["In Gusgen Mines, go straight ahead and down the staircase, and use the west switch to open the door to map 2. Take the ramp down at (F-5) to map 3 and trade the Pickaxe to the ??? at (G-7) to spawn the Wandering Ghost (about 3 minutes between spawns)."] = "En Gusgen Mines, sigue recto y baja la escalera, y usa el interruptor oeste para abrir la puerta al mapa 2. Baja por la rampa de (F-5) al mapa 3 y entrega el Pickaxe a la ??? en (G-7) para hacer aparecer al Wandering Ghost (unos 3 minutos entre apariciones).",
    ["In Jugner Forest (S), examine the Overgrown Mushrooms on the path at (F-10) for a cutscene (Recall-Jugner or the Survival Guide is closest). Have a free inventory slot, or you have to watch it again."] = "En Jugner Forest (S), examina los Overgrown Mushrooms del camino en (F-10) para una escena (Recall-Jugner o la Survival Guide es lo más cercano). Ten un hueco libre en el inventario, o tendrás que volver a verla.",
    ["In Jugner Forest, head for the Maiden's Spring at (E-6); a cutscene starts as you get close."] = "En Jugner Forest, dirígete al Maiden's Spring en (E-6); al acercarte empieza una escena.",
    ["In Jugner Forest, speak with Alexius at the very top of (I-6) near the lake. He saw the creature, and says Semih Lafihna was looking for it at the south end of the lake during a full moon (no full moon is needed)."] = "En Jugner Forest, habla con Alexius en lo más alto de (I-6), cerca del lago. Vio a la criatura y dice que Semih Lafihna la buscaba en el extremo sur del lago durante una luna llena (no hace falta luna llena).",
    ["In Kazham, trade 10,000 gil to Magriffon (I-7), in Celodehki's Bed & Breakfast, for the key items Letter from Magriffon and Providence pot."] = "En Kazham, entrega 10,000 gil a Magriffon (I-7), en Celodehki's Bed & Breakfast, para obtener los key items Letter from Magriffon y Providence pot.",
    ["In Korroloka Tunnel, go to (K-8) on Map 5. The quickest entrance is from Western Altepa Desert (M-8) via the Survival Guide, which puts you straight onto Map 5; the Zeruhn Mines Survival Guide is also close. Click on the ??? to spawn 3 Korroloka Leech enemies. They link with any Thread Leech enemies nearby. If the leeches do not appear after you click the ???, try relogging."] = "En Korroloka Tunnel, ve a (K-8) en el mapa 5. La entrada más rápida es desde Western Altepa Desert (M-8) con la Survival Guide, que te deja directamente en el mapa 5; la Survival Guide de Zeruhn Mines también está cerca. Pulsa la ??? para hacer aparecer 3 enemigos Korroloka Leech. Se enlazan con los enemigos Thread Leech cercanos. Si las sanguijuelas no aparecen tras pulsar la ???, prueba a reconectar.",
    ["In La Vaule [S]: enter the big room at (J-7) and go west to (I-7), north then west to (G-7), north to (G-6) and turn left. Cross the big room of level-80 Orcs to (E-6), giving a wide berth to Coinbiter Cjaknokk (true sight; the others link to it). Go north, west to (E-7), then east and south over the bridge at (F-8): the Reinforced Gateway is on your right at (F-9)."] = "En La Vaule [S]: entra en la sala grande de (J-7) y ve al oeste hasta (I-7), al norte y luego al oeste hasta (G-7), al norte hasta (G-6) y gira a la izquierda. Cruza la sala grande de Orcs de nivel 80 hasta (E-6), manteniéndote lejos de Coinbiter Cjaknokk (true sight; los demás se enlazan con él). Ve al norte, al oeste hasta (E-7), luego al este y al sur por el puente de (F-8): el Reinforced Gateway está a tu derecha en (F-9).",
    ["In Lower Jeuno, trade the garlic to Muckvix in Muckvix's Junk Shop (Goblins' Goblet, H-10) for a long cutscene, 2,000 gil and the key item Letter from Muckvix."] = "En Lower Jeuno, entrega el ajo a Muckvix en Muckvix's Junk Shop (Goblins' Goblet, H-10) para una escena larga, 2,000 gil y el key item Letter from Muckvix.",
    ["In Lufaise Meadows, examine the ??? at (G-6) during foggy weather (most often early morning) to spawn the NM Baumesel. Defeat it and examine the ??? again."] = "En Lufaise Meadows, examina la ??? en (G-6) con niebla (sobre todo a primera hora de la mañana) para hacer aparecer al NM Baumesel. Derrótalo y examina de nuevo la ???.",
    ["In Lufaise Meadows, examine the ??? at (I-8) to spawn Blackbone Frazdiz (DRK) and Rainbringer Vjatvot (BLM). Both can be slept briefly, and nearby Orcs link."] = "En Lufaise Meadows, examina la ??? en (I-8) para hacer aparecer a Blackbone Frazdiz (DRK) y Rainbringer Vjatvot (BLM). Ambos se pueden dormir un poco, y los Orcs cercanos se enlazan.",
    ["In Marjami Ravine, go to the ??? at the base of the waterfall east of Bivouac #2 (I-8), use Ignis three times, then examine it for a cutscene and the key item Vial of vivid rainbow extract. If nothing happens, go back to Gaddiux and repeat his dialogue."] = "En Marjami Ravine, ve a la ??? de la base de la cascada al este del Bivouac #2 (I-8), usa Ignis tres veces y luego examínala para una escena y el key item Vial of vivid rainbow extract. Si no pasa nada, vuelve con Gaddiux y repite su diálogo.",
    ["In Maze of Shakhrami map 2, examine the Iron Door in the room in the north-west corner of (K-9) to spawn Lost Soul (any job). Closest is the Unity Warp (level 119) to Buburimu Peninsula, or the Abyssea - Attohwa warp or Buburimu Survival Guide and the zone line at (F-6); then take exit H to map 2. From the start of map 1: exit C to map 2, F to map 1, H to map 2."] = "En el mapa 2 de Maze of Shakhrami, examina la Iron Door de la sala de la esquina noroeste de (K-9) para hacer aparecer a Lost Soul (cualquier job). Lo más cercano es el Unity Warp (nivel 119) a Buburimu Peninsula, o el warp de Abyssea - Attohwa o la Survival Guide de Buburimu y el límite de zona de (F-6); luego toma la salida H al mapa 2. Desde el inicio del mapa 1: salida C al mapa 2, F al mapa 1, H al mapa 2.",
    ["In Metalworks: Romualdo (K-9), in the southeastern Cannonry, and Elayne (G-8), at the entrance to the Temple of the Goddess. In Port Bastok: Ehrhard (G-5), in the northeast corner outside Warehouse #1, and Latifah (J-8), north of the drawbridge."] = "En Metalworks: Romualdo (K-9), en el Cannonry sureste, y Elayne (G-8), en la entrada del Temple of the Goddess. En Port Bastok: Ehrhard (G-5), en la esquina noreste fuera del Warehouse #1, y Latifah (J-8), al norte del puente levadizo.",
    ["In Mhaura, speak twice with Koh Lenbalalako (F-9) for a cutscene. She asks you for a Gold Earring."] = "En Mhaura, habla dos veces con Koh Lenbalalako (F-9) para una escena. Te pide un Gold Earring.",
    ["In Misareaux Coast, get a Misareaux Garlic from the Orcs."] = "En Misareaux Coast, consigue un Misareaux Garlic de los Orcs.",
    ["In Moh Gates (K-8), trade an Ifritite to the Molten Rift for a cutscene. The Morimar Frontier Station waypoint is quickest (or Yahse Bivouac #1); you must get past a Colonization Reive at (I-7). In a group, everyone trades their Ifritite before the NM is spawned."] = "En Moh Gates (K-8), entrega una Ifritite a la Molten Rift para una escena. El waypoint de la Frontier Station de Morimar es lo más rápido (o el Bivouac #1 de Yahse); debes pasar una Colonization Reive en (I-7). En grupo, todos entregan su Ifritite antes de hacer aparecer al NM.",
    ["In Mount Zhayolm, examine the ??? on a round steam vent at (L-8) for the key item Toggle switch. The Voidwatch warp is easiest: head north, then turn left toward the south part of the map."] = "En Mount Zhayolm, examina la ??? sobre un respiradero de vapor redondo en (L-8) para obtener el key item Toggle switch. El warp de Voidwatch es lo más fácil: ve al norte y luego gira a la izquierda hacia la parte sur del mapa.",
    ["In Nashmau, speak with Sajhra at (H-9) in the docks for another cutscene."] = "En Nashmau, habla con Sajhra en (H-9), en los muelles, para otra escena.",
    ["In Ordelle's Caves (enter from La Theine Plateau at (F-7) or use the Survival Guide): take the east path at (H-3) to the next map, then the path at (H-9) back to the first map, and drop down the hole at (H-11/12). Go east through the tunnel at (I-11), careful not to fall off the cliff, follow the stairs to the intersection at (I-6), go left (south), and take the tunnel west at (H-9), where you see Napalms, to come out in La Theine Plateau."] = "En Ordelle's Caves (entra desde La Theine Plateau por (F-7) o usa la Survival Guide): toma el camino este de (H-3) al mapa siguiente, luego el camino de (H-9) de vuelta al primer mapa y déjate caer por el agujero de (H-11/12). Ve al este por el túnel de (I-11), con cuidado de no caer por el acantilado, sigue las escaleras hasta el cruce de (I-6), ve a la izquierda (sur) y toma el túnel oeste de (H-9), donde ves Napalms, para salir a La Theine Plateau.",
    ["In Palborough Mines, trade a Pickaxe to a Mythril Seam to obtain Mine Gravel."] = "En Palborough Mines, entrega una Pickaxe a una Mythril Seam para obtener Mine Gravel.",
    ["In Port Bastok, speak with Kagetora (F-6), then trade 5 Eastern Gems to Patient Wheel (F-5). They drop from Riparian Sahagin behind the silver door in Sea Serpent Grotto."] = "En Port Bastok, habla con Kagetora (F-6) y luego entrega 5 Eastern Gems a Patient Wheel (F-5). Las sueltan los Riparian Sahagin tras la puerta de plata de Sea Serpent Grotto.",
    ["In Port Bastok: Paujean (F-6), Kaede (J-5), Tilian (F-8), Hilda (E-6) and Patient Wheel (F-5). In Metalworks: Manilam (G-7), Invincible Shield (G-8), Ayame (K-7) and Kaela (I-8)."] = "En Port Bastok: Paujean (F-6), Kaede (J-5), Tilian (F-8), Hilda (E-6) y Patient Wheel (F-5). En Metalworks: Manilam (G-7), Invincible Shield (G-8), Ayame (K-7) y Kaela (I-8).",
    ["In Port Jeuno, examine the ??? by the crates near the Auction House and the Jeuno Duty-Free Shop (H-8) for a cutscene."] = "En Port Jeuno, examina la ??? junto a las cajas cerca de la Auction House y la Jeuno Duty-Free Shop (H-8) para una escena.",
    ["In Port Windurst (E-7), speak with Ohruru at the back of the Orastery, use Ignis, then speak with her twice more for a cutscene."] = "En Port Windurst (E-7), habla con Ohruru al fondo de la Orastery, usa Ignis y luego habla con ella dos veces más para una escena.",
    ["In Port Windurst, speak with Yujuju (M-6), Choyi Totlihpa (F-6), Yaman-Hachuman (E-7), Kunchichi (E-7) and Three of Clubs (G-7)."] = "En Port Windurst, habla con Yujuju (M-6), Choyi Totlihpa (F-6), Yaman-Hachuman (E-7), Kunchichi (E-7) y Three of Clubs (G-7).",
    ["In Pso'Xja, collect a Carmine Chip, a Gray Chip and a Cyan Chip from the monsters below. The chips aren't Rare, so you can gather several sets, but the reward is."] = "En Pso'Xja, consigue un Carmine Chip, un Gray Chip y un Cyan Chip de los monstruos indicados abajo. Los chips no son Rare, así que puedes reunir varios juegos, pero la recompensa sí lo es.",
    ["In Qulun Dome, go through the door on the right (this needs the Magicite key items). Ruby Quadav, a level 71-73 True-Sound NM, guards the first room; run past if it's on the far side. In the main room, hug the south wall and examine the ??? on the west wall in the northern part of (I-7) for the Quadav crest; don't drop off the ledge. If you pull too much, zone out to the left."] = "En Qulun Dome, cruza la puerta de la derecha (requiere los key items de Magicite). Ruby Quadav, un NM con True-Sound de nivel 71-73, vigila la primera sala; pasa corriendo si está en el lado opuesto. En la sala principal, pégate a la pared sur y examina la ??? de la pared oeste en la parte norte de (I-7) para obtener el Quadav crest; no te caigas de la cornisa. Si atraes demasiados, sal de la zona por la izquierda.",
    ["In Rabao, speak with Leodarion at (F-7), on the west side of the lake near the windmill."] = "En Rabao, habla con Leodarion en (F-7), en el lado oeste del lago, cerca del molino.",
    ["In Rabao, speak with Leodarion at (F-8), on the west side of the lake near the windmill. He asks for an Oak Pole."] = "En Rabao, habla con Leodarion en (F-8), en el lado oeste del lago, cerca del molino. Te pide un Oak Pole.",
    ["In Rala Waterways (E-10), in the Arboretum (closest entrance is near the Western Adoulin Mog House), examine the Tomato Vantage Point for a cutscene with Jerra Ndala. Ask about the Rune saber and trade a Sowilo Claymore or an Elixir for the key item Rune saber."] = "En Rala Waterways (E-10), en el Arboretum (la entrada más cercana está junto a la Mog House de Western Adoulin), examina el Tomato Vantage Point para una escena con Jerra Ndala. Pregunta por el Rune saber y entrega una Sowilo Claymore o un Elixir para obtener el key item Rune saber.",
    ["In Rala Waterways, go to the room in the center of (M-6) and speak with Yeggah Dolashi (M-6) for a cutscene. The Eastern Adoulin (F-7) entrance is closest."] = "En Rala Waterways, ve a la sala del centro de (M-6) y habla con Yeggah Dolashi (M-6) para una escena. La entrada de Eastern Adoulin (F-7) es la más cercana.",
    ["In Rala Waterways, speak with Yeggah Dolashi (M-6) for a cutscene. The Eastern Adoulin (F-7) entrance (waypoints #1 and #4, Home Point #1) is closest."] = "En Rala Waterways, habla con Yeggah Dolashi (M-6) para una escena. La entrada de Eastern Adoulin (F-7) (waypoints #1 y #4, Home Point #1) es la más cercana.",
    ["In Reisenjima, examine ??? adjacent to the large ruins (H-5) on the hill for a cutscene. If you get a Tribulens message, you are at the wrong ??? further down the hill."] = "En Reisenjima, examina la ??? junto a las grandes ruinas (H-5) de la colina para una escena. Si recibes un mensaje de Tribulens, estás en la ??? equivocada, más abajo en la colina.",
    ["In Riverne - Site #A01 the ??? is on the island at (E-8) that holds the zone to Monarch Linn. Two Giant Scales are required, and the Home Point warp places you at (I-9)."] = "En Riverne - Site #A01 la ??? está en la isla de (E-8) que contiene la zona a Monarch Linn. Hacen falta dos Giant Scales, y el warp de Home Point te coloca en (I-9).",
    ["In Riverne - Site #A01, go through the portals to the island at (I-11) for a cutscene, then trade the Copper Key to the Trunk there for another cutscene."] = "En Riverne - Site #A01, cruza los portales hasta la isla de (I-11) para una escena y luego entrega la Copper Key al Trunk de allí para otra escena.",
    ["In Riverne - Site #B01 the ??? is on the island at (E-7), just before the final Stable Displacement heading toward Monarch Linn. One Giant Scale, or the Home Point warp, is required."] = "En Riverne - Site #B01 la ??? está en la isla de (E-7), justo antes del último Stable Displacement hacia Monarch Linn. Hace falta una Giant Scale, o el warp de Home Point.",
    ["In Selbina, speak with Abelard (G-9). Then take the Swirling Vortex in the Valkurm Dunes cave at (I-9) to Lufaise Meadows for a cutscene as you zone in."] = "En Selbina, habla con Abelard (G-9). Luego toma el Swirling Vortex de la cueva de Valkurm Dunes en (I-9) hasta Lufaise Meadows para una escena al entrar.",
    ["In Upper Jeuno, speak with Baudin at (G-8) and trade him Coeurl Meat for the Crest of Davoi."] = "En Upper Jeuno, habla con Baudin en (G-8) y entrégale Coeurl Meat a cambio del Crest of Davoi.",
    ["In Vunkerl Inlet (S) (the Campaign warp is closer than the Survival Guide), examine the Toppled Cresset at (I-8), then the one at (F-9)/(F-8)."] = "En Vunkerl Inlet (S) (el warp de Campaign está más cerca que la Survival Guide), examina el Toppled Cresset de (I-8) y luego el de (F-9)/(F-8).",
    ["In Wajaom Woodlands, kill Aht Urhgan Attercops (spiders) until you get a Frayed Arrow. Three are at the Giwahb Watchtower, with more at (F-6) and (E-8). The Wajaom Woodlands Survival Guide is fastest; the long way is the Aht Urhgan Whitegate exit at (G-10)."] = "En Wajaom Woodlands, mata Aht Urhgan Attercops (arañas) hasta conseguir una Frayed Arrow. Hay tres en la Giwahb Watchtower y más en (F-6) y (E-8). La Survival Guide de Wajaom Woodlands es lo más rápido; el camino largo es la salida de Aht Urhgan Whitegate en (G-10).",
    ["In Wajaom Woodlands, kill Wajaom Tigers (they spawn near (E-8), (F-7) and (K-9)) until you get a Rusty Medal. The Wajaom Woodlands Survival Guide is fastest; the long way is the Aht Urhgan Whitegate exit at (G-10)."] = "En Wajaom Woodlands, mata Wajaom Tigers (aparecen cerca de (E-8), (F-7) y (K-9)) hasta conseguir una Rusty Medal. La Survival Guide de Wajaom Woodlands es lo más rápido; el camino largo es la salida de Aht Urhgan Whitegate en (G-10).",
    ["In Western Adoulin (I-4), examine the Inconspicuous Barrel in the alley near the Adoulin Waterfront waypoint. Yestin-Ovestin asks for a Rune saber and a Frost-encrusted flame gem."] = "En Western Adoulin (I-4), examina el Inconspicuous Barrel del callejón cerca del waypoint de Adoulin Waterfront. Yestin-Ovestin pide un Rune saber y una Frost-encrusted flame gem.",
    ["In Windurst Walls, speak with Yoriri (J-11), Moan-Maon (J-6), Shantotto (K-7), Chomomo (H-3) and Naih Arihmepp (F-5)."] = "En Windurst Walls, habla con Yoriri (J-11), Moan-Maon (J-6), Shantotto (K-7), Chomomo (H-3) y Naih Arihmepp (F-5).",
    ["In Windurst Waters North, enter the Timbre Timbers tavern (F-10) and speak with Yuli Yaam, then Yung Yaam, then Jatan-Paratan."] = "En Windurst Waters North, entra en la taberna Timbre Timbers (F-10) y habla con Yuli Yaam, luego con Yung Yaam y luego con Jatan-Paratan.",
    ["In Windurst Waters North, speak with Npopo (G-4), Amagusa-Chigurusa (G-9), Funpo-Shipo (F-9), Kyume-Romeh (F-10) and Lago-Charago (F-8)."] = "En Windurst Waters North, habla con Npopo (G-4), Amagusa-Chigurusa (G-9), Funpo-Shipo (F-9), Kyume-Romeh (F-10) y Lago-Charago (F-8).",
    ["In Windurst Woods, speak with Umumu (I-5), Cayu Pensharhumi (I-10), Nanaa Mihgo (J-3), Etsa Rhuyuli (J-13) and Soni-Muni (H-10)."] = "En Windurst Woods, habla con Umumu (I-5), Cayu Pensharhumi (I-10), Nanaa Mihgo (J-3), Etsa Rhuyuli (J-13) y Soni-Muni (H-10).",
    ["In Xarcabard, answer three questions about your own character at Option One (G/H-8), Option Two (G-9) and Option Three (G-8), in any order. Divide the bigger option by the smaller: about 2 means pick the bigger, about 1.5 the smaller; if one option is 0, pick 0."] = "En Xarcabard, responde tres preguntas sobre tu propio personaje en Option One (G/H-8), Option Two (G-9) y Option Three (G-8), en cualquier orden. Divide la opción mayor entre la menor: si da 2 aproximadamente, elige la mayor; si da 1.5, la menor; si una opción es 0, elige 0.",
    ["In Yahse Hunting Grounds (K-7), examine the Yahse Wildflower at the northern end of the three beaches for the key item Yahse wildflower petal."] = "En Yahse Hunting Grounds (K-7), examina la Yahse Wildflower del extremo norte de las tres playas para obtener el key item Yahse wildflower petal.",
    ["In Yuhtunga Jungle (K-7), find the ??? overlooking Gemini Falls; reach that side through the tunnel at (I-7) (no need to go through Ifrit's Cauldron). The cutscene spawns 5 Nasus, easy at level 75. Only one player at a time gets the cutscene; others wait 3 minutes after the Nasus die to spawn their own."] = "En Yuhtunga Jungle (K-7), busca la ??? que da a Gemini Falls; llega a ese lado por el túnel de (I-7) (no hace falta pasar por Ifrit's Cauldron). La escena hace aparecer 5 Nasus, fáciles a nivel 75. Solo un jugador a la vez ve la escena; los demás esperan 3 minutos tras la muerte de los Nasus para hacer aparecer los suyos.",
    ["In any order, collect the other three rings. Rukususu: in Fei'Yin (F-6) on Map 2, examine the Cermet Door of the north-western small room (Fei'Yin Home Point #2 is closest)."] = "En cualquier orden, reúne los otros tres anillos. Rukususu: en Fei'Yin (F-6), en el mapa 2, examina la Cermet Door de la sala pequeña del noroeste (el Home Point #2 de Fei'Yin es el más cercano).",
    ["In any other weather, even clear but cloudy, Enu says it has to be a starry night and you have to wait."] = "Con cualquier otro clima, incluso despejado pero nublado, Enu dice que tiene que ser una noche estrellada y tienes que esperar.",
    ["In either order: speak with Radford near the Metalworks in Bastok Markets [S] (H-6) (Survival Guide is closest), and with Velda-Galda in north Windurst Waters [S] (K-9), near the zone line to Windurst Walls."] = "En cualquier orden: habla con Radford cerca de Metalworks en Bastok Markets [S] (H-6) (la Survival Guide es la más cercana) y con Velda-Galda en el norte de Windurst Waters [S] (K-9), cerca del límite de zona con Windurst Walls.",
    ["In general, Seals drop off any mob that gives you experience once every 5 real-life minutes, and which Seal or Crest you get is determined by the mob's level:"] = "En general, los Seals los suelta cualquier monstruo que te dé experiencia una vez cada 5 minutos reales, y el Seal o Crest que recibes depende del nivel del monstruo:",
    ["In no particular order, here's all the destinations:"] = "Sin un orden concreto, estos son todos los destinos:",
    ["In order to get to the camp:"] = "Para llegar al campamento:",
    ["In some cases the quest ends here, with a cutscene and your reward. The exact trigger is unknown; it seems related to your progress in the Windurst missions or to having the key item Old ring."] = "En algunos casos la quest termina aquí, con una escena y tu recompensa. El disparador exacto se desconoce; parece relacionado con tu progreso en las misiones de Windurst o con tener el key item Old ring.",
    ["In the Altar Room (no monsters), examine the Magicite to receive Magicite: Orastone. If you only get a message that the magicite glows ominously, you are missing the Yagudo torch key item."] = "En la Altar Room (sin monstruos), examina la Magicite para recibir Magicite: Orastone. Si solo recibes un mensaje de que la magicita brilla de forma inquietante, te falta el key item Yagudo torch.",
    ["In the Chasm"] = "En la sima",
    ["In the Den of Rancor (Sneak and Invisible), go to (E-5) on map 1 and trade your Unlit Lantern to the Altar of Rancor for a Rancor Flame. Drop down the hole in the northeast corner of (F-7) to map 2 and go to (E-5)."] = "En Den of Rancor (Sneak e Invisible), ve a (E-5) en el mapa 1 y entrega tu Unlit Lantern al Altar of Rancor para obtener una Rancor Flame. Déjate caer por el agujero de la esquina noreste de (F-7) al mapa 2 y ve a (E-5).",
    ["In the Den of Rancor, hug the right wall to the Altar of Rancor at (D/E-5) and trade it the Unlit Lanterns for Rancor Flames. Take them to the other Altar of Rancor at (I/J-13) and trade them; after the fourth lantern is lit, the bomb NM Rancor Torch appears."] = "En Den of Rancor, pégate a la pared derecha hasta el Altar of Rancor de (D/E-5) y entrégale las Unlit Lanterns para obtener Rancor Flames. Llévalas al otro Altar of Rancor de (I/J-13) y entrégaselas; tras encender el cuarto farolillo aparece el NM bomba Rancor Torch.",
    ["In the Grand Palace of Hu'Xzoi, examine the entrance to The Garden of Ru'Hmet (Gate of the Gods) for a cutscene."] = "En el Grand Palace of Hu'Xzoi, examina la entrada a The Garden of Ru'Hmet (Gate of the Gods) para una escena.",
    ["In the Lion Springs Tavern in Southern San d'Oria (K-6), speak with Valderotaux at the bar and dance for him (any choice on stage gives the same result). Home Point #3 is near the tavern."] = "En la Lion Springs Tavern de Southern San d'Oria (K-6), habla con Valderotaux en la barra y baila para él (cualquier opción en el escenario da el mismo resultado). El Home Point #3 está cerca de la taberna.",
    ["In the Navukgo Execution Chamber, examine the Decorative Bronze Gate to start a battlefield fight (any job). Up to 18 people can enter, but more people cause more Immortal Flans to spawn. Trust Magic is allowed."] = "En la Navukgo Execution Chamber, examina la Decorative Bronze Gate para empezar una pelea de campo de batalla (cualquier job). Pueden entrar hasta 18 personas, pero cuantas más haya, más Immortal Flans aparecen. Se permite la Trust Magic.",
    ["In the Silver Knife, speak with Zemerine while wearing all three (or a lockstyle of exactly that set) for a cutscene."] = "En el Silver Knife, habla con Zemerine llevando las tres piezas (o un lockstyle exactamente de ese conjunto) para una escena.",
    ["In the Walk of Echoes, go east (toward Atomos in the sky) and examine the glowing white ??? for a cutscene and Cait Sith's whisker."] = "En el Walk of Echoes, ve al este (hacia Atomos en el cielo) y examina la ??? blanca brillante para una escena y el Cait Sith's whisker.",
    ["In the basement, cross the large room to the south-east and examine the Cermet Door at (K/L-9) for a cutscene. Another player using a key for you does not work here."] = "En el sótano, cruza la sala grande hacia el sureste y examina la Cermet Door de (K/L-9) para una escena. Que otro jugador use una llave por ti no sirve aquí.",
    ["In the basement, examine the Cermet Door at (L-7) for a cutscene. Another player using a key for you does not work here."] = "En el sótano, examina la Cermet Door de (L-7) para una escena. Que otro jugador use una llave por ti no sirve aquí.",
    ["In the basement, head east to the large room and examine the Cermet Door at (L-8) for a cutscene. Another player using a key for you does not work here."] = "En el sótano, ve al este hasta la sala grande y examina la Cermet Door de (L-8) para una escena. Que otro jugador use una llave por ti no sirve aquí.",
    ["In the cutscene you choose whether to return the Faded ruby. Return to the ??? in La Theine Plateau (G-6): returning it gives the title Disturber of Slumber, keeping it Interrupter of Dreams."] = "En la escena eliges si devolver el Faded ruby. Vuelve a la ??? de La Theine Plateau (G-6): devolverlo da el título Disturber of Slumber, y quedártelo, Interrupter of Dreams.",
    ["In the cutscene, answer \"Of course it won't help\". If you pick the other answer and fail to repeat the password, examine the gate again for the Note detailing seditious plans. Too many wrong passwords lock you out until you reread the History book."] = "En la escena, responde \"Of course it won't help\". Si eliges la otra respuesta y no repites la contraseña, examina de nuevo la puerta para obtener la Note detailing seditious plans. Demasiadas contraseñas incorrectas te bloquean hasta que vuelvas a leer el libro History.",
    ["In the cutscene, choose the first option (the second only adds some text). You receive the key item Underpass hatch key. If you get a short Voidwatch scene with Jeuno's leader instead, examine the gate again."] = "En la escena, elige la primera opción (la segunda solo añade algo de texto). Recibes el key item Underpass hatch key. Si en su lugar ves una escena corta de Voidwatch con el líder de Jeuno, examina de nuevo la puerta.",
    ["In the hallway, use Tab to target the oil lamps on the walls (don't take the farthest one and walk into the room beyond: it's one-way). Examine the lamp for today's element and the one today's element is strong against (Firesday: Fire and Ice) within a few seconds of each other to open the west door."] = "En el pasillo, usa Tab para seleccionar las lámparas de aceite de las paredes (no tomes la más lejana ni entres en la sala de detrás: es de un solo sentido). Examina la lámpara del elemento del día y la del elemento al que vence el del día (Firesday: Fire e Ice) con pocos segundos de diferencia para abrir la puerta oeste.",
    ["In the main area of the assault there are many Mamool Ja Trainers (blue mages) and Recruits (orange melees) that must be avoided. Refer to the map for the locations of the treasure coffers."] = "En la zona principal del assault hay muchos Mamool Ja Trainers (magos azules) y Recruits (cuerpo a cuerpo naranjas) que hay que evitar. Consulta el mapa para ver dónde están los cofres del tesoro.",
    ["In the next room, drop down the hole to a hidden area and head to (D-4) to zone into the Chamber of Oracles."] = "En la sala siguiente, déjate caer por el agujero a una zona oculta y ve a (D-4) para entrar en la Chamber of Oracles.",
    ["In the south hallway, examine the three ??? in any order: from west to east, in the first (G-10), third (H-10) and fourth (I-10) rooms. Each gives a Piece of a broken key; the fourth room has several ???, so make sure you get the key item message. Every party member needs all three pieces."] = "En el pasillo sur, examina las tres ??? en cualquier orden: de oeste a este, en la primera (G-10), tercera (H-10) y cuarta (I-10) salas. Cada una da un Piece of a broken key; la cuarta sala tiene varias ???, así que asegúrate de ver el mensaje del key item. Cada miembro del grupo necesita las tres piezas.",
    ["In the southwest corner of Pashhow Marshlands (S), touch the Indescript Markings on the line between (E-10) and (E-11) for a cutscene and Schultz's sealed letter. Level ~80 Virulent Peistes around them aggro on sight: use Invisible, or bring a strong job."] = "En la esquina suroeste de Pashhow Marshlands (S), toca las Indescript Markings en la línea entre (E-10) y (E-11) para una escena y la Schultz's sealed letter. Los Virulent Peistes de nivel ~80 de alrededor atacan a la vista: usa Invisible o lleva un job fuerte.",
    ["Indigo (snow): Beaucedine Glacier or Xarcabard (extremely common; not Uleguerand Range). Violet (thunder): Pashhow Marshlands, The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah (very common), Konschtat Highlands, Jugner Forest, Sauromugue Champaign (not Qufim Island or Behemoth's Dominion)."] = "Índigo (nieve): Beaucedine Glacier o Xarcabard (extremadamente común; no Uleguerand Range). Violeta (tormenta): Pashhow Marshlands, The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah (muy común), Konschtat Highlands, Jugner Forest, Sauromugue Champaign (no Qufim Island ni Behemoth's Dominion).",
    ["Individual Training Page 1."] = "Individual Training Page 1.",
    ["Individual Training Page 2."] = "Individual Training Page 2.",
    ["Individual Training Page 4."] = "Individual Training Page 4.",
    ["Individual Training Page 4. Records of Eminence Objective"] = "Individual Training Page 4. Objetivo de Records of Eminence",
    ["Individual Training Page 5."] = "Individual Training Page 5.",
    ["Individual Training Page 7."] = "Individual Training Page 7.",
    ["Individual Training Page 8."] = "Individual Training Page 8.",
    ["Individual Training Pages 1 or 2"] = "Individual Training Pages 1 o 2",
    ["Individual Training Pages 2 and 5."] = "Individual Training Pages 2 y 5.",
    ["Individual Training Pages 2, 4 and 5."] = "Individual Training Pages 2, 4 y 5.",
    ["Individual Training Pages 3, 4, or 5."] = "Individual Training Pages 3, 4 o 5.",
    ["Individual Training Pages 3."] = "Individual Training Pages 3.",
    ["Individual Training Pages 4 and 5."] = "Individual Training Pages 4 y 5.",
    ["Individual Training Pages 4, 5, 6, 7 and 8."] = "Individual Training Pages 4, 5, 6, 7 y 8.",
    ["Inside the Den, head south and turn east as the room opens up, take the north tunnel, go east at the intersection and follow it into a large room; go south through it to the ??? at (I-13)."] = "Dentro del Den, ve al sur y gira al este cuando la sala se abra, toma el túnel norte, ve al este en el cruce y síguelo hasta una sala grande; crúzala hacia el sur hasta la ??? en (I-13).",
    ["Inside the Hall of Transference, examine the Large Apparatus on your left to enter Promyvion. Your log only changes to this mission after you clear the first Promyvion."] = "Dentro del Hall of Transference, examina el Large Apparatus de tu izquierda para entrar en Promyvion. Tu registro solo pasa a esta misión tras superar el primer Promyvion.",
    ["Inside the Monastic Cavern from (J-9), stick to the west wall to avoid the True-Sight NMs and examine the ??? at (J-6), among cave-flower-like stalks before the cliff (don't fall off), for the Orcish crest."] = "Dentro del Monastic Cavern desde (J-9), pégate a la pared oeste para evitar los NMs con True-Sight y examina la ??? en (J-6), entre tallos parecidos a flores de cueva antes del acantilado (no te caigas), para obtener el Orcish crest.",
    ["Inside there are several chests, and three of them hold coins that depict the constellations. The correct coins are Odin to the north, Alexander to the northeast, Shiva to the east and Garuda to the southeast."] = "Dentro hay varios cofres, y tres de ellos contienen monedas que representan las constelaciones. Las monedas correctas son Odin al norte, Alexander al noreste, Shiva al este y Garuda al sureste.",
    ["Inside, defeat Fallen Evacuee enemies in the small rooms near the entrance until one drops a Garlaige Key."] = "Dentro, derrota a enemigos Fallen Evacuee en las salas pequeñas cerca de la entrada hasta que uno suelte una Garlaige Key.",
    ["Inside, defeat Galgalim (level 56). It has Fire Spikes and uses Poison and Paralyze; Trusts can be summoned."] = "Dentro, derrota a Galgalim (nivel 56). Tiene Fire Spikes y usa Poison y Paralyze; se pueden invocar Trusts.",
    ["Inside, examine the Gate of the Gods for a cutscene and your reward."] = "Dentro, examina la Gate of the Gods para una escena y tu recompensa.",
    ["Inside, go to the maze in the southeast part of Map 1. Its layout changes with the game day; follow the map for today to connection point B, which puts you in the southwest of Map 2."] = "Dentro, ve al laberinto de la parte sureste del mapa 1. Su trazado cambia según el día de juego; sigue el mapa de hoy hasta el punto de conexión B, que te deja en el suroeste del mapa 2.",
    ["Inside, past two Oak Doors, defeat Dirtyhanded Gochakzuk on its throne for a Curse Wand. It drops 2 per kill and respawns every 5 minutes; everyone needs one, and it won't drop if you already have one."] = "Dentro, pasadas dos Oak Doors, derrota a Dirtyhanded Gochakzuk en su trono para obtener una Curse Wand. Suelta 2 por muerte y reaparece cada 5 minutos; todos necesitan una, y no la suelta si ya tienes una.",
    ["Inside, take the north path to (J-8) on the first map, open the door there and head to the tunnel at (I-6). Go east through it, take the southern route at the fork and follow it until you zone out into Caedarva Mire."] = "Dentro, toma el camino norte hasta (J-8) en el primer mapa, abre allí la puerta y ve al túnel de (I-6). Crúzalo hacia el este, toma la ruta sur en la bifurcación y síguela hasta salir a Caedarva Mire.",
    ["Interact with Barricade (E-7) at (E-7)."] = "Interactúa con la Barricade (E-7) en (E-7).",
    ["Introduction to Combat"] = "Introducción al combate",
    ["Inventory, referred to in-game as a Gobbiebag or \"bag\""] = "Inventario, llamado en el juego Gobbiebag o \"bag\"",
    ["Ipupu accepts it and gives you the key item Note from Ipupu in return."] = "Ipupu la acepta y te da a cambio el key item Note from Ipupu.",
    ["Irmilant repairs the rod and you receive the Lu Shang's Fishing Rod and the title The Immortal Fisher, Lu Shang. You do not need to have completed The Competition or The Rivalry to have your rod fixed. You can repeat the quest."] = "Irmilant repara la caña y recibes la Lu Shang's Fishing Rod y el título The Immortal Fisher, Lu Shang. No hace falta haber completado The Competition ni The Rivalry para que te arreglen la caña. Puedes repetir la quest.",
    ["Iroha fights with you: she casts area Protect V and Shell V, then Flare, Flare II and Embrava, and raises herself whenever she falls. She also casts Arise on some players nearby (you come back weakened). Helpers who finished the mission don't need the key item."] = "Iroha lucha contigo: lanza Protect V y Shell V de área, luego Flare, Flare II y Embrava, y se resucita cada vez que cae. También lanza Arise a algunos jugadores cercanos (vuelves debilitado). Los ayudantes que ya terminaron la misión no necesitan el key item.",
    ["Ironclad link from ~10'"] = "Los Ironclad se enlazan desde ~10'",
    ["Isarukitsck in the Uleguerand Range: rifts at (G-11), (G-10) and (J-10/11)."] = "Isarukitsck en Uleguerand Range: rifts en (G-11), (G-10) y (J-10/11).",
    ["It is no longer possible to flag the original quest. Speak to a Synergy Engineer to obtain a Synergy Crucible if you did not activate this quest before March 27, 2012."] = "Ya no es posible activar la quest original. Habla con un Synergy Engineer para obtener un Synergy Crucible si no activaste esta quest antes del 27 de marzo de 2012.",
    ["It takes 6 feeding attempts to complete the quest. The first 2 attempts automatically fail and do not consume a grass."] = "Hacen falta 6 intentos de alimentación para completar la quest. Los 2 primeros intentos fallan automáticamente y no consumen hierba.",
    ["It's a bit of a hike. It can be a dangerous walk if you don't pay attention, it's but mostly just long. You have two options, one of which trivializes the trip:"] = "Es una buena caminata. Puede ser un camino peligroso si no prestas atención, pero sobre todo es largo. Tienes dos opciones, una de las cuales lo hace trivial:",
    ["Item trades: Eumielle (I-9) 12 for an Angler's Cassoulet; Coucheutand (I-8) 5/10/15 for an Orcish Axe/Orc Helm/Gold Orcmask; Hauberliond (H-9) 9-12 for 1-4 stacks of Crossbow Bolts; Sabiliont (I-11) 9-12 for 3-8 stacks of Gysahl Greens; Rongelouts N Distaud (I-9) 35 for a Gnole Claw plus three wins at his rock-paper-scissors (/point: use Nether Vellum, /think: Volcanic Rock, /poke: Scorpion Stinger)."] = "Entregas de objetos: Eumielle (I-9) 12 por un Angler's Cassoulet; Coucheutand (I-8) 5/10/15 por un Orcish Axe/Orc Helm/Gold Orcmask; Hauberliond (H-9) de 9 a 12 por 1-4 montones de Crossbow Bolts; Sabiliont (I-11) de 9 a 12 por 3-8 montones de Gysahl Greens; Rongelouts N Distaud (I-9) 35 por una Gnole Claw más tres victorias en su piedra, papel o tijera (/point: usa Nether Vellum, /think: Volcanic Rock, /poke: Scorpion Stinger).",
    ["Its regular melee attacks count as weapon skills, so keep that in mind when going for the red, blue and green staggers."] = "Sus ataques cuerpo a cuerpo normales cuentan como weapon skills, tenlo en cuenta al buscar los staggers rojo, azul y verde.",
    ["Jagils are the main target as Frogs really suck to nuke. Frogs don't link though if you take them on for some reason."] = "Los Jagils son el objetivo principal, ya que las ranas son muy malas para nukear. Aun así, las ranas no se enlazan si por algún motivo luchas contra ellas.",
    ["Jagils are the main target as Velkk can occasionally remove weapons and/or dispel Corsair's Roll/Haste. A good group can quickly burn them down regardless."] = "Los Jagils son el objetivo principal, ya que los Velkk pueden a veces quitar armas y/o disipar los Corsair's Roll/Haste. Un buen grupo puede acabar con ellos rápido igualmente.",
    ["Job"] = "Job",
    ["Join a Unity Concord"] = "Únete a un Unity Concord",
    ["Join an offensive campaign battle in a territory that the beastmen control."] = "Participa en una batalla de campaña ofensiva en un territorio que controlen las bestias.",
    ["Join the Mob to get to Aht Urhgan"] = "Únete a la mafia para llegar a Aht Urhgan",
    ["Joining a Unity"] = "Unirse a una Unity",
    ["Jugner Forest at (J-8)"] = "Jugner Forest en (J-8)",
    ["Just outside the city, you'll see a book called a Field Manual. Examining it, then picking \"Read about individual training\", then selecting \"Page 1\" (or any later page) will activate Fields of Valor objectives. Killing the listed targets gives you bonus experience and a currency called Tabs that you can spend on buffs to help you level faster, like HP regen and defense boosts."] = "Justo fuera de la ciudad verás un libro llamado Field Manual. Examinarlo, elegir \"Read about individual training\" y luego \"Page 1\" (o cualquier página posterior) activa objetivos de Fields of Valor. Matar los objetivos indicados te da experiencia extra y una moneda llamada Tabs que puedes gastar en buffs para subir más rápido, como regeneración de HP y aumentos de defensa.",
    ["Keep doing the maw quests: Joachim (H-8) has cutscenes for you after your sixth and seventh (see A Sea Dog's Summons)."] = "Sigue haciendo las quests de los maws: Joachim (H-8) tiene escenas para ti tras la sexta y la séptima (ver A Sea Dog's Summons).",
    ["Keep left to the Granite Door at (J-6), map 3, and examine Granite Door (J-6) for a cutscene."] = "Mantente a la izquierda hasta la Granite Door de (J-6), mapa 3, y examina la Granite Door (J-6) para una escena.",
    ["Keep talking to as many other NPCs as you can: too few gives no credit, and the reward grows with the number you speak to."] = "Sigue hablando con todos los demás NPCs que puedas: demasiado pocos no dan crédito, y la recompensa crece con el número de personas con las que hables.",
    ["Keep the goblin foods (they aren't used up). For the optional daily Viridian Key, give them to Squintrox Dryeyes (G-8) in Port Jeuno, but wait until after Gatherer of Light (II): he takes the foods."] = "Guarda las comidas goblin (no se gastan). Para la Viridian Key diaria opcional, dáselas a Squintrox Dryeyes (G-8) en Port Jeuno, pero espera a después de Gatherer of Light (II): se queda con las comidas.",
    ["Keep using imprimaturs: later missions need more."] = "Sigue usando imprimaturs: las misiones posteriores necesitan más.",
    ["Keep walking forward and exit into Yuhtunga Jungle. Turn North running up to F-10, take the NE exit to G-9/10, then south to the outpost at (G-11), which has another Survival Guide."] = "Sigue avanzando y sal a Yuhtunga Jungle. Gira al norte corriendo hasta F-10, toma la salida noreste hacia G-9/10 y luego al sur hasta el puesto avanzado de (G-11), que tiene otra Survival Guide.",
    ["Keep watching the cutscene from the previous mission; it takes you to Empyreal Paradox and the next mission starts when it ends."] = "Sigue viendo la escena de la misión anterior; te lleva a Empyreal Paradox y la misión siguiente empieza cuando termina.",
    ["Ken's messages show where he is on his fixed route: at 1 (\"..being watched\") and 6 (\"What was that sound\") he stops and turns round; at 3 he spins round and runs to the pond in the big room; at 4 (\"A dead end\") he turns back, so hide behind the southern rock; at 5 he takes readings at the hot spring; at 7 he runs in circles in the first room, so stay well away from its edge."] = "Los mensajes de Ken indican dónde está en su ruta fija: en 1 (\"..being watched\") y 6 (\"What was that sound\") se para y se da la vuelta; en 3 gira sobre sí mismo y corre al estanque de la sala grande; en 4 (\"A dead end\") se da la vuelta, así que escóndete tras la roca del sur; en 5 toma mediciones en la fuente termal; en 7 corre en círculos en la primera sala, así que mantente bien lejos de su borde.",
    ["Kill Aydeewa Diremite enemies until you get a Colorful Hair. You can find them around (I-9) after you take the (I-7) entrance from Bhaflau Thickets and slide down at (H-8). Circle back up to farm the item, then slide back down. The Voidwatch warp, if you have it, is a quick shortcut."] = "Mata enemigos Aydeewa Diremite hasta conseguir un Colorful Hair. Los encuentras cerca de (I-9) tras tomar la entrada (I-7) desde Bhaflau Thickets y deslizarte en (H-8). Da la vuelta hacia arriba para farmear el objeto y vuelve a deslizarte. El warp de Voidwatch, si lo tienes, es un atajo rápido.",
    ["Kill Bahamut for a cutscene."] = "Mata a Bahamut para una escena.",
    ["Kill Goblin Robber enemies to get a Sack of Fish Bait, a common drop."] = "Mata enemigos Goblin Robber para conseguir un Sack of Fish Bait, un drop común.",
    ["Kill Pugils just outside in East Sarutabaruta if there are no scales on the Auction House. (The Starfall Tear itself is sometimes on the Auction House, under Other.)"] = "Mata Pugils justo fuera, en East Sarutabaruta, si no hay escamas en la Auction House. (La propia Starfall Tear a veces está en la Auction House, en Other.)",
    ["Kill enemies in Rala Waterways until you get a Consummate simulacrum (a temporary key item; the chat message is easy to miss). Waterway Pugils and New Moon Bats seem to drop it most. Everyone on the mission in the zone gets one at once."] = "Mata enemigos en Rala Waterways hasta obtener un Consummate simulacrum (un key item temporal; el mensaje del chat es fácil de pasar por alto). Los Waterway Pugils y los New Moon Bats parecen soltarlo más. Todos los que estén en la misión en la zona reciben uno a la vez.",
    ["Kill monsters on the 7th to 10th floors of Upper Delkfutt's Tower until you get a Delkfutt Chest Key; the Gigas, Evil Spirits, Magic Urns and Light and Thunder Elementals drop it. Alternatively, you can buy one from the Curio Vendor Moogle."] = "Mata monstruos en los pisos 7 a 10 de Upper Delkfutt's Tower hasta conseguir una Delkfutt Chest Key; la sueltan los Gigas, Evil Spirits, Magic Urns y los Elementals de Light y Thunder. También puedes comprar una al Curio Vendor Moogle.",
    ["Kill the Rancor Torch, then head back to Kazham and talk to the Chieftainess for your reward, 11,000 gil."] = "Mata al Rancor Torch, vuelve a Kazham y habla con la Chieftainess para recibir tu recompensa, 11,000 gil.",
    ["Killing the Casanova makes all the other frogs disappear and ends the battle. Mikilulu cannot be killed but can be brought down to 1% HP. You only have to fight it once for it to count for the rest of your party if they are at that stage of the quest."] = "Matar al Casanova hace desaparecer a todas las demás ranas y termina la batalla. Mikilulu no se puede matar, pero se le puede bajar hasta el 1% de HP. Solo tienes que luchar una vez para que cuente para el resto de tu grupo si están en ese punto de la quest.",
    ["Kindred's Seals come from any normal monster of level 50-69 that checks as Easy Prey or higher, from Shemo at 3 other seals for 1 (2 for 1 during some campaigns), or from the Greeter Moogle for 5 login points each when that's offered. New Worlds Await needs 5 more, so you may want 9 at once. Don't confuse them with Kindred's Crests."] = "Los Kindred's Seals los sueltan monstruos normales de nivel 50-69 que se consideren Easy Prey o más, Shemo los da a 3 sellos de otro tipo por 1 (2 por 1 en algunas campañas), o el Greeter Moogle por 5 login points cada uno cuando se ofrece. New Worlds Await necesita 5 más, así que quizá quieras 9 de una vez. No los confundas con los Kindred's Crests.",
    ["King Ranperre's Tomb, just off of East Ronfaure, has a Guide at the entrance."] = "King Ranperre's Tomb, junto a East Ronfaure, tiene una Guide en la entrada.",
    ["King of Hearts (a Red Mage who focuses on buffing the player and removing status ailments from the party, along with an AoE WS.)"] = "King of Hearts (un Red Mage que se centra en potenciar al jugador y quitar estados alterados al grupo, además de un WS de área.)",
    ["Konschtat Highlands at (I-12)"] = "Konschtat Highlands en (I-12)",
    ["Koru-Moru (also a Red Mage, but buffs all party members)"] = "Koru-Moru (también Red Mage, pero potencia a todos los miembros del grupo)",
    ["Kupofried trades a functional party slot for a +20% experience buff. (This is generally not worthwhile since it's only additive.)"] = "Kupofried cambia un hueco útil del grupo por un +20% de experiencia. (En general no compensa, ya que solo se suma.)",
    ["La Theine Plateau at (E-4)"] = "La Theine Plateau en (E-4)",
    ["Labyrinth of Onzozo - levels 40-47 - warp to the Survival Guide and kill nearby Goblins and Leeches."] = "Labyrinth of Onzozo - niveles 40-47 - teletranspórtate a la Survival Guide y mata los Goblins y Leeches cercanos.",
    ["Lady Karababa fights with you, casting fast Ancient Magic II. Keep her healed: if her HP drops too low she warps out and you lose."] = "Lady Karababa lucha contigo, lanzando rápido Ancient Magic II. Mantenla curada: si su HP baja demasiado se teletransporta fuera y pierdes.",
    ["Lamian Fang Keys drop from Lamia and Drauger enemies in the area, and you can also receive one from a ??? spot in Caedarva Mire (I-7), map 1, once every game day. Use the key on the Iron Gate at (J-10), then go west on the small map to another Iron Gate, which is unlocked."] = "Las Lamian Fang Keys las sueltan los enemigos Lamia y Drauger de la zona, y también puedes recibir una de un lugar ??? en Caedarva Mire (I-7), mapa 1, una vez por día de juego. Usa la llave en la Iron Gate de (J-10), luego ve al oeste en el mapa pequeño hasta otra Iron Gate, que está abierta.",
    ["Lamian Fang Keys drop from Lamia and Drauger enemies in the area. You can also receive one from a ??? spot in Caedarva Mire (I-7), map 1 (southern part of the block); you can obtain a new key from there once every game day."] = "Las Lamian Fang Keys las sueltan los enemigos Lamia y Drauger de la zona. También puedes recibir una de un lugar ??? en Caedarva Mire (I-7), mapa 1 (parte sur del bloque); puedes obtener una llave nueva allí una vez por día de juego.",
    ["Land Worm"] = "Land Worm",
    ["Land Worm/Seeker Bats"] = "Land Worm/Seeker Bats",
    ["Leave Abyssea - Attohwa for a cutscene that finishes the quest and gives a Lunar or Ivory abyssite (which one depends on how many of the nine maw quests you have finished)."] = "Sal de Abyssea - Attohwa para una escena que termina la quest y da una abyssite Lunar o Ivory (cuál depende de cuántas de las nueve quests de los maws hayas terminado).",
    ["Leave Abyssea - Konschtat for a cutscene that finishes the quest and gives a Lunar or Ivory abyssite (which one depends on how many of the nine maw quests you have finished)."] = "Sal de Abyssea - Konschtat para una escena que termina la quest y da una abyssite Lunar o Ivory (cuál depende de cuántas de las nueve quests de los maws hayas terminado).",
    ["Leave Abyssea - La Theine for a cutscene that finishes the quest and gives a Lunar or Ivory abyssite (which one depends on how many of the nine maw quests you have finished)."] = "Sal de Abyssea - La Theine para una escena que termina la quest y da una abyssite Lunar o Ivory (cuál depende de cuántas de las nueve quests de los maws hayas terminado).",
    ["Leave Abyssea - Misareaux for a cutscene that finishes the quest and gives a Lunar or Ivory abyssite (which one depends on how many of the nine maw quests you have finished)."] = "Sal de Abyssea - Misareaux para una escena que termina la quest y da una abyssite Lunar o Ivory (cuál depende de cuántas de las nueve quests de los maws hayas terminado).",
    ["Leave Abyssea - Tahrongi for a cutscene that finishes the quest and gives a Lunar or Ivory abyssite (which one depends on how many of the nine maw quests you have finished)."] = "Sal de Abyssea - Tahrongi para una escena que termina la quest y da una abyssite Lunar o Ivory (cuál depende de cuántas de las nueve quests de los maws hayas terminado).",
    ["Leave Abyssea - Vunkerl for a cutscene that finishes the quest and gives a Lunar or Ivory abyssite (which one depends on how many of the nine maw quests you have finished)."] = "Sal de Abyssea - Vunkerl para una escena que termina la quest y da una abyssite Lunar o Ivory (cuál depende de cuántas de las nueve quests de los maws hayas terminado).",
    ["Leave Abyssea and enter North Gustaberg for a cutscene that finishes the quest and gives a Lunar or Ivory abyssite (which one depends on how many of the nine maw quests you have finished)."] = "Sal de Abyssea y entra en North Gustaberg para una escena que termina la quest y da una abyssite Lunar o Ivory (cuál depende de cuántas de las nueve quests de los maws hayas terminado).",
    ["Leave Abyssea and enter South Gustaberg for a cutscene that finishes the quest and gives a Lunar or Ivory abyssite (which one depends on how many of the nine maw quests you have finished)."] = "Sal de Abyssea y entra en South Gustaberg para una escena que termina la quest y da una abyssite Lunar o Ivory (cuál depende de cuántas de las nueve quests de los maws hayas terminado).",
    ["Leave Abyssea and enter Xarcabard for a cutscene that finishes the quest and gives a Lunar or Ivory abyssite (which one depends on how many of the nine maw quests you have finished)."] = "Sal de Abyssea y entra en Xarcabard para una escena que termina la quest y da una abyssite Lunar o Ivory (cuál depende de cuántas de las nueve quests de los maws hayas terminado).",
    ["Leave Aht Urhgan Whitegate and come back in (there is an exit to Wajaom Woodlands west of the office, under the stairs)."] = "Sal de Aht Urhgan Whitegate y vuelve a entrar (hay una salida a Wajaom Woodlands al oeste de la oficina, bajo las escaleras).",
    ["Leave Aht Urhgan Whitegate and return after the required transition."] = "Sal de Aht Urhgan Whitegate y vuelve tras la transición requerida.",
    ["Leave Bastok Markets (S) for North Gustaberg (S) at (G-4) and obtain the Clump of Animal Hair."] = "Sal de Bastok Markets (S) hacia North Gustaberg (S) en (G-4) y obtén el Clump of Animal Hair.",
    ["Leave Eastern Adoulin and come back."] = "Sal de Eastern Adoulin y vuelve a entrar.",
    ["Leave Nashmau by the east gate into Caedarva Mire. On the island in the lake just outside at (I-10), reached from the east side across the lily pads, examine the ??? in the center of the marsh (not the one on the outside) to spawn Caedarva Toad. Stay near the lake; Chigoes roam further out."] = "Sal de Nashmau por la puerta este hacia Caedarva Mire. En la isla del lago justo fuera, en (I-10), a la que se llega desde el lado este por los nenúfares, examina la ??? del centro de la ciénaga (no la de fuera) para hacer aparecer a Caedarva Toad. Quédate cerca del lago; los Chigoes deambulan más lejos.",
    ["Leave Oldton Movalpolos and enter again through the (K-6) entrance while wearing Choplix's Coif for a cutscene and a Gold Beastcoin. You earn the title Moblin Kinsman. The quest can be repeated once per Conquest tally."] = "Sal de Oldton Movalpolos y vuelve a entrar por la entrada de (K-6) llevando el Choplix's Coif para una escena y una Gold Beastcoin. Obtienes el título Moblin Kinsman. La quest se puede repetir una vez por Conquest tally.",
    ["Leave Rabao the way you came in, then head south and west and north again to (H-4) to enter Kuftal Tunnel, which has a Survival Guide at the entrance."] = "Sal de Rabao por donde entraste, luego ve al sur, al oeste y de nuevo al norte hasta (H-4) para entrar en Kuftal Tunnel, que tiene una Survival Guide en la entrada.",
    ["Leave Rosel's Armour Shop and head west into Victory Square. Head north through Victory Arch into Northern San d'Oria, then straight north towards Chateau d'Oraguille."] = "Sal de Rosel's Armour Shop y ve al oeste hasta Victory Square. Ve al norte por el Victory Arch hasta Northern San d'Oria y luego sigue recto al norte hacia Chateau d'Oraguille.",
    ["Leave Windurst Woods, then return after one Earth minute and speak with Kororo again."] = "Sal de Windurst Woods, vuelve tras un minuto terrestre y habla de nuevo con Kororo.",
    ["Leave the Monastic Cavern and enter again while wearing Gadzradd's Helm for a cutscene and a Gold Beastcoin. You earn the title Orcish Serjeant. The quest is repeatable."] = "Sal del Monastic Cavern y vuelve a entrar llevando el Gadzradd's Helm para una escena y una Gold Beastcoin. Obtienes el título Orcish Serjeant. La quest es repetible.",
    ["Leave the Qulun Dome and enter again while wearing Da'Vhu's Barbut for a cutscene and a Gold Beastcoin. You earn the title Bronze Quadav. The quest is repeatable."] = "Sal de Qulun Dome y vuelve a entrar llevando el Da'Vhu's Barbut para una escena y una Gold Beastcoin. Obtienes el título Bronze Quadav. La quest es repetible.",
    ["Leave the aqueducts and speak with Justinius at (J-6) on the top floor of Tavnazian Safehold (Home Point #3). This cutscene freezes above 30 FPS or with cutscene-skipping addons, so set the frame rate back to 30 first."] = "Sal de los acueductos y habla con Justinius en (J-6), en el último piso de Tavnazian Safehold (Home Point #3). Esta escena se congela por encima de 30 FPS o con addons que saltan escenas, así que vuelve antes a 30 FPS.",
    ["Leave the area and return to Louxiard (G-7)."] = "Sal de la zona y vuelve con Louxiard (G-7).",
    ["Leave the area and return to Salaheem's Sentinels after the required transition."] = "Sal de la zona y vuelve con los Salaheem's Sentinels tras la transición requerida.",
    ["Leave the area and return, then speak with Rholont (E-7) again."] = "Sal de la zona y vuelve, luego habla de nuevo con Rholont (E-7).",
    ["Leave the area and speak with Rholont (E-7) again."] = "Sal de la zona y habla de nuevo con Rholont (E-7).",
    ["Leave the tower into East Sarutabaruta for a cutscene."] = "Sal de la torre a East Sarutabaruta para una escena.",
    ["Leave your party (or have no members in the zone), then examine the Test of Talents again for a solo battle against the Shadow Lord. No Trusts; buffs you zone in with carry over."] = "Sal de tu grupo (o que no haya miembros en la zona) y examina de nuevo el Test of Talents para una batalla en solitario contra el Shadow Lord. Sin Trusts; los buffs con los que entras se mantienen.",
    ["Leave your party, then examine the Aspirant's Grounds (K-7) again for a 10-minute solo battle (no Trusts). The mobs hit for 1; the goal is for you and Nii Aquu to each defeat half of them, so soften them with AoE and let her finish some. Her comments tell you if the ratio is right."] = "Sal de tu grupo y examina de nuevo los Aspirant's Grounds (K-7) para una batalla en solitario de 10 minutos (sin Trusts). Los monstruos golpean por 1; el objetivo es que tú y Nii Aquu derrotéis la mitad cada una, así que debilítalos con ataques de área y deja que ella remate algunos. Sus comentarios te indican si la proporción es correcta.",
    ["Leaving Home"] = "Salir de casa",
    ["Leepe-Hoppe needs 3 items, all of which must be farmed in Chains of Promathia areas."] = "Leepe-Hoppe necesita 3 objetos, todos ellos se deben farmear en zonas de Chains of Promathia.",
    ["Lesser Colibri"] = "Lesser Colibri",
    ["Level Up"] = "Sube de nivel",
    ["Level ranges:"] = "Rangos de nivel:",
    ["Leveling for 56-60:"] = "Subir del 56 al 60:",
    ["Levels 1-5: Getting Started"] = "Niveles 1-5: Primeros pasos",
    ["Levels 10-18: Making Progress"] = "Niveles 10-18: Avanzar",
    ["Levels 19-30: To Jeuno, Other Jobs, and Starting Abyssea"] = "Niveles 19-30: A Jeuno, otros jobs y el inicio de Abyssea",
    ["Levels 30-50: Home Points, Survival Guides, Missions, and So On"] = "Niveles 30-50: Home Points, Survival Guides, Missions y demás",
    ["Levels 5-10: Building Trust"] = "Niveles 5-10: Construir la confianza",
    ["Levels 50-55: Breaking Limits and Doing Deeds"] = "Niveles 50-55: Romper límites y hacer hazañas",
    ["Levels 55-60: Beating the Game"] = "Niveles 55-60: Terminar el juego",
    ["Levels 60-65: Getting into the Grind"] = "Niveles 60-65: Metidos en faena",
    ["Light all four lanterns outside the Sacrificial Chamber gate by trading each a Rancor Flame. You can only carry one at a time, so a solo player makes four trips; two players two trips, four players one."] = "Enciende los cuatro farolillos de fuera de la puerta de la Sacrificial Chamber entregando a cada uno una Rancor Flame. Solo puedes llevar una cada vez, así que un jugador solo hace cuatro viajes; dos jugadores, dos viajes; cuatro jugadores, uno.",
    ["Lilisette fights with you and can be healed and buffed by anyone; if she dies, you lose. Solo with Trusts, staying out of range can avoid Level ? Holy."] = "Lilisette lucha contigo y cualquiera puede curarla y potenciarla; si muere, pierdes. En solitario con Trusts, quedarte fuera de alcance puede evitar Level ? Holy.",
    ["Lilisette joins after about three minutes; if she falls, you lose."] = "Lilisette se une tras unos tres minutos; si cae, pierdes.",
    ["Limit Break 1"] = "Limit Break 1",
    ["Limit Break 3, Whence Blows the Wind, requires you to go to... Davoi, Beadeaux, and Castle Oztroja."] = "El Limit Break 3, Whence Blows the Wind, requiere ir a... Davoi, Beadeaux y Castle Oztroja.",
    ["Linkshells are the colored pearl icons you see next to other players' names. A linkshell, or LS, is FFXI's equivalent to a guild or free company, but is essentially only a dedicated chat channel. Finding a linkshell is typically how you should go about meeting other players in game. You can equip up to two linkpearl items at once for two chat channels."] = "Las linkshells son los iconos de perlas de colores que ves junto al nombre de otros jugadores. Una linkshell, o LS, es el equivalente en FFXI a un gremio o una free company, pero en el fondo es solo un canal de chat dedicado. Buscar una linkshell es normalmente la forma de conocer a otros jugadores en el juego. Puedes equipar hasta dos linkpearls a la vez para dos canales de chat.",
    ["Listen to his instructions and travel to Monastic Cavern via Davoi (H-11)."] = "Escucha sus instrucciones y viaja a Monastic Cavern por Davoi (H-11).",
    ["Lizards have wide Sound linking range."] = "Los Lizards tienen un amplio alcance de enlace por sonido.",
    ["Loadstone - Lets a solo player open the weighted doors in Quicksand Caves, even if they're not a Galka."] = "Loadstone: permite a un jugador solo abrir las puertas de peso de Quicksand Caves, aunque no sea Galka.",
    ["Locate Hilda at (E-6) and speak with her. You can interact with her through the floor if you stand under her, near the bar, while she is upstairs."] = "Localiza a Hilda en (E-6) y habla con ella. Puedes interactuar con ella a través del suelo si te pones debajo de ella, cerca de la barra, mientras está arriba.",
    ["Locate and defeat Orcish Turret at approximately (H-10) on Map 15 within 30 minutes."] = "Localiza y derrota a Orcish Turret aproximadamente en (H-10) del Map 15 en 30 minutos.",
    ["Lode Golem at Ro'Maeve (E-9)/(E-10): blue fragment. Only Ice, Water, Earth or Dark magic hurts it (Quick Draw works)."] = "Lode Golem en Ro'Maeve (E-9)/(E-10): fragmento azul. Solo le hace daño la magia de Ice, Water, Earth o Dark (Quick Draw funciona).",
    ["Log > Window 1/2"] = "Log > Window 1/2",
    ["Log a Piece of rugged tree bark in East Ronfaure, Jugner Forest, Ghelsba Outpost or Yuhtunga Jungle."] = "Tala un Piece of rugged tree bark en East Ronfaure, Jugner Forest, Ghelsba Outpost o Yuhtunga Jungle.",
    ["Long way, with Silent Oil: from The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah (J-12) enter the Tree, follow the path to the large room around (I-8), go north-west to (G-7) and drop off the ledge, continue north-west to the tunnel at (C-4), follow it south to the tunnel at (A-6), and cross the waterfall area (Korrigan, Elder Goobbue) south to the (G-10) tunnel; the ??? is just inside."] = "Camino largo, con Silent Oil: desde The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah (J-12) entra en el Tree, sigue el camino hasta la sala grande de (I-8), ve al noroeste hasta (G-7) y déjate caer de la cornisa, sigue al noroeste hasta el túnel de (C-4), síguelo al sur hasta el túnel de (A-6) y cruza la zona de la cascada (Korrigan, Elder Goobbue) hacia el sur hasta el túnel de (G-10); la ??? está justo dentro.",
    ["Long way: climb all 10 floors from the Qufim Island entrance (about 15 minutes). Bats and Dancing Weapons detect sound, Goblins and Giants sight, Pots and Dolls magic; below level 50 bring Sneak and Invisible. The Delkfutt Key drops from Porphyrion at the top."] = "Camino largo: sube los 10 pisos desde la entrada de Qufim Island (unos 15 minutos). Los murciélagos y las Dancing Weapons detectan por sonido, los Goblins y los Giants por vista, los Pots y los Dolls por magia; por debajo de nivel 50 lleva Sneak e Invisible. La Delkfutt Key la suelta Porphyrion arriba del todo.",
    ["Look at the other patrol members' reports (reports 1 and 2 from Mengrenaux, 3 and 4 from Chemioue), then return to Tressia and say where each was gathered: report 1 (I-8), report 2 (H-8), report 3 (G-9), report 4 (J-7)."] = "Mira los informes de los demás miembros de la patrulla (informes 1 y 2 de Mengrenaux, 3 y 4 de Chemioue) y vuelve con Tressia para decir dónde se reunió cada uno: informe 1 (I-8), informe 2 (H-8), informe 3 (G-9), informe 4 (J-7).",
    ["Look for Andelain in East Ronfaure at (J-11) and give him the peas."] = "Busca a Andelain en East Ronfaure en (J-11) y dale los guisantes.",
    ["Look for the NM Silk Caterpillar. It spawns when an airship goes by, about every 11 to 14 minutes."] = "Busca al NM Silk Caterpillar. Aparece cuando pasa una airship, más o menos cada 11 a 14 minutos.",
    ["Look for the guard Guilerme near the bridge into the Chateau. He takes the receipt but cannot read the intended recipient: tell him which prince it is for, Pieuje or Trion, and he runs into the Chateau to deliver it."] = "Busca al guardia Guilerme cerca del puente que entra al Chateau. Coge el recibo pero no puede leer el destinatario: dile para qué príncipe es, Pieuje o Trion, y corre al Chateau para entregarlo.",
    ["Lookin' Good"] = "Buena pinta",
    ["Lord of Ulbuka: in Cirdas Caverns at the exit to Yorcia Weald, with a Dwarf Pugil or Rotten Meat. First you must have caught a Remora (Woh Gates pond, J-11, Minnow), an Ancient Carp (Moh Gates pond, L-6/7, Insect Ball), a Tusoteuthis Longa (Dho Gates Map 1, F/G-12, Minnow) and a Cameroceras (Sih Gates Map 2, Minnow)."] = "Lord of Ulbuka: en Cirdas Caverns, en la salida a Yorcia Weald, con un Dwarf Pugil o Rotten Meat. Antes debes haber pescado una Remora (estanque de Woh Gates, J-11, Minnow), un Ancient Carp (estanque de Moh Gates, L-6/7, Insect Ball), un Tusoteuthis Longa (Dho Gates mapa 1, F/G-12, Minnow) y un Cameroceras (Sih Gates mapa 2, Minnow).",
    ["Lower Delkfutt's Tower: examine the Seed Fragment (H-10) on the first floor."] = "Lower Delkfutt's Tower: examina el Seed Fragment (H-10) del primer piso.",
    ["Luminicloth: Revenant, Utukku or Wekufe in Fei'Yin, or Qaitu in Abyssea - Konschtat."] = "Luminicloth: Revenant, Utukku o Wekufe de Fei'Yin, o Qaitu de Abyssea - Konschtat.",
    ["Maat asks for a Bomb Coal, an Exoray Mold and an Ancient Papyrus, in any order. Each drops from monsters, or three key-item pieces from ??? spots combine into it. If you already hold one of the finished items in any inventory, that zone's ??? says \"There is nothing out of the ordinary here.\""] = "Maat pide un Bomb Coal, un Exoray Mold y un Ancient Papyrus, en cualquier orden. Cada uno lo sueltan monstruos, o se forma combinando tres key items de puntos ???. Si ya tienes uno de los objetos terminados en cualquier inventario, la ??? de esa zona dice \"There is nothing out of the ordinary here.\"",
    ["Machairodus/Kuftal Delver"] = "Machairodus/Kuftal Delver",
    ["Macros have their own \"fun\" syntax. If you're a Black Mage and you want a macro to cast Stone on the currently targeted enemy, the macro would read:"] = "Las macros tienen su propia sintaxis \"divertida\". Si eres Black Mage y quieres una macro que lance Stone al enemigo seleccionado, la macro sería:",
    ["Macros: A User's Guide"] = "Macros: guía de uso",
    ["Madthrasher Zradbodd is an Orc BLM with lots of Fast Cast: tier IV and -ga III spells, Sleepga and Dispelga (a BLU to stun helps below i119). Afterwards examine the Underbrush again for the message sending you to Pashhow Marshlands (S); if you zone without it, you must fight him again."] = "Madthrasher Zradbodd es un Orc BLM con mucho Fast Cast: hechizos de nivel IV y -ga III, Sleepga y Dispelga (un BLU que lo aturda ayuda por debajo de i119). Después examina de nuevo el Underbrush para ver el mensaje que te envía a Pashhow Marshlands (S); si cambias de zona sin él, tendrás que volver a luchar.",
    ["Magic Urn Magic"] = "Magic Urn: magia",
    ["Magicked astrolabe - Allows a player to pass through the gates in Eldieme Necropolis solo."] = "Magicked astrolabe: permite a un jugador cruzar solo las puertas de Eldieme Necropolis.",
    ["Make sure Let Sleeping Dogs Lie and Teacher's Pet are not active, and zone first if you have just finished one of them."] = "Asegúrate de que Let Sleeping Dogs Lie y Teacher's Pet no estén activas, y cambia de zona antes si acabas de terminar una de ellas.",
    ["Make sure you are wearing a body armor piece, or the quest cannot start."] = "Asegúrate de llevar una pieza de armadura de cuerpo, o la quest no puede empezar.",
    ["Make sure you have an Ephramadian gold coin (Jazaraat's Headstone, Caedarva Mire E-10)."] = "Asegúrate de tener una Ephramadian gold coin (Jazaraat's Headstone, Caedarva Mire E-10).",
    ["Make sure you have one free inventory slot. Unequip all weapons and shield in the Main and Sub slots, then examine the ??? and you receive the message that you have obtained a Siren's Tear."] = "Asegúrate de tener un hueco libre en el inventario. Desequipa todas las armas y el escudo de los slots Main y Sub, luego examina la ??? y recibes el mensaje de que has obtenido una Siren's Tear.",
    ["Make sure you have two free slots in your active inventory. Speak with Regine in Port San d'Oria (J-8) to begin the quest, and choose the option to look for work. You receive 15 Magicmart Flyers."] = "Asegúrate de tener dos huecos libres en tu inventario activo. Habla con Regine en Port San d'Oria (J-8) para empezar la quest y elige la opción de buscar trabajo. Recibes 15 Magicmart Flyers.",
    ["Make sure you pick up a few Pickaxes before leaving, since they can break. This quest requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Asegúrate de llevar varios Pickaxes antes de irte, porque se pueden romper. Esta quest requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Make sure your main job is Dragoon, level 40 or higher, when you speak with Miaux in Northern San d'Oria (E-6). She asks you to obtain an Altepa polishing stone. After speaking to her you can change to another job to do the rest of the quest."] = "Asegúrate de que tu trabajo principal sea Dragoon, nivel 40 o superior, cuando hables con Miaux en Northern San d'Oria (E-6). Te pide que obtengas una Altepa polishing stone. Tras hablar con ella puedes cambiar a otro trabajo para hacer el resto de la quest.",
    ["Make your way through Quicksand Caves to the Cloister of Tremors. Home Point #2 is at the entrance. If it is your first visit, enter Quicksand Caves via Eastern Altepa Desert at (K-7) and walk to (C-9), taking the right two one-way drops on the way."] = "Avanza por Quicksand Caves hasta el Cloister of Tremors. El Home Point #2 está en la entrada. Si es tu primera visita, entra en Quicksand Caves por Eastern Altepa Desert en (K-7) y camina hasta (C-9), tomando por el camino las dos caídas de un solo sentido de la derecha.",
    ["Make your way through the Temple of Uggalepih and Den of Rancor to the Mahogany Door in the Sacrificial Chamber. Glowing ??? along the way give Tablets of Hexes, each a buff in the next fight."] = "Avanza por el Temple of Uggalepih y Den of Rancor hasta la Mahogany Door de la Sacrificial Chamber. Las ??? brillantes del camino dan Tablets of Hexes, cada una un buff para la siguiente pelea.",
    ["Make your way to Hut Door (G-9) at (F-10), in the large open area around (G-9)."] = "Avanza hasta la Hut Door (G-9) en (F-10), en la gran zona abierta alrededor de (G-9).",
    ["Make your way to the door at (I-10) on Map 2, which opens only after the Temple Guardian is defeated (it stays open for 15 minutes after someone kills it). The Temple of Uggalepih Geomagnetic Fount is closest, or take the Survival Guide, exit to Yhoator Jungle and come back in through entrance #3 to land on Map 2."] = "Avanza hasta la puerta de (I-10) en el mapa 2, que solo se abre tras derrotar al Temple Guardian (queda abierta 15 minutos después de que alguien lo mate). La Geomagnetic Fount del Temple of Uggalepih es lo más cercano, o toma la Survival Guide, sal a Yhoator Jungle y vuelve a entrar por la entrada #3 para llegar al mapa 2.",
    ["Making Money"] = "Ganar dinero",
    ["Malleator Maurok in the Quicksand Caves: rift on Map 3 at (G-9)/(F-9). Use the Unity Warp (level 125) in the Western Altepa Desert, then take Entrance 2 of the Quicksand Caves."] = "Malleator Maurok en Quicksand Caves: rift en el mapa 3 en (G-9)/(F-9). Usa el Unity Warp (nivel 125) de Western Altepa Desert y luego toma la Entrance 2 de Quicksand Caves.",
    ["Manage the Goblin Effluvial Grenade attacks and poison effects during the battle."] = "Gestiona los ataques de Goblin Effluvial Grenade y los efectos de veneno durante la batalla.",
    ["Managing Your Inventory"] = "Gestionar el inventario",
    ["Map 1: the first ??? is at (I-9), just south of Banishing Gate #1. Head west, take the first left, and examine the next one at (H-9)."] = "Mapa 1: la primera ??? está en (I-9), justo al sur de la Banishing Gate #1. Ve al oeste, toma el primer desvío a la izquierda y examina la siguiente en (H-9).",
    ["Map 3"] = "Mapa 3",
    ["Map 3: take the south corridor and examine the ??? at the north-east corner of (J-9), behind the ladder against the bookcase, to open the secret door. In the hidden hallway, examine the second Ornate Gate at (K-8) for a cutscene."] = "Mapa 3: toma el pasillo sur y examina la ??? de la esquina noreste de (J-9), detrás de la escalera apoyada en la librería, para abrir la puerta secreta. En el pasillo oculto, examina la segunda Ornate Gate de (K-8) para una escena.",
    ["Marchelute drops a Tavnazia Pass."] = "Marchelute suelta un Tavnazia Pass.",
    ["Match the male Lebros Apkallu up to the female Lebros Apkallu. You only need to match up one pair to win, but you receive reduced points for every pair fewer than 8."] = "Empareja al Lebros Apkallu macho con la Lebros Apkallu hembra. Solo necesitas emparejar una pareja para ganar, pero recibes menos puntos por cada pareja que falte hasta 8.",
    ["Matsya: at the East Bridges in Vunkerl Inlet (S), with a Dwarf Pugil."] = "Matsya: en los East Bridges de Vunkerl Inlet (S), con un Dwarf Pugil.",
    ["Meet Joachim"] = "Conoce a Joachim",
    ["Melees should be upper end of level range. Cockatrices and Wyverns still VT-IT at 75. Stona recommended when fighting cockatrice. Paralyna and Silena recommended when fighting wyverns."] = "Los cuerpo a cuerpo deberían estar en la parte alta del rango de nivel. Las Cockatrices y los Wyverns siguen siendo VT-IT a nivel 75. Se recomienda Stona contra las cockatrices, y Paralyna y Silena contra los wyverns.",
    ["Meriphataud Mountains has an exit in the northeast to The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah, which has a Survival Guide at its regional outpost. Alternatively, Unity warp directly to Zi'Tah (level 122) and walk northwest."] = "Meriphataud Mountains tiene una salida al noreste a The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah, que tiene una Survival Guide en su puesto avanzado regional. También puedes usar el Unity warp directamente a Zi'Tah (nivel 122) y caminar al noroeste.",
    ["Mhaura: choose the first dialogue option, \"You're searching for adventurers?\""] = "Mhaura: elige la primera opción de diálogo, \"You're searching for adventurers?\"",
    ["Mhaura: examine Oaken Door (K-8) in Norg."] = "Mhaura: examina la Oaken Door (K-8) en Norg.",
    ["Mhaura: obtain 3 Mandragora Dewdrops from Pygmaioi in Tahrongi Canyon, or purchase them from the Auction House."] = "Mhaura: obtén 3 Mandragora Dewdrops de los Pygmaioi de Tahrongi Canyon, o cómpralas en la Auction House.",
    ["Mhaura: return to Mhaura and trade all 3 Mandragora Dewdrops to Ekokoko."] = "Mhaura: vuelve a Mhaura y entrega las 3 Mandragora Dewdrops a Ekokoko.",
    ["Mhaura: speak with Numi Adaligo at (F-9) in the Governor's House."] = "Mhaura: habla con Numi Adaligo en (F-9), en la Governor's House.",
    ["Mhaura: speak with Tonasav at (H-9) to travel to Norg."] = "Mhaura: habla con Tonasav en (H-9) para viajar a Norg.",
    ["Michea asks for a Mythril Ingot. Trade it to her, then zone out of Bastok Markets once."] = "Michea pide un Mythril Ingot. Entrégaselo y luego sal de Bastok Markets una vez.",
    ["Middle and North: 35-40"] = "Centro y norte: 35-40",
    ["Mihli Aliapoh is an okay starting healer, though you may find there's not much need for her services with Valaineral around. Once you have access to them, your Unity leader will be your go-to for healing."] = "Mihli Aliapoh es una curandera inicial aceptable, aunque puede que con Valaineral no haga mucha falta. Cuando tengas acceso a él, tu líder de Unity será tu curandero de cabecera.",
    ["Mimic King in Ro'Maeve: rifts at (E-7), (I-9) and (K-7)."] = "Mimic King en Ro'Maeve: rifts en (E-7), (I-9) y (K-7).",
    ["Mine a Sturdy metal strip in Gusgen Mines, Palborough Mines or Ifrit's Cauldron."] = "Mina una Sturdy metal strip en Gusgen Mines, Palborough Mines o Ifrit's Cauldron.",
    ["Mine up an Orichalcum Ore from the mining points scattered around the map."] = "Extrae un Orichalcum Ore de los puntos de minería repartidos por el mapa.",
    ["Misareaux Coast (E-7) (Unity Warp level 122 is close): examine the Storage Compartment to spawn Boggelmann, a Bugard with high defense that uses Blood Weapon. Examine it again afterwards for a cutscene and the key item Vessel of light."] = "Misareaux Coast (E-7) (el Unity Warp de nivel 122 está cerca): examina el Storage Compartment para hacer aparecer a Boggelmann, un Bugard con defensa alta que usa Blood Weapon. Examínalo de nuevo después para una escena y el key item Vessel of light.",
    ["Mission 4-1 (identical for every nation) requires you to go to deep parts of Davoi, Beadeaux, and Castle Oztroja."] = "La Mission 4-1 (igual para todas las naciones) requiere ir a partes profundas de Davoi, Beadeaux y Castle Oztroja.",
    ["Mission orders: become a test subject."] = "Órdenes de la misión: convertirte en sujeto de pruebas.",
    ["Modron in The Boyahda Tree: rifts on Map 1 at (G-5), (K-8) and (L-9), and on Map 2 at (F-7), very close to the Unity Warp (level 125)."] = "Modron en The Boyahda Tree: rifts en el mapa 1 en (G-5), (K-8) y (L-9), y en el mapa 2 en (F-7), muy cerca del Unity Warp (nivel 125).",
    ["Mog Case, immediately available upon character creation, accessible anywhere in the world from the menu option named \"View House\" or by typing /case"] = "Mog Case, disponible desde que creas el personaje, accesible desde cualquier parte con la opción de menú \"View House\" o escribiendo /case",
    ["Mog House"] = "Mog House",
    ["Mog Safe 1, located in (and only accessible from) your Mog House or a Nomad Moogle"] = "Mog Safe 1, en tu Mog House o con un Nomad Moogle (solo accesible desde ahí)",
    ["Mog Satchel, given for free to players who have enabled two-factor authentication via the Square-Enix security token, accessible anywhere in the world from the menu option named \"View House\" or by typing /satchel"] = "Mog Satchel, gratis para los jugadores que hayan activado la autenticación en dos pasos con el token de seguridad de Square-Enix, accesible desde cualquier parte con la opción de menú \"View House\" o escribiendo /satchel",
    ["Mog Wardrobe 1 & 2, immediately available upon character creation, the caveat is only weapons, armor, and ammunition can be stored here; accessible anywhere in the world from the menu option named \"View House\" or by typing /wardrobe, /wardrobe2, etc."] = "Mog Wardrobe 1 y 2, disponibles desde que creas el personaje, con la pega de que solo se pueden guardar armas, armaduras y munición; accesibles desde cualquier parte con la opción de menú \"View House\" o escribiendo /wardrobe, /wardrobe2, etc.",
    ["Monsters are listed above in order of level."] = "Los monstruos están indicados arriba por orden de nivel.",
    ["More Trusts (or not)"] = "Más Trusts (o no)",
    ["Move with WASD / the left Analog stick. Hit R on the keyboard or L1 on controller when running to turn on autorun and continue running in the same direction."] = "Muévete con WASD o la palanca analógica izquierda. Pulsa R en el teclado o L1 en el mando mientras corres para activar la carrera automática y seguir corriendo en la misma dirección.",
    ["Moving Out"] = "Mudanza",
    ["Mute is inflicted through the additional effect of the weapon of Eight of Cups in the Outer Horutoto Ruins (enter from (F-11) in West Sarutabaruta), and pays 1,000 gil."] = "Mute se inflige mediante el efecto adicional del arma de Eight of Cups en las Outer Horutoto Ruins (entra desde (F-11) en West Sarutabaruta), y paga 1,000 gil.",
    ["Mutton Tortilla can be bought at the Auction House (Food, Meals, Breads & Rice), or from Taajiji at the Timbre Timbers Tavern in Windurst Waters North if Windurst is at least 2nd place in Conquest."] = "La Mutton Tortilla se puede comprar en la Auction House (Food, Meals, Breads & Rice), o a Taajiji en la Timbre Timbers Tavern de Windurst Waters North si Windurst está al menos en 2nd lugar en Conquest.",
    ["Naja Salaheem fights with you and must survive. Battle 1: Amnaf and four Imperial Gears, which only appear once Amnaf is aggroed. Pull Amnaf, let the gears spawn and gather their hate on yourself with AoE before they kill Naja (Gravity and Bind work on them; Amnaf can be slept)."] = "Naja Salaheem lucha contigo y debe sobrevivir. Batalla 1: Amnaf y cuatro Imperial Gears, que solo aparecen cuando Amnaf entra en combate. Atrae a Amnaf, deja que aparezcan los engranajes y gana su odio con ataques de área antes de que maten a Naja (Gravity y Bind funcionan con ellos; Amnaf se puede dormir).",
    ["Naja requires you to successfully complete three mini-games. If you fail any portion, wait one real-life minute and speak to Naja again. After each one you may need to wait a game day to find out whether you passed; if you failed, you repeat that mini-game."] = "Naja te exige completar con éxito tres minijuegos. Si fallas alguna parte, espera un minuto real y habla de nuevo con Naja. Tras cada uno puede que tengas que esperar un día de juego para saber si lo superaste; si fallaste, repites ese minijuego.",
    ["Navigation Key Items"] = "Key items de navegación",
    ["Near the beaches"] = "Cerca de las playas",
    ["Near the entrance."] = "Cerca de la entrada.",
    ["Near the exit to Cape Teriggan."] = "Cerca de la salida a Cape Teriggan.",
    ["Near where you land, examine the ??? (stand very close) and choose \"Yes\" to dig, spawning the Pot NM Ancient Vessel."] = "Cerca de donde caes, examina la ??? (colócate muy cerca) y elige \"Yes\" para excavar, lo que hace aparecer al NM Pot Ancient Vessel.",
    ["Neith in the Temple of Uggalepih: rifts on Map 1 at (I-9) and (K-6), and on Map 2 at (G-8)."] = "Neith en el Temple of Uggalepih: rifts en el mapa 1 en (I-9) y (K-6), y en el mapa 2 en (G-8).",
    ["Neither monster aggros, but Trimmer link."] = "Ninguno de los dos ataca, pero los Trimmer se enlazan.",
    ["New players: unlock Norg's Survival Guide, Proto-Waypoint and Home Point before leaving. If you miss the door, the boatman takes you back to Norg again."] = "Jugadores nuevos: desbloquead la Survival Guide, el Proto-Waypoint y el Home Point de Norg antes de salir. Si te pasas la puerta, el barquero te vuelve a llevar a Norg.",
    ["Next to Survival Guide"] = "Junto a la Survival Guide",
    ["Next, Roropp (H-9) Sands of Silence (Demon Magistrate/Chancellor, Castle Zvahl Baileys: from the Survival Guide go west to map 2 and down the stairs at (H-6) or (H-10), or fall through the big holes); Popopp (H-9) a Wandering Bulb (Utukku, Fei'Yin: downstairs at (G-9) and north, or south from Home Point #2, in the small rooms with doors); Bubupp (I-8) Giant Fish Bones (Tonberry Stalker)."] = "Después, a Roropp (H-9) Sands of Silence (Demon Magistrate/Chancellor, Castle Zvahl Baileys: desde la Survival Guide ve al oeste al mapa 2 y baja las escaleras de (H-6) o (H-10), o déjate caer por los grandes agujeros); a Popopp (H-9) un Wandering Bulb (Utukku, Fei'Yin: abajo en (G-9) y al norte, o al sur desde el Home Point #2, en las salas pequeñas con puertas); a Bubupp (I-8) Giant Fish Bones (Tonberry Stalker).",
    ["Next, check this month's Repeat Login Campaign to see if there are any Trusts available. If you can afford them, they should be your first priority to purchase."] = "Después, mira la Repeat Login Campaign de este mes por si hay Trusts disponibles. Si puedes permitírtelos, deberían ser tu primera prioridad de compra.",
    ["Next, head to Castle Oztroja and kill the monsters to find an Oztroja Chest Key, or buy one from the Curio Vendor Moogle."] = "Después, ve a Castle Oztroja y mata monstruos hasta encontrar una Oztroja Chest Key, o compra una al Curio Vendor Moogle.",
    ["Next, speak with Esca in West Ronfaure (F-6)."] = "Después, habla con Esca en West Ronfaure (F-6).",
    ["Next, speak with Tehf Kimasnahya at (F-8) on Balrahn Way, who explains the whole thing."] = "Después, habla con Tehf Kimasnahya en (F-8) de Balrahn Way, que lo explica todo.",
    ["Next, travel to Xarcabard and examine ??? (H-7) near the clustered trees to receive the Figure of Garuda."] = "Después, viaja a Xarcabard y examina la ??? (H-7) cerca del grupo de árboles para recibir la Figure of Garuda.",
    ["Nine allied NPCs split up by nation and each fight two waves: Quadavs to the northwest, Orcs to the northeast, Yagudo to the south. Help them clear the waves."] = "Nueve PNJ aliados se dividen por nación y cada grupo lucha contra dos oleadas: Quadavs al noroeste, Orcs al noreste, Yagudo al sur. Ayúdalos a acabar con las oleadas.",
    ["No Fomors spawn in this area."] = "En esta zona no aparecen Fomors.",
    ["No More Rhapsodies For Now"] = "Se acabaron las Rhapsodies por ahora",
    ["No Trusts in this fight, but your buffs and pets carry in."] = "En esta pelea no hay Trusts, pero tus buffs y mascotas entran contigo.",
    ["No access to Aht Urhgan yet? Speak with Faursel in the Tenshodo in Lower Jeuno (J-8), choose the third (hidden) option twice, then \"Where is Tenzen\"."] = "¿Aún sin acceso a Aht Urhgan? Habla con Faursel en el Tenshodo de Lower Jeuno (J-8), elige dos veces la tercera opción (oculta) y luego \"Where is Tenzen\".",
    ["No aggro in the tunnel near the Altepa zone"] = "Nada ataca en el túnel cerca de la zona de Altepa",
    ["None are aggressive, but do link. Coppercaps are slightly lower leveled."] = "Ninguno es agresivo, pero se enlazan. Los Coppercaps son de nivel algo más bajo.",
    ["None of the mobs link."] = "Ninguno de los monstruos se enlaza.",
    ["North Gustaberg at (G-7). (There are two different Cavernous Maws in North Gustaberg.)"] = "North Gustaberg en (G-7). (Hay dos Cavernous Maws distintos en North Gustaberg.)",
    ["Northern Fur x4 pays 1,500 gil and drops from Giant Hunter enemies in Qufim Island, and from Giant Lobber enemies in Lower Delkfutt's Tower or Middle Delkfutt's Tower. Southern Mummy x4 pays 3,000 gil and drops from Lich enemies in Western Altepa Desert."] = "Northern Fur x4 paga 1,500 gil y lo sueltan los enemigos Giant Hunter de Qufim Island y los Giant Lobber de Lower Delkfutt's Tower o Middle Delkfutt's Tower. Southern Mummy x4 paga 3,000 gil y lo sueltan los enemigos Lich de Western Altepa Desert.",
    ["Northern San d'Oria: Guilberdrier (F-3), in front of the Carpenters' Guild; Villion (F-3), on the guild's 2nd-floor balcony; Capiria (F-6), near the Laborman's Way arch above the sluice gates; Boncort (F-8), Phoenix Perch Inn 2nd floor; Coullene (M-6), in the Cathedral."] = "Northern San d'Oria: Guilberdrier (F-3), frente al Carpenters' Guild; Villion (F-3), en el balcón del 2.º piso del gremio; Capiria (F-6), cerca del arco de Laborman's Way sobre las compuertas; Boncort (F-8), 2.º piso de la Phoenix Perch Inn; Coullene (M-6), en la Cathedral.",
    ["Note that most RoEs don't track progress unless they are activated. This means you should be sure to activate whatever you want to complete before you complete it!"] = "Ten en cuenta que la mayoría de los RoE no registran el progreso salvo que estén activados. ¡Así que asegúrate de activar lo que quieras completar antes de completarlo!",
    ["Note that this is for low level normally, but every little bit helps."] = "Ten en cuenta que normalmente es para nivel bajo, pero todo ayuda.",
    ["Note that you can't Unity Warp to places with entry requirements, like Aht Urhgan or Tavnazia, until you've unlocked direct access to such areas. If you haven't walked somewhere you could have walked, you can warp there. If you can't get there, you can't warp there yet."] = "Ten en cuenta que no puedes usar el Unity Warp a sitios con requisitos de entrada, como Aht Urhgan o Tavnazia, hasta que hayas desbloqueado el acceso directo a esas zonas. Si podrías haber ido caminando a un sitio, puedes teletransportarte allí. Si no puedes llegar, aún no puedes teletransportarte.",
    ["Note that your Unity leader Trust has \"(UC)\" for (Unity Concord) at the end of the spell's name, even though it isn't in their name on the party list or over their head on the overworld."] = "Ten en cuenta que el Trust de tu líder de Unity lleva \"(UC)\" de Unity Concord al final del nombre del hechizo, aunque no aparezca en su nombre en la lista del grupo ni sobre su cabeza en el mundo.",
    ["Now back out and head to (J-8), into a tunnel heading east. Zone into Valley of Sorrows and pick up the Survival Guide near the entrance. You're done with the desert for now! Let's go to the beach instead."] = "Ahora vuelve a salir y ve a (J-8), a un túnel que va al este. Entra en Valley of Sorrows y coge la Survival Guide cerca de la entrada. ¡Ya has terminado con el desierto por ahora! Vamos a la playa.",
    ["Now head west and up all the ramps to Castle Zvahl Baileys, which has a Survival Guide at the entrance. You'll be coming back here and climbing to the very top of Castle Zvahl for Mission 5-2, so you can skip the Home Point at the top for now."] = "Ahora ve al oeste y sube todas las rampas hasta Castle Zvahl Baileys, que tiene una Survival Guide en la entrada. Volverás aquí y subirás hasta lo más alto de Castle Zvahl para la Mission 5-2, así que por ahora puedes saltarte el Home Point de arriba.",
    ["Now is a good time to start learning Survival Skills (Logging, Watercrafting, Climbing and so on); you need them to cross the Ulbuka zones."] = "Es buen momento para empezar a aprender las Survival Skills (Logging, Watercrafting, Climbing, etc.); las necesitas para cruzar las zonas de Ulbuka.",
    ["Now it's time to start the actual storyline. Near the Conquest Overseer you receive Signet from will be another NPC known as a Gate Guard. These NPCs will be your purveyor of most story Missions."] = "Ahora toca empezar la historia de verdad. Cerca del Conquest Overseer que te dio Signet habrá otro NPC llamado Gate Guard. Estos NPCs te darán la mayoría de las Missions de la historia.",
    ["Now retrace your steps all the way back up those stairs to get back to the first map. This time, take the path immediately to your left (formerly right, because you were running the other direction) that you ignored before. Go north into a large room at (H-8), then go east out of that room and continue straight through a four-way intersection. Once you hit the next room, there are two exits to the left and right. This bit is symmetric, so you can take first the left exit, then the right exit from the next circular room, or take the right exit and then the next left. Either way, you end up in a hallway at (K-8) with a small door on the wall. Behind that door there is a Home Point at the zone line to Qu'Bia Arena."] = "Ahora desanda el camino subiendo esas escaleras para volver al primer mapa. Esta vez, toma el camino justo a tu izquierda (antes a la derecha, porque corrías en la otra dirección) que ignoraste antes. Ve al norte a una sala grande en (H-8), sal de ella por el este y sigue recto por un cruce de cuatro caminos. Al llegar a la sala siguiente hay dos salidas, a izquierda y derecha. Este tramo es simétrico, así que puedes tomar primero la salida izquierda y luego la derecha de la siguiente sala circular, o la derecha y luego la izquierda. En cualquier caso, acabas en un pasillo en (K-8) con una pequeña puerta en la pared. Tras esa puerta hay un Home Point en el límite de zona de Qu'Bia Arena.",
    ["Now that you have access to all the expansion areas, you also have access to all the jobs! Here are the newly-available advanced jobs."] = "Ahora que tienes acceso a todas las zonas de expansión, ¡también tienes acceso a todos los jobs! Estos son los jobs avanzados recién disponibles.",
    ["Now that you have entered your first field zone, you have unlocked access to a Records of Eminence objective to defeat enemies in it. Head to Quests > Combat (Region) > Original Areas 1 and undertake this new objective. As you enter new areas, be sure to flag this objective type to maximize Spark and Accolade earnings while traveling."] = "Ahora que has entrado en tu primera zona exterior, has desbloqueado un objetivo de Records of Eminence para derrotar enemigos en ella. Ve a Quests > Combat (Region) > Original Areas 1 y acepta este nuevo objetivo. Al entrar en zonas nuevas, activa este tipo de objetivo para ganar el máximo de Sparks y Accolades mientras viajas.",
    ["Now that you have your subjob, you can also finish off the Tutorial NPC's questline back in your home city for your free Echad Ring. Enjoy the free experience!"] = "Ahora que tienes subjob, también puedes terminar la serie de quests del NPC tutorial de tu ciudad para conseguir tu Echad Ring gratis. ¡Disfruta de la experiencia gratuita!",
    ["Now that you're in the mob, go down to their secret basement bar coincidentally located just below this legitimate establishment to get yourself a mercenary license."] = "Ahora que estás en la mafia, baja a su bar secreto del sótano, que casualmente está justo debajo de este establecimiento legal, para conseguir una licencia de mercenario.",
    ["Now that you're level 5, you can activate and complete the incredibly important RoE objective Basics > \"Call Forth An Alter Ego\" to unlock the \"Trust\" system."] = "Ahora que eres nivel 5, puedes activar y completar el importantísimo objetivo de RoE Basics > \"Call Forth An Alter Ego\" para desbloquear el sistema de \"Trust\".",
    ["Now that you're level 55, you can complete the rank 4 and 5 missions with Trusts, culminating in the Shadow Lord fight at the end of Mission 5-2."] = "Ahora que eres nivel 55, puedes completar las misiones de rango 4 y 5 con Trusts, culminando en la pelea contra el Shadow Lord al final de la Mission 5-2.",
    ["Now that you're this deep, you know whether or not you're in FFXI for the long haul. If you aren't, no shame. You can skip ahead to the next section."] = "A estas alturas ya sabes si vas a quedarte en FFXI a largo plazo. Si no, no pasa nada. Puedes saltar a la sección siguiente.",
    ["Now that you've got the Survival Guide for Kuftal Tunnel, immediately leave and Unity warp right back to Kuftal Tunnel (level 125) to arrive at the opposite end. (Alternatively, walk through it, but that's not nearly as funny.) Head north into Cape Teriggan and go to the outpost at (G-8_ for a Survival Guide."] = "Ahora que tienes la Survival Guide de Kuftal Tunnel, sal enseguida y usa el Unity warp de vuelta a Kuftal Tunnel (nivel 125) para llegar al extremo opuesto. (También puedes cruzarlo caminando, pero no tiene ni la mitad de gracia.) Ve al norte hacia Cape Teriggan y ve al puesto avanzado de (G-8_ para una Survival Guide.",
    ["Now that you've got your new sweet gear, you can keep leveling! Remember Sanction for ToAU areas."] = "Ahora que tienes tu nuevo equipo, ¡puedes seguir subiendo! Recuerda Sanction en las zonas de ToAU.",
    ["Now that you've obtained a Trust, talk to the Tutorial NPC again to continue their quest line and get your free Warp Ring."] = "Ahora que tienes un Trust, habla de nuevo con el NPC tutorial para continuar su serie de quests y conseguir tu Warp Ring gratis.",
    ["Now that you've used that Home Point, it won't blink on the map anymore. That's how you can tell whether you've already touched one!"] = "Ahora que has usado ese Home Point, ya no parpadeará en el mapa. ¡Así sabes si ya has tocado uno!",
    ["Now you can ride the raptor any time by either selecting Abilities > Mount or using the text command \"/mount Raptor\". I'd just make a macro for the latter."] = "Ahora puedes montar el raptor cuando quieras eligiendo Abilities > Mount o usando el comando de texto \"/mount Raptor\". Yo haría una macro con lo segundo.",
    ["Now you must complete Cook-a-roon? to get a Nashmau Stew. Buying one from the Auction House will not work, and keeping one from a previous repeat of Cook-a-roon? will not work either."] = "Ahora debes completar Cook-a-roon? para conseguir un Nashmau Stew. Comprar uno en la Auction House no sirve, y conservar uno de una repetición anterior de Cook-a-roon? tampoco sirve.",
    ["Now's the time to get Rank 3! Not because you particularly derive benefits from the intended reason to do so, but because being on your nation's Mission 2-3 lets you pick up two powerful trusts. Now that you've got your mount, head back to your home city and accept Mission 2-3. Remember, you can, and probably should, skip Mission 2-2."] = "¡Es hora de conseguir Rank 3! No porque saques mucho de la razón oficial para hacerlo, sino porque estar en la Mission 2-3 de tu nación te permite conseguir dos trusts potentes. Ahora que tienes montura, vuelve a tu ciudad y acepta la Mission 2-3. Recuerda que puedes, y seguramente deberías, saltarte la Mission 2-2.",
    ["Now, go outside of town for real and get ready to rumble! If you haven't already, make sure you equip your weapon and use the free scroll that you were given if you chose a mage job."] = "¡Ahora sí, sal de la ciudad y prepárate para pelear! Si aún no lo has hecho, equipa tu arma y usa el pergamino gratuito que te dieron si elegiste un job de mago.",
    ["Objective: allied scholars have determined that an unseen barrier is preventing direct damage to the walls of Castle Zvahl, greatly impeding our siege effort."] = "Objetivo: los eruditos aliados han determinado que una barrera invisible impide dañar directamente los muros de Castle Zvahl, lo que entorpece mucho nuestro asedio.",
    ["Objective: ambush one of the enemy's supply caravans."] = "Objetivo: emboscar una de las caravanas de suministros del enemigo.",
    ["Objective: assist in devising a plan to secure safe supply transport."] = "Objetivo: ayudar a idear un plan para asegurar el transporte seguro de suministros.",
    ["Objective: attack and defeat any suppliers, seize the cargo and return it."] = "Objetivo: atacar y derrotar a cualquier proveedor, capturar la carga y devolverla.",
    ["Objective: bomb an enemy stronghold."] = "Objetivo: bombardear una fortaleza enemiga.",
    ["Objective: bring supplies to a stronghold of your nation."] = "Objetivo: llevar suministros a una fortaleza de tu nación.",
    ["Objective: carry hazardous materials to the stronghold."] = "Objetivo: llevar materiales peligrosos a la fortaleza.",
    ["Objective: escort a Reinforcement to the outpost."] = "Objetivo: escoltar a un Reinforcement hasta el puesto avanzado.",
    ["Objective: fend off a beastman siege against one of your nation's strongholds."] = "Objetivo: rechazar un asedio de las bestias contra una de las fortalezas de tu nación.",
    ["Objective: find a Suspicious Object in Bastok."] = "Objetivo: encontrar un Suspicious Object en Bastok.",
    ["Objective: find a Suspicious Object in San d'Oria."] = "Objetivo: encontrar un Suspicious Object en San d'Oria.",
    ["Objective: find a Suspicious Object in Windurst."] = "Objetivo: encontrar un Suspicious Object en Windurst.",
    ["Objective: fortify strongholds against siege turrets."] = "Objetivo: fortificar las fortalezas contra las torretas de asedio.",
    ["Objective: gather intelligence from an enemy fortress."] = "Objetivo: reunir información de una fortaleza enemiga.",
    ["Objective: give needed supplies to Bastok."] = "Objetivo: entregar los suministros que necesita Bastok.",
    ["Objective: give needed supplies to San d'Oria."] = "Objetivo: entregar los suministros que necesita San d'Oria.",
    ["Objective: give needed supplies to Windurst."] = "Objetivo: entregar los suministros que necesita Windurst.",
    ["Objective: infiltrate an enemy stronghold and gather as much data as possible."] = "Objetivo: infiltrarte en una fortaleza enemiga y reunir todos los datos posibles.",
    ["Objective: join a campaign battle and assist in your nation's siege of a beastman stronghold."] = "Objetivo: unirte a una batalla de campaña y ayudar en el asedio de tu nación a una fortaleza bestia.",
    ["Objective: join a campaign battle and assist in your nation's siege of the Northlands."] = "Objetivo: unirte a una batalla de campaña y ayudar en el asedio de tu nación a las Northlands.",
    ["Objective: lend your crafting knowledge to crafting adepts."] = "Objetivo: poner tu conocimiento de artesanía al servicio de artesanos expertos.",
    ["Objective: lend your crafting knowledge to unskilled crafters."] = "Objetivo: poner tu conocimiento de artesanía al servicio de artesanos sin experiencia.",
    ["Objective: patrol local territories and eliminate any immediate threats."] = "Objetivo: patrullar los territorios locales y eliminar cualquier amenaza inmediata.",
    ["Objective: travel to La Vaule and defeat Darkheir Grradhod."] = "Objetivo: viajar a La Vaule y derrotar a Darkheir Grradhod.",
    ["Objective: travel to Vunkerl Inlet (J-7) and obliterate the beastmen campground in Everbloom Hollow."] = "Objetivo: viajar a Vunkerl Inlet (J-7) y arrasar el campamento de las bestias en Everbloom Hollow.",
    ["Objective: travel to the area named by the operation and obliterate the beastmen campground there."] = "Objetivo: viajar a la zona que indica la operación y arrasar allí el campamento de las bestias.",
    ["Obtain 1 Scream Fungus and 1 Land Crab Meat and trade them to Valgeir."] = "Consigue 1 Scream Fungus y 1 Land Crab Meat y entrégaselos a Valgeir.",
    ["Obtain 10 Rusty Leggings (they are fished up or come from a Goblin Box) and trade them to Heizo. You do not have to trade all 10 at the same time, as he remembers how many you have traded."] = "Consigue 10 Rusty Leggings (se pescan o salen de un Goblin Box) y entrégaselos a Heizo. No hace falta entregar los 10 a la vez, porque él recuerda cuántos le has entregado.",
    ["Obtain 10 Rusty Subligar (they are fished up) and trade them to Heiji. You do not have to trade all 10 at the same time, as he remembers how many you have traded."] = "Consigue 10 Rusty Subligar (se pescan) y entrégaselos a Heiji. No hace falta entregar los 10 a la vez, porque él recuerda cuántos le has entregado.",
    ["Obtain 12 sheets of Vellum: buy them at the Auction House (Leathercraft), or trade Rolanberries to Tucker in Crawlers' Nest (S) (K-8) on the first map, once the quest is active. Tucker accepts only 3 trades of up to 4 stacks each (one sheet per stack), so bring 12 stacks and trade 4 at a time. Champalpieu in Upper Jeuno sells Rolanberries."] = "Consigue 12 hojas de Vellum: cómpralas en la Auction House (Leathercraft), o entrega Rolanberries a Tucker en Crawlers' Nest (S) (K-8), en el primer mapa, una vez activa la quest. Tucker solo acepta 3 entregas de hasta 4 montones cada una (una hoja por montón), así que lleva 12 montones y entrega 4 cada vez. Champalpieu en Upper Jeuno vende Rolanberries.",
    ["Obtain 2 Cluster Cores, a fairly common drop from Cluster-type monsters."] = "Consigue 2 Cluster Cores, un drop bastante común de los monstruos Cluster-type.",
    ["Obtain 2 Dhalmel Meat and trade them to Rycharde to complete the quest. You receive 1,500 gil and the title Purveyor in Training."] = "Consigue 2 Dhalmel Meat y entrégaselos a Rycharde para completar la quest. Recibes 1,500 gil y el título Purveyor in Training.",
    ["Obtain 2 Hippogryph Tailfeathers (from Hippogryphs in Riverne - Site #A01 and #B01, or the Auction House under Clothcraft) and trade them to Ferchinne for your reward, the Mistmelt. You can repeat the quest."] = "Consigue 2 Hippogryph Tailfeathers (de los Hippogryphs de Riverne - Site #A01 y #B01, o en la Auction House en Clothcraft) y entrégaselas a Ferchinne para tu recompensa, el Mistmelt. Puedes repetir la quest.",
    ["Obtain 2 Lufet Salts from River Crabs in West Ronfaure."] = "Obtén 2 Lufet Salts de los River Crabs de West Ronfaure.",
    ["Obtain 3 Acuex Ore and trade them to Sylvie. Buy them at the Auction House (Materials > Smithing) or get them from Putrid Acuex and Flatus Acuex in Cirdas Caverns."] = "Consigue 3 Acuex Ore y entrégaselos a Sylvie. Cómpralos en la Auction House (Materials > Smithing) o consíguelos de los Putrid Acuex y Flatus Acuex de Cirdas Caverns.",
    ["Obtain 3 Black Tiger Hides."] = "Obtén 3 Black Tiger Hides.",
    ["Obtain 3 Lizard Skins. They can be bought from Cletae in Southern San d'Oria (D-8) for 600 gil, but only with Leathercraft Recruit rank or higher."] = "Obtén 3 Lizard Skins. Se pueden comprar a Cletae en Southern San d'Oria (D-8) por 600 gil, pero solo con rango Leathercraft Recruit o superior.",
    ["Obtain 3 Sheepskins; Cletae, in the building right behind Hanaa Punaa, sells them."] = "Consigue 3 Sheepskins; Cletae, en el edificio justo detrás de Hanaa Punaa, las vende.",
    ["Obtain 4 Ladybug Wings."] = "Obtén 4 Ladybug Wings.",
    ["Obtain Astragalos x4 and trade them to Koru-Moru. Astragalos can be bought from Shih Tayuun at the Bonecraft Guild in Windurst Woods (H-13), but it is only restocked if players sell it to the guild."] = "Consigue Astragalos x4 y entrégaselos a Koru-Moru. Se pueden comprar a Shih Tayuun en el Bonecraft Guild de Windurst Woods (H-13), pero solo se reponen si los jugadores se los venden al gremio.",
    ["Obtain Bat Wing x2."] = "Obtén Bat Wing x2.",
    ["Obtain Beehive Chip x3 or Remi Shell x2. Beehive Chip can be bought for 40 gil from Odoba at the Alchemy Guild in Bastok Mines (K-6)."] = "Obtén Beehive Chip x3 o Remi Shell x2. El Beehive Chip se puede comprar por 40 gil a Odoba en el Alchemy Guild de Bastok Mines (K-6).",
    ["Obtain Beeswax x2."] = "Obtén Beeswax x2.",
    ["Obtain Black Tiger Fang x3. It can be found at the Auction House (Materials, Bonecraft) or bought from Retto-Marutto in Windurst Woods (H-13) for 2,000 gil."] = "Obtén Black Tiger Fang x3. Se puede encontrar en la Auction House (Materials, Bonecraft) o comprar a Retto-Marutto en Windurst Woods (H-13) por 2,000 gil.",
    ["Obtain Bone Chip x2 and a Bomb Ash; both can be bought from NPCs."] = "Obtén Bone Chip x2 y un Bomb Ash; ambos se pueden comprar a NPCs.",
    ["Obtain Darksteel Ore x2 from the Auction House, Mog Garden, mining or other sources."] = "Obtén Darksteel Ore x2 en la Auction House, en el Mog Garden, minando u otras fuentes.",
    ["Obtain Flint Stone x4. It can be found at the Auction House (Materials, Goldsmithing) or dropped by worm enemies such as Tunnel Worm in East Ronfaure, West Ronfaure, North Gustaberg and South Gustaberg."] = "Obtén Flint Stone x4. Se puede encontrar en la Auction House (Materials, Goldsmithing) o la sueltan enemigos gusano como Tunnel Worm en East Ronfaure, West Ronfaure, North Gustaberg y South Gustaberg.",
    ["Obtain Flint Stone x4. It drops from worm type enemies such as Tunnel Worm, Carrion Worm and Stone Eater, and can also be found at the Auction House (Materials, Goldsmithing)."] = "Obtén Flint Stone x4. La sueltan enemigos de tipo gusano como Tunnel Worm, Carrion Worm y Stone Eater, y también se puede encontrar en la Auction House (Materials, Goldsmithing).",
    ["Obtain Gausebit Grass x4. Buy them at the Auction House (Weapons > Ammo & Misc. > Pet Items), or farm Crane Fly enemies in northern Meriphataud Mountains (near the outpost and Survival Guide, or the Castle Oztroja entrance) or Wadi Hare enemies in Dangruf Wadi. Gysahl Greens from the stables don't work."] = "Consigue Gausebit Grass x4. Cómpralas en la Auction House (Weapons > Ammo & Misc. > Pet Items) o farmea enemigos Crane Fly en el norte de Meriphataud Mountains (cerca del puesto avanzado y la Survival Guide, o de la entrada a Castle Oztroja) o enemigos Wadi Hare en Dangruf Wadi. Las Gysahl Greens de los establos no sirven.",
    ["Obtain Goobbue Humus. It drops from Goobbue Gardeners in The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah (13 of them in the north-east and south-east, 5-minute respawn, Treasure Hunter helps; Unity Warp level 122 goes there) and Old Goobbues in The Boyahda Tree."] = "Consigue Goobbue Humus. Lo sueltan los Goobbue Gardeners de The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah (13 en el noreste y el sureste, reaparecen cada 5 minutos, Treasure Hunter ayuda; el Unity Warp de nivel 122 va allí) y los Old Goobbues de The Boyahda Tree.",
    ["Obtain Hare Meat x5. For low-level players, Wild Rabbit and Forest Hare enemies can be defeated for experience points and have a chance to drop it."] = "Obtén Hare Meat x5. Para jugadores de nivel bajo, los enemigos Wild Rabbit y Forest Hare se pueden derrotar para obtener experiencia y tienen posibilidad de soltarla.",
    ["Obtain Honey x5. It drops from Maneating Hornet enemies in North Gustaberg and South Gustaberg, or can be bought from Chomo Jinjahl in Windurst Waters North (E-8) for 200 gil with Cooking Guild Recruit rank or higher."] = "Obtén Honey x5. Cae de Maneating Hornet en North Gustaberg y South Gustaberg, o se puede comprar a Chomo Jinjahl en Windurst Waters North (E-8) por 200 gil con rango Cooking Guild Recruit o superior.",
    ["Obtain Jody's Acid from Ameretats in Bhaflau Thickets or Wajaom Woodlands."] = "Obtén Jody's Acid de los Ameretats de Bhaflau Thickets o Wajaom Woodlands.",
    ["Obtain Laminated Ram Leather, Sheep Leather, and Silk Thread and trade them to Kipopo."] = "Obtén Laminated Ram Leather, Sheep Leather y Silk Thread y entrégaselos a Kipopo.",
    ["Obtain Lufet Salt x3."] = "Obtén Lufet Salt x3.",
    ["Obtain Rice Vinegar, Ground Wasabi and Holy Basil; Amalasanda in the Tenshodo in Lower Jeuno (J-8) sells all three."] = "Consigue Rice Vinegar, Ground Wasabi y Holy Basil; Amalasanda, en el Tenshodo de Lower Jeuno (J-8), vende los tres.",
    ["Obtain Rock Salt, Gausebit Grass and Lizard Egg. You may need several of each."] = "Obtén Rock Salt, Gausebit Grass y Lizard Egg. Puede que necesites varios de cada uno.",
    ["Obtain Ronfaure Maple Syrup by logging in East Ronfaure (S) (buy several Hatchets; the next quest also needs logging), Long-life Biscuits from the Tree Hollow right behind Rholont (E-7), and a Flask of Kingdom Water from the Well east of Rholont (E-7)."] = "Consigue Ronfaure Maple Syrup talando en East Ronfaure (S) (compra varios Hatchets; la siguiente quest también requiere talar), Long-life Biscuits del Tree Hollow justo detrás de Rholont (E-7) y un Flask of Kingdom Water del Well al este de Rholont (E-7).",
    ["Obtain Shaman Garlic x2, which drops from Orcish Cursemaker enemies."] = "Obtén Shaman Garlic x2, que cae de enemigos Orcish Cursemaker.",
    ["Obtain Shell Bug x3 from Quadav enemies or at the Auction House, and trade them to Ronan. Shell Bug can also be obtained from the Green Thumb Moogle if you have a Baby eft memento."] = "Obtén Shell Bug x3 de enemigos Quadav o en la Auction House y entrégalos a Ronan. El Shell Bug también se puede obtener del Green Thumb Moogle si tienes un Baby eft memento.",
    ["Obtain Silk Thread x3 or Crawler Calculus x3. Both drop from Crawler enemies in East Sarutabaruta and West Sarutabaruta."] = "Obtén Silk Thread x3 o Crawler Calculus x3. Ambos los sueltan enemigos Crawler en East Sarutabaruta y West Sarutabaruta.",
    ["Obtain Sleepshroom, Treant Bulb or Wild Onion and trade it to her depending on the time of day. Sleepshroom pays 200 gil from 18:00 to 5:59, Treant Bulb 200 gil from 6:00 to 11:59, and Wild Onion 350 gil from 12:00 to 17:59. If you trade an item that does not match the time of day, you only receive 100 gil."] = "Obtén Sleepshroom, Treant Bulb o Wild Onion y entrégaselo según la hora del día. Sleepshroom paga 200 gil de 18:00 a 5:59, Treant Bulb 200 gil de 6:00 a 11:59 y Wild Onion 350 gil de 12:00 a 17:59. Si entregas un objeto que no corresponde a la hora, solo recibes 100 gil.",
    ["Obtain Wild Onion x4 and trade them to him."] = "Obtén Wild Onion x4 y entrégaselos.",
    ["Obtain Yagudo Necklace x4."] = "Obtén Yagudo Necklace x4.",
    ["Obtain Zinc Ore x4. It can be bought from Teerth in Bastok Markets for 200 gil, from Celestina in Mhaura for 200 gil, or at the Auction House, or you can mine it from a Mineral Vein."] = "Obtén Zinc Ore x4. Se puede comprar a Teerth en Bastok Markets por 200 gil, a Celestina en Mhaura por 200 gil, o en la Auction House, o minarlo de una Mineral Vein.",
    ["Obtain a Bal Shell by using a Pickaxe at an Excavation Point in Korroloka Tunnel. Angelica's path: trade it to Angelica on the top floor of the Rarab Tail Hostelry in Windurst Waters (North) (F-10). Umberto's path: trade it to Umberto in Bastok Markets (L-10), then speak with Diederik again."] = "Consigue una Bal Shell usando un Pickaxe en un Excavation Point de Korroloka Tunnel. Camino de Angelica: entrégasela a Angelica en el último piso del Rarab Tail Hostelry en Windurst Waters (North) (F-10). Camino de Umberto: entrégasela a Umberto en Bastok Markets (L-10) y luego habla de nuevo con Diederik.",
    ["Obtain a Bastore Sweeper (fish in Vunkerl Inlet (S)), a Walnut (log in East Ronfaure (S)), a Dragon Fruit (log in Fort Karugo-Narugo (S)) and Pepperoni (Cooking 85); all are also on the Auction House."] = "Consigue un Bastore Sweeper (pesca en Vunkerl Inlet (S)), una Walnut (tala en East Ronfaure (S)), una Dragon Fruit (tala en Fort Karugo-Narugo (S)) y Pepperoni (Cooking 85); todos están también en la Auction House.",
    ["Obtain a Beehive Chip and a Dhalmel Meat and trade them to Rycharde to complete the quest. You receive between 1,000 and 1,500 gil and the title One-Star Purveyor."] = "Consigue un Beehive Chip y un Dhalmel Meat y entrégaselos a Rycharde para completar la quest. Recibes entre 1,000 y 1,500 gil y el título One-Star Purveyor.",
    ["Obtain a Beetle Shell and a Hecteyes Eye."] = "Obtén una Beetle Shell y un Hecteyes Eye.",
    ["Obtain a Bird Feather. It can be bought at the Auction House, or dropped by Carrion Crow enemies outside Windurst."] = "Obtén una Bird Feather. Se puede comprar en la Auction House, o la sueltan enemigos Carrion Crow fuera de Windurst.",
    ["Obtain a Bloody Robe, a Dhalmel Saliva and a Wild Rabbit Tail and bring them to Vera."] = "Consigue un Bloody Robe, un Dhalmel Saliva y un Wild Rabbit Tail y llévaselos a Vera.",
    ["Obtain a Blue Mage's Testimony from Mamool Ja Mimicker enemies."] = "Consigue un Blue Mage's Testimony de los enemigos Mamool Ja Mimicker.",
    ["Obtain a Boarding Permit through The Road to Aht Urhgan or the Rhapsodies of Vana'diel progression."] = "Obtén un Boarding Permit mediante The Road to Aht Urhgan o la progresión de Rhapsodies of Vana'diel.",
    ["Obtain a Bomb Ash from the Auction House, from Tenshodo or Alchemy vendors, or by farming Lantern and Bomb type monsters."] = "Obtén un Bomb Ash de la Auction House, de vendedores de Tenshodo o de Alchemy, o farmeando monstruos de tipo Lantern y Bomb.",
    ["Obtain a Bone Chip from the Auction House or by farming Skeleton type monsters."] = "Obtén un Bone Chip en la Auction House o farmeando monstruos de tipo Skeleton.",
    ["Obtain a Brass Hairpin. It can be bought at the Auction House, or crafted."] = "Obtén una Brass Hairpin. Se puede comprar en la Auction House o fabricar.",
    ["Obtain a Bruised Starfruit, which drops from Cursed Weapon enemies (levels 43-45) in Xarcabard or can be bought at the Auction House."] = "Consigue una Bruised Starfruit, que sueltan los enemigos Cursed Weapon (niveles 43-45) de Xarcabard o que se puede comprar en la Auction House.",
    ["Obtain a Carbuncle's Ruby from a Leech enemy. The drop rate is low (about 1%, 3%+ with Treasure Hunter 3), so a Thief helps. Poison Leeches in Buburimu Peninsula are probably easiest; Bloodsuckers in Toraimarai Canal (H-9 and J-9 on map 1) may have the best rate; Acrophies on Qufim Island also work."] = "Consigue un Carbuncle's Ruby de un enemigo Leech. La tasa de drop es baja (alrededor del 1%, 3%+ con Treasure Hunter 3), así que un Thief ayuda. Las Poison Leeches de Buburimu Peninsula son probablemente las más fáciles; los Bloodsuckers de Toraimarai Canal (H-9 y J-9 en el mapa 1) quizá tengan la mejor tasa; los Acrophies de Qufim Island también sirven.",
    ["Obtain a Cathedral Tapestry. It drops from Orcish Fighter enemies in Fort Ghelsba or the Yughott Grotto. Trade it to Sobane."] = "Obtén un Cathedral Tapestry. Cae de enemigos Orcish Fighter en Fort Ghelsba o Yughott Grotto. Entrégaselo a Sobane.",
    ["Obtain a Cold Bone, which can be bought at the Auction House or dropped by Doom Soldier enemies that appear at night in Cape Teriggan."] = "Obtén un Cold Bone, que se puede comprar en la Auction House o que sueltan enemigos Doom Soldier que aparecen de noche en Cape Teriggan.",
    ["Obtain a Copper Ingot from the Auction House, Goldsmithing guild shops, or by crafting it. To buy the Copper Ore for crafting at a guild shop, visit Teerth or Visala in Bastok Markets (H-8), or Yabby Tanmikey or Celestina in Mhaura (G-8)."] = "Obtén un Copper Ingot en la Auction House, en las tiendas del Goldsmithing guild o fabricándolo. Para comprar el Copper Ore para fabricar en una tienda del guild, visita a Teerth o Visala en Bastok Markets (H-8), o a Yabby Tanmikey o Celestina en Mhaura (G-8).",
    ["Obtain a Copper Key, which drops from Riverne Vultures in Riverne - Site #A01. You also need a Giant Scale (from a Firedrake) to pass through the Unstable Displacements."] = "Consigue una Copper Key, que sueltan los Riverne Vultures de Riverne - Site #A01. También necesitas una Giant Scale (de un Firedrake) para cruzar los Unstable Displacements.",
    ["Obtain a Copper Ring, either at the Auction House, from merchants (Carmelide or Raghd in Bastok Markets) or by crafting it."] = "Obtén un Copper Ring, en la Auction House, de mercaderes (Carmelide o Raghd en Bastok Markets) o fabricándolo.",
    ["Obtain a Crystal Bass. Buying one from the Auction House (Food > Fish) is much easier; you can also fish one at Crystalwater Spring in Jugner Forest (J-9), but it caps at fishing skill 35."] = "Consigue un Crystal Bass. Comprarlo en la Auction House (Food > Fish) es mucho más fácil; también puedes pescarlo en Crystalwater Spring, en Jugner Forest (J-9), pero el skill de pesca se queda en 35.",
    ["Obtain a Damselfly Worm, a Magicked Skull and a Crab Apron and bring them to Isacio."] = "Consigue un Damselfly Worm, un Magicked Skull y un Crab Apron y llévaselos a Isacio.",
    ["Obtain a Darksteel Ingot from the Auction House or by crafting it. One is enough for multiple people doing the quest."] = "Obtén un Darksteel Ingot en la Auction House o fabricándolo. Uno basta para varias personas que hagan la quest.",
    ["Obtain a Derfland Humus. It drops from Doom Scorpion enemies in Crawlers' Nest, and can also be purchased at the Auction House."] = "Obtén un Derfland Humus. Cae de enemigos Doom Scorpion en Crawlers' Nest y también se puede comprar en la Auction House.",
    ["Obtain a Desert Venom, which drops from Doom Scorpion enemies in Eastern Altepa Desert and Tulwar Scorpion enemies in Western Altepa Desert, or buy one at the Auction House."] = "Consigue un Desert Venom, que sueltan los enemigos Doom Scorpion de Eastern Altepa Desert y los Tulwar Scorpion de Western Altepa Desert, o cómpralo en la Auction House.",
    ["Obtain a Dog Collar, either at the Auction House or by farming Black Wolf enemies in North Gustaberg and South Gustaberg at night (game time 20:00 to 04:00)."] = "Obtén un Dog Collar, en la Auction House o farmeando enemigos Black Wolf en North Gustaberg y South Gustaberg de noche (hora del juego 20:00 a 04:00).",
    ["Obtain a Faded Crystal and trade it to Cid for the key item C. L report. Faded Crystals are not Rare/Ex (Auction House: Others > Misc. 1), or you can trade a synthesis crystal to a Crag's Telepoint for one: Crag of Dem (Konschtat Highlands I-6), Crag of Holla (La Theine Plateau K-8) or Crag of Mea (Tahrongi Canyon I-6)."] = "Consigue un Faded Crystal y entrégaselo a Cid para obtener el key item C. L report. Los Faded Crystals no son Rare/Ex (Auction House: Others > Misc. 1), o puedes entregar un cristal de síntesis al Telepoint de un Crag para conseguir uno: Crag of Dem (Konschtat Highlands I-6), Crag of Holla (La Theine Plateau K-8) o Crag of Mea (Tahrongi Canyon I-6).",
    ["Obtain a Fei'Yin Chest Key by defeating Shadow, Underworld Bat and Ore Golem enemies in that area."] = "Obtén una Fei'Yin Chest Key derrotando a enemigos Shadow, Underworld Bat y Ore Golem de esa zona.",
    ["Obtain a Flame Degen. It can be purchased at the Auction House, purchased with Sparks of Eminence, crafted, or it rarely drops from Napalm enemies."] = "Obtén una Flame Degen. Se puede comprar en la Auction House, comprar con Sparks of Eminence, fabricar, o la sueltan raramente los enemigos Napalm.",
    ["Obtain a Garnet."] = "Consigue una Garnet.",
    ["Obtain a Giant Sheep Meat from the Auction House or from Ornery Sheep in South Gustaberg."] = "Obtén una Giant Sheep Meat en la Auction House o de los Ornery Sheep de South Gustaberg.",
    ["Obtain a Ginger Cookie, sold by the Curio Vendor Moogle or by Valeriano in Port Bastok, and trade it to Deidogg. The quest is not flagged in your log until after you trade the Ginger Cookie, and from then on it is active."] = "Obtén una Ginger Cookie, que vende el Curio Vendor Moogle o Valeriano en Port Bastok, y entrégala a Deidogg. La quest no queda marcada en tu log hasta que entregas la Ginger Cookie, y desde entonces está activa.",
    ["Obtain a Gnole Claw: Auction House (Materials > Bonecraft), Gnoles in Vunkerl Inlet (S) (E-7) or Decrepit Gnoles in Jugner Forest (S) (H-11)."] = "Consigue una Gnole Claw: Auction House (Materials > Bonecraft), Gnoles de Vunkerl Inlet (S) (E-7) o Decrepit Gnoles de Jugner Forest (S) (H-11).",
    ["Obtain a Gold Earring. It can be obtained for free by completing the Records of Eminence objective Conflict: Xarcabard for the first time."] = "Obtén un Gold Earring. Se puede conseguir gratis completando por primera vez el objetivo de Records of Eminence Conflict: Xarcabard.",
    ["Obtain a Hare Meat."] = "Obtén un Hare Meat.",
    ["Obtain a Heavy Quadav Chestplate and Heavy Quadav Backplate."] = "Obtén un Heavy Quadav Chestplate y un Heavy Quadav Backplate.",
    ["Obtain a Kuftal Coffer Key and use it to open any coffer in Kuftal Tunnel (the Survival Guide is quickest). This gives you the key item Challenge to the Royal Knights."] = "Consigue una Kuftal Coffer Key y úsala para abrir cualquier cofre de Kuftal Tunnel (la Survival Guide es lo más rápido). Esto te da el key item Challenge to the Royal Knights.",
    ["Obtain a Lamian Fang Key. You can get one from a ??? in Caedarva Mire at (I-7), in a small crevice behind a Jnun, or it can drop from a Reserve Draugar in Caedarva Mire. Otherwise, obtain it from Merrow enemies inside Arrapago Reef."] = "Consigue una Lamian Fang Key. Puedes conseguir una de una ??? en Caedarva Mire en (I-7), en una pequeña grieta detrás de un Jnun, o puede caer de un Reserve Draugar en Caedarva Mire. Si no, consíguela de los enemigos Merrow dentro de Arrapago Reef.",
    ["Obtain a Lilac. It can be bought at the Auction House, or from Areebah in Upper Jeuno (H-6) for 120 gil."] = "Obtén un Lilac. Se puede comprar en la Auction House, o a Areebah en Upper Jeuno (H-6) por 120 gil.",
    ["Obtain a Lilac: Areebah at the M&P's Market in Upper Jeuno (H-6) sells them."] = "Consigue un Lilac: Areebah en el M&P's Market de Upper Jeuno (H-6) los vende.",
    ["Obtain a Lizard Egg."] = "Obtén un Lizard Egg.",
    ["Obtain a Luminicloth, a Revival Tree Root and a Wolf Hide. All three are on the Auction House, or farm them in The Eldieme Necropolis at any time of day: Luminicloth (rare) from ghosts, Revival Tree Root from undead, Wolf Hide from hounds."] = "Consigue una Luminicloth, una Revival Tree Root y una Wolf Hide. Las tres están en la Auction House, o farméalas en The Eldieme Necropolis a cualquier hora: Luminicloth (rara) de los fantasmas, Revival Tree Root de los no-muertos, Wolf Hide de los sabuesos.",
    ["Obtain a Marguerite. It can be bought at the Auction House, or from Areebah in Upper Jeuno (H-6) for 120 gil."] = "Obtén una Marguerite. Se puede comprar en la Auction House o a Areebah en Upper Jeuno (H-6) por 120 gil.",
    ["Obtain a Mary's Milk. It drops from Stray Mary in Konschtat Highlands, and can also be bought at the Auction House."] = "Obtén un Mary's Milk. Cae de Stray Mary en Konschtat Highlands y también se puede comprar en la Auction House.",
    ["Obtain a Muddy Siredon. It is fished up in the Newt Pool area of the Phanauet Channel, but one bought from the Auction House works just as well."] = "Consigue un Muddy Siredon. Se pesca en la zona de Newt Pool del Phanauet Channel, pero uno comprado en la Auction House sirve igual.",
    ["Obtain a Mythril Sallet from the Auction House (Armor, Head) or for 437 Sparks."] = "Obtén un Mythril Sallet de la Auction House (Armor, Head) o por 437 Sparks.",
    ["Obtain a Palborough Chest Key. It drops from Scimitar Scorpion, Brass Quadav, Copper Quadav and Old Quadav enemies in Palborough Mines, or can be bought from the Curio Vendor Moogle for 2,500 gil if you have the key item Rhapsody in White."] = "Obtén una Palborough Chest Key. La sueltan enemigos Scimitar Scorpion, Brass Quadav, Copper Quadav y Old Quadav en Palborough Mines, o se puede comprar al Curio Vendor Moogle por 2,500 gil si tienes el key item Rhapsody in White.",
    ["Obtain a Papaka Grass."] = "Obtén una Papaka Grass.",
    ["Obtain a Parchment from the Auction House (Leathercraft), by crafting it, or from Pikini-Mikini in the Mhaura warehouse (G-9) for just over 2,000 gil."] = "Consigue un Parchment en la Auction House (Leathercraft), fabricándolo o comprándolo a Pikini-Mikini en el almacén de Mhaura (G-9) por algo más de 2,000 gil.",
    ["Obtain a Parchment, which Pikini-Mikini sells in Mhaura (G-9) for 2,019 gil, and a Black Ink, which Maymunah sells in Bastok Mines (K-7) for 570 gil."] = "Consigue un Parchment, que vende Pikini-Mikini en Mhaura (G-9) por 2,019 gil, y una Black Ink, que vende Maymunah en Bastok Mines (K-7) por 570 gil.",
    ["Obtain a Philosopher's Stone."] = "Obtén una Philosopher's Stone.",
    ["Obtain a Puffball and trade it to Rycharde to complete the quest. You receive 2,100 gil and the title Two-Star Purveyor."] = "Consigue un Puffball y entrégaselo a Rycharde para completar la quest. Recibes 2,100 gil y el título Two-Star Purveyor.",
    ["Obtain a Punch Bug from Lou Carcolhs, Ancient Quadavs, Vajra Quadavs, or Gold Quadavs in Pashhow Marshlands [S] or Beadeaux [S]."] = "Obtén un Punch Bug de Lou Carcolhs, Ancient Quadavs, Vajra Quadavs o Gold Quadavs en Pashhow Marshlands [S] o Beadeaux [S].",
    ["Obtain a Puppetmaster's Testimony (Pup. Testimony). It drops from Troll Surveillant enemies in Bhaflau Thickets (F-8, northern map) and from Troll Engraver enemies in Halvung. It can be used for up to three fight attempts before you need a new one."] = "Obtén un Puppetmaster's Testimony (Pup. Testimony). Lo sueltan enemigos Troll Surveillant en Bhaflau Thickets (F-8, mapa norte) y enemigos Troll Engraver en Halvung. Se puede usar para hasta tres intentos de combate antes de necesitar uno nuevo.",
    ["Obtain a Quadav Backplate, either at the Auction House or by farming Amethyst Quadav enemies in North Gustaberg, South Gustaberg, Palborough Mines or Konschtat Highlands."] = "Obtén un Quadav Backplate, ya sea en la Auction House o farmeando enemigos Amethyst Quadav en North Gustaberg, South Gustaberg, Palborough Mines o Konschtat Highlands.",
    ["Obtain a Quadav Backscale from Quadavs in Palborough Mines."] = "Obtén un Quadav Backscale de los Quadavs de Palborough Mines.",
    ["Obtain a Quadav Helm. It only drops from Old Quadav enemies in Beadeaux; Old Quadav in other areas do not drop the same items. It can also be bought at the Auction House (Others, Beast-made)."] = "Obtén un Quadav Helm. Solo lo sueltan enemigos Old Quadav en Beadeaux; los Old Quadav de otras zonas no sueltan los mismos objetos. También se puede comprar en la Auction House (Others, Beast-made).",
    ["Obtain a Rabbit Hide, a Two-Leaf Mandragora Bud and an Insect Wing."] = "Obtén una Rabbit Hide, un Two-Leaf Mandragora Bud y un Insect Wing.",
    ["Obtain a Rain Lily."] = "Consigue una Rain Lily.",
    ["Obtain a Rampaging Horn and a Lumbering Horn."] = "Obtén un Rampaging Horn y un Lumbering Horn.",
    ["Obtain a Rarab Tail. It can be bought from the Sarutabaruta regional vendor, for example Baehu-Faehu in Windurst Waters North (G-5), for about 22 gil."] = "Obtén una Rarab Tail. Se puede comprar al vendedor regional de Sarutabaruta, por ejemplo Baehu-Faehu en Windurst Waters North (G-5), por unos 22 gil.",
    ["Obtain a Red Oven Mitt from Copper Quadav and Onyx Quadav enemies in Grauberg (S) (two of each in the (J-5/6) corridor, near the Campaign Arbiter and Survival Guide) or North Gustaberg (S) (one Copper Quadav south of the Survival Guide)."] = "Consigue un Red Oven Mitt de los enemigos Copper Quadav y Onyx Quadav de Grauberg (S) (dos de cada en el pasillo de (J-5/6), cerca del Campaign Arbiter y la Survival Guide) o de North Gustaberg (S) (un Copper Quadav al sur de la Survival Guide).",
    ["Obtain a Revival Tree Root. It can be bought at the Auction House (Materials, Alchemy) or dropped by Ghost-type enemies, and it does not need to come from King Ranperre's Tomb."] = "Obtén una Revival Tree Root. Se puede comprar en la Auction House (Materials, Alchemy) o la sueltan enemigos Ghost-type, y no tiene que venir de King Ranperre's Tomb.",
    ["Obtain a Rolanberry 874, either at the Auction House (Food, Ingredients) or by defeating the Drone Crawler (G) in Crawlers' Nest (Survival Guide, Derfland Region)."] = "Obtén un Rolanberry 874, en la Auction House (Food, Ingredients) o derrotando al Drone Crawler (G) en Crawlers' Nest (Survival Guide, Derfland Region).",
    ["Obtain a Rose Wand, an Oak Staff and a Mythril Rod. All three can be bought with sparks: the Oak Staff and the Mythril Rod are in the level 30-39 category, the Rose Wand in the level 40-49 category."] = "Obtén una Rose Wand, un Oak Staff y una Mythril Rod. Los tres se pueden comprar con sparks: el Oak Staff y la Mythril Rod están en la categoría de nivel 30-39, la Rose Wand en la de nivel 40-49.",
    ["Obtain a Royal Jelly. Death Jacket enemies are common near the main entrance of Crawlers' Nest."] = "Obtén una Royal Jelly. Los enemigos Death Jacket son comunes cerca de la entrada principal de Crawlers' Nest.",
    ["Obtain a Sahagin Key."] = "Obtén una Sahagin Key.",
    ["Obtain a Sand Bat Fang. It can be bought at the Auction House (Materials, Bonecraft) or taken from Sand Bat enemies found in the tunnels of Valkurm Dunes. It is also a Records of Eminence objective: Combat (Wide Area), Combat (Spoils) 2, Spoils (Sand Bat Fang)."] = "Obtén un Sand Bat Fang. Se puede comprar en la Auction House (Materials, Bonecraft) o conseguir de enemigos Sand Bat en los túneles de Valkurm Dunes. También es un objetivo de Records of Eminence: Combat (Wide Area), Combat (Spoils) 2, Spoils (Sand Bat Fang).",
    ["Obtain a Sand Charm, which drops from Crossbones on the Ferry between Mhaura and Selbina. Crossbones appear on the ferry only when pirates attack, which is a rare occurrence."] = "Consigue una Sand Charm, que sueltan los Crossbones del Ferry entre Mhaura y Selbina. Los Crossbones aparecen en el ferry solo cuando atacan piratas, algo poco frecuente.",
    ["Obtain a Scholar's Testimony, which drops from Orcs such as the Orcish Stonechucker, Orcish Fodder and Orcish Mesmerizer in East Ronfaure (S)."] = "Consigue un Scholar's Testimony, que sueltan Orcs como el Orcish Stonechucker, el Orcish Fodder y el Orcish Mesmerizer de East Ronfaure (S).",
    ["Obtain a Scorpion Stinger. It drops from Labyrinth Scorpion and Maze Scorpion enemies in the Maze of Shakhrami, and from Diplopod enemies in Kuftal Tunnel."] = "Obtén un Scorpion Stinger. Lo sueltan enemigos Labyrinth Scorpion y Maze Scorpion en Maze of Shakhrami, y enemigos Diplopod en Kuftal Tunnel.",
    ["Obtain a Shell Shield, either at the Auction House or from Young Quadav enemies in North Gustaberg, South Gustaberg, Palborough Mines or Konschtat Highlands. Only level 7 or higher WAR, RDM, PLD, BST and SAM can equip it."] = "Obtén un Shell Shield, ya sea en la Auction House o de enemigos Young Quadav en North Gustaberg, South Gustaberg, Palborough Mines o Konschtat Highlands. Solo WAR, RDM, PLD, BST y SAM de nivel 7 o superior pueden equiparlo.",
    ["Obtain a Silver Ingot from the Auction House or by crafting it. This quest follows The Elvaan Goldsmith."] = "Obtén un Silver Ingot en la Auction House o fabricándolo. Esta quest sigue a The Elvaan Goldsmith.",
    ["Obtain a Silver Name Tag. It can be bought at the Auction House, or dropped by Onyx Quadav and Greater Quadav enemies in Palborough Mines. Since the tags are rare, you can only turn in one at a time."] = "Obtén una Silver Name Tag. Se puede comprar en la Auction House, o la sueltan enemigos Onyx Quadav y Greater Quadav en Palborough Mines. Como las placas son raras, solo puedes entregar una a la vez.",
    ["Obtain a Slime Oil and a Frost Turnip."] = "Obtén un Slime Oil y un Frost Turnip.",
    ["Obtain a Smooth Stone, which drops from Crawler enemies in East Sarutabaruta and West Sarutabaruta."] = "Obtén una Smooth Stone, que sueltan enemigos Crawler en East Sarutabaruta y West Sarutabaruta.",
    ["Obtain a Soiled Letter and trade it to Koblakiq to complete the quest and receive 4,000 gil."] = "Consigue una Soiled Letter y entrégasela a Koblakiq para completar la quest y recibir 4,000 gil.",
    ["Obtain a Star Spinel from Spelunking Sabotender enemies in Quicksand Caves. Enter from Western Altepa Desert at (G-5); they are in the passageway near (F-7), and a couple spawn by Home Point #1. Sneak is required even at level 99. The weight sensors need one Galka or any two of Hume, Elvaan or Mithra."] = "Obtén un Star Spinel de enemigos Spelunking Sabotender en Quicksand Caves. Entra desde Western Altepa Desert en (G-5); están en el pasaje cerca de (F-7), y un par aparecen junto al Home Point #1. Se requiere Sneak incluso a nivel 99. Los sensores de peso necesitan un Galka o dos cualesquiera de Hume, Elvaan o Mithra.",
    ["Obtain a Steam Clock. You can buy one at the Auction House, or defeat Bubbly Bernie: get a Quus (a fish), from the Auction House or by fishing, travel to the lighthouse in South Gustaberg (M-10) and look for a ???, then trade the Quus to the ??? and Bubbly Bernie appears. Defeat him and loot his corpse for a Steam Clock."] = "Obtén un Steam Clock. Puedes comprar uno en la Auction House, o derrotar a Bubbly Bernie: consigue un Quus (un pez), en la Auction House o pescando, viaja al faro de South Gustaberg (M-10) y busca una ???, luego entrega el Quus a la ??? y aparece Bubbly Bernie. Derrótalo y saquea su cadáver para obtener un Steam Clock.",
    ["Obtain a Sutlac and head off to Nashmau."] = "Consigue un Sutlac y parte hacia Nashmau.",
    ["Obtain a Tavnazian Liver from the Orcs in Lufaise Meadows or the Tavnazian Sheep in Lufaise Meadows or Misareaux Coast, and trade it to Odeya."] = "Consigue un Tavnazian Liver de los Orcs de Lufaise Meadows o de las Tavnazian Sheep de Lufaise Meadows o Misareaux Coast, y entrégaselo a Odeya.",
    ["Obtain a Tonberry Board. It drops from Tonberry Pursuer enemies in the Temple of Uggalepih, Tonberry Shadower enemies in Yhoator Jungle and Tonberry Trailer enemies in the Den of Rancor."] = "Consigue un Tonberry Board. Lo sueltan los enemigos Tonberry Pursuer del Temple of Uggalepih, los Tonberry Shadower de Yhoator Jungle y los Tonberry Trailer del Den of Rancor.",
    ["Obtain a Twinstone Earring. It can be found at the Auction House, or farmed from Hill Lizard enemies in Meriphataud Mountains."] = "Obtén un Twinstone Earring. Se puede encontrar en la Auction House, o farmear de enemigos Hill Lizard en Meriphataud Mountains.",
    ["Obtain a Two-Leaf Mandragora Bud, which only drops from Mandragora enemies such as Tiny Mandragora in East and West Sarutabaruta."] = "Obtén un Two-Leaf Mandragora Bud, que solo sueltan enemigos Mandragora como Tiny Mandragora en East y West Sarutabaruta.",
    ["Obtain a Valkurm Sunsand, either at the Auction House or by traveling to Valkurm Dunes."] = "Obtén una Valkurm Sunsand, en la Auction House o viajando a Valkurm Dunes.",
    ["Obtain a Warm Egg, which can be bought at the Auction House or dropped by Anemone enemies in Yhoator Jungle."] = "Obtén un Warm Egg, que se puede comprar en la Auction House o que sueltan enemigos Anemone en Yhoator Jungle.",
    ["Obtain a Wild Pamamas, which drops from Young Opo-opo enemies in Yuhtunga Jungle and can sometimes be found at the Auction House. On later repeats a Wild Melon also works. Despite what the NPC says, you do not need to bring Ice Clusters, as there are no Flame Spouts on the path."] = "Consigue una Wild Pamamas, que suelta los enemigos Young Opo-opo de Yuhtunga Jungle y a veces se encuentra en la Auction House. En repeticiones posteriores también sirve una Wild Melon. Aunque lo diga el NPC, no necesitas llevar Ice Clusters, porque en el camino no hay Flame Spouts.",
    ["Obtain a Yagudo Caulk from Yagudos in Giddeus."] = "Obtén un Yagudo Caulk de los Yagudos de Giddeus.",
    ["Obtain a Yagudo Cherry from a vendor or the Auction House. One is enough for multiple people doing the quest."] = "Obtén una Yagudo Cherry de un vendedor o de la Auction House. Una basta para varias personas que hagan la quest.",
    ["Obtain a Zinc Ore. Monsters in Gustaberg are known to drop it."] = "Obtén un Zinc Ore. Se sabe que los monstruos de Gustaberg lo sueltan.",
    ["Obtain a Zvahl Coffer Key and trade it to a Treasure Coffer in Castle Zvahl Baileys to get the key item Mique's paintbrush. You can buy the key from the Curio Vendor Moogle for 5,000 gil if you have the key item Rhapsody in Umber. It also drops from Ahriman, Abyssal Demon, Arch Demon, Blood Demon and Doom Demon, or a Thief can pick the coffer's lock with Thief's Tools, a Living Key or a Skeleton Key."] = "Obtén una Zvahl Coffer Key y entrégala a un Treasure Coffer de Castle Zvahl Baileys para obtener el key item Mique's paintbrush. Puedes comprar la llave al Curio Vendor Moogle por 5,000 gil si tienes el key item Rhapsody in Umber. También la sueltan Ahriman, Abyssal Demon, Arch Demon, Blood Demon y Doom Demon, o un Thief puede forzar la cerradura del cofre con Thief's Tools, una Living Key o una Skeleton Key.",
    ["Obtain an Ahriman Lens and trade it to Ropunono."] = "Obtén un Ahriman Lens y entrégalo a Ropunono.",
    ["Obtain an Amaryllis. It can be bought at the Auction House, or from Areebah in Upper Jeuno (H-6)."] = "Obtén una Amaryllis. Se puede comprar en la Auction House o a Areebah en Upper Jeuno (H-6).",
    ["Obtain an Animal Glue."] = "Obtén un Animal Glue.",
    ["Obtain an Arnica Root if you have not already."] = "Consigue una Arnica Root si aún no la tienes.",
    ["Obtain an Attohwa Ginseng, which drops from Gallinipper, Ogrefly and Monarch Ogrefly enemies in Attohwa Chasm."] = "Obtén un Attohwa Ginseng, que cae de enemigos Gallinipper, Ogrefly y Monarch Ogrefly en Attohwa Chasm.",
    ["Obtain an Elixir."] = "Obtén un Elixir.",
    ["Obtain an Elshimo Marble, which drops from Ivory Lizard enemies in Yuhtunga Jungle."] = "Consigue un Elshimo Marble, que sueltan los enemigos Ivory Lizard de Yuhtunga Jungle.",
    ["Obtain an Imperial Army I.D. Tag from Rytaal in the Commissions Agency of Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). This assault is offered to mercenaries of the rank Chief Sergeant or higher, and it requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Consigue un Imperial Army I.D. Tag de Rytaal en la Commissions Agency de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). Este assault se ofrece a mercenarios del rango Chief Sergeant o superior, y requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Obtain an Imperial Army I.D. Tag from Rytaal in the Commissions Agency of Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). This assault is offered to mercenaries of the rank Corporal or higher, and it requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Consigue un Imperial Army I.D. Tag de Rytaal en la Commissions Agency de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). Este assault se ofrece a mercenarios del rango Corporal o superior, y requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Obtain an Imperial Army I.D. Tag from Rytaal in the Commissions Agency of Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). This assault is offered to mercenaries of the rank First Lieutenant or higher, and it requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Consigue un Imperial Army I.D. Tag de Rytaal en la Commissions Agency de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). Este assault se ofrece a mercenarios del rango First Lieutenant o superior, y requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Obtain an Imperial Army I.D. Tag from Rytaal in the Commissions Agency of Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). This assault is offered to mercenaries of the rank Lance Corporal or higher, and it requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Consigue un Imperial Army I.D. Tag de Rytaal en la Commissions Agency de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). Este assault se ofrece a mercenarios del rango Lance Corporal o superior, y requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Obtain an Imperial Army I.D. Tag from Rytaal in the Commissions Agency of Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). This assault is offered to mercenaries of the rank Private First Class or higher, and it requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Consigue un Imperial Army I.D. Tag de Rytaal en la Commissions Agency de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). Este assault se ofrece a mercenarios del rango Private First Class o superior, y requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Obtain an Imperial Army I.D. Tag from Rytaal in the Commissions Agency of Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). This assault is offered to mercenaries of the rank Private Second Class or higher, and it requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Consigue un Imperial Army I.D. Tag de Rytaal en la Commissions Agency de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). Este assault se ofrece a mercenarios del rango Private Second Class o superior, y requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Obtain an Imperial Army I.D. Tag from Rytaal in the Commissions Agency of Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). This assault is offered to mercenaries of the rank Second Lieutenant or higher, and it requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Consigue un Imperial Army I.D. Tag de Rytaal en la Commissions Agency de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). Este assault se ofrece a mercenarios del rango Second Lieutenant o superior, y requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Obtain an Imperial Army I.D. Tag from Rytaal in the Commissions Agency of Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). This assault is offered to mercenaries of the rank Sergeant Major or higher, and it requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Consigue un Imperial Army I.D. Tag de Rytaal en la Commissions Agency de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). Este assault se ofrece a mercenarios del rango Sergeant Major o superior, y requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Obtain an Imperial Army I.D. Tag from Rytaal in the Commissions Agency of Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). This assault is offered to mercenaries of the rank Sergeant or higher, and it requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Consigue un Imperial Army I.D. Tag de Rytaal en la Commissions Agency de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). Este assault se ofrece a mercenarios del rango Sergeant o superior, y requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Obtain an Imperial Army I.D. Tag from Rytaal in the Commissions Agency of Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). This assault is offered to mercenaries of the rank Superior Private or higher, and it requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Consigue un Imperial Army I.D. Tag de Rytaal en la Commissions Agency de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). Este assault se ofrece a mercenarios del rango Superior Private o superior, y requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Obtain an Imperial Army I.D. Tag from Rytaal in the Commissions Agency of Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). This assault requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Consigue un Imperial Army I.D. Tag de Rytaal en la Commissions Agency de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-10). Este assault requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Obtain an Ordrynite. Enter Pso'Xja from Beaucedine Glacier (G-9) and defeat Cryptonberry Plaguer or Cryptonberry Stalker enemies for it. You can use an Outpost Warp or the Survival Guide to Beaucedine Glacier, then go to (G-9), or use Home Point #1 in Pso'Xja, Escape and go to (G-9). With Rank 10 Chocobo Digging you can probably get 10 in a day, although they are Rare, so you have to turn each one in."] = "Obtén un Ordrynite. Entra en Pso'Xja desde Beaucedine Glacier (G-9) y derrota a enemigos Cryptonberry Plaguer o Cryptonberry Stalker para conseguirlo. Puedes usar un Outpost Warp o la Survival Guide a Beaucedine Glacier y luego ir a (G-9), o usar el Home Point #1 en Pso'Xja, Escape y ir a (G-9). Con Rank 10 de Chocobo Digging probablemente consigas 10 en un día, aunque son Rare, así que tienes que entregar cada uno.",
    ["Obtain four Rancor Flames to pass through the Sacrificial Chamber entrance unless its Home Point is already unlocked."] = "Obtén cuatro Rancor Flames para pasar por la entrada de la Sacrificial Chamber, salvo que su Home Point ya esté desbloqueado.",
    ["Obtain one Adaman Ore for every six people doing the mission (Auction House: Materials > Smithing; mining one in Ifrit's Cauldron is very rare). Each fight gives up to 6 Frag Rocks."] = "Consigue un Adaman Ore por cada seis personas que hagan la misión (Auction House: Materials > Smithing; minarlo en Ifrit's Cauldron es muy raro). Cada pelea da hasta 6 Frag Rocks.",
    ["Obtain one Giant Scale if necessary."] = "Obtén una Giant Scale si es necesario.",
    ["Obtain some pickaxes, then go to the third floor of Palborough Mines."] = "Obtén algunas pickaxes y ve al tercer piso de Palborough Mines.",
    ["Obtain the Dark Sap crystal at (F-8), Map 1."] = "Obtén el Dark Sap crystal en (F-8), Map 1.",
    ["Obtain the Earth Sap crystal at (J-8) or (H-7), Map 1."] = "Obtén el Earth Sap crystal en (J-8) o (H-7), Map 1.",
    ["Obtain the Fire Sap crystal at (J-9), Map 1, or (F-10)/(J-8), Map 2."] = "Obtén el Fire Sap crystal en (J-9), Map 1, o en (F-10)/(J-8), Map 2.",
    ["Obtain the Ice Sap crystal at (I-8) or (H-7), Map 2."] = "Obtén el Ice Sap crystal en (I-8) o (H-7), Map 2.",
    ["Obtain the Light Sap crystal at (G-8), Map 2; there are two possible positions."] = "Obtén el Light Sap crystal en (G-8), Map 2; hay dos posiciones posibles.",
    ["Obtain the Lightning Sap crystal at (H-7), Map 1, or (G-10/G-11), Map 2."] = "Obtén el Lightning Sap crystal en (H-7), Map 1, o en (G-10/G-11), Map 2.",
    ["Obtain the Loadstone from the Open Sesame quest if entering the weight doors solo."] = "Obtén el Loadstone de la quest Open Sesame si entras solo en las puertas de peso.",
    ["Obtain the Opalescent Stone from Castle Oztroja. Go through the Brass Door at (I-8) to Map 2, take the exit at (I-9) to Map 6, and examine the Brass Door at (I-8) there for a cutscene, then again to enter."] = "Consigue la Opalescent Stone en Castle Oztroja. Cruza la Brass Door de (I-8) al mapa 2, toma la salida de (I-9) al mapa 6 y examina allí la Brass Door de (I-8) para una escena, y de nuevo para entrar.",
    ["Obtain the Test Answers: they drop from Wendigos in Inner Horutoto Ruins past the Three Mage Gate (shown as \"Pile of answer sheets\" in the log), or can sometimes be bought at the Auction House."] = "Consigue los Test Answers: los sueltan los Wendigos de Inner Horutoto Ruins pasada la Three Mage Gate (aparecen como \"Pile of answer sheets\" en el registro), o a veces se pueden comprar en la Auction House.",
    ["Obtain the Vunkerl Herb from the Leafy Patch."] = "Obtén la Vunkerl Herb del Leafy Patch.",
    ["Obtain the Water Sap crystal at (H-7) or (J-9), Map 1."] = "Obtén el Water Sap crystal en (H-7) o (J-9), Map 1.",
    ["Obtain the Wind Sap crystal at (H-9) or (J-9), Map 2."] = "Obtén el Wind Sap crystal en (H-9) o (J-9), Map 2.",
    ["Obtain the five fish he asks for: Ahtapot, Istakoz, Istavrit, Istiridye and Mercanbaligi. You can buy them at the Auction House or fish them up in the Treasures of Aht Urhgan zones."] = "Consigue los cinco pescados que pide: Ahtapot, Istakoz, Istavrit, Istiridye y Mercanbaligi. Puedes comprarlos en la Auction House o pescarlos en las zonas de Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Obtain the four Fetich pieces: Fetich Head, Fetich Torso, Fetich Arms and Fetich Legs. They are not Rare/Ex, so you can buy them from the Auction House (Others > Beast-made) or a bazaar instead of farming them."] = "Consigue las cuatro piezas del Fetich: Fetich Head, Fetich Torso, Fetich Arms y Fetich Legs. No son Rare/Ex, así que puedes comprarlas en la Auction House (Others > Beast-made) o en un bazar en lugar de farmearlas.",
    ["Obtain the seven items by choosing them as your reward from the Prime Avatar fights: Trial by Fire (Ifrit) for Egil's Torch, Trial by Ice (Shiva) for Rust 'B' Gone, Trial by Wind (Garuda) for Bubbly Water, Trial by Earth (Titan) for Desert Light, Trial by Lightning (Ramuh) for Elder Branch, Trial by Water (Leviathan) for Eye of Nept, and The Moonlit Path (Fenrir) for Ancients' Key."] = "Consigue los siete objetos eligiéndolos como recompensa en las peleas contra los Prime Avatars: Trial by Fire (Ifrit) para Egil's Torch, Trial by Ice (Shiva) para Rust 'B' Gone, Trial by Wind (Garuda) para Bubbly Water, Trial by Earth (Titan) para Desert Light, Trial by Lightning (Ramuh) para Elder Branch, Trial by Water (Leviathan) para Eye of Nept y The Moonlit Path (Fenrir) para Ancients' Key.",
    ["Offensive Chapuli abilities give them a stoneskin."] = "Las habilidades ofensivas de los Chapuli les dan un stoneskin.",
    ["On Dancer, speak with Laila in Upper Jeuno for a cutscene and your Dancer's Tights."] = "Como Dancer, habla con Laila en Upper Jeuno para una escena y tus Dancer's Tights.",
    ["On Map 2 of Crawlers' Nest at (I-10), examine the ??? and choose to bury the Old boots and the Crawler blood."] = "En el mapa 2 de Crawlers' Nest, en (I-10), examina la ??? y elige enterrar las Old boots y la Crawler blood.",
    ["On Map 2, go west to the Brass Door at (G-8), which opens with the right combination of its 4 levers (you can just try them until it opens). Go upstairs to Map 3 and straight on to Map 4."] = "En el mapa 2, ve al oeste hasta la Brass Door de (G-8), que se abre con la combinación correcta de sus 4 palancas (puedes probar hasta que se abra). Sube al mapa 3 y sigue recto al mapa 4.",
    ["On Map 4, defeat Yagudo Flagellants until one drops a Judgment Key."] = "En el mapa 4, derrota Yagudo Flagellants hasta que uno suelte una Judgment Key.",
    ["On a Full Moon cycle, at night, board the Jeuno to San d'Oria airship."] = "En un ciclo de Full Moon, de noche, sube a la airship de Jeuno a San d'Oria.",
    ["On a level 30 or higher job, zone into Port Jeuno for a cutscene."] = "Con un job de nivel 30 o superior, entra en Port Jeuno para una escena.",
    ["On foot from Batallia Downs [S]: keep left into Vunkerl Inlet [S] (L-6), take the eastern path toward (H-7) (there is a one-way drop at F-6), down to (D-10) into Jugner Forest [S], drop off the ramp at (J-11), cross the logs at (I-9), pass the Telepoint at (H-9) and keep right at the split at (H-11) to the Wooden Gate at (G-11)."] = "A pie desde Batallia Downs [S]: mantente a la izquierda hacia Vunkerl Inlet [S] (L-6), toma el camino este hacia (H-7) (hay una caída de un solo sentido en F-6), baja hasta (D-10) hacia Jugner Forest [S], déjate caer de la rampa en (J-11), cruza los troncos en (I-9), pasa el Telepoint de (H-9) y mantente a la derecha en la bifurcación de (H-11) hasta la Wooden Gate de (G-11).",
    ["On the 4th floor, the spire zone lines are: Dem at (H-8) southwest of where you arrive, Holla at (K-8) straight north around a large hole, Mea at (I-6) southeast. Inside the spire, examine the Web of Recollections and choose \"Ancient Flames Beckon\". Summon Trusts only after passing the barrier, and buff inside: all buffs except food wear off."] = "En el 4.º piso, los límites de zona de las agujas son: Dem en (H-8), al suroeste de donde llegas; Holla en (K-8), recto al norte rodeando un gran agujero; Mea en (I-6), al sureste. Dentro de la aguja, examina la Web of Recollections y elige \"Ancient Flames Beckon\". Invoca los Trusts solo tras cruzar la barrera, y poténciate dentro: todos los buffs salvo la comida desaparecen.",
    ["On the North map, talk to Clais near the bridge to the Rarab's Tail Hostelery (G-10), Kyume-Romeh in the Timbre Timbers Tavern (F-10), Tosuka-Porika in the east Optistery (G-8), Pechiru-Mashiru in the east Aurastery (L-6) and Machitata near the Mog House (L-11)."] = "En el mapa North, habla con Clais cerca del puente al Rarab's Tail Hostelery (G-10), Kyume-Romeh en la Timbre Timbers Tavern (F-10), Tosuka-Porika en el Optistery este (G-8), Pechiru-Mashiru en el Aurastery este (L-6) y Machitata cerca del Mog House (L-11).",
    ["On the fifth floor the Memory Flux is at (D-6), northwest of where you start."] = "En el quinto piso el Memory Flux está en (D-6), al noroeste de donde empiezas.",
    ["On the first map of the Den of Rancor (Map C), drop down the hole at (J-7) to the sixth map (Map D) and enter the Cloister of Tides at (I-7)."] = "En el primer mapa del Den of Rancor (Map C), déjate caer por el agujero de (J-7) al sexto mapa (Map D) y entra en la Cloister of Tides en (I-7).",
    ["On the fourth floor go straight east to the Memory Flux at (M-6)."] = "En el cuarto piso ve recto al este hasta el Memory Flux de (M-6).",
    ["On the isle, examine the ??? at (H-9) to spawn 6 Peerifools (Mandragora that use Dream Flower and link with other Mandragora). Defeat them and examine the ??? again for the key item Deed to Purgonorgo Isle."] = "En la isla, examina la ??? de (H-9) para hacer aparecer 6 Peerifools (Mandragoras que usan Dream Flower y se enlazan con otras Mandragoras). Derrótalos y examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener el key item Deed to Purgonorgo Isle.",
    ["On the next map, go to (G-7) and through the exit onto a ledge; walk north along it to Daa Bola the Seer at (I-7) and trade him the Arnica Root."] = "En el mapa siguiente, ve a (G-7) y cruza la salida a una cornisa; camina por ella hacia el norte hasta Daa Bola the Seer en (I-7) y entrégale la Arnica Root.",
    ["On the second floor (Map 2), get the key item Brand of Dawn to the north (shorter) and Brand of Twilight to the south (longer path). The Warp Distortions dismiss Trusts. Warping out and returning by Home Point saves time between them."] = "En el segundo piso (mapa 2), consigue el key item Brand of Dawn al norte (más corto) y Brand of Twilight al sur (camino más largo). Las Warp Distortions despiden a los Trusts. Teletransportarte fuera y volver por Home Point ahorra tiempo entre uno y otro.",
    ["On the second floor of Vemalpeau's house, examine the ??? on the painting, look behind it and read the letter to get the key item Strange sheet of paper."] = "En el segundo piso de la casa de Vemalpeau, examina la ??? del cuadro, mira detrás y lee la carta para obtener el key item Strange sheet of paper.",
    ["On the small plateau. Enemies are passive and have a short linking range. If you can be patient and don't want to get the extra Tragopan by the Catoblepas (76-77), this camp can be started at 67-68."] = "En la pequeña meseta. Los enemigos son pasivos y tienen poco alcance de enlace. Si tienes paciencia y no quieres el Tragopan extra junto al Catoblepas (76-77), puedes empezar este campamento a nivel 67-68.",
    ["On the third floor, trade the Gravel to the Refiner, pull the lever, drop to the second floor, pull the second lever, and obtain Mythril Sand."] = "En el tercer piso, entrega la Gravel al Refiner, tira de la palanca, déjate caer al segundo piso, tira de la segunda palanca y obtén Mythril Sand.",
    ["On the top floor, don't go through the timed gate: in the H-shaped room before it, trade the Yagudo Drink to the ??? on a torch at (H-8) to spawn Huu Xalmo the Savage (3 minutes between spawns)."] = "En el piso superior, no cruces la puerta temporizada: en la sala con forma de H anterior, entrega la Yagudo Drink a la ??? de una antorcha en (H-8) para hacer aparecer a Huu Xalmo the Savage (3 minutos entre apariciones).",
    ["Once all 10 are traded you receive your reward, the Scroll of Dokumori: Ichi, and the title Looks Good in Leggings."] = "Cuando hayas entregado los 10 recibes tu recompensa, el Scroll of Dokumori: Ichi, y el título Looks Good in Leggings.",
    ["Once all 10 are traded you receive your reward, the Scroll of Kurayami: Ichi, and the title Looks Sublime in a Subligar."] = "Cuando hayas entregado los 10 recibes tu recompensa, el Scroll of Kurayami: Ichi, y el título Looks Sublime in a Subligar.",
    ["Once all 15 Magicmart Flyers have been distributed, return to Regine and speak with her to end the quest."] = "Cuando hayas repartido los 15 Magicmart Flyers, vuelve con Regine y habla con ella para terminar la quest.",
    ["Once all parcels are delivered, speak with Fontoumant again for your reward."] = "Cuando hayas entregado todos los paquetes, vuelve a hablar con Fontoumant para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Once all the switches are off, return to the ??? in the Temple of the Goddess for a cutscene and your reward."] = "Cuando todos los interruptores estén desactivados, vuelve a la ??? del Temple of the Goddess para una escena y tu recompensa.",
    ["Once both are defeated, click the ??? again for a cutscene."] = "Cuando hayas derrotado a ambos, pulsa de nuevo la ??? para una escena.",
    ["Once everyone has seen the cutscene, examine the Bloodstained Glove again to spawn Insidio (any job; Trusts allowed). This Orobon uses Mayhem Lantern (area Charm) and takes less physical damage each time it does, so bring magic damage and skillchains, or let Trusts hold hate while you stay out of Charm range; Tenebrae with Pflug and other Magic Evasion buffs also helps. Everyone on the quest gets Insidio's extinguished lantern; helpers who have never assisted get up to 10,000 Bayld."] = "Cuando todos hayan visto la escena, examina de nuevo el Bloodstained Glove para hacer aparecer a Insidio (cualquier job; se permiten Trusts). Este Orobon usa Mayhem Lantern (Charm de área) y recibe menos daño físico cada vez que lo usa, así que lleva daño mágico y skillchains, o deja que los Trusts mantengan el odio mientras tú te quedas fuera del alcance del Charm; Tenebrae con Pflug y otros buffs de Magic Evasion también ayudan. Todos los que tengan la quest obtienen la Insidio's extinguished lantern; los ayudantes que nunca hayan ayudado reciben hasta 10,000 Bayld.",
    ["Once in Davoi you need to locate a Jar that contains the Power Sandals. The jar can spawn at (I-8), (K-9), (J-8), (H-8), (F-6), (J-9), (F-9), (G-9), (H-9) and (F-7)."] = "Una vez en Davoi, debes localizar un Jar que contiene las Power Sandals. La jarra puede aparecer en (I-8), (K-9), (J-8), (H-8), (F-6), (J-9), (F-9), (G-9), (H-9) y (F-7).",
    ["Once in Horlais Peak, go to the Hot Springs and check them to fill the bottle. The name does not change, so to confirm you filled it, read the description of the item under Temporary Items: it should say it is full of water from the hot spring that flows from Horlais Peak."] = "Una vez en Horlais Peak, ve a los Hot Springs y examínalos para llenar la botella. El nombre no cambia, así que para confirmar que la llenaste, lee la descripción del objeto en Temporary Items: debe decir que está llena de agua de la fuente termal que fluye de Horlais Peak.",
    ["Once in Mhaura, take the ferry to Selbina so that you are traveling at nighttime. Suitable ferry departure times for this quest leave Mhaura at 16:00 and 0:00. On the ferry that departs at 16:00, you must wait until night time at 20:00 for the event to appear."] = "Una vez en Mhaura, toma el ferry a Selbina para viajar de noche. Los horarios de salida adecuados desde Mhaura son 16:00 y 0:00. En el ferry que sale a las 16:00, debes esperar a la noche, a las 20:00, para que aparezca el evento.",
    ["Once in Upper Delkfutt's Tower, go to (F-8) on the first map and through the door (this area isn't shown on the map). Climb the stairs to the 11th floor with Sneak and Invisible (Bats and Giants; Dolls and Pots detect magic)."] = "Ya en Upper Delkfutt's Tower, ve a (F-8) en el primer mapa y cruza la puerta (esta zona no aparece en el mapa). Sube las escaleras hasta el piso 11 con Sneak e Invisible (murciélagos y Giants; los Dolls y Pots detectan magia).",
    ["Once in the temple, head to (I-10) and defeat the Temple Guardian to open the door."] = "Una vez en el templo, ve a (I-10) y derrota al Temple Guardian para abrir la puerta.",
    ["Once inside Ifrit's Cauldron, take the left path at the fork and continue until you find the Altar of Ashes at (I-9) on map 2, a black pillar near the edge of the path. Alternatively, use the Unity 125 teleport to map 3 and take exit G, then A, then B to reach (I-9) of map 2."] = "Dentro de Ifrit's Cauldron, toma el camino de la izquierda en la bifurcación y sigue hasta encontrar el Altar of Ashes en (I-9) del mapa 2, un pilar negro cerca del borde del camino. También puedes usar el teletransporte de Unity 125 al mapa 3 y tomar la salida G, luego A y luego B para llegar a (I-9) del mapa 2.",
    ["Once inside Sea Serpent Grotto, head to (K-6), where you find a ???. Check the ??? to spawn Glyryvilu."] = "Una vez dentro de Sea Serpent Grotto, ve a (K-6), donde encuentras una ???. Revisa la ??? para invocar a Glyryvilu.",
    ["Once inside, find a Toad's Footprint at (J-7) and click it for another cutscene."] = "Una vez dentro, encuentra una Toad's Footprint en (J-7) y haz clic en ella para otra escena.",
    ["Once inside, go to the point where (I-9) and (J-8) meet and check the mushroom patch to find a mature Scourshroom (a key item). Then check the mushroom patch at (I-9)/(J-9) to plant it. Repeat the process at (E-7)."] = "Una vez dentro, ve al punto donde se juntan (I-9) y (J-8) y revisa la mata de hongos para encontrar un Scourshroom maduro (un key item). Luego revisa la mata de hongos en (I-9)/(J-9) para plantarlo. Repite el proceso en (E-7).",
    ["Once inside, hug the south side until you reach a large room at (G-9), and fall through the grave in the center of the room. To reach the room at (G-9) you need someone to operate the gates for you, or the Magicked astrolabe."] = "Una vez dentro, pégate al lado sur hasta llegar a una sala grande en (G-9) y cae por la tumba del centro de la sala. Para llegar a la sala de (G-9) necesitas que alguien te abra las puertas, o el Magicked astrolabe.",
    ["Once inside, the displacement sequence is red, purple, red, purple (you lose all buffs, Trusts included, at each one). Take the elevator down, go north, then west at the intersection, and use the Stone Gate with your Pso'Xja pass. The Home Point is just past the gate on the left; head down the steps into The Shrouded Maw."] = "Una vez dentro, la secuencia de desplazamientos es rojo, morado, rojo, morado (pierdes todos los buffs, Trusts incluidos, en cada uno). Baja en el ascensor, ve al norte, luego al oeste en el cruce, y usa la Stone Gate con tu Pso'Xja pass. El Home Point está justo pasada la puerta, a la izquierda; baja los escalones hasta The Shrouded Maw.",
    ["Once prepared, examine the ??? at (I-7), northwest of Bloodlet Spring, to spawn 3 Sahagin NMs: Kappa Akuso (Monk), Kappa Biwa (Bard) and Kappa Bonze (White Mage)."] = "Una vez preparado, examina la ??? de (I-7), al noroeste de Bloodlet Spring, para invocar a 3 NMs Sahagin: Kappa Akuso (Monk), Kappa Biwa (Bard) y Kappa Bonze (White Mage).",
    ["Once the NM is defeated, check the ??? again to receive the key item Whispering conch."] = "Cuando el NM esté derrotado, revisa la ??? de nuevo para recibir el key item Whispering conch.",
    ["Once the Old Sabertooth has died on its own, examine the Tiger Bones to get the key item Old tiger's fang."] = "Cuando el Old Sabertooth haya muerto por sí solo, examina los Tiger Bones para obtener el key item Old tiger's fang.",
    ["Once the chocobo has eaten the Gausebit Grass x4, you are presented with a Chocobo license."] = "Cuando el chocobo haya comido las Gausebit Grass x4, te dan una Chocobo license.",
    ["Once the item sells, go back to the \"Sale Status\" menu and select the item (which will \"helpfully\" have turned yellow rather than green) to remove it from your \"items for sale\" so that you can sell more items. (Yes, this is obtuse as hell.)"] = "Cuando se venda, vuelve al menú \"Sale Status\" y elige el objeto (que, \"muy útilmente\", se habrá vuelto amarillo en lugar de verde) para quitarlo de tus \"items for sale\" y poder vender más. (Sí, es absurdamente enrevesado.)",
    ["Once the leeches are defeated and their bodies despawn, click on the ??? to receive the key item Strangely shaped coral. Several players can do this at the same time: have one member spawn the leeches and, after they despawn, have the others select the ??? before the player who spawned them. If the player who spawned them is KO'd, do not raise them until the Korroloka Leeches are defeated, or the leeches respawn immediately."] = "Cuando las leeches estén derrotadas y sus cuerpos desaparezcan, haz clic en la ??? para recibir el key item Strangely shaped coral. Varios jugadores pueden hacerlo a la vez: que un miembro invoque las leeches y, cuando desaparezcan, que los demás seleccionen la ??? antes que quien las invocó. Si quien las invocó queda KO'd, no lo levantes hasta que los Korroloka Leeches estén derrotados, o las leeches reaparecen de inmediato.",
    ["Once the quest is complete, she removes the status ailment from you."] = "Una vez completa la quest, te quita el estado alterado.",
    ["Once you accept, obtain Rusty Bucket x5, either by fishing for them or by buying them at the Auction House or from Kahah Hobichai in Al Zahbi."] = "Una vez aceptada, obtén Rusty Bucket x5, pescándolos o comprándolos en la Auction House o a Kahah Hobichai en Al Zahbi.",
    ["Once you arrive in Selbina or Mhaura (and get a Rhapsodies cutscene), open your map and beeline for the Home Point. Be sure to use it so you don't have to take another walk back. Now you can teleport back to your home city if you need to do some shopping! (If you'd like to change jobs or need to access anything in your Mog House other than Storage, you can do so by talking to the nearby Nomad Moogle, so you don't have to travel just for that.)"] = "Cuando llegues a Selbina o Mhaura (y veas una escena de Rhapsodies), abre el mapa y ve directo al Home Point. Úsalo para no tener que volver a hacer el camino. ¡Ahora puedes teletransportarte a tu ciudad si necesitas comprar algo! (Si quieres cambiar de job o necesitas algo de tu Mog House que no sea el Storage, puedes hacerlo hablando con el Nomad Moogle de al lado, así que no hace falta viajar solo para eso.)",
    ["Once you bring him the item, you are given the option to choose a Fewell element. He crafts it for you while explaining the crafting process."] = "Cuando le traes el objeto, te dan la opción de elegir un elemento de Fewell. Te lo fabrica mientras te explica el proceso de fabricación.",
    ["Once you cast your first Trust, you will complete that RoE objective and unlock the next objective in the category, Alter Ego: Valaineral."] = "Cuando lances tu primer Trust, completarás ese objetivo de RoE y desbloquearás el siguiente de la categoría, Alter Ego: Valaineral.",
    ["Once you complete LB3, your new level cap will be 65."] = "Cuando completes la LB3, tu nuevo límite de nivel será 65.",
    ["Once you complete this quest, you unlock the first of the Aht Urhgan missions. You can get through Mission 11 without any combat."] = "Al completar esta quest desbloqueas la primera de las misiones de Aht Urhgan. Puedes llegar a la Mission 11 sin combatir.",
    ["Once you do, they will automatically and silently appear in your trust list. They will vanish again if you don't gain 5,000 Accolades for two weeks in a row, but reappear again when you meet the requirements again."] = "Cuando lo hagas, aparecerá automáticamente y sin aviso en tu lista de trusts. Desaparecerá de nuevo si no ganas 5,000 Accolades dos semanas seguidas, pero volverá cuando vuelvas a cumplir los requisitos.",
    ["Once you enter Abyssea, head back out the way you came, go back to Port Jeuno, and talk to Joachim again. Now your traverser stone accumulation timer has started ticking (at a rate of one stone per sixteen IRL hours) and you can ignore Abyssea until you actually care about it!"] = "Cuando entres en Abyssea, sal por donde viniste, vuelve a Port Jeuno y habla de nuevo con Joachim. Tu temporizador de traverser stones ya está en marcha (a razón de una piedra cada dieciséis horas reales) ¡y puedes olvidarte de Abyssea hasta que de verdad te interese!",
    ["Once you get the cutscene in Kuftal Tunnel, return to Datta for your reward, 8,000 gil, and the title Kuftal Tourist. You can watch the cutscene again with the Goblin Footprint after returning to Datta."] = "Cuando veas la escena en Kuftal Tunnel, vuelve con Datta por tu recompensa, 8,000 gil, y el título Kuftal Tourist. Puedes volver a ver la escena con el Goblin Footprint después de volver con Datta.",
    ["Once you get the items, trade them to the sick chocobo and receive the Chocobo license key item. This license... lets you buy Chocobo rides from vendors, FF6-style. One ride per purchase, and the instant you dismount (or after 20 minutes) it's gone. It's useless, but it's a prerequisite to the real deal!"] = "Cuando tengas los objetos, entrégaselos al chocobo enfermo y recibe el key item Chocobo license. Esta licencia... te permite comprar paseos en chocobo a los vendedores, al estilo de FF6. Un paseo por compra, y en cuanto desmontas (o a los 20 minutos) se acaba. Es inútil, ¡pero es requisito para lo de verdad!",
    ["Once you have all 7 colors, Carbuncle appears in a cutscene and sends you to La Theine Plateau."] = "Cuando tengas los 7 colores, Carbuncle aparece en una escena y te envía a La Theine Plateau.",
    ["Once you have completed your first objective, you will have unlocked access to a plethora of new ones. Re-open the Objective List and check it out. Get used to this system, because it is going to be a primary source of income throughout your adventure to 99, as well as a fantastic source of passive Experience Points. The sheer number of objectives can be overwhelming, and you can have 30 active at one time. Here are some recommended objectives to flag before you continue on outside:"] = "Cuando completes tu primer objetivo, habrás desbloqueado un montón de objetivos nuevos. Vuelve a abrir la Objective List y échale un vistazo. Acostúmbrate a este sistema, porque será una fuente principal de ingresos durante toda tu aventura hasta el 99, además de una fuente fantástica de Experience Points pasivos. La cantidad de objetivos puede abrumar, y puedes tener 30 activos a la vez. Estos son algunos objetivos recomendados para activar antes de salir:",
    ["Once you have finished Even More Gullible's Travels and received the scent, speak with Lulupp in Kazham (G-7) for a cutscene. The Opo-opo in Kazham love your new fragrance: bring them what they want, in the correct order, and they make you their king."] = "Cuando hayas terminado Even More Gullible's Travels y recibido el olor, habla con Lulupp en Kazham (G-7) para una escena. Los Opo-opo de Kazham adoran tu nueva fragancia: tráeles lo que quieren, en el orden correcto, y te harán su rey.",
    ["Once you have finished the battle, return to the Blank Target in The Shrine of Ru'Avitau to choose your reward: the key items Shard of Apathy, Shard of Arrogance, Shard of Cowardice, Shard of Envy and Shard of Rage, and one of the following earrings: Abyssal Earring, Beastly Earring, Bushinomimi, Knight's Earring or Suppanomimi."] = "Cuando termines la batalla, vuelve al Blank Target de The Shrine of Ru'Avitau para elegir tu recompensa: los key items Shard of Apathy, Shard of Arrogance, Shard of Cowardice, Shard of Envy y Shard of Rage, y uno de estos pendientes: Abyssal Earring, Beastly Earring, Bushinomimi, Knight's Earring o Suppanomimi.",
    ["Once you have fished up a Hydrogauge, trade it to Leleroon in Nashmau (G-7)."] = "Cuando hayas pescado un Hydrogauge, entrégaselo a Leleroon en Nashmau (G-7).",
    ["Once you have obtained competitive healer trusts - typically Monberaux or Ygnas, both of whom take RL months to get - consider switching to Sylvie (UC), the only Geomancer trust."] = "Cuando tengas trusts curanderos competitivos (normalmente Monberaux o Ygnas, que tardan meses reales en conseguirse), plantéate cambiar a Sylvie (UC), el único trust Geomancer.",
    ["Once you have one, trade it to Yazan for your reward, 350 gil."] = "Cuando tengas uno, entrégalo a Yazan para recibir tu recompensa, 350 gil.",
    ["Once you have spoken to all 20 people, return to Alib-Mufalib. He takes your Blue Sentinel badge and gives you a Blue invitation card."] = "Cuando hayas hablado con las 20 personas, vuelve con Alib-Mufalib. Se queda tu Blue Sentinel badge y te da una Blue invitation card.",
    ["Once you have spoken to all 20 people, return to Amutiyaal, who takes your Red Sentinel badge and gives you a Red invitation card."] = "Cuando hayas hablado con las 20 personas, vuelve con Amutiyaal, que se queda tu Red Sentinel badge y te da una Red invitation card.",
    ["Once you have spoken to all 20 people, return to Ibwam, who takes your Green Sentinel badge and gives you a Green invitation card."] = "Cuando hayas hablado con las 20 personas, vuelve con Ibwam, que se queda tu Green Sentinel badge y te da una Green invitation card.",
    ["Once you have the Cotton Gloves, trade them to Romilda to finish the quest and receive 2,000 gil."] = "Cuando tengas los Cotton Gloves, entrégaselos a Romilda para terminar la quest y recibir 2,000 gil.",
    ["Once you have the Rivernewort, return to Rouva for your reward, a Page from Miratete's Memoirs. Like other Experience Points scroll quests, it can be completed once per Conquest tally."] = "Cuando tengas el Rivernewort, vuelve con Rouva por tu recompensa, un Page from Miratete's Memoirs. Como otras quests de scrolls de Experience Points, se puede completar una vez por Conquest tally.",
    ["Once you have used a Rancor Flame, talk to Jakoh Wahcondalo in Kazham (J-9), who tells you to leave her village. The other NPCs in the room tell you to go to the Den of Rancor and Temple of Uggalepih complex to be cleansed and then come back. You get the title Excommunicate of Kazham as soon as the quest becomes active."] = "Una vez usada una Rancor Flame, habla con Jakoh Wahcondalo en Kazham (J-9), que te dice que abandones su aldea. Los demás NPCs de la sala te dicen que vayas al complejo del Den of Rancor y el Temple of Uggalepih para purificarte y luego vuelvas. Recibes el título Excommunicate of Kazham en cuanto la quest se activa.",
    ["Once you hit the Survival Guide in Zi'Tah, go all the way north to enter Ro'Maeve, then run north up the stairs to the zone line with a Guide there. (For some reason you can mount up in Ro'Maeve. So do that. Otherwise, Silent Oil is your friend here, since the enemies aggro both Sound and Magic.)"] = "Cuando toques la Survival Guide de Zi'Tah, ve todo al norte para entrar en Ro'Maeve y luego corre al norte subiendo las escaleras hasta el límite de zona, donde hay una Guide. (Por algún motivo puedes ir en montura en Ro'Maeve, así que hazlo. Si no, el Silent Oil es tu amigo aquí, ya que los enemigos detectan por sonido y por magia.)",
    ["Once you open the little menu, go to \"Sell\" and select your (single or full stack of 12, nothing in between) item to set a price - you'll see the history of the last ten sale prices for that item to give you an idea of what to set your price to."] = "Cuando abras el pequeño menú, ve a \"Sell\" y elige el objeto (uno suelto o un montón completo de 12, nada intermedio) para fijar un precio; verás el historial de los diez últimos precios de venta de ese objeto para hacerte una idea de qué precio poner.",
    ["Once you trade the Testimony to Maat, he asks if you are ready."] = "Cuando entregas el Testimony a Maat, te pregunta si estás listo.",
    ["Once you're Rank 3 and have completed Trust: Bastok, you can get the Ayame trust by talking to Ayame in Metalworks (K-7). She's not as good as Semih Lafihna for general purposes, but she opens skillchains for you. This is especially useful if you have Shantotto II, as this lets her Magic Burst more often."] = "Cuando seas Rank 3 y hayas completado Trust: Bastok, puedes conseguir el trust de Ayame hablando con Ayame en Metalworks (K-7). No es tan buena como Semih Lafihna en general, pero te abre skillchains. Es especialmente útil si tienes a Shantotto II, ya que así puede hacer Magic Burst más a menudo.",
    ["Once you're Rank 3, go to the \"Mog Dinghy\" in Port Bastok (K-11) / Port San d'Oria (I-8) / Port Windurst (C-8) and interact with it to be taken to your Mog Garden."] = "Cuando seas Rank 3, ve al \"Mog Dinghy\" de Port Bastok (K-11) / Port San d'Oria (I-8) / Port Windurst (C-8) e interactúa con él para que te lleve a tu Mog Garden.",
    ["Once you're good with movement and you've messed with settings to your heart's content, open your map (\"/map\" in chat, or \"Map\" in the - menu) and find the nearest blinking blue crystal, which is a Home Point:"] = "Cuando te manejes bien con el movimiento y hayas toqueteado la configuración a tu gusto, abre el mapa (\"/map\" en el chat, o \"Map\" en el menú -) y busca el cristal azul parpadeante más cercano, que es un Home Point:",
    ["Once you're level 10, zoning into your Mog House and talking to your Moogle will start the A Moogle Kupo d'Etat missions. Just so you're not wondering why you got that cutscene. Also, while you're in your Mog House, feel free to drop things off in your Mog Safe."] = "Cuando seas nivel 10, entrar en tu Mog House y hablar con tu Moogle empezará las misiones de A Moogle Kupo d'Etat. Te lo digo para que no te preguntes por qué ves esa escena. Además, ya que estás en tu Mog House, deja cosas en tu Mog Safe si quieres.",
    ["Once you're level 30, you can - and immediately should - start the Abyssea storyline. Zone into Port Jeuno on your level 30 job for a cutscene, then talk to Joachim at H-8. After this, you have to enter Abyssea exactly once to start the traverser stone accumulation timer. The fastest way to do this is to teleport to the Valkurm Dunes Survival Guide and examine the nearby Cavernous Maw at I-9 to the southeast."] = "Cuando seas nivel 30, puedes (y deberías hacerlo enseguida) empezar la historia de Abyssea. Entra en Port Jeuno con tu job de nivel 30 para una escena y luego habla con Joachim en H-8. Después tienes que entrar en Abyssea exactamente una vez para que empiece el temporizador de acumulación de traverser stones. Lo más rápido es teletransportarte a la Survival Guide de Valkurm Dunes y examinar el Cavernous Maw cercano de I-9, al sureste.",
    ["Once you're level 60, consider taking a break. Your friendly Sparks vendor no longer offers you armor options for levels 50 and beyond - and I bet you're a fashion disaster too. Let's change that. It's time for Artifact Armor, or \"AF\":"] = "Cuando seas nivel 60, plantéate hacer una pausa. Tu amable vendedor de Sparks ya no te ofrece armaduras de nivel 50 en adelante, y apuesto a que vas hecho un desastre. Vamos a cambiar eso. Es hora del Artifact Armor, o \"AF\":",
    ["Once you're ready to continue leveling - ideally after a quick trip to spend some Sparks on a new weapon and some armor - grab Signet from one of the guards near the Jeuno exit gates."] = "Cuando estés listo para seguir subiendo de nivel (idealmente tras un viaje rápido para gastar Sparks en un arma nueva y algo de armadura), consigue Signet de uno de los guardias de las puertas de salida de Jeuno.",
    ["Once you've completed the level 52 quest for the hands, \"Borghertz's [adjective] Hands\", you can also open two additional coffers in the zones indicated for the leg and body pieces."] = "Cuando completes la quest de nivel 52 de las manos, \"Borghertz's [adjetivo] Hands\", también podrás abrir dos cofres más en las zonas indicadas para las piernas y el cuerpo.",
    ["Once you've gotten comfortable with running around, maybe talked to some NPCs, possibly traded (use the - menu and select \"Trade\" once you have targeted them) the appropriate NPC your alt=Adventurer Coupon for a measly 50 gil, it's time to start playing in earnest."] = "Cuando ya te muevas con soltura, quizá hayas hablado con algunos NPCs y puede que hayas entregado (usa el menú - y elige \"Trade\" tras seleccionarlos) tu Adventurer Coupon al NPC adecuado por unos míseros 50 gil, es hora de empezar a jugar en serio.",
    ["Once your Scholar is level 5 or higher, speak with Erlene (J-8) again while on Scholar to learn Embrava and Kaustra (these spells have no scrolls)."] = "Cuando tu Scholar sea de nivel 5 o superior, habla de nuevo con Erlene (J-8) siendo Scholar para aprender Embrava y Kaustra (estos hechizos no tienen pergamino).",
    ["One Mammet-800 appears per 2 alliance members (up to 9). They have the abilities of Mammet-19 Epsilon from Promathia Mission 2-5, scaled up; Yellow Liquid (0-3 drop from each) still locks one into its current form. They change stance when someone enters the grassy arena and attack a minute later. The fight ends when the last one dies."] = "Aparece un Mammet-800 por cada 2 miembros de la alianza (hasta 9). Tienen las habilidades del Mammet-19 Epsilon de la Promathia Mission 2-5, potenciadas; el Yellow Liquid (cada uno suelta de 0 a 3) sigue bloqueando a uno en su forma actual. Cambian de postura cuando alguien entra en la arena de hierba y atacan un minuto después. La pelea termina cuando muere el último.",
    ["One exception: there are limited-time objectives that change once every 4 real-life hours; like \"Vanquish Vermin\" or \"Open Treasure Caskets\". These automatically activate themselves and don't count towards your limit of 30 active objectives. These objectives are, for the most part, not worth your time to pursue. The only special case is \"Gain Experience Points\", which is a fantastic way to earn extra experience and farm Sparks at the same time. (It rewards an additional 1,500 experience and 300 sparks every time you earn 5,000 experience.)"] = "Una excepción: hay objetivos temporales que cambian cada 4 horas reales, como \"Vanquish Vermin\" u \"Open Treasure Caskets\". Se activan solos y no cuentan para tu límite de 30 objetivos activos. Estos objetivos, en general, no merecen tu tiempo. El único caso especial es \"Gain Experience Points\", que es una forma fantástica de ganar experiencia extra y farmear Sparks a la vez. (Da 1,500 de experiencia y 300 sparks extra cada vez que ganas 5,000 de experiencia.)",
    ["One signature each for just talking to: Aissaville (I-7), Illeuse (H-9), Daigraffeaux (I-11), Andagge (H-9), Louxiard (G-7), Machionage (C-6), Remiotte (L-10), Elnonde (K-9), Loillie (K-9) and Mailleronce (M-6)."] = "Una firma cada uno solo por hablar con ellos: Aissaville (I-7), Illeuse (H-9), Daigraffeaux (I-11), Andagge (H-9), Louxiard (G-7), Machionage (C-6), Remiotte (L-10), Elnonde (K-9), Loillie (K-9) y Mailleronce (M-6).",
    ["Only Count Bifrons (black magic, Sleepga II) has to die. Sleep the Orcs at the start."] = "Solo hay que matar al Count Bifrons (magia negra, Sleepga II). Duerme a los Orcs al principio.",
    ["Only Count Halphas has to die; the Dark Demons vanish with him. The Demons can be slept with Sleepga, Halphas can't."] = "Solo hay que matar al Count Halphas; los Dark Demons desaparecen con él. A los Demons se les puede dormir con Sleepga, a Halphas no.",
    ["Only Fangmonger Colossus must die; each of the 6 Tombstones you kill weakens its damage resistance. They use Seismostomp and Numbing Glare (conal paralysis) and are slow, so kite them while curing Excenmille and Maxcimille (Bostillette joins later)."] = "Solo hay que matar a Fangmonger Colossus; cada una de las 6 Tombstones que mates debilita su resistencia al daño. Usan Seismostomp y Numbing Glare (parálisis cónica) y son lentas, así que pasealas mientras curas a Excenmille y Maxcimille (Bostillette se une más tarde).",
    ["Only one of the three body armors may be owned at a time."] = "Solo se puede tener una de las tres armaduras de cuerpo a la vez.",
    ["Only one of them needs to be killed, so a recommended strategy is to zone to Den of Rancor and fight one while the others despawn."] = "Solo hace falta matar a uno, así que una estrategia recomendada es cambiar de zona a Den of Rancor y luchar contra uno mientras los otros desaparecen.",
    ["Only the Primogenial Marolith has to die. Gargouille Drudges keep arriving one at a time from behind it, but they have little HP."] = "Solo hay que matar al Primogenial Marolith. Los Gargouille Drudges siguen llegando de uno en uno desde detrás de él, pero tienen poco HP.",
    ["Open Oaken Door (K-8) and speak with Gilgamesh (L-8) about the Mithra carrying a mysterious crystal."] = "Abre la Oaken Door (K-8) y habla con Gilgamesh (L-8) sobre la Mithra que lleva un cristal misterioso.",
    ["Open a treasure chest using either the key or Thief's Tools to obtain the key item Fei'Yin magic tome."] = "Abre un treasure chest con la llave o con Thief's Tools para obtener el key item Fei'Yin magic tome.",
    ["Open the Door: Prince Regent's Rm in Chateau d'Oraguille at (H-8) to start the quest. You can continue as any job from this point."] = "Abre la Door: Prince Regent's Rm en Chateau d'Oraguille en (H-8) para empezar la quest. Desde este punto puedes continuar con cualquier trabajo.",
    ["Open the large Brass Door by lighting the unlit Torch in one of the four corner rooms, then solve the Brass Statue's password to open the trap door and drop down."] = "Abre la gran Brass Door encendiendo la Torch apagada de una de las cuatro salas de las esquinas, y luego resuelve la contraseña de la Brass Statue para abrir la trampilla y déjate caer.",
    ["Open the main menu and select Quests. Under Records of Eminence, go to Objective List > Tutorial > Basics and set the objective First Step Forward."] = "Abre el menú principal y elige Quests. En Records of Eminence, ve a Objective List > Tutorial > Basics y fija el objetivo First Step Forward.",
    ["Open your Temporary Key Items and examine the Piece of evidence to see the cipher."] = "Abre tus Temporary Key Items y examina la Piece of evidence para ver el cifrado.",
    ["Open your menu, go to the second page, select \"Quests\", and go to the full list of \"Records of Eminence\". These are small quests with surprisingly big rewards added relatively late in FFXI's life. Since they were added so late, they're hidden away here, but they're a big deal. You will have done a lot of them by the time you're level 99."] = "Abre el menú, ve a la segunda página, elige \"Quests\" y ve a la lista completa de \"Records of Eminence\". Son pequeñas quests con recompensas sorprendentemente grandes que se añadieron bastante tarde en la vida de FFXI. Como se añadieron tan tarde están escondidas aquí, pero son muy importantes. Habrás hecho un montón cuando llegues a nivel 99.",
    ["Optional hints: Luuh Koplehn, Bonchacha and Maan-Pokuun outside; Maan-Pokuun sends you to Yoran-Oran, and once Tokaka (fishing guild) says Yoran-Oran had one, Yoran-Oran names the Maze of Shakhrami."] = "Pistas opcionales: Luuh Koplehn, Bonchacha y Maan-Pokuun fuera; Maan-Pokuun te envía a Yoran-Oran, y cuando Tokaka (gremio de pesca) dice que Yoran-Oran tenía uno, Yoran-Oran menciona Maze of Shakhrami.",
    ["Optional memories (worth seeing; Memorian activates): Honoi-Gomoi upstairs at the back of the Trader's Home, Windurst Waters (E-7); Dancing Wolf (G-7) and Rahi Fohlatti (G-9) in Rabao; Ghatsad in Whitegate (I-7); zoning into Palborough Mines from North Gustaberg; plus Halver and Rahal during the next mission. Then return the Depleted Memorian to Shantotto."] = "Recuerdos opcionales (merecen la pena; Memorian se activa): Honoi-Gomoi arriba, al fondo del Trader's Home, Windurst Waters (E-7); Dancing Wolf (G-7) y Rahi Fohlatti (G-9) en Rabao; Ghatsad en Whitegate (I-7); entrar en Palborough Mines desde North Gustaberg; y Halver y Rahal durante la misión siguiente. Luego devuelve el Depleted Memorian a Shantotto.",
    ["Optional, any time before Both Paths Taken: extra cutscenes play by re-entering Alzadaal Undersea Ruins (all Aht Urhgan missions done), entering The Shrouded Maw (after Promathia 3-5), and reaching the bottom of The Garden of Ru'Hmet (all Promathia missions done)."] = "Opcional, en cualquier momento antes de Both Paths Taken: hay escenas extra al volver a entrar en Alzadaal Undersea Ruins (con todas las misiones de Aht Urhgan hechas), al entrar en The Shrouded Maw (tras Promathia 3-5) y al llegar al fondo de The Garden of Ru'Hmet (con todas las misiones de Promathia hechas).",
    ["Optional, for the title: speak with Romualdo in the present, then with Childerich, and choose \"Message on the Wind\"."] = "Opcional, para el título: habla con Romualdo en el presente, luego con Childerich, y elige \"Message on the Wind\".",
    ["Optional: Cornelia's door, behind President Karst, is no longer locked; examine it for a cutscene. You can return for a different one after Beauty and the Galka, Fallen Comrades and Rivals."] = "Opcional: la puerta de Cornelia, detrás de President Karst, ya no está cerrada; examínala para una escena. Puedes volver para otra distinta tras Beauty and the Galka, Fallen Comrades y Rivals.",
    ["Optional: Drake Fang in Zeruhn Mines (H-6) points you south."] = "Opcional: Drake Fang en Zeruhn Mines (H-6) te indica que vayas al sur.",
    ["Optional: Elysia (G-10) on the main floor starts the quest Unforgiven, which rewards a map of Tavnazian Safehold."] = "Opcional: Elysia (G-10), en el piso principal, empieza la quest Unforgiven, que da como recompensa un mapa de Tavnazian Safehold.",
    ["Optional: Guslam mentions more armor scattered about Vana'diel. With Bard as your main job, open the Treasure Coffer in Crawlers' Nest for the Choral Roundlet, and the one in Castle Oztroja for the Choral Cannions, each with that zone's coffer key. The quest must be active or completed, but these are not needed to complete it."] = "Opcional: Guslam menciona más armadura repartida por Vana'diel. Con Bard como job principal, abre el Treasure Coffer de Crawlers' Nest para el Choral Roundlet y el de Castle Oztroja para los Choral Cannions, cada uno con la coffer key de esa zona. La quest debe estar activa o completada, pero no son necesarios para completarla.",
    ["Optional: Guslam mentions more armor scattered about Vana'diel. With Beastmaster as your main job, open the Treasure Coffer in Garlaige Citadel for the Beast Helm, and the one in Beadeaux for the Beast Jackcoat, each with that zone's coffer key. The quest must be active or completed, but these are not needed to complete it."] = "Opcional: Guslam menciona más armadura repartida por Vana'diel. Con Beastmaster como job principal, abre el Treasure Coffer de Garlaige Citadel para el Beast Helm y el de Beadeaux para el Beast Jackcoat, cada uno con la coffer key de esa zona. La quest debe estar activa o completada, pero no son necesarios para completarla.",
    ["Optional: Guslam mentions more armor scattered about Vana'diel. With Black Mage as your main job, open the Treasure Coffer in Davoi's Monastic Cavern for the Wizard's Coat, and the one in The Eldieme Necropolis for the Wizard's Tonban, each with that zone's coffer key. The quest must be active or completed, but these are not needed to complete it."] = "Opcional: Guslam menciona más armadura repartida por Vana'diel. Con Black Mage como job principal, abre el Treasure Coffer de Davoi's Monastic Cavern para el Wizard's Coat y el de The Eldieme Necropolis para el Wizard's Tonban, cada uno con la coffer key de esa zona. La quest debe estar activa o completada, pero no son necesarios para completarla.",
    ["Optional: Guslam mentions more armor scattered about Vana'diel. With Dark Knight as your main job, open the Treasure Coffer in Davoi's Monastic Cavern for the Chaos Flanchard, and the one in Castle Oztroja for the Chaos Cuirass, each with that zone's coffer key. The quest must be active or completed, but these are not needed to complete it."] = "Opcional: Guslam menciona más armadura repartida por Vana'diel. Con Dark Knight como job principal, abre el Treasure Coffer de Davoi's Monastic Cavern para el Chaos Flanchard y el de Castle Oztroja para el Chaos Cuirass, cada uno con la coffer key de esa zona. La quest debe estar activa o completada, pero no son necesarios para completarla.",
    ["Optional: Guslam mentions more armor scattered about Vana'diel. With Dragoon as your main job, open the Treasure Coffer in Ifrit's Cauldron for the Drachen Mail, and the one in Quicksand Caves for the Drachen Greaves, each with that zone's coffer key. The quest must be active or completed, but these are not needed to complete it."] = "Opcional: Guslam menciona más armadura repartida por Vana'diel. Con Dragoon como job principal, abre el Treasure Coffer de Ifrit's Cauldron para el Drachen Mail y el de Quicksand Caves para las Drachen Greaves, cada uno con la coffer key de esa zona. La quest debe estar activa o completada, pero no son necesarios para completarla.",
    ["Optional: Guslam mentions more armor scattered about Vana'diel. With Monk as your main job, open the Treasure Coffer in Garlaige Citadel for the Temple Crown, and the one in Beadeaux for the Temple Cyclas, each with that zone's coffer key. The quest must be active or completed, but these are not needed to complete it."] = "Opcional: Guslam menciona más armadura repartida por Vana'diel. Con Monk como job principal, abre el Treasure Coffer de Garlaige Citadel para la Temple Crown y el de Beadeaux para la Temple Cyclas, cada uno con la coffer key de esa zona. La quest debe estar activa o completada, pero no son necesarios para completarla.",
    ["Optional: Guslam mentions more armor scattered about Vana'diel. With Ninja as your main job, open the Treasure Coffer in Sea Serpent Grotto for the Ninja Kyahan, and the one in The Boyahda Tree for the Ninja Hatsuburi, each with that zone's coffer key. The quest must be active or completed, but these are not needed to complete it. The Sea Serpent Grotto coffers are all past the Mythril Door, on Map 3: examine the door until it mentions mythril dust in the indentation, then trade it a Mythril Beastcoin. The Grotto Coffer Key drops from enemies past that door, and the Boyahda Coffer Key from enemies in The Boyahda Tree."] = "Opcional: Guslam menciona más armadura repartida por Vana'diel. Con Ninja como job principal, abre el Treasure Coffer de Sea Serpent Grotto para el Ninja Kyahan y el de The Boyahda Tree para el Ninja Hatsuburi, cada uno con la coffer key de esa zona. La quest debe estar activa o completada, pero no son necesarios para completarla. Los cofres de Sea Serpent Grotto están todos pasada la Mythril Door, en el mapa 3: examina la puerta hasta que mencione polvo de mithril en la hendidura y entrégale una Mythril Beastcoin. La Grotto Coffer Key la sueltan los enemigos tras esa puerta, y la Boyahda Coffer Key los enemigos de The Boyahda Tree.",
    ["Optional: Guslam mentions more armor scattered about Vana'diel. With Paladin as your main job, open the Treasure Coffer in Garlaige Citadel for the Gallant Coronet, and the one in Beadeaux for the Gallant Breeches, each with that zone's coffer key. The quest must be active or completed, but these are not needed to complete it."] = "Opcional: Guslam menciona más armadura repartida por Vana'diel. Con Paladin como job principal, abre el Treasure Coffer de Garlaige Citadel para el Gallant Coronet y el de Beadeaux para los Gallant Breeches, cada uno con la coffer key de esa zona. La quest debe estar activa o completada, pero no son necesarios para completarla.",
    ["Optional: Guslam mentions more armor scattered about Vana'diel. With Ranger as your main job, open the Treasure Coffer in Crawlers' Nest for the Hunter's Braccae, and the one in Davoi's Monastic Cavern for the Hunter's Jerkin, each with that zone's coffer key. The quest must be active or completed, but these are not needed to complete it."] = "Opcional: Guslam menciona más armadura repartida por Vana'diel. Con Ranger como job principal, abre el Treasure Coffer de Crawlers' Nest para las Hunter's Braccae y el de Davoi's Monastic Cavern para el Hunter's Jerkin, cada uno con la coffer key de esa zona. La quest debe estar activa o completada, pero no son necesarios para completarla.",
    ["Optional: Guslam mentions more armor scattered about Vana'diel. With Red Mage as your main job, open the Treasure Coffer in Garlaige Citadel for the Warlock's Tights, and the one in Castle Oztroja for the Warlock's Tabard, each with that zone's coffer key. The quest must be active or completed, but these are not needed to complete it. In Castle Oztroja the four-lever Brass Gate combination changes every game day."] = "Opcional: Guslam menciona más armadura repartida por Vana'diel. Con Red Mage como job principal, abre el Treasure Coffer de Garlaige Citadel para las Warlock's Tights y el de Castle Oztroja para el Warlock's Tabard, cada uno con la coffer key de esa zona. La quest debe estar activa o completada, pero no son necesarios para completarla. En Castle Oztroja la combinación de las cuatro palancas de la Brass Gate cambia cada día de juego.",
    ["Optional: Guslam mentions more armor scattered about Vana'diel. With Samurai as your main job, open the Treasure Coffer in the Temple of Uggalepih for the Myochin Domaru, and the one in Quicksand Caves for the Myochin Haidate, each with that zone's coffer key. The quest must be active or completed, but these are not needed to complete it."] = "Opcional: Guslam menciona más armadura repartida por Vana'diel. Con Samurai como job principal, abre el Treasure Coffer del Temple of Uggalepih para el Myochin Domaru y el de Quicksand Caves para el Myochin Haidate, cada uno con la coffer key de esa zona. La quest debe estar activa o completada, pero no son necesarios para completarla.",
    ["Optional: Guslam mentions more armor scattered about Vana'diel. With Summoner as your main job, open the Treasure Coffer in the Temple of Uggalepih for the Evoker's Doublet, and the one in Toraimarai Canal for the Evoker's Pigaches, each with that zone's coffer key. The quest must be active or completed, but these are not needed to complete it."] = "Opcional: Guslam menciona más armadura repartida por Vana'diel. Con Summoner como job principal, abre el Treasure Coffer del Temple of Uggalepih para el Evoker's Doublet y el de Toraimarai Canal para los Evoker's Pigaches, cada uno con la coffer key de esa zona. La quest debe estar activa o completada, pero no son necesarios para completarla.",
    ["Optional: Guslam mentions more armor scattered about Vana'diel. With Thief as your main job, open the Treasure Coffer in Castle Oztroja for the Rogue's Culottes, and the one in Castle Zvahl Baileys for the Rogue's Vest, each with that zone's coffer key. The quest must be active or completed, but these are not needed to complete it."] = "Opcional: Guslam menciona más armadura repartida por Vana'diel. Con Thief como job principal, abre el Treasure Coffer de Castle Oztroja para los Rogue's Culottes y el de Castle Zvahl Baileys para el Rogue's Vest, cada uno con la coffer key de esa zona. La quest debe estar activa o completada, pero no son necesarios para completarla.",
    ["Optional: Guslam mentions more armor scattered about Vana'diel. With Warrior as your main job, open the Treasure Coffer in Crawlers' Nest for the Fighter's Mask, and the one in Castle Zvahl Baileys for the Fighter's Cuisses, each with that zone's coffer key. The quest must be active or completed, but these are not needed to complete it."] = "Opcional: Guslam menciona más armadura repartida por Vana'diel. Con Warrior como job principal, abre el Treasure Coffer de Crawlers' Nest para la Fighter's Mask y el de Castle Zvahl Baileys para los Fighter's Cuisses, cada uno con la coffer key de esa zona. La quest debe estar activa o completada, pero no son necesarios para completarla.",
    ["Optional: Guslam mentions more armor scattered about Vana'diel. With White Mage as your main job, open the Treasure Coffer in Garlaige Citadel for the Healer's Cap, and the one in Crawlers' Nest for the Healer's Pantaloons, each with that zone's coffer key. The quest must be active or completed, but these are not needed to complete it."] = "Opcional: Guslam menciona más armadura repartida por Vana'diel. Con White Mage como job principal, abre el Treasure Coffer de Garlaige Citadel para el Healer's Cap y el de Crawlers' Nest para los Healer's Pantaloons, cada uno con la coffer key de esa zona. La quest debe estar activa o completada, pero no son necesarios para completarla.",
    ["Optional: Kerutoto in Windurst Waters (J-8) now offers Waking Dreams, which can unlock Diabolos as an avatar."] = "Opcional: Kerutoto en Windurst Waters (J-8) ofrece ahora Waking Dreams, que puede desbloquear a Diabolos como avatar.",
    ["Optional: after completing the quest you may trade Quelveuiat a Sealion Crest Key and a Coral Crest Key to obtain a Temple Knight key, which lets you open the large door to the inner part of Sacrarium at (H-7) solo."] = "Opcional: tras completar la quest puedes entregar a Quelveuiat una Sealion Crest Key y una Coral Crest Key para obtener una Temple Knight key, que te permite abrir tú solo la gran puerta de la parte interior de Sacrarium en (H-7).",
    ["Optional: cutscenes with Despachiaire (K-10), Parelbriaux (K-7) and Odeya (J-10) on the top floor of Tavnazian Safehold, Chasalvige in Northern San d'Oria (L-6) and Anoki in Port San d'Oria (H-6) give context and hints; none are required."] = "Opcional: las escenas con Despachiaire (K-10), Parelbriaux (K-7) y Odeya (J-10) en el último piso de Tavnazian Safehold, Chasalvige en Northern San d'Oria (L-6) y Anoki en Port San d'Oria (H-6) dan contexto y pistas; ninguna es obligatoria.",
    ["Optional: examine the Bloodstained Glove again after the fight."] = "Opcional: examina de nuevo el Bloodstained Glove tras la pelea.",
    ["Optional: examine the Dilapidated Gate in Misareaux Coast (I-11) for Trust: Ulmia, and after all the epilogue scenes, the Walnut Door (K-7) in Tavnazian Safehold for Trust: Prishe."] = "Opcional: examina la Dilapidated Gate de Misareaux Coast (I-11) para Trust: Ulmia y, tras todas las escenas del epílogo, la Walnut Door (K-7) de Tavnazian Safehold para Trust: Prishe.",
    ["Optional: go through the Sealed Portal at the Three Mage Gate in Inner Horutoto Ruins and examine the Gate of Earth at (I-7) for a cutscene. Quickest is the Toraimarai Canal Survival Guide, which puts you right outside that part of the ruins by the Gate of Earth (a Rhinostery Certificate also lets you through the Canal)."] = "Opcional: cruza el Sealed Portal de la Three Mage Gate en Inner Horutoto Ruins y examina la Gate of Earth en (I-7) para una escena. Lo más rápido es la Survival Guide de Toraimarai Canal, que te deja justo fuera de esa parte de las ruinas, junto a la Gate of Earth (un Rhinostery Certificate también te deja cruzar el Canal).",
    ["Optional: look to the sky around the Crag of Holla for the rainbow that appears when someone unlocks Summoner (if it's raining, it appears when the rain stops)."] = "Opcional: mira al cielo alrededor del Crag of Holla para ver el arcoíris que aparece cuando alguien desbloquea Summoner (si llueve, aparece cuando para la lluvia).",
    ["Optional: sell the Pungent providence pot to Ravorara in Port Bastok for 1,000 gil and a final cutscene."] = "Opcional: vende la Pungent providence pot a Ravorara en Port Bastok por 1,000 gil y una última escena.",
    ["Optional: show the Tattered test sheet to Chomoro-Kyotoro and Kirarara on top of the Windurst Waters Aurastery for extra dialogue."] = "Opcional: muestra la Tattered test sheet a Chomoro-Kyotoro y Kirarara en lo alto de la Aurastery de Windurst Waters para diálogo extra.",
    ["Optional: speak with Aldo at the Tenshodo in Lower Jeuno for a cutscene."] = "Opcional: habla con Aldo en el Tenshodo de Lower Jeuno para una escena.",
    ["Optional: speak with Aldo at the Tenshodo in Lower Jeuno."] = "Opcional: habla con Aldo en el Tenshodo de Lower Jeuno.",
    ["Optional: speak with Ardea again to try to get the stone back."] = "Opcional: habla de nuevo con Ardea para intentar recuperar la piedra.",
    ["Optional: speak with Arnau again after the Gate Guard for one more cutscene."] = "Opcional: habla de nuevo con Arnau tras el Gate Guard para una escena más.",
    ["Optional: speak with Cha Lebagta and Bopa Greso, just south of Nanaa Mihgo at (J-4), for a couple of clues."] = "Opcional: habla con Cha Lebagta y Bopa Greso, justo al sur de Nanaa Mihgo en (J-4), para un par de pistas.",
    ["Optional: speak with Fubruhn (F-11) about Mog Locker access."] = "Opcional: habla con Fubruhn (F-11) sobre el acceso al Mog Locker.",
    ["Optional: speak with Furakku-Norakku again at Orn's request."] = "Opcional: habla de nuevo con Furakku-Norakku a petición de Orn.",
    ["Optional: speak with Gaddiux at the Inventors' Coalition in Western Adoulin (J-10) about the blacksmith."] = "Opcional: habla con Gaddiux en la Inventors' Coalition de Western Adoulin (J-10) sobre el herrero.",
    ["Optional: speak with Gumbah (J-7) and Detzo (I-6) in Bastok Mines and Iron Eater in Bastok Metalworks for short cutscenes."] = "Opcional: habla con Gumbah (J-7) y Detzo (I-6) en Bastok Mines y con Iron Eater en Bastok Metalworks para escenas cortas.",
    ["Optional: speak with Hikkuku, Ewchichi, Bebibi, Yakuku, Damama and Abobo in the tower basement to hear their concerns about the trees, or with Shantotto in her mansion in Windurst Walls (K-7) for a reminder."] = "Opcional: habla con Hikkuku, Ewchichi, Bebibi, Yakuku, Damama y Abobo en el sótano de la torre para oír sus preocupaciones sobre los árboles, o con Shantotto en su mansión de Windurst Walls (K-7) para un recordatorio.",
    ["Optional: speak with Kaede afterwards for some closing dialogue."] = "Opcional: habla con Kaede después para un diálogo de cierre.",
    ["Optional: speak with Kupipi in Heavens Tower to receive an Earthen Charm."] = "Opcional: habla con Kupipi en Heavens Tower para recibir un Earthen Charm.",
    ["Optional: speak with Kuu Mohzolhi in Northern San d'Oria (F-8). She does not say it at first, but she would like a Marguerite."] = "Opcional: habla con Kuu Mohzolhi en Northern San d'Oria (F-8). Al principio no lo dice, pero le gustaría una Marguerite.",
    ["Optional: speak with Laityn in Ru'Lude Gardens (G-9) for a story cutscene and a hint on where to go."] = "Opcional: habla con Laityn en Ru'Lude Gardens (G-9) para una escena de la historia y una pista de adónde ir.",
    ["Optional: speak with Mataligeat for some extra dialogue about Lewenhart."] = "Opcional: habla con Mataligeat para un diálogo extra sobre Lewenhart.",
    ["Optional: speak with Mengrenaux and Chemioue, also in the Patrol HQ (J-6, third floor)."] = "Opcional: habla con Mengrenaux y Chemioue, también en el Patrol HQ (J-6, tercer piso).",
    ["Optional: speak with Nonterene (I-10) at the Parade Grounds near Victory Arch."] = "Opcional: habla con Nonterene (I-10) en el Parade Grounds cerca del Victory Arch.",
    ["Optional: speak with Offa in Bastok Markets (F-10), on the second floor behind the door on the left, for instructions on how to make the sausage."] = "Opcional: habla con Offa en Bastok Markets (F-10), en el segundo piso tras la puerta de la izquierda, para saber cómo hacer la salchicha.",
    ["Optional: speak with Ojha Rhawash in Windurst Walls (C-13). She does not say it at first, but she would like a Lilac."] = "Opcional: habla con Ojha Rhawash en Windurst Walls (C-13). Al principio no lo dice, pero le gustaría un Lilac.",
    ["Optional: speak with Otto and then Carmelo in the Steaming Sheep Restaurant, Port Bastok (E-6), for hints about the tear."] = "Opcional: habla con Otto y luego con Carmelo en el Steaming Sheep Restaurant, Port Bastok (E-6), para pistas sobre la lágrima.",
    ["Optional: speak with Ratihb again to start The Die Is Cast, which passes through the same key-locked area."] = "Opcional: habla de nuevo con Ratihb para empezar The Die Is Cast, que pasa por la misma zona cerrada con llave.",
    ["Optional: speak with Shalott in Upper Jeuno (G-7), outside the Chocobo Stables next to Mapitoto, for a cutscene."] = "Opcional: habla con Shalott en Upper Jeuno (G-7), fuera de los Chocobo Stables junto a Mapitoto, para una escena.",
    ["Optional: speak with Taillegeas in Ru'Lude Gardens (I-7, Dining Hall) to learn Trust: Cherukiki."] = "Opcional: habla con Taillegeas en Ru'Lude Gardens (I-7, Dining Hall) para aprender Trust: Cherukiki.",
    ["Optional: speak with Valah Molkot in Port Bastok (J-12). She does not say it at first, but she would like an Amaryllis."] = "Opcional: habla con Valah Molkot en Port Bastok (J-12). Al principio no lo dice, pero le gustaría una Amaryllis.",
    ["Optional: speak with Yoran-Oran (E-5) about the author of the thesis on alchemy, and with Shantotto (K-7) about alchemy."] = "Opcional: habla con Yoran-Oran (E-5) sobre el autor de la tesis de alquimia y con Shantotto (K-7) sobre alquimia.",
    ["Optional: speak with Zurko-Bazurko in Mhaura by the Proto-Waypoint for an extra cutscene; he asks for the Runic kinegraver."] = "Opcional: habla con Zurko-Bazurko en Mhaura, junto al Proto-Waypoint, para una escena extra; te pide el Runic kinegraver.",
    ["Optional: three more apparatuses give a Stone of unknown runic origins for three runes in order: Fei'Yin map 1 (G-6) Ignis, Tellus, Tenebrae; Ranguemont Pass (E-4) Flabra, Ignis, Lux; King Ranperre's Tomb map 2 (E-7) Gelus, Sulpor, Unda. These don't count toward the three. Each Stone adds 2,000 Bayld to your reward."] = "Opcional: otros tres aparatos dan una Stone of unknown runic origins con tres runas en orden: Fei'Yin mapa 1 (G-6) Ignis, Tellus, Tenebrae; Ranguemont Pass (E-4) Flabra, Ignis, Lux; King Ranperre's Tomb mapa 2 (E-7) Gelus, Sulpor, Unda. No cuentan para los tres. Cada Stone añade 2,000 Bayld a tu recompensa.",
    ["Optional: trade the Torn Epistle to Koru-Moru for 50 gil, although it is not necessary."] = "Opcional: entrega la Torn Epistle a Koru-Moru por 50 gil, aunque no es necesario.",
    ["Optional: visiting the Merchant's House in Lower Jeuno from now on gives a brief scene of their appreciation."] = "Opcional: a partir de ahora, visitar la Merchant's House de Lower Jeuno muestra una breve escena de agradecimiento.",
    ["Optional: while you are in Beadeaux, you can get the Quadav Charm and Quadav Augury Shell needed later for Mission 4-1."] = "Opcional: mientras estás en Beadeaux, puedes conseguir el Quadav Charm y la Quadav Augury Shell que necesitarás más adelante para la Mission 4-1.",
    ["Optional: you can try trading the button to Altiret. Guards and bystanders comment on the thief, but only these give hints: Crilde, Rielle and Avandale in Port San d'Oria, and Pepigort, Maurinne, Gilipese and Rodaillece in Northern San d'Oria."] = "Opcional: puedes intentar entregarle el botón a Altiret. Los guardias y los transeúntes comentan lo del ladrón, pero solo estos dan pistas: Crilde, Rielle y Avandale en Port San d'Oria, y Pepigort, Maurinne, Gilipese y Rodaillece en Northern San d'Oria.",
    ["Optional: zone into any starting city area with a Mog House entrance for a cutscene sending you to Ceizak Battlegrounds."] = "Opcional: entra en cualquier zona de una ciudad inicial con entrada a la Mog House para una escena que te envía a Ceizak Battlegrounds.",
    ["Or use Unity Warp (level 125) to Sea Serpent Grotto: go back northeast through the blank-named door at (M-5); the lake is straight ahead. Sneak helps, as the Mousse there aggro to sound."] = "O usa el Unity Warp (nivel 125) a Sea Serpent Grotto: vuelve al noreste por la puerta sin nombre de (M-5); el lago está justo delante. Sneak ayuda, ya que los Mousse de allí atacan por sonido.",
    ["Orange (clear skies): any outdoor area that isn't cloudy. Yellow (dust/sand): Konschtat Highlands, Tahrongi Canyon, Western/Eastern Altepa Desert (very common), Meriphataud Mountains, Valkurm Dunes, Sauromugue Champaign. Green (wind): La Theine Plateau (often right after rain), Tahrongi Canyon, Buburimu Peninsula, Cape Teriggan. Blue (rain): Pashhow Marshlands (very common), La Theine Plateau, Jugner Forest, Buburimu Peninsula, Yuhtunga/Yhoator Jungle (not Carpenters' Landing)."] = "Naranja (cielo despejado): cualquier zona exterior que no esté nublada. Amarillo (polvo/arena): Konschtat Highlands, Tahrongi Canyon, Western/Eastern Altepa Desert (muy común), Meriphataud Mountains, Valkurm Dunes, Sauromugue Champaign. Verde (viento): La Theine Plateau (a menudo justo después de llover), Tahrongi Canyon, Buburimu Peninsula, Cape Teriggan. Azul (lluvia): Pashhow Marshlands (muy común), La Theine Plateau, Jugner Forest, Buburimu Peninsula, Yuhtunga/Yhoator Jungle (no Carpenters' Landing).",
    ["Orcish crest: in Davoi, enter the Monastic Cavern at (H-11), exit it at (I-8), and go to the Wall of Banishing at the (J-9) entrance. A Crimson orb opens it (a partner's orb lets everyone through). Orcs near the wall aggro once Invisible drops and interrupt the prompt."] = "Orcish crest: en Davoi, entra en el Monastic Cavern por (H-11), sal por (I-8) y ve al Wall of Banishing de la entrada de (J-9). Un Crimson orb lo abre (el orbe de un compañero deja pasar a todos). Los Orcs junto al muro atacan en cuanto se va Invisible e interrumpen el mensaje.",
    ["Orcs/Sheep/Birds/Goblins/Crabs/Bats/Bees/Worms"] = "Orcs/Sheep/Birds/Goblins/Crabs/Bats/Bees/Worms",
    ["Orichalcumshell"] = "Orichalcumshell",
    ["Orichalcumshell aggro to sound but do not link. Aggro range increases at night. C-9"] = "Los Orichalcumshell atacan por sonido pero no se enlazan. Su alcance aumenta de noche. C-9",
    ["Other aggro:"] = "Otros que atacan:",
    ["Other categories for the first option include:"] = "Otras categorías para la primera opción son:",
    ["Other categories for the third option include:"] = "Otras categorías para la tercera opción son:",
    ["Other mounts are available from login campaigns and quests. (Personally, I'm fond of Omega and the cute lil' Xzomit.)"] = "Hay otras monturas en las campañas de conexión y en quests. (Personalmente, me gustan Omega y el monísimo Xzomit.)",
    ["Other weapons (and pets of players not using their Prime) deal 70% less and can't finish him; the last hit must come from a Prime Weapon. Chaos regenerates when idle and can Cure IV for 30,000+. When his HP first drops low it is hidden, Gurebu-Ougrebu and Medada fall and become Profane Circle fetters that cut his damage taken; kill them. Cornelia, Lehko Habhoka, Ragelise, Fickblix and Luzaf then arrive one at a time and absorb Black Sanctus (a doom counter) for you; fallen ones become fetters too."] = "Las demás armas (y las mascotas de los jugadores que no usan su Prime) hacen un 70% menos y no pueden rematarlo; el último golpe debe venir de una Prime Weapon. Chaos se regenera cuando está inactivo y puede usar Cure IV por más de 30,000. Cuando su HP baja por primera vez queda oculto, Gurebu-Ougrebu y Medada caen y se convierten en grilletes Profane Circle que reducen el daño que recibe; mátalos. Luego llegan de uno en uno Cornelia, Lehko Habhoka, Ragelise, Fickblix y Luzaf, que absorben por ti el Black Sanctus (un contador de doom); los que caen también se convierten en grilletes.",
    ["Otherwise reach Ra'Kaznar Inner Court first. Each Naakual you have beaten opens a shortcut through a Gates zone. Shortest first: Yumcax (Yorcia Weald, via Cirdas Caverns map 2), Tchakka (Foret de Hennetiel, via Dho Gates), Hurkan (Marjami Ravine, via Woh Gates), Achuka (Morimar Basalt Fields, via Moh Gates), Colkhab (Ceizak Battlegrounds, via Sih Gates), Kumhau (Woh Gates (D-8) to Outer Ra'Kaznar map 2, then the elevator at (I-8))."] = "Si no, llega antes a Ra'Kaznar Inner Court. Cada Naakual que hayas vencido abre un atajo por una zona Gates. Del más corto al más largo: Yumcax (Yorcia Weald, por el mapa 2 de Cirdas Caverns), Tchakka (Foret de Hennetiel, por Dho Gates), Hurkan (Marjami Ravine, por Woh Gates), Achuka (Morimar Basalt Fields, por Moh Gates), Colkhab (Ceizak Battlegrounds, por Sih Gates), Kumhau (Woh Gates (D-8) al mapa 2 de Outer Ra'Kaznar, y luego el ascensor de (I-8)).",
    ["Otherwise you need an Unlit Lantern (Rare, from Tonberry Jinxers in Yhoator Jungle, Tonberry Maledictors and Pursuers in the Temple of Uggalepih, or Tonberry Imprecators in the Den of Rancor). Without Unity Warp you also need the Paintbrush of souls to open the way from the Temple."] = "Si no, necesitas una Unlit Lantern (Rare, de los Tonberry Jinxers de Yhoator Jungle, los Tonberry Maledictors y Pursuers del Temple of Uggalepih o los Tonberry Imprecators de Den of Rancor). Sin Unity Warp también necesitas el Paintbrush of souls para abrir el paso desde el Temple.",
    ["Otherwise, bring Silent Oil, Prism Powder and a Paintbrush of Souls (yours or a party member's) to the Temple of Uggalepih. Go south at the first intersection, north at the next T-intersection and north again at the one after, which zones you into Yhoator Jungle; head west and south straight back into the Temple."] = "Si no, lleva Silent Oil, Prism Powder y un Paintbrush of Souls (tuyo o de un miembro del grupo) al Temple of Uggalepih. Ve al sur en el primer cruce, al norte en el siguiente cruce en T y de nuevo al norte en el siguiente, lo que te saca a Yhoator Jungle; ve al oeste y al sur directamente de vuelta al Temple.",
    ["Otherwise, go to the House of the Hero in Windurst Walls (G-3) and try to enter it for a cutscene."] = "Si no, ve a la House of the Hero en Windurst Walls (G-3) e intenta entrar para una escena.",
    ["Otherwise, the \"beginner\" path will be the easiest, as it tasks you with farming all six of the old subjob items."] = "Si no, el camino de \"principiante\" será el más fácil, ya que te pide farmear los seis objetos de subjob antiguos.",
    ["Outside Mamook(2) entrance."] = "Fuera de la entrada de Mamook(2).",
    ["Outside, follow the right wall north and then east to re-enter the Temple (exit 5, map 3), then follow the path south to the ??? at (G-9) to spawn Yallery Brown, a sapling weak to Fire and Dark. Defeat it and examine the ??? again for the key item Annals of Truth."] = "Fuera, sigue la pared derecha hacia el norte y luego al este para volver a entrar en el Temple (salida 5, mapa 3), y sigue el camino al sur hasta la ??? en (G-9) para hacer aparecer a Yallery Brown, un sapling débil a Fire y Dark. Derrótalo y examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener el key item Annals of Truth.",
    ["Ovinnik/Greater Cockatrice/Ladon"] = "Ovinnik/Greater Cockatrice/Ladon",
    ["Paladin PLD is the classic Sword and Shield knight, and the best tank for reducing physical damage or handling large numbers of enemies. Not only that, PLD can keep their party alive with surprisingly potent healing spells! It does tend to lack damage, however. Dark Knight DRK is all about offense! It hits slow and hard, and can sacrifice its own HP and defenses to power up its attacks. It also has a small suite of black magic spells to add some extra utility. DRKs mostly use Great Swords and Scythes. Beastmaster BST is the first dedicated pet job on the list. It can Charm enemies into doing the fighting for you (or use special Jug items to summon unique pets) - which can be very powerful and provide a wide array of damage and debuff options. The BST itself doesn't have as much going on, but can deal decent damage with one-handed Axes. Bard BRD is a dedicated support job, using a wide range of songs to provide powerful buffs to their party. They don't deal much damage on their own, but can drastically improve the damage of those around them - and have a few debuff songs to boot! They primarily wield one-handed Daggers. Ranger RNG spends its time standing back and tearing enemies up with ranged attacks from Bows, Crossbows, and even Guns. It provides very little party support beyond its damage - but wow, does it deal damage. That damage comes at a (literal) price, though, as you'll need to buy ammunition for your ranged attacks. Samurai SAM specializes in gaining lots of TP quickly. It can generate it out of thin air with Meditate and preserve it with Sekkanoki, letting you use Weapon Skills fast enough to Skillchain solo! SAMs are the only job to specialize in Great Katanas, though they can also use Bows for ranged attacks. Ninja NIN is a flexible job with a wide range of options. It can deal decent physical damage, and can cast Ninjutsu spells to add a bit of magic damage as well. It can also be a decent tank, as its Utsusemi ninjutsu allows it to automatically evade most attacks - even many single-target spells! It primarily dual-wields one-handed Katanas, and uses Shurikens for ranged attacks. Dragoon DRG gets a pet wyvern! Or is it a dragon...? Either way, it's mostly automated, so no need to worry about micromanaging. DRG is one of the more active jobs, with a variety of Jump abilities to generate TP very quickly. Its wyvern pet also can provide utility depending on your subjob - it can even heal! DRGs primarily wield two-handed Polearms, like spears and lances. Summoner SMNs can control the classic Final Fantasy summons (Shiva, Ifrit, etc) as pets. These summons can be difficult to attain, but are extremely powerful - providing a ton of damage, buffs, debuffs, and even other utility such as healing. However, much like in other classic FFs, SMN is easily the weakest physical class, relying entirely on the summon to do their dirty work for them. They wield two-handed Staves, but don't expect to be dealing much melee damage with them."] = "Paladin: PLD es el clásico caballero de espada y escudo, y el mejor tanque para reducir el daño físico o manejar muchos enemigos. Y no solo eso: ¡PLD puede mantener con vida a su grupo con hechizos de curación sorprendentemente potentes! Eso sí, suele quedarse corto de daño. Dark Knight: ¡DRK va de atacar! Golpea lento y fuerte, y puede sacrificar su propio HP y defensas para potenciar sus ataques. También tiene un pequeño repertorio de magia negra que añade algo de utilidad. Los DRK usan sobre todo Great Swords y Scythes. Beastmaster: BST es el primer job de mascotas de la lista. Puede encantar (Charm) a los enemigos para que luchen por ti (o usar objetos Jug especiales para invocar mascotas únicas), lo que puede ser muy potente y dar muchas opciones de daño y debilitamiento. El BST en sí no hace tanto, pero puede hacer un daño decente con Axes a una mano. Bard: BRD es un job de apoyo puro, que usa un amplio repertorio de canciones para dar buffs potentes a su grupo. No hacen mucho daño por sí mismos, pero pueden mejorar muchísimo el daño de quienes los rodean, ¡y además tienen algunas canciones de debilitamiento! Usan sobre todo Daggers a una mano. Ranger: RNG se dedica a quedarse atrás y destrozar enemigos con ataques a distancia con Bows, Crossbows e incluso Guns. Aporta muy poco apoyo al grupo aparte de su daño, pero vaya si hace daño. Ese daño tiene un precio (literal), eso sí, ya que tendrás que comprar munición para tus ataques a distancia. Samurai: SAM se especializa en ganar mucho TP rápido. Puede generarlo de la nada con Meditate y conservarlo con Sekkanoki, ¡lo que te permite usar Weapon Skills lo bastante rápido como para hacer Skillchains en solitario! Los SAM son el único job especializado en Great Katanas, aunque también pueden usar Bows para atacar a distancia. Ninja: NIN es un job flexible con muchas opciones. Puede hacer un daño físico decente y lanzar Ninjutsu para añadir algo de daño mágico. También puede ser un tanque decente, ya que su ninjutsu Utsusemi le permite esquivar automáticamente la mayoría de los ataques, ¡incluso muchos hechizos de un solo objetivo! Usa sobre todo dos Katanas a una mano y Shurikens para atacar a distancia. Dragoon: ¡DRG tiene un wyvern de mascota! ¿O es un dragón...? En cualquier caso, es casi automático, así que no hay que preocuparse de controlarlo al detalle. DRG es uno de los jobs más activos, con varias habilidades de Jump para generar TP muy rápido. Su wyvern también puede aportar utilidad según tu subjob: ¡incluso puede curar! Los DRG usan sobre todo Polearms a dos manos, como lanzas y picas. Summoner: los SMN pueden controlar como mascotas las invocaciones clásicas de Final Fantasy (Shiva, Ifrit, etc.). Estas invocaciones pueden costar de conseguir, pero son potentísimas: dan muchísimo daño, buffs, debilitamientos e incluso otra utilidad como la curación. Sin embargo, igual que en otros FF clásicos, SMN es con diferencia la clase física más débil, y depende por completo de su invocación para hacer el trabajo sucio. Usan Staves a dos manos, pero no esperes hacer mucho daño cuerpo a cuerpo con ellos.",
    ["Part 2: a Wyvern and a Manticore, fought alongside Ajido-Marujido. If he dies you lose, so keep him cured and pull the NMs off him."] = "Parte 2: un Wyvern y una Manticore, contra los que luchas junto a Ajido-Marujido. Si muere pierdes, así que mantenlo curado y apártale a los NMs.",
    ["Participate in a Campaign battle at a stronghold of Bastok. The objective is complete when you receive an Objective Completed message and are told to report back."] = "Participa en una Campaign battle en una fortaleza de Bastok. El objetivo se completa cuando recibes el mensaje Objective Completed y te dicen que informes.",
    ["Participate in a Campaign battle at a stronghold of San d'Oria. The objective is complete when you receive an Objective Completed message and are told to report back."] = "Participa en una Campaign battle en una fortaleza de San d'Oria. El objetivo se completa cuando recibes el mensaje Objective Completed y te dicen que informes.",
    ["Participate in a Campaign battle at a stronghold of Windurst. The objective is complete when you receive an Objective Completed message and are told to report back."] = "Participa en una Campaign battle en una fortaleza de Windurst. El objetivo se completa cuando recibes el mensaje Objective Completed y te dicen que informes.",
    ["Pass the first brazier room (first ???) to an identical room down the hall (second ???), follow the only path west and north through the large grave room and up the stairs, to the last brazier room with the third ???."] = "Pasa la primera sala del brasero (primera ???) hasta una sala idéntica al fondo del pasillo (segunda ???), sigue el único camino al oeste y al norte por la gran sala de tumbas y sube las escaleras hasta la última sala del brasero, con la tercera ???.",
    ["Pass through the colored walls at (H-7) and (I-7) in this order: Red, Black/Purple, Red, Black/Purple."] = "Atraviesa las paredes de colores en (H-7) y (I-7) en este orden: Red, Black/Purple, Red, Black/Purple.",
    ["Pass through the eastern Cracked Wall and examine the Gate: Magical Gizmo for the event."] = "Atraviesa la Cracked Wall del este y examina la Gate: Magical Gizmo para el evento.",
    ["Pass through the first yellow door at (J-7), then continue west through the second yellow door to reach the room with the two Monoliths at (H-7)."] = "Atraviesa la primera puerta amarilla en (J-7), luego continúa al oeste por la segunda puerta amarilla hasta la sala de los dos Monoliths en (H-7).",
    ["Pass through the gate and continue to the shimmering light at the far end."] = "Atraviesa la puerta y continúa hasta la luz brillante del fondo.",
    ["Pass through the weighted door at (K-8) and continue to the next area."] = "Atraviesa la puerta de peso en (K-8) y continúa hasta la siguiente zona.",
    ["Past Map 2 (E) at the rock that will occasionally block your path."] = "Pasado el mapa 2 (E), en la roca que a veces bloquea el camino.",
    ["Past Sins: travel to Tavnazian Safehold and speak with Despachiaire (K-10), then travel to Windurst Woods and speak with Perih Vashai at (K-7)."] = "Past Sins: viaja a Tavnazian Safehold y habla con Despachiaire (K-10), luego viaja a Windurst Woods y habla con Perih Vashai en (K-7).",
    ["Past a Yagudo High Priest (true sight), trade the Judgment Key to the smaller Brass Door on the platform. The key is used up, so make sure your whole party goes through before it closes."] = "Pasado un Yagudo High Priest (true sight), entrega la Judgment Key a la Brass Door más pequeña de la plataforma. La llave se gasta, así que asegúrate de que todo tu grupo pase antes de que se cierre.",
    ["Past the door, take the right fork to Wooden Gate (G-8) at (G-8) for a cutscene."] = "Tras la puerta, toma el ramal derecho hasta la Wooden Gate (G-8) en (G-8) para una escena.",
    ["Past the gate she heads to (F-8) by the north or south path and stops there on her own. Speak with her quickly for the Completion certificate; if she disappears first, you get no credit."] = "Pasada la puerta va hacia (F-8) por el camino norte o el sur y se detiene allí sola. Habla con ella rápidamente para obtener el Completion certificate; si desaparece antes, no se te cuenta.",
    ["Past the gate, touch the Home Point to unlock it, then zone into the Sacrificial Chamber and examine the door to enter the battlefield \"The Temple of Uggalepih\". Buff inside, as buffs wear off on entering."] = "Tras la puerta, toca el Home Point para desbloquearlo, entra en la Sacrificial Chamber y examina la puerta para entrar en el campo de batalla \"The Temple of Uggalepih\". Poténciate dentro, ya que los buffs se pierden al entrar.",
    ["Past the guardian's door, head north to the paintings room at (I-7) and use a Paintbrush of souls to enter the Den of Rancor."] = "Pasada la puerta del guardián, ve al norte a la sala de los cuadros en (I-7) y usa un Paintbrush of souls para entrar en Den of Rancor.",
    ["Past the rock that will occasionally block your path."] = "Pasada la roca que a veces bloquea el camino.",
    ["Pay close attention to the leeches (or use /check) as there is a blue-skinned leech NM Bloodsucker (Notorious Monster) that spawns."] = "Fíjate bien en las sanguijuelas (o usa /check), ya que aparece un NM sanguijuela de piel azul, Bloodsucker (Notorious Monster).",
    ["Perform well to complete the quest and receive your Dancer's Casaque."] = "Actúa bien para completar la quest y recibir tu Dancer's Casaque.",
    ["Personally, I am very lazy, so now that I have Trusts, I'd streamline summoning them with macros! Hold Ctrl or Alt to see your macro bars, or L2/R2 for controllers. Now let go of that button and go edit them under \"Macros\" in the - menu."] = "Personalmente soy muy vago, así que ahora que tengo Trusts, ¡agilizaría su invocación con macros! Mantén Ctrl o Alt para ver tus barras de macros, o L2/R2 en el mando. Ahora suelta ese botón y ve a editarlas en \"Macros\" en el menú -.",
    ["Phantom Serpent: in Abyssea - Misareaux, at the seafront next to Veridical Conflux #08, with a Sea Dragon Liver (exclusive bait)."] = "Phantom Serpent: en Abyssea - Misareaux, en la costa junto a la Veridical Conflux #08, con un Sea Dragon Liver (cebo exclusivo).",
    ["Phase 2: keep Volker alive or you lose. Zeid summons two Shadows of Rage (strong hits, low HP, immune to Sleep) and resummons them when they die. They can skillchain with him, so kill them if your group is small; otherwise focus on Zeid. Winning gives a cutscene."] = "Fase 2: mantén vivo a Volker o pierdes. Zeid invoca dos Shadows of Rage (golpes fuertes, poco HP, inmunes a Sleep) y los vuelve a invocar cuando mueren. Pueden hacer skillchains con él, así que mátalos si tu grupo es pequeño; si no, céntrate en Zeid. Ganar da una escena.",
    ["Phomiuna Aqueducts: the libraries are the four rooms at (F-7), (F-9), (J-7) and (J-9) on the third map, with the ??? on the north or south bookshelf. From the entrance, open the iron door at (G-8) or (J-6) with a Bronze Key (or a Thief's tools), avoid the Taurus, and take the ladder at (E-8) or (M-8). Two True-Sight Taurus guard each hallway to the libraries, and their aggro can't be avoided in the narrow corridors."] = "Phomiuna Aqueducts: las bibliotecas son las cuatro salas de (F-7), (F-9), (J-7) y (J-9) del tercer mapa, con la ??? en la estantería norte o sur. Desde la entrada, abre la puerta de hierro de (G-8) o (J-6) con una Bronze Key (o las herramientas de un Thief), evita al Taurus y toma la escalera de (E-8) o (M-8). Dos Taurus con True-Sight vigilan cada pasillo hacia las bibliotecas, y en los pasillos estrechos no se puede evitar que te ataquen.",
    ["Pick a damage-dealing weapon (not Duban or Loughnashade); you need it at stage 2 for Duke Alloces's Decision and The Voracious Beast, and its job limits who you can bring to the hard final fight. For a support-job-friendly melee pick: Lorg Mor (WHM, GEO), Opashoro (BLM, SMN, SCH), Mpu Gandring (RDM, THF, BRD, DNC), Caliburnus (PLD, BLU, RDM)."] = "Elige un arma de daño (no Duban ni Loughnashade); la necesitas en la fase 2 para Duke Alloces's Decision y The Voracious Beast, y su job limita a quién puedes llevar a la difícil pelea final. Si quieres un cuerpo a cuerpo que sirva a jobs de apoyo: Lorg Mor (WHM, GEO), Opashoro (BLM, SMN, SCH), Mpu Gandring (RDM, THF, BRD, DNC), Caliburnus (PLD, BLU, RDM).",
    ["Pick a necklace: Adoulin's Refuge, Arciela's Grace or Ygnas's Resolve. You must choose one to progress. It doesn't limit which +1 you pick later, and you trade it back then."] = "Elige un collar: Adoulin's Refuge, Arciela's Grace o Ygnas's Resolve. Debes elegir uno para avanzar. No limita qué +1 eliges después, y entonces lo devuelves.",
    ["Pick an NPC to dress as (head, body, hands, legs, feet; weapons don't matter). Cheapest: Nbu Latteh (Bronze Harness, Scale Cuisses, Scale Greaves; about 3,000 gil at Brunhilde Armorer in Bastok Markets, or from Sparks). Black Mud: Wool Hat (Chetak, Lower Jeuno), Doublet, Slops, Ash Clogs. Naji: Gavial Mail, Breeches, Battle Boots. Michea: Gambison, Brais, Gaiters. Azima's Shadowreign look (Witch Hat, Marduk's Jubbah/Dastanas/Shalwar, Sorcerer's Sabots) wins first prize for 2,000 extra gil."] = "Elige un NPC del que disfrazarte (cabeza, cuerpo, manos, piernas, pies; las armas dan igual). Lo más barato: Nbu Latteh (Bronze Harness, Scale Cuisses, Scale Greaves; unos 3,000 gil en Brunhilde Armorer de Bastok Markets, o con Sparks). Black Mud: Wool Hat (Chetak, Lower Jeuno), Doublet, Slops, Ash Clogs. Naji: Gavial Mail, Breeches, Battle Boots. Michea: Gambison, Brais, Gaiters. El aspecto de Shadowreign de Azima (Witch Hat, Marduk's Jubbah/Dastanas/Shalwar, Sorcerer's Sabots) gana el primer premio, con 2,000 gil extra.",
    ["Pick up the Dragon's Aery Survival Guide while you're here: from the Cloister, head back north to the lake, drop down to the west, take the passage in the northwest of the room you arrive in, and keep following it without falling down until you find the zone line."] = "Coge la Survival Guide de Dragon's Aery mientras estás aquí: desde el Cloister, vuelve al norte hasta el lago, déjate caer hacia el oeste, toma el pasaje del noroeste de la sala a la que llegas y síguelo sin caerte hasta encontrar el límite de zona.",
    ["Pick up the quest from Maat at level 56 and you can double dip."] = "Coge la quest de Maat a nivel 56 y matas dos pájaros de un tiro.",
    ["Pinetorum/Bight Uragnite"] = "Pinetorum/Bight Uragnite",
    ["Place a Bronze Bed in your Mog House using the furniture Layout menu. You need Other fame level 3 (home nation fame). Wait one Earth minute, exit your Mog House, re-enter and speak to the Moogle. If you have enough fame, you receive a cutscene."] = "Coloca una Bronze Bed en tu Mog House con el menú Layout de mobiliario. Necesitas el nivel 3 de fama de Other (fama de tu nación de origen). Espera un minuto terrestre, sal de tu Mog House, vuelve a entrar y habla con el Moogle. Si tienes fama suficiente, recibes una escena.",
    ["Place a Mahogany Bed in your Mog House, zone out and back in, and speak to the Moogle (maybe twice). You need to have completed Give a Moogle a Break and have home nation fame level 5. If an item that gives weekly conquest rewards (such as an Aurum Coffer) is in your layout, you may need to remove it."] = "Coloca una Mahogany Bed en tu Mog House, sal y vuelve a entrar, y habla con el Moogle (quizá dos veces). Debes haber completado Give a Moogle a Break y tener fama de tu nación nivel 5. Si tienes en la distribución un objeto que da recompensas semanales de conquest (como un Aurum Coffer), puede que tengas que quitarlo.",
    ["Place a Noble's Bed in your Mog House, zone out and back in, wait one Earth minute and speak to your Moogle (maybe twice). You need to have completed The Moogle's Picnic! and have home nation fame level 7. Remove any weekly conquest-reward item (such as an Aurum Coffer) from your layout if it won't trigger."] = "Coloca una Noble's Bed en tu Mog House, sal y vuelve a entrar, espera un minuto real y habla con tu Moogle (quizá dos veces). Debes haber completado The Moogle's Picnic! y tener fama de tu nación nivel 7. Quita de la distribución cualquier objeto de recompensas semanales de conquest (como un Aurum Coffer) si no se activa.",
    ["Place the Gravel in the Refiner, operate the levers as required, and obtain Mythril Sand."] = "Coloca la Gravel en el Refiner, acciona las palancas según haga falta y obtén Mythril Sand.",
    ["Plague (1,500 gil) is inflicted by Bloodsucker enemies in Toraimarai Canal, by Deathmaw Orobon enemies in the Ceizak Battlegrounds with Vile Belch (which also inflicts Silence, so use an item or Echo Drops first if you plan to warp back to Ohruru), and by the Devouring Mosquito in Reisenjima with Infected Leech, which lasts 45 seconds. Many of these wear off quickly, so set your Home Point at Port Windurst #1."] = "Plague (1,500 gil) la provocan los enemigos Bloodsucker de Toraimarai Canal, los enemigos Deathmaw Orobon de Ceizak Battlegrounds con Vile Belch (que también provoca Silence, así que usa un objeto o Echo Drops antes si piensas teletransportarte de vuelta con Ohruru) y el Devouring Mosquito de Reisenjima con Infected Leech, que dura 45 segundos. Muchos se pasan rápido, así que fija tu Home Point en Port Windurst #1.",
    ["Plant a Shadow bug on five Cait Siths at towers across Beaucedine Glacier [S] by examining the Regal Pawprints at each and winning a minigame (any order; three tries each, no need to zone). Other Regal Pawprints in the zone are for later missions."] = "Coloca un Shadow bug en cinco Cait Siths de las torres de Beaucedine Glacier [S] examinando las Regal Pawprints de cada una y ganando un minijuego (en cualquier orden; tres intentos cada uno, sin necesidad de cambiar de zona). Las demás Regal Pawprints de la zona son para misiones posteriores.",
    ["Plant the seeds to grow a Deathball or a Sobbing Fungus, or buy one at the Auction House. A Sobbing Fungus can also be bought from Soupox in Leafallia for 60 gil."] = "Planta las semillas para cultivar un Deathball o un Sobbing Fungus, o cómpralo en la Auction House. Un Sobbing Fungus también se puede comprar a Soupox en Leafallia por 60 gil.",
    ["Port San d'Oria: Answald (J-10), in front of the Mog House; Portaure (H-9), Cargo Room B; Miene (I-9), by the water; Prietta (H-9), up the stairs above the cargo rooms; Auvare (H-6), behind the Air Travel Agency."] = "Port San d'Oria: Answald (J-10), frente a la Mog House; Portaure (H-9), Cargo Room B; Miene (I-9), junto al agua; Prietta (H-9), subiendo las escaleras sobre las salas de carga; Auvare (H-6), detrás de la Air Travel Agency.",
    ["Possible maps: Map 5 via Western Altepa (G-5) entrance 6 (Kuftal Tunnel Survival Guide); Maps 3 and 4 via Western Altepa (J-9) entrance 2 (Unity Warp level 125; Map 4 is exit C at (D-11)); Map 1 via Eastern Altepa (K-7) entrance 1 (Unity Warp level 125 to Quicksand Caves); Map 2 via Eastern Altepa (H-10) entrance 4 (Survival Guide). Many are one-way drops; Teleport-Altep, Instant Warp or Quicksand Caves Home Point #2 help."] = "Mapas posibles: mapa 5 por la entrada 6 de Western Altepa (G-5) (Survival Guide de Kuftal Tunnel); mapas 3 y 4 por la entrada 2 de Western Altepa (J-9) (Unity Warp de nivel 125; el mapa 4 es la salida C en (D-11)); mapa 1 por la entrada 1 de Eastern Altepa (K-7) (Unity Warp de nivel 125 a Quicksand Caves); mapa 2 por la entrada 4 de Eastern Altepa (H-10) (Survival Guide). Muchas son caídas de un solo sentido; Teleport-Altep, Instant Warp o el Home Point #2 de Quicksand Caves ayudan.",
    ["Pouch of weighted stones - Lets a solo player open the Banishing Gates in Garlaige Citadel."] = "Pouch of weighted stones: permite a un jugador solo abrir las Banishing Gates de Garlaige Citadel.",
    ["Prepare for a battle and go to the Nyzul Isle Staging Point."] = "Prepárate para una batalla y ve al Nyzul Isle Staging Point.",
    ["Prepare for the battle. Whenever you are ready, trade the tuning fork to Castilchat to be transported to the arena."] = "Prepárate para la batalla. Cuando estés listo, entrega el tuning fork a Castilchat para ser transportado a la arena.",
    ["Prepare for the battle. Whenever you are ready, trade the tuning fork to Ferrol to be transported to the arena."] = "Prepárate para la batalla. Cuando estés listo, entrega el tuning fork a Ferrol para ser transportado a la arena.",
    ["Prioritize pulling leeches."] = "Da prioridad a atraer a las sanguijuelas.",
    ["Probably not a good enemy for melee due to the evasion boost ability but could be good for starting nuke party."] = "Probablemente no es buen enemigo para cuerpo a cuerpo por su habilidad de aumento de evasión, pero puede venir bien para empezar un grupo de nukes.",
    ["Proceed northwest while keeping to the right-hand wall."] = "Avanza al noroeste pegado a la pared derecha.",
    ["Proceed through the opened passage and examine Ornate Gate."] = "Atraviesa el pasaje abierto y examina la Ornate Gate.",
    ["Proceed to (H-8) and examine the ??? in the spiral staircase to reach the 10th floor."] = "Ve a (H-8) y examina la ??? de la escalera de caracol para llegar al piso 10.",
    ["Proceed to Map 2 and speak with Pecca-Pocca at (G-12) to receive the Sheaf of Handmade Incense."] = "Avanza al Map 2 y habla con Pecca-Pocca en (G-12) para recibir el Sheaf of Handmade Incense.",
    ["Proceed to Sealion's Den."] = "Dirígete a Sealion's Den.",
    ["Proceed to the Castle Gates in Eastern Adoulin."] = "Dirígete a las Castle Gates en Eastern Adoulin.",
    ["Proceed to the Cracked Wall at (H-9) and examine it to enter the passage."] = "Dirígete a la Cracked Wall en (H-9) y examínala para entrar en el pasaje.",
    ["Proceed west to Weighted Door (H-7) and use the second weight pad to pass through."] = "Sigue al oeste hasta la Weighted Door (H-7) y usa la segunda placa de peso para cruzar.",
    ["Progress through the Promyvions by defeating Memory Receptacles and following the Memory Stream portals."] = "Avanza por las Promyvions derrotando a los Memory Receptacles y siguiendo los portales Memory Stream.",
    ["Protect Adelheid as she runs through the maze; groups of level 66-70 Quadavs (1,500-2,000 HP) attack her, and sometimes switch to her. You can cure and buff her (not with BLU spells). Hard solo without AoE sleep or damage; Valaineral's Trust helps."] = "Protege a Adelheid mientras corre por el laberinto; la atacan grupos de Quadavs de nivel 66-70 (1,500-2,000 HP), que a veces cambian de objetivo hacia ella. Puedes curarla y potenciarla (no con hechizos de BLU). Es difícil en solitario sin sueño o daño de área; el Trust de Valaineral ayuda.",
    ["Purchase a Mollifier from Affi to prevent high-level NMs from appearing."] = "Compra un Mollifier a Affi para impedir que aparezcan NMs de nivel alto.",
    ["Purchase some Rolanberries."] = "Compra algunas Rolanberries.",
    ["Pygmalion shows you a picture of an NPC that you must memorize."] = "Pygmalion te muestra una imagen de un NPC que debes memorizar.",
    ["Qilin in The Shrine of Ru'Avitau: rifts at (F-6), (F-9) and (J-6) (the wikis disagree on whether this is Map 2 or Map 3)."] = "Qilin en The Shrine of Ru'Avitau: rifts en (F-6), (F-9) y (J-6) (las wikis no coinciden en si es el mapa 2 o el 3).",
    ["Quadav crest: bring Sneak (Silent Oil) but no Invisible is needed. In Beadeaux, take the tunnel at (H-7) (\"A\") to map 2 and get silenced by The Mute at (G-7), so The Afflictor at (G-8) can't curse you with a heavy gravity effect (the silence lasts about 10 minutes)."] = "Quadav crest: lleva Sneak (Silent Oil), pero no hace falta Invisible. En Beadeaux, toma el túnel de (H-7) (\"A\") al mapa 2 y deja que The Mute te silencie en (G-7), para que The Afflictor en (G-8) no pueda maldecirte con un fuerte efecto de gravedad (el silencio dura unos 10 minutos).",
    ["Quadav/Sheep/Birds/Goblins/Lizards/Bats/Bees/Worms"] = "Quadav/Sheep/Birds/Goblins/Lizards/Bats/Bees/Worms",
    ["Quality of Life"] = "Comodidades",
    ["Quick assignments: repeat the Inventors' Coalition task Gather Materials: Rala Waterways (trade 3 Bloodthread to the Task Delegator), or Couriers' Coalition deliveries using waypoints. Accepting assignments and cancelling them later refunds the imprimaturs, so you can bank them."] = "Encargos rápidos: repite la tarea de la Inventors' Coalition Gather Materials: Rala Waterways (entrega 3 Bloodthread al Task Delegator), o las entregas de la Couriers' Coalition usando waypoints. Aceptar encargos y cancelarlos después devuelve los imprimaturs, así que puedes acumularlos.",
    ["Quicksilver Blade: on the Silver Sea route to Nashmau or to Al Zahbi, with a Sardine Ball."] = "Quicksilver Blade: en la ruta del Silver Sea a Nashmau o a Al Zahbi, con una Sardine Ball.",
    ["Quiz answers: four-leaf Mandragora bud = AGI; after Firesday = Earthsday; Windurst kids love the Agatha Crystalie mystery series; airship pass = 500,000 gil; herb seeds can't grow a Marguerite; Bastok's constellation = Titan; Windurst Waters cardians = hearts; Curilla's hair covers her left eye; Delkfutt's Tower = thirteen floors; Bastok waterwheels facing north turn counter clockwise; Galka eat raw meat, Mithra raw fish; in Kazham you can't learn the weather in Sarutabaruta; Rabao Oasis = six springs; Karaha-Baruha = Minister of the Optistery; M & P's Market = Kazham or Upper Jeuno; Ayame's sister = Kaede; Iron Eater's master = Werei; Naji = the 5th Musketeer; not on Elshimo = Cloister of Storms; Prince Trion lost an entire company; Quadav lack a Quadav hand fetich; Autumn Hunt quarry = a Giant Sheep; Rukususu likes peanuts; San d'Oria's younger prince = Pieuje; archduke of Jeuno = Kam'lanaut; Bastok Markets armourer = Kulatz Bridge; Bastok auction house = 5 counters; constellation map = Lago-Charago; Balga's Dais dragon = Black Dragon; ex-Minister of the Manustery = Zonpa-Zippa; N. Gustaberg falls = Drachenfall; Galka who lived with Werei = Gumbah; red flower girl = Valah Molkot; Goldsmiths' Guild closed 23:00-8:00; most mythril = Palborough Mines; N. San d'Oria kid looks for Exoroche; Konschtat houses the Crag of Dem; lost San d'Oria kid wants a willow fishing rod; map of Mindartia = Enid Ironheart; Mithra chieftainness = Perih Vashai; monster that doesn't belong = Zu; far-left Norg auction clerk = Atrevaux; President of Bastok = Karst, sleeps in the Presidential Suite; Aurastery principal = Koru-Moru; Port Bastok restaurant = The Steaming Sheep; river near San d'Oria = Cheval River; delivery boy's mom has Davoi Fever; papsque = Shamonde P Grauche; Royal Knight general = Rahal; sea east of Mindartia = Gugru Blue; Tenshodo leader's cape = black; Troupe Valeriano = five members; war 20 years ago = Crystal War; Windurst flag = five stars; weapon shop greeting = Hohbiba-Mubiba; west of Zulkheim = Vollbow; crystal bass = Maiden's Spring."] = "Respuestas del examen: brote de Mandragora de cuatro hojas = AGI; después de Firesday = Earthsday; a los niños de Windurst les encanta la serie de misterio de Agatha Crystalie; pase de aeronave = 500,000 gil; con semillas de hierbas no crece una Marguerite; constelación de Bastok = Titan; cardians de Windurst Waters = corazones; el pelo de Curilla le tapa el ojo izquierdo; Delkfutt's Tower = trece pisos; las norias de Bastok que miran al norte giran en sentido antihorario; los Galka comen carne cruda, los Mithra pescado crudo; en Kazham no puedes saber el clima de Sarutabaruta; Rabao Oasis = seis manantiales; Karaha-Baruha = Minister of the Optistery; M & P's Market = Kazham o Upper Jeuno; hermana de Ayame = Kaede; maestro de Iron Eater = Werei; Naji = el 5.º mosquetero; no está en Elshimo = Cloister of Storms; Prince Trion perdió una compañía entera; los Quadav no tienen un Quadav hand fetich; presa del Autumn Hunt = una Giant Sheep; a Rukususu le gustan los cacahuetes; príncipe menor de San d'Oria = Pieuje; archiduque de Jeuno = Kam'lanaut; armero de Bastok Markets = Kulatz Bridge; casa de subastas de Bastok = 5 mostradores; mapa de constelaciones = Lago-Charago; dragón de Balga's Dais = Black Dragon; ex Minister of the Manustery = Zonpa-Zippa; cascadas de N. Gustaberg = Drachenfall; Galka que vivió con Werei = Gumbah; niña de la flor roja = Valah Molkot; Goldsmiths' Guild cerrado de 23:00 a 8:00; más mithril = Palborough Mines; el niño de N. San d'Oria busca a Exoroche; Konschtat alberga el Crag of Dem; el niño perdido de San d'Oria quiere una caña de sauce; mapa de Mindartia = Enid Ironheart; jefa Mithra = Perih Vashai; monstruo que no encaja = Zu; empleado de subastas más a la izquierda de Norg = Atrevaux; presidente de Bastok = Karst, duerme en la Presidential Suite; directora de la Aurastery = Koru-Moru; restaurante de Port Bastok = The Steaming Sheep; río cerca de San d'Oria = Cheval River; la madre del repartidor tiene Davoi Fever; papsque = Shamonde P Grauche; general de los Royal Knight = Rahal; mar al este de Mindartia = Gugru Blue; capa del líder del Tenshodo = negra; Troupe Valeriano = cinco miembros; guerra de hace 20 años = Crystal War; bandera de Windurst = cinco estrellas; saludo de la armería = Hohbiba-Mubiba; al oeste de Zulkheim = Vollbow; crystal bass = Maiden's Spring.",
    ["Quizzes, up to 6 each (no retry unless you get every answer wrong): Farouel (K-7): Smilodons, Tauri, Ghosts. Vichauxdat (I-8): Three, Gutrenders, Grradhod. Aurfet (G-9, upper level): Yrvaulair S Coussereaux, Febrenard C Brunnaut, Valaineral R Davilles, Knights of the Rustwing Hawk. Corseihaut (F-6): Uwe Prien, Mythril Musketeers, Klara Bester, Robel Akbel, Twelve, Choh Moui."] = "Preguntas, hasta 6 cada uno (sin repetir salvo que falles todas): Farouel (K-7): Smilodons, Tauri, Ghosts. Vichauxdat (I-8): Three, Gutrenders, Grradhod. Aurfet (G-9, nivel superior): Yrvaulair S Coussereaux, Febrenard C Brunnaut, Valaineral R Davilles, Knights of the Rustwing Hawk. Corseihaut (F-6): Uwe Prien, Mythril Musketeers, Klara Bester, Robel Akbel, Twelve, Choh Moui.",
    ["Qultada (an excellent support - the only Corsair trust who actually uses the Corsair's signature ability, Phantom Roll) (sorry, Luzaf)"] = "Qultada (un apoyo excelente: el único trust Corsair que de verdad usa la habilidad característica del Corsair, Phantom Roll) (lo siento, Luzaf)",
    ["Quu Bokye is in the Treasure Room on the underground map of Giddeus: the northwest room at the end of a U-turn on the map."] = "Quu Bokye está en la Treasure Room del mapa subterráneo de Giddeus: la sala noroeste al final de un U-turn del mapa.",
    ["Rabbits are sending the shanarha grass, unique to Leujaoam Sanctum, to the verge of extinction. Mission orders: protect the vegetation."] = "Los conejos están llevando al borde de la extinción a la shanarha grass, exclusiva de Leujaoam Sanctum. Órdenes de la misión: proteger la vegetación.",
    ["Rainemard - Once you have the Bundle, go to Batallia Downs (H-5) and interact with the Cavernous Maw to go to Batallia Downs (S). (This will trigger a cutscene for Wings of the Goddess if you've never touched one of these before.) Mount up and ride over to Shanene at (I/J-7) (she's next to a wall with an archway) and talk to her for a Trust cutscene."] = "Rainemard: cuando tengas el Bundle, ve a Batallia Downs (H-5) e interactúa con el Cavernous Maw para ir a Batallia Downs (S). (Esto activará una escena de Wings of the Goddess si nunca has tocado uno.) Monta y cabalga hasta Shanene en (I/J-7) (está junto a una muralla con un arco) y habla con ella para la escena del Trust.",
    ["Rank 3 Missions"] = "Misiones de Rank 3",
    ["Rasdinice sends you to the Quartermaster at (H-9) in Southern San d'Oria (S). Obtain the supplies that he requests, either by gathering them or by buying them at the Auction House, and hand them over."] = "Rasdinice te envía al Quartermaster at (H-9) in Southern San d'Oria (S). Consigue los suministros que pide, ya sea recolectándolos o comprándolos en la Auction House, y entrégaselos.",
    ["Re-enter Bastok Markets (S) from North Gustaberg (S)."] = "Vuelve a entrar en Bastok Markets (S) desde North Gustaberg (S).",
    ["Re-examine the ??? to obtain the Handful of crystal scales."] = "Vuelve a examinar la ??? para obtener el Handful of crystal scales.",
    ["Reach (H-8) and pass through the weighted door."] = "Llega a (H-8) y atraviesa la puerta de peso.",
    ["Reach ??? (H-8)."] = "Llega a la ??? (H-8).",
    ["Reach ??? (J-11) near the Stone Monument and examine it to face Suparna and Suparna Fledgling."] = "Llega a la ??? (J-11) cerca del Stone Monument y examínala para enfrentarte a Suparna y Suparna Fledgling.",
    ["Reach Eschan Portal #15 (H-12)."] = "Llega al Eschan Portal #15 (H-12).",
    ["Reach Flames of Fate (G-8) within 8 minutes: on the floor below the last torch on the left at (G-8), just before the stairs into Castle Zvahl Keep (don't go up them). Drop Invisible to click it for the Festival Souvenir Kupon."] = "Llega a las Flames of Fate (G-8) en 8 minutos: en el suelo bajo la última antorcha de la izquierda en (G-8), justo antes de las escaleras a Castle Zvahl Keep (no las subas). Quítate Invisible para pulsarlas y obtener el Festival Souvenir Kupon.",
    ["Reach Horlais Peak through Ghelsba Outpost and Yughott Grotto; Yughott Grotto Home Point #1 is right outside it."] = "Llega a Horlais Peak por Ghelsba Outpost y Yughott Grotto; el Home Point #1 de Yughott Grotto está justo fuera.",
    ["Reach Mamook by entering the cave at (D-12) on the Wajaom Woodlands map, or by using the Mamook Survival Guide warp."] = "Llega a Mamook entrando por la cueva en (D-12) del mapa de Wajaom Woodlands, o usando el warp de la Survival Guide de Mamook.",
    ["Reach Map 2 from point A on Map 1 (point B won't work): climb the ladder at (F-6), go to (F-4) and drop to Map 2 (K-10), then head north. On Map 2, take the wooden ladder up at (I-6) and drop at (K-5) to reach the Minotaur at (J-2). The Taurus see with true sight but have a narrow view, so pass behind them."] = "Llega al mapa 2 desde el punto A del mapa 1 (el punto B no sirve): sube por la escalera de (F-6), ve a (F-4) y déjate caer al mapa 2 (K-10), luego ve al norte. En el mapa 2, sube por la escalera de madera de (I-6) y déjate caer en (K-5) para llegar al Minotaur en (J-2). Los Taurus ven con true sight pero tienen un campo de visión estrecho, así que pasa por detrás.",
    ["Reach Rank 3 in your home nation."] = "Alcanza el Rank 3 en tu nación de origen.",
    ["Reach Rank 4"] = "Llega a Rank 4",
    ["Reach Rank 6 in your home nation."] = "Alcanza el Rank 6 en tu nación de origen.",
    ["Reach Sluice Gate (C-6)."] = "Llega a la Sluice Gate (C-6).",
    ["Reach Weighted Door (G-8), pass through, and drop into the lower room."] = "Llega a la Weighted Door (G-8), crúzala y déjate caer a la sala de abajo.",
    ["Reach Weighted Door (K-8) and use the pressure plate to pass through."] = "Llega a la Weighted Door (K-8) y usa la placa de presión para cruzar.",
    ["Reach all 24 Republic Operatives while under Flee; each one refreshes your Flee and detonates a charge. Talking to one without Flee sends you back to Antje. The Flee job ability, Powder Boots (bring 5+) or gear that grants Flee can cover a gap, but then the operatives stop refreshing it."] = "Llega hasta los 24 Republic Operatives bajo el efecto de Flee; cada uno renueva tu Flee y detona una carga. Hablar con uno sin Flee te devuelve con Antje. La habilidad Flee, las Powder Boots (lleva 5 o más) o el equipo que da Flee pueden cubrir un hueco, pero entonces los operativos dejan de renovarlo.",
    ["Reach level 10."] = "Alcanza el nivel 10.",
    ["Reach level 30"] = "Llega a nivel 30",
    ["Reach level 50"] = "Llega a nivel 50",
    ["Reach level 55"] = "Llega a nivel 55",
    ["Reach level 60"] = "Llega a nivel 60",
    ["Reach level 65"] = "Llega a nivel 65",
    ["Reach the Cheval River target at (H-5)."] = "Llega al objetivo Cheval River en (H-5).",
    ["Reach the Goblin Geologist (J-11) on Quicksand Caves Map 5: the Geomagnetic Fount waypoint (go east, right after the door; don't fall in the hole), or the hidden Western Altepa Desert (D-12) entrance (Quicksand Caves Home Point #1, exit 5 at (H-4), then south). Speak with him."] = "Llega al Goblin Geologist (J-11) en el mapa 5 de Quicksand Caves: el waypoint de la Geomagnetic Fount (ve al este justo tras la puerta; no caigas en el agujero) o la entrada oculta de Western Altepa Desert (D-12) (Home Point #1 de Quicksand Caves, salida 5 en (H-4) y luego al sur). Habla con él.",
    ["Reach the Memory Flux around (J-8) on the third floor."] = "Llega al Memory Flux cerca de (J-8) en el tercer piso.",
    ["Reach the Spire of Dem and defeat Progenerator. Obtain the Light of Dem."] = "Llega a la Spire of Dem y derrota a Progenerator. Obtén la Light of Dem.",
    ["Reach the Spire of Holla and defeat Wreaker. Obtain the Light of Holla."] = "Llega a la Spire of Holla y derrota a Wreaker. Obtén la Light of Holla.",
    ["Reach the Spire of Mea and defeat Delver. Obtain the Light of Mea."] = "Llega a la Spire of Mea y derrota a Delver. Obtén la Light of Mea.",
    ["Reach the bottom of Ra'Kaznar Turris and examine the Ominous Postern for a cutscene. Ra'Kaznar Inner Court Home Point #1 is right next to the entrance."] = "Llega al fondo de Ra'Kaznar Turris y examina el Ominous Postern para una escena. El Home Point #1 de Ra'Kaznar Inner Court está justo al lado de la entrada.",
    ["Reach the bottom of Ra'Kaznar Turris and examine the Ominous Postern for a long cutscene. With Ra'Kaznar Inner Court Home Point #1, warp there and take the Vertical Transit Device down."] = "Llega al fondo de Ra'Kaznar Turris y examina el Ominous Postern para una escena larga. Con el Home Point #1 de Ra'Kaznar Inner Court, teletranspórtate allí y baja con el Vertical Transit Device.",
    ["Reach the southern chamber at (G-9), fall through the center hole, and enter the northern room at (I-7)."] = "Llega a la cámara sur en (G-9), cae por el agujero central y entra en la sala norte en (I-7).",
    ["Reach the southern room and drop through the center hole at (G-9), then follow the route through Maps 2 and 3 and exit back to Batallia Downs at (J-9)."] = "Llega a la sala sur y déjate caer por el agujero central en (G-9), luego sigue la ruta por los Maps 2 y 3 y sal de nuevo a Batallia Downs en (J-9).",
    ["Reaching Level 30 and Doing Stuff"] = "Llegar a nivel 30 y hacer cosas",
    ["Read all three options in the book \"History\" on the shelf between Yefafa and Vainrachault. If you can't read the books, first do the quest Order Up from Reja Ygridhi inside the library; it needs a library card (1,000 bayld from Patient Snake in Eastern Adoulin (F-9), at the end of the path into the Scouts' Coalition)."] = "Lee las tres opciones del libro \"History\" en la estantería entre Yefafa y Vainrachault. Si no puedes leer los libros, haz antes la quest Order Up de Reja Ygridhi dentro de la biblioteca; necesita un carné de biblioteca (1,000 bayld a Patient Snake en Eastern Adoulin (F-9), al final del camino a la Scouts' Coalition).",
    ["Read the Hastily scribbled note in Temporary Key Items."] = "Lee la Hastily scribbled note en los Temporary Key Items.",
    ["Read the Unaddressed sealed letter from your Temporary Key Items menu."] = "Lee la Unaddressed sealed letter desde tu menú de Temporary Key Items.",
    ["Read the different stories in the cutscene to continue."] = "Lee las distintas historias de la escena para continuar.",
    ["Read this before the last ???: at (I-6), examining the final ??? spawns the Bomb NM Chandelier. If it aggroes anyone before it is claimed (it detects sight and magic), it self-destructs at once and drops nothing. Use Hide or Spectral Jig right after the cutscene and claim it with a melee attack, not a spell."] = "Lee esto antes de la última ???: en (I-6), examinar la última ??? hace aparecer al NM Bomb Chandelier. Si ataca a alguien antes de ser reclamado (detecta por vista y magia), se autodestruye al instante y no suelta nada. Usa Hide o Spectral Jig justo tras la escena y reclámalo con un ataque cuerpo a cuerpo, no con un hechizo.",
    ["Receive Breath of the avatars."] = "Recibe Breath of the avatars.",
    ["Receive Cipher: Balamor's Alter Ego."] = "Recibe Cipher: Balamor's Alter Ego.",
    ["Receive Cipher: Iroha and Rhapsody in Ochre."] = "Recibe Cipher: Iroha y Rhapsody in Ochre.",
    ["Receive Cipher: Lilisette's Alter Ego II."] = "Recibe Cipher: Lilisette's Alter Ego II.",
    ["Receive Cipher: Nashmeira's Alter Ego II."] = "Recibe Cipher: Nashmeira's Alter Ego II.",
    ["Receive Cipher: Prishe's Alter Ego II."] = "Recibe Cipher: Prishe's Alter Ego II.",
    ["Receive Cipher: Zeid II."] = "Recibe Cipher: Zeid II.",
    ["Receive Lightsworm if your Wings of the Goddess progression requires it."] = "Recibe Lightsworm si tu progresión de Wings of the Goddess lo requiere.",
    ["Receive Most curious curio."] = "Recibe Most curious curio.",
    ["Receive Phoenix's blessing, Scintillating Rhapsody, and Cipher: Iroha II."] = "Recibe Phoenix's blessing, Scintillating Rhapsody y Cipher: Iroha II.",
    ["Receive Rhapsody in Azure."] = "Recibe Rhapsody in Azure.",
    ["Receive Rhapsody in Crimson."] = "Recibe Rhapsody in Crimson.",
    ["Receive Rhapsody in Mauve."] = "Recibe Rhapsody in Mauve.",
    ["Receive Rhapsody in Umber and Cipher: Lion's Alter Ego II."] = "Recibe Rhapsody in Umber y Cipher: Lion's Alter Ego II.",
    ["Receive Siren's plume and Rhapsody in Emerald."] = "Recibe Siren's plume y Rhapsody in Emerald.",
    ["Receive five Imperial Gold Pieces."] = "Recibe cinco Imperial Gold Pieces.",
    ["Receive the Adaman Ingot reward."] = "Recibe la recompensa Adaman Ingot.",
    ["Receive the Allied Council Summons."] = "Recibe la Allied Council Summons.",
    ["Receive the Behemoth key."] = "Recibe la Behemoth key.",
    ["Receive the Blue acidity tester."] = "Recibe el Blue acidity tester.",
    ["Receive the Ebon Key and Prismatic Key."] = "Recibe la Ebon Key y la Prismatic Key.",
    ["Receive the Glory Crown."] = "Recibe la Glory Crown.",
    ["Receive the Grimoire and Scholar job access."] = "Recibe el Grimoire y el acceso al trabajo Scholar.",
    ["Receive the Imperial Standard."] = "Recibe el Imperial Standard.",
    ["Receive the Mysterious Amulet."] = "Recibe el Mysterious Amulet.",
    ["Receive the Piece of Paper after completing the event at the Garden."] = "Recibe la Piece of Paper tras completar el evento en el Garden.",
    ["Receive the Pioneer's Badge, Map of Adoulin, and 1,000 Bayld."] = "Recibe la Pioneer's Badge, el Map of Adoulin y 1,000 Bayld.",
    ["Receive the Republican Silver Medal reward."] = "Recibe la recompensa Republican Silver Medal.",
    ["Receive the Tiny Memory Fragment."] = "Recibe el Tiny Memory Fragment.",
    ["Receive the Trainee Knife reward."] = "Recibe la recompensa Trainee Knife.",
    ["Recently there have been multiple reports of a three-headed beast attacking traders on the way to Al Zahbi. Travel to its rumored lair in Lebros Cavern and slay it. Mission orders: defeat Black Shuck."] = "Últimamente ha habido varios informes de una bestia de tres cabezas que ataca a comerciantes de camino a Al Zahbi. Viaja a su supuesta guarida en Lebros Cavern y mátala. Órdenes de la misión: derrotar a Black Shuck.",
    ["Recipes: Silver Earring + Black or White Chip, 5 Euvhi Organs, 5 Luminian Tissues. Silver Obi + chip, 7 + 3 organs and 3 Luminian Tissues: Red 7 Phuabo/3 Xzomit, Yellow 7 Hpemde/3 Aern, Blue 7 Hpemde/3 Phuabo, Green 7 Aern/3 Hpemde, Clear 7 Xzomit/3 Phuabo, Purple 7 Phuabo/3 Hpemde, White 7 Xzomit/3 Aern, Black 7 Aern/3 Xzomit."] = "Recetas: Silver Earring + Black o White Chip, 5 Euvhi Organs, 5 Luminian Tissues. Silver Obi + chip, 7 + 3 órganos y 3 Luminian Tissues: Red 7 Phuabo/3 Xzomit, Yellow 7 Hpemde/3 Aern, Blue 7 Hpemde/3 Phuabo, Green 7 Aern/3 Hpemde, Clear 7 Xzomit/3 Phuabo, Purple 7 Phuabo/3 Hpemde, White 7 Xzomit/3 Aern, Black 7 Aern/3 Xzomit.",
    ["Recommended: continue to (C-8), exit to Western Altepa Desert, and press the sapphire column; the next mission needs the Altepa Gate open."] = "Recomendado: sigue hasta (C-8), sal a Western Altepa Desert y pulsa la columna de zafiro; la misión siguiente necesita la Altepa Gate abierta.",
