    ["Speak with Ratihb in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-12) for your reward, the Trump Gun. You may have to speak to him twice."] = "Habla con Ratihb en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-12) por tu recompensa, el Trump Gun. Puede que tengas que hablar con él dos veces.",
    ["Speak with Ratihb in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-12) to start this quest. The correct cutscene is the one about Balajaha, Yadhiwa and a game of dice, not the one for Luck of the Draw. This quest requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Habla con Ratihb en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-12) para empezar esta quest. La escena correcta es la de Balajaha, Yadhiwa y una partida de dados, no la de Luck of the Draw. Esta quest requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Speak with Ratihb in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-12), at the Shararat Teahouse, as a Corsair of level 40 or higher. If he just welcomes you with tea, you probably already did the optional last step of the previous quest. The quest only appears in your log after the next step."] = "Habla con Ratihb en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-12), en la Shararat Teahouse, como Corsair de nivel 40 o superior. Si solo te da la bienvenida con té, probablemente ya hiciste el último paso opcional de la quest anterior. La quest solo aparece en tu registro tras el siguiente paso.",
    ["Speak with Ratihb inside the Shararat Teahouse (J-12). If the cutscene does not involve Foudeel and Wahboud, speak to him again for the correct cutscene."] = "Habla con Ratihb dentro de la Shararat Teahouse (J-12). Si la escena no incluye a Foudeel y Wahboud, vuelve a hablar con él para la escena correcta.",
    ["Speak with Raustigne (I-7) in Southern San d'Oria (S) (I-7) to receive the Large Memory Fragment."] = "Habla con Raustigne (I-7) en Southern San d'Oria (S) (I-7) para recibir el Large Memory Fragment.",
    ["Speak with Raustigne (I-7) in Southern San d'Oria (S)."] = "Habla con Raustigne (I-7) en Southern San d'Oria (S).",
    ["Speak with Raustigne at the Victory Gate in Southern San d'Oria [S] (I-7)."] = "Habla con Raustigne en la Victory Gate de Southern San d'Oria [S] (I-7).",
    ["Speak with Raustigne in Southern San d'Oria [S] (I-7) for a cutscene."] = "Habla con Raustigne en Southern San d'Oria [S] (I-7) para una escena.",
    ["Speak with Raustigne in Southern San d'Oria [S] (I-7) for a cutscene. It can freeze with cutscene-skip or frame-rate addons; set the frame rate back to 30 if so."] = "Habla con Raustigne en Southern San d'Oria [S] (I-7) para una escena. Puede congelarse con addons que saltan escenas o de FPS; si pasa, vuelve a 30 FPS.",
    ["Speak with Raustigne in Southern San d'Oria [S] (I-7/8) for a cutscene."] = "Habla con Raustigne en Southern San d'Oria [S] (I-7/8) para una escena.",
    ["Speak with Rauteinot in Kazham (G-9), who asks for a slab of Elshimo Marble. You need Kazham fame level 3 and the Rise of the Zilart pack."] = "Habla con Rauteinot en Kazham (G-9), que pide una losa de Elshimo Marble. Necesitas el nivel 3 de fama de Kazham y el pack Rise of the Zilart.",
    ["Speak with Red Axe (I-8) in The Eldieme Necropolis (S)."] = "Habla con Red Axe (I-8) en The Eldieme Necropolis (S).",
    ["Speak with Reikuu (K-8) at (K-8) near Ethereal Ingress #6 for a cutscene."] = "Habla con Reikuu (K-8) en (K-8), cerca del Ethereal Ingress #6, para una escena.",
    ["Speak with Reikuu (K-8) at (K-8) near Ethereal Ingress #6 in Reisenjima for a cutscene."] = "Habla con Reikuu (K-8) en (K-8), cerca del Ethereal Ingress #6 de Reisenjima, para una escena.",
    ["Speak with Reikuu (K-8) for a cutscene (no zoning needed)."] = "Habla con Reikuu (K-8) para una escena (no hace falta cambiar de zona).",
    ["Speak with Reinberta in Bastok Markets (I-8)."] = "Habla con Reinberta en Bastok Markets (I-8).",
    ["Speak with Rhea Myuliah next to her."] = "Habla con Rhea Myuliah, a su lado.",
    ["Speak with Rhea Myuliah to practice performing for an audience. Keep their attention with the dance each likes: young people a Waltz, older people a Samba, children a Jig. Use the right one when someone starts to walk away."] = "Habla con Rhea Myuliah para practicar actuando ante un público. Mantén su atención con el baile que le gusta a cada uno: a los jóvenes un Waltz, a los mayores un Samba, a los niños un Jig. Usa el adecuado cuando alguien empiece a irse.",
    ["Speak with Rhea Myuliah, the Mithra dancer next to her. If Rhea Myuliah answers when you speak with Laila, that counts too."] = "Habla con Rhea Myuliah, la bailarina Mithra que está a su lado. Si Rhea Myuliah responde cuando hablas con Laila, también cuenta.",
    ["Speak with Rholont (E-7) again to receive Biscuit a la Rholont."] = "Habla de nuevo con Rholont (E-7) para recibir Biscuit a la Rholont.",
    ["Speak with Rholont (E-7) in Southern San d'Oria (S) (more than once if needed) to receive the Letter to Count Aurchiat. Buy Hatchets from Geltpix (M-6) now; you'll need them."] = "Habla con Rholont (E-7) en Southern San d'Oria (S) (más de una vez si hace falta) para recibir la Letter to Count Aurchiat. Compra ahora Hatchets a Geltpix (M-6); los vas a necesitar.",
    ["Speak with Rholont (E-7) in Southern San d'Oria (S) and bring the Bundle of half-inscribed scrolls to obtain Trust: Excenmille (S)."] = "Habla con Rholont (E-7) en Southern San d'Oria (S) y lleva el Bundle of half-inscribed scrolls para obtener Trust: Excenmille (S).",
    ["Speak with Rholont (E-7) in Southern San d'Oria (S)."] = "Habla con Rholont (E-7) en Southern San d'Oria (S).",
    ["Speak with Rholont (E-7) to complete the quest and receive the Fullmetal Bullet."] = "Habla con Rholont (E-7) para completar la quest y recibir la Fullmetal Bullet.",
    ["Speak with Rholont (E-7)."] = "Habla con Rholont (E-7).",
    ["Speak with Rhy Epocan at the top of Heavens Tower for a cutscene. The blue teleporter there takes you back down."] = "Habla con Rhy Epocan en lo alto de Heavens Tower para una escena. El teletransportador azul de allí te devuelve abajo.",
    ["Speak with Rigobertine (J-7) in the alley at the southeast corner of (J-7) for the Eternal flame and hints. You can't get the other items without this cutscene."] = "Habla con Rigobertine (J-7) en el callejón de la esquina sureste de (J-7) para obtener la Eternal flame y pistas. No puedes conseguir los demás objetos sin esta escena.",
    ["Speak with Ripapa in Mhaura (I-9) to obtain the quest. You need Mhaura fame level 6. Warning: Trust Magic cannot be used in this battlefield. Once you have the key item Tuning fork of lightning, you can safely undertake the quest, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Ripapa en Mhaura (I-9) para obtener la quest. Necesitas el nivel 6 de fama de Mhaura. Aviso: no se puede usar Trust Magic en este campo de batalla. Cuando tengas el key item Tuning fork of lightning, ya puedes emprender la quest con seguridad, y cada miembro del grupo necesita el suyo.",
    ["Speak with Roderich (E-11) at (E-11)."] = "Habla con Roderich (E-11) en (E-11).",
    ["Speak with Roderich (E-11) at the Benedikt Watchtower."] = "Habla con Roderich (E-11) en la Benedikt Watchtower.",
    ["Speak with Rodeupansat (J-7) in Crawlers' Nest (S) and receive the Evil Warding Seal."] = "Habla con Rodeupansat (J-7) en Crawlers' Nest (S) y recibe el Evil Warding Seal.",
    ["Speak with Rodin-Comidin (I-7) outside the Automaton Workshop (I-7)."] = "Habla con Rodin-Comidin (I-7) fuera del Automaton Workshop (I-7).",
    ["Speak with Rohn Ehlbalna (G-9)."] = "Habla con Rohn Ehlbalna (G-9).",
    ["Speak with Rojaireaut (G-3) to have your level capped at 25. Everyone in your party or alliance needs the level cap applied to them, and it has no timer."] = "Habla con Rojaireaut (G-3) para que tu nivel quede limitado a 25. Todos los de tu grupo o alianza necesitan que se les aplique el límite de nivel, y no tiene temporizador.",
    ["Speak with Romaa Mihgo in Kazham (H-11)."] = "Habla con Romaa Mihgo en Kazham (H-11).",
    ["Speak with Romeo in Selbina (H-9). You need Other fame level 1. Donate five pieces of onion equipment to help new recruits everywhere; donors may receive an award."] = "Habla con Romeo en Selbina (H-9). Necesitas el nivel 1 de fama de Other. Dona cinco piezas de equipo onion para ayudar a los nuevos reclutas de todas partes; los donantes pueden recibir un premio.",
    ["Speak with Romilda in Port Bastok (I-7), who wants to give her husband, Qiji, a pair of Cotton Gloves."] = "Habla con Romilda en Port Bastok (I-7), que quiere regalarle a su marido, Qiji, unos Cotton Gloves.",
    ["Speak with Romualdo (I-7) in Batallia Downs (S)."] = "Habla con Romualdo (I-7) en Batallia Downs (S).",
    ["Speak with Romualdo in the Metalworks (K-9) in the present. The quest appears in your log after the next step."] = "Habla con Romualdo en Metalworks (K-9) en el presente. La quest aparece en tu registro tras el siguiente paso.",
    ["Speak with Ronan in Port Bastok (K-6) to activate the quest."] = "Habla con Ronan en Port Bastok (K-6) para activar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Rondipur in Northern San d'Oria (F-6) to begin the quest. Only one Escort for Hire quest can be active at a time, and only one can be completed each Conquest Tally."] = "Habla con Rondipur en Northern San d'Oria (F-6) para empezar la quest. Solo puede haber una quest Escort for Hire activa a la vez, y solo se puede completar una por Conquest Tally.",
    ["Speak with Rongelouts N Distaud in Southern San d'Oria (S) at (I-9)."] = "Habla con Rongelouts N Distaud en Southern San d'Oria (S) en (I-9).",
    ["Speak with Ronta-Onta in Kazham (J-9) to obtain the quest. You need Kazham fame level 6 and the Rise of the Zilart pack; if he won't give it, keep talking to him until his text changes. Once you have the key item Tuning fork of fire, you can safely undertake the quest. Each party member must have their own Tuning fork of fire. Trusts can't be used."] = "Habla con Ronta-Onta en Kazham (J-9) para obtener la quest. Necesitas fama de Kazham nivel 6 y el pack de Rise of the Zilart; si no te la da, sigue hablando con él hasta que cambie su texto. Cuando tengas el key item Tuning fork of fire, puedes emprender la quest sin problemas. Cada miembro del grupo debe tener su propio Tuning fork of fire. No se pueden usar Trusts.",
    ["Speak with Ropunono in Windurst Waters (F-7) to start the quest."] = "Habla con Ropunono en Windurst Waters (F-7) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Rosel in Southern San d'Oria (K-8) to start the quest; you receive the receipt for the prince's cloak to deliver to the Chateau guards."] = "Habla con Rosel en Southern San d'Oria (K-8) para empezar la quest; recibes el recibo de la capa del príncipe para entregarlo a los guardias del Chateau.",
    ["Speak with Rouva in Southern San d'Oria (I-8)."] = "Habla con Rouva en Southern San d'Oria (I-8).",
    ["Speak with Rouva on the west side of Victory Square in Southern San d'Oria (I-8) to begin the quest. She asks you to bring her a sprig of Rivernewort. This quest requires the Chains of Promathia pack."] = "Habla con Rouva en el lado oeste de Victory Square en Southern San d'Oria (I-8) para empezar la quest. Te pide que le traigas una ramita de Rivernewort. Esta quest requiere el pack Chains of Promathia.",
    ["Speak with Ruenda outside The Steaming Sheep in Port Bastok (Home Point #3, (E-7)) while wearing the outfit (actual gear or an equipment set; turn /lockstyle off). The cutscene runs over 5 minutes."] = "Habla con Ruenda fuera de The Steaming Sheep en Port Bastok (Home Point #3, (E-7)) llevando el conjunto (equipo de verdad o un set de equipo; desactiva /lockstyle). La escena dura más de 5 minutos.",
    ["Speak with Runje Desaali (J-10) in Eastern Adoulin (J-10) until she shows you the Esthete's Masque and hints at the gear she wants. Get that dialogue before trading."] = "Habla con Runje Desaali (J-10) en Eastern Adoulin (J-10) hasta que te enseñe la Esthete's Masque y te dé pistas del equipo que quiere. Consigue ese diálogo antes de entregarle nada.",
    ["Speak with Rycharde on the second floor of the Sailor's Stay to begin the quest. He needs your help to find some dhalmel meat."] = "Habla con Rycharde en el segundo piso del Sailor's Stay para empezar la quest. Necesita tu ayuda para encontrar carne de dhalmel.",
    ["Speak with Ryoma in Norg (H-8) to begin the quest. You need to be a Ninja of level 50 or higher and have the Rise of the Zilart pack; this quest follows I'll Take the Big Box. The Sahagin have stolen Mitsunari's treasure and hidden it somewhere in the jungle on Elshimo Island."] = "Habla con Ryoma en Norg (H-8) para empezar la quest. Debes ser Ninja de nivel 50 o superior y tener el pack Rise of the Zilart; esta quest sigue a I'll Take the Big Box. Los Sahagin han robado el tesoro de Mitsunari y lo han escondido en algún lugar de la jungla de Elshimo Island.",
    ["Speak with Ryoma in Norg (H-8). He grants you the key item Weapon Training Guide as well as the Kodachi of Trials."] = "Habla con Ryoma en Norg (H-8). Te concede el key item Weapon Training Guide y el Kodachi of Trials.",
    ["Speak with Rytaal in the Commissions Agency (K-10, door at K-9) for an explanation of Assault, which unlocks it."] = "Habla con Rytaal en la Commissions Agency (K-10, puerta en K-9) para una explicación de Assault, lo que lo desbloquea.",
    ["Speak with Salaheem's Sentinels."] = "Habla con los Salaheem's Sentinels.",
    ["Speak with Salim in Metalworks (G-7) to start the quest; he wants you to help get rid of someone. You need Bastok fame level 3."] = "Habla con Salim en Metalworks (G-7) para empezar la quest; quiere que le ayudes a deshacerse de alguien. Necesitas el nivel 3 de fama de Bastok.",
    ["Speak with Salimah in Bastok Markets (L-8) to begin the quest."] = "Habla con Salimah en Bastok Markets (L-8) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Sanosuke in Port Jeuno (H-8), inside the Duty Free Shop."] = "Habla con Sanosuke en Port Jeuno (H-8), dentro de la Duty Free Shop.",
    ["Speak with Sattal-Mansal at (J-8) and obtain the required Quadav key items."] = "Habla con Sattal-Mansal en (J-8) y obtén los key items de Quadav requeridos.",
    ["Speak with Sattal-Mansal at (J-8): trade a Quadav Charm for the Coruscant Rosary, then trade a Quadav Augury Shell for the Black Matinee Necklace."] = "Habla con Sattal-Mansal en (J-8): entrega un Quadav Charm a cambio del Coruscant Rosary, y luego un Quadav Augury Shell a cambio del Black Matinee Necklace.",
    ["Speak with Sattal-Mansal in Lower Jeuno and obtain the required key items."] = "Habla con Sattal-Mansal en Lower Jeuno y obtén los key items requeridos.",
    ["Speak with Scarred Shark (G-5) in Bastok Markets (S)."] = "Habla con Scarred Shark (G-5) en Bastok Markets (S).",
    ["Speak with Secodiand in Northern San d'Oria (F-6) to start the quest; he wants two bat wings."] = "Habla con Secodiand en Northern San d'Oria (F-6) para empezar la quest; quiere dos alas de murciélago.",
    ["Speak with Selliste in Bastok Mines (K-7) to begin the quest. You need a Synergy skill of 5 or higher."] = "Habla con Selliste en Bastok Mines (K-7) para empezar la quest. Necesitas una habilidad de Synergy de 5 o superior.",
    ["Speak with Shami in Port Jeuno (H-8) for a cutscene."] = "Habla con Shami en Port Jeuno (H-8) para una escena.",
    ["Speak with Shantotto (K-7) in Windurst Walls (K-7) for a cutscene. She asks for a Ripe starfruit, and the next mission starts."] = "Habla con Shantotto (K-7) en Windurst Walls (K-7) para una escena. Te pide una Ripe starfruit, y empieza la misión siguiente.",
    ["Speak with Shantotto (K-7) in Windurst Walls (K-7) for the final cutscene and 20,000 gil. If the title doesn't appear, it is still unlocked (Burute-Sorute, Windurst Walls (H-10), 400 gil list)."] = "Habla con Shantotto (K-7) en Windurst Walls (K-7) para la última escena y 20,000 gil. Si el título no aparece, está desbloqueado igualmente (Burute-Sorute, Windurst Walls (H-10), lista de 400 gil).",
    ["Speak with Shantotto (K-7) in Windurst Walls (K-7), Home Point #3. Koru-Moru asks for a Spectral Crimson, a Spectral Goldenrod and a Luminicloth."] = "Habla con Shantotto (K-7) en Windurst Walls (K-7), Home Point #3. Koru-Moru pide un Spectral Crimson, un Spectral Goldenrod y una Luminicloth.",
    ["Speak with Shantotto (K-7) in her manor in Windurst Walls (K-7) for a cutscene (no zoning needed)."] = "Habla con Shantotto (K-7) en su mansión de Windurst Walls (K-7) para una escena (no hace falta cambiar de zona).",
    ["Speak with Shantotto at her manor in Windurst Walls (K-7). She may start other quests first; keep talking until she mentions Sunny-Pabonny."] = "Habla con Shantotto en su mansión de Windurst Walls (K-7). Puede que antes te ofrezca otras quests; sigue hablando hasta que mencione a Sunny-Pabonny.",
    ["Speak with Shantotto in Windurst Walls (K-7) for a cutscene and the key item Glove of perpetual twilight (it may take a few tries)."] = "Habla con Shantotto en Windurst Walls (K-7) para una escena y el key item Glove of perpetual twilight (puede llevar varios intentos).",
    ["Speak with Shantotto in Windurst Walls (K-7) to receive the key item Weapon Training Guide and the Pole of Trials."] = "Habla con Shantotto en Windurst Walls (K-7) para recibir el key item Weapon Training Guide y la Pole of Trials.",
    ["Speak with Shantotto in Windurst Walls (K-7) to start the quest. The quest Blood and Glory may prevent you from starting it: come back with a job that does not meet the prerequisites for Blood and Glory."] = "Habla con Shantotto en Windurst Walls (K-7) para empezar la quest. La quest Blood and Glory puede impedirte empezarla: vuelve con un trabajo que no cumpla los requisitos de Blood and Glory.",
    ["Speak with Sharzalion in the Lion Springs Tavern in Southern San d'Oria (K-6) with Red Mage as your main job, level 40 or higher. You only have to be on Red Mage to start the quest, and you must answer \"Yes\" for it to start."] = "Habla con Sharzalion en la Lion Springs Tavern de Southern San d'Oria (K-6) con Red Mage como trabajo principal, nivel 40 o superior. Solo tienes que ser Red Mage para empezar la quest, y debes responder \"Yes\" para que empiece.",
    ["Speak with Shiftrix, the goblin by the entrance, to activate Oseem augments. Buy a Map of Reisenjima (50 silt) and a Mollifier (500 silt) for the next mission. Most monsters here aggro, some with True Sight or True Sound."] = "Habla con Shiftrix, el goblin de la entrada, para activar los aumentos de Oseem. Compra un Map of Reisenjima (50 silt) y un Mollifier (500 silt) para la misión siguiente. Aquí casi todos los monstruos atacan, algunos con True Sight o True Sound.",
    ["Speak with Sigismund on top of the Orastery in Port Windurst (E-7); he tells you about the elusive Starfall Tear."] = "Habla con Sigismund en lo alto del Orastery de Port Windurst (E-7); te habla de la esquiva Starfall Tear.",
    ["Speak with Sobane in Southern San d'Oria (D-6) to begin the quest. You must zone after finishing Signed in Blood."] = "Habla con Sobane en Southern San d'Oria (D-6) para empezar la quest. Debes cambiar de zona tras terminar Signed in Blood.",
    ["Speak with Sobane in Southern San d'Oria (D-6). Be sure to speak with her twice if you get a cutscene the first time."] = "Habla con Sobane en Southern San d'Oria (D-6). Habla con ella dos veces si la primera vez ves una escena.",
    ["Speak with Sobane in Southern San d'Oria (D-6); she asks you to bring her a Cathedral Tapestry."] = "Habla con Sobane en Southern San d'Oria (D-6); te pide que le traigas un Cathedral Tapestry.",
    ["Speak with Sobane to complete the quest."] = "Habla con Sobane para completar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Soni-Muni in Windurst Woods (H-10) to start the quest."] = "Habla con Soni-Muni en Windurst Woods (H-10) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Sorrowful Sage at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Nyzul Isle Investigation. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Sorrowful Sage en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Nyzul Isle Investigation. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Sorrowful Sage at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Nyzul Isle Uncharted Area Survey. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Sorrowful Sage en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Nyzul Isle Uncharted Area Survey. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Steel Bones in Port Bastok (D-8); after the cutscene you receive the key item Letter from Domien."] = "Habla con Steel Bones en Port Bastok (D-8); tras la escena recibes el key item Letter from Domien.",
    ["Speak with Stray Cloud in Norg (H-9) for a cutscene. You need Outlands fame level 4 and the Rise of the Zilart pack. Find Stray Cloud's friend Gubokka in the Sea Serpent Grotto."] = "Habla con Stray Cloud en Norg (H-9) para una escena. Necesitas el nivel 4 de fama de Outlands y el pack Rise of the Zilart. Encuentra a Gubokka, amigo de Stray Cloud, en la Sea Serpent Grotto.",
    ["Speak with Sueleen (H-6)."] = "Habla con Sueleen (H-6).",
    ["Speak with Sueleen in Sealion's Den (H-6), near Tavnazian Safehold Home Point #2, for a cutscene. Note: if you plan to finish Rhapsodies of Vana'diel soon, A Fate Decided is your last chance before Dawn."] = "Habla con Sueleen en Sealion's Den (H-6), cerca del Home Point #2 de Tavnazian Safehold, para una escena. Nota: si piensas terminar pronto Rhapsodies of Vana'diel, A Fate Decided es tu última oportunidad antes de Dawn.",
    ["Speak with Suldiran in Al Zahbi (J-10), on the upper level, to begin the quest. He asks for 2 Imp Wings."] = "Habla con Suldiran en Al Zahbi (J-10), en el nivel superior, para empezar la quest. Pide 2 Imp Wings.",
    ["Speak with Sylvie in Western Adoulin at the Waterfront (I-5), Waypoint #9. You need a job at level 30 or higher."] = "Habla con Sylvie en Western Adoulin, en el Waterfront (I-5), Waypoint #9. Necesitas un job de nivel 30 o superior.",
    ["Speak with Talib in Port Bastok (F-6) to start the quest. After the cutscene, accept the quest to proceed to the next portion. If you declined it the first time, you can restart it by speaking with Parraggoh in Bastok Mines (H-5), who is on the lower level."] = "Habla con Talib en Port Bastok (F-6) para empezar la quest. Tras la escena, acepta la quest para pasar a la siguiente parte. Si la rechazaste la primera vez, puedes reiniciarla hablando con Parraggoh en Bastok Mines (H-5), que está en el nivel inferior.",
    ["Speak with Talib in Port Bastok (F-6) to start the quest. This quest follows Beauty and the Galka."] = "Habla con Talib en Port Bastok (F-6) para empezar la quest. Esta quest sigue a Beauty and the Galka.",
    ["Speak with Tami in Bastok Mines (J-8) to begin the quest. She gives you the key item Tami's note. If you open and read the key item, you can no longer repeat the quest."] = "Habla con Tami en Bastok Mines (J-8) para empezar la quest. Te da el key item Tami's note. Si abres y lees el key item, ya no podrás repetir la quest.",
    ["Speak with Tapoh Lihzeh at the medicine shop at (I-8), past the Dhalmel farm, and trade her one Papaka Grass."] = "Habla con Tapoh Lihzeh en la tienda de medicinas en (I-8), pasada la granja de Dhalmel, y entrégale una Papaka Grass.",
    ["Speak with Tapoh Lihzeh in Windurst Woods (I-8). The quest will not start while Chocobilious is active."] = "Habla con Tapoh Lihzeh en Windurst Woods (I-8). La quest no empezará mientras Chocobilious esté activa.",
    ["Speak with Tarnotik (K-10) in Oldton Movalpolos (K-10) for a cutscene (Proto-Waypoint is closest, or the Survival Guide)."] = "Habla con Tarnotik (K-10) en Oldton Movalpolos (K-10) para una escena (el Proto-Waypoint es lo más cercano, o la Survival Guide).",
    ["Speak with Tarnotik (K-10) in Oldton Movalpolos (K-10) for a cutscene."] = "Habla con Tarnotik (K-10) en Oldton Movalpolos (K-10) para una escena.",
    ["Speak with Tataroon in Nashmau (G-8) to complete the quest and receive an Imperial Silver Piece."] = "Habla con Tataroon en Nashmau (G-8) para completar la quest y recibir una Imperial Silver Piece.",
    ["Speak with Tateeya in the Automaton Workshop (I-7), Aht Urhgan Whitegate, for a cutscene."] = "Habla con Tateeya en el Automaton Workshop (I-7) de Aht Urhgan Whitegate para una escena.",
    ["Speak with Tehf Kimasnahya again."] = "Habla de nuevo con Tehf Kimasnahya.",
    ["Speak with Tehf Kimasnahya in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (F-8). You need Aht Urhgan fame level 1 and the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack. He wants you to get a vial of luminous water from Ekhu Pesshyadha."] = "Habla con Tehf Kimasnahya en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (F-8). Necesitas el nivel 1 de fama de Aht Urhgan y el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan. Quiere que consigas un vial de agua luminosa de Ekhu Pesshyadha.",
    ["Speak with Tehf Kimasnahya."] = "Habla con Tehf Kimasnahya.",
    ["Speak with Tete at (I-5) in Port Bastok."] = "Habla con Tete en (I-5) en Port Bastok.",
    ["Speak with Thierride (F-8) in Southern San d'Oria (S)."] = "Habla con Thierride (F-8) en Southern San d'Oria (S).",
    ["Speak with Thierride (F-8) in the Rusty Anchor Pub in Port San d'Oria (G-7) for Thierride's bean creation."] = "Habla con Thierride (F-8) en el Rusty Anchor Pub de Port San d'Oria (G-7) para obtener la Thierride's bean creation.",
    ["Speak with Thorben (J-10) again to complete the quest and receive the reward."] = "Habla de nuevo con Thorben (J-10) para completar la quest y recibir la recompensa.",
    ["Speak with Thorben (J-10) in Batallia Downs (S)."] = "Habla con Thorben (J-10) en Batallia Downs (S).",
    ["Speak with Thunder Hawk in Selbina (G-9) to begin the quest. He wants you to rescue two merchants from captivity; they should be somewhere in the Quadav camp in Beadeaux."] = "Habla con Thunder Hawk en Selbina (G-9) para empezar la quest. Quiere que rescates a dos mercaderes cautivos; deberían estar en algún lugar del campamento Quadav de Beadeaux.",
    ["Speak with Titus again for a cutscene and to receive your reward."] = "Habla de nuevo con Titus para una escena y para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Speak with Titus on the second floor of the Alchemy Guild in Bastok Mines (L-7) for a cutscene that begins the quest. You receive the Prospector's pan and the key item Corked ampoule."] = "Habla con Titus en el segundo piso del Alchemy Guild de Bastok Mines (L-7) para una escena que empieza la quest. Recibes la Prospector's pan y el key item Corked ampoule.",
    ["Speak with Tohka Telposkha at (I-8) for a cutscene. You must tell the Galka to go to Port Ephramad; if you choose any other option, you must select again until you pick Port Ephramad."] = "Habla con Tohka Telposkha en (I-8) para una escena. Debes decirle al Galka que vaya a Port Ephramad; si eliges cualquier otra opción, debes volver a elegir hasta que escojas Port Ephramad.",
    ["Speak with Tohopka, who stands right next to Sigismund (E-7). Tohopka explains how to collect the tears and that you need Pugil Scales. Pugil enemies drop them, or you can find them at the Auction House under Bonecrafting."] = "Habla con Tohopka, que está justo junto a Sigismund (E-7). Tohopka explica cómo recoger las lágrimas y que necesitas Pugil Scales. Los enemigos Pugil las sueltan, o puedes encontrarlas en la Auction House en Bonecrafting.",
    ["Speak with Tokaka in Port Windurst (C-8) to start the quest. Home Point #1 in Port Windurst is extremely close to her."] = "Habla con Tokaka en Port Windurst (C-8) para empezar la quest. El Home Point #1 de Port Windurst está muy cerca de ella.",
    ["Speak with Torino-Samarino at the tower in Beaucedine Glacier (I-7); the Survival Guide and the Unity Warp (level 125) are fastest. The quest completes after this cutscene."] = "Habla con Torino-Samarino en la torre de Beaucedine Glacier (I-7); la Survival Guide y el Unity Warp (nivel 125) son lo más rápido. La quest se completa tras esta escena.",
    ["Speak with Tosuka-Porika (G-8) again for a cutscene (no zoning needed)."] = "Habla de nuevo con Tosuka-Porika (G-8) para una escena (no hace falta cambiar de zona).",
    ["Speak with Tosuka-Porika (G-8) in the east wing of the Optistery, Windurst Waters (Home Point #1), for a cutscene."] = "Habla con Tosuka-Porika (G-8) en el ala este de la Optistery, Windurst Waters (Home Point #1), para una escena.",
    ["Speak with Tosuka-Porika in Windurst Waters (G-8)."] = "Habla con Tosuka-Porika en Windurst Waters (G-8).",
    ["Speak with Tosuka-Porika in Windurst Waters North (G-8) to start the quest; you are sent to Furakku-Norakku, who gives you the Overdue book notification for Orn."] = "Habla con Tosuka-Porika en Windurst Waters North (G-8) para empezar la quest; te envían con Furakku-Norakku, que te da el Overdue book notification para Orn.",
    ["Speak with Tosuka-Porika in the Optistery of Windurst Waters (G-8, east door, near Home Point #1)."] = "Habla con Tosuka-Porika en la Optistery de Windurst Waters (G-8, puerta este, cerca del Home Point #1).",
    ["Speak with Tosuka-Porika in the Optistery of Windurst Waters (G-8, near Home Point #1) for a cutscene and the key item Optistery ring."] = "Habla con Tosuka-Porika en la Optistery de Windurst Waters (G-8, cerca del Home Point #1) para una escena y el key item Optistery ring.",
    ["Speak with Travonce in the Tavnazian Safehold (F-9) for your reward: Dragon Chronicles, a Glass Fiber Fishing Rod, a Sinking Minnow, or one of the odd things he fished up. The quest is repeatable."] = "Habla con Travonce en Tavnazian Safehold (F-9) para tu recompensa: Dragon Chronicles, una Glass Fiber Fishing Rod, un Sinking Minnow o una de las cosas raras que pescó. La quest es repetible.",
    ["Speak with Travonce in the Tavnazian Safehold (F-9). His final wish is to reel in the big one, and he asks you to protect him while he fishes."] = "Habla con Travonce en Tavnazian Safehold (F-9). Su último deseo es pescar el pez gordo, y te pide que lo protejas mientras pesca.",
    ["Speak with Tressia in Tavnazian Safehold (J-6). You need to have completed Darkness Named and have the Chains of Promathia pack. Search for information regarding what happened on the day Wazozo's treasure was stolen."] = "Habla con Tressia en Tavnazian Safehold (J-6). Debes haber completado Darkness Named y tener el pack Chains of Promathia. Busca información sobre lo que pasó el día que robaron el tesoro de Wazozo.",
    ["Speak with Tressia, next to Chemioue."] = "Habla con Tressia, junto a Chemioue.",
    ["Speak with Trilok in Port Bastok (D-6) to begin the quest. Only one Escort for Hire quest can be active at a time, and only one can be completed each Conquest Tally."] = "Habla con Trilok en Port Bastok (D-6) para empezar la quest. Solo puede haber una quest Escort for Hire activa a la vez, y solo se puede completar una por Conquest Tally.",
    ["Speak with Tsetseroon in Nashmau (G-6) to begin the quest. There is no cutscene to start it. He needs a cobalt jellyfish and a chunk of tin ore to make his special stew. This quest requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Habla con Tsetseroon en Nashmau (G-6) para empezar la quest. No hay escena al empezarla. Necesita una medusa cobalto y un trozo de mineral de estaño para hacer su estofado especial. Esta quest requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Speak with Turlough in present-day Upper Jeuno (G-7), watching the dancers, for the key item Mayakov show ticket."] = "Habla con Turlough en la Upper Jeuno del presente (G-7), que mira a los bailarines, para obtener el key item Mayakov show ticket.",
    ["Speak with Ulamaal for your reward, an Imperial Silver Piece."] = "Habla con Ulamaal por tu recompensa, una Imperial Silver Piece.",
    ["Speak with Umberto in Bastok Markets, near Harmodio's Music Shop (L-10), for a cutscene and your reward."] = "Habla con Umberto en Bastok Markets, cerca de Harmodio's Music Shop (L-10), para una escena y tu recompensa.",
    ["Speak with Umumu near the Dhalmel Farm in Windurst Woods (I-6) to get the key item Windurst Woods scoop."] = "Habla con Umumu cerca de la Dhalmel Farm en Windurst Woods (I-6) para obtener el key item Windurst Woods scoop.",
    ["Speak with Unlucky Rat on the first floor of the Cermet Refinery in Metalworks (G-7). You need Bastok fame level 2. He is having a machine problem."] = "Habla con Unlucky Rat en el primer piso del Cermet Refinery de Metalworks (G-7). Necesitas el nivel 2 de fama de Bastok. Tiene un problema con una máquina.",
    ["Speak with Vah Keshura at (H-9)."] = "Habla con Vah Keshura en (H-9).",
    ["Speak with Valaineral R Davilles in Southern San d'Oria (S) (H-8) for a cutscene. He may be away on Campaign; Voucheramme, Hinrich or Dallus-Mallus can tell you where the Royal Guards are. Zone out and back if he doesn't reappear."] = "Habla con Valaineral R Davilles en Southern San d'Oria (S) (H-8) para una escena. Puede estar fuera en una Campaign; Voucheramme, Hinrich o Dallus-Mallus te dicen dónde están los Royal Guards. Sal y vuelve a entrar si no reaparece.",
    ["Speak with Valgeir in Selbina (I-9), inside the Shepherd's Muster."] = "Habla con Valgeir en Selbina (I-9), dentro del Shepherd's Muster.",
    ["Speak with Vamorcote in Northern San d'Oria (F-5) to begin the quest."] = "Habla con Vamorcote en Northern San d'Oria (F-5) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Varun in Windurst Woods (H-9)."] = "Habla con Varun en Windurst Woods (H-9).",
    ["Speak with Vemalpeau inside a house in Southern San d'Oria (M-7)."] = "Habla con Vemalpeau dentro de una casa de Southern San d'Oria (M-7).",
    ["Speak with Vera in Mhaura (G-10). You need to be level 18 or higher. Fulfill her request if you want the promised rewards."] = "Habla con Vera en Mhaura (G-10). Debes ser nivel 18 o superior. Cumple su petición si quieres las recompensas prometidas.",
    ["Speak with Vounebariont in Port San d'Oria (I-10) to begin the quest."] = "Habla con Vounebariont en Port San d'Oria (I-10) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Speak with Wahid in Bastok Mines (I-8), near Home Point #1; he asks for a Siren's Tear."] = "Habla con Wahid en Bastok Mines (I-8), cerca del Home Point #1; pide una Siren's Tear.",
    ["Speak with Waoud in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-10) as a Blue Mage of level 50 or higher."] = "Habla con Waoud en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-10) como Blue Mage de nivel 50 o superior.",
    ["Speak with Waoud in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-10) to begin the quest. Raubahn directs you to find and kill a Flan in the Navukgo Execution Chamber."] = "Habla con Waoud en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-10) para empezar la quest. Raubahn te manda a encontrar y matar un Flan en la Navukgo Execution Chamber.",
    ["Speak with Waoud in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-10) to flag the quest. You need to be a Blue Mage of level 66 or higher and have the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack. Remember to set the Records of Eminence objective Level Cap Increase: 75 (BLU) under Objective, Tutorial, Level Cap Increase. Waoud may offer an optional 1,000-gil divination afterwards, which is not required."] = "Habla con Waoud en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-10) para marcar la quest. Debes ser Blue Mage de nivel 66 o superior y tener el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan. Recuerda activar el objetivo de Records of Eminence Level Cap Increase: 75 (BLU) en Objective, Tutorial, Level Cap Increase. Waoud puede ofrecerte después una adivinación opcional de 1,000 gil, que no es necesaria.",
    ["Speak with Waoud in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-10), on the top floor. You need to be level 30 or higher."] = "Habla con Waoud en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (J-10), en el piso superior. Debes ser nivel 30 o superior.",
    ["Speak with Washu at (J-8)."] = "Habla con Washu en (J-8).",
    ["Speak with Wazyih again."] = "Habla de nuevo con Wazyih.",
    ["Speak with Wazyih in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (F-11) to begin the quest. This quest requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack. His failure to deliver a package has caused a rift between him and Saliyahf, and the self-proclaimed Defenders of Aht Urhgan need your help."] = "Habla con Wazyih en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (F-11) para empezar la quest. Esta quest requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan. Su fallo al entregar un paquete ha provocado una ruptura entre él y Saliyahf, y los autoproclamados Defenders of Aht Urhgan necesitan tu ayuda.",
    ["Speak with Wetata in Windurst Woods (G-10); you receive the key item Green institute card."] = "Habla con Wetata en Windurst Woods (G-10); recibes el key item Green institute card.",
    ["Speak with Wyatt (L-6) in Southern San d'Oria (S)."] = "Habla con Wyatt (L-6) en Southern San d'Oria (S).",
    ["Speak with Yahsra at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Azure Experiments. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Yahsra en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Azure Experiments. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Yahsra at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Bloody Rondo. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Yahsra en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Bloody Rondo. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Yahsra at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Counting Sheep. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Yahsra en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Counting Sheep. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Yahsra at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Escort Professor Chanoix. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Yahsra en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Escort Professor Chanoix. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Yahsra at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Imperial Code. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Yahsra en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Imperial Code. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Yahsra at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Leujaoam Cleansing. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Yahsra en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Leujaoam Cleansing. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Yahsra at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Orichalcum Survey. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Yahsra en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Orichalcum Survey. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Yahsra at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Red Versus Blue. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Yahsra en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Red Versus Blue. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Yahsra at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Shanarha Grass Conservation. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Yahsra en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Shanarha Grass Conservation. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Yahsra at the desks in the lower area of the Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) and select Supplies Recovery. You receive Assault Orders in exchange for the tag, and every party member needs their own."] = "Habla con Yahsra en los escritorios de la zona baja de la Commissions Agency (L-9/L-10) y elige Supplies Recovery. Recibes Assault Orders a cambio de la ficha, y cada miembro del grupo necesita las suyas.",
    ["Speak with Yaya in Selbina (H-9), then Oswald (I-9), inside the Shepherd's Muster by the Nomad Moogles, then Jimaida (H-9); the quest is now active."] = "Habla con Yaya en Selbina (H-9), luego con Oswald (I-9), dentro del Shepherd's Muster junto a los Nomad Moogles, y luego con Jimaida (H-9); la quest ya está activa.",
    ["Speak with Yazan in Port Bastok (H-6), who asks you to exterminate Sand Bats in Valkurm Dunes."] = "Habla con Yazan en Port Bastok (H-6), que te pide exterminar Sand Bats en Valkurm Dunes.",
    ["Speak with Yoran-Oran in Windurst Walls (E-5); he asks for one of several items."] = "Habla con Yoran-Oran en Windurst Walls (E-5); pide uno de varios objetos.",
    ["Speak with Yujuju by the Air Travel Agency in Port Windurst (M-6) to get the key item Port Windurst scoop."] = "Habla con Yujuju junto a la Air Travel Agency en Port Windurst (M-6) para obtener el key item Port Windurst scoop.",
    ["Speak with Yurim again. Either collect the organs now, or trade him an Apple Pie for a hint. Then trade him the organs to complete the quest and receive your item."] = "Habla de nuevo con Yurim. Reúne ya los órganos o entrégale una Apple Pie para una pista. Luego entrégale los órganos para completar la quest y recibir tu objeto.",
    ["Speak with Zabahf in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (F-8)."] = "Habla con Zabahf en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (F-8).",
    ["Speak with Zacc in Bastok Markets (G-9), who is standing next to Enu. You need Bastok fame level 5."] = "Habla con Zacc en Bastok Markets (G-9), que está junto a Enu. Necesitas el nivel 5 de fama de Bastok.",
    ["Speak with Zaldon (H-9). Fish up a Fat Greedie in Selbina and trade it to Zaldon; repeat with one fish at a time until he gives you the temporary key item Etched ring."] = "Habla con Zaldon (H-9). Pesca un Fat Greedie en Selbina y entrégaselo a Zaldon; repite con un pez cada vez hasta que te dé el key item temporal Etched ring.",
    ["Speak with Zaldon in Selbina (H-9). This quest follows The Real Gift. You need a Fishing skill of 30 or higher; you can use gear and Advanced Synthesis Image Support to reach it. Some fish in Vana'diel like to eat shiny objects, and Zaldon will cut open any you catch."] = "Habla con Zaldon en Selbina (H-9). Esta quest sigue a The Real Gift. Necesitas habilidad de Fishing de 30 o más; puedes usar equipo y Advanced Synthesis Image Support para llegar a ella. A algunos peces de Vana'diel les gusta comer objetos brillantes, y Zaldon abrirá los que pesques.",
    ["Speak with Zexu."] = "Habla con Zexu.",
    ["Speak with Zon-Fobun in Bastok Markets (G-5) to begin the quest. You receive the key item Cursepaper. You need Bastok fame level 4."] = "Habla con Zon-Fobun en Bastok Markets (G-5) para empezar la quest. Recibes el key item Cursepaper. Necesitas el nivel 4 de fama de Bastok.",
    ["Speak with Zubaba on the second floor of Heavens Tower for the key item Charm of light."] = "Habla con Zubaba en el segundo piso de Heavens Tower para obtener el key item Charm of light.",
    ["Speak with a Unity Concord NPC: Urbiolaine in Southern San d'Oria (G-10), Igsli in Bastok Markets (E-11), Teldro-Kesdrodo or Yonolala in Windurst Woods (J-10), or Nunaarl Bthtrogg in Western Adoulin (H-11)."] = "Habla con un NPC de Unity Concord: Urbiolaine en Southern San d'Oria (G-10), Igsli en Bastok Markets (E-11), Teldro-Kesdrodo o Yonolala en Windurst Woods (J-10), o Nunaarl Bthtrogg en Western Adoulin (H-11).",
    ["Speak with all three imps and determine which one is honest."] = "Habla con los tres imps y determina cuál es el honesto.",
    ["Speak with any Gate Guard in San d'Oria: Ambrotien (Southern San d'Oria K-10), Endracion (Southern San d'Oria F-9) or Grilau (Northern San d'Oria D-8) and accept the mission."] = "Habla con cualquier Gate Guard de San d'Oria: Ambrotien (Southern San d'Oria K-10), Endracion (Southern San d'Oria F-9) o Grilau (Northern San d'Oria D-8) y acepta la misión.",
    ["Speak with any Gate Guard in San d'Oria: Ambrotien (Southern San d'Oria K-10), Endracion (Southern San d'Oria F-9) or Grilau (Northern San d'Oria D-8) to accept the mission."] = "Habla con cualquier Gate Guard de San d'Oria: Ambrotien (Southern San d'Oria K-10), Endracion (Southern San d'Oria F-9) o Grilau (Northern San d'Oria D-8) para aceptar la misión.",
    ["Speak with any Gate Guard in San d'Oria: Ambrotien (Southern San d'Oria K-10), Endracion (Southern San d'Oria F-9) or Grilau (Northern San d'Oria D-8)."] = "Habla con cualquier Gate Guard de San d'Oria: Ambrotien (Southern San d'Oria K-10), Endracion (Southern San d'Oria F-9) o Grilau (Northern San d'Oria D-8).",
    ["Speak with any Gate Guard in Windurst: Mokyokyo (Windurst Waters F-5), Janshura-Rashura (Port Windurst B-5), Rakoh Buuma (Windurst Woods K-10) or Zokima-Rokima (Windurst Walls H-7)."] = "Habla con cualquier Gate Guard de Windurst: Mokyokyo (Windurst Waters F-5), Janshura-Rashura (Port Windurst B-5), Rakoh Buuma (Windurst Woods K-10) o Zokima-Rokima (Windurst Walls H-7).",
    ["Speak with any Gate Guard: Argus (Port Bastok L-7), Cleades (Bastok Markets D-11), Malduc (Metalworks J-8) or Rashid (Bastok Mines H-10)."] = "Habla con cualquier Gate Guard: Argus (Port Bastok L-7), Cleades (Bastok Markets D-11), Malduc (Metalworks J-8) o Rashid (Bastok Mines H-10).",
    ["Speak with one of the Records of Eminence NPCs: Isakoth in Bastok Markets (E-11), Rolandienne in Southern San d'Oria (G-10), Fhelm Jobeizat in Windurst Woods (J-10), or the Eternal Flame in Western Adoulin (H-11)."] = "Habla con uno de los NPCs de Records of Eminence: Isakoth en Bastok Markets (E-11), Rolandienne en Southern San d'Oria (G-10), Fhelm Jobeizat en Windurst Woods (J-10) o la Eternal Flame en Western Adoulin (H-11).",
    ["Speak with the Apkallu Guide (F-7) on Arrapago Reef Map 3 (F-7) for a cutscene (Caedarva Mire Survival Guide, then east)."] = "Habla con el Apkallu Guide (F-7) en el mapa 3 de Arrapago Reef (F-7) para una escena (Survival Guide de Caedarva Mire y luego al este).",
    ["Speak with the Cardian that Kororo mentions and choose any greeting; the choice does not matter."] = "Habla con el Cardian que menciona Kororo y elige cualquier saludo; la elección no importa.",
    ["Speak with the Gate Guard three times about the book; after the guard says it will take time to decipher, return later and speak with the guard again."] = "Habla tres veces con el Gate Guard sobre el libro; cuando el guardia diga que tardará en descifrarlo, vuelve más tarde y habla de nuevo con el guardia.",
    ["Speak with the Goblin Grenadier (H-8) at the tower (H-8). You need the Map of the Northlands. Don't leave the zone until the chest is open, or it resets."] = "Habla con el Goblin Grenadier (H-8) en la torre (H-8). Necesitas el Map of the Northlands. No salgas de la zona hasta abrir el cofre, o se reinicia.",
    ["Speak with the Mandragora Warden (F-4) again and choose \"Where did Magh Bihu go?\""] = "Habla de nuevo con el Mandragora Warden (F-4) y elige \"Where did Magh Bihu go?\"",
    ["Speak with the Moogle in your home nation's Mog House for a cutscene."] = "Habla con el Moogle de la Mog House de tu nación para una escena.",
    ["Speak with the Suspicious Hume in the Pashhow Marshlands (E-12). The Voidwatch teleport or the Unity Warp to the Pashhow Marshlands are the quickest ways there."] = "Habla con el Suspicious Hume en Pashhow Marshlands (E-12). El teletransporte de Voidwatch o el Unity Warp a Pashhow Marshlands son las formas más rápidas de llegar.",
    ["Speak with the War Warlock Captains in the Orastery: Ohruru, just south of Hakkuru-Rinkuru on the stage; Goltata, against the west wall; and Yaman-Hachuman, against the wall to the northeast."] = "Habla con los War Warlock Captains del Orastery: Ohruru, justo al sur de Hakkuru-Rinkuru en el escenario; Goltata, contra la pared oeste; y Yaman-Hachuman, contra la pared del noreste.",
    ["Speak with the people around Bastok. In Bastok Mines: Deidogg (H-6), Echo Hawk (I-7), Griselda (H-5), Goraow (I-6) and Vaghron (H-9)."] = "Habla con la gente de Bastok. En Bastok Mines: Deidogg (H-6), Echo Hawk (I-7), Griselda (H-5), Goraow (I-6) y Vaghron (H-9).",
    ["Speak with the starting NPC at the Chocobo stables in Bastok Mines (J-9): Azette, Eulaphe or Quelle. You must be level 20 or higher, and you are asked to deliver a Chocobo to a distant stable."] = "Habla con el NPC inicial en los establos de Chocobos de Bastok Mines (J-9): Azette, Eulaphe o Quelle. Debes ser nivel 20 o superior, y te piden entregar un Chocobo en un establo lejano.",
    ["Speak with the starting NPC at the Chocobo stables in Windurst Woods (K-12); you are asked to deliver a Chocobo to a distant stable."] = "Habla con el NPC inicial en los establos de Chocobos de Windurst Woods (K-12); te piden entregar un Chocobo en un establo lejano.",
    ["Speak with them again until you find the one carrying the Bronze Sword, then trade it to Ruillont (G-3) in Ordelle's Caves."] = "Habla con ellos de nuevo hasta encontrar al que lleva la Bronze Sword, y entrégasela a Ruillont (G-3) en Ordelle's Caves.",
    ["Speak with these four, in any order, for short cutscenes: Fouagine (I-9, third floor, under the archway), Noam (G-9, second floor, lower section), Zadant (H-8, second floor, on the ramp down) and Raminey (J-7, third floor, Home Point #3)."] = "Habla con estos cuatro, en cualquier orden, para escenas cortas: Fouagine (I-9, tercer piso, bajo el arco), Noam (G-9, segundo piso, parte baja), Zadant (H-8, segundo piso, en la rampa de bajada) y Raminey (J-7, tercer piso, Home Point #3).",
    ["Speaking of item storage, Jeuno is also the location of the ten Gobbiebag quests, each of which expands your Inventory by 5 slots to a final total of 80. You may need more Fame to start them, so check that page for information on the quick repeatable quests to use (Mandragora-Mad for Windurst and Only the Best for both Bastok and San d'Oria simultaneously.). Take the \"Item Required Comparison\" list on each Gobbiebag quest page with a grain of salt; on some servers, the items required for any given quest may be more expensive in total than a Goblin Stew 880 or one or more of the required items may not even be in stock at all. Check the Auction House first for all four items before buying any of them!"] = "Hablando de almacenamiento, Jeuno es también donde están las diez quests de Gobbiebag, cada una de las cuales amplía tu Inventory en 5 huecos hasta un total final de 80. Puede que necesites más Fame para empezarlas, así que consulta esa página para ver las quests repetibles rápidas que usar (Mandragora-Mad para Windurst y Only the Best para Bastok y San d'Oria a la vez.). Toma con cautela la lista \"Item Required Comparison\" de cada página de quest de Gobbiebag; en algunos servidores, los objetos requeridos para una quest pueden costar en total más que un Goblin Stew 880, o puede que uno o más ni siquiera estén disponibles. ¡Mira en la Auction House los cuatro objetos antes de comprar ninguno!",
    ["Speaking of key items that open doors, there's some more of those designed to skip doors that would otherwise require three players. It's wise to pick all of these up now, since you will need some (possibly all) of them later for some combination of Limit Break 1, your Artifact Armor, and Zilart Missions"] = "Hablando de key items que abren puertas, hay algunos más pensados para saltarse puertas que si no requerirían tres jugadores. Conviene conseguirlos todos ahora, ya que necesitarás algunos (quizá todos) más adelante para alguna combinación de Limit Break 1, tu Artifact Armor y las Missions de Zilart",
    ["Speaking of, there's a far better and faster method of making gil than selling Crystals on the Auction House. As you've been completing RoE objectives, you've been acquiring Sparks of Eminence and Unity Accolades. Each of these can be used to purchase items that sell to NPCs for gil."] = "Hablando de eso, hay un método mucho mejor y más rápido de ganar gil que vender Crystals en la Auction House. Al completar objetivos de RoE has ido acumulando Sparks of Eminence y Unity Accolades. Ambas se pueden usar para comprar objetos que se venden a NPCs por gil.",
    ["Speaking to Hildolf in Metalworks (F-8) still triggers a quest under the same title. This time he asks for a vial of Slime Oil."] = "Hablar con Hildolf en Metalworks (F-8) todavía activa una quest con el mismo título. Esta vez te pide un vial de Slime Oil.",
    ["Speaking to either brother tells you how many carp he has been traded by all players since the last server maintenance."] = "Al hablar con cualquiera de los hermanos te dice cuántos carp le han entregado todos los jugadores desde el último mantenimiento del servidor.",
    ["Specifically, accept the only one you have available, Mission 1-1, and then complete it."] = "En concreto, acepta la única que tienes disponible, la Mission 1-1, y complétala.",
    ["Specifically, there's an arrival point at (G-8) of Valkurm Dunes under \"Level 119\". From there, take a few steps south and you're in Selbina."] = "En concreto, hay un punto de llegada en (G-8) de Valkurm Dunes en \"Level 119\". Desde ahí, da unos pasos al sur y estás en Selbina.",
    ["Spectral Crimson: Fomor BRD, PLD and RDM in Misareaux Coast (near the Sacrarium (E-7), the campfire at (J-11)) or Lufaise Meadows Blueblade Fell (J-6), at night (20:00-4:00)."] = "Spectral Crimson: Fomor BRD, PLD y RDM de Misareaux Coast (cerca del Sacrarium (E-7), la hoguera de (J-11)) o de Blueblade Fell en Lufaise Meadows (J-6), de noche (20:00-4:00).",
    ["Spectral Goldenrod: Haunts in Kuftal Tunnel (Survival Guide, hug the left wall to (H-7) on Map 1) or Srei Ap in Uleguerand Range (K-7)."] = "Spectral Goldenrod: Haunts de Kuftal Tunnel (Survival Guide, pégate a la pared izquierda hasta (H-7) en el mapa 1) o Srei Ap de Uleguerand Range (K-7).",
    ["Splitting the chat log into two windows and turning off its awful, slow, animation effect"] = "Dividir el registro del chat en dos ventanas y quitar su animación horrible y lenta",
    ["Stairs B, second floor Seed Afterglow (H-7): Veritas Stone."] = "Escaleras B, Seed Afterglow del segundo piso (H-7): Veritas Stone.",
    ["Stairs B, twelfth floor Seed Afterglow (H-7): Salus Stone. Take the (F-10) teleport to the Stellar Fulcrum."] = "Escaleras B, Seed Afterglow del duodécimo piso (H-7): Salus Stone. Toma el teletransporte de (F-10) al Stellar Fulcrum.",
    ["Stairs D, third floor Seed Afterglow (I-9): Sapientia Stone. Take the (G-6) teleport to Middle Delkfutt's Tower."] = "Escaleras D, Seed Afterglow del tercer piso (I-9): Sapientia Stone. Toma el teletransporte de (G-6) a Middle Delkfutt's Tower.",
    ["Stairs E, fifth floor Seed Afterglow (G-7): Felicitas Stone."] = "Escaleras E, Seed Afterglow del quinto piso (G-7): Felicitas Stone.",
    ["Stairs K, eighth floor Seed Afterglow (I-8): Amoris Stone."] = "Escaleras K, Seed Afterglow del octavo piso (I-8): Amoris Stone.",
    ["Stairs L, N, then M, ninth floor Seed Afterglow (G-8): Caritas Stone. Take the (F-6) teleport to Upper Delkfutt's Tower."] = "Escaleras L, N y luego M, Seed Afterglow del noveno piso (G-8): Caritas Stone. Toma el teletransporte de (F-6) a Upper Delkfutt's Tower.",
    ["Stairs, eleventh floor Seed Afterglow (H-7): Spei Stone."] = "Escaleras, Seed Afterglow del undécimo piso (H-7): Spei Stone.",
    ["Stand on the teleporter to go back upstairs for a cutscene and your Chaos Burgeonet."] = "Colócate sobre el teletransportador para volver arriba y ver una escena y recibir tu Chaos Burgeonet.",
    ["Starmite Shell drops from Starmite enemies. Get Starmite Shell x3."] = "La Starmite Shell la sueltan enemigos Starmite. Consigue Starmite Shell x3.",
    ["Start at beginning of the zone and work your way toward Buburimu Peninsula. Camp around there and the Crag of Mea."] = "Empieza al principio de la zona y avanza hacia Buburimu Peninsula. Acampa por allí y por el Crag of Mea.",
    ["Start at the top of the path with Ovinnik then as you get stronger venture down and add Greater Cockatrice and then Ladon."] = "Empieza en lo alto del camino con los Ovinnik y, a medida que te hagas más fuerte, baja y añade las Greater Cockatrice y luego los Ladon.",
    ["Start from the beginning of the zone and continue toward Valkurm Dunes"] = "Empieza desde el principio de la zona y avanza hacia Valkurm Dunes",
    ["Start from the beginning of the zone and continue toward Valkurm Dunes."] = "Empieza desde el principio de la zona y avanza hacia Valkurm Dunes.",
    ["Start the quest by speaking with Foss in Bastok Markets (F-7)."] = "Empieza la quest hablando con Foss en Bastok Markets (F-7).",
    ["Start the quest by talking to Yurim in Tavnazian Safehold (J-8), on the top floor. This quest requires the Chains of Promathia pack."] = "Empieza la quest hablando con Yurim en Tavnazian Safehold (J-8), en el piso superior. Esta quest requiere el pack Chains of Promathia.",
    ["Start with the Worms and the goblins just as you land on the ledge from the geyser. From there keep fighting until you are stronger to start fighting Crabs and Opo-Opo (~85+)."] = "Empieza con los gusanos y los goblins nada más caer en la cornisa desde el géiser. A partir de ahí sigue luchando hasta que seas lo bastante fuerte para empezar con los cangrejos y los Opo-Opo (~85+).",
    ["Start your Prime Weapon now: speak with Oggbi in The Steaming Sheep, Port Bastok (E-6), for Uran-Mafran's orb, then pay Gama-Shama in the Silver Knife 10,000 Gallimaufry and wait a game day."] = "Empieza ya tu Prime Weapon: habla con Oggbi en The Steaming Sheep, Port Bastok (E-6), para obtener el orbe de Uran-Mafran, luego paga 10,000 Gallimaufry a Gama-Shama en el Silver Knife y espera un día de juego.",
    ["Starting RoV Mission 1-7 temporarily locks you out of Escha - Zi'Tah, which is a very popular leveling area. You'll have to clear RoV 1-9 at around level 45ish to get back in there, and you'd start leveling there at 40 at earliest, so it's not much of a problem, but it's enough of one that I'm noting it here for the second time."] = "Empezar la RoV Mission 1-7 te impide temporalmente entrar en Escha - Zi'Tah, una zona muy popular para subir de nivel. Tendrás que superar la RoV 1-9 hacia el nivel 45 para volver a entrar, y empezarías a subir allí a nivel 40 como muy pronto, así que no es un gran problema, pero lo es lo suficiente como para mencionarlo aquí por segunda vez.",
    ["Starting Some Clocks"] = "Poner relojes en marcha",
    ["Starting a Story"] = "Empezar una historia",
    ["Stay in Windurst Waters until the quest is finished, and show the hat off by talking to the townsfolk."] = "Permanece en Windurst Waters hasta que termine la quest, y presume del sombrero hablando con los habitantes.",
    ["Steely Weapon at Ro'Maeve (G-10)/(G-11): yellow fragment. Only ranged weapons hurt it (not Daken)."] = "Steely Weapon en Ro'Maeve (G-10)/(G-11): fragmento amarillo. Solo le hacen daño las armas a distancia (no Daken).",
    ["Straight back and through the left tunnel."] = "Recto hacia el fondo y por el túnel de la izquierda.",
    ["Strength: a Beef Stewpot (15,000 gil)."] = "Fuerza: un Beef Stewpot (15,000 gil).",
    ["Style: 30 Spicy Crackers (450 gil each, 13,500 total; also easy to craft)."] = "Estilo: 30 Spicy Crackers (450 gil cada una, 13,500 en total; también son fáciles de fabricar).",
    ["Subbing In"] = "El subjob",
    ["Summon Trusts and put on DT gear, then click the Camp Remnants just west at (F-7) to fight two Merrow Kabukidancers (SAM; Torrent strips gear), two Qutrub (DRK) and two Mamool Ja Divers (MNK). AoEs only hit the main target here, so sleep them individually (not the Qutrub)."] = "Invoca a los Trusts y ponte equipo de DT, y luego pulsa los Camp Remnants justo al oeste en (F-7) para luchar contra dos Merrow Kabukidancers (SAM; Torrent quita equipo), dos Qutrub (DRK) y dos Mamool Ja Divers (MNK). Aquí los ataques de área solo alcanzan al objetivo principal, así que duérmelos de uno en uno (no a los Qutrub).",
    ["Summon your Trusts and buff first, then examine Undulating Confluence (G-8) again: Ophiotaurus spawns and attacks immediately. Only one party can have it up at a time."] = "Invoca a tus Trusts y poténciate primero, y luego examina de nuevo la Undulating Confluence (G-8): Ophiotaurus aparece y ataca al instante. Solo un grupo puede tenerlo fuera a la vez.",
    ["Supply manufacture operations are done with the Adjutant at (D-8) in Southern San d'Oria (S). They take place inside your city, with no battle outside, and any job and level can do them: you only need the knowledge of the craft."] = "Las operaciones de fabricación de suministros se hacen con el Adjutant at (D-8) in Southern San d'Oria (S). Ocurren dentro de tu ciudad, sin combate fuera, y sirve cualquier trabajo y nivel: solo hace falta conocer el oficio.",
    ["Supply manufacture operations are done with the Adjutant at (F-9) in Windurst Waters (S). They take place inside your city, with no battle outside, and any job and level can do them: you only need the knowledge of the craft."] = "Las operaciones de fabricación de suministros se hacen con el Adjutant at (F-9) in Windurst Waters (S). Ocurren dentro de tu ciudad, sin combate fuera, y sirve cualquier trabajo y nivel: solo hace falta conocer el oficio.",
    ["Supply manufacture operations are done with the Adjutant at (J-9) in Bastok Markets (S). They take place inside your city, with no battle outside, and any job and level can do them: you only need the knowledge of the craft."] = "Las operaciones de fabricación de suministros se hacen con el Adjutant at (J-9) in Bastok Markets (S). Ocurren dentro de tu ciudad, sin combate fuera, y sirve cualquier trabajo y nivel: solo hace falta conocer el oficio.",
    ["Survive"] = "Sobrevive",
    ["Swift shows you a picture of the passenger who dropped an item. You can look at it as many times as you like; when you say you have it memorized you receive the key item Dropped Item."] = "Swift te muestra una imagen del pasajero al que se le cayó un objeto. Puedes mirarla tantas veces como quieras; cuando digas que la has memorizado recibes el key item Dropped Item.",
    ["Synergize the stones into Astral Matter in a Synergy Furnace, then trade the result to Selliste for your reward, a Portafurnace."] = "Sintetiza las piedras en Astral Matter en un Synergy Furnace y luego entrega el resultado a Selliste por tu recompensa, un Portafurnace.",
    ["Synthesize a Goblin Coif (Leathercraft 75, Earth Crystal): Goblin Cutting, Steel Sheet, Linen Cloth, 2 Artificial Lens, Moblin Thread, Undead Skin and Sheep Leather."] = "Sintetiza un Goblin Coif (Leathercraft 75, Earth Crystal): Goblin Cutting, Steel Sheet, Linen Cloth, 2 Artificial Lens, Moblin Thread, Undead Skin y Sheep Leather.",
    ["Synthesize a Quadav Barbut (Bonecraft 78, Earth Crystal): Quadav Parts, Tiger Leather, Lizard Molt, Bugard Tusk, Wool Thread, Red Grass Cloth and 2 Black Pearls."] = "Sintetiza un Quadav Barbut (Bonecraft 78, Earth Crystal): Quadav Parts, Tiger Leather, Lizard Molt, Bugard Tusk, Wool Thread, Red Grass Cloth y 2 Black Pearls.",
    ["Synthesize an Orc Helm (Leathercraft 74, Earth Crystal): Orc Cutting, Iron Sheet, Linen Thread, Wool Thread, 2 Manticore Hair and 2 Black Pearls."] = "Sintetiza un Orc Helm (Leathercraft 74, Earth Crystal): Orc Cutting, Iron Sheet, Linen Thread, Wool Thread, 2 Manticore Hair y 2 Black Pearls.",
    ["TP Burn, SC/MB, and other party setups will work."] = "Sirven TP Burn, SC/MB y otras composiciones de grupo.",
    ["TP Drainkiss can interrupt skillchains."] = "TP Drainkiss puede interrumpir skillchains.",
    ["Tahrongi Canyon at (H-12)"] = "Tahrongi Canyon en (H-12)",
    ["Take (F-8) (\"B\") back to map 1, go up the ramp at (E-10), make your way to (I-9) and then (K-6) (you can drop from the second level), and follow the path to (M-8) into Qulun Dome. Enemies wait beyond the zone line."] = "Toma (F-8) (\"B\") de vuelta al mapa 1, sube la rampa de (E-10), avanza hasta (I-9) y luego (K-6) (puedes dejarte caer desde el segundo nivel) y sigue el camino hasta (M-8) para entrar en Qulun Dome. Hay enemigos esperando tras el límite de zona.",
    ["Take Portal #4 and go north to get to leveling area."] = "Toma el Portal #4 y ve al norte para llegar a la zona de subir de nivel.",
    ["Take Portal #4 and go south and west."] = "Toma el Portal #4 y ve al sur y al oeste.",
    ["Take Silent Oil and Prism Powder to the Labyrinth of Onzozo. Inside, follow the path to (H-9) and take the eastern tunnel, continue northeast through the large room and take the tunnel at (J-8). In the next large room, curve around the eastern wall to the tunnel at (H-7), head north at the next intersection, and continue north to the border of (I-5)/(I-6), where the ??? spawns the NM."] = "Lleva Silent Oil y Prism Powder al Labyrinth of Onzozo. Dentro, sigue el camino hasta (H-9) y toma el túnel del este, continúa al noreste por la sala grande y toma el túnel de (J-8). En la siguiente sala grande, rodea la pared este hasta el túnel de (H-7), ve al norte en la siguiente intersección y sigue al norte hasta el límite de (I-5)/(I-6), donde la ??? invoca al NM.",
    ["Take Silent Oil: the Weapons aggro by sound and magic and the Dolls by magic, so Sneak (a spell) isn't recommended. Inside Ro'Maeve, go down the north-east stairs and turn immediately east, take the hallway to the right, turn left, drop down the ledge and go through the north-east door. Turn left and up the stairs to the north at (K-8), then follow the path north-west to the open doorway at (J-8). From the Survival Guide or the Hall of the Gods entrance, just run down the long stairs to the south-east."] = "Lleva Silent Oil: los Weapons detectan por sonido y magia y los Dolls por magia, así que no se recomienda Sneak (el hechizo). Dentro de Ro'Maeve, baja las escaleras del noreste y gira enseguida al este, toma el pasillo de la derecha, gira a la izquierda, déjate caer de la cornisa y cruza la puerta del noreste. Gira a la izquierda y sube las escaleras al norte en (K-8), luego sigue el camino al noroeste hasta la puerta abierta de (J-8). Desde la Survival Guide o la entrada de Hall of the Gods, baja corriendo las largas escaleras hacia el sureste.",
    ["Take a Mythril Beastcoin (farm it or buy it on the Auction House) to Quu Bokye in the lower levels of Giddeus and trade it for the Leather-bound Book."] = "Lleva una Mythril Beastcoin (farméala o cómprala en la Auction House) a Quu Bokye, en los niveles inferiores de Giddeus, y entrégasela a cambio del Leather-bound Book.",
    ["Take a left at the T intersection, then head north. Go west until another split."] = "Gira a la izquierda en la intersección en T y ve al norte. Ve al oeste hasta otra bifurcación.",
    ["Take exit A or B, then C to Map 3, and ride the beastmen beacon teleporters. After each one, check the Craggy Pillar in that room (after the 4th, it's in the next room south) until one gives the Mega Bonanza Kupon. Don't zone into the next area by accident."] = "Toma la salida A o B, luego la C al mapa 3, y usa los teletransportadores de baliza de los hombres bestia. Tras cada uno, revisa el Craggy Pillar de esa sala (tras el 4.º, está en la sala siguiente al sur) hasta que uno te dé el Mega Bonanza Kupon. No entres por accidente en la zona siguiente.",
    ["Take the Batagreens back to Abeaule for your reward."] = "Lleva el Batagreens a Abeaule para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Take the Bruised Starfruit to Apururu."] = "Lleva la Bruised Starfruit a Apururu.",
    ["Take the Glowstone that drops from the Chaos Elemental and return to Chumimi to complete the quest and receive a Casting Wand."] = "Toma el Glowstone que suelta el Chaos Elemental y vuelve con Chumimi para completar la quest y recibir un Casting Wand.",
    ["Take the Moccasins and the Yagudo Holy Water to Narcheral (M-6) in Northern San d'Oria to complete the quest and obtain your Healer's Duckbills."] = "Lleva los Moccasins y el Yagudo Holy Water a Narcheral (M-6) en Northern San d'Oria para completar la quest y obtener tus Healer's Duckbills.",
    ["Take the Ripped Cap to Baren-Moren in Windurst Waters South (H-7)."] = "Lleva la Ripped Cap a Baren-Moren en Windurst Waters South (H-7).",
    ["Take the Selbina Clay to the Stone Monuments around the world and copy their writings. Repeat for the remaining Stone Monuments; the quest does not complete until you finish all the tablets."] = "Lleva el Selbina Clay a los Stone Monuments de todo el mundo y copia sus escritos. Repite con los Stone Monuments restantes; la quest no se completa hasta que termines todas las tablillas.",
    ["Take the Starfall Tear back to Sigismund to complete the quest and receive a Fish Scale Shield."] = "Lleva la Starfall Tear de vuelta a Sigismund para completar la quest y recibir un Fish Scale Shield.",
    ["Take the Supplies Order to the tower at (I-11) in West Ronfaure and trade it to Phairet to receive the Batagreens. Trading him 50 gil also gets you the Batagreens, as long as the quest has been flagged."] = "Lleva el Supplies Order a la torre en (I-11) de West Ronfaure y entrégalo a Phairet para recibir el Batagreens. Darle 50 gil también te consigue el Batagreens, siempre que la quest esté activada.",
    ["Take the Supplies package to any Staging Point except Nyzul Isle (Azouph Isle, Dvucca Isle, Mamool Ja, Halvung or Ilrusi Atoll). You will want them all eventually. Tip: the Voidwatch warp (Atmacite Refiner > Aht Urhgan > Caedarva Mire, 1,000 cruor) puts you just outside Nashmau, close to the Azouph Isle Staging Point."] = "Lleva el Supplies package a cualquier Staging Point salvo Nyzul Isle (Azouph Isle, Dvucca Isle, Mamool Ja, Halvung o Ilrusi Atoll). Acabarás queriéndolos todos. Consejo: el warp de Voidwatch (Atmacite Refiner > Aht Urhgan > Caedarva Mire, 1,000 cruor) te deja justo fuera de Nashmau, cerca del Azouph Isle Staging Point.",
    ["Take the Survival Guide to The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah and head to the north-west corner of (F-6) for the ???. Fastest: take the Unity Warp to Ro'Maeve (level 125) and zone into The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah; the wiki gives the ??? there as (F-5)."] = "Toma la Survival Guide a The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah y ve a la esquina noroeste de (F-6) para la ???. Lo más rápido: toma el Unity Warp a Ro'Maeve (nivel 125) y entra en The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah; la wiki sitúa allí la ??? en (F-5).",
    ["Take the Tavnazia Pass back to Narcheral to complete the quest and receive your Blessed Hammer."] = "Lleva el Tavnazia Pass a Narcheral para completar la quest y recibir tu Blessed Hammer.",
    ["Take the bisque to Take for your reward, the Tableware Set, and the title Three-Star Purveyor."] = "Lleva la bisque a Take para tu recompensa, el Tableware Set, y el título Three-Star Purveyor.",
    ["Take the elevator back down and cross the bridge off the island (don't drop into the river). Continue to Sedal-Godjal at (J-8) and speak with him until he turns your key item into the Magic-drained Star Seeker."] = "Baja de nuevo en el ascensor y cruza el puente para salir de la isla (no te caigas al río). Sigue hasta Sedal-Godjal en (J-8) y habla con él hasta que convierta tu key item en el Magic-drained Star Seeker.",
    ["Take the elevator to the bottom level (no Diremites at the bottom)."] = "Toma el ascensor hasta el nivel inferior (abajo no hay Diremites).",
    ["Take the ferry between Mhaura and Selbina and fish up Ocean Crab; they drop the Bronze Box you need."] = "Toma el ferry entre Mhaura y Selbina y pesca Ocean Crab; sueltan el Bronze Box que necesitas.",
    ["Take the ferry from Mhaura to Aht Urhgan Whitegate. Once you have the Boarding Permit you can skip the boat: Unity Warp (level 125) to Wajaom Woodlands puts you a short walk from Whitegate."] = "Toma el ferry de Mhaura a Aht Urhgan Whitegate. Cuando tengas el Boarding Permit puedes saltarte el barco: el Unity Warp (nivel 125) a Wajaom Woodlands te deja a poca distancia de Whitegate.",
    ["Take the first left and walk toward (I-6) on map 2 to use exit B to map 1, then go toward (H-9) and take exit D back to map 2."] = "Toma el primer desvío a la izquierda y camina hacia (I-6) en el mapa 2 para usar la salida B al mapa 1, luego ve hacia (H-9) y toma la salida D de vuelta al mapa 2.",
    ["Take the letter to Windurst Waters and talk to Angelica at the Rarab Tail Hostelry. You receive the key items Angelica's letter and the painting \"Final Fantasy\", which she wants you to hang in the Temple of Uggalepih."] = "Lleva la carta a Windurst Waters y habla con Angelica en el Rarab Tail Hostelry. Recibes los key items Angelica's letter y el cuadro \"Final Fantasy\", que quiere que cuelgues en el Temple of Uggalepih.",
    ["Take the northern Port Ephramad ferry to Nashmau and go through the North Gate to Caedarva Mire. Head northeast or northwest to the (I-6) zone line to Arrapago Reef. The Arrapago Reef Survival Guide also works."] = "Toma el ferry del norte de Port Ephramad a Nashmau y cruza la North Gate hacia Caedarva Mire. Ve al noreste o al noroeste hasta el límite de zona de (I-6) hacia Arrapago Reef. La Survival Guide de Arrapago Reef también sirve.",
    ["Take the note to Ipupu in West Sarutabaruta (I-8/J-8), near the entrance to Windurst Waters."] = "Lleva la nota a Ipupu en West Sarutabaruta (I-8/J-8), cerca de la entrada a Windurst Waters.",
    ["Take the portrait to Umberto in Bastok Markets (L-10) for a cutscene that completes the quest. Your Adventuring Fellow's level cap rises to 55 and you earn the title Team Player."] = "Lleva el retrato a Umberto en Bastok Markets (L-10) para una escena que completa la quest. El límite de nivel de tu Adventuring Fellow sube a 55 y obtienes el título Team Player.",
    ["Take the right-hand teleporter at (I-9) as you enter the room, then examine the blank spot in the north-west corner of (G-7) for a cutscene. Examine it again to spawn the Nepionic Soulflayer (if it won't spawn, logging out and back in may fix it)."] = "Toma el teletransportador de la derecha en (I-9) al entrar en la sala y examina el punto vacío de la esquina noroeste de (G-7) para una escena. Examínalo de nuevo para hacer aparecer al Nepionic Soulflayer (si no aparece, desconectar y volver a entrar puede arreglarlo).",
    ["Take the scroll to Horlais Peak (hot springs side) and trade it to the hot springs there. This transforms the scroll into a Scroll of Jubaku: Ichi and gives you the title Cracker of the Secret Code."] = "Lleva el pergamino a Horlais Peak (lado de las fuentes termales) y entrégalo a las fuentes termales de allí. Esto transforma el pergamino en un Scroll of Jubaku: Ichi y te da el título Cracker of the Secret Code.",
    ["Take the southeastern transport device at (H-9) to the Bhaflau Remnants, then the right (eastern) one into the Alzadaal Undersea Ruins."] = "Toma el dispositivo de transporte sureste de (H-9) a Bhaflau Remnants y luego el de la derecha (este) a Alzadaal Undersea Ruins.",
    ["Take the unity (lvl 135) warp to the zone or use the Home Point for quick access."] = "Toma el warp de Unity (nivel 135) a la zona o usa el Home Point para un acceso rápido.",
    ["Take them off or disable the lockstyle, then speak with Oscarnot for a cutscene. (If Zemerine's cutscene didn't play, try this step anyway.)"] = "Quítatelas o desactiva el lockstyle y habla con Oscarnot para una escena. (Si no salió la escena de Zemerine, prueba este paso de todos modos.)",
    ["Take trips to briefly enter the rest of the Abyssea Cavernous Maws in:"] = "Haz viajes para entrar brevemente en el resto de los Cavernous Maws de Abyssea en:",
    ["Talk to Abelard in Selbina (G-9) to receive some Selbina Clay. You need to be level 15 or higher. The mayor wants you to find the stone monuments left by a certain adventurer and copy their writings to clay."] = "Habla con Abelard en Selbina (G-9) para recibir algo de Selbina Clay. Debes ser nivel 15 o superior. El alcalde quiere que encuentres los monumentos de piedra que dejó cierto aventurero y copies sus escritos en arcilla.",
    ["Talk to Angelica again; she tells you to wear your item."] = "Habla de nuevo con Angelica; te dice que te pongas tu objeto.",
    ["Talk to Angelica and stand still for 10 seconds."] = "Habla con Angelica y quédate quieto durante 10 segundos.",
    ["Talk to Angelica one last time to complete the quest and receive Ancient Blood and Angelica's autograph."] = "Habla con Angelica una última vez para completar la quest y recibir Ancient Blood y el Angelica's autograph.",
    ["Talk to Bondada in the hat shop, Honoi-Gomoi in Gingerberry Grove (E-7) and Kenapa-Keppa in the Rhinostery (South map), since they react to the hat."] = "Habla con Bondada en la tienda de sombreros, Honoi-Gomoi en Gingerberry Grove (E-7) y Kenapa-Keppa en el Rhinostery (mapa sur), ya que reaccionan al sombrero.",
    ["Talk to Chemioue (J-6). If you have not done Petals for Parelbriaux and you are at Promathia Mission 3-5 or later, you may get that cutscene first."] = "Habla con Chemioue (J-6). Si no has hecho Petals for Parelbriaux y estás en la Promathia Mission 3-5 o posterior, puede que veas esa escena primero.",
    ["Talk to Despachiaire in Tavnazian Safehold (K-10), on the top floor. This quest follows Spice Gals and requires the Chains of Promathia pack."] = "Habla con Despachiaire en Tavnazian Safehold (K-10), en el piso superior. Esta quest sigue a Spice Gals y requiere el pack Chains of Promathia.",
    ["Talk to Despachiaire in Tavnazian Safehold (K-10, upper level), behind the Walnut Door at (K-9), to start the quest."] = "Habla con Despachiaire en Tavnazian Safehold (K-10, nivel superior), tras la Walnut Door en (K-9), para empezar la quest.",
    ["Talk to Enaremand in Tavnazian Safehold (J-7, Home Point #3), on the upper level. This quest follows It's Raining Mannequins and requires the Chains of Promathia pack. One last material is required to complete his final masterpiece, and the mannequin craftswoman in Mhaura may have clues."] = "Habla con Enaremand en Tavnazian Safehold (J-7, Home Point #3), en el nivel superior. Esta quest sigue a It's Raining Mannequins y requiere el pack Chains of Promathia. Falta un último material para completar su obra maestra final, y la artesana de mannequins de Mhaura puede tener pistas.",
    ["Talk to Equette (I-9, 2nd floor)."] = "Habla con Equette (I-9, 2.º piso).",
    ["Talk to Etteh Sulaej in Kazham (J-9). You need Kazham fame level 6 and the Rise of the Zilart pack, and this quest follows A Pose by Any Other Name. You receive the key item Letter to Angelica."] = "Habla con Etteh Sulaej en Kazham (J-9). Necesitas el nivel 6 de fama de Kazham y el pack Rise of the Zilart, y esta quest sigue a A Pose by Any Other Name. Recibes el key item Letter to Angelica.",
    ["Talk to Fari-Wari at the Shararat Teahouse in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-12) for a cutscene that begins the quest. This quest requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack, and Gadalar must be present in Al Zahbi."] = "Habla con Fari-Wari en la Shararat Teahouse de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-12) para una escena que empieza la quest. Esta quest requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan, y Gadalar debe estar presente en Al Zahbi.",
    ["Talk to Frescheque in Tavnazian Safehold (H-8, 3rd floor) to start the quest."] = "Habla con Frescheque en Tavnazian Safehold (H-8, 3.er piso) para empezar la quest.",
    ["Talk to Ghebi Damomohe inside the totally legitimate \"Neptune's Spire\" in Lower Jeuno and complete a brief quest to officially join the Tenshodo, Vana'diel's finest organized crime syndicate."] = "Habla con Ghebi Damomohe dentro del totalmente legal \"Neptune's Spire\" de Lower Jeuno y completa una quest breve para unirte oficialmente al Tenshodo, el mejor sindicato del crimen organizado de Vana'diel.",
    ["Talk to Hagakoff, then go back to Abquhbah, then Hagakoff once more. Through these cutscenes you learn that Naja Salaheem's mace is rusty and needs to be cleaned, and that the best way is with Scourshrooms, found in Aydeewa Subterrane."] = "Habla con Hagakoff, luego vuelve con Abquhbah y otra vez con Hagakoff. Con estas escenas te enteras de que la maza de Naja Salaheem está oxidada y hay que limpiarla, y de que la mejor forma es con Scourshrooms, que se encuentran en Aydeewa Subterrane.",
    ["Talk to Jaucribaix in Norg (K-8), near the Captain's Chamber, while on Samurai to initiate the quest. You need to be a Samurai of level 40 or higher and have the Rise of the Zilart pack; this quest follows Forge Your Destiny. You may change to a different job to complete the rest of the quest."] = "Habla con Jaucribaix en Norg (K-8), cerca de la Captain's Chamber, siendo Samurai para iniciar la quest. Debes ser Samurai de nivel 40 o superior y tener el pack Rise of the Zilart; esta quest sigue a Forge Your Destiny. Puedes cambiar a otro trabajo para completar el resto de la quest.",
    ["Talk to Jonette on the middle floor, near the stream at (G-9)."] = "Habla con Jonette en el piso intermedio, cerca del arroyo en (G-9).",
    ["Talk to Maat before every fight: he asks for that job's Testimony and names the battlefield. After your first win each job has an assigned arena, and you have to walk, use the Tenshodo warp or a Home Point to get there: Balga's Dais for MNK/WHM/SMN, Horlais Peak for WAR/BLM/RNG, Qu'Bia Arena for PLD/DRK/BRD, Waughroon Shrine for RDM/THF/BST, Chamber of Oracles for SAM/NIN/DRG. The fights are like Shattering Stars, without the level cap."] = "Habla con Maat antes de cada pelea: pide el Testimony de ese job y nombra el campo de batalla. Tras tu primera victoria cada job tiene una arena asignada, y tienes que ir andando, con el warp del Tenshodo o con un Home Point: Balga's Dais para MNK/WHM/SMN, Horlais Peak para WAR/BLM/RNG, Qu'Bia Arena para PLD/DRK/BRD, Waughroon Shrine para RDM/THF/BST, Chamber of Oracles para SAM/NIN/DRG. Las peleas son como Shattering Stars, sin límite de nivel.",
    ["Talk to Maudaal in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (E-9) to start the quest. You receive a lengthy cutscene. You have been hired by Professor Clavauert B Chanoix to accompany him and his guinea toad, Salwa-Molwa, to Mamook to research the elusive Poroggo."] = "Habla con Maudaal en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (E-9) para empezar la quest. Recibes una escena larga. Te ha contratado el Professor Clavauert B Chanoix para acompañarle a él y a su cobaya sapo, Salwa-Molwa, a Mamook para investigar al esquivo Poroggo.",
    ["Talk to Mihli Aliapoh in Al Zahbi (H-7), who tells you to obtain a Colorful Hair."] = "Habla con Mihli Aliapoh en Al Zahbi (H-7), que te dice que consigas un Colorful Hair.",
    ["Talk to Nadeey at (K-7) inside the Walahra Temple. You may get a cutscene upon entry for The Rider Cometh."] = "Habla con Nadeey en (K-7) dentro del Walahra Temple. Puede que veas una escena al entrar por The Rider Cometh.",
    ["Talk to Naja Salaheem in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10) to receive the Quartz transmitter."] = "Habla con Naja Salaheem en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10) para recibir el Quartz transmitter.",
    ["Talk to Naja Salaheem in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10). When presented an option, choose \"Balrahn Way\"."] = "Habla con Naja Salaheem en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10). Cuando te den una opción, elige \"Balrahn Way\".",
    ["Talk to Olavia to stop her, and again to make her walk on. She dies easily, so stop her before camps of aggressive monsters and clear the way first."] = "Habla con Olavia para detenerla, y otra vez para que siga caminando. Muere con facilidad, así que detenla antes de los grupos de monstruos agresivos y despeja el camino primero.",
    ["Talk to Pesoso to start. Clear three rooms of weak monsters; the last one in each room flees to a wall and blows it open to the next room."] = "Habla con Pesoso para empezar. Limpia tres salas de monstruos débiles; el último de cada sala huye hacia una pared y la vuela para abrir paso a la siguiente.",
    ["Talk to Quelveuiat in Tavnazian Safehold (I-10, middle floor)."] = "Habla con Quelveuiat en Tavnazian Safehold (I-10, piso intermedio).",
    ["Talk to Raminey (J-7, 3rd floor)."] = "Habla con Raminey (J-7, 3.er piso).",
    ["Talk to Rubahah at (F-9) and repeat this process, and then do the same with Cacaroon at (G-11)."] = "Habla con Rubahah en (F-9) y repite este proceso, y luego haz lo mismo con Cacaroon en (G-11).",
    ["Talk to Ryoma in Norg (H-8), at Home Point #1, to begin the quest, then head to Port Bastok. You need to be a Ninja of level 40 or higher, Outlands fame level 1 and the Rise of the Zilart pack; this quest follows Ayame and Kaede. Norg has begun investigating an ancient scroll that was rediscovered recently."] = "Habla con Ryoma en Norg (H-8), junto al Home Point #1, para empezar la quest y luego ve a Port Bastok. Debes ser Ninja de nivel 40 o superior, tener el nivel 1 de fama de Outlands y el pack Rise of the Zilart; esta quest sigue a Ayame and Kaede. Norg ha empezado a investigar un pergamino antiguo que se redescubrió hace poco.",
    ["Talk to Saliyahf at (G-7)."] = "Habla con Saliyahf en (G-7).",
    ["Talk to Shamarhaan in Bastok Markets (F-9). You need to be level 30 or higher and have the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Habla con Shamarhaan en Bastok Markets (F-9). Debes ser nivel 30 o superior y tener el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Talk to Vuntar in Selbina (H-9). He will pay a premium price for rolanberries, but only for those that are thoroughly aged and can serve as food for long voyages."] = "Habla con Vuntar en Selbina (H-9). Pagará un precio superior por rolanberries, pero solo por las que estén completamente maduradas y sirvan de comida para viajes largos.",
    ["Talk to Wanzo-Unzozo to stop him, and again to make him continue. He draws aggro from almost everything, and at low HP draws undead, so cure him. He can run through the Banishing Gate like monsters, so stop him before you open it, or carry the Pouch of weighted stones."] = "Habla con Wanzo-Unzozo para detenerlo, y de nuevo para que continúe. Atrae a casi todo, y con HP bajo atrae a los no-muertos, así que cúralo. Puede cruzar la Banishing Gate como los monstruos, así que detenlo antes de abrirla o lleva la Pouch of weighted stones.",
    ["Talk to Washu. He gives you an Empty Barrel, which you need to fill with Opo-opo brew found in a Yhoator Jungle tree."] = "Habla con Washu. Te da un Empty Barrel, que debes llenar con Opo-opo brew que se encuentra en un árbol de Yhoator Jungle.",
    ["Talk to Zoriboh in Rabao (F-6)."] = "Habla con Zoriboh en Rabao (F-6).",
    ["Talk to a Task Delegator now so you start earning imprimaturs for Coalition Assignments."] = "Habla ahora con un Task Delegator para empezar a ganar imprimaturs para las Coalition Assignments.",
    ["Talk to the nearby Taru in a chocobo suit, Mapitoto, to start the quest Full Speed Ahead!. After a (frankly awful) raptor riding tutorial mission, you will unlock Mounts."] = "Habla con la Taru disfrazada de chocobo de al lado, Mapitoto, para empezar la quest Full Speed Ahead!. Tras una misión tutorial de montar en raptor (francamente horrible), desbloquearás las monturas.",
    ["Talk to these NPCs in this exact order: first Ohbiru-Dohbiru in the southern Rhinostery building (J-9), who says he's hungry; then Kerutoto in the northern Rhinostery building (J-8), which adds the quest to your log."] = "Habla con estos NPCs en este orden exacto: primero Ohbiru-Dohbiru en el edificio sur de la Rhinostery (J-9), que dice que tiene hambre; luego Kerutoto en el edificio norte de la Rhinostery (J-8), lo que añade la quest a tu registro.",
    ["Talk to your Moogle. He says he found something and gives you a Small teacup. If he does not give it to you, you may not have waited long enough."] = "Habla con tu Moogle. Dice que encontró algo y te da una Small teacup. Si no te la da, puede que no hayas esperado lo suficiente.",
    ["Talking to the Unity Concord NPC in your home city and selecting \"bring me to a Wanted Encounter area\" will let you teleport directly to a broad variety of locations."] = "Hablar con el NPC de Unity Concord de tu ciudad y elegir \"bring me to a Wanted Encounter area\" te permite teletransportarte directamente a muchísimos lugares.",
    ["Tangaroa in the Kuftal Tunnel: rifts on Map 2 at (F-8) and (J-9), and on Map 3 at (I-8). The closest teleport is the Unity Warp (level 125) to Map 2."] = "Tangaroa en Kuftal Tunnel: rifts en el mapa 2 en (F-8) y (J-9), y en el mapa 3 en (I-8). El teletransporte más cercano es el Unity Warp (nivel 125) al mapa 2.",
    ["Teldro-Kesdrodo in Windurst Woods (J-10)"] = "Teldro-Kesdrodo en Windurst Woods (J-10)",
    ["Teleport G, seventh floor Seed Afterglow (H-9): Studium Stone."] = "Teletransporte G, Seed Afterglow del séptimo piso (H-9): Studium Stone.",
    ["Teleport to Bastok Mines Home Point #3, go inside the house (upper floor) at (J-7) and speak with Gumbah. Speak to him repeatedly until you get the cutscene that begins the quest, which mentions finding Zeid; if the dialogue keeps repeating, zone and try again. You must be level 30 or higher."] = "Teletranspórtate al Home Point #3 de Bastok Mines, entra en la casa (piso superior) de (J-7) y habla con Gumbah. Habla con él repetidamente hasta obtener la escena que empieza la quest, que menciona encontrar a Zeid; si el diálogo se repite, cambia de zona y vuelve a intentarlo. Debes ser de nivel 30 o superior.",
    ["Teleporting to another HP in the same city is free, so teleport around your home city at will."] = "Teletransportarse a otro HP de la misma ciudad es gratis, así que muévete por tu ciudad como quieras.",
    ["Temple of Uggalepih: Malice (F-10) Map 1, Deceit (F-8) Map 1, Envy (F-8) Map 2, Greed (G-10) Map 2, Pride (J-11) Map 2, Bale (I-8) Map 2."] = "Temple of Uggalepih: Malice (F-10) mapa 1, Deceit (F-8) mapa 1, Envy (F-8) mapa 2, Greed (G-10) mapa 2, Pride (J-11) mapa 2, Bale (I-8) mapa 2.",
    ["Temple route: enter from Yhoator Jungle (J-11/12), go to the northwestern exit (F-5), turn left in Yhoator Jungle and re-enter at (H-11). Pass the Temple Guardian's door at (I-10) (kill it if it is up). At (I-7), whoever has the Paintbrush examines the empty frame, waits 30 seconds without moving or being attacked, and examines it again to open the door to the Den of Rancor."] = "Ruta del Temple: entra desde Yhoator Jungle (J-11/12), ve a la salida noroeste (F-5), gira a la izquierda en Yhoator Jungle y vuelve a entrar por (H-11). Pasa la puerta del Temple Guardian en (I-10) (mátalo si está). En (I-7), quien tenga el Paintbrush examina el marco vacío, espera 30 segundos sin moverse ni ser atacado y lo examina de nuevo para abrir la puerta a Den of Rancor.",
    ["Tends to be a bit crowded."] = "Suele estar algo concurrido.",
    ["Tenth floor Seed Afterglow (F-10): Constantia Stone."] = "Seed Afterglow del décimo piso (F-10): Constantia Stone.",
    ["Test tube #1 goes to Wajaom Woodlands (H-11), #2 to Wajaom Woodlands (G-11), #3 to Wajaom Woodlands (I-7), #4 to Wajaom Woodlands (J-8) and #5 to Bhaflau Thickets (G-7), on map 1."] = "El Test tube #1 va a Wajaom Woodlands (H-11), el #2 a Wajaom Woodlands (G-11), el #3 a Wajaom Woodlands (I-7), el #4 a Wajaom Woodlands (J-8) y el #5 a Bhaflau Thickets (G-7), en el mapa 1.",
    ["Thanks to the enemy destroying a bridge along the path of the attack, the unit assaulting Periqia is at an impasse. Mission orders: activate the bridge."] = "Como el enemigo destruyó un puente en la ruta del ataque, la unidad que asalta Periqia está en un punto muerto. Órdenes de la misión: activar el puente.",
    ["That's:"] = "Es decir:",
    ["The \"Config\" settings are mostly self-explanatory, aside from the two-chat-window text splits and the subsequent chat filters added in 2023, which often require trial and error to get just right."] = "Los ajustes de \"Config\" se explican casi solos, salvo la división del texto en dos ventanas de chat y los filtros de chat añadidos en 2023, que a menudo requieren prueba y error para dejarlos a tu gusto.",
    ["The \"middle\" zones on the path to Jeuno (Pashhow Marshlands, Jugner Forest, and Meriphataud Mountains) also have a Survival Guide each at their outpost and an attached beastman stronghold zone each (Beadeaux, Davoi, and Castle Oztroja) with a Survival Guide at the entrance."] = "Las zonas \"intermedias\" del camino a Jeuno (Pashhow Marshlands, Jugner Forest y Meriphataud Mountains) también tienen cada una una Survival Guide en su puesto avanzado y una fortaleza de hombres bestia conectada (Beadeaux, Davoi y Castle Oztroja) con una Survival Guide en la entrada.",
    ["The ??? spot is always present at the far end of the cave, and you receive the key item once you touch it, so you do not need to defeat the Notorious Monsters: you can simply hold them while examining the spots. They no longer use draw-in according to the page, although a note says the Coeurl did use it several times when tested in 2024."] = "El lugar ??? siempre está presente al fondo de la cueva, y recibes el key item al tocarlo, así que no necesitas derrotar a los Notorious Monsters: puedes simplemente retenerlos mientras examinas los lugares. Según la página ya no usan draw-in, aunque una nota dice que el Coeurl lo usó varias veces al probarlo en 2024.",
    ["The ??? you are looking for is in the room at (C-5). Examine it to get the key item Sealed iron box."] = "La ??? que buscas está en la sala de (C-5). Examínala para obtener el key item Sealed iron box.",
    ["The Ancient tablet fragment is found by checking one of 5 ???s in the Quicksand Caves: (H-6), (H-10) and (E-9) on map 1, and (D-9) and (L-11) on map 2. As soon as the ??? is found, it instantly respawns in one of those 5 locations."] = "El Ancient tablet fragment se encuentra revisando una de 5 ???s en las Quicksand Caves: (H-6), (H-10) y (E-9) en el mapa 1, y (D-9) y (L-11) en el mapa 2. En cuanto se encuentra la ???, reaparece al instante en uno de esos 5 lugares.",
    ["The Brass Door has two handles: one opens it, the other opens a trap door in front of it. Pull one and immediately step away; if the trap door opens, wait for it to close and pull the other."] = "La Brass Door tiene dos palancas: una la abre y la otra abre una trampilla delante. Tira de una y apártate enseguida; si se abre la trampilla, espera a que se cierre y tira de la otra.",
    ["The Cardian you are looking for is the Five of Spades, at the outpost in Buburimu Peninsula. Go there and speak with Five of Spades."] = "El Cardian que buscas es el Five of Spades, en el outpost de Buburimu Peninsula. Ve allí y habla con Five of Spades.",
    ["The Ding Bats and tombstone can be handled in either order."] = "Los Ding Bats y la tombstone se pueden resolver en cualquier orden.",
    ["The Effluvial Flasks (about 150 HP) and the other Orcs and Goblins (about 1,500 HP) don't need to be killed. If you fail, speak with Diordinne again and wait a game day for a new key."] = "No hace falta matar a los Effluvial Flasks (unos 150 HP) ni a los demás Orcs y Goblins (unos 1,500 HP). Si fallas, habla de nuevo con Diordinne y espera un día de juego para una nueva llave.",
    ["The Eldieme Necropolis map 2 (K-13) is Ignis for the Stone of Ignis: drop down the westernmost hole in room D on map 1 (G-9), not the centre one. Maze of Shakhrami map 2 (L-10) is Lux for the Stone of Lux: enter from Buburimu Peninsula, not Tahrongi Canyon (the Unity Warp drops you at the entrance)."] = "The Eldieme Necropolis mapa 2 (K-13) es Ignis para la Stone of Ignis: déjate caer por el agujero más al oeste de la sala D del mapa 1 (G-9), no por el del centro. Maze of Shakhrami mapa 2 (L-10) es Lux para la Stone of Lux: entra desde Buburimu Peninsula, no desde Tahrongi Canyon (el Unity Warp te deja en la entrada).",
    ["The Empress Band only has seven charges, but it can be recharged once per week for 100 CP per charge by trading it back to the Signet NPC."] = "La Empress Band solo tiene siete cargas, pero se puede recargar una vez por semana por 100 CP por carga entregándosela al NPC de Signet.",
    ["The Exoplates use Phase Shift, a large AoE with Stun or Bind, at about 66%, 33% and 1-2% HP, harder each time. Before each one, heal everyone to full, get shadows back up and keep mages far away. At 1% they don't die until they have used Phase Shift."] = "Las Exoplates usan Phase Shift, un gran ataque de área con Stun o Bind, hacia el 66%, el 33% y el 1-2% de HP, más fuerte cada vez. Antes de cada uno, cura a todos al máximo, recupera las sombras y mantén a los magos bien lejos. Al 1% no mueren hasta haber usado Phase Shift.",
    ["The Goblin Bounty Hunter that runs around the lake is annoying, but weak. Easily avoidable."] = "El Goblin Bounty Hunter que corre alrededor del lago es molesto, pero débil. Fácil de evitar.",
    ["The Gusgen Clay is by the right-most pond at (I-6/7) on map 3 of Gusgen Mines; bring Sneak, as monsters there are 85+. From the Survival Guide, head north, down the stairs and through the right-most door at (H-6) (use the lever if it's closed; not while Invisible), then drop down the hole in the north-east corner of (I-6) on map 2. The Grounds Tome at (H-7) sells Sneak and Invisible, but only buy it after the door."] = "La Gusgen Clay está junto al estanque más a la derecha en (I-6/7) del mapa 3 de Gusgen Mines; lleva Sneak, ya que allí los monstruos son de nivel 85+. Desde la Survival Guide, ve al norte, baja las escaleras y cruza la puerta más a la derecha en (H-6) (usa la palanca si está cerrada; no con Invisible), luego déjate caer por el agujero de la esquina noreste de (I-6) en el mapa 2. El Grounds Tome de (H-7) vende Sneak e Invisible, pero cómpralo solo después de la puerta.",
    ["The Home Point page on this wiki has a list of every home point, and you should keep it (or this guide) open whenever you go to a new area for a while. Always make it your first priority to hit a Home Point when you arrive somewhere new, because you don't want to leave and have to make that trip all over again."] = "La página Home Point de la wiki tiene una lista de todos los home points, y conviene que la tengas abierta (o esta guía) cada vez que vayas a una zona nueva durante un tiempo. Ten siempre como primera prioridad tocar un Home Point al llegar a un sitio nuevo, porque no querrás irte y tener que repetir todo el viaje.",
    ["The Immortals have captured a member of the Seagull Phratrie, a rebel organization. Escort the prisoner safely to a holding area."] = "Los Immortals han capturado a un miembro de la Seagull Phratrie, una organización rebelde. Escolta al prisionero hasta una zona de retención.",
    ["The Imperial Army on the eastern front is being hit by a peculiar cold wave, and warm uniforms are in short supply. Mission orders: buy black sheep."] = "El Imperial Army del frente oriental sufre una ola de frío peculiar y escasean los uniformes de abrigo. Órdenes de la misión: comprar ovejas negras.",
    ["The Lamiae are preparing to release swarms of chigoes in Al Zahbi to collect blood samples. Destroy the chigoes and thwart their plan. Mission orders: exterminate the chigoes."] = "Los Lamiae se preparan para soltar enjambres de chigoes en Al Zahbi para recoger muestras de sangre. Destruye los chigoes y frustra su plan. Órdenes de la misión: exterminar a los chigoes.",
    ["The Lamiae have hired Qiqirn demolition experts to set land mines in Periqia. Mission orders: clear the mine fields. The recommended level is 60."] = "Los Lamiae han contratado a expertos en demolición Qiqirn para colocar minas terrestres en Periqia. Órdenes de la misión: limpiar los campos de minas. El nivel recomendado es 60.",
    ["The Last Verse is recorded after completing Apocalypse Nigh."] = "The Last Verse se registra tras completar Apocalypse Nigh.",
    ["The Last Verse is recorded after completing Dawn."] = "The Last Verse se registra tras completar Dawn.",
    ["The Lumbering Horn comes from defeating Lumbering Lambert or Bloodtear Baldurf in La Theine Plateau; Bloodtear Baldurf is also a Records of Eminence objective under Combat: Region (Original Areas 1). It also comes from various battlefields."] = "El Lumbering Horn se consigue derrotando a Lumbering Lambert o Bloodtear Baldurf en La Theine Plateau; Bloodtear Baldurf también es un objetivo de Records of Eminence en Combat: Region (Original Areas 1). También se consigue en varios campos de batalla.",
    ["The Magicked astrolabe lets you open the doors in The Eldieme Necropolis by yourself."] = "El Magicked astrolabe te permite abrir tú solo las puertas de The Eldieme Necropolis.",
    ["The Mamool Ja Trainees are aggressive and link. Sagelord Molaal Ja himself does not aggro."] = "Los Mamool Ja Trainees son agresivos y se enlazan. Sagelord Molaal Ja en sí no ataca por aggro.",
    ["The Mamool Ja move around very frequently, which makes it difficult to avoid aggro."] = "Los Mamool Ja se mueven con mucha frecuencia, lo que dificulta evitar el aggro.",
    ["The Mumeito is required for the Samurai artifact quest The Sacred Katana, so hold on to it. If you lose it, you have to pay Ranemaud 30,000 gil for a replacement."] = "La Mumeito es necesaria para la quest de artifact de Samurai The Sacred Katana, así que guárdala. Si la pierdes, tienes que pagar 30,000 gil a Ranemaud por una de reemplazo.",
    ["The NM Enagakure appears on the main deck: on the 0:00 ferry it is already there (and leaves at 4:00), on the 16:00 ferry it appears at 20:00. Unload any cutscene-skipping addon first, or zoning onto the night ferry can send you straight to Selbina."] = "El NM Enagakure aparece en la cubierta principal: en el ferry de las 0:00 ya está allí (y se va a las 4:00), en el de las 16:00 aparece a las 20:00. Descarga antes cualquier addon que salte escenas, o entrar en el ferry nocturno puede mandarte directamente a Selbina.",
    ["The NPC will give you a Linkpearl item. (Yes, it really is an item in your inventory!) To equip a Linkpearl, go to Menu > Linkshell. You must hold the Linkpearl in a universally available inventory bag (Inventory, Satchel, Sack, or Case) in order to equip it, but it doesn't have to be in specifically your Inventory. Once equipped, you can chat with other players with the commands /l or /l2 (that's lowercase L, for linkshell), depending on which slot you equipped it to."] = "El NPC te dará un objeto Linkpearl. (¡Sí, de verdad es un objeto de tu inventario!) Para equipar una Linkpearl, ve a Menu > Linkshell. Debes tener la Linkpearl en una bolsa accesible desde cualquier parte (Inventory, Satchel, Sack o Case) para equiparla, pero no tiene que estar justo en el Inventory. Una vez equipada, puedes chatear con otros jugadores con los comandos /l o /l2 (es una L minúscula, de linkshell), según la ranura en la que la equipaste.",
    ["The NPCs can be put to sleep while they are charmed, and can be healed and given non-party buffs while they are not under the control of Lamia No. 13."] = "Los NPCs pueden dormirse mientras están hechizados, y se les puede curar y dar buffs de fuera del grupo mientras no estén bajo el control de Lamia No. 13.",
    ["The Notorious Monsters stand guard in caves, have a fairly large aggro range, and respawn within about 5 minutes after being defeated."] = "Los Notorious Monsters vigilan en cuevas, tienen un rango de aggro bastante grande y reaparecen unos 5 minutos tras ser derrotados.",
    ["The Odontotyrannus monster is fished up; defeat it and it drops Odontotyrannus. You can fish it up again right away for other characters (the fish can be sent to characters on the same account), and you can fish it before trading Ailbeche the Giant Shell Bug."] = "Se pesca el monstruo Odontotyrannus; derrótalo y suelta Odontotyrannus. Puedes volver a pescarlo enseguida para otros personajes (el pez se puede enviar a personajes de la misma cuenta), y puedes pescarlo antes de entregar a Ailbeche el Giant Shell Bug.",
    ["The Oxblood Key can be used at the same coffer for its separate reward."] = "La Oxblood Key se puede usar en el mismo cofre para obtener su recompensa aparte.",
    ["The Periqia Pugils are scattered around the middle of the map and detect by sound. The Black Baron appears at random in one of several places (the middle area or one of the corner tunnels) and does not show on Widescan."] = "Los Periqia Pugils están repartidos por el centro del mapa y detectan por sonido. El Black Baron aparece al azar en uno de varios lugares (la zona central o uno de los túneles de las esquinas) y no sale en el Widescan.",
    ["The Pursuit of Paradise: travel to La Theine Plateau and examine ??? (G-6)."] = "The Pursuit of Paradise: viaja a La Theine Plateau y examina la ??? (G-6).",
    ["The Qiqirn Miners become hostile after an Orichalcum Ore has been mined, so it is recommended to use Invisible and run back to the starting NPC."] = "Los Qiqirn Miners se vuelven hostiles después de extraer un Orichalcum Ore, así que se recomienda usar Invisible y volver corriendo al NPC del inicio.",
    ["The Rampaging Horn comes from defeating Rampaging Ram or Steelfleece Baldarich in Konschtat Highlands, or from various battlefields."] = "El Rampaging Horn se consigue derrotando a Rampaging Ram o Steelfleece Baldarich en Konschtat Highlands, o en varios campos de batalla.",
    ["The Ronfaure dawndrop is obtained automatically."] = "La Ronfaure dawndrop se obtiene automáticamente.",
    ["The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah - levels 37-42 - warp to the Survival Guide and kill everything in sight."] = "The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah - niveles 37-42 - teletranspórtate a la Survival Guide y mata todo lo que veas.",
    ["The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah NMs only appear from 17:00 to 7:00 Vana'diel time."] = "Los NMs de The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah solo aparecen de 17:00 a 7:00 hora de Vana'diel.",
    ["The Sand Charm must be completed before you are offered this quest. Speak with Oswald in Selbina (I-9) to begin it."] = "Debes haber completado The Sand Charm antes de que se te ofrezca esta quest. Habla con Oswald en Selbina (I-9) para empezarla.",
    ["The Shrine of Ru'Avitau is full of monsters that detect magic, so even mages should bring Silent Oil and Prism Powder (Ninjutsu or Spectral Jig also work)."] = "The Shrine of Ru'Avitau está lleno de monstruos que detectan magia, así que incluso los magos deberían llevar Silent Oil y Prism Powder (Ninjutsu o Spectral Jig también sirven).",
    ["The Survival Guide puts you at the Outpost, fairly close to him. Below level 20 you have to walk, as mounts need level 20."] = "La Survival Guide te deja en el Outpost, bastante cerca de él. Por debajo de nivel 20 tienes que ir andando, ya que las monturas requieren nivel 20.",
    ["The Swirling Vortex in the tunnel just east of where you arrived leads to Valkurm Dunes, so you can use it to come and go."] = "El Swirling Vortex del túnel justo al este de donde llegaste lleva a Valkurm Dunes, así que puedes usarlo para ir y venir.",
    ["The Thyme Moss is at a ??? in Davoi (F-9), behind the one-way barrier in the centre-north of that grid. Enter the waterway at (J-10), follow it north and west, and go south at (D-8)."] = "El Thyme Moss está en una ??? en Davoi (F-9), tras la barrera de un solo sentido en el centro-norte de esa cuadrícula. Entra en el canal por (J-10), síguelo al norte y al oeste, y ve al sur en (D-8).",
    ["The Tonberry key (Shantotto) from the A Shantotto Ascension missions is a temporary key item and does not do this. If you are having trouble resetting Tonberry Hate, you may have the wrong key item; check with Magephaud to see if he still requests the 3 beastcoins."] = "La Tonberry key (Shantotto) de las misiones A Shantotto Ascension es un key item temporal y no sirve para esto. Si tienes problemas para reiniciar el Tonberry Hate, puede que tengas el key item equivocado; consulta con Magephaud si aún pide las 3 beastcoins.",
    ["The Tremorstone comes from the Cloister of Tremors in the west of Quicksand Caves; the Unity Warp (level 125) to Quicksand Caves helps, and Home Point #2 puts you just outside the Cloister."] = "La Tremorstone se consigue en el Cloister of Tremors, en el oeste de Quicksand Caves; el Unity Warp (nivel 125) a Quicksand Caves ayuda, y el Home Point #2 te deja justo fuera del Cloister.",
    ["The Two-Leaf Mandragora Bud is exclusive and can be found by defeating most Mandragora-type enemies, including Tiny Mandragora in East Sarutabaruta and West Sarutabaruta."] = "El Two-Leaf Mandragora Bud es exclusivo y se puede conseguir derrotando a la mayoría de enemigos Mandragora-type, incluidos los Tiny Mandragora de East Sarutabaruta y West Sarutabaruta.",
    ["The Unity Warp (level 125) gets you fairly close. Otherwise, with Silent Oil and Prism Powder, follow the path to the first junction and head north through the large tunnel to (I-5), then go south-east; the ??? is in this tunnel at (L-7)."] = "El Unity Warp (nivel 125) te deja bastante cerca. Si no, con Silent Oil y Prism Powder, sigue el camino hasta el primer cruce y ve al norte por el túnel grande hasta (I-5), luego al sureste; la ??? está en este túnel, en (L-7).",
    ["The Voracious Resurgence Mission 3-1 and its epilogue quests take priority: if Halver sends you to Rahal, finish that first; after an epilogue cutscene, zone out and back in to continue."] = "La The Voracious Resurgence Mission 3-1 y sus quests de epílogo tienen prioridad: si Halver te envía con Rahal, termina eso primero; tras una escena de epílogo, sal y vuelve a entrar para continuar.",
    ["The Wandering Ghost that appears drops a Miner's Pendant, and the Pickaxe is still in your inventory."] = "El Wandering Ghost que aparece suelta un Miner's Pendant, y la Pickaxe sigue en tu inventario.",
    ["The avatars are level 85, use their meritable Blood Pacts and can use Astral Flow at any time. Each has four elementals that share its hate, heal it with tier IV nukes and add their element's debuff to their melee; new ones only appear when the avatar uses its meritable Blood Pact (up to four at a time)."] = "Los avatares son de nivel 85, usan sus Blood Pacts de méritos y pueden usar Astral Flow en cualquier momento. Cada uno tiene cuatro elementales que comparten su odio, lo curan con nukes de nivel IV y añaden el debuff de su elemento a sus golpes; solo aparecen nuevos cuando el avatar usa su Blood Pact de méritos (hasta cuatro a la vez).",
    ["The battlefield is against Eald'narche, in two forms. First form: Eald'narche (about 2,000 HP, ancient magic, Sleepga II) surrounded by Exoplates (about 10,000 HP, no melee) and two Orbitals (low HP, resummoned when killed, Sleep works but not Lullaby)."] = "El campo de batalla es contra Eald'narche, en dos formas. Primera forma: Eald'narche (unos 2,000 HP, magia antigua, Sleepga II) rodeado de Exoplates (unos 10,000 HP, sin cuerpo a cuerpo) y dos Orbitals (poco HP, se vuelven a invocar al matarlos; Sleep funciona, Lullaby no).",
    ["The birds link so pull carefully for the first few levels. Recommended safe spot is near the man-made ramp structure at the southeast cliff edge in the condor area."] = "Los pájaros se enlazan, así que atráelos con cuidado los primeros niveles. Un sitio seguro recomendado es junto a la rampa artificial del borde del acantilado sureste, en la zona de los cóndores.",
    ["The chat command \"/refa all\" will unsummon all your Trusts."] = "El comando de chat \"/refa all\" despide a todos tus Trusts.",
    ["The corresponding [S] Cavernous Maw locations can also be used."] = "También se pueden usar las ubicaciones [S] correspondientes de los Cavernous Maws.",
    ["The corresponding [S] locations can also be used."] = "También se pueden usar las ubicaciones [S] correspondientes.",
    ["The curse dramatically lowers your maximum HP and MP."] = "La maldición reduce drásticamente tu HP y MP máximos.",
    ["The cutscene afterwards shows whether you passed; if so, you get your reward."] = "La escena posterior muestra si has superado la prueba; si es así, recibes tu recompensa.",
    ["The default button to open the main menu is \"-\" (the minus key. Either the one next to 0 or the top-right one on the numpad works) or the Square button. There's a second page in the main menu if you use the left/right arrow keys to change pages."] = "La tecla por defecto para abrir el menú principal es \"-\" (el signo menos; sirve el que está junto al 0 o el de arriba a la derecha del teclado numérico) o el botón Cuadrado. El menú principal tiene una segunda página si usas las flechas izquierda/derecha para cambiar de página.",
    ["The early Chains of Promathia missions used to be level capped and intended for full parties. You can get up to Promathia Mission 3-3 at level 50 solo with Trusts. Chapter 1 originally capped at 30 and Chapter 2 originally capped at 40, so if anything you're ahead of the intended power level."] = "Las primeras misiones de Chains of Promathia tenían antes límite de nivel y estaban pensadas para grupos completos. Puedes llegar hasta la Promathia Mission 3-3 a nivel 50 en solitario con Trusts. El capítulo 1 tenía originalmente un límite de 30 y el capítulo 2 de 40, así que, si acaso, vas por delante del nivel de poder previsto.",
    ["The easiest NPC to get Sanction from is Asrahd in the central square of Aht Urhgan Whitegate by Home Point #1."] = "El NPC más cómodo para conseguir Sanction es Asrahd, en la plaza central de Aht Urhgan Whitegate, junto al Home Point #1.",
    ["The enemies of this assault are Carrion monsters (Carrion Crabs, Carrion Leeches, Carrion Slimes and Carrion Toads), which detect by sound."] = "Los enemigos de este assault son monstruos Carrion (Carrion Crabs, Carrion Leeches, Carrion Slimes y Carrion Toads), que detectan por sonido.",
    ["The enemy of this assault is Lamia No. 13, who detects by sight and links."] = "El enemigo de este assault es Lamia No. 13, que detecta por vista y se enlaza.",
    ["The final reward also unlocks the ability to purchase Atma of Ambition."] = "La recompensa final también desbloquea la posibilidad de comprar Atma of Ambition.",
    ["The first ??? is in the north-east corner of (H-7): from the Survival Guide, follow the left wall to the grate blocking the path. The second is at (I-9)."] = "La primera ??? está en la esquina noreste de (H-7): desde la Survival Guide, sigue la pared izquierda hasta la reja que bloquea el camino. La segunda está en (I-9).",
    ["The first and easiest set of machines: go straight in when entering Beadeaux, then turn left (north) when you reach the wall at (F-7). Go north to the wall in (F-6), then due east to (H-6)."] = "El primer y más fácil conjunto de máquinas: ve recto al entrar en Beadeaux, luego gira a la izquierda (norte) al llegar a la pared en (F-7). Ve al norte hasta la pared en (F-6), luego directo al este hasta (H-6).",
    ["The first quest in this series is to obtain Signet. Near each town exit you should see a Conquest Overseer NPC, identified by having \"W.W\", \"T.K\", or \"I.M\" in their name. Speak to them and ask to receive the Signet effect (be sure to set the weekly \"Signet, brb\" RoE under \"Vana'versary 15 I\" first). You should always be sure you have this buff active when leveling in Conquest areas."] = "La primera quest de la serie es conseguir Signet. Cerca de cada salida de la ciudad verás un NPC Conquest Overseer, que se reconoce por tener \"W.W\", \"T.K\" o \"I.M\" en el nombre. Habla con él y pide el efecto Signet (antes, fija el RoE semanal \"Signet, brb\" en \"Vana'versary 15 I\"). Asegúrate siempre de tener este buff activo al subir de nivel en zonas de Conquest.",
    ["The goal is to rescue the NPC Brujeel by tricking the Mamool Ja into breaking the impassable gates."] = "El objetivo es rescatar al NPC Brujeel engañando a los Mamool Ja para que rompan las puertas infranqueables.",
    ["The hot spring is in Korroloka Tunnel (G-9) on map 4."] = "La fuente termal está en Korroloka Tunnel (G-9) del mapa 4.",
    ["The key item Rivernewort is found at a ??? in either Riverne - Site #B01 or Riverne - Site #A01. To reach either you need Giant Scale(s), or the Home Point warps, to teleport through the Unstable Displacements."] = "El key item Rivernewort se encuentra en una ??? en Riverne - Site #B01 o en Riverne - Site #A01. Para llegar a cualquiera de ellos necesitas Giant Scale(s), o los warps de Home Point, para teletransportarte por los Unstable Displacements.",
    ["The key items are: Round frigicite from Boreal Tiger at (I-5), Square frigicite from Boreal Coeurl at (J-6) and Triangular frigicite from Boreal Hound at (G-10)."] = "Los key items son: Round frigicite de Boreal Tiger en (I-5), Square frigicite de Boreal Coeurl en (J-6) y Triangular frigicite de Boreal Hound en (G-10).",
    ["The kit takes a Padded Box (Earth Crystal, 2 Bast Parchment, Inferior Cocoon; or from a Woodworking Kit 5), 2 Fine Parchment (Dark Crystal, Parchment, Pumice Stone), 2 Enchanted Ink (Dark Crystal, Black Ink, Magicked Blood) and the matching Silencing, Sleeping, Poison or Blinding Potion, combined with an Earth Crystal."] = "El kit lleva una Padded Box (Earth Crystal, 2 Bast Parchment, Inferior Cocoon; o de un Woodworking Kit 5), 2 Fine Parchment (Dark Crystal, Parchment, Pumice Stone), 2 Enchanted Ink (Dark Crystal, Black Ink, Magicked Blood) y la Silencing, Sleeping, Poison o Blinding Potion correspondiente, combinados con un Earth Crystal.",
    ["The latent is broken when the elemental resistances listed in the Club of Trials description disappear from the elemental resistances shown under the equipped gear grid in the equipment window."] = "El latent está roto cuando las resistencias elementales indicadas en la descripción del Club of Trials desaparecen de las resistencias elementales que se muestran bajo la cuadrícula de equipo en la ventana de equipo.",
    ["The latent is broken when the elemental resistances listed in the Pole of Trials description disappear from the elemental resistances shown under the equipped gear grid in the equipment window."] = "El latent está roto cuando las resistencias elementales indicadas en la descripción de la Pole of Trials desaparecen de las resistencias elementales que se muestran bajo la cuadrícula de equipo en la ventana de equipo.",
    ["The level cap stays after the fight and can't be clicked off: speak with Rojaireaut (maybe twice) to remove it, or warp out."] = "El límite de nivel se mantiene tras la pelea y no se puede quitar: habla con Rojaireaut (quizá dos veces) para eliminarlo, o teletranspórtate fuera.",
    ["The level required to fight Maat is at least level 66."] = "El nivel requerido para luchar contra Maat es al menos el nivel 66.",
    ["The main goal for this band of levels is to unlock your subjob at 18. Subjobs are a second job, capped at half the level of your main job, that grants its abilities and stats to your main job. However, there's no such thing as a free lunch - you'll have to spend time leveling up another job to have those levels when the job is set as your subjob. Otherwise you'll find yourself a THF99/WAR1 without any sweet benefits. The bright side is that you only need to level them - no other forms of horizontal progression impact your subjob's performance."] = "El objetivo principal de esta franja de niveles es desbloquear tu subjob a nivel 18. Los subjobs son un segundo job, limitado a la mitad del nivel de tu job principal, que le da sus habilidades y atributos. Sin embargo, nada es gratis: tendrás que dedicar tiempo a subir otro job para tener esos niveles cuando lo pongas como subjob. Si no, te encontrarás siendo THF99/WAR1 sin ninguna ventaja. Lo bueno es que solo tienes que subirlos de nivel: ninguna otra forma de progresión horizontal afecta al rendimiento de tu subjob.",
    ["The map shows the up-ramps as dashes on the hillside. On the first plateau, go counter-clockwise to the ramp in the middle of (J-8); on the second, follow the path back round the hill to the last ramp."] = "El mapa muestra las rampas de subida como guiones en la ladera. En la primera meseta, ve en sentido antihorario hasta la rampa del centro de (J-8); en la segunda, sigue el camino rodeando la colina hasta la última rampa.",
    ["The missing piece is the command, which pauses for X seconds before executing the next line. You can put it on the same line as an action, so your Trust macro can be all one button and look like this:"] = "La pieza que falta es el comando que espera X segundos antes de ejecutar la siguiente línea. Puedes ponerlo en la misma línea que una acción, así que tu macro de Trusts puede ocupar un solo botón y quedar así:",
    ["The mission finishes when you get the cutscene with Tenzen in Aht Urhgan Whitegate."] = "La misión termina cuando ves la escena con Tenzen en Aht Urhgan Whitegate.",
    ["The money from sales, or any returned item that didn't sell, goes to your Delivery Box, which you can access from your Mog House."] = "El dinero de las ventas, o cualquier objeto devuelto que no se vendió, va a tu Delivery Box, a la que puedes acceder desde tu Mog House.",
    ["The most important long-term goal is 480 deeds (12 months of full deed completion, at earliest) to obtain the Monberaux Trust. You know, that guy you totally remember from the rank 2 missions and his clinic by Upper Jeuno Home Point #3. Best healer Trust in the game."] = "El objetivo a largo plazo más importante son 480 deeds (12 meses completando todas las deeds, como muy pronto) para conseguir el Trust de Monberaux. Sí, ese tipo que seguro que recuerdas de las misiones de rango 2 y su clínica junto al Home Point #3 de Upper Jeuno. El mejor Trust curandero del juego.",
    ["The next cutscene is here too, but only after the next game day and a zone."] = "La siguiente escena también es aquí, pero solo tras el siguiente día de juego y un cambio de zona.",
    ["The next part of the cutscene takes you to Nashmau Port, where you see Iruki's plan in action: he has set up a tea shop, and as you approach he asks what you would like to drink."] = "La siguiente parte de la escena te lleva al puerto de Nashmau, donde ves el plan de Iruki en marcha: ha montado una tetería y, al acercarte, te pregunta qué quieres beber.",
    ["The next part of this quest is long and leaves you stuck in a remote area, so bring either a Warp Ring or a Scroll of Instant Warp."] = "La siguiente parte de esta quest es larga y te deja atascado en una zona remota, así que lleva un Warp Ring o un Scroll of Instant Warp.",
    ["The one Hatchet will probably break, so buy more first; Ostalie in Southern San d'Oria (E-9) is closest. If you've never harvested, trade the hatchet to the yellow-sparkling Logging Points. Optional: the Records of Eminence objective Harvesting > Original Areas > Jugner Forest gives sparks, and 12 hatchets on the first clear."] = "Es probable que el único Hatchet se rompa, así que compra más antes; Ostalie en Southern San d'Oria (E-9) es la más cercana. Si nunca has talado, entrega el hacha a los Logging Points con destellos amarillos. Opcional: el objetivo de Records of Eminence Harvesting > Original Areas > Jugner Forest da sparks, y 12 hachas la primera vez que lo completas.",
    ["The other two options for this voucher are a Chariot Band an Emperor Band, each of which give less total experience."] = "Las otras dos opciones de este vale son una Chariot Band y una Emperor Band, que dan menos experiencia en total.",
    ["The other way to get to the Mog Garden is exiting directly from your Mog House after completing an individual city's Mog House Exit Quest. These quests are pretty simple (just a single item traded to a NPC) and have a great reward - not only do they let you exit from your Mog House out to any zone in a city regardless of the zone you entered from, but they let you go to the Mog Garden as well."] = "La otra forma de ir al Mog Garden es salir directamente desde tu Mog House tras completar la Mog House Exit Quest de cada ciudad. Estas quests son bastante sencillas (solo un objeto entregado a un NPC) y tienen una gran recompensa: no solo te permiten salir de tu Mog House a cualquier zona de una ciudad, sea cual sea la zona por la que entraste, sino que también te permiten ir al Mog Garden.",
    ["The parts can be bought or traded, but you must synthesize the kit yourself. Alchemy 10 is recommended; bring spare parts in case the synth fails."] = "Las piezas se pueden comprar o intercambiar, pero debes sintetizar tú el kit. Se recomienda Alchemy 10; lleva piezas de repuesto por si falla la síntesis.",
    ["The party must choose a single leader by talking to the Imperial Guard at the Staging Point. 50 Imperial Standing can be exchanged for an Assault Armband, which is needed to lead the mission."] = "El grupo debe elegir un único líder hablando con el Imperial Guard del Staging Point. Se pueden cambiar 50 Imperial Standing por un Assault Armband, que hace falta para liderar la misión.",
    ["The prerequisite key items are shared between the three nations' Magicite missions, so only missing items need to be obtained."] = "Los key items previos se comparten entre las misiones de Magicite de las tres naciones, así que solo hay que obtener los que falten.",
    ["The quest Cook's Pride must be active."] = "La quest Cook's Pride debe estar activa.",
    ["The quest begins with either Joulet (for The Competition) or Gallijaux (for The Rivalry) in Port San d'Oria (H-8)."] = "La quest empieza con Joulet (para The Competition) o con Gallijaux (para The Rivalry) en Port San d'Oria (H-8).",
    ["The quest can also be completed without the Blazing Pepper: trade Paku-Nakku a remedy, go back to Maabu-Sonbu, who points you to Pechiru-Mashiru for advice, then go back to Paku-Nakku, choose \"The automaton butler did it!\" and get the reward from Pechiru-Mashiru. Trading the remedy locks you out of trading the Blazing Pepper."] = "La quest también se puede completar sin el Blazing Pepper: entrega un remedy a Paku-Nakku, vuelve con Maabu-Sonbu, que te remite a Pechiru-Mashiru para pedir consejo, luego vuelve con Paku-Nakku, elige \"The automaton butler did it!\" y recibe la recompensa de Pechiru-Mashiru. Entregar el remedy te impide entregar el Blazing Pepper.",
    ["The quest can be abandoned and re-accepted every minute without zoning. To be given a different female description, you must accept and then cancel the quest. It resets every minute at XX:XX:00 Earth time, not when you actually cancel it."] = "La quest se puede abandonar y volver a aceptar cada minuto sin cambiar de zona. Para que te den una descripción femenina distinta, debes aceptarla y luego cancelarla. Se reinicia cada minuto en XX:XX:00 hora terrestre, no cuando realmente la cancelas.",
    ["The quest can be repeated as many times as you want, but it requires zoning between each trade."] = "La quest se puede repetir tantas veces como quieras, pero requiere cambiar de zona entre cada entrega.",
    ["The quest can be repeated."] = "La quest se puede repetir.",
    ["The quest completes automatically once the final order is traded, so you do not need to speak with Kerutoto again."] = "La quest se completa automáticamente cuando se entrega el último pedido, así que no necesitas hablar de nuevo con Kerutoto.",
    ["The quest is marked complete after the cutscene. Speak with Leepe-Hoppe afterwards to receive a Cache-nez."] = "La quest se marca como completa tras la escena. Habla después con Leepe-Hoppe para recibir un Cache-nez.",
    ["The quest is only repeatable if the Evoker's Ring is dropped."] = "La quest solo se puede repetir si se tira el Evoker's Ring.",
    ["The quest is timed: if you take too long to return dressed in the requested item, it ends without success. You can try again by zoning out and back in."] = "La quest tiene límite de tiempo: si tardas demasiado en volver vestido con el objeto pedido, termina sin éxito. Puedes intentarlo de nuevo saliendo de la zona y volviendo a entrar.",
    ["The quest's ??? is at (K-10), at the water's edge on map 2. Cast your buffs before you click it, as the NM Bukki that spawns uses Deafening Tantara (area Silence) immediately and often."] = "La ??? de la quest está en (K-10), en la orilla del agua en el mapa 2. Lanza tus buffs antes de hacer clic, ya que el NM Bukki que aparece usa Deafening Tantara (Silence de área) de inmediato y con frecuencia.",
    ["The quicker you return, the more money you get back. The time is measured in game hours, not Earth hours."] = "Cuanto antes vuelvas, más dinero recuperas. El tiempo se mide en horas de juego, no en horas terrestres.",
    ["The quickest way is the Home Point in the part of Mount Zhayolm just outside the chamber, or the Mount Zhayolm Unity warps (level 128 or 135)."] = "La forma más rápida es el Home Point de la parte de Mount Zhayolm justo fuera de la cámara, o los warps de Unity de Mount Zhayolm (nivel 128 o 135).",
    ["The recommended level is 99. The Nyzul Isle Uncharted Area is a 100-floor tower, with boss floors yielding increasingly powerful armor every 20 floors."] = "El nivel recomendado es 99. La Nyzul Isle Uncharted Area es una torre de 100 pisos, con pisos de jefe que dan armaduras cada vez más potentes cada 20 pisos.",
    ["The rest of this quest may be completed on any job. If you lose the battle, you may return to get another key item after one real life day (midnight JST)."] = "El resto de esta quest se puede completar con cualquier trabajo. Si pierdes el combate, puedes volver para obtener otro key item tras un día real (medianoche JST).",
    ["The rings can be synthesized with a Wind Crystal, and can also be signed with a Cyclone Crystal. Doing so with either removes the Rare and Exclusive attributes, and the rings can then be traded to another person, acting like a Wedding Ring."] = "Los anillos se pueden sintetizar con un Wind Crystal, y también se pueden firmar con un Cyclone Crystal. Hacerlo con cualquiera de los dos quita los atributos Rare y Exclusive, y los anillos pueden entregarse a otra persona, funcionando como un Wedding Ring.",
    ["The room of crabs is just enough to provide infinite chaining."] = "La sala de cangrejos basta para encadenar sin fin.",
    ["The same rules apply as in the original quest: for example, weapon skill kills do not count."] = "Se aplican las mismas reglas que en la quest original: por ejemplo, las muertes con weapon skill no cuentan.",
    ["The scroll leads to the signpost at (H-6) in East Ronfaure; examine it for 3,000 gil."] = "El pergamino lleva al poste indicador de (H-6) en East Ronfaure; examínalo para obtener 3,000 gil.",
    ["The second part in quotes can be any spell, ability, or item in the game."] = "La segunda parte entre comillas puede ser cualquier hechizo, habilidad u objeto del juego.",
    ["The small switch is at the Cermet Refinery (G-7), under a shelf by the door; the medium switch at the Replica (G-8) near the Metalworks entrance, next to Quasim; the large switch at the kiln (F-8), just outside the Blacksmiths' Guild. Correct switches give \"The first switch has been deactivated\", \"The second switch has been deactivated\", and finally \"You hear a noise from the direction of the Temple of the Goddess.\""] = "El interruptor pequeño está en la Cermet Refinery (G-7), bajo un estante junto a la puerta; el mediano en la Replica (G-8), cerca de la entrada de Metalworks, junto a Quasim; el grande en el horno (F-8), justo fuera del Blacksmiths' Guild. Los interruptores correctos dan \"The first switch has been deactivated\", \"The second switch has been deactivated\" y por último \"You hear a noise from the direction of the Temple of the Goddess.\"",
    ["The standard riding time limit for a Chocobo is 30 minutes, which is not enough time to ride to Windurst unless you have equipped Orange Race Silks and/or a Chocobo Wand."] = "El límite de tiempo estándar de monta de un Chocobo es de 30 minutos, que no es suficiente para llegar a Windurst salvo que lleves equipadas Orange Race Silks y/o una Chocobo Wand.",
    ["The target is King Goldemar. He uses the regular dvergr weapon skills, among them Cackle, an area attack that lowers magic attack, magic defense and magic accuracy."] = "El objetivo es King Goldemar. Usa las weapon skills normales de los dvergr, entre ellas Cackle, un ataque de área que reduce el ataque mágico, la defensa mágica y la precisión mágica.",
    ["The third quest gives you a Conquest promotion voucher, which you should exchange for an Empress Band, which you can use to increase your EXP gain."] = "La tercera quest te da un Conquest promotion voucher, que deberías cambiar por una Empress Band, que puedes usar para aumentar la EXP que ganas.",
    ["The three Magicite locations can be completed in any order."] = "Las tres ubicaciones de Magicite se pueden completar en cualquier orden.",
    ["The three Tiny Memory Fragments combine into the Large Memory Fragment and complete the quest."] = "Los tres Tiny Memory Fragments se combinan en el Large Memory Fragment y completan la quest.",
    ["The three key items can be gathered in any order, even before the Moogle asks. They are random and can take 50+ tries: fill your inventory first so the point keeps going without moving, and bring a stack of each tool."] = "Los tres key items pueden reunirse en cualquier orden, incluso antes de que el Moogle los pida. Son aleatorios y pueden llevar más de 50 intentos: llena antes tu inventario para que el punto siga activo sin moverse, y lleva un montón de cada herramienta.",
    ["The three objectives must be completed in order. Before entering Eldieme Necropolis alone, obtain a Magicked Astrolabe from Churano-Shurano in Windurst Waters (F-8) to open the required doors."] = "Los tres objetivos deben completarse en orden. Antes de entrar solo en Eldieme Necropolis, obtén un Magicked Astrolabe de Churano-Shurano en Windurst Waters (F-8) para abrir las puertas necesarias.",
    ["The town you choose determines which path you will follow in Emissary from the Seas."] = "La ciudad que elijas determina qué camino seguirás en Emissary from the Seas.",
    ["The western entrance to Oldton Movalpolos, at North Gustaberg (J-6), has the Movalpolos regional outpost and its accompanying Survival Guide immediately north down the tunnel."] = "La entrada oeste de Oldton Movalpolos, en North Gustaberg (J-6), tiene el puesto avanzado de la región de Movalpolos y su Survival Guide justo al norte bajando por el túnel.",
    ["Then Tatapp, who walks counter-clockwise round the town (trade while moving), a Blackened Toad (Brook Sahagin round the lake at (J-12) in Sea Serpent Grotto, or the room at (M-14)); Kakapp (J-9) a Wyvern Skull (Hurricane Wyvern, Ifrit's Cauldron: from the Home Point drop at (J-4) into map 7, round the crater to (J-8), north to map 3 and west to a square room); Lalapp (F-9) Ancient Salt (Sand Digger, Quicksand Caves, same spot as Zilart Mission 12); Nenepp (I-11), who moves in and out of range, a Lucky Egg (Knight Crawler, The Boyahda Tree)."] = "Luego a Tatapp, que camina en sentido antihorario por el pueblo (entrégaselo mientras se mueve), un Blackened Toad (Brook Sahagin alrededor del lago de (J-12) en Sea Serpent Grotto, o la sala de (M-14)); a Kakapp (J-9) un Wyvern Skull (Hurricane Wyvern, Ifrit's Cauldron: desde el Home Point déjate caer en (J-4) al mapa 7, rodea el cráter hasta (J-8), al norte al mapa 3 y al oeste hasta una sala cuadrada); a Lalapp (F-9) Ancient Salt (Sand Digger, Quicksand Caves, en el mismo sitio que la Zilart Mission 12); a Nenepp (I-11), que entra y sale del alcance, un Lucky Egg (Knight Crawler, The Boyahda Tree).",
    ["Then defeat One-eyed Gwajboj, a Paladin who may use Invincible more than once."] = "Luego derrota a One-eyed Gwajboj, un Paladin que puede usar Invincible más de una vez.",
    ["Then do Mission 1-2. Mission 1-3 takes you to a dungeon-esque area full of beastmen near your city. Before you go, you should buy a map of that area at your local Map Vendor!"] = "Luego haz la Mission 1-2. La Mission 1-3 te lleva a una zona tipo mazmorra llena de hombres bestia cerca de tu ciudad. Antes de ir, ¡compra un mapa de esa zona al vendedor de mapas de tu ciudad!",
    ["Then do two more RoV missions. Completing Rhapsodies Mission 1-11 rewards you with Rhapsody in Umber for another +30% experience gain."] = "Luego haz dos misiones más de RoV. Completar la Rhapsodies Mission 1-11 te da Rhapsody in Umber, con otro +30% de experiencia.",
    ["There are 3 gates, as marked on the map, and Brujeel is trapped in a pot beyond one of them."] = "Hay 3 puertas, como indica el mapa, y Brujeel está atrapado en una vasija tras una de ellas.",
    ["There are also Home Points and Survival Guides in Caedarva Mire and Arrapago Reef, but they require a lot of stealth and navigation, so I'd personally skip them for now."] = "También hay Home Points y Survival Guides en Caedarva Mire y Arrapago Reef, pero requieren mucho sigilo y orientación, así que personalmente me los saltaría por ahora.",
    ["There are five(!) home points in Uleguerand Range at five distinct entrances to Bearclaw Pinnacle. Either walk there from Xarcabard or Unity warp (level 128) and walk south to the entrance, then proceed around counterclockwise and upwards. Every time you hit a HP, warp back and repeat (or find your way out of the maze of underground tunnels it's in and resume from your previous location.) In order:"] = "¡Hay cinco home points en Uleguerand Range, en cinco entradas distintas a Bearclaw Pinnacle! Ve caminando desde Xarcabard o usa el Unity warp (nivel 128) y camina al sur hasta la entrada, y luego avanza en sentido antihorario y hacia arriba. Cada vez que toques un HP, teletranspórtate de vuelta y repite (o busca la salida del laberinto de túneles subterráneos en el que está y continúa desde donde estabas.) En orden:",
    ["There are two ??? around the stronghold: one is used for Hawk Eye and the other for Slaughterhouse."] = "Hay dos ??? alrededor de la fortaleza: una se usa para Hawk Eye y la otra para Slaughterhouse.",
    ["There are very few safe spots. Non-Goblin Bats are not aggressive, but link to Sound."] = "Hay muy pocos sitios seguros. Los Bats que no son Goblin no son agresivos, pero se enlazan por sonido.",
    ["There have been reports that Qiqirn hunters have been collecting the eggs of the army's messenger apkallus. Mission orders: drive out the hunters."] = "Se ha informado de que unos cazadores Qiqirn han estado recogiendo los huevos de los apkallus mensajeros del ejército. Órdenes de la misión: expulsar a los cazadores.",
    ["There is a Cermet Door to the west at E-8 this takes you to the basement which has monsters in the Level 25-32 range it also has a passage to take you to the top of the tower in Upper Delkfutt's Tower, to another leveling area in this guide that can take you from level 35 to level 50."] = "Hay una Cermet Door al oeste en E-8 que lleva al sótano, con monstruos de nivel 25-32; también tiene un paso hasta lo alto de la torre en Upper Delkfutt's Tower, otra zona de esta guía que sirve del nivel 35 al 50.",
    ["There is a home point at the top of Upper Delkfutt's Tower. Personally, I'd wait until going there for Rise of the Zilart Mission 8."] = "Hay un home point en lo alto de Upper Delkfutt's Tower. Personalmente, esperaría a ir allí para la Rise of the Zilart Mission 8.",
    ["There is a rumor that orichalcum ore has been discovered in Leujaoam Sanctum. Mission orders: discover orichalcum ore. The recommended level is 50."] = "Se rumorea que se ha descubierto mineral de orichalcum en Leujaoam Sanctum. Órdenes de la misión: descubrir mineral de orichalcum. El nivel recomendado es 50.",
    ["There is a second home point in the Den of Rancor that requires killing level 62-65 Tonberries for an item... or having someone else let you through the door. Personally, I'd wait until Zilart Mission 4 and then make someone else help, because it takes ten seconds of their life to save ten minutes or more of yours."] = "Hay un segundo home point en Den of Rancor que requiere matar Tonberries de nivel 62-65 para conseguir un objeto... o que alguien te abra la puerta. Personalmente, esperaría a la Zilart Mission 4 y pediría ayuda a alguien, porque a esa persona le cuesta diez segundos y a ti te ahorra diez minutos o más.",
    ["There is one clue each for San d'Oria, Bastok and Windurst, and one for Selbina or Mhaura, in no particular order. Trade a seal to the person the clue describes; in return you receive either a Smiling stone, Scowling stone, Somber stone or Spirited stone."] = "Hay una pista para San d'Oria, Bastok y Windurst, y otra para Selbina o Mhaura, sin un orden concreto. Entrega un sello a la persona que describe la pista; a cambio recibes una Smiling stone, Scowling stone, Somber stone o Spirited stone.",
    ["There's a similar method of spending Unity Accolades. Buy Prize Powders for 10 Accolades each and sell them for 100 gil each. (This is also capped at 100,000 Accolades per week for the same bot-related reasons.) Think of this as a two million gil per week UBI!"] = "Hay un método parecido para gastar Unity Accolades. Compra Prize Powders por 10 Accolades cada uno y véndelos por 100 gil cada uno. (También está limitado a 100,000 Accolades por semana por los mismos motivos de los bots.) ¡Piénsalo como una renta básica de dos millones de gil por semana!",
    ["There's a small red dot labeled \"Outpost\" on the map of one of the two areas immediately outside your city. (Specifically, North Gustaberg, West Ronfaure, or West Sarutabaruta) Try going there and interacting with the Survival Guide. When you're done, you can use it to warp back to the Guide in town. Poke your nose into the next area for more levels if you want, but don't go too far, because you've got a main plot to progress."] = "En el mapa de una de las dos zonas justo fuera de tu ciudad hay un pequeño punto rojo marcado como \"Outpost\". (En concreto, North Gustaberg, West Ronfaure o West Sarutabaruta.) Ve allí e interactúa con la Survival Guide. Cuando termines, puedes usarla para volver a la Guide de la ciudad. Asómate a la zona siguiente para más niveles si quieres, pero no te alejes demasiado, porque tienes una historia principal que avanzar.",
    ["There's also a Survival Guide in the Temple of Uggalepih, however it requires going through a chunk of the dungeon first. You will likely pass by it naturally during Zilart Mission 4, so it isn't essential right now."] = "También hay una Survival Guide en el Temple of Uggalepih, pero requiere recorrer antes una parte de la mazmorra. Seguramente pases por ella de forma natural durante la Zilart Mission 4, así que ahora no es imprescindible.",
    ["There's also a few minor stops you should make now for quality-of-life purposes. In no particular order:"] = "También hay algunas paradas menores que conviene hacer ahora por comodidad. Sin un orden concreto:",
    ["There's also a level 40 AF weapon. Acquiring it is a prerequisite to start the armor quests, but unlike the armor, it can't be upgraded. Feel free to immediately store it with a Porter Moogle (Storage Slip 04). Or keep it for lockstyle if you like the look of it."] = "También hay un arma de AF de nivel 40. Conseguirla es requisito para empezar las quests de armadura, pero a diferencia de la armadura no se puede mejorar. Guárdala enseguida con un Porter Moogle (Storage Slip 04) si quieres. O quédatela para el lockstyle si te gusta su aspecto.",
    ["There's also a set of repeatable RoE objectives (under Combat > Spoils I) for obtaining each type of Crystal, which you should probably keep active for a while."] = "También hay una serie de objetivos de RoE repetibles (en Combat > Spoils I) por conseguir cada tipo de Crystal, que probablemente te convenga mantener activos un tiempo.",
    ["These are consumables used for crafting, so they're always in demand. You can sell full stacks of 12 at the Auction House for some walking-around money."] = "Son consumibles que se usan para fabricar, así que siempre tienen demanda. Puedes vender montones completos de 12 en la Auction House para tener algo de dinero.",
    ["These birds are non-aggressive but link from fair distances."] = "Estos pájaros no son agresivos pero se enlazan desde bastante distancia.",
    ["These blue beauties allow you to set your character's home point (where you return to when you die or use Warp) and also let you teleport to any other HP that you've previously touched."] = "Estas preciosidades azules te permiten fijar el home point de tu personaje (adonde vuelves al morir o al usar Warp) y también teletransportarte a cualquier otro HP que hayas tocado antes.",
    ["These can only be cast outside of town, and are located under Magic > Trusts in the \"-\" menu (or Ctrl-M > Trusts, or target anything - including yourself - hit Enter, and select Magic > Trusts.)"] = "Solo se pueden lanzar fuera de la ciudad, y están en Magic > Trusts en el menú \"-\" (o Ctrl-M > Trusts, o selecciona cualquier cosa, incluido tú mismo, pulsa Intro y elige Magic > Trusts.)",
    ["These epilogue scenes can be done in any order. Louverance: speak with Hinaree in Southern San d'Oria (B-6) (Home Point #4), zone into Uleguerand Range, then approach Count Caffaule's Manor (B-6) in Southern San d'Oria."] = "Estas escenas del epílogo pueden hacerse en cualquier orden. Louverance: habla con Hinaree en Southern San d'Oria (B-6) (Home Point #4), entra en Uleguerand Range y luego acércate al Count Caffaule's Manor (B-6) en Southern San d'Oria.",
    ["These have the same ability to teleport you to each other, so you want to interact with them the instant you find them."] = "Tienen la misma capacidad de teletransportarte entre ellos, así que interactúa con ellos en cuanto los encuentres.",
    ["These missions will open up Home Points in Tavnazian Safehold (three of them), Misareaux Coast, and Riverne - Site A01, plus Survival Guides in Tavnazian Safehold, Lufaise Meadows, Misareaux Coast, and Phomiuna Aqueducts."] = "Estas misiones abren Home Points en Tavnazian Safehold (tres), Misareaux Coast y Riverne - Site A01, además de Survival Guides en Tavnazian Safehold, Lufaise Meadows, Misareaux Coast y Phomiuna Aqueducts.",
    ["These objectives also reward Trust Primers. Hang onto these until you hit level 99, when you can use them. Don't throw them out, because they're limited in quantity by IRL monthly gates like Deeds!"] = "Estos objetivos también dan Trust Primers. Guárdalos hasta llegar a nivel 99, cuando podrás usarlos. ¡No los tires, porque su cantidad está limitada por meses reales, igual que las Deeds!",
    ["These objectives rotate once per month (after server maintenance) and there are four objectives active per month."] = "Estos objetivos rotan una vez al mes (tras el mantenimiento de los servidores) y hay cuatro activos cada mes.",
    ["These quests are given to you by a spry old chap named Maat at (H-5) in the very back of Ru'Lude Gardens:"] = "Estas quests te las da un anciano muy vivaz llamado Maat en (H-5), al fondo del todo de Ru'Lude Gardens:",
    ["They usually come paired with another book, like a Grounds Tome or Hunt Registry, so be sure you've actually touched the Survival Guide."] = "Suelen estar junto a otro libro, como un Grounds Tome o un Hunt Registry, así que asegúrate de haber tocado de verdad la Survival Guide.",
    ["Third Rubious Crystal:"] = "Tercer Rubious Crystal:",
    ["Third goblin, Eggblix (Lizard Egg): go west across F-11/G-11 and walk through the wall into the hidden cave at F-11, follow the tunnel, drop down the hole and head south to the ??? in the corner at E-12."] = "Tercer goblin, Eggblix (Lizard Egg): ve al oeste cruzando F-11/G-11 y atraviesa la pared hacia la cueva oculta de F-11, sigue el túnel, déjate caer por el agujero y ve al sur hasta la ??? de la esquina en E-12.",
    ["This completes First Step Forward, gives you the key item Memorandoll and unlocks the other Records of Eminence objectives. Some objectives only appear after completing others."] = "Esto completa First Step Forward, te da el key item Memorandoll y desbloquea los demás objetivos de Records of Eminence. Algunos objetivos solo aparecen tras completar otros.",
    ["This currently costs you 1,000 gil, so there's no shame in going places on foot instead."] = "Ahora mismo cuesta 1,000 gil, así que no pasa nada por ir a los sitios a pie.",
    ["This cutscene can freeze with frame-rate or cutscene-skip addons; set the frame rate back to 30 if it does."] = "Esta escena puede congelarse con addons de FPS o que saltan escenas; si pasa, vuelve a 30 FPS.",
    ["This is a private instanced zone where you can gather materials a set number of times per day - some of which are valuable enough to bother selling on the AH. The only way to be able to gather more times per day is to purchase key items that are gated behind having already gathered a fixed number of times, so you want to start early!"] = "Es una zona privada instanciada donde puedes recolectar materiales un número fijo de veces al día; algunos valen lo suficiente como para venderlos en la AH. La única forma de recolectar más veces al día es comprar key items que solo se desbloquean tras haber recolectado un número fijo de veces, ¡así que te conviene empezar pronto!",
    ["This is a solo fight with a 10 minute limit, and your support job is locked when it spawns (wiping your buffs). Trusts are dismissed on spawn, but you can call them again during the fight if you have Rhapsody in Umber. It only casts Fire spells (up to about 350 damage without buffs) and has under 3,800 HP; at level 119 it's trivial."] = "Es una pelea en solitario con un límite de 10 minutos, y tu support job queda bloqueado al aparecer (lo que borra tus buffs). Los Trusts se despiden al aparecer, pero puedes volver a llamarlos durante la pelea si tienes Rhapsody in Umber. Solo lanza hechizos de Fire (hasta unos 350 de daño sin buffs) y tiene menos de 3,800 HP; a nivel 119 es trivial.",
    ["This makes a total of 350 inventory slots you can use right away, and there are more bags you can get access to before level 30 (specifically, Mog Safe 2, Storage, and Mog Sack.) See the Inventory 101 guide for more details. It's recommended you unequip your armor and weapon and stuff them in a Wardrobe. Store items that you are unsure of their value or use in your Safe, Case, or Satchel for later use or disposal."] = "Eso hace un total de 350 huecos de inventario que puedes usar ya, y hay más bolsas a las que puedes acceder antes de nivel 30 (en concreto, Mog Safe 2, Storage y Mog Sack). Consulta la guía Inventory 101 para más detalles. Se recomienda quitarte la armadura y el arma y meterlas en un Wardrobe. Guarda en el Safe, el Case o el Satchel los objetos cuyo valor o uso no tengas claro, para usarlos o deshacerte de ellos más adelante.",
    ["This menu lets you do all kinds of stuff, including:"] = "Este menú te permite hacer todo tipo de cosas, como:",
    ["This mission completes during the long cutscene from Sin; you receive Rhapsody in Puce when it ends."] = "Esta misión se completa durante la escena larga de Sin; recibes Rhapsody in Puce al terminar.",
    ["This mission finishes as soon as you beat Teodor at Boom or Bust (or win with the Card Jailer Teodor)."] = "Esta misión termina en cuanto ganas a Teodor en Boom or Bust (o ganas con la Card Jailer Teodor).",
    ["This mission starts automatically after The Voracious Beast."] = "Esta misión empieza automáticamente tras The Voracious Beast.",
    ["This mission unlocks Rhapsodies of Vana'diel 2-16 (Ganged Up On). Continue your nation's quests: Bastok, Storm on the Horizon and Fire in the Hole; San d'Oria, Perils of the Griffon and In a Haze of Glory; Windurst, When One Man Is Not Enough and A Feast for Gnats."] = "Esta misión desbloquea Rhapsodies of Vana'diel 2-16 (Ganged Up On). Continúa con las quests de tu nación: Bastok, Storm on the Horizon y Fire in the Hole; San d'Oria, Perils of the Griffon e In a Haze of Glory; Windurst, When One Man Is Not Enough y A Feast for Gnats.",
    ["This one uses , for \"current target\", rather than , because you use WSes on enemies."] = "Esta usa el objetivo actual en lugar de a ti mismo, porque los WS se usan contra enemigos.",
    ["This opens up four Home Points in Aht Urhgan Whitegate, plus one each in Nashmau, Bhaflau Thickets, Halvung, and Mount Zhayolm, along with Survival Guides in Aht Urhgan Whitegate, Wajaom Woodlands, Mamook, Aydeewa Subterrane, Halvung, and Nashmau."] = "Esto abre cuatro Home Points en Aht Urhgan Whitegate, más uno en cada una de Nashmau, Bhaflau Thickets, Halvung y Mount Zhayolm, además de Survival Guides en Aht Urhgan Whitegate, Wajaom Woodlands, Mamook, Aydeewa Subterrane, Halvung y Nashmau.",
    ["This operation needs the campaign rank Allied Ribbon of Glory or higher."] = "Esta operación necesita el rango de campaña Allied Ribbon of Glory o superior.",
    ["This operation needs the campaign rank Brass Ribbon of Service or higher."] = "Esta operación necesita el rango de campaña Brass Ribbon of Service o superior.",
    ["This operation needs the campaign rank Brass Wings of Service or higher."] = "Esta operación necesita el rango de campaña Brass Wings of Service o superior.",
    ["This operation needs the campaign rank Bronze Ribbon of Service or higher."] = "Esta operación necesita el rango de campaña Bronze Ribbon of Service o superior.",
    ["This operation needs the campaign rank Golden Star or higher."] = "Esta operación necesita el rango de campaña Golden Star o superior.",
    ["This operation needs the campaign rank Iron Emblem of Service or higher."] = "Esta operación necesita el rango de campaña Iron Emblem of Service o superior.",
    ["This operation needs the campaign rank Mythril Wings of Service or higher."] = "Esta operación necesita el rango de campaña Mythril Wings of Service o superior.",
    ["This operation needs the campaign rank Sterling Star or higher."] = "Esta operación necesita el rango de campaña Sterling Star o superior.",
    ["This quest begins automatically when Kieran gives you the Ashen Stratum Abyssite III at the end of VW Op. 115: Li'Telor Variant."] = "Esta quest empieza automáticamente cuando Kieran te da el Ashen Stratum Abyssite III al final de VW Op. 115: Li'Telor Variant.",
    ["This quest begins automatically when Owain upgrades your key item to the Hyacinth Stratum Abyssite II at the end of VW Op. 026: Tavnazian Terrors."] = "Esta quest empieza automáticamente cuando Owain mejora tu key item al Hyacinth Stratum Abyssite II al final de VW Op. 026: Tavnazian Terrors.",
    ["This quest cannot be completed while you are on Windurst Mission 8-1 or the quest Orastery Woes, so finish those first."] = "Esta quest no se puede completar mientras estás en la Windurst Mission 8-1 o en la quest Orastery Woes, así que termínalas primero.",
    ["This quest cannot be started if you have started Say It with Flowers or the mission The Price of Peace. If Kerutoto keeps asking about challenging Diabolos, accept Waking Dreams first; once it's in your quest log you can start this one."] = "Esta quest no se puede empezar si has empezado Say It with Flowers o la misión The Price of Peace. Si Kerutoto sigue preguntando por desafiar a Diabolos, acepta antes Waking Dreams; cuando esté en tu registro de quests podrás empezar esta.",
    ["This quest cannot be started while you have the quests The Tenshodo Showdown, As Thick as Thieves, Hitting the Marquisate or Rock Racketeer, or Windurst Mission 2-1, active."] = "Esta quest no se puede empezar mientras tengas activas las quests The Tenshodo Showdown, As Thick as Thieves, Hitting the Marquisate o Rock Racketeer, o la Windurst Mission 2-1.",
    ["This quest does not appear in your quest list until it is completed."] = "Esta quest no aparece en tu lista de quests hasta que se completa.",
    ["This quest does not show up in your quest log until it is completed."] = "Esta quest no aparece en tu quest log hasta que se completa.",
    ["This quest follows Elementary, My Dear Sylvie and requires the Seekers of Adoulin pack. With Geomancer as your main job (level 90 or higher), speak with Sylvie at the Western Adoulin Waterfront (I-5), Waypoint #9. After this you can be on any job."] = "Esta quest sigue a Elementary, My Dear Sylvie y requiere el pack de Seekers of Adoulin. Con Geomancer como job principal (nivel 90 o superior), habla con Sylvie en el Waterfront de Western Adoulin (I-5), Waypoint #9. Después de esto puedes ir con cualquier job.",
    ["This quest follows Endeavoring to Awaken and requires the Seekers of Adoulin pack. Zone after finishing it, then speak with Octavien in Eastern Adoulin (I-8), near the Sverdhried Hillock waypoint, as a Rune Fencer of level 90 or higher. After this you can be on any job."] = "Esta quest sigue a Endeavoring to Awaken y requiere el pack de Seekers of Adoulin. Cambia de zona tras terminarla y luego habla con Octavien en Eastern Adoulin (I-8), cerca del waypoint de Sverdhried Hillock, como Rune Fencer de nivel 90 o superior. Después de esto puedes ir con cualquier job.",
    ["This quest follows Secrets of Ovens Lost and requires the Chains of Promathia pack. Speak with Despachiaire in Tavnazian Safehold (K-10) for a cutscene and the Antique amulet."] = "Esta quest sigue a Secrets of Ovens Lost y requiere el pack de Chains of Promathia. Habla con Despachiaire en Tavnazian Safehold (K-10) para una escena y el Antique amulet.",
    ["This quest follows Tango with a Tracker and requires the Chains of Promathia pack. Speak with Despachiaire in Tavnazian Safehold (K-10) for the Letter from Shikaree Y (on repeats, the Letter from the Mithran Trackers)."] = "Esta quest sigue a Tango with a Tracker y requiere el pack de Chains of Promathia. Habla con Despachiaire en Tavnazian Safehold (K-10) para obtener la Letter from Shikaree Y (al repetirla, la Letter from the Mithran Trackers).",
    ["This quest is repeatable, but it cannot be repeated if you have activated the quest Curses, Foiled A-Golem!?."] = "Esta quest es repetible, pero no se puede repetir si has activado la quest Curses, Foiled A-Golem!?.",
    ["This quest requires the Rise of the Zilart pack. Talk to Maat at (H-5) in Ru'Lude Gardens on each of the 15 jobs that existed before Treasures of Aht Urhgan, and defeat him with each one."] = "Esta quest requiere el pack Rise of the Zilart. Habla con Maat en (H-5) de Ru'Lude Gardens con cada uno de los 15 trabajos que existían antes de Treasures of Aht Urhgan, y derrótalo con cada uno.",
    ["This quest starts automatically after Chasing Shadows. Enter present-day Jugner Forest from Batallia Downs for a cutscene."] = "Esta quest empieza automáticamente tras Chasing Shadows. Entra en la Jugner Forest del presente desde Batallia Downs para una escena.",
    ["This quest starts automatically when you finish Tenuous Existence."] = "Esta quest empieza automáticamente al terminar Tenuous Existence.",
    ["This quest starts with the cutscene at Stone Circle ??? (G-6) that finished First Contact. If you have not seen it, examine it between 18:00 and 05:00 (Vana'diel time)."] = "Esta quest empieza con la escena de la Stone Circle ??? (G-6) que terminó First Contact. Si no la has visto, examínala entre las 18:00 y las 05:00 (hora de Vana'diel).",
    ["This spawns two level 65 NMs: Magma, a Bomb that may Self-Destruct, and Salamander, a weaker Lizard. Only Magma has to die, so sneak-pull it. It drops the Frag Rocks."] = "Esto hace aparecer dos NMs de nivel 65: Magma, una Bomb que puede usar Self-Destruct, y Salamander, un Lizard más débil. Solo hay que matar a Magma, así que atráelo con Sneak. Suelta las Frag Rocks.",
    ["This time go west at the first intersection, through the Wooden Gate, south to a T-intersection and east. Defeat the Temple Guardian at the Granite Door, go east into the large circular room, take the north-east hallway at (J-9), and open the Granite Door at (I-7) with the Paintbrush of Souls into the Den of Rancor."] = "Esta vez ve al oeste en el primer cruce, cruza la Wooden Gate, ve al sur hasta un cruce en T y luego al este. Derrota al Temple Guardian de la Granite Door, ve al este a la gran sala circular, toma el pasillo noreste en (J-9) y abre la Granite Door de (I-7) con el Paintbrush of Souls para entrar en Den of Rancor.",
    ["This was a huge deal back in the day - it wasn't even beaten for the first time until they raised the level cap to 55!"] = "En su día esto fue algo enorme: ¡nadie lo superó por primera vez hasta que subieron el límite de nivel a 55!",
    ["This will likely come up again later when you need different Crests for later Limit Breaks."] = "Seguramente esto vuelva a salir más adelante, cuando necesites otros Crests para Limit Breaks posteriores.",
    ["Three more monuments exist in the Shadowreign: Vunkerl Inlet (S) at (E-12), Grauberg (S) at (F-5) and Fort Karugo-Narugo (S) at (E-7), outside the map. You can copy them with the Selbina Clay, but when you trade them there is no response from Abelard."] = "Existen tres monumentos más en la Shadowreign: Vunkerl Inlet (S) en (E-12), Grauberg (S) en (F-5) y Fort Karugo-Narugo (S) en (E-7), fuera del mapa. Puedes copiarlos con el Selbina Clay, pero al entregarlos no hay respuesta de Abelard.",
    ["Through Mamool Ja Staging Point."] = "Por el Mamool Ja Staging Point.",
    ["Through the doorway, turn right and follow the long hallway south-east past the Moongate to (M-8); the ??? is on the ground in front of an inaccessible tunnel entrance. Examine it to spawn Eldhrimnir, a magic pot. Defeat it and examine the ??? again for the key item Annals of Truth."] = "Tras la puerta, gira a la derecha y sigue el largo pasillo al sureste pasando la Moongate hasta (M-8); la ??? está en el suelo frente a la entrada inaccesible de un túnel. Examínala para hacer aparecer a Eldhrimnir, una olla mágica. Derrótala y examina de nuevo la ??? para obtener el key item Annals of Truth.",
    ["Through the gate, head southwest, go up the ramp in the middle of (I-8), then west and south to the Acid-eaten Door at the northwest corner of (I-9). Examine it for a cutscene."] = "Tras la puerta, ve al suroeste, sube la rampa del centro de (I-8), luego al oeste y al sur hasta la Acid-eaten Door de la esquina noroeste de (I-9). Examínala para una escena.",
    ["Tip: before leaving Jugner Forest [S], kill Wandering Saplings (at J-6 and F-10) for a Cernunnos Bulb, one per person, for the next mission."] = "Consejo: antes de salir de Jugner Forest [S], mata Wandering Saplings (en J-6 y F-10) para conseguir un Cernunnos Bulb, uno por persona, para la misión siguiente.",
    ["Tip: start the quest Flavors of Our Lives now (Berghent at (J-9) near the Big Bridge in Western Adoulin, then Masad in the Mummers' Coalition) until Teodor is introduced. Otherwise Budding Prospects costs you an extra game day."] = "Consejo: empieza ahora la quest Flavors of Our Lives (Berghent en (J-9), cerca del Big Bridge de Western Adoulin, y luego Masad en la Mummers' Coalition) hasta que aparezca Teodor. Si no, Budding Prospects te costará un día de juego más.",
    ["To Bastok: Miratete's Memoirs at 31:00 to 32:29, a Chocobo Ticket at 32:30 to 34:43, Gysahl Greens at 34:44 or more."] = "A Bastok: Miratete's Memoirs entre 31:00 y 32:29, un Chocobo Ticket entre 32:30 y 34:43, Gysahl Greens a 34:44 o más.",
    ["To Jeuno: a Windurst Woods Glyph at 14:00 to 15:29, Gysahl Greens at 15:30 or more."] = "A Jeuno: un Windurst Woods Glyph entre 14:00 y 15:29, Gysahl Greens a 15:30 o más.",
    ["To Rank 6"] = "A Rank 6",
    ["To Windurst: Miratete's Memoirs at 31:00 to 32:29, a Chocobo Ticket at 32:30 to 34:43, Gysahl Greens at 34:44 or more. To Jeuno: a Bastok Mines Glyph at 16:00 to 18:49, Gysahl Greens at 18:50 or more."] = "A Windurst: Miratete's Memoirs entre 31:00 y 32:29, un Chocobo Ticket entre 32:30 y 34:43, Gysahl Greens a 34:44 o más. A Jeuno: un Bastok Mines Glyph entre 16:00 y 18:49, Gysahl Greens a 18:50 o más.",
    ["To acquire Halver, talk to Halver himself just inside Chateau d'Oraguille, north of Northern San d'Oria."] = "Para conseguir a Halver, habla con el propio Halver justo al entrar en Chateau d'Oraguille, al norte de Northern San d'Oria.",
    ["To activate the Paladin quest Sharpening the Sword, trade the fishing rod back to Ailbeche. Doing so also changes your title to Family Counselor."] = "Para activar la quest de Paladin Sharpening the Sword, entrega la caña de pescar de vuelta a Ailbeche. Al hacerlo, tu título cambia a Family Counselor.",
    ["To activate this quest you must be on or past Promathia Mission 4-2 and have zoned into Riverne - Site B01. You need the Chains of Promathia pack."] = "Para activar esta quest debes estar en la Promathia Mission 4-2 o más allá y haber entrado en Riverne - Site B01. Necesitas el pack Chains of Promathia.",
    ["To begin this quest in your log, you need the key item Serpent Rumors. It can be bought from Fennella in Port Windurst (C-8) for 95,000 Guild Points with Fishing rank Adept or higher. You can still obtain the other items needed for this quest before initiating it. You need the Rise of the Zilart pack."] = "Para empezar esta quest en tu registro, necesitas el key item Serpent Rumors. Se puede comprar a Fennella en Port Windurst (C-8) por 95,000 Guild Points con rango de Fishing Adept o superior. Aún puedes conseguir los demás objetos necesarios para esta quest antes de iniciarla. Necesitas el pack Rise of the Zilart.",
    ["To begin this quest you first need a Damp Scroll. It can be fished up in Sea Serpent Grotto or bought at the Auction House. You need level 10 or higher, Outlands fame level 3 and the Rise of the Zilart pack."] = "Para empezar esta quest primero necesitas una Damp Scroll. Se puede pescar en Sea Serpent Grotto o comprar en la Auction House. Necesitas nivel 10 o superior, el nivel 3 de fama de Outlands y el pack Rise of the Zilart.",
    ["To begin this quest you must have traded an Unlit Lantern to the Altar of Rancor and received a Rancor Flame at some point before; it helps to have a Rancor Flame on you. This quest follows A Question of Taste and requires the Rise of the Zilart pack."] = "Para empezar esta quest debes haber entregado antes una Unlit Lantern al Altar of Rancor y haber recibido una Rancor Flame; ayuda llevar una Rancor Flame encima. Esta quest sigue a A Question of Taste y requiere el pack Rise of the Zilart.",
    ["To begin, speak with Brutus in Upper Jeuno (G-7) on any job at level 20 or higher. This starts the quest Chocobo on the Loose! first, and this quest follows it."] = "Para empezar, habla con Brutus en Upper Jeuno (G-7) con cualquier trabajo de nivel 20 o superior. Esto empieza primero la quest Chocobo on the Loose!, y esta quest la sigue.",
    ["To check which jobs you have beaten Maat with, enter the Feretory and speak with Teyrnon. Instincts associated with the jobs on which you have defeated Maat cost 5,000 Infamy instead of 10,000."] = "Para comprobar con qué trabajos has vencido a Maat, entra en el Feretory y habla con Teyrnon. Los Instincts asociados a los trabajos con los que has derrotado a Maat cuestan 5,000 Infamy en lugar de 10,000.",
    ["To collect it in its natural environment, locate the ??? on an overturned boat on the easternmost beach in Valkurm Dunes, called Siren Sands (H-9). You must first wait for dusty weather for the ??? to appear. Click it and you receive a Valkurm Sunsand."] = "Para recogerla en su entorno natural, localiza la ??? en un bote volcado en la playa más oriental de Valkurm Dunes, llamada Siren Sands (H-9). Primero debes esperar clima polvoriento para que aparezca la ???. Haz clic en ella y recibes una Valkurm Sunsand.",
    ["To craft the ingot, use a Fire Crystal with 4 Copper Ores."] = "Para fabricar el lingote, usa un Fire Crystal con 4 Copper Ores.",
    ["To face all five Ark Angels at once, examine Blank target (H-11) twice, then obtain an Ark Pentasphere."] = "Para enfrentarte a los cinco Ark Angels a la vez, examina dos veces el Blank target (H-11) y luego obtén una Ark Pentasphere.",
    ["To farm them, enter Palborough Mines from North Gustaberg (K-3); North Gustaberg is reached from Port Bastok (L-7). Amber, Greater, Onyx and Veteran Quadavs drop the pieces."] = "Para farmearlas, entra en Palborough Mines desde North Gustaberg (K-3); a North Gustaberg se llega desde Port Bastok (L-7). Los Amber, Greater, Onyx y Veteran Quadavs sueltan las piezas.",
    ["To find Starmites, enter Toraimarai Canal by speaking with Seven of Diamonds in Windurst Walls (H-3). Go east at the first intersection, down the stairs at (I-8) and east, turn right at both intersections at (I-10), go up the stairs at (I-9), then head west to (G-9), where the Starmites spawn."] = "Para encontrar Starmites, entra en Toraimarai Canal hablando con Seven of Diamonds en Windurst Walls (H-3). Ve al este en el primer cruce, baja las escaleras de (I-8) y ve al este, gira a la derecha en ambos cruces de (I-10), sube las escaleras de (I-9) y luego ve al oeste hasta (G-9), donde aparecen los Starmites.",
    ["To find a linkshell to join, you can check the Linkshell Concierge in your home nation. It will have a list of recruiting linkshells, along with their languages. E means it is primarily an English linkshell. The three NPCs don't share available linkshells, so check all three when you visit the other two nations in the future."] = "Para encontrar una linkshell a la que unirte, consulta al Linkshell Concierge de tu nación. Tiene una lista de linkshells que buscan miembros, con sus idiomas. E significa que es principalmente una linkshell en inglés. Los tres NPCs no comparten linkshells disponibles, así que revisa los tres cuando visites las otras dos naciones más adelante.",
    ["To find these enemies near you even when they're not close enough to be immediately visible, open your Map and select the \"Wide Scan\" option. This shows all monsters within about a map square radius of you, sorted by internal ID rather than anything sensible like \"name\" or \"monster type\", and lets you select a specific monster to \"track\" on the small in-game compass on your HUD. This is super convenient and used to be exclusive to Rangers and Beastmasters (who still get an expanded radius on their Wide Scan, because this is FFXI) for the first decade of the game's life."] = "Para encontrar estos enemigos cerca de ti aunque no estén lo bastante cerca para verlos, abre el mapa y elige la opción \"Wide Scan\". Muestra todos los monstruos en un radio de aproximadamente una cuadrícula del mapa, ordenados por ID interno en lugar de algo sensato como \"nombre\" o \"tipo de monstruo\", y te permite elegir un monstruo para \"rastrearlo\" en la pequeña brújula del HUD. Es comodísimo y durante la primera década del juego fue exclusivo de los Rangers y los Beastmasters (que siguen teniendo un radio mayor en su Wide Scan, porque esto es FFXI).",
    ["To get Semih Lafihna, talk to Kupipi behind the desk in Heavens Tower in Windurst Walls."] = "Para conseguir a Semih Lafihna, habla con Kupipi detrás del mostrador de Heavens Tower, en Windurst Walls.",
    ["To get a Purple Ribbon, first speak with Roberta in the Nchaa's Good Goods shop in Windurst Woods (I-13)."] = "Para conseguir una Purple Ribbon, habla primero con Roberta en la tienda Nchaa's Good Goods de Windurst Woods (I-13).",
    ["To increase production of special nighttime camouflage, the Imperial marines need large quantities of a secretion from a rare cephalopod known as the ahtapot, found on Ilrusi Atoll. Mission orders: collect ahtapot."] = "Para aumentar la producción de camuflaje nocturno especial, los marines Imperial necesitan grandes cantidades de una secreción de un cefalópodo raro conocido como ahtapot, que se encuentra en Ilrusi Atoll. Órdenes de la misión: recoger ahtapot.",
    ["To open the coffer, select it and then \"Trade\" it the appropriate key. You can buy the keys directly from a Curio Vendor Moogle since you have Rhapsody in Umber."] = "Para abrir el cofre, selecciónalo y entrégale (\"Trade\") la llave adecuada. Puedes comprar las llaves directamente a un Curio Vendor Moogle, ya que tienes Rhapsody in Umber.",
    ["To pass the Banishing Gates alone, take a Pouch of weighted stones from the ??? on the ground on map 1 (G-8)."] = "Para pasar las Banishing Gates en solitario, toma una Pouch of weighted stones de la ??? del suelo del mapa 1 (G-8).",
    ["To pass the double-keyhole door at (H-7) on Map 2 you need either the key item Temple Knight key or two Coral Crest Keys plus a Sealion Crest Key. Solo: farm a Coral Crest Key (rare drop from Map 2 Fomors) and the Sealion Crest Key (NM Keremet, night 20:00-04:00 only, with 12 weak Azren Kuba skeletons along its hallways) and trade them to Quelveuiat in Tavnazian Safehold (I-10) for the Temple Knight key via the quest A Hard Day's Knight. Or ask someone who has it to open the door."] = "Para cruzar la puerta de doble cerradura de (H-7) en el mapa 2 necesitas el key item Temple Knight key, o dos Coral Crest Keys y una Sealion Crest Key. En solitario: farmea una Coral Crest Key (drop raro de los Fomors del mapa 2) y la Sealion Crest Key (NM Keremet, solo de noche de 20:00 a 04:00, con 12 esqueletos débiles Azren Kuba por sus pasillos) y entrégaselas a Quelveuiat en Tavnazian Safehold (I-10) para obtener la Temple Knight key mediante la quest A Hard Day's Knight. O pide a alguien que la tenga que abra la puerta.",
    ["To progress further you need a Mutton Tortilla, Habaneros and a serving of Black Curry."] = "Para avanzar necesitas una Mutton Tortilla, Habaneros y una ración de Black Curry.",
    ["To re-roll the augment, toss the armor, buy an Omnis Stone from Squintrox Dryeyes (G-8) in Port Jeuno (2,000 gil and 20 Beastmen's Seals) and win the Stellar Fulcrum fight again."] = "Para volver a sortear el aumento, tira la armadura, compra una Omnis Stone a Squintrox Dryeyes (G-8) en Port Jeuno (2,000 gil y 20 Beastmen's Seals) y vuelve a ganar la pelea del Stellar Fulcrum.",
    ["To re-roll the augment: toss the helm, redeem any Angel skin key you still hold, buy a Mega Bonanza Kupon from Squintrox Dryeyes (G-8) in Port Jeuno (2,000 gil and 20 Beastmen's Seals) and win the Throne Room fight again (once per Japanese midnight)."] = "Para volver a sortear el aumento: tira el casco, canjea cualquier Angel skin key que aún tengas, compra un Mega Bonanza Kupon a Squintrox Dryeyes (G-8) en Port Jeuno (2,000 gil y 20 Beastmen's Seals) y vuelve a ganar la pelea de la Throne Room (una vez por medianoche de Japón).",
    ["To re-roll the augment: use any Tonberry key first, get a tablet (or buy tablets from Squintrox Dryeyes in Port Jeuno for 2,000 gil and 20 Beastmen's Seals) and refight at the Mahogany Door for new Tonberry and Behemoth keys."] = "Para volver a sortear el aumento: usa antes cualquier Tonberry key, consigue una tablilla (o compra tablillas a Squintrox Dryeyes en Port Jeuno por 2,000 gil y 20 Beastmen's Seals) y vuelve a luchar en la Mahogany Door para obtener nuevas Tonberry y Behemoth keys.",
    ["To repeat (once per Conquest Tally): drop your earring (zone if you dropped it in the same area), then take the quest again at the Blank Target (G/H-11); it shows as a second Divine Might quest."] = "Para repetirla (una vez por Conquest Tally): tira tu pendiente (cambia de zona si lo tiraste en la misma zona) y vuelve a aceptar la quest en el Blank Target (G/H-11); aparece como una segunda quest Divine Might.",
    ["To repeat it, you must zone each time you finish before the quest is offered to you again."] = "Para repetirla, debes cambiar de zona cada vez que termines antes de que te vuelvan a ofrecer la quest.",
    ["To repeat the quest you must trade a Sobbing Fungus."] = "Para repetir la quest debes entregar un Sobbing Fungus.",
    ["To repeat the quest you must wait until the next Conquest update."] = "Para repetir la quest debes esperar hasta la siguiente actualización de Conquest.",
    ["To save travel time to the Cloister of Frost, you can use the Mini tuning fork of ice from the quest Trial-Size Trial by Ice. You must be on Summoner as your main job: get the Mini tuning fork from Castilchat, trade the fork back to Castilchat, and enter the Protocrystal normally. As long as you do not clear the level 20 version, you may warp to the Cloister as many times as you like."] = "Para ahorrar tiempo de viaje al Cloister of Frost, puedes usar el Mini tuning fork of ice de la quest Trial-Size Trial by Ice. Debes tener Summoner como trabajo principal: consigue el Mini tuning fork de Castilchat, entrégalo de vuelta a Castilchat y entra en el Protocrystal con normalidad. Mientras no completes la versión de nivel 20, puedes teletransportarte al Cloister tantas veces como quieras.",
    ["To save travel time to the Cloister of Tremors, you can use the Mini tuning fork of earth from the quest Trial-Size Trial by Earth. You must be on Summoner as your main job: get the Mini tuning fork from Ferrol, trade the fork back to Ferrol, and enter the Protocrystal normally. As long as you do not clear the level 20 version of the battlefield, you may warp to the Cloister as many times as you wish."] = "Para ahorrar tiempo de viaje al Cloister of Tremors, puedes usar el Mini tuning fork of earth de la quest Trial-Size Trial by Earth. Debes tener Summoner como trabajo principal: consigue el Mini tuning fork de Ferrol, entrégalo de vuelta a Ferrol y entra en el Protocrystal con normalidad. Mientras no completes la versión de nivel 20 del campo de batalla, puedes teletransportarte al Cloister tantas veces como quieras.",
    ["To save travel time to the Cloister, use the Mini Fork of Fire from Trial-Size Trial by Fire: be on Summoner as your main job, get the Mini Tuning Fork from Dodmos, trade it back to Dodmos, and enter the Protocrystal normally. As long as you do not clear the level 20 version of the battlefield, you may warp to the Cloister as many times as you wish."] = "Para ahorrar viaje hasta la Cloister, usa el Mini Fork of Fire de Trial-Size Trial by Fire: ten Summoner como trabajo principal, consigue el Mini Tuning Fork de Dodmos, entrégaselo de vuelta a Dodmos y entra al Protocrystal con normalidad. Mientras no completes la versión de nivel 20 del campo de batalla, puedes teletransportarte a la Cloister las veces que quieras.",
    ["To save travel time to the Cloister, use the Mini Fork of Ltn given by Trial-Size Trial by Lightning: be on Summoner as your main job, get the Mini Tuning Fork from Lacia, trade it back to her, and enter the Protocrystal normally."] = "Para ahorrar viaje hasta la Cloister, usa el Mini Fork of Ltn que da Trial-Size Trial by Lightning: ten Summoner como trabajo principal, consigue el Mini Tuning Fork de Lacia, entrégaselo de vuelta y entra al Protocrystal con normalidad.",
    ["To save travel time to the Cloister, use the Mini Fork of Wind from Trial-Size Trial by Wind: be on Summoner as your main job, get the Mini Tuning Fork from Rahi Fohlatti, trade it back to her, and enter the Protocrystal normally. As long as you do not clear the level 20 version of the battlefield, you may warp to the Cloister as many times as you wish."] = "Para ahorrar viaje hasta la Cloister, usa el Mini Fork of Wind de Trial-Size Trial by Wind: ten Summoner como trabajo principal, consigue el Mini Tuning Fork de Rahi Fohlatti, entrégaselo de vuelta y entra al Protocrystal con normalidad. Mientras no completes la versión de nivel 20 del campo de batalla, puedes teletransportarte a la Cloister las veces que quieras.",
    ["To save travel time to the Cloister, use the Mini Tuning Fork given by the quest Trial-Size Trial by Water. As long as you do not clear the level 20 version of the battlefield, you may warp to the Cloister as many times as you wish."] = "Para ahorrar viaje hasta la Cloister, usa el Mini Tuning Fork que da la quest Trial-Size Trial by Water. Mientras no completes la versión de nivel 20 del campo de batalla, puedes teletransportarte a la Cloister las veces que quieras.",
    ["To sell something on the Auction House (or \"AH\"), interact with any of the points named \"Auction House\" located on the windows of the physical AH building in town."] = "Para vender algo en la Auction House (o \"AH\"), interactúa con cualquiera de los puntos llamados \"Auction House\" en las ventanillas del edificio de la AH de la ciudad.",
    ["To start this quest you must first trade the fishing rod from Father and Son back to Ailbeche. You need to be a Paladin of level 40 or higher, and to have completed A Knight's Test."] = "Para empezar esta quest debes entregar antes a Ailbeche la caña de pescar de Father and Son. Debes ser Paladin de nivel 40 o superior y haber completado A Knight's Test.",
    ["To start, open \"Objective List > Tutorial > Basics\", then select \"First Step Forward\" to activate it. These NPCs will be marked on the map, and you will receive a chat notification stating it would behoove you to speak to the NPC when you first zone into the area they reside in. Complete the objective by talking to the Records of Eminence NPC in your starting city."] = "Para empezar, abre \"Objective List > Tutorial > Basics\" y elige \"First Step Forward\" para activarlo. Estos NPCs aparecen marcados en el mapa, y recibirás un aviso en el chat de que te conviene hablar con el NPC la primera vez que entres en su zona. Completa el objetivo hablando con el NPC de Records of Eminence de tu ciudad inicial.",
    ["To synergize Astral Matter you must gather six stones from ??? spots in the matching cloisters: Flamestone from the Cloister of Flames, Froststone from the Cloister of Frost, Galestone from the Cloister of Gales, Tremorstone from the Cloister of Tremors, Stormstone from the Cloister of Storms and Tidestone from the Cloister of Tides."] = "Para sintetizar Astral Matter debes reunir seis piedras de lugares ??? en los cloisters correspondientes: Flamestone del Cloister of Flames, Froststone del Cloister of Frost, Galestone del Cloister of Gales, Tremorstone del Cloister of Tremors, Stormstone del Cloister of Storms y Tidestone del Cloister of Tides.",
    ["To take part in Campaign Ops you must have joined your nation's campaign faction and have an Op Credit. One Op Credit is granted per Vana'diel day and the NPC can store up to 7. Below level 10 you earn Allied Notes but no experience points."] = "Para participar en las Campaign Ops debes haberte unido a la facción de campaña de tu nación y tener un Op Credit. Se concede un Op Credit por día de Vana'diel y el NPC puede guardar hasta 7. Por debajo del nivel 10 ganas Allied Notes pero no puntos de experiencia.",
    ["To that end, this section will have you leveling to 18 in zones further out from your starting city and completing a few Rhapsodies of Vana'diel (or \"RoV\") missions to be rewarded with the ability to set a subjob and the first of the Rhapsody key items, which have really, really varied (and also really strong) benefits."] = "Para ello, en esta sección subirás hasta el 18 en zonas más alejadas de tu ciudad inicial y completarás algunas misiones de Rhapsodies of Vana'diel (o \"RoV\") para obtener como recompensa la posibilidad de poner un subjob y el primero de los key items Rhapsody, que tienen ventajas muy, muy variadas (y también muy potentes).",
    ["To unlock trusts, talk to the appropriate NPC in your city to start a quick quest called \"Trust: [city name]\"."] = "Para desbloquear los trusts, habla con el NPC adecuado de tu ciudad para empezar una quest corta llamada \"Trust: [nombre de la ciudad]\".",
    ["To unsummon only a specific one, target them and use \"/refa\"."] = "Para despedir solo a uno, selecciónalo y usa \"/refa\".",
    ["To use the Warp Ring, equip it, wait for its 8-second cooldown to tick down to zero, then either go into your Inventory, select it, and select \"Use\" or just type /item \"Warp Ring\" in chat and hit Enter."] = "Para usar el Warp Ring, equípalo, espera a que su recarga de 8 segundos llegue a cero y luego ve al inventario, selecciónalo y elige \"Use\", o simplemente escribe /item \"Warp Ring\" en el chat y pulsa Intro.",
    ["To win this assault, subdue at least one Lamia or Merrow by breaking its weapon."] = "Para ganar este assault, somete al menos a una Lamia o Merrow rompiéndole el arma.",
    ["Together with your party, travel to North Gustaberg and locate the Galka Hunting Bear at (F-8), near the waterfalls."] = "Junto con tu grupo, viaja a North Gustaberg y localiza al Galka Hunting Bear en (F-8), cerca de las cascadas.",
    ["Torama/Labyrinth Manticore"] = "Torama/Labyrinth Manticore",
    ["Tosuka-Porika: in the Optistery of Windurst Waters (near Home Point #1)."] = "Tosuka-Porika: en la Optistery de Windurst Waters (cerca del Home Point #1).",
    ["Touch Journey's End (K-10) again for a cutscene."] = "Toca de nuevo Journey's End (K-10) para una escena.",
    ["Touch Journey's End (K-10) at (K-10) to fight Uran-Mafran (BLM/RDM, about 185,000 HP; Trusts allowed). Oggbi (MNK) helps and must survive."] = "Toca Journey's End (K-10) en (K-10) para luchar contra Uran-Mafran (BLM/RDM, unos 185,000 HP; se permiten Trusts). Oggbi (MNK) ayuda y debe sobrevivir.",
    ["Touch a bunch of Home Points and Survival Guides"] = "Toca un montón de Home Points y Survival Guides",
    ["Touch another Peculiar Rootprints in North Gustaberg (S) at (E-11), close to where Campaign Arbiters teleport you."] = "Toca otras Peculiar Rootprints en North Gustaberg (S) en (E-11), cerca de donde te teletransportan los Campaign Arbiters.",
    ["Touch it again (any time of day) to fight \"The Shadow\" (about 200,000 HP). You have 15 minutes. Mumor helps; you lose if she falls. He uses many SP abilities: Benediction whenever either of you weapon skills (from 89% HP), Manafont, Hundred Fists, Chainspell (with Dispelga), Meikyo Shisui, Blood Weapon, and hand-to-hand self-skillchains. He isn't resistant to enfeebles; Silence lasts."] = "Tócalo de nuevo (a cualquier hora) para luchar contra \"The Shadow\" (unos 200,000 HP). Tienes 15 minutos. Mumor ayuda; pierdes si cae. Usa muchas habilidades SP: Benediction cada vez que cualquiera de los dos usa un weapon skill (desde el 89% de HP), Manafont, Hundred Fists, Chainspell (con Dispelga), Meikyo Shisui, Blood Weapon y skillchains propios de cuerpo a cuerpo. No resiste los debilitamientos; Silence dura.",
    ["Touch some Crystals"] = "Toca algunos Crystals",
    ["Touch the ??? again for the final cutscene and your reward."] = "Toca de nuevo la ??? para la última escena y tu recompensa.",
    ["Touch the ??? between 16:00 and 18:00 in-game time to complete the quest."] = "Toca la ??? entre las 16:00 y las 18:00 hora del juego para completar la quest.",
    ["Touch the ??? to obtain Gulemont's document."] = "Toca la ??? para obtener el Gulemont's document.",
    ["Touch the Cermet Headstone in The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah (I-7) with the key item from that mission in your possession."] = "Toca el Cermet Headstone de The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah (I-7) con el key item de esa misión en tu poder.",
    ["Touch the Ferric Stench again for a cutscene."] = "Toca de nuevo el Ferric Stench para una escena.",
    ["Touch the Goblin Festival Site on the coast at Batallia Downs (K-7) at night (18:00-6:00) for a cutscene. Unity Warp (level 125) puts you at (K-8)."] = "Toca el Goblin Festival Site de la costa de Batallia Downs (K-7) de noche (18:00-6:00) para una escena. El Unity Warp (nivel 125) te deja en (K-8).",
    ["Touch the Home Point in front of the elevator ramp, then step on the platform and ascend to the second floor."] = "Toca el Home Point delante de la rampa del ascensor y luego súbete a la plataforma y sube al segundo piso.",
    ["Touch the Home Point in the residential area near the ferry dock if this is your first visit."] = "Toca el Home Point de la zona residencial cerca del muelle del ferry si es tu primera visita.",
    ["Touch the Peculiar Rootprints in Rolanberry Fields (S) at (H-14). The Rolanberry Fields (S) Survival Guide is the fastest way; second best is to teleport to the stronghold in Pashhow Marshlands (S) and zone into Rolanberry Fields (S)."] = "Toca las Peculiar Rootprints en Rolanberry Fields (S) en (H-14). La Survival Guide de Rolanberry Fields (S) es la forma más rápida; la segunda mejor es teletransportarte a la fortaleza de Pashhow Marshlands (S) y entrar en Rolanberry Fields (S).",
    ["Touch the Point of Interest on the lowest level by Mirror Pond, at the lower-left corner of (J-6)/(I-6), for a cutscene and a Hi-Elixir Tank. Unity Warp (level 128) to Fei'Yin and zoning out is close. Don't warp away if you're continuing."] = "Toca el Point of Interest del nivel más bajo junto a Mirror Pond, en la esquina inferior izquierda de (J-6)/(I-6), para una escena y un Hi-Elixir Tank. El Unity Warp (nivel 128) a Fei'Yin y salir de la zona está cerca. No te teletransportes si vas a continuar.",
    ["Touch the Vicious Claw Marks again for a cutscene with Altennia."] = "Toca de nuevo las Vicious Claw Marks para una escena con Altennia.",
    ["Touch the monument for an event."] = "Toca el monument para ver un evento.",
    ["Touch the shiny Secret Entrance at the east edge of Batallia Downs (S) (G-7) to enter The Eldieme Necropolis (S). The Survival Guide or Campaign warp puts you nearby."] = "Toca la Secret Entrance brillante del borde este de Batallia Downs (S) (G-7) para entrar en The Eldieme Necropolis (S). La Survival Guide o el warp de Campaign te dejan cerca.",
    ["Touch the site again for a cutscene and Maat's pillow."] = "Toca de nuevo el lugar para una escena y la Maat's pillow.",
    ["Touch the six Pips (green map markers) to see their elements. Lay the six out as on the map and draw a line between each pair that touches straight across or up/down (not diagonally) and are neighbors in the week: Fire, Earth, Water, Wind, Ice, Lightning, Light, Dark (Dark wraps back to Fire). The lines draw a digit like a digital clock."] = "Toca los seis Pips (marcadores verdes del mapa) para ver sus elementos. Distribuye los seis como en el mapa y traza una línea entre cada pareja que se toque en línea recta, en horizontal o en vertical (no en diagonal), y que sean vecinos en la semana: Fire, Earth, Water, Wind, Ice, Lightning, Light, Dark (Dark vuelve a Fire). Las líneas dibujan un dígito como en un reloj digital.",
    ["Touch the third and final Peculiar Rootprints in Meriphataud Mountains (S) at (L-4), near the zone line to The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah. The Meriphataud Mountains (S) Survival Guide and Recall-Meriph are both good ways to get there."] = "Toca las terceras y últimas Peculiar Rootprints en Meriphataud Mountains (S) en (L-4), cerca de la línea de zona a The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah. La Survival Guide de Meriphataud Mountains (S) y Recall-Meriph son buenas formas de llegar.",
    ["Touching the active spot spawns the Templar Crawler right away. It hits hard with Poison Breath and gains extra Protect after Cocoon. Everyone in the party gets a Sublime lucky egg when it dies."] = "Tocar el punto activo hace aparecer enseguida al Templar Crawler. Golpea fuerte con Poison Breath y gana Protect extra tras Cocoon. Todos los del grupo reciben un Sublime lucky egg cuando muere.",
    ["Trade 10 gil to Nouveil nearby to receive a Blessed Waterskin."] = "Entrega 10 gil a Nouveil, cerca, para recibir un Blessed Waterskin.",
    ["Trade 2 Imperial Mythril Pieces to Abquhbah to start the first trial. Trial 1, memory: you're shown a scene briefly and must answer every question about it. Scene 1 asks what kind of critters and how many; scene 2 asks twice how many face left, right, up or down; scene 3 asks how many there were."] = "Entrega 2 Imperial Mythril Pieces a Abquhbah para empezar la primera prueba. Prueba 1, memoria: se te muestra brevemente una escena y debes responder todas las preguntas sobre ella. La escena 1 pregunta qué tipo de bichos y cuántos; la escena 2 pregunta dos veces cuántos miran a la izquierda, a la derecha, arriba o abajo; la escena 3 pregunta cuántos había.",
    ["Trade 2 Imperial Mythril Pieces to Abquhbah to start the second trial. Trial 2, proof of competence: trade him a piece of eastern beastmen equipment, such as Macuahuitl -1, Mamool Ja Collar, Mamool Ja Helmet, Jadagna -1, Januwiyah -1, Tariqah -1, Troll Pauldron, Troll Vambrace, Lamian Armlet, Lamian Kaman -1 or Qutrub Gorget. Upgraded items (Lamian Kaman, Lamian Kaman +1) and western beastmen gear (Yagudo, Orc, Goblin) don't work."] = "Entrega 2 Imperial Mythril Pieces a Abquhbah para empezar la segunda prueba. Prueba 2, prueba de competencia: entrégale una pieza de equipo de los hombres bestia del este, como Macuahuitl -1, Mamool Ja Collar, Mamool Ja Helmet, Jadagna -1, Januwiyah -1, Tariqah -1, Troll Pauldron, Troll Vambrace, Lamian Armlet, Lamian Kaman -1 o Qutrub Gorget. Los objetos mejorados (Lamian Kaman, Lamian Kaman +1) y el equipo de los hombres bestia del oeste (Yagudo, Orc, Goblin) no sirven.",
    ["Trade 2 Imperial Mythril Pieces to Abquhbah to start the third trial. Trial 3, trivia: get at least 7 of 8 right. Answers: Fulfill requests without fail; Bigger than a Marid; Mythralline Wellspring; A detective agency; Empyrean Incense; Warjal; Blackrust; He tripped over his right foot."] = "Entrega 2 Imperial Mythril Pieces a Abquhbah para empezar la tercera prueba. Prueba 3, preguntas: acierta al menos 7 de 8. Respuestas: Fulfill requests without fail; Bigger than a Marid; Mythralline Wellspring; A detective agency; Empyrean Incense; Warjal; Blackrust; He tripped over his right foot.",
    ["Trade 3 Imperial Gold Pieces to Abquhbah, who gives you the Officer Academy manual."] = "Entrega 3 Imperial Gold Pieces a Abquhbah, que te da el Officer Academy manual.",
    ["Trade 4 more Honey, one at a time, to Zayhi-Bauhi."] = "Entrega 4 Honey más, una a una, a Zayhi-Bauhi.",
    ["Trade Ailbeche a Giant Shell Bug. You can buy one at the Auction House, or go to Crawlers' Nest and defeat Dreadbug from the ??? on map 2, south-west of (H-9); it can drop up to 4. Dreadbug can be spawned again once per game day while the quest is active."] = "Entrega a Ailbeche un Giant Shell Bug. Puedes comprar uno en la Auction House, o ir a Crawlers' Nest y derrotar a Dreadbug de la ??? del mapa 2, al suroeste de (H-9); puede soltar hasta 4. Dreadbug se puede volver a hacer aparecer una vez por día de juego mientras la quest esté activa.",
    ["Trade Beehive Chip x3 for 150 gil or Remi Shell x2 for 200 gil to Tapoh Lihzeh to complete the quest."] = "Entrega Beehive Chip x3 por 150 gil o Remi Shell x2 por 200 gil a Tapoh Lihzeh para completar la quest.",
    ["Trade Blatherix (F-8) a Goblin Mess Tin, a Goblin Mushpot and Twinkle Powder for another cutscene. Mess Tins drop from Goblin Skirmishers (few spawn points) and other goblins, or the Auction House (Other > Beast-made); Mushpots are sold by Pawkrix in Lower Jeuno (H-10); Twinkle Powder by Upih Khachla in Windurst Waters North (H-9), sometimes by Dabih Jajalioh in Ru'Lude Gardens (F-9)."] = "Entrega a Blatherix (F-8) una Goblin Mess Tin, un Goblin Mushpot y Twinkle Powder para otra escena. Las Mess Tins las sueltan los Goblin Skirmishers (pocos puntos de aparición) y otros goblins, o están en la Auction House (Other > Beast-made); los Mushpots los vende Pawkrix en Lower Jeuno (H-10); la Twinkle Powder, Upih Khachla en Windurst Waters North (H-9), y a veces Dabih Jajalioh en Ru'Lude Gardens (F-9).",
    ["Trade Blatherix (F-8) either 30 Goblin Chocolate (sold by Pawkrix in Lower Jeuno (H-10)) or 5,000 gil for the Mine Shaft Key."] = "Entrega a Blatherix (F-8) 30 Goblin Chocolate (las vende Pawkrix en Lower Jeuno (H-10)) o 5,000 gil para obtener la Mine Shaft Key.",
    ["Trade Brakobrik 1, 2, 3 and 4 ash, in separate trades, for the key items Dusty tome, Pointed jug, Cracked club and Peeling hairpin. You can only hold one of each, so trading the same amount twice wastes the ash."] = "Entrega a Brakobrik 1, 2, 3 y 4 cenizas, en entregas separadas, para obtener los key items Dusty tome, Pointed jug, Cracked club y Peeling hairpin. Solo puedes tener uno de cada, así que entregar la misma cantidad dos veces desperdicia la ceniza.",
    ["Trade Cacaroon 1,000 gil for another cutscene."] = "Entrega a Cacaroon 1,000 gil para otra escena.",
    ["Trade Cacaroon 1,000 gil or one Imperial Bronze Piece for another cutscene (he won't take the gil automatically; you must trade it)."] = "Entrega a Cacaroon 1,000 gil o una Imperial Bronze Piece para otra escena (no coge el gil automáticamente; debes entregárselo).",
    ["Trade Coeurl Meat to Baudin in Upper Jeuno to obtain the Crest of Davoi."] = "Entrega Coeurl Meat a Baudin en Upper Jeuno para obtener el Crest of Davoi.",
    ["Trade Faulpie a Buffalo Hide, a Ram Leather and 10,000 gil."] = "Entrega a Faulpie una Buffalo Hide, una Ram Leather y 10,000 gil.",
    ["Trade Faulpie a Buffalo Hide, a Sheep Leather and 10,000 gil."] = "Entrega a Faulpie una Buffalo Hide, una Sheep Leather y 10,000 gil.",
    ["Trade Gerwitz's Axe to the ??? at (H-8) on map 3 to spawn Gerwitz's Sword (NM). Defeat it and it drops Gerwitz's Sword."] = "Entrega Gerwitz's Axe a la ??? en (H-8) del mapa 3 para invocar a Gerwitz's Sword (NM). Derrótalo y suelta Gerwitz's Sword.",
    ["Trade Giant Bird Feather x3 to Baren-Moren in a single trade to complete the quest and receive 1,500 gil."] = "Entrega Giant Bird Feather x3 a Baren-Moren en una sola entrega para completar la quest y recibir 1,500 gil.",
    ["Trade Irmilant in Rabao (G-7) the Broken Lu Shang's Rod, a Piece of Ancient Lumber and 2 Light Crystals."] = "Entrega a Irmilant en Rabao (G-7) la Broken Lu Shang's Rod, un Piece of Ancient Lumber y 2 Light Crystals.",
    ["Trade Iruki-Waraki 1 Sleeping Potion and 1 Chai."] = "Entrega a Iruki-Waraki 1 Sleeping Potion y 1 Chai.",
    ["Trade Jody's Acid to Pyopyoroon (H-7)."] = "Entrega Jody's Acid a Pyopyoroon (H-7).",
    ["Trade Kerutoto a Grilled Hare (440 gil), Kenapa-Keppa a Hard-boiled Egg (120 gil), and Ohbiru-Dohbiru a Pamtam Kelp, a Tortilla and Windurstian Tea (440 gil)."] = "Entrega a Kerutoto un Grilled Hare (440 gil), a Kenapa-Keppa un Hard-boiled Egg (120 gil) y a Ohbiru-Dohbiru un Pamtam Kelp, una Tortilla y Windurstian Tea (440 gil).",
    ["Trade Lokpix the Tremorstone and the other item together to receive the key item Loadstone. The Loadstone lets you open the weighted doors in Quicksand Caves solo, without needing multiple players."] = "Entrega a Lokpix la Tremorstone y el otro objeto a la vez para recibir el key item Loadstone. La Loadstone te permite abrir tú solo las puertas de peso de Quicksand Caves, sin necesitar varios jugadores.",
    ["Trade Lu Shang's Fishing Rod to Jourdenaux to complete the quest and receive Lu Shang's Fishing Rod +1 (Rare/Ex, tagged with your server and completion number) and the title Fish Whisperer. If it breaks, Jourdenaux repairs it for an Ancient Lumber."] = "Entrega la Lu Shang's Fishing Rod a Jourdenaux para completar la quest y recibir la Lu Shang's Fishing Rod +1 (Rare/Ex, marcada con tu servidor y tu número de finalización) y el título Fish Whisperer. Si se rompe, Jourdenaux la repara a cambio de un Ancient Lumber.",
    ["Trade Melyon any one of those sets to complete the quest and receive between 100 and 600 gil. If you have already completed the quest at least once, you do not need to speak to him again to start it; you can simply trade the items again."] = "Entrega a Melyon cualquiera de esos lotes para completar la quest y recibir entre 100 y 600 gil. Si ya has completado la quest al menos una vez, no hace falta hablar de nuevo con él para empezarla; basta con entregar otra vez los objetos.",
    ["Trade Mhebi Juhbily in Kazham (I-10) a Sandfish. You need Kazham fame level 6 and the Rise of the Zilart pack. When asked, tell her you give it to her. Then check the shed behind her for a cutscene."] = "Entrega un Sandfish a Mhebi Juhbily en Kazham (I-10). Necesitas el nivel 6 de fama de Kazham y el pack Rise of the Zilart. Cuando te pregunten, dile que se lo das. Luego revisa el cobertizo que hay tras ella para una escena.",
    ["Trade Novalmauge a Dahlia to receive a Neutralizer."] = "Entrega una Dahlia a Novalmauge para recibir un Neutralizer.",
    ["Trade Novalmauge a vial of Beastman Blood to complete the quest."] = "Entrega a Novalmauge un vial de Beastman Blood para completar la quest.",
    ["Trade Orlando eight of any one of the items to complete the quest and receive 100 to 900 gil, depending on the item. You can repeat the quest."] = "Entrega a Orlando ocho de cualquiera de los objetos para completar la quest y recibir de 100 a 900 gil, según el objeto. Puedes repetir la quest.",
    ["Trade Oswald a Danceshroom to complete the quest and receive the Sleep Dagger. Danceshrooms can be bought at the Auction House under Food, Ingredients."] = "Entrega a Oswald una Danceshroom para completar la quest y recibir la Sleep Dagger. Las Danceshrooms se pueden comprar en la Auction House en Food, Ingredients.",
    ["Trade Oswald a Shall Shell to complete the quest. You receive the Glass Fiber Fishing Rod and the title The Love Doctor."] = "Entrega a Oswald un Shall Shell para completar la quest. Recibes la Glass Fiber Fishing Rod y el título The Love Doctor.",
    ["Trade Peshi Yohnts a Bugard Leather, a Turtle Shell and 10,000 gil."] = "Entrega a Peshi Yohnts una Bugard Leather, un Turtle Shell y 10,000 gil.",
    ["Trade Ploh Trishbahk (K-9) the necklace from The Lightsland (Adoulin's Refuge, Arciela's Grace or Ygnas's Resolve). If you threw it away, just talk to her."] = "Entrega a Ploh Trishbahk (K-9) el collar de The Lightsland (Adoulin's Refuge, Arciela's Grace o Ygnas's Resolve). Si lo tiraste, solo habla con ella.",
    ["Trade Plumes d'Or to Machionage (C-6), Louxiard (G-7), Illeuse (H-9), Rongelouts N Distaud (I-9), Sabiliont (I-11), Elnonde (K-9), and Loillie (K-9 via the stairs at L-8)."] = "Entrega Plumes d'Or a Machionage (C-6), Louxiard (G-7), Illeuse (H-9), Rongelouts N Distaud (I-9), Sabiliont (I-11), Elnonde (K-9) y Loillie (K-9 por las escaleras en L-8).",
    ["Trade Qutiba three pots of White Honey for another cutscene and your reward, the Irmik Helvasi and additional recipes."] = "Entrega a Qutiba tres botes de White Honey para otra escena y tu recompensa, el Irmik Helvasi y recetas adicionales.",
    ["Trade Rabbit Hide x3 to Parvipon for your reward. Rabbit Hide is sold upstairs in the Leathercraft guild by Cletae (D-8)."] = "Entrega Rabbit Hide x3 a Parvipon para recibir tu recompensa. La Rabbit Hide se vende arriba en el Leathercraft guild por Cletae (D-8).",
    ["Trade Runje Desaali (J-10) an item level 106 or 115 Wildskeeper Reive weapon, armor or Rare/Ex accessory (she pays 4,000-6,000 Bayld). Check for a Kupon AW-WK first; Records of Eminence NPCs also trade all six Wildskeeper key items for a weapon."] = "Entrega a Runje Desaali (J-10) un arma, armadura o accesorio Rare/Ex de Wildskeeper Reive de item level 106 o 115 (te paga 4,000-6,000 Bayld). Mira antes si tienes un Kupon AW-WK; los NPCs de Records of Eminence también cambian los seis key items de Wildskeeper por un arma.",
    ["Trade Suldiran 2 Imp Wings to complete the quest and receive 200 gil. You can repeat the quest."] = "Entrega 2 Imp Wings a Suldiran para completar la quest y recibir 200 gil. Puedes repetir la quest.",
    ["Trade Taillegeas the items he requests to receive your reward, 4,000 gil. You can repeat the quest."] = "Entrega a Taillegeas los objetos que pide para recibir tu recompensa, 4,000 gil. Puedes repetir la quest.",
    ["Trade Tokaka a Bastore Sardine to complete the quest and receive 70 gil."] = "Entrega a Tokaka una Bastore Sardine para completar la quest y recibir 70 gil.",
    ["Trade Tsetseroon a Tin Ore and a Cobalt Jellyfish. He gives you a Pot of Tsetseroon's stew."] = "Entrega a Tsetseroon un Tin Ore y una Cobalt Jellyfish. Te da un Pot of Tsetseroon's stew.",
    ["Trade Vounebariont 5 Beetle Shells to complete the quest and receive 750 gil. About 5 to 6 stacks of Beetle Shells raise your fame from around 1 up to the maximum of 9."] = "Entrega 5 Beetle Shells a Vounebariont para completar la quest y recibir 750 gil. Unas 5 o 6 pilas de Beetle Shells suben tu fama desde aproximadamente 1 hasta el máximo de 9.",
    ["Trade Washu a Bastore Sardine, a Frost Turnip, a piece of Giant Sheep Meat and a Hecteyes Eye to receive the key item Washu's tasty wurst."] = "Entrega a Washu un Bastore Sardine, un Frost Turnip, un trozo de Giant Sheep Meat y un Hecteyes Eye para recibir el key item Washu's tasty wurst.",
    ["Trade Zaldon certain fish and he will gut them for you. What you receive depends on the fish, and some of them earn a title. You can repeat the quest."] = "Entrega a Zaldon ciertos peces y te los destripará. Lo que recibes depende del pez, y algunos dan un título. Puedes repetir la quest.",
    ["Trade a Cernunnos Bulb to the Humus-rich Earth in Jugner Forest [S] (E-6) to plant it (Campaign Arbiter warp then northwest, or the Survival Guide; watch for Lobisons)."] = "Entrega un Cernunnos Bulb a la Humus-rich Earth de Jugner Forest [S] (E-6) para plantarlo (warp del Campaign Arbiter y luego al noroeste, o la Survival Guide; cuidado con los Lobisons).",
    ["Trade a Cornette for 200 gil. It drops from the Mandragora and Pygmaioi enemies above, and can also be bought for 50 sparks from the Records of Eminence NPCs, or from Harmodios in Bastok Markets (K-10) when Bastok is 1st or 2nd in Conquest."] = "Entrega una Cornette por 200 gil. La sueltan los enemigos Mandragora y Pygmaioi anteriores, y también se puede comprar por 50 sparks a los NPCs de Records of Eminence, o a Harmodios en Bastok Markets (K-10) cuando Bastok está en 1st o 2nd en Conquest.",
    ["Trade a Deathball to Mashuu-Ajuu to receive a Stationery Set and 700 gil, or a Sobbing Fungus to receive a Stationery Set and 500 gil."] = "Entrega un Deathball a Mashuu-Ajuu para recibir un Stationery Set y 700 gil, o un Sobbing Fungus para recibir un Stationery Set y 500 gil.",
    ["Trade a Dream Flower Petal to Habida-Jubida (Auction House: Materials > Alchemy 1, or kill Alraune in Bibiki Bay - Purgonorgo Isle after they use Dream Flower)."] = "Entrega un Dream Flower Petal a Habida-Jubida (Auction House: Materials > Alchemy 1, o mata Alraune en Bibiki Bay - Purgonorgo Isle después de que usen Dream Flower).",
    ["Trade a Flint Stone to Charred Firewood two levels above and north of the (I-7) tower."] = "Entrega una Flint Stone a Charred Firewood, dos niveles por encima y al norte de la torre (I-7).",
    ["Trade a Four-Leaf Mandragora Bud for 120 gil. It drops from Mandragora enemies in West Sarutabaruta, Pygmaioi enemies in Tahrongi Canyon and Sylvestre enemies in Buburimu Peninsula."] = "Entrega un Four-Leaf Mandragora Bud por 120 gil. Lo sueltan enemigos Mandragora en West Sarutabaruta, enemigos Pygmaioi en Tahrongi Canyon y enemigos Sylvestre en Buburimu Peninsula.",
    ["Trade a Hydrangea to Fari-Wari. Hilltroll Red Mages, Hilltroll Warriors and Hilltroll Puppetmasters in Mount Zhayolm drop it, or buy it at the Auction House."] = "Entrega una Hydrangea a Fari-Wari. La sueltan los Hilltroll Red Mages, Hilltroll Warriors y Hilltroll Puppetmasters de Mount Zhayolm, o cómprala en la Auction House.",
    ["Trade a Hydrangea to the Withered Petals in Mount Zhayolm (L-6); this one doesn't have to be at night."] = "Entrega una Hydrangea a los Withered Petals de Mount Zhayolm (L-6); esta no tiene que ser de noche.",
    ["Trade a King Truffle to Hilda to receive the Steaming Sheep invitation. King Truffle can be found at the Auction House, in Voidwatch, or dropped by some Funguar enemies in Crawlers' Nest."] = "Entrega un King Truffle a Hilda para recibir la Steaming Sheep invitation. El King Truffle se puede encontrar en la Auction House, en Voidwatch o lo sueltan algunos enemigos Funguar en Crawlers' Nest.",
    ["Trade a Mythril Pick to the same unnamed target for the final cutscene and your reward: the Map of Mount Zhayolm (if you do not already own it), 2,000 experience points and 2,000 gil."] = "Entrega un Mythril Pick al mismo objetivo sin nombre para la escena final y tu recompensa: el Map of Mount Zhayolm (si aún no lo tienes), 2,000 puntos de experiencia y 2,000 gil.",
    ["Trade a Pickaxe to the same unnamed target for another cutscene."] = "Entrega un Pickaxe al mismo objetivo sin nombre para otra escena.",
    ["Trade a Quadav Helm to Goraow to complete the quest and receive 900 gil. You can repeat it without zoning."] = "Entrega un Quadav Helm a Goraow para completar la quest y recibir 900 gil. Puedes repetirla sin cambiar de zona.",
    ["Trade a Red Grass Cloth to Sassa-Kotassa in the lobby (Auction House: Materials > Clothcraft)."] = "Entrega una Red Grass Cloth a Sassa-Kotassa en el vestíbulo (Auction House: Materials > Clothcraft).",
    ["Trade a Stygian Ash to the Odyssean Passage for a cutscene and the Bronze-hued tag. Pixies drop it around Witchfire Glen in Grauberg (S) (Lightsworm at the blue sparkles by the Batallia Downs Survival Guide, then the conflux behind you; or the Grauberg (S) Survival Guide or Campaign warp)."] = "Entrega una Stygian Ash al Odyssean Passage para una escena y la Bronze-hued tag. La sueltan los Pixies alrededor de Witchfire Glen en Grauberg (S) (Lightsworm en los destellos azules junto a la Survival Guide de Batallia Downs y luego la conflux de detrás; o la Survival Guide de Grauberg (S) o el warp de Campaign).",
    ["Trade a Sutlac to Totoroon."] = "Entrega un Sutlac a Totoroon.",
    ["Trade a Three-Leaf Mandragora Bud for 1,200 gil. It drops from Yuhtunga Mandragora enemies in Yuhtunga Jungle."] = "Entrega un Three-Leaf Mandragora Bud por 1,200 gil. Lo sueltan enemigos Yuhtunga Mandragora en Yuhtunga Jungle.",
    ["Trade a Yagudo Drink to Sheelala (Curio Vendor Moogle or Auction House: Food > Meals > Drinks)."] = "Entrega una Yagudo Drink a Sheelala (Curio Vendor Moogle o Auction House: Food > Meals > Drinks).",
    ["Trade a Yuhtunga Sulfur for 250 gil. It drops from the same enemies as the Four-Leaf Mandragora Bud."] = "Entrega un Yuhtunga Sulfur por 250 gil. Lo sueltan los mismos enemigos que el Four-Leaf Mandragora Bud.",
    ["Trade a piece of Mahogany Lumber to Osker near the chocobos and Brutus in Upper Jeuno (G-7) to receive the Tamer's whistle."] = "Entrega una Mahogany Lumber a Osker, junto a los chocobos y Brutus en Upper Jeuno (G-7), para recibir el Tamer's whistle.",
    ["Trade a piece of Rosewood Lumber to Jatan-Paratan to complete the quest and receive your reward."] = "Entrega una pieza de Rosewood Lumber a Jatan-Paratan para completar la quest y recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Trade all 12 Vellum to Erlene (J-8)."] = "Entrega los 12 Vellum a Erlene (J-8).",
    ["Trade all 3 items to Leepe-Hoppe at once to complete the quest and receive 4,000 gil. Speak with Leepe-Hoppe again to start the quest Tuning Out."] = "Entrega los 3 objetos a Leepe-Hoppe a la vez para completar la quest y recibir 4,000 gil. Habla de nuevo con Leepe-Hoppe para empezar la quest Tuning Out.",
    ["Trade all five fish to Ququroon to complete the quest and receive a Nashmau Stew. There is a small chance that he fails to make the stew: the quest still counts as completed, but you do not receive the reward. You can repeat the quest."] = "Entrega los cinco pescados a Ququroon para completar la quest y recibir un Nashmau Stew. Hay una pequeña probabilidad de que no consiga hacer el estofado: la quest cuenta igualmente como completada, pero no recibes la recompensa. Puedes repetir la quest.",
    ["Trade all four ingredients to Ranpi-Monpi and wait one Vana'diel day."] = "Entrega los cuatro ingredientes a Ranpi-Monpi y espera un día de Vana'diel.",
    ["Trade all three at once to Moogle in the Mog House of your current nation of allegiance."] = "Entrega las tres a la vez al Moogle de la Mog House de tu nación actual.",
    ["Trade all three chips to Cid in Metalworks (H-8) to complete the quest and receive a CCB Polymer Pump. It's Rare, so trade it away or put it in a delivery box before getting another."] = "Entrega los tres chips a Cid en Metalworks (H-8) para completar la quest y recibir una CCB Polymer Pump. Es Rare, así que entrégala o déjala en una caja de envío antes de conseguir otra.",
    ["Trade all three to Shantotto (K-7) for a cutscene, your rewards and Memorian, the Magicked Doll."] = "Entrega los tres a Shantotto (K-7) para una escena, tus recompensas y Memorian, the Magicked Doll.",
    ["Trade all three to the ??? (G-6) on Qufim Island, mid-east of (G-6) near two rock columns, for a cutscene."] = "Entrega las tres a la ??? (G-6) de Qufim Island, en la parte centro-este de (G-6) cerca de dos columnas de roca, para una escena.",
    ["Trade an Imp Wing to Naja Salaheem in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10) to complete the quest and receive the key item PFC Wildcat badge, which gives access to PFC Assaults."] = "Entrega un Imp Wing a Naja Salaheem en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (I-10) para completar la quest y recibir el key item PFC Wildcat badge, que da acceso a los PFC Assaults.",
    ["Trade both armor pieces to Scarred Shark (G-5)."] = "Entrega ambas piezas de armadura a Scarred Shark (G-5).",
    ["Trade both horns to Paujean to complete the quest."] = "Entrega ambos cuernos a Paujean para completar la quest.",
    ["Trade crystals to a Conquest NPC until your rank bar fills, then accept the mission from any Gate Guard: Argus (Port Bastok L-7), Cleades (Bastok Markets D-11), Malduc (Metalworks J-8) or Rashid (Bastok Mines H-10)."] = "Entrega cristales a un NPC de Conquest hasta llenar tu barra de rango y luego acepta la misión de cualquier Gate Guard: Argus (Port Bastok L-7), Cleades (Bastok Markets D-11), Malduc (Metalworks J-8) o Rashid (Bastok Mines H-10).",
    ["Trade either Silk Thread x3 or Crawler Calculus x3 to Illu Bohjaa to complete the quest and receive 600 gil."] = "Entrega Silk Thread x3 o Crawler Calculus x3 a Illu Bohjaa para completar la quest y recibir 600 gil.",
    ["Trade her a Ladybug Wing for a cutscene and to receive your reward."] = "Entrégale un Ladybug Wing para una escena y recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Trade her the Holy Water. She returns it and sends you to purify the tomb of a great bard in The Eldieme Necropolis. From here on any job works. Optional: Mataligeat in the meadhouse tells you more about the bard."] = "Entrégale el Holy Water. Te lo devuelve y te envía a purificar la tumba de un gran bardo en The Eldieme Necropolis. A partir de aquí sirve cualquier job. Opcional: Mataligeat, en la taberna, te cuenta más sobre el bardo.",
    ["Trade him 100 gil to receive a Blackened Siredon. The quest is repeatable."] = "Entrégale 100 gil para recibir un Blackened Siredon. La quest es repetible.",
    ["Trade him 70 gil to receive the Blue Peas."] = "Dale 70 gil para recibir el Blue Peas.",
    ["Trade him a Gold Hairpin for a cutscene. A Gold Hairpin +1 will not work."] = "Entrégale una Gold Hairpin para una escena. Una Gold Hairpin +1 no sirve.",
    ["Trade him a Gugru Tuna. In exchange he tells you your fishing history: how many times you have cast your line, how many fish you have caught, and the longest and heaviest fish you have landed."] = "Entrégale un Gugru Tuna. A cambio te cuenta tu historial de pesca: cuántas veces has lanzado la caña, cuántos peces has pescado y el pez más largo y el más pesado que has sacado.",
    ["Trade him a Merrow Scale to complete the quest and receive Merrow No.17's Locket."] = "Entrégale una Merrow Scale para completar la quest y recibir el Merrow No.17's Locket.",
    ["Trade him five pieces of the same type of onion equipment to complete the quest. You receive a Wastebasket and the title Ecologist."] = "Entrégale cinco piezas del mismo tipo de equipo onion para completar la quest. Recibes una Wastebasket y el título Ecologist.",
    ["Trade him the 2 Shaman Garlic to complete the quest and receive 900 gil."] = "Entrégale los 2 Shaman Garlic para completar la quest y recibir 900 gil.",
    ["Trade him the Bone Chip to complete the quest and receive the Map of the Dangruf Wadi."] = "Entrégale el Bone Chip para completar la quest y recibir el Map of the Dangruf Wadi.",
    ["Trade him the gil he asks for, between 10,000 and 30,000 gil. This earns you the title Gullible's Travels."] = "Entrégale el gil que te pide, entre 10,000 y 30,000 gil. Esto te da el título Gullible's Travels.",
    ["Trade him the item and he tells you to go to Aydeewa Subterrane. He gives the item back; keep it in your inventory, or you won't get the next cutscene."] = "Entrégale el objeto y te dice que vayas a Aydeewa Subterrane. Te devuelve el objeto; guárdalo en el inventario o no verás la siguiente escena.",
    ["Trade him the two Cluster Cores to receive your reward, the Shu'Meyo Salt. You can repeat the quest."] = "Entrégale los dos Cluster Cores para recibir tu recompensa, el Shu'Meyo Salt. Puedes repetir la quest.",
    ["Trade him the two ores to end the quest and receive 8,000 gil. You may immediately repeat the quest."] = "Entrégale los dos minerales para terminar la quest y recibir 8,000 gil. Puedes repetir la quest de inmediato.",
    ["Trade one Giant Scale to Unstable Displacement (G-10)."] = "Entrega una Giant Scale al Unstable Displacement (G-10).",
    ["Trade one Lufet Salt, then another, to complete the required sequence."] = "Entrega una Lufet Salt y luego otra para completar la secuencia requerida.",
    ["Trade one to four of these items to Ambrosius in a single trade to complete the quest: 1 gives 50 gil, 2 give 150 gil, 3 give 250 gil and 4 give 500 gil."] = "Entrega de uno a cuatro de estos objetos a Ambrosius en una sola entrega para completar la quest: 1 da 50 gil, 2 dan 150 gil, 3 dan 250 gil y 4 dan 500 gil.",
    ["Trade the 108-Knot Quipu to Bulwark Gate (F-6)."] = "Entrega la 108-Knot Quipu a la Bulwark Gate (F-6).",
    ["Trade the 3 Slabs of Plumbago to the Acid-eaten Door for the lightning cell. Then examine the blank target on the single dark lamp at the Nyzul Isle Staging Point in Alzadaal Undersea Ruins (J-8/9) for a cutscene."] = "Entrega las 3 Slabs of Plumbago a la Acid-eaten Door para obtener la célula de rayo. Luego examina el objetivo vacío de la única lámpara apagada del Nyzul Isle Staging Point en Alzadaal Undersea Ruins (J-8/9) para una escena.",
    ["Trade the 3 Zeruhn Soot to Gerbaum for your reward, 150 gil."] = "Entrega las 3 Zeruhn Soot a Gerbaum para recibir tu recompensa, 150 gil.",
    ["Trade the 4 Flint Stones to Legata for your reward."] = "Entrega las 4 Flint Stones a Legata para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Trade the 4 Ladybug Wings to Wyatt (L-6) to receive the reward."] = "Entrega las 4 Ladybug Wings a Wyatt (L-6) para recibir la recompensa.",
    ["Trade the 5 Hare Meat to Thierride to complete the quest."] = "Entrega los 5 Hare Meat a Thierride para completar la quest.",
    ["Trade the 5 Rusty Buckets to Foss for your reward, 300 gil."] = "Entrega los 5 Rusty Buckets a Foss por tu recompensa, 300 gil.",
    ["Trade the Acidic Humus to the Mandragora Warden (F-4) for a cutscene."] = "Entrega el Acidic Humus al Mandragora Warden (F-4) para una escena.",
    ["Trade the Amaryllis to Valah Molkot to complete the quest."] = "Entrega la Amaryllis a Valah Molkot para completar la quest.",
    ["Trade the Animal Glue to Hakkuru-Rinkuru to complete the quest and receive 1,500 gil."] = "Entrega el Animal Glue a Hakkuru-Rinkuru para completar la quest y recibir 1,500 gil.",
    ["Trade the Antique Coin to the Dry Fountain at (H-8) for a cutscene."] = "Entrega la Antique Coin a la Dry Fountain en (H-8) para una escena.",
    ["Trade the Ark Pentasphere to any Shimmering Circle in La'Loff Amphitheater. Up to 18 can enter, with a 30-minute limit. Defeat Ark Angel MR, TT, EV, HM and GK; at level 99 it's easy."] = "Entrega la Ark Pentasphere a cualquier Shimmering Circle de La'Loff Amphitheater. Pueden entrar hasta 18, con un límite de 30 minutos. Derrota a los Ark Angel MR, TT, EV, HM y GK; a nivel 99 es fácil.",
    ["Trade the Aspir Knife to Uu Zhoumo."] = "Entrega el Aspir Knife a Uu Zhoumo.",
    ["Trade the Axe of Trials back to Iron Eater for the key item Map to the Annals of Truth, which sends you to The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah."] = "Devuelve la Axe of Trials a Iron Eater para obtener el key item Map to the Annals of Truth, que te envía a The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah.",
    ["Trade the Banishing Charm to the Burning Circle in Waughroon Shrine to start a battle against three Demons: Rasetsu (DRK), Gaki (BLM) and Onki (SMN, with an elemental). All three can use their two-hour abilities; 30 minute limit, Trusts allowed."] = "Entrega el Banishing Charm al Burning Circle de Waughroon Shrine para empezar una batalla contra tres Demons: Rasetsu (DRK), Gaki (BLM) y Onki (SMN, con un elemental). Los tres pueden usar sus habilidades de dos horas; límite de 30 minutos, se permiten Trusts.",
    ["Trade the Bat Wing x2 to Secodiand to complete the quest and receive 200 gil."] = "Entrega la Bat Wing x2 a Secodiand para completar la quest y recibir 200 gil.",
    ["Trade the Beast Collar to Tebhi, an Opo-opo that roams the indoor pond near the Brass Door leading to the magicite for the nation missions. Tebhi disappears for 3 minutes after accepting it."] = "Entrega el Beast Collar a Tebhi, un Opo-opo que deambula por el estanque interior cerca de la Brass Door que lleva a la magicita de las misiones de nación. Tebhi desaparece 3 minutos tras aceptarlo.",
    ["Trade the Beeswax x2 to Pagisalis for your reward."] = "Entrega la Beeswax x2 a Pagisalis para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Trade the Beetle Shell and the Hecteyes Eye to Kopuro-Popuro to complete the quest and receive 600 gil."] = "Entrega la Beetle Shell y el Hecteyes Eye a Kopuro-Popuro para completar la quest y recibir 600 gil.",
    ["Trade the Bird Feather and the Two-Leaf Mandragora Bud to Moreno-Toeno to complete the quest and receive 250 gil."] = "Entrega la Bird Feather y el Two-Leaf Mandragora Bud a Moreno-Toeno para completar la quest y recibir 250 gil.",
    ["Trade the Black Tiger Fang x3 to Taumila in Southern San d'Oria (E-9) to complete the quest and receive 2,100 gil."] = "Entrega la Black Tiger Fang x3 a Taumila en Southern San d'Oria (E-9) para completar la quest y recibir 2,100 gil.",
    ["Trade the Blazing Pepper to Paku-Nakku, then speak with Paku-Nakku again."] = "Entrega el Blazing Pepper a Paku-Nakku y luego habla de nuevo con Paku-Nakku.",
    ["Trade the Blessed Waterskin to the Cheval River to obtain Cheval Water."] = "Entrega el Blessed Waterskin al Cheval River para obtener Cheval Water.",
    ["Trade the Bomb Ash to Benita to complete the quest."] = "Entrega el Bomb Ash a Benita para completar la quest.",
    ["Trade the Bomb Steel and the Sacred Branch to Jaucribaix."] = "Entrega el Bomb Steel y la Sacred Branch a Jaucribaix.",
    ["Trade the Bone Chip x2 and the Bomb Ash to Shantotto to complete the quest and receive a Brass Rod."] = "Entrega el Bone Chip x2 y el Bomb Ash a Shantotto para completar la quest y recibir una Brass Rod.",
    ["Trade the Bow of Trials back to Perih Vashai for the key item Map to the Annals of Truth, which sends you to Cape Teriggan."] = "Devuelve el Bow of Trials a Perih Vashai para obtener el key item Map to the Annals of Truth, que te envía a Cape Teriggan.",
    ["Trade the Brass Canteen to the Waterfall Base, not to the ??? on the south shore (that one is for the relic Apocalypse), to receive Drachenfall Water. Optional: the Stone Monument for An Explorer's Footsteps is at the end of the cave."] = "Entrega la Brass Canteen a la Waterfall Base, no a la ??? de la orilla sur (esa es para la reliquia Apocalypse), para recibir Drachenfall Water. Opcional: el Stone Monument de An Explorer's Footsteps está al fondo de la cueva.",
    ["Trade the Brass Hairpin to Romilda, who is standing next to Qiji."] = "Entrega la Brass Hairpin a Romilda, que está junto a Qiji.",
    ["Trade the Bronze Box to Naiko-Paneiko to complete the quest and receive 1,500 gil."] = "Entrega el Bronze Box a Naiko-Paneiko para completar la quest y recibir 1,500 gil.",
    ["Trade the Burnite Shell to Koru-Moru to complete the quest."] = "Entrega la Burnite Shell a Koru-Moru para completar la quest.",
    ["Trade the Castle Floor Plans back to Dauperiat for your reward."] = "Entrega los Castle Floor Plans a Dauperiat para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Trade the Cheval Water to Miageau to receive the Wing Pendant."] = "Entrega el Cheval Water a Miageau para recibir el Wing Pendant.",
    ["Trade the Club of Trials back to Kuroido-Moido for the key item Map to the Annals of Truth, which sends you to Ro'Maeve."] = "Devuelve el Club of Trials a Kuroido-Moido para obtener el key item Map to the Annals of Truth, que te envía a Ro'Maeve.",
    ["Trade the Cold Bone and Warm Egg to Koru-Moru for a cutscene."] = "Entrega el Cold Bone y el Warm Egg a Koru-Moru para una escena.",
    ["Trade the Copper Ingot to Michea to complete the quest and receive 180 gil. You can repeat it by zoning out of the area, but it is no longer repeatable once you reach Bastok fame level 2."] = "Entrega el Copper Ingot a Michea para completar la quest y recibir 180 gil. Puedes repetirla saliendo de la zona, pero ya no es repetible una vez alcanzas el nivel 2 de fama de Bastok.",
    ["Trade the Copper Ring to Roh Latteh in Bastok Mines (H-7), in the first-floor house on Ore Street. When her dialogue ends, you obtain the key item Letter from Roh Latteh. If you check (read) the letter from your key item menu, you get a penalty and only half of the actual reward."] = "Entrega el Copper Ring a Roh Latteh en Bastok Mines (H-7), en la casa de la planta baja de Ore Street. Cuando termina su diálogo, obtienes el key item Letter from Roh Latteh. Si compruebas (lees) la carta desde tu menú de key items, recibes una penalización y solo la mitad de la recompensa real.",
    ["Trade the Corsair's Testimony to the ??? for another cutscene, which takes you to Talacca Cove."] = "Entrega el Corsair's Testimony a la ??? para otra escena, que te lleva a Talacca Cove.",
    ["Trade the Corsair's Testimony to the Rock Slab to enter the battlefield. Buffs are wiped on entry; with the key item \"Rhapsody in Umber\" you can call Trusts. The fight ends when the boss drops to 20% HP or less. You don't need this quest for the level limit if you've already completed New Worlds Await or later."] = "Entrega el Corsair's Testimony a la Rock Slab para entrar en el campo de batalla. Los buffs se borran al entrar; con el key item \"Rhapsody in Umber\" puedes llamar a Trusts. La pelea termina cuando el jefe baja al 20% de HP o menos. No necesitas esta quest para el límite de nivel si ya completaste New Worlds Await o posteriores.",
    ["Trade the Crystal Bass to any Gate Guard in San d'Oria: Ambrotien (Southern San d'Oria K-10), Endracion (Southern San d'Oria F-9) or Grilau (Northern San d'Oria D-8)."] = "Entrega el Crystal Bass a cualquier Gate Guard de San d'Oria: Ambrotien (Southern San d'Oria K-10), Endracion (Southern San d'Oria F-9) o Grilau (Northern San d'Oria D-8).",
    ["Trade the Curse Wand to Sedal-Godjal (J-8) for a cutscene."] = "Entrega la Curse Wand a Sedal-Godjal (J-8) para una escena.",
    ["Trade the Cursed Key to the Granite Door at (J-6) on the same map for a cutscene and the key item Book of the Gods."] = "Entrega la Cursed Key a la Granite Door de (J-6) en el mismo mapa para una escena y el key item Book of the Gods.",
    ["Trade the Dagger of Trials back to Jakoh Wahcondalo for the key item Map to the Annals of Truth, which sends you to Gustav Tunnel."] = "Devuelve la Dagger of Trials a Jakoh Wahcondalo para obtener el key item Map to the Annals of Truth, que te envía a Gustav Tunnel.",
    ["Trade the Darksteel Ingot to the ??? at (I-8) on map 1 to spawn Gerwitz's Axe (NM). If you zoned in from La Theine Plateau or used the Survival Guide, take the east path (B on the wiki maps). If you are defeated you need another Darksteel Ingot to respawn the NM."] = "Entrega el Darksteel Ingot a la ??? en (I-8) del mapa 1 para invocar a Gerwitz's Axe (NM). Si entraste desde La Theine Plateau o usaste la Survival Guide, toma el camino este (B en los mapas de la wiki). Si te derrotan necesitas otro Darksteel Ingot para reinvocar al NM.",
    ["Trade the Davoi Storage Key to the targetable Storage Hole, which moves randomly around the zone at the start or end of each game day and is usually in open areas. Each field shows a few holes on the ground, but only one is targetable. Known locations: (E-10), (F-6), (F-7), (F-9), (G-9), (G-10), (H-8), (I-7), (I-8), (J-7), (J-8), (K-7), (K-8), (K-9) and (K-10). The center island Storage Hole at (H-8) can be reached from the river."] = "Entrega la Davoi Storage Key al Storage Hole que se puede seleccionar, que se mueve al azar por la zona al empezar o terminar cada día de juego y suele estar en zonas abiertas. Cada campo muestra varios agujeros en el suelo, pero solo uno se puede seleccionar. Ubicaciones conocidas: (E-10), (F-6), (F-7), (F-9), (G-9), (G-10), (H-8), (I-7), (I-8), (J-7), (J-8), (K-7), (K-8), (K-9) y (K-10). Al Storage Hole de la isla central en (H-8) se llega desde el río.",
    ["Trade the Demon Pen to Koblakiq, wait one Earth minute and speak with him again."] = "Entrega la Demon Pen a Koblakiq, espera un minuto real y vuelve a hablar con él.",
    ["Trade the Derfland Humus to Chalvatot to complete the quest and receive the Map of the Northlands area."] = "Entrega el Derfland Humus a Chalvatot para completar la quest y recibir el Map of the Northlands area.",
    ["Trade the Desert Venom to Edigey for your reward. The first time you complete the quest you receive a Dotanuki and the title Desert Hunter; each time after that you only receive gil. You can repeat the quest."] = "Entrega el Desert Venom a Edigey por tu recompensa. La primera vez que completas la quest recibes un Dotanuki y el título Desert Hunter; las siguientes veces solo recibes gil. Puedes repetir la quest.",
    ["Trade the Eagle Button to her, which prompts her to admit she was the thief."] = "Entrégale el Eagle Button, lo que la lleva a admitir que fue la ladrona.",
    ["Trade the Earth Pendulum to the Protocrystal to enter the battlefield."] = "Entrega el Earth Pendulum al Protocrystal para entrar en el campo de batalla.",
    ["Trade the Elixir to the correct imp. If you choose incorrectly, wait one Vana'diel day before trying again."] = "Entrega el Elixir al imp correcto. Si eliges mal, espera un día de Vana'diel antes de volver a intentarlo.",
    ["Trade the Elshimo Marble to Rauteinot. You receive Rauteinot's parcel."] = "Entrega el Elshimo Marble a Rauteinot. Recibes el Rauteinot's parcel.",
    ["Trade the Engraved Key to Vamorcote to complete the quest and receive 10,000 gil."] = "Entrega la Engraved Key a Vamorcote para completar la quest y recibir 10,000 gil.",
    ["Trade the Faded Crystal to the ??? to spawn the Chaos Elemental, a Light Elemental that resists all physical damage (a level 40 party of six can handle it). If several people are doing the quest, wait 3 minutes after it dies to spawn it again."] = "Entrega el Faded Crystal a la ??? para hacer aparecer al Chaos Elemental, un Light Elemental que resiste todo el daño físico (un grupo de seis de nivel 40 puede con él). Si varias personas hacen la quest, espera 3 minutos tras su muerte para volver a hacerlo aparecer.",
    ["Trade the Fish Bait to the ??? at (E-8) to pop Isonade, a fish NM with approximately 6,100 HP."] = "Entrega el Fish Bait a la ??? de (E-8) para invocar a Isonade, un NM pez con unos 6,100 de HP.",
    ["Trade the Flame Degen to Radeivepart to complete the quest and receive the Map of Castle Zvahl."] = "Entrega la Flame Degen a Radeivepart para completar la quest y recibir el Map of Castle Zvahl.",
    ["Trade the Flint Stone x4 to Aquillina to complete the quest and receive 100 gil. The page notes that the quest can be repeated but has a restriction of 15 Earth minutes that applies to everyone, so if another player completed it recently it will not be available."] = "Entrega la Flint Stone x4 a Aquillina para completar la quest y recibir 100 gil. La página indica que la quest se puede repetir pero tiene una restricción de 15 minutos terrestres que se aplica a todos, así que si otro jugador la completó hace poco no estará disponible.",
    ["Trade the Galkan Sausage to Hungry Wolf to complete the quest and receive 300 gil."] = "Entrega el Galkan Sausage a Hungry Wolf para completar la quest y recibir 300 gil.",
    ["Trade the Garnet to the Cermet Headstone in Yuhtunga Jungle (L-7) at any time during or after Zilart Mission 5 to receive an Opo-opo Necklace and the title Friend of the Opo-opos."] = "Entrega la Garnet al Cermet Headstone de Yuhtunga Jungle (L-7) en cualquier momento durante o después de la Zilart Mission 5 para recibir un Opo-opo Necklace y el título Friend of the Opo-opos.",
    ["Trade the Giant Scale to Unstable Displacement (G-8)."] = "Entrega la Giant Scale al Unstable Displacement (G-8).",
    ["Trade the Giant Sheep Meat to the campfire to begin cooking it, then wait one minute (Earth time). Do not zone out, or you will have to repeat the steps."] = "Entrega la Giant Sheep Meat a la campfire para empezar a cocinarla, y espera un minuto (tiempo terrestre). No salgas de la zona, o tendrás que repetir los pasos.",
    ["Trade the Glittersand to Perchond, who gives you the temporary key item Perchond's envelope and explains that a merchant in Jugner Forest has also seen the creature, and that Semih Lafihna is probably there."] = "Entrega la Glittersand a Perchond, que te da el key item temporal Perchond's envelope y te explica que un mercader de Jugner Forest también ha visto a la criatura, y que Semih Lafihna probablemente esté allí.",
    ["Trade the Gold Earring to Koh Lenbalalako for a second cutscene and the key item Koh's letter."] = "Entrega el Gold Earring a Koh Lenbalalako para una segunda escena y el key item Koh's letter.",
    ["Trade the Goobbue Humus to the lone Mandragora Warden in the hidden area of The Boyahda Tree Map 1 (F-4) (not the pair) for a cutscene and the key item Letter from Zonpa-Zippa."] = "Entrega el Goobbue Humus al Mandragora Warden solitario de la zona oculta del mapa 1 de The Boyahda Tree (F-4) (no a la pareja) para una escena y el key item Letter from Zonpa-Zippa.",
    ["Trade the Gun of Trials back to Cid for the key item Map to the Annals of Truth, which sends you to The Boyahda Tree."] = "Devuelve la Gun of Trials a Cid para obtener el key item Map to the Annals of Truth, que te envía a The Boyahda Tree.",
    ["Trade the Hare Meat to the ??? at the pond to spawn Blind Moby, a Pugil NM. If the NM Smothered Schmidt is up (it can spawn at 0:00, 1:00 or 2:00 when the siren sounds), wait for it to leave first."] = "Entrega la Hare Meat a la ??? del estanque para hacer aparecer a Blind Moby, un NM Pugil. Si el NM Smothered Schmidt está fuera (puede aparecer a las 0:00, 1:00 o 2:00 cuando suena la sirena), espera a que se vaya primero.",
    ["Trade the Holy Water to the sarcophagus that spawns three skeleton NMs (which one is random): Yum Kimil (BLM, around level 60-65), Dog Guardian and Owl Guardian (around level 50-55). They resist Lullaby, but Repose works on the Guardians."] = "Entrega el Holy Water al sarcófago que hace aparecer tres NMs esqueleto (cuál es, es aleatorio): Yum Kimil (BLM, hacia nivel 60-65), Dog Guardian y Owl Guardian (hacia nivel 50-55). Resisten Lullaby, pero Repose funciona con los Guardians.",
    ["Trade the Honey to Zayhi-Bauhi, the speaker by the bridge to Heavens Tower, then speak with Kalupa-Tawalupa and Rutango-Botango."] = "Entrega la Honey a Zayhi-Bauhi, el orador junto al puente a Heavens Tower, y luego habla con Kalupa-Tawalupa y Rutango-Botango.",
    ["Trade the Honey x5 to Raimbroy to complete the quest and receive 400 gil."] = "Entrega la Honey x5 a Raimbroy para completar la quest y recibir 400 gil.",
    ["Trade the Ice Pendulum to the Protocrystal to enter the battlefield and defeat six Dryads. They share hate, so a low-level Summoner may struggle solo; Trusts are allowed."] = "Entrega el Ice Pendulum al Protocrystal para entrar en el campo de batalla y derrota a seis Dryads. Comparten el odio, así que un Summoner de nivel bajo puede tener problemas en solitario; se permiten Trusts.",
    ["Trade the Kaiser Sword to Imasuke to complete the quest and receive the Map of Delkfutt's Tower."] = "Entrega la Kaiser Sword a Imasuke para completar la quest y recibir el Map of Delkfutt's Tower.",
    ["Trade the Knuckles of Trials back to Oggbi for the key item Map to the Annals of Truth, which sends you to Bostaunieux Oubliette."] = "Devuelve los Knuckles of Trials a Oggbi para obtener el key item Map to the Annals of Truth, que te envía a Bostaunieux Oubliette.",
    ["Trade the Kodachi of Trials back to Ryoma for the key item Map to the Annals of Truth, which sends you to the Labyrinth of Onzozo (the Survival Guide is fastest)."] = "Devuelve la Kodachi of Trials a Ryoma para obtener el key item Map to the Annals of Truth, que te envía a Labyrinth of Onzozo (la Survival Guide es lo más rápido).",
    ["Trade the Lightning Pendulum to the Lightning Protocrystal in the Cloister of Storms for a cutscene and a battlefield. Reach it through The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah (K-12) into The Boyahda Tree (Home Point #1 is closest): go upstairs at (B-7), then to (J-12) on the next map."] = "Entrega el Lightning Pendulum al Lightning Protocrystal del Cloister of Storms para una escena y un campo de batalla. Llega por The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah (K-12) hasta The Boyahda Tree (el Home Point #1 es el más cercano): sube las escaleras de (B-7) y luego ve a (J-12) en el mapa siguiente.",
    ["Trade the Lilac to Ojha Rhawash to complete the quest."] = "Entrega el Lilac a Ojha Rhawash para completar la quest.",
    ["Trade the Lilac to Weathered Gravestone (I-10)."] = "Entrega el Lilac a la Weathered Gravestone (I-10).",
    ["Trade the Lilac to the Weathered Gravestone for a cutscene and the Tiny Memory Fragment, or the Large memory fragment if this is the last of the three."] = "Entrega el Lilac a la Weathered Gravestone para una escena y el Tiny Memory Fragment, o el Large memory fragment si es el último de los tres.",
    ["Trade the Lizard Egg to Alois (J-8)."] = "Entrega el Lizard Egg a Alois (J-8).",
    ["Trade the Lufet Salt x3 to Nogelle to complete the quest and receive 600 gil."] = "Entrega la Lufet Salt x3 a Nogelle para completar la quest y recibir 600 gil.",
    ["Trade the Luminicloth, the Revival Tree Root and the Wolf Hide to Kopuro-Popuro to complete the quest and receive 700 gil and Scentless Armlets."] = "Entrega la Luminicloth, la Revival Tree Root y la Wolf Hide a Kopuro-Popuro para completar la quest y recibir 700 gil y Scentless Armlets.",
    ["Trade the Marguerite to Kuu Mohzolhi to complete the quest."] = "Entrega la Marguerite a Kuu Mohzolhi para completar la quest.",
    ["Trade the Mary's Milk to Paouala to complete the quest and receive 5,000 gil."] = "Entrega el Mary's Milk a Paouala para completar la quest y recibir 5,000 gil.",
    ["Trade the Meat Jerky to Tami for your reward, a Rabbit Mantle. The quest is then complete and no longer repeatable."] = "Entrega el Meat Jerky a Tami por tu recompensa, un Rabbit Mantle. La quest queda completa y ya no se puede repetir.",
    ["Trade the Meteorite to Koru-Moru to complete the quest and receive your reward."] = "Entrega el Meteorite a Koru-Moru para completar la quest y recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Trade the Miner's Pendant to Oggbi to receive the Beat Cesti."] = "Entrega el Miner's Pendant a Oggbi para recibir el Beat Cesti.",
    ["Trade the Moblin Hotrok to the ??? to complete the quest."] = "Entrega el Moblin Hotrok a la ??? para completar la quest.",
    ["Trade the Moogle the items he asks for: a Power Bow and a Beetle Ring. The Power Bow can be bought from a Records of Eminence NPC using Sparks (equip level 10 to 19). The Beetle Ring +1 does not count."] = "Entrega al Moogle los objetos que pide: un Power Bow y un Beetle Ring. El Power Bow se puede comprar a un NPC de Records of Eminence con Sparks (nivel de equipo 10 a 19). El Beetle Ring +1 no cuenta.",
    ["Trade the Muddy Siredon to Lourdaude, the Tonberry standing beside Anguenet. He asks for 100 gil."] = "Entrega el Muddy Siredon a Lourdaude, el Tonberry que está junto a Anguenet. Te pide 100 gil.",
    ["Trade the Mythril Sallet to Detzo to complete the quest and receive your reward. The sallet is returned to you, so make sure you have space in your inventory."] = "Entrega el Mythril Sallet a Detzo para completar la quest y recibir tu recompensa. El sallet te lo devuelven, así que asegúrate de tener espacio en el inventario.",
    ["Trade the Nashmau Stew to Kyokyoroon back in Nashmau (H-7)."] = "Entrega el Nashmau Stew a Kyokyoroon de vuelta en Nashmau (H-7).",
    ["Trade the Odontotyrannus to Zaldon, inside the Fisherman's Guild in Selbina (H-9), to receive the Knight's boots."] = "Entrega el Odontotyrannus a Zaldon, dentro del Fisherman's Guild de Selbina (H-9), para recibir las Knight's boots.",
    ["Trade the Ointment to Aaveleon, who gives you back an Ointment Case."] = "Entrega el Ointment a Aaveleon, que te devuelve un Ointment Case.",
    ["Trade the Old Earring to Perih Vashai for a cutscene and the Hunter's Beret."] = "Entrega el Old Earring a Perih Vashai para una escena y el Hunter's Beret.",
    ["Trade the Opal Silk and the Saber Shoot to Irmilant."] = "Entrega el Opal Silk y el Saber Shoot a Irmilant.",
    ["Trade the Orcish Axe to any Gate Guard in San d'Oria: Ambrotien (Southern San d'Oria K-10), Endracion (Southern San d'Oria F-9) or Grilau (Northern San d'Oria D-8)."] = "Entrega el Orcish Axe a cualquier Gate Guard de San d'Oria: Ambrotien (Southern San d'Oria K-10), Endracion (Southern San d'Oria F-9) o Grilau (Northern San d'Oria D-8).",
    ["Trade the Orcish Mail Scales to any Gate Guard in San d'Oria: Ambrotien (Southern San d'Oria K-10), Endracion (Southern San d'Oria F-9) or Grilau (Northern San d'Oria D-8)."] = "Entrega las Orcish Mail Scales a cualquier Gate Guard de San d'Oria: Ambrotien (Southern San d'Oria K-10), Endracion (Southern San d'Oria F-9) o Grilau (Northern San d'Oria D-8).",
    ["Trade the Ordrynite to Raibaht to complete the quest."] = "Entrega el Ordrynite a Raibaht para completar la quest.",
    ["Trade the Parchment and the Black Ink to Ahkk Jharcham. The reward is the ability to exit your Mog House to any zone within the city of Aht Urhgan."] = "Entrega el Parchment y la Black Ink a Ahkk Jharcham. La recompensa es poder salir de tu Mog House a cualquier zona dentro de la ciudad de Aht Urhgan.",
    ["Trade the Parchment to the Song Runes for a Poetic Parchment, which completes the quest."] = "Entrega el Parchment a las Song Runes para obtener un Poetic Parchment, lo que completa la quest.",
    ["Trade the Philosopher's Stone to Fey Blossoms (F-5) at Witchfire Glen in Grauberg (S). With the Lightsworm, a blue ??? by any Cavernous Maw (the Batallia Downs Survival Guide is next to one) and the centre Conflux in the Walk of Echoes take you there; otherwise use the Grauberg (S) Survival Guide or Campaign warp and run north-west."] = "Entrega la Philosopher's Stone a las Fey Blossoms (F-5) de Witchfire Glen en Grauberg (S). Con el Lightsworm, una ??? azul junto a cualquier Cavernous Maw (la Survival Guide de Batallia Downs está al lado de uno) y la Conflux central del Walk of Echoes te llevan allí; si no, usa la Survival Guide de Grauberg (S) o el warp de Campaign y corre al noroeste.",
    ["Trade the Pick of Trials back to Brutus."] = "Entrega el Pick of Trials de vuelta a Brutus.",
    ["Trade the Pole of Trials back to Shantotto. You are instructed to travel to Ifrit's Cauldron."] = "Entrega la Pole of Trials de vuelta a Shantotto. Te indican viajar a Ifrit's Cauldron.",
    ["Trade the Punch Bug to Veridical Conflux (F-5) in Grauberg [S] (F-5) for a cutscene and the key item Bottled punch bug."] = "Entrega el Punch Bug a la Veridical Conflux (F-5) de Grauberg [S] (F-5) para una escena y el key item Bottled punch bug.",
    ["Trade the Pup. Testimony to Shamarhaan to initiate the Navukgo Execution Chamber battlefield; you are warped there. Just like the Maat fight, you have to fight Shamarhaan to break the level cap limit."] = "Entrega el Pup. Testimony a Shamarhaan para iniciar el campo de batalla Navukgo Execution Chamber; te teletransportan allí. Igual que en el combate contra Maat, tienes que luchar contra Shamarhaan para romper el límite de nivel.",
    ["Trade the Purple Ribbon to the Hume Bones to spawn the NM Lich C Magnus, which can drop the level 50 club Lilith's Rod."] = "Entrega la Purple Ribbon a los Hume Bones para hacer aparecer al NM Lich C Magnus, que puede soltar la maza de nivel 50 Lilith's Rod.",
    ["Trade the Quadav Mage Blood to the ??? to spawn Gerwitz's Scythe and two Scythe Victims. Only Gerwitz's Scythe has to die, but the other two are weak and quicker to kill than to sleep."] = "Entrega la Quadav Mage Blood a la ??? para hacer aparecer a Gerwitz's Scythe y dos Scythe Victims. Solo hay que matar a Gerwitz's Scythe, pero los otros dos son débiles y se matan antes de lo que se tarda en dormirlos.",
    ["Trade the Rain Lily to the Cermet Headstone in Cape Teriggan (H-5) to receive a Flagellant's Rope and the title Bearer of Bonds Beyond Time."] = "Entrega la Rain Lily al Cermet Headstone de Cape Teriggan (H-5) para recibir una Flagellant's Rope y el título Bearer of Bonds Beyond Time.",
    ["Trade the Rarab Tail to Kohlo-Lakolo for a cutscene and your reward, which completes the quest."] = "Entrega la Rarab Tail a Kohlo-Lakolo para una escena y tu recompensa, que completa la quest.",
    ["Trade the Red Oven Mitt to Leonhardt for a brief cutscene."] = "Entrega la Red Oven Mitt a Leonhardt para una breve escena.",
    ["Trade the Rhinostery Canteen to the Giddeus Spring at (K-12) or (E-12) in Giddeus to receive a Canteen of Giddeus water."] = "Entrega la Rhinostery Canteen al Giddeus Spring en (K-12) o (E-12) de Giddeus para recibir una Canteen of Giddeus water.",
    ["Trade the Rolanberry 874 to Hilda to receive the Unfinished letter."] = "Entrega el Rolanberry 874 a Hilda para recibir la Unfinished letter.",
    ["Trade the Rose Wand, the Oak Staff and the Mythril Rod to Hakkuru-Rinkuru for the cutscene that completes the quest. Two of the items are returned to you at the end, together with your reward and a new title."] = "Entrega la Rose Wand, el Oak Staff y la Mythril Rod a Hakkuru-Rinkuru para la escena que completa la quest. Dos de los objetos te los devuelven al final, junto con tu recompensa y un nuevo título.",
    ["Trade the Royal Jelly to Maysoon in Windurst Waters (E-9) to complete the quest and receive the key item Super soup pot."] = "Entrega la Royal Jelly a Maysoon en Windurst Waters (E-9) para completar la quest y recibir el key item Super soup pot.",
    ["Trade the Rusty Key to the Iron Door at (K-9) on the second map."] = "Entrega la Rusty Key a la Iron Door en (K-9) del segundo mapa.",
    ["Trade the Sand Charm to Celestina to complete the quest and receive the Map of Bostaunieux Oubliette."] = "Entrega la Sand Charm a Celestina para completar la quest y recibir el Map of Bostaunieux Oubliette.",
    ["Trade the Sapara of Trials back to Curilla for the Map to the Annals of Truth, which sends you to Quicksand Caves."] = "Devuelve la Sapara of Trials a Curilla para obtener el Map to the Annals of Truth, que te envía a Quicksand Caves.",
    ["Trade the Saruta Cotton x4 to Chamama, then return to Kohlo-Lakolo for a cutscene to complete the quest and receive a Heko Obi."] = "Entrega la Saruta Cotton x4 a Chamama y luego vuelve con Kohlo-Lakolo para una escena que completa la quest y recibir un Heko Obi.",
    ["Trade the Scorpion Stinger to Soni-Muni to complete the quest and receive 1,500 gil."] = "Entrega el Scorpion Stinger a Soni-Muni para completar la quest y recibir 1,500 gil.",
    ["Trade the Scythe of Trials back to Novalmauge for the key item Map to the Annals of Truth, which sends you to the Den of Rancor."] = "Devuelve la Scythe of Trials a Novalmauge para obtener el key item Map to the Annals of Truth, que te envía a Den of Rancor.",
    ["Trade the Sharp Stone to Varun to complete the quest and receive 2,100 gil."] = "Entrega la Sharp Stone a Varun para completar la quest y recibir 2,100 gil.",
    ["Trade the Shelling Piece to Ropunono to complete the quest and receive 4,800 gil."] = "Entrega la Shelling Piece a Ropunono para completar la quest y recibir 4,800 gil.",
    ["Trade the Silver Name Tag to Pavvke for your reward, 550 gil."] = "Entrega la Silver Name Tag a Pavvke para recibir tu recompensa, 550 gil.",
    ["Trade the Slime Oil and the Frost Turnip to Hariga-Origa at the same time to complete the quest and receive your reward."] = "Entrega el Slime Oil y el Frost Turnip a Hariga-Origa a la vez para completar la quest y recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Trade the Smooth Stone to Chamama."] = "Entrega la Smooth Stone a Chamama.",
    ["Trade the Spear of Trials back to Balasiel for the key item Map to the Annals of Truth, which sends you to Sea Serpent Grotto. You, or someone in your party, need a Sahagin Key."] = "Devuelve la Spear of Trials a Balasiel para obtener el key item Map to the Annals of Truth, que te envía a Sea Serpent Grotto. Tú, o alguien de tu grupo, necesitáis una Sahagin Key.",
    ["Trade the Sword of Trials back to Gumbah for the key item Map to the Annals of Truth."] = "Devuelve la Sword of Trials a Gumbah para obtener el key item Map to the Annals of Truth.",
    ["Trade the Tachi of Trials back to Jaucribaix for the key item Map to the Annals of Truth, which sends you to Kuftal Tunnel."] = "Devuelve la Tachi of Trials a Jaucribaix para obtener el key item Map to the Annals of Truth, que te envía a Kuftal Tunnel.",
    ["Trade the Tavnazia Bell to the ??? at (G-8) on Map 1, just west of the big fountain, to spawn Altedour I Tavnazia. Older maps show it near Home Point #1, but it has moved."] = "Entrega la Tavnazia Bell a la ??? en (G-8) del mapa 1, justo al oeste de la gran fuente, para hacer aparecer a Altedour I Tavnazia. Los mapas antiguos la sitúan cerca del Home Point #1, pero se ha movido.",
    ["Trade the Tavnazian Mask to Narcheral in the Cathedral, upstairs in Northern San d'Oria (M-6), to receive your reward."] = "Entrega la Tavnazian Mask a Narcheral en la Cathedral, arriba en Northern San d'Oria (M-6), para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Trade the Test Answers to Fuepepe, who tells you to take them to Koru-Moru in Windurst Walls."] = "Entrega los Test Answers a Fuepepe, que te dice que se los lleves a Koru-Moru en Windurst Walls.",
    ["Trade the Test Answers to Koru-Moru in Windurst Walls (E-7), not Yoran-Oran, for a Tattered test sheet."] = "Entrega los Test Answers a Koru-Moru en Windurst Walls (E-7), no a Yoran-Oran, para obtener una Tattered test sheet.",
    ["Trade the Testimony to the Burning Circle to enter a one-on-one battle against Maat. The time limit is 10 minutes, and after about 5 minutes from engaging Maat, he begins to use Asuran Fists. Maat has all the relevant abilities and spells of your main job."] = "Entrega el Testimony al Burning Circle para entrar en una batalla uno contra uno contra Maat. El límite de tiempo es de 10 minutos, y tras unos 5 minutos desde que te enfrentas a Maat, empieza a usar Asuran Fists. Maat tiene todas las habilidades y hechizos relevantes de tu trabajo principal.",
    ["Trade the Two-Leaf Mandragora Bud, the Insect Wing and the Rabbit Hide to Kopuro-Popuro to complete the quest and receive 200 gil."] = "Entrega el Two-Leaf Mandragora Bud, el Insect Wing y la Rabbit Hide a Kopuro-Popuro para completar la quest y recibir 200 gil.",
    ["Trade the Watermelon to the Mandragora Warden (F-4) for the final cutscene and your reward."] = "Entrega el Watermelon al Mandragora Warden (F-4) para la última escena y tu recompensa.",
    ["Trade the Well Water to the tombstone to receive a Tomb Waterskin."] = "Entrega el Well Water a la tombstone para recibir un Tomb Waterskin.",
    ["Trade the Well Weight to the Village Well for a cutscene and the key item Knight's confession."] = "Entrega el Well Weight al Village Well para una escena y el key item Knight's confession.",
    ["Trade the White Rolanberry or Ripe White Rolanberry to Kupipi for a cutscene."] = "Entrega la White Rolanberry o la Ripe White Rolanberry a Kupipi para una escena.",
    ["Trade the Wild Pamamas to the Altar. The NPC mentions needing to shout your name, but that is not necessary."] = "Entrega la Wild Pamamas al Altar. El NPC menciona que hay que gritar tu nombre, pero no es necesario.",
    ["Trade the Wind Pendulum to the Wind Protocrystal in the Cloister of Gales for a cutscene and a battlefield. Get there through Western Altepa Desert (H-4) into Kuftal Tunnel, reach A on the first map, then go all the way north to Cape Teriggan; the Cloister is at (F-5)."] = "Entrega el Wind Pendulum al Wind Protocrystal del Cloister of Gales para una escena y un campo de batalla. Llega por Western Altepa Desert (H-4) hasta Kuftal Tunnel, alcanza A en el primer mapa y sigue todo al norte hasta Cape Teriggan; el Cloister está en (F-5).",
    ["Trade the Yagudo Necklace x4 to Nanaa Mihgo to complete the quest and receive 200 gil."] = "Entrega el Yagudo Necklace x4 a Nanaa Mihgo para completar la quest y recibir 200 gil.",
    ["Trade the Zinc Ore to Talib."] = "Entrega el Zinc Ore a Talib.",
    ["Trade the Zinc Ore x4 to Talib to complete the quest and receive 350 gil. You do not have to zone to repeat it."] = "Entrega el Zinc Ore x4 a Talib para completar la quest y recibir 350 gil. No tienes que cambiar de zona para repetirla.",
    ["Trade the aged Rolanberries to Vuntar: Rolanberry 881 pays 800 gil, 874 pays 2,000 gil and 864 pays 3,000 gil (Rolanberry 854 and the white or withered berries aren't accepted). You can repeat the quest."] = "Entrega las Rolanberries envejecidas a Vuntar: la Rolanberry 881 paga 800 gil, la 874 paga 2,000 gil y la 864 paga 3,000 gil (la Rolanberry 854 y las bayas blancas o marchitas no se aceptan). Puedes repetir la quest.",
    ["Trade the egg to one of the VCS Trainers located in Bastok Mines, Southern San d'Oria or Windurst Woods to begin raising a chocobo."] = "Entrega el huevo a uno de los VCS Trainers de Bastok Mines, Southern San d'Oria o Windurst Woods para empezar a criar un chocobo.",
    ["Trade the food Iroha asked for to the ??? next to Undulating Confluence (G-5). All three are sold by Curio Vendor Moogles:"] = "Entrega la comida que pidió Iroha a la ??? junto a la Undulating Confluence (G-5). Las tres las venden los Curio Vendor Moogles:",
    ["Trade the fork to the Earth Protocrystal to enter the fighting arena."] = "Entrega el fork al Earth Protocrystal para entrar en la arena de combate.",
    ["Trade the fork to the Fire Protocrystal to enter the fighting arena."] = "Entrega el fork al Fire Protocrystal para entrar en la arena de combate.",
    ["Trade the fork to the Ice Protocrystal to enter the fighting arena."] = "Entrega el fork al Ice Protocrystal para entrar en la arena de combate.",
    ["Trade the fork to the Lightning Protocrystal to enter the fighting arena."] = "Entrega el fork al Lightning Protocrystal para entrar en la arena de combate.",
    ["Trade the fork to the Water Protocrystal to enter the fighting arena."] = "Entrega el fork al Water Protocrystal para entrar en la arena de combate.",
    ["Trade the fork to the Wind Protocrystal to enter the fighting arena."] = "Entrega el fork al Wind Protocrystal para entrar en la arena de combate.",
    ["Trade the item to any of the Suspicious NPCs: the Suspicious Tarutaru in Port Windurst (M-4) near Home Point #3, the Suspicious Elvaan in Northern San d'Oria (L-8) near Home Point #3, or the Suspicious Galka in Port Bastok (K-12) near Home Point #2. After a short cutscene you receive the Ring of Supernal Disjunction."] = "Entrega el objeto a cualquiera de los NPCs Suspicious: el Suspicious Tarutaru en Port Windurst (M-4) cerca del Home Point #3, el Suspicious Elvaan en Northern San d'Oria (L-8) cerca del Home Point #3, o el Suspicious Galka en Port Bastok (K-12) cerca del Home Point #2. Tras una escena corta recibes el Ring of Supernal Disjunction.",
    ["Trade the items to Maat to complete the quest, which raises your level cap to 55."] = "Entrega los objetos a Maat para completar la quest, que sube tu límite de nivel a 55.",
    ["Trade the items to Shantotto to complete the quest and receive a Misery Staff."] = "Entrega los objetos a Shantotto para completar la quest y recibir un Misery Staff.",
    ["Trade the kit to Trodden Snow (H-7) on Qufim Island (H-7) for a cutscene."] = "Entrega el kit a Trodden Snow (H-7) en Qufim Island (H-7) para una escena.",
    ["Trade the logs to Ramua for your reward. She also returns the logs to you."] = "Entrega los troncos a Ramua para recibir tu recompensa. También te devuelve los troncos.",
    ["Trade the requested item(s) to the Port Storage door at (J-4) on the Western Adoulin Waterfront for a cutscene with Guilberien."] = "Entrega lo que pida a la puerta del Port Storage en (J-4) del Waterfront de Western Adoulin para una escena con Guilberien.",
    ["Trade the root to Balasiel to complete the quest and receive your reward."] = "Entrega la raíz a Balasiel para completar la quest y recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Trade the same testimony to the Ornamental Door to initiate a battle against Raubahn. If you have the key item Rhapsody in Umber, you can summon Trust Magic to aid you. If the attempt fails, return to the Imperial Whitegate with a usable testimony and trade it again."] = "Entrega el mismo testimonio a la Ornamental Door para iniciar una batalla contra Raubahn. Si tienes el key item Rhapsody in Umber, puedes invocar Trust Magic para que te ayude. Si el intento falla, vuelve a la Imperial Whitegate con un testimonio utilizable y entrégalo de nuevo.",
    ["Trade the second Giant Scale to Unstable Displacement (E-10)."] = "Entrega la segunda Giant Scale al Unstable Displacement (E-10).",
    ["Trade the six Fat Worm Meat to Hedrov (H-7) for a cutscene and your reward."] = "Entrega los seis Fat Worm Meat a Hedrov (H-7) para una escena y tu recompensa.",
    ["Trade the testimony to the Imperial Whitegate (L-8) and you are teleported to Jade Sepulcher."] = "Entrega el testimonio a la Imperial Whitegate (L-8) y te teletransportan a Jade Sepulcher.",
    ["Trade the three Soul Plates to Andrause (I-8) one at a time for the Black book."] = "Entrega las tres Soul Plates a Andrause (I-8) de una en una para obtener el Black book.",
    ["Trade these items in this exact order; a wrong order resets all progress (you then need to trade each item again, but they don't take it a second time): Lulupp (G-7) a Broken Mithran Rod (Auction House, or break a Mithran Fishing Rod from Babubu in Port Windurst (C-8) on something too heavy); Kukupp (I-11) a Workbench (Woodworking 7 or Auction House); Mumupp (J-9) a Ten of Coins (Ten of Coins monster, Outer Horutoto Ruins, same place as The Kind Cardian)."] = "Entrega estos objetos en este orden exacto; un orden equivocado reinicia todo el progreso (tendrás que volver a entregar cada objeto, pero no se lo quedan una segunda vez): a Lulupp (G-7) una Broken Mithran Rod (Auction House, o rompe una Mithran Fishing Rod de Babubu en Port Windurst (C-8) con algo demasiado pesado); a Kukupp (I-11) un Workbench (Woodworking 7 o Auction House); a Mumupp (J-9) un Ten of Coins (monstruo Ten of Coins, Outer Horutoto Ruins, en el mismo sitio que The Kind Cardian).",
    ["Trade whichever brother you want to help Moat Carp and/or Forest Carp x10,000."] = "Entrega al hermano al que quieras ayudar Moat Carp y/o Forest Carp x10,000.",
    ["Trade your Moogle a Raptor Mantle and a Wool Hat."] = "Entrega a tu Moogle un Raptor Mantle y un Wool Hat.",
    ["Trade your Moogle a Shrimp Lure and Selbina Butter."] = "Entrega a tu Moogle un Shrimp Lure y Selbina Butter.",
    ["Trade your Yagudo Headgear to the Stone Lid for a cutscene; it is replaced by Tsoo's Headgear."] = "Entrega tu Yagudo Headgear a la Stone Lid para una escena; se sustituye por Tsoo's Headgear.",
    ["Travel back to Aht Urhgan Whitegate and speak with Iruki-Waraki for a cutscene."] = "Vuelve a Aht Urhgan Whitegate y habla con Iruki-Waraki para una escena.",
    ["Travel back to Southern San d'Oria and speak with Femitte to complete the quest."] = "Vuelve a Southern San d'Oria y habla con Femitte para completar la quest.",
    ["Travel east and use another Ratstail Explosive on explosive wall (I-9)."] = "Viaja al este y usa otro Ratstail Explosive en la explosive wall (I-9).",
    ["Travel east to Map 2 and examine Wooden Crates (H-9) to enter Ghoyu's Reverie; the party leader must perform this examination."] = "Viaja al este hasta el Map 2 y examina las Wooden Crates (H-9) para entrar en Ghoyu's Reverie; el líder del grupo debe hacer este examen.",
    ["Travel far from home"] = "Viaja lejos de casa",
    ["Travel through Giddeus to Balga's Dais and enter the Rank 2 Final Mission battlefield."] = "Atraviesa Giddeus hasta Balga's Dais y entra en el campo de batalla de la Rank 2 Final Mission.",
    ["Travel through Jugner Forest and enter Davoi from (G-12)."] = "Atraviesa Jugner Forest y entra en Davoi desde (G-12).",
    ["Travel through Palborough Mines, obtain Mine Gravel and turn it into Mythril Sand, then return to Savae E. Paleade (I-9)."] = "Atraviesa Palborough Mines, obtén Mine Gravel y conviértela en Mythril Sand, luego vuelve con Savae E. Paleade (I-9).",
    ["Travel through Riverne - Site #A01."] = "Viaja por Riverne - Site #A01.",
    ["Travel through Riverne - Site B01."] = "Viaja por Riverne - Site B01.",
    ["Travel through the tunnel in Valkurm Dunes (C-6) to the Secret Beach and examine the Song Runes (B-7) for a last cutscene."] = "Viaja por el túnel de Valkurm Dunes (C-6) hasta la Secret Beach y examina las Song Runes (B-7) para una última escena.",
    ["Travel to (H-8) in The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah to locate a ???, in the middle of the pool. The Survival Guide of The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah is the quickest way to get there."] = "Viaja a (H-8) en The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah para localizar una ???, en medio del estanque. La Survival Guide de The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah es la forma más rápida de llegar.",
    ["Travel to (I-10) in Xarcabard and examine the Perennial Snow at the end of the short tunnel. You must now wait one Earth minute before you can retrieve the ring."] = "Viaja a (I-10) en Xarcabard y examina la Perennial Snow al final del túnel corto. Ahora debes esperar un minuto terrestre antes de poder recuperar el anillo.",
    ["Travel to (I-6) of the basement map and touch the Cermet Door to pop 3 NMs: Orna, the boss, and 2 Fomorian Spear."] = "Viaja a (I-6) del mapa del sótano y toca la Cermet Door para invocar 3 NMs: Orna, el jefe, y 2 Fomorian Spear.",
    ["Travel to (I-7) in Yhoator Jungle. The quickest way is Survival Guide teleportation from Elshimo Uplands to Yhoator Jungle, with one east of Home Point #1 in Norg. The Unity warp (level 122) teleports you to (J-7)."] = "Viaja a (I-7) de Yhoator Jungle. La forma más rápida es el teletransporte de la Survival Guide de Elshimo Uplands a Yhoator Jungle, con una al este del Home Point #1 de Norg. El warp de Unity (nivel 122) te teletransporta a (J-7).",
    ["Travel to (J-9) in North Gustaberg and look for a ???. It appears randomly up and down the length of the river. Taking Port Bastok Home Point #1 to North Gustaberg is the quickest way to reach the river."] = "Viaja a (J-9) en North Gustaberg y busca una ???. Aparece al azar a lo largo del río. Tomar el Home Point #1 de Port Bastok hacia North Gustaberg es la forma más rápida de llegar al río.",
    ["Travel to (K-8) in La Theine Plateau, at the tail end wall of the Crag of Holla, and look for the NPC Faurbellant."] = "Viaja a (K-8) en La Theine Plateau, en la pared del extremo del Crag of Holla, y busca al NPC Faurbellant.",
    ["Travel to Aht Urhgan Whitegate."] = "Viaja a Aht Urhgan Whitegate.",
    ["Travel to Al'Taieu."] = "Viaja a Al'Taieu.",
    ["Travel to Alzadaal Undersea Ruins."] = "Viaja a Alzadaal Undersea Ruins.",
    ["Travel to Arrapago Reef by way of the (I-6) entrance from Caedarva Mire and open the first Iron Gate at (J-10) with the Lamian Fang Key."] = "Viaja a Arrapago Reef por la entrada (I-6) desde Caedarva Mire y abre la primera Iron Gate en (J-10) con la Lamian Fang Key.",
    ["Travel to Attohwa Chasm and examine the Loose Sand around (K-8), defeat Lioumere, then examine the Loose Sand again to obtain the Mimeo Jewel."] = "Viaja a Attohwa Chasm y examina la Loose Sand cerca de (K-8), derrota a Lioumere y luego examina de nuevo la Loose Sand para obtener el Mimeo Jewel.",
    ["Travel to Bastok Markets (S) and speak with young Offa. You are given two options, which lead to two different paths through the quest."] = "Viaja a Bastok Markets (S) y habla con el joven Offa. Te dan dos opciones, que llevan a dos caminos distintos por la quest.",
    ["Travel to Bastok Metalworks and speak with Cid (H-8)."] = "Viaja a Bastok Metalworks y habla con Cid (H-8).",
    ["Travel to Bastok Metalworks and speak with Cid (H-8). Complete the three paths in any order."] = "Viaja a Bastok Metalworks y habla con Cid (H-8). Completa los tres caminos en cualquier orden.",
    ["Travel to Bastok and speak with Patt-Pott (I-7)."] = "Viaja a Bastok y habla con Patt-Pott (I-7).",
    ["Travel to Bastok and speak with Savae E. Paleade (I-9), Pius (J-8), and Grohm (G-9)."] = "Viaja a Bastok y habla con Savae E. Paleade (I-9), Pius (J-8) y Grohm (G-9).",
    ["Travel to Bastok to continue with the second leg."] = "Viaja a Bastok para continuar con la segunda parte.",
    ["Travel to Batallia Downs (S) and enter The Eldieme Necropolis (S) via (J-10)."] = "Viaja a Batallia Downs (S) y entra en The Eldieme Necropolis (S) por (J-10).",
    ["Travel to Beadeaux as a Dark Knight of level 50 or higher, and zone in from Pashhow Marshlands (this is important) to receive a cutscene that starts the quest. The quest follows Dark Puppet. Easiest: the Beadeaux Survival Guide, exit to Pashhow Marshlands, then re-enter. The rest can be done on any job."] = "Viaja a Beadeaux como Dark Knight de nivel 50 o superior y entra desde Pashhow Marshlands (esto es importante) para recibir una escena que empieza la quest. La quest sigue a Dark Puppet. Lo más fácil: la Survival Guide de Beadeaux, salir a Pashhow Marshlands y volver a entrar. El resto puede hacerse con cualquier job.",
    ["Travel to Beadeaux, follow the left wall to (H-7), enter Qulun Dome, and obtain the magicite."] = "Viaja a Beadeaux, sigue la pared izquierda hasta (H-7), entra en Qulun Dome y obtén la magicite.",
    ["Travel to Beadeaux. Upon entry, proceed straight in, then turn left (north) when you reach the wall at (F-7). Go north to the wall in (F-6), then due east to (H-6)."] = "Viaja a Beadeaux. Al entrar, ve recto y luego gira a la izquierda (norte) al llegar a la pared en (F-7). Ve al norte hasta la pared en (F-6) y luego directo al este hasta (H-6).",
    ["Travel to Beaucedine Glacier (S) and examine Hoarfang (F-10) to complete the quest and receive the reward."] = "Viaja a Beaucedine Glacier (S) y examina Hoarfang (F-10) para completar la quest y recibir la recompensa.",
    ["Travel to Beaucedine Glacier and enter Fei'Yin at (J-4). On map A, go to (G-9) and down the stairs; in the basement (map B), go to (I-5) for the entrance to the Cloister of Frost. Fei'Yin Home Point #2 is best. Each party member must have their own Tuning fork of ice."] = "Viaja a Beaucedine Glacier y entra en Fei'Yin por (J-4). En el mapa A, ve a (G-9) y baja las escaleras; en el sótano (mapa B), ve a (I-5) para la entrada al Cloister of Frost. Lo mejor es el Home Point #2 de Fei'Yin. Cada miembro del grupo debe tener su propio Tuning fork of ice.",
    ["Travel to Behemoth's Dominion. Without the Survival Guide warp, the quickest way is through Qufim Island: follow the tunnel starting at (G-5) until you zone in."] = "Viaja a Behemoth's Dominion. Sin el warp de la Survival Guide, lo más rápido es pasar por Qufim Island: sigue el túnel que empieza en (G-5) hasta entrar en la zona.",
    ["Travel to Bhaflau Thickets through the northern exit from Aht Urhgan Whitegate at (H-7)."] = "Viaja a Bhaflau Thickets por la salida norte de Aht Urhgan Whitegate en (H-7).",
    ["Travel to Bibiki Bay, reach Purgonorgo Isle, and examine ??? Warmachine (H-11). Speak with Yoran-Oran at (E-5) in Windurst Walls for additional dialogue."] = "Viaja a Bibiki Bay, llega a Purgonorgo Isle y examina el ??? Warmachine (H-11). Habla con Yoran-Oran en (E-5) en Windurst Walls para diálogo adicional.",
    ["Travel to Cape Teriggan (F-5) to enter the Cloister of Gales and ring the tuning fork upon the protocrystal."] = "Viaja a Cape Teriggan (F-5) para entrar en la Cloister of Gales y hacer sonar el tuning fork sobre el protocrystal.",
    ["Travel to Carpenters' Landing through the (E-6) entrance from Jugner Forest and speak with Guilloud (H-10) to face Overgrown Ivy."] = "Viaja a Carpenters' Landing por la entrada (E-6) de Jugner Forest y habla con Guilloud (H-10) para enfrentarte a Overgrown Ivy.",
    ["Travel to Carpenters' Landing to obtain a Garhada Teak Lumber. It can be obtained from monsters that appear on the Phanauet Channel barge, or that spawn from fishing on the barge or on the Carpenters' Landing pier."] = "Viaja a Carpenters' Landing para obtener una Garhada Teak Lumber. Se puede obtener de monstruos que aparecen en la barcaza Phanauet Channel, o que surgen al pescar en la barcaza o en el muelle de Carpenters' Landing.",
    ["Travel to Castle Oztroja. You do not need the three passwords to enter the Altar Room."] = "Viaja a Castle Oztroja. No necesitas las tres contraseñas para entrar en la Altar Room.",
    ["Travel to Castle Zvahl Baileys, go to (F-8) on the first map and examine one of the torches to spawn Dark Spark."] = "Viaja a Castle Zvahl Baileys, ve a (F-8) en el primer mapa y examina una de las antorchas para hacer aparecer a Dark Spark.",
    ["Travel to Castle Zvahl Baileys, go to (F-8) on the first map and examine one of the torches to spawn Dark Spark. If Recollections is still unfinished, take it up to its Castle Zvahl Baileys part (the Whine Cellar Key) to save a trip."] = "Viaja a Castle Zvahl Baileys, ve a (F-8) en el primer mapa y examina una de las antorchas para hacer aparecer a Dark Spark. Si Recollections sigue sin terminar, avánzala hasta su parte de Castle Zvahl Baileys (la Whine Cellar Key) para ahorrarte un viaje.",
    ["Travel to Ceizak Battlegrounds."] = "Viaja a Ceizak Battlegrounds.",
    ["Travel to Cermet Grate in the Hall of the Gods between 18:00 and 05:00 (Vana'diel time) for a cutscene."] = "Viaja a la Cermet Grate de Hall of the Gods entre las 18:00 y las 05:00 (hora de Vana'diel) para una escena.",
    ["Travel to Cermet Grate in the Hall of the Gods between 18:00 and 05:00 (Vana'diel time) for a cutscene. Beneath a Blood-red Sky starts when it ends."] = "Viaja a la Cermet Grate de Hall of the Gods entre las 18:00 y las 05:00 (hora de Vana'diel) para una escena. Beneath a Blood-red Sky empieza cuando termina.",
    ["Travel to Cermet Grate in the Hall of the Gods between 18:00 and 05:00 (Vana'diel time) for a cutscene. Emissaries of God only starts once you have seen it."] = "Viaja a la Cermet Grate de Hall of the Gods entre las 18:00 y las 05:00 (hora de Vana'diel) para una escena. Emissaries of God solo empieza cuando la hayas visto.",
    ["Travel to Cermet Grate in the Hall of the Gods between 18:00 and 05:00 (Vana'diel time). Entering the Hall of the Gods from Ro'Maeve gives a cutscene with Gilgamesh."] = "Viaja a la Cermet Grate de Hall of the Gods entre las 18:00 y las 05:00 (hora de Vana'diel). Entrar en Hall of the Gods desde Ro'Maeve da una escena con Gilgamesh.",
    ["Travel to Chateau d'Oraguille and examine Prince's Royal Room (G/H-7)."] = "Viaja a Chateau d'Oraguille y examina la Prince's Royal Room (G/H-7).",
    ["Travel to Chateau d'Oraguille and examine the Great Hall."] = "Viaja a Chateau d'Oraguille y examina el Great Hall.",
    ["Travel to Chateau d'Oraguille and speak with Halver (I-9)."] = "Viaja al Chateau d'Oraguille y habla con Halver (I-9).",
    ["Travel to Chateau d'Oraguille and speak with Prince Trion in Prince's Royal Room (G/H-7)."] = "Viaja a Chateau d'Oraguille y habla con Prince Trion en la Prince's Royal Room (G/H-7).",
    ["Travel to Cid's Lab at (G-8) in Metalworks and speak with Cid (H-8)."] = "Viaja al Cid's Lab en (G-8) de Metalworks y habla con Cid (H-8).",
    ["Travel to Cid's Lab in Bastok Metalworks and speak with Cid (H-8)."] = "Viaja al Cid's Lab en Bastok Metalworks y habla con Cid (H-8).",
    ["Travel to Cirdas Caverns and go to the Ergon Locus at (E-9) for a cutscene. A Colonization Reive that needs the Logging survival skill blocks the way."] = "Viaja a Cirdas Caverns y ve al Ergon Locus de (E-9) para una escena. Una Colonization Reive que requiere la survival skill de Logging bloquea el camino.",
    ["Travel to Dangruf Wadi and head north from the entrance. The quickest method is the Survival Guide; otherwise zone in from South Gustaberg (D-9)."] = "Viaja a Dangruf Wadi y ve al norte desde la entrada. El método más rápido es la Survival Guide; si no, entra desde South Gustaberg (D-9).",
    ["Travel to Davoi and reach (G-7). Pass through the Wall of Dark Arts into Monastic Cavern and examine the Magicite at (F-6) to obtain the magicite."] = "Viaja a Davoi y llega a (G-7). Cruza el Wall of Dark Arts hacia el Monastic Cavern y examina la Magicite de (F-6) para obtener la magicita.",
    ["Travel to Durable Shields in Upper Jeuno and speak with Guslam at (H-8) as a Ninja of level 50 or higher to begin the quest. This quest requires the Rise of the Zilart pack and follows 20 in Pirate Years."] = "Viaja a Durable Shields en Upper Jeuno y habla con Guslam en (H-8) como Ninja de nivel 50 o superior para empezar la quest. Esta quest requiere el pack Rise of the Zilart y sigue a 20 in Pirate Years.",
    ["Travel to East Ronfaure."] = "Viaja a East Ronfaure.",
    ["Travel to East Sarutabaruta and enter Inner Horutoto Ruins through the eastern magic tower."] = "Viaja a East Sarutabaruta y entra en Inner Horutoto Ruins por la torre mágica del este.",
    ["Travel to Eastern Adoulin."] = "Viaja a Eastern Adoulin.",
    ["Travel to Eastern Altepa Desert and enter Quicksand Caves at (J-7), by the level 30+ beetle and Antica camp; you arrive on the first map at (L-4). Make your way to (E-10) to find the hidden entrance to the Cloister of Tremors, watching out for hidden falls and traps. Quicksand Caves Home Point #2 is best; the Unity Warp (level 125) is about a minute's run from it. Each party member must have their own Tuning fork of earth."] = "Viaja a Eastern Altepa Desert y entra en Quicksand Caves por (J-7), junto al escarabajo de nivel 30+ y el campamento de Antica; llegas al primer mapa en (L-4). Avanza hasta (E-10) para encontrar la entrada oculta al Cloister of Tremors, con cuidado con las caídas y trampas ocultas. Lo mejor es el Home Point #2 de Quicksand Caves; el Unity Warp (nivel 125) está a un minuto corriendo de él. Cada miembro del grupo debe tener su propio Tuning fork of earth.",
    ["Travel to Empyreal Paradox."] = "Viaja a Empyreal Paradox.",
    ["Travel to Fei'Yin (Home Point #1 if you have it). Zone into Qu'Bia Arena and back out for a cutscene and the key item Letter from Dalzakk."] = "Viaja a Fei'Yin (Home Point #1 si lo tienes). Entra en Qu'Bia Arena y vuelve a salir para una escena y el key item Letter from Dalzakk.",
    ["Travel to Fei'Yin and continue to battlefield entrance."] = "Viaja a Fei'Yin y continúa hasta la entrada del campo de batalla.",
    ["Travel to Fei'Yin and zone in for a cutscene. Warping to the Home Point also triggers it."] = "Viaja a Fei'Yin y entra en la zona para una escena. Teletransportarse al Home Point también la activa.",
    ["Travel to Foret de Hennetiel."] = "Viaja a Foret de Hennetiel.",
    ["Travel to Fort Karugo-Narugo (S) and reach the Phosphorous Ward at (I-9) on Map 1."] = "Viaja a Fort Karugo-Narugo (S) y llega a la Phosphorous Ward en (I-9) del Map 1.",
    ["Travel to Fort Karugo-Narugo (S) and speak with Rotih Moalghett on the Fivespires map (I-8), on the second-floor ledge east of the Spiritwell; reach Fivespires through the Cavalry Gate (F-8) or by touching the Phosphorous Ward at (I-9)."] = "Viaja a Fort Karugo-Narugo (S) y habla con Rotih Moalghett en el mapa de Fivespires (I-8), en la cornisa del segundo piso al este del Spiritwell; llega a Fivespires por la Cavalry Gate (F-8) o tocando la Phosphorous Ward de (I-9).",
    ["Travel to Ghelsba Outpost and defeat Warchief Vatgit at (H-7)."] = "Viaja a Ghelsba Outpost y derrota a Warchief Vatgit en (H-7).",
    ["Travel to Ghelsba Outpost and defeat Warchief Vatgit."] = "Viaja a Ghelsba Outpost y derrota a Warchief Vatgit.",
    ["Travel to Giddeus and complete the battle at Balga's Dais."] = "Viaja a Giddeus y completa la batalla en Balga's Dais.",
    ["Travel to Giddeus and defeat Eyy Mon the Ironbreaker at (G-7)."] = "Viaja a Giddeus y derrota a Eyy Mon the Ironbreaker en (G-7).",
    ["Travel to Giddeus and trade the Yagudo Cherry to the ??? at (H-14) to spawn the NM Vaa Huja the Erudite; clear the area first if you can."] = "Viaja a Giddeus y entrega la Yagudo Cherry a la ??? en (H-14) para hacer aparecer al NM Vaa Huja the Erudite; si puedes, despeja antes la zona.",
    ["Travel to Giddeus from West Sarutabaruta (F-8) (Home Point #1 puts you at (G-12)). Take every left turn from the Sarutabaruta entrance to Laa Mozi (H-7) at (H-7) and hand over the Food Offering."] = "Viaja a Giddeus desde West Sarutabaruta (F-8) (el Home Point #1 te deja en (G-12)). Toma todos los giros a la izquierda desde la entrada de Sarutabaruta hasta Laa Mozi (H-7) en (H-7) y entrégale la Food Offering.",
    ["Travel to Giddeus via West Sarutabaruta. You can't do this while The Dawn of Delectability is active; a Map of Giddeus helps."] = "Viaja a Giddeus por West Sarutabaruta. No puedes hacerlo mientras The Dawn of Delectability esté activa; un Map of Giddeus ayuda.",
    ["Travel to Grauberg (S) and examine ??? near Witchfire Glen (F-5/H-6 area) inside the cave; the entrance is on the border of (H/I-5/6) (the Survival Guide is fairly close)."] = "Viaja a Grauberg (S) y examina la ??? cerca de Witchfire Glen (zona de F-5/H-6) dentro de la cueva; la entrada está en el límite de (H/I-5/6) (la Survival Guide está bastante cerca).",
    ["Travel to Grauberg (S)."] = "Viaja a Grauberg (S).",
    ["Travel to Gusgen Mines from Konschtat Highlands. The fastest way is the Survival Guide, then Zulkheim, then Gusgen Mines."] = "Viaja a Gusgen Mines desde Konschtat Highlands. La forma más rápida es la Survival Guide, luego Zulkheim y luego Gusgen Mines.",
    ["Travel to Ifrit's Cauldron and examine three different Flame Spouts. Each one burns one of the vines, until only the vine from the most fire-resistant side is left. If a spout shows only bubbling lava, wait for the flame to rise again. Bombs guard the last spouts, so bring Sneak and Invisible (non-magic, or cast them well away from the bombs)."] = "Viaja a Ifrit's Cauldron y examina tres Flame Spouts distintos. Cada uno quema una de las lianas, hasta que solo queda la del lado más resistente al fuego. Si un surtidor solo muestra lava burbujeante, espera a que la llama vuelva a subir. Las bombas vigilan los últimos surtidores, así que lleva Sneak e Invisible (no mágicos, o lánzalos bien lejos de las bombas).",
    ["Travel to Jugner Forest (S) (H-10) and find ??? (H-10) at the foot of a watch platform. The Survival Guide is fastest; grab it and the Recall-Jugner key item if you don't have them, as other quests use them."] = "Viaja a Jugner Forest (S) (H-10) y busca la ??? (H-10) al pie de una plataforma de vigilancia. La Survival Guide es lo más rápido; consíguela, y el key item Recall-Jugner, si no los tienes, ya que otras quests los usan.",
    ["Travel to Jugner Forest (S) and examine the ??? on the tree stump at (I-6), east of the river, to obtain the Orcish Warmachine Body key item. The East Ronfaure (S) Survival Guide is the shortest way."] = "Viaja a Jugner Forest (S) y examina la ??? del tocón en (I-6), al este del río, para obtener el key item Orcish Warmachine Body. La Survival Guide de East Ronfaure (S) es el camino más corto.",
    ["Travel to Jugner Forest (S) via East Ronfaure (S)."] = "Viaja a Jugner Forest (S) por East Ronfaure (S).",
    ["Travel to Jugner Forest and click on the signposts along the dirt path to clean them: (E-11), (G-8), (H-7) and (J-5). From the La Theine Plateau Survival Guide, go east into Jugner Forest and follow the path."] = "Viaja a Jugner Forest y pulsa los postes indicadores a lo largo del camino de tierra para limpiarlos: (E-11), (G-8), (H-7) y (J-5). Desde la Survival Guide de La Theine Plateau, ve al este hacia Jugner Forest y sigue el camino.",
    ["Travel to Jugner Forest and log the five items on the checklist: Arrowwood Log, Ash Log, Yew Log, Willow Log and Walnut Log. Each one you log shows a message that data was recorded; you must log them yourself and cannot buy them from shops or the Auction House."] = "Viaja a Jugner Forest y registra los cinco objetos de la lista: Arrowwood Log, Ash Log, Yew Log, Willow Log y Walnut Log. Cada uno que registras muestra un mensaje de que se grabaron datos; debes registrarlos tú mismo y no puedes comprarlos en tiendas ni en la Auction House.",
    ["Travel to Kazham and speak with Romaa Mihgo (H-11) in Mihgo's Residence."] = "Viaja a Kazham y habla con Romaa Mihgo (H-11) en Mihgo's Residence.",
    ["Travel to Kazham."] = "Viaja a Kazham.",
    ["Travel to King Ranperre's Tomb and examine Heavy Stone Door (H-8)."] = "Viaja a King Ranperre's Tomb y examina la Heavy Stone Door (H-8).",
    ["Travel to King Ranperre's Tomb and make your way to Heavy Stone Door (H-8)."] = "Viaja a King Ranperre's Tomb y abre camino hasta la Heavy Stone Door (H-8).",
    ["Travel to Konschtat Highlands and inspect the signpost at the south edge of (G-4) and the north edge of (G-5). You receive a Painting of a windmill. Consider doing this together with the quest Past Perfect, since both click on a location in the Highlands."] = "Viaja a Konschtat Highlands e inspecciona el cartel en el borde sur de (G-4) y el borde norte de (G-5). Recibes un Painting of a windmill. Considera hacerlo junto con la quest Past Perfect, ya que ambas hacen clic en un lugar de las Highlands.",
    ["Travel to La Theine Plateau and enter Jugner Forest at (M-8), then follow the right side of Jugner Forest to Davoi at (G-12)."] = "Viaja a La Theine Plateau y entra en Jugner Forest en (M-8), luego sigue el lado derecho de Jugner Forest hasta Davoi en (G-12).",
    ["Travel to La Theine Plateau and speak with Galaihaurat (E-6)."] = "Viaja a La Theine Plateau y habla con Galaihaurat (E-6).",
    ["Travel to Lower Delkfutt's Tower and proceed to the basement. A Delkfutt Key (or the key item version) is required."] = "Viaja a Lower Delkfutt's Tower y ve al sótano. Se requiere una Delkfutt Key (o la versión key item).",
    ["Travel to Lower Jeuno and inspect the Street Lamp targets until you find a Hyper altimeter."] = "Viaja a Lower Jeuno e inspecciona los objetivos Street Lamp hasta encontrar un Hyper altimeter.",
    ["Travel to Lower Jeuno."] = "Viaja a Lower Jeuno.",
    ["Travel to Meriphataud Mountains (K-8) and trade the Wyvern Egg to the ??? near the base of Drogaroga's Spine for a cutscene. Quickest is the Survival Guide to Castle Oztroja: step outside and you're looking at the spine's base."] = "Viaja a Meriphataud Mountains (K-8) y entrega el Wyvern Egg a la ??? cerca de la base de Drogaroga's Spine para una escena. Lo más rápido es la Survival Guide de Castle Oztroja: sal fuera y verás la base de la espina.",
    ["Travel to Metalworks and speak with Raibaht at (G-8), in Cid's Lab. Make sure you receive a short dialog for this specific quest and not a cutscene for one of the several quests that involve Raibaht."] = "Viaja a Metalworks y habla con Raibaht en (G-8), en el Cid's Lab. Asegúrate de recibir un diálogo corto de esta quest y no una escena de una de las varias quests que involucran a Raibaht.",
    ["Travel to Mhaura and speak with Fyi Chalmwoh, who takes the key item and lets you pose your mannequins for 200 gil."] = "Viaja a Mhaura y habla con Fyi Chalmwoh, que se queda el key item y te deja posar tus maniquíes por 200 gil.",
    ["Travel to Misareaux Coast (G-5)."] = "Viaja a Misareaux Coast (G-5).",
    ["Travel to Misareaux Coast and examine Dilapidated Gate at (I-11)."] = "Viaja a Misareaux Coast y examina la Dilapidated Gate en (I-11).",
    ["Travel to Misareaux Coast and look for a ??? at (K-12). Checking the ??? spawns the NM Bloody Coffin."] = "Viaja a Misareaux Coast y busca una ??? en (K-12). Al revisar la ??? aparece el NM Bloody Coffin.",
    ["Travel to Misareaux Coast at (I-11)."] = "Viaja a Misareaux Coast en (I-11).",
    ["Travel to Misareaux Coast."] = "Viaja a Misareaux Coast.",
    ["Travel to Misareaux Coast: Home Point #1 in Tavnazian Safehold, then the southern exit (H-6), is fastest."] = "Viaja a Misareaux Coast: el Home Point #1 de Tavnazian Safehold y luego la salida sur (H-6) es lo más rápido.",
    ["Travel to Monarch Linn: the Riverne - Site #B01 Home Point and the Spatial Displacement are fastest. Without it you need 2 Giant Scales for Site #A01 or 1 for Site #B01 (exclusive drops from Firedrakes and Ignidrakes)."] = "Viaja a Monarch Linn: el Home Point de Riverne - Site #B01 y el Spatial Displacement son lo más rápido. Sin él necesitas 2 Giant Scales para el Site #A01 o 1 para el Site #B01 (drops exclusivos de Firedrakes e Ignidrakes).",
    ["Travel to Nashmau and speak with Jijiroon (H-8). You can pick any option again to proceed with this cutscene. Before you leave Nashmau, bring a good supply of Echo Drops for the NM fight."] = "Viaja a Nashmau y habla con Jijiroon (H-8). Puedes elegir cualquier opción de nuevo para avanzar esta escena. Antes de salir de Nashmau, lleva una buena reserva de Echo Drops para el combate contra el NM.",
    ["Travel to Nashmau and speak with Pyopyoroon (H-7)."] = "Viaja a Nashmau y habla con Pyopyoroon (H-7).",
    ["Travel to Norg and enter the Buccaneer's Quarters at (J-8). You need to be level 10 or higher with Norg fame level 4 and have the Rise of the Zilart pack."] = "Viaja a Norg y entra en el Buccaneer's Quarters en (J-8). Debes ser nivel 10 o superior con el nivel 4 de fama de Norg y tener el pack Rise of the Zilart.",
    ["Travel to Norg and examine the Oaken Door at (K-8), choosing \"Open the door\", for a cutscene with Lion and Gilgamesh. If another expansion's mission is active, make sure you pick this option."] = "Viaja a Norg y examina la Oaken Door de (K-8), eligiendo \"Open the door\", para una escena con Lion y Gilgamesh. Si hay activa una misión de otra expansión, asegúrate de elegir esta opción.",
    ["Travel to Norg and speak with Gilgamesh behind the Oaken Door at (K-8) until he mentions Frag Rocks."] = "Viaja a Norg y habla con Gilgamesh tras la Oaken Door de (K-8) hasta que mencione las Frag Rocks.",
    ["Travel to Norg and speak with Gilgamesh by examining the Oaken Door at (K-8)."] = "Viaja a Norg y habla con Gilgamesh examinando la Oaken Door de (K-8).",
    ["Travel to Norg and speak with Ryoma (H-8) to receive the quest. You need to be a Ninja of level 50 or higher, Outlands fame level 1 and the Rise of the Zilart pack; this quest follows 20 in Pirate Years. If you just completed 20 in Pirate Years, you need to zone and re-enter Norg for Ryoma to begin it. The trick box you brought back has been identified as a fake, and he needs help finding the real box."] = "Viaja a Norg y habla con Ryoma (H-8) para recibir la quest. Debes ser Ninja de nivel 50 o superior, tener el nivel 1 de fama de Outlands y el pack Rise of the Zilart; esta quest sigue a 20 in Pirate Years. Si acabas de completar 20 in Pirate Years, tienes que cambiar de zona y volver a entrar en Norg para que Ryoma la empiece. El trick box que trajiste se ha identificado como falso, y necesita ayuda para encontrar el verdadero.",
    ["Travel to Norg and speak with Ryoma at (H-8), who gives you the key item Sealed dagger."] = "Viaja a Norg y habla con Ryoma en (H-8), que te da el key item Sealed dagger.",
    ["Travel to Norg."] = "Viaja a Norg.",
    ["Travel to North Gustaberg (S) and examine Stonehoused Adit (E-9) at the top middle of (E-9) (Survival Guide or a Campaign Arbiter Allied Notes teleport)."] = "Viaja a North Gustaberg (S) y examina la Stonehoused Adit (E-9) en la parte central superior de (E-9) (Survival Guide o teletransporte del Campaign Arbiter con Allied Notes).",
    ["Travel to North Gustaberg (S), climb the first level of Zegham Hill from around (I-8), and speak with Gebhardt (I-6) at (I-6)."] = "Viaja a North Gustaberg (S), sube al primer nivel de Zegham Hill desde los alrededores de (I-8) y habla con Gebhardt (I-6) en (I-6).",
    ["Travel to Northern San d'Oria and enter the Papal Chambers on the third floor of the Cathedral."] = "Viaja a Northern San d'Oria y entra en las Papal Chambers del tercer piso de la Cathedral.",
    ["Travel to Northern San d'Oria and speak with Arnau (M-6) in the Cathedral."] = "Viaja a Northern San d'Oria y habla con Arnau (M-6) en la Cathedral.",
    ["Travel to Northern San d'Oria and speak with Baraka at the Bastokan Consulate."] = "Viaja a Northern San d'Oria y habla con Baraka en el Bastokan Consulate.",
    ["Travel to Northern San d'Oria and speak with Helaku at (K-10)."] = "Viaja a Northern San d'Oria y habla con Helaku en (K-10).",
    ["Travel to Northern San d'Oria and speak with Heruze-Moruze, then Helaku at (K-10)."] = "Viaja a Northern San d'Oria y habla con Heruze-Moruze, luego con Helaku en (K-10).",
    ["Travel to Northern San d'Oria and speak with Kasaroro at (H-9)."] = "Viaja a Northern San d'Oria y habla con Kasaroro en (H-9).",
    ["Travel to Northern San d'Oria to continue with the second leg."] = "Viaja a Northern San d'Oria para continuar con la segunda parte.",
    ["Travel to Oldton or Newton Movalpolos."] = "Viaja a Oldton o Newton Movalpolos.",
    ["Travel to Palborough Mines and enter Waughroon Shrine from the upper level at (H-10)."] = "Viaja a Palborough Mines y entra en Waughroon Shrine desde el nivel superior en (H-10).",
    ["Travel to Palborough Mines and go to the top floor (map 3). If you have not unlocked it yet and have completed the limit break quest Beyond Infinity, you can use Domenic to teleport right to the home point outside Waughroon Shrine."] = "Viaja a Palborough Mines y ve al piso superior (mapa 3). Si aún no lo has desbloqueado y has completado la quest de limit break Beyond Infinity, puedes usar a Domenic para teletransportarte directo al home point fuera de Waughroon Shrine.",
    ["Travel to Palborough Mines and obtain Mine Gravel from a Mythril Seam at (F-7) or (I-8)."] = "Viaja a Palborough Mines y obtén Mine Gravel de una Mythril Seam en (F-7) o (I-8).",
    ["Travel to Palborough Mines and open a Treasure Chest to receive the key item Diary of Mukunda."] = "Viaja a Palborough Mines y abre un Treasure Chest para recibir el key item Diary of Mukunda.",
    ["Travel to Pashhow Marshlands (S) and examine Shimmering Pondweed (G-6) for a cutscene that flags the quest. The Campaign teleport is fastest, or the Rolanberry Fields (S) Survival Guide, right at the zone line."] = "Viaja a Pashhow Marshlands (S) y examina el Shimmering Pondweed (G-6) para una escena que activa la quest. El teletransporte de Campaign es lo más rápido, o la Survival Guide de Rolanberry Fields (S), justo en el límite de zona.",
    ["Travel to Port Bastok (Home Point #3) and visit the Steaming Sheep Restaurant."] = "Viaja a Port Bastok (Home Point #3) y visita el Steaming Sheep Restaurant.",
    ["Travel to Port Bastok for a cutscene."] = "Viaja a Port Bastok para una escena.",
    ["Travel to Port Jeuno."] = "Viaja a Port Jeuno.",
    ["Travel to Port Jeuno. A Home Point warp is fastest and you don't need an airship ticket, but you must still go through Jeuno's Air Travel Agency before delivering to the Tenshodo, or the package is damaged and the quest fails."] = "Viaja a Port Jeuno. Un warp de Home Point es lo más rápido y no necesitas billete de aeronave, pero aun así debes pasar por la Air Travel Agency de Jeuno antes de entregar al Tenshodo, o el paquete se daña y la quest falla.",
    ["Travel to Port Windurst and speak with Melek at (F-6) inside the Bastokan Consulate."] = "Viaja a Port Windurst y habla con Melek en (F-6), dentro del Bastokan Consulate.",
    ["Travel to Port Windurst to continue with the second leg."] = "Viaja a Port Windurst para continuar con la segunda parte.",
    ["Travel to Queen Leaute's Garden (F-8)."] = "Viaja al jardín de la reina Leaute (F-8).",
    ["Travel to Qufim Island and head to Home Point #1 at (G-8)."] = "Viaja a Qufim Island y ve al Home Point #1 en (G-8).",
    ["Travel to Rabao (Home Point #2)."] = "Viaja a Rabao (Home Point #2).",
    ["Travel to Rabao and speak with Dancing Wolf (G-7) until he mentions Miraclesalt. If he keeps repeating himself without mentioning it, zone and try again; it can take a few tries."] = "Viaja a Rabao y habla con Dancing Wolf (G-7) hasta que mencione la Miraclesalt. Si se repite sin mencionarla, cambia de zona y vuelve a intentarlo; puede llevar varios intentos.",
    ["Travel to Ranguemont Pass and go to the pool at (E-5). Examine the Waters of Oblivion to spawn the NM Tros. Only the bracelet is needed, not Bard, so a higher-level job makes this easy; one spawn counts for everyone in the group."] = "Viaja a Ranguemont Pass y ve al estanque de (E-5). Examina las Waters of Oblivion para hacer aparecer al NM Tros. Solo hace falta el brazalete, no Bard, así que un job de más nivel lo facilita; una aparición cuenta para todos los del grupo.",
    ["Travel to Riverne - Site #A01 and check the Stone Monument at (C-7). You receive a cutscene and the Ornamented scroll."] = "Viaja a Riverne - Site #A01 y revisa el Stone Monument en (C-7). Recibes una escena y la Ornamented scroll.",
    ["Travel to Ro'Maeve (from The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah (F-5); the Unity Warp (level 125) lands at (H-11), the Survival Guide at (H-6)). Everything there aggroes to magic, most to sound and sight too. Search for the ??? at one of these locations; it moves about every 15 minutes, even during the fight: (D-10), (E-9), (E-10), (E-11), (G-9), (I-8), (J-8), (K-10), (K-11), (L-10) or (L-7). Avoid the ??? at (M-8), which is used for a different purpose."] = "Viaja a Ro'Maeve (desde The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah (F-5); el Unity Warp (nivel 125) te deja en (H-11) y la Survival Guide en (H-6)). Allí todo ataca por magia, y casi todo también por sonido y vista. Busca la ??? en uno de estos puntos; se mueve cada 15 minutos aproximadamente, incluso durante la pelea: (D-10), (E-9), (E-10), (E-11), (G-9), (I-8), (J-8), (K-10), (K-11), (L-10) o (L-7). Evita la ??? de (M-8), que sirve para otra cosa.",
    ["Travel to Ro'Maeve. Everything there detects magic, so use Silent Oil and Prism Powder (or Sneak and Invisible cast at the zone line). Mounts work here. The Ro'Maeve Survival Guide puts you right by the Hall of the Gods; Unity Warp (level 125) puts you at the Ro'Maeve entrance."] = "Viaja a Ro'Maeve. Todo allí detecta magia, así que usa Silent Oil y Prism Powder (o Sneak e Invisible lanzados en el límite de zona). Aquí se pueden usar monturas. La Survival Guide de Ro'Maeve te deja justo junto a Hall of the Gods; el Unity Warp (nivel 125) te deja en la entrada de Ro'Maeve.",
    ["Travel to Rolanberry Fields (S) and speak with Rakula-Motakula (G-9) on the turret."] = "Viaja a Rolanberry Fields (S) y habla con Rakula-Motakula (G-9) en la torreta.",
    ["Travel to Rolanberry Fields and proceed to (K-7)."] = "Viaja a Rolanberry Fields y avanza hasta (K-7).",
    ["Travel to Ru'Lude Gardens and approach the Palace."] = "Viaja a Ru'Lude Gardens y acércate al Palace.",
    ["Travel to Ru'Lude Gardens and speak with Goggehn at the Bastokan Embassy."] = "Viaja a Ru'Lude Gardens y habla con Goggehn en la Bastokan Embassy.",
    ["Travel to Ru'Lude Gardens and speak with Pherimociel at (G-6) in the Grand Duke's Palace."] = "Viaja a Ru'Lude Gardens y habla con Pherimociel en (G-6), en el Grand Duke's Palace.",
    ["Travel to Ru'Lude Gardens."] = "Viaja a Ru'Lude Gardens.",
    ["Travel to Sauromugue Champaign (S) and check Bulwark Gate (F-6) to meet Rachemace."] = "Viaja a Sauromugue Champaign (S) y revisa la Bulwark Gate (F-6) para conocer a Rachemace.",
    ["Travel to Sauromugue Champaign and find the cave at (L-10); to get there, go up the cliff at (L-8). The Survival Guide at (J-9/J-10) is the easiest way to reach it."] = "Viaja a Sauromugue Champaign y encuentra la cueva en (L-10); para llegar, sube el acantilado en (L-8). La Survival Guide en (J-9/J-10) es la forma más fácil de llegar.",
    ["Travel to Sealion's Den."] = "Viaja a Sealion's Den.",
    ["Travel to Selbina and speak with Abelard (G-9)."] = "Viaja a Selbina y habla con Abelard (G-9).",
    ["Travel to Selbina and speak with Elfriede (J-9) in the Shepherd's Muster Inn for a cutscene with Sneaking Tiger, who asks for a Quadav Stew. It can only be stolen from certain Quadavs in Beadeaux, so you can steal it before going to Selbina to save time."] = "Viaja a Selbina y habla con Elfriede (J-9) en la Shepherd's Muster Inn para una escena con Sneaking Tiger, que pide un Quadav Stew. Solo se puede robar a ciertos Quadav de Beadeaux, así que puedes robarlo antes de ir a Selbina para ahorrar tiempo.",
    ["Travel to Selbina."] = "Viaja a Selbina.",
    ["Travel to South Gustaberg and find the Goblin campfire (???) on the small hill at (K-9): the ramp up is directly south of the hill, at the top of (K-10). It blends in with the surroundings, so keep an eye open for it."] = "Viaja a South Gustaberg y busca la hoguera Goblin (???) en la pequeña colina de (K-9): la rampa de subida está justo al sur de la colina, en la parte superior de (K-10). Se confunde con el entorno, así que estate atento.",
    ["Travel to Southern San d'Oria [S]."] = "Viaja a Southern San d'Oria [S].",
    ["Travel to Southern San d'Oria and speak with Hinaree (B-6) in the Count's Manor."] = "Viaja a Southern San d'Oria y habla con Hinaree (B-6) en el Count's Manor.",
    ["Travel to Tavnazian Safehold and speak with Despachiaire (K-10)."] = "Viaja a Tavnazian Safehold y habla con Despachiaire (K-10).",
    ["Travel to Tavnazian Safehold."] = "Viaja a Tavnazian Safehold.",
    ["Travel to The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah."] = "Viaja a The Sanctuary of Zi'Tah.",
    ["Travel to Toraimarai Canal through Inner Horutoto Ruins or Windurst Walls."] = "Viaja a Toraimarai Canal por Inner Horutoto Ruins o por Windurst Walls.",
    ["Travel to Uleguerand Range and enter Bearclaw Pinnacle through the hole at (J-9). Enter the Flames for the Dead battlefield and defeat Snoll Tzar."] = "Viaja a Uleguerand Range y entra en Bearclaw Pinnacle por el agujero en (J-9). Entra en el campo de batalla Flames for the Dead y derrota a Snoll Tzar.",
    ["Travel to Upper Jeuno and examine Marble Bridge (F-7)."] = "Viaja a Upper Jeuno y examina el Marble Bridge (F-7).",
    ["Travel to Upper Jeuno and speak with Monberaux (G-10) in the Infirmary."] = "Viaja a Upper Jeuno y habla con Monberaux (G-10) en la enfermería.",
    ["Travel to Upper Jeuno and speak with Monberaux (G-10) to receive the Envelope, then travel to Ru'Lude Gardens and speak with Pherimociel at (G-6)."] = "Viaja a Upper Jeuno y habla con Monberaux (G-10) para recibir el Envelope, luego viaja a Ru'Lude Gardens y habla con Pherimociel en (G-6).",
    ["Travel to Upper Jeuno and trade Coeurl Meat to Baudin at (G-8)."] = "Viaja a Upper Jeuno y entrega Coeurl Meat a Baudin en (G-8).",
    ["Travel to Upper Jeuno."] = "Viaja a Upper Jeuno.",
    ["Travel to Vunkerl Inlet (S) and examine ??? (F-6), just east of the bridge (Survival Guide or Atmacite Refiner)."] = "Viaja a Vunkerl Inlet (S) y examina la ??? (F-6), justo al este del puente (Survival Guide o Atmacite Refiner).",
    ["Travel to Vunkerl Inlet (S) and examine ??? (F-6), just east of the bridge."] = "Viaja a Vunkerl Inlet (S) y examina la ??? (F-6), justo al este del puente.",
    ["Travel to Vunkerl Inlet (S) and examine ??? near the bridge (H-6) to obtain the Vunkerl Herb Memo."] = "Viaja a Vunkerl Inlet (S) y examina la ??? cerca del puente (H-6) para obtener el Vunkerl Herb Memo.",
    ["Travel to Vunkerl Inlet (S) and trade Beeswax and Red Textile Dye to Leadavox (J-6) for the Wax Seal."] = "Viaja a Vunkerl Inlet (S) y entrega Beeswax y Red Textile Dye a Leadavox (J-6) por el Wax Seal.",
    ["Travel to Vunkerl Inlet (S) and trade all three ingredients to Leadavox (J-6) at (J-6) to receive the Pot of Martial Relish."] = "Viaja a Vunkerl Inlet (S) y entrega los tres ingredientes a Leadavox (J-6) en (J-6) para recibir el Pot of Martial Relish.",
    ["Travel to Vunkerl Inlet (S) at (D-11)."] = "Viaja a Vunkerl Inlet (S) en (D-11).",
    ["Travel to Vunkerl Inlet (S), find Leafy Patch (F-5), and select the correct color."] = "Viaja a Vunkerl Inlet (S), busca el Leafy Patch (F-5) y elige el color correcto.",
    ["Travel to Vunkerl Inlet (S), talk to Leadavox (J-6) at (J-6) first, then trade the Gnole Claw for the Xhifhut key item."] = "Viaja a Vunkerl Inlet (S), habla antes con Leadavox (J-6) en (J-6) y luego entrégale la Gnole Claw para obtener el key item Xhifhut.",
    ["Travel to Waughroon Shrine through Palborough Mines (the Palborough Mines Home Point is close), or pay Domenic in Lower Jeuno (J-7) 750 gil to be teleported straight to the battlefield."] = "Viaja a Waughroon Shrine por Palborough Mines (el Home Point de Palborough Mines está cerca), o paga 750 gil a Domenic en Lower Jeuno (J-7) para que te teletransporte directamente al campo de batalla.",
    ["Travel to West Ronfaure and locate a ???. It appears in one of three places: the border of (G-10) and (G-11), (G-9) at the outpost, or (F-11) in the south part of the square, close to a wall."] = "Viaja a West Ronfaure y localiza una ???. Aparece en uno de tres lugares: el límite de (G-10) y (G-11), (G-9) en el outpost, o (F-11) en la parte sur de la plaza, cerca de una pared.",
    ["Travel to West Sarutabaruta (S) and apply the putty to the sealed entrances at (F-4), (F-11), and (J-8)."] = "Viaja a West Sarutabaruta (S) y aplica la masilla a las entradas selladas en (F-4), (F-11) y (J-8).",
    ["Travel to West Sarutabaruta (S) and examine ??? at Starfall Hillock (I-6) to obtain the Small Starfruit key item."] = "Viaja a West Sarutabaruta (S) y examina la ??? del Starfall Hillock (I-6) para obtener el key item Small Starfruit.",
    ["Travel to Western Altepa Desert and examine Dreamrose (G-7) to face Sabotender Enamorado."] = "Viaja a Western Altepa Desert y examina la Dreamrose (G-7) para enfrentarte a Sabotender Enamorado.",
    ["Travel to Western Altepa Desert: Unity Warp (level 125) puts you at (I-7), the Survival Guide at (K-7)."] = "Viaja a Western Altepa Desert: el Unity Warp (nivel 125) te deja en (I-7) y la Survival Guide en (K-7).",
    ["Travel to Windurst Waters and speak with Cochal-Monchal at (F-8), at Home Point #1 on the north map, in the Optistery."] = "Viaja a Windurst Waters y habla con Cochal-Monchal en (F-8), en el Home Point #1 del mapa norte, en el Optistery.",
    ["Travel to Windurst Waters and speak with Kerutoto at (J-8), then speak with Yoran-Oran (E-5) in Windurst Walls."] = "Viaja a Windurst Waters y habla con Kerutoto en (J-8), luego con Yoran-Oran (E-5) en Windurst Walls.",
    ["Travel to Windurst Woods and speak with Mourices (F/G-10)."] = "Viaja a Windurst Woods y habla con Mourices (F/G-10).",
    ["Travel to Windurst to continue with the second leg."] = "Viaja a Windurst para continuar con la segunda parte.",
    ["Travel to Xarcabard (S) and obtain the Commander's Endorsement key item."] = "Viaja a Xarcabard (S) y obtén el key item Commander's Endorsement.",
    ["Travel to Xarcabard and head toward (E-8), very close to the Castle Zvahl Baileys zone line (quickest: the Castle Zvahl Baileys Survival Guide, then zone out). Find the ??? in the glowing trenches."] = "Viaja a Xarcabard y dirígete hacia (E-8), muy cerca del límite de zona de Castle Zvahl Baileys (lo más rápido: la Survival Guide de Castle Zvahl Baileys y salir de la zona). Busca la ??? en las zanjas brillantes.",
    ["Travel to Yhoator Jungle and look for the entrance to Ifrit's Cauldron at (I-6). On the first map, go to the Flame Spout at (H-6), trade it an Ice Cluster or wait for it to recede, and continue to (F-6). On map B, drop down at (I-8); on map C, take the drop at (H-7), then go to (G-6) for the Cloister of Flames. Home Point #1 is best; the Unity Warp (level 125) puts you a short run from it (go left to J, follow the tunnel and walk off the ledge at its end)."] = "Viaja a Yhoator Jungle y busca la entrada a Ifrit's Cauldron en (I-6). En el primer mapa, ve al Flame Spout de (H-6), entrégale un Ice Cluster o espera a que baje, y continúa hasta (F-6). En el mapa B, déjate caer en (I-8); en el mapa C, toma la caída de (H-7) y ve a (G-6) para el Cloister of Flames. Lo mejor es el Home Point #1; el Unity Warp (nivel 125) te deja a poca distancia corriendo (ve a la izquierda hacia J, sigue el túnel y déjate caer de la cornisa al final).",
    ["Travel to Yughott Grotto Map 1 and examine Scrape Mark (G-9) at (G-9)."] = "Viaja al mapa 1 de Yughott Grotto y examina la Scrape Mark (G-9) en (G-9).",
    ["Travel to Yuhtunga Jungle on Elshimo Island (by airship with a Kazham Airship Pass, or by boat to Norg from Mhaura or Selbina after RoV 1-5) and log at a Logging Point to receive a Fallen Star."] = "Viaja a Yuhtunga Jungle en Elshimo Island (en aeronave con un Kazham Airship Pass, o en barco a Norg desde Mhaura o Selbina tras RoV 1-5) y tala en un Logging Point para recibir una Fallen Star.",
    ["Travel to battlefield entrance and enter the battlefield."] = "Viaja a la entrada del campo de batalla y entra.",
    ["Travel to present-day Metalworks and speak with Iron Eater in the President's Office at (J-8), maybe more than once."] = "Viaja a la Metalworks del presente y habla con Iron Eater en el President's Office en (J-8), quizá más de una vez.",
    ["Travel to present-day Southern San d'Oria and speak with Kipopo inside the first-floor room at (D-8)."] = "Viaja a la Southern San d'Oria del presente y habla con Kipopo dentro de la habitación del primer piso en (D-8).",
    ["Travel to present-day Windurst Waters and speak with Ranpi-Monpi there."] = "Viaja a la Windurst Waters actual y habla allí con Ranpi-Monpi.",
    ["Travel to the Benedikt Watchtower in North Gustaberg (S) (E-11) and speak with Roderich (E-11); the Campaign Arbiter warp is close."] = "Viaja a la Benedikt Watchtower de North Gustaberg (S) (E-11) y habla con Roderich (E-11); el warp del Campaign Arbiter está cerca.",
    ["Travel to the Crag of Holla, Dem, or Mea."] = "Viaja al Crag of Holla, Dem o Mea.",
    ["Travel to the Durable Shields shop and speak with Guslam in Upper Jeuno (H-8) as a Bard of level 50 or higher to begin the quest."] = "Viaja a la tienda Durable Shields y habla con Guslam en Upper Jeuno (H-8) como Bard de nivel 50 o superior para empezar la quest.",
    ["Travel to the Durable Shields shop and speak with Guslam in Upper Jeuno (H-8) as a Beastmaster of level 50 or higher to begin the quest. This quest follows Scattered Into Shadow."] = "Viaja a la tienda Durable Shields y habla con Guslam en Upper Jeuno (H-8) como Beastmaster de nivel 50 o superior para empezar la quest. Esta quest sigue a Scattered Into Shadow.",
    ["Travel to the Durable Shields shop and speak with Guslam in Upper Jeuno (H-8) as a Dark Knight of level 50 or higher to begin the quest. This quest follows Dark Puppet."] = "Viaja a la tienda Durable Shields y habla con Guslam en Upper Jeuno (H-8) como Dark Knight de nivel 50 o superior para empezar la quest. Esta quest sigue a Dark Puppet.",
    ["Travel to the Durable Shields shop and speak with Guslam in Upper Jeuno (H-8) as a Monk of level 50 or higher to begin the quest."] = "Viaja a la tienda Durable Shields y habla con Guslam en Upper Jeuno (H-8) como Monk de nivel 50 o superior para empezar la quest.",
    ["Travel to the Durable Shields shop and speak with Guslam in Upper Jeuno (H-8) as a Paladin of level 50 or higher to begin the quest. This quest requires the Rise of the Zilart pack and follows A Boy's Dream."] = "Viaja a la tienda Durable Shields y habla con Guslam en Upper Jeuno (H-8) como Paladin de nivel 50 o superior para empezar la quest. Esta quest requiere el pack Rise of the Zilart y sigue a A Boy's Dream.",
    ["Travel to the Durable Shields shop and speak with Guslam in Upper Jeuno (H-8) as a Ranger of level 50 or higher to begin the quest. This quest follows Fire and Brimstone."] = "Viaja a la tienda Durable Shields y habla con Guslam en Upper Jeuno (H-8) como Ranger de nivel 50 o superior para empezar la quest. Esta quest sigue a Fire and Brimstone.",
    ["Travel to the Durable Shields shop and speak with Guslam in Upper Jeuno (H-8) as a Red Mage of level 50 or higher to begin the quest. This quest follows The Crimson Trial."] = "Viaja a la tienda Durable Shields y habla con Guslam en Upper Jeuno (H-8) como Red Mage de nivel 50 o superior para empezar la quest. Esta quest sigue a The Crimson Trial.",
    ["Travel to the Durable Shields shop and speak with Guslam in Upper Jeuno (H-8) as a Samurai of level 50 or higher to begin the quest. This quest requires the Rise of the Zilart pack."] = "Viaja a la tienda Durable Shields y habla con Guslam en Upper Jeuno (H-8) como Samurai de nivel 50 o superior para empezar la quest. Esta quest requiere el pack Rise of the Zilart.",
    ["Travel to the Durable Shields shop and speak with Guslam in Upper Jeuno (H-8) as a Summoner of level 50 or higher to begin the quest. You need the Rise of the Zilart pack."] = "Viaja a la tienda Durable Shields y habla con Guslam en Upper Jeuno (H-8) como Summoner de nivel 50 o superior para empezar la quest. Necesitas el pack Rise of the Zilart.",
    ["Travel to the Durable Shields shop and speak with Guslam in Upper Jeuno (H-8) as a Warrior of level 50 or higher to begin the quest. This quest follows The Talekeeper's Truth."] = "Viaja a la tienda Durable Shields y habla con Guslam en Upper Jeuno (H-8) como Warrior de nivel 50 o superior para empezar la quest. Esta quest sigue a The Talekeeper's Truth.",
    ["Travel to the Durable Shields shop and speak with Guslam in Upper Jeuno (H-8) as a White Mage to begin the quest. Once you have started it as a White Mage you may complete the other steps on a different job, even finishing the quest and receiving the Healer's Mitts."] = "Viaja a la tienda Durable Shields y habla con Guslam en Upper Jeuno (H-8) como White Mage para empezar la quest. Una vez empezada como White Mage puedes completar el resto de pasos con otro trabajo, incluso terminar la quest y recibir los Healer's Mitts.",
    ["Travel to the Durable Shields shop in Upper Jeuno and speak with Guslam at (H-8) as a Black Mage of level 50 or higher to begin the quest. You must have started Recollections."] = "Viaja a la tienda Durable Shields de Upper Jeuno y habla con Guslam en (H-8) como Black Mage de nivel 50 o superior para empezar la quest. Debes haber empezado Recollections.",
    ["Travel to the Durable Shields shop in Upper Jeuno and speak with Guslam at (H-8) as a Dragoon of level 50 or higher to begin the quest. This quest requires the Rise of the Zilart pack and follows Chasing Quotas."] = "Viaja a la tienda Durable Shields de Upper Jeuno y habla con Guslam en (H-8) como Dragoon de nivel 50 o superior para empezar la quest. Esta quest requiere el pack Rise of the Zilart y sigue a Chasing Quotas.",
    ["Travel to the Durable Shields shop in Upper Jeuno and speak with Guslam at (H-8) as a Thief of level 50 or higher to begin the quest. This quest follows As Thick as Thieves."] = "Viaja a la tienda Durable Shields de Upper Jeuno y habla con Guslam en (H-8) como Thief de nivel 50 o superior para empezar la quest. Esta quest sigue a As Thick as Thieves.",
    ["Travel to the Eduard Watchtower on Zegham Hill in North Gustaberg (S) and speak with Gebhardt (I-6)."] = "Viaja a la Eduard Watchtower en Zegham Hill, en North Gustaberg (S), y habla con Gebhardt (I-6).",
    ["Travel to the Gates of Castle Adoulin in Eastern Adoulin at (K-9)."] = "Viaja a las Gates of Castle Adoulin en Eastern Adoulin, en (K-9).",
    ["Travel to the Manustery in Windurst Woods and speak with Apururu (H-9)."] = "Viaja al Manustery de Windurst Woods y habla con Apururu (H-9).",
    ["Travel to the Metalworks gate area and speak with Gentle Tiger (H-6)."] = "Viaja a la zona de la puerta de Metalworks y habla con Gentle Tiger (H-6).",
    ["Travel to the Mummers' Coalition in Western Adoulin."] = "Viaja al Mummers' Coalition en Western Adoulin.",
    ["Travel to the Navukgo Execution Chamber: Mount Zhayolm's Home Point is right outside it (without it, Unity Warp level 135 to Mount Zhayolm, turn around and take the east junction at the C-7/C-8 line). You get a cutscene on entering."] = "Viaja a la Navukgo Execution Chamber: el Home Point de Mount Zhayolm está justo fuera (sin él, Unity Warp de nivel 135 a Mount Zhayolm, date la vuelta y toma el cruce este en la línea C-7/C-8). Al entrar ves una escena.",
    ["Travel to the Orastery in Port Windurst and speak with Hakkuru-Rinkuru."] = "Viaja al Orastery en Port Windurst y habla con Hakkuru-Rinkuru.",
    ["Travel to the Pioneers' Coalition in Western Adoulin at (E-8)."] = "Viaja al Pioneers' Coalition en Western Adoulin, en (E-8).",
    ["Travel to the President's Office and speak with Karst."] = "Viaja a la President's Office y habla con Karst.",
    ["Travel to the President's Office in Bastok Metalworks and speak with Alois (J-8)."] = "Viaja al President's Office de Bastok Metalworks y habla con Alois (J-8).",
    ["Travel to the Rubious Crystal at (D-10)."] = "Viaja al Rubious Crystal en (D-10).",
    ["Travel to the Rubious Crystal at (H-13)."] = "Viaja al Rubious Crystal en (H-13).",
    ["Travel to the Rubious Crystal at (L-10)."] = "Viaja al Rubious Crystal en (L-10).",
    ["Travel to the San d'Orian Embassy in Ru'Lude Gardens and speak with Nelcabrit (H-9)."] = "Viaja a la San d'Orian Embassy en Ru'Lude Gardens y habla con Nelcabrit (H-9).",
    ["Travel to the Stone Circle at (G-6) in La Theine Plateau."] = "Viaja al Stone Circle en (G-6) en La Theine Plateau.",
    ["Travel to the Weathered Gravestone (I-10) in Batallia Downs (I-10), on the hill just above The Eldieme Necropolis entrance (its Survival Guide is closest)."] = "Viaja a la Weathered Gravestone (I-10) de Batallia Downs (I-10), en la colina justo encima de la entrada de The Eldieme Necropolis (su Survival Guide es la más cercana).",
    ["Travel to the battlefield entrance and enter the battlefield."] = "Viaja a la entrada del campo de batalla y entra.",
    ["Travel to the crags of Holla, Dem and Mea and investigate the coordinates where the strange readings from the Emptiness are occurring, to obtain the key items Promyvion - Holla sliver, Promyvion - Dem sliver and Promyvion - Mea sliver."] = "Viaja a los crags de Holla, Dem y Mea e investiga las coordenadas donde ocurren las extrañas lecturas del Emptiness, para obtener los key items Promyvion - Holla sliver, Promyvion - Dem sliver y Promyvion - Mea sliver.",
    ["Travel to the ice pond in Beaucedine Glacier (G-10) and click on the Mirror Pond. It only appears on days without snow or clouds (single gloom weather is fine). The Beaucedine Glacier Voidwatch warp is closest."] = "Viaja al estanque helado de Beaucedine Glacier (G-10) y pulsa el Mirror Pond. Solo aparece en días sin nieve ni nubes (el clima de penumbra simple sirve). El warp de Voidwatch de Beaucedine Glacier es el más cercano.",
    ["Travel to the roof of the Rhinostery in Windurst Waters (J-8), near Home Point #3, and speak with Leepe-Hoppe (J-8) for the Food Offering and Drink Offering."] = "Viaja a la azotea de la Rhinostery en Windurst Waters (J-8), cerca del Home Point #3, y habla con Leepe-Hoppe (J-8) para obtener la Food Offering y la Drink Offering.",
    ["Travel to the three required locations and obtain three key items from Treasure Chests: Un Moment, L'Ephemere and L'Ancienne, the missing parts of the Chanson de Liberte."] = "Viaja a las tres ubicaciones requeridas y obtén tres key items de Treasure Chests: Un Moment, L'Ephemere y L'Ancienne, las partes que faltan de la Chanson de Liberte.",
    ["Travel to the top floor of Palborough Mines (map 3). Palborough Mines Home Point #1 is the fastest way."] = "Viaja al piso superior de Palborough Mines (mapa 3). El Home Point #1 de Palborough Mines es la forma más rápida.",
    ["Travel to the top floor of Tavnazian Safehold."] = "Viaja al piso superior de Tavnazian Safehold.",
    ["Travel to the waterfall in North Gustaberg (S) at (F-8), near the Survival Guide, and examine the ??? on its right side."] = "Viaja a la cascada de North Gustaberg (S) en (F-8), cerca de la Survival Guide, y examina la ??? de su lado derecho.",
    ["Travel west and speak with Uu Zhoumo (F-7) to offer the Shield Offering."] = "Viaja al oeste y habla con Uu Zhoumo (F-7) para ofrecer la Shield Offering.",
    ["Travel west into the tunnel entrance, then north to find the Rock Slab. Examine it for a cutscene that ends the quest and gives you your reward, the Corsair Die."] = "Viaja al oeste hasta la entrada del túnel y luego al norte para encontrar la Rock Slab. Examínala para una escena que termina la quest y te da tu recompensa, el Corsair Die.",
    ["Travel west to (F-7) and speak with Uu Zhoumo (F-7) to offer the Shield Offering."] = "Viaja al oeste hasta (F-7) y habla con Uu Zhoumo (F-7) para ofrecer la Shield Offering.",
    ["Treasure Coffers spawn at fixed points in each zone that has them - there's only one in existence at a time, and a new one spawns five minutes after the last one was opened."] = "Los Treasure Coffers aparecen en puntos fijos de cada zona que los tiene; solo existe uno a la vez, y aparece uno nuevo cinco minutos después de abrir el anterior.",
    ["Trial 1, logic puzzle: find the Qiqirn spies among 12 humes. You can ask how many spies are in a set of 4 consecutive humes, or in a pair. Round 1: 3 spies, 5 sets and 5 pairs; round 2: 4 spies, 5 sets and 4 pairs; round 3: 5 spies, 6 sets and 5 pairs."] = "Prueba 1, acertijo lógico: encuentra a los espías Qiqirn entre 12 humes. Puedes preguntar cuántos espías hay en un grupo de 4 humes consecutivos, o en una pareja. Ronda 1: 3 espías, 5 grupos y 5 parejas; ronda 2: 4 espías, 5 grupos y 4 parejas; ronda 3: 5 espías, 6 grupos y 5 parejas.",
    ["Trial 1, push-ups: count three NPCs doing push-ups and determine who did the least; it is either one of the three, or none. A reliable way is to use a piece of paper and make a mark in three different sections each time an NPC does a push-up."] = "Prueba 1, flexiones: cuenta a tres NPCs haciendo flexiones y determina quién hizo menos; es uno de los tres, o ninguno. Una forma fiable es usar un papel y hacer una marca en tres secciones distintas cada vez que un NPC hace una flexión.",
    ["Trial 2, cipher: the four answers are \"Haes, Waami lakiino kiichi.\", \"Waami lakiino tachiito!\", \"Waami lakiino Yasmeel.\" and \"Waami lakiino kolcha.\""] = "Prueba 2, cifrado: las cuatro respuestas son \"Haes, Waami lakiino kiichi.\", \"Waami lakiino tachiito!\", \"Waami lakiino Yasmeel.\" y \"Waami lakiino kolcha.\"",
    ["Trial 2, sit-ups: you must give a message advancement prompt with proper timing as the three NPCs do sit-ups. The Windower addon Enternity must be unloaded for this trial, as it repeatedly queues the advancement prompt. You can practice indefinitely with Abquhbah. In the real challenge, three NPCs have slightly different timings."] = "Prueba 2, sentadillas: debes dar un aviso de avance de mensaje con el tiempo adecuado mientras los tres NPCs hacen sentadillas. El addon de Windower Enternity debe estar descargado en esta prueba, porque pone en cola repetidamente el aviso de avance. Puedes practicar sin límite con Abquhbah. En el reto real, los tres NPCs tienen tiempos ligeramente distintos.",
    ["Trial 3, BCG (rock-paper-scissors): Ghost beats Beetle, Beetle beats Crab, Crab beats Ghost. A lost round costs 1 point; each tie grows both bombs, adding 1 to the next loss. Reduce your opponent to 0 points."] = "Prueba 3, BCG (piedra, papel o tijera): Ghost gana a Beetle, Beetle gana a Crab, Crab gana a Ghost. Perder una ronda cuesta 1 punto; cada empate hace crecer ambas bombas y suma 1 a la siguiente derrota. Deja a tu rival en 0 puntos.",
    ["Trial 3, running: you must give prompts to the three NPCs so that they finish running at the same time. If you select an NPC who is not behind, you are penalized and can fail the trial."] = "Prueba 3, carrera: debes dar avisos a los tres NPCs para que terminen de correr a la vez. Si eliges a un NPC que no va rezagado, te penalizan y puedes fallar la prueba.",
    ["Trimmer start becoming Decent Challenge at level 91."] = "Los Trimmer pasan a ser Decent Challenge a nivel 91.",
    ["Trimmer/Natty Gibbon"] = "Trimmer/Natty Gibbon",
    ["Trion - Examine the \"Door: Prince Royal's Room\" in Chateau d'Oraguille at (H-7)."] = "Trion: examina la \"Door: Prince Royal's Room\" de Chateau d'Oraguille en (H-7).",
    ["Troll mercenary leader Martial Maestro Megomak has finished his newest creation, the Khimaira 14X, and taken it to Ilrusi Atoll for combat testing. Mission orders: defeat Khimaira 14X."] = "El líder mercenario Troll Martial Maestro Megomak ha terminado su última creación, el Khimaira 14X, y la ha llevado a Ilrusi Atoll para pruebas de combate. Órdenes de la misión: derrotar al Khimaira 14X.",
    ["Tropical Rarab/Tragopan"] = "Tropical Rarab/Tragopan",
    ["Trust Magic"] = "Trust Magic",
    ["Trust magic cannot be used in this battlefield."] = "La Trust magic no se puede usar en este campo de batalla.",
    ["Trusts and Adventuring Fellows don't count, but Level Sync works, and you only need to be synced when you talk to Hunting Bear."] = "Los Trusts y los Adventuring Fellows no cuentan, pero Level Sync sí funciona, y solo necesitas estar sincronizado cuando hablas con Hunting Bear.",
    ["Trusts are SE's answer to a declining number of lower level players. Since FFXI was designed to be multiplayer, a lot of content assumes that you have a varied group of other players. As the playerbase became more top-heavy, less players were interested in participating in lower level content, so Trusts - summonable party member copies of various NPCs throughout the game - were invented to pick up the slack."] = "Los Trusts son la respuesta de SE a la caída del número de jugadores de nivel bajo. Como FFXI se diseñó para ser multijugador, mucho contenido da por hecho que tienes un grupo variado de otros jugadores. A medida que la base de jugadores se concentró en el nivel alto, menos jugadores querían participar en contenido de nivel bajo, así que se inventaron los Trusts, copias invocables como miembros del grupo de varios NPCs del juego, para cubrir el hueco.",
    ["Trusts are summoned with full HP and MP. This means that you can deliberately unsummon and resummon them to fully heal them, as long as their summon spell is not still on its three-minute cooldown."] = "Los Trusts aparecen con el HP y el MP al máximo. Esto significa que puedes despedirlos e invocarlos de nuevo a propósito para curarlos del todo, siempre que su hechizo de invocación no siga en su recarga de tres minutos.",
    ["Trusts make the Notorious Monsters easy to solo. Or ride through each cave on a Mount to get the key item, then remount or run out."] = "Los Trusts hacen fácil vencer en solitario a los Notorious Monsters. También puedes atravesar cada cueva en Mount para conseguir el key item, y luego volver a montar o salir corriendo.",
    ["Trusts particularly worth noting from the campaigns are:"] = "Trusts de las campañas que merecen especial mención:",
    ["Trusts will only act on enemies that you have engaged and performed at least one melee attack (hit or miss) against. They will disengage from an enemy when you do. You cannot order them to attack or retreat independently of your actions. Therefore, even as a job like White Mage or Black Mage, you will need to engage in melee combat against every enemy you wish your trusts to fight."] = "Los Trusts solo actúan contra enemigos con los que hayas entrado en combate y a los que hayas hecho al menos un ataque cuerpo a cuerpo (acierte o falle). Dejan a un enemigo cuando lo dejas tú. No puedes ordenarles atacar ni retirarse por su cuenta. Por eso, incluso con un job como White Mage o Black Mage, tendrás que entrar en combate cuerpo a cuerpo con cada enemigo contra el que quieras que luchen tus trusts.",
    ["Trusts' levels are equal to your level at the moment that you summoned them. This matters when you're low level and advancing quickly - if you level up a few times, you should probably take a quick break to unsummon and resummon your team so that they also instantly level up - but stops mattering almost immediately when your leveling pace slows down."] = "El nivel de los Trusts es igual a tu nivel en el momento de invocarlos. Esto importa cuando eres de nivel bajo y avanzas rápido (si subes varios niveles, conviene hacer una pausa rápida para despedir e invocar de nuevo a tu equipo y que también suban de nivel al instante), pero deja de importar casi enseguida cuando tu ritmo de subida se ralentiza.",
    ["Tsui-Goab in Misareaux Coast: rifts at (J-8), (I-7) and (J-10)."] = "Tsui-Goab en Misareaux Coast: rifts en (J-8), (I-7) y (J-10).",
    ["Turn around, take the west teleporter in the same room and walk south toward the exit for the second cutscene. Avoid the Apex Archaic Cogs, which detect by sight, sound and magic."] = "Date la vuelta, toma el teletransportador oeste de la misma sala y camina al sur hacia la salida para la segunda escena. Evita los Apex Archaic Cogs, que detectan por vista, sonido y magia.",
    ["Turn in the Quadav Backplate to Corann to complete the quest."] = "Entrega el Quadav Backplate a Corann para completar la quest.",
    ["Turn south at (F-7) and continue west, following the path as it turns north at (B-7)."] = "Gira al sur en (F-7) y sigue al oeste, siguiendo el camino cuando gira al norte en (B-7).",
    ["Turn the whispers in to Leepe-Hoppe to receive a Moon bauble."] = "Entrega los whispers a Leepe-Hoppe para recibir una Moon bauble.",
    ["Tutorial > Basics"] = "Tutorial > Basics",
    ["Twitherym do not link."] = "Los Twitherym no se enlazan.",
    ["Two Great Trusts"] = "Dos grandes Trusts",
    ["Two battles, in either order. You win each by bringing the main target below 10%. Drawing your weapon starts the fight at once. If you lose, get the entry key item again from the Aged Stump (H-8) in Leafallia."] = "Dos batallas, en cualquier orden. Ganas cada una bajando al objetivo principal por debajo del 10%. Desenfundar el arma empieza la pelea al instante. Si pierdes, vuelve a conseguir el key item de entrada en el Aged Stump (H-8) de Leafallia.",
    ["Two ghosts spawn at night which are stronger than the mobs you are fighting."] = "De noche aparecen dos fantasmas más fuertes que los monstruos contra los que luchas.",
    ["Two parties can share the opposite sides of this big room."] = "Dos grupos pueden compartir los lados opuestos de esta sala grande.",
    ["Two parties can share this spot, but they will have to pull over each other."] = "Dos grupos pueden compartir este punto, pero tendrán que atraer por encima del otro.",
    ["Ufanne in Port San d'Oria (H-8) keeps track of how many fish you have turned in, and to which brother. You may need to speak to her multiple times."] = "Ufanne en Port San d'Oria (H-8) lleva la cuenta de cuántos peces has entregado y a qué hermano. Puede que tengas que hablar con ella varias veces.",
    ["Undead also have \"blood aggro\" so make sure your HP is not in the yellow or below - if you're not fighting, this is generally easy, but be careful if you're swapping gear."] = "Los no-muertos también detectan \"por sangre\", así que asegúrate de que tu HP no esté en amarillo o menos; si no estás luchando suele ser fácil, pero ten cuidado si cambias de equipo.",
    ["Undead may spawn and roam somewhat near the camp so keep an eye out."] = "Pueden aparecer no-muertos que deambulan cerca del campamento, así que estate atento.",
    ["Undead spawn at night."] = "De noche aparecen no-muertos.",
    ["Unequip all weapons and your shield."] = "Desequipa todas las armas y tu escudo.",
    ["Unequip your weapons and shield."] = "Desequipa tus armas y tu escudo.",
    ["Unity Concord expands the RoE system, and is unlockable once you have completed 10 RoE objectives of any kind. It grants additional objectives and a new currency you can earn with many RoE objectives called Accolades. Activate the RoE objective Tutorial > Basics > \"All For One\" and talk to one of the Unity NPCs (found near the RoE NPCs) to join a Unity:"] = "Unity Concord amplía el sistema de RoE, y se desbloquea al completar 10 objetivos de RoE de cualquier tipo. Da objetivos adicionales y una nueva moneda que se gana con muchos objetivos de RoE, las Accolades. Activa el objetivo de RoE Tutorial > Basics > \"All For One\" y habla con uno de los NPCs de Unity (cerca de los NPCs de RoE) para unirte a una Unity:",
    ["Unity Warp (level 99) to La Theine Plateau puts you nearby."] = "El Unity Warp (nivel 99) a La Theine Plateau te deja cerca.",
    ["Unity objectives in Records of Eminence earn Accolades, spent at the same NPCs on items, Unity Warps and the Wanted battles. You can change Unity once per Conquest week for an Accolade fee."] = "Los objetivos de Unity en Records of Eminence dan Accolades, que se gastan en los mismos NPCs en objetos, Unity Warps y las batallas Wanted. Puedes cambiar de Unity una vez por semana de Conquest pagando Accolades.",
    ["Unity warp to Attohwa Chasm (level 125) and then - bearing in mind how bad the default in-game map for this area is - follow the tunnel north until you hit a canyon at (H-9) and go north without crossing the canyon until you see the second tunnel on the left. Take that second tunnel and go north until you hit a chasm at (H-8). Cross over to the north side of this chasm and go north to enter a tunnel. Take the left path at both forks you come to until you arrive at the chasm again at (G-7). Now head north, then take the tunnel to your right to finally reach a Home Point at the zone line to Boneyard Gully."] = "Usa el Unity warp a Attohwa Chasm (nivel 125) y luego (teniendo en cuenta lo malo que es el mapa por defecto de esta zona) sigue el túnel al norte hasta llegar a un cañón en (H-9) y ve al norte sin cruzar el cañón hasta ver el segundo túnel a la izquierda. Toma ese segundo túnel y ve al norte hasta llegar a una sima en (H-8). Cruza al lado norte de esta sima y ve al norte para entrar en un túnel. Toma el camino de la izquierda en las dos bifurcaciones que encuentres hasta llegar otra vez a la sima en (G-7). Ahora ve al norte y toma el túnel de tu derecha para llegar por fin a un Home Point en el límite de zona de Boneyard Gully.",
    ["Unity warp to Beaucedine Glacier (level 125) and head up several ramps (go west, north-then-west, southwest-then-north) to reach the outpost and Survival Guide."] = "Usa el Unity warp a Beaucedine Glacier (nivel 125) y sube varias rampas (ve al oeste, al norte y luego al oeste, al suroeste y luego al norte) para llegar al puesto avanzado y la Survival Guide.",
    ["Unity warp to Behemoth's Dominion (level 135) and walk east through the tunnels to reach the Survival Guide at the entrance of the zone at (L-9). (Alternatively, walk through a hidden tunnel in Qufim slightly north of the Survival Guide there.)"] = "Usa el Unity warp a Behemoth's Dominion (nivel 135) y camina al este por los túneles hasta la Survival Guide de la entrada de la zona en (L-9). (También puedes cruzar un túnel oculto de Qufim, un poco al norte de la Survival Guide de allí.)",
    ["Unity warp to Bibiki Bay (level 119) and hit the Survival Guide at the entrance. (Alternatively, Bibiki is on the southwest side of Buburimu Peninsula - go down onto the beach and walk west on the shoreline below the cliff.)"] = "Usa el Unity warp a Bibiki Bay (nivel 119) y toca la Survival Guide de la entrada. (También puedes ir: Bibiki está en el lado suroeste de Buburimu Peninsula; baja a la playa y camina al oeste por la orilla bajo el acantilado.)",
    ["Unity warp to Carpenters' Landing (level 119) and backtrack to the entrance at (J-10) to find a Survival Guide. (Alternatively, you can walk there from Jugner Forest. The entrance from Northern San d'Oria does not directly connect to this part, you have to take an in-zone ferry. Because FFXI.)"] = "Usa el Unity warp a Carpenters' Landing (nivel 119) y vuelve atrás hasta la entrada de (J-10) para encontrar una Survival Guide. (También puedes ir caminando desde Jugner Forest. La entrada desde Northern San d'Oria no conecta directamente con esta parte; tienes que tomar un ferry dentro de la zona. Porque FFXI.)",
    ["Unity warp to Eastern Altepa Desert (level 122) and head to the southwest corner of the map, where the outpost has a Survival Guide. Directly east of the tetris-Z shape on the line between (G-6) and (G-7) is a zone line at (I-6) into the Western Altepa Desert with a Survival Guide on the Western side."] = "Usa el Unity warp a Eastern Altepa Desert (nivel 122) y ve a la esquina suroeste del mapa, donde el puesto avanzado tiene una Survival Guide. Justo al este de la forma de Z de tetris en la línea entre (G-6) y (G-7) hay un límite de zona en (I-6) hacia Western Altepa Desert, con una Survival Guide en el lado oeste.",
    ["Unity warp to Fei'Yin (level 128) to arrive at the entrance. Go through the first room and take the exit on the right side of the second room. From here, take a U-shaped path by going east into a room and then west out the other exit of that room, then run straight ahead. Ignore a path on the right that you will return to in the next bullet point and go down some stairs at (G-9) to arrive on a second map. Continue on until you hit a room, then hug the left wall until you hit an even larger room. Take the exit in the northeast corner of this large room at (H-5) and continue through some small rooms to find a Home Point outside the Cloister of Frost."] = "Usa el Unity warp a Fei'Yin (nivel 128) para llegar a la entrada. Cruza la primera sala y toma la salida del lado derecho de la segunda sala. Desde aquí, haz un camino en U yendo al este a una sala y saliendo al oeste por la otra salida de esa sala, y luego corre recto. Ignora un camino a la derecha al que volverás en el punto siguiente y baja unas escaleras en (G-9) para llegar a un segundo mapa. Sigue hasta llegar a una sala y pégate a la pared izquierda hasta llegar a una sala aún más grande. Toma la salida de la esquina noreste de esta sala grande en (H-5) y sigue por unas salas pequeñas hasta encontrar un Home Point fuera del Cloister of Frost.",
    ["Unity warp to Ifrit's Cauldron (level 125) and walk east to change maps. Follow the only path straight south until you change maps again at (G-12)ish. Walk to (H-7) and deliberately fall south onto the lower path. Then walk north until the path forks at (H-6) and go west to the Home Point outside the Cloister of Flames."] = "Usa el Unity warp a Ifrit's Cauldron (nivel 125) y camina al este para cambiar de mapa. Sigue el único camino recto al sur hasta cambiar otra vez de mapa hacia (G-12). Camina hasta (H-7) y déjate caer a propósito hacia el sur al camino inferior. Luego camina al norte hasta que el camino se bifurca en (H-6) y ve al oeste hasta el Home Point de fuera del Cloister of Flames.",
    ["Unity warp to Quicksand Caves (level 125), head south, drop down on the east side of the drop, head south to a room, then west, then drop down on the west side of the next drop, and arrive at the Cloister of Tremors Home Point. If you mess up either of these drops, Warp out and try again."] = "Usa el Unity warp a Quicksand Caves (nivel 125), ve al sur, déjate caer por el lado este de la caída, ve al sur hasta una sala, luego al oeste, déjate caer por el lado oeste de la siguiente caída y llegarás al Home Point del Cloister of Tremors. Si fallas alguna de estas caídas, teletranspórtate fuera y vuelve a intentarlo.",
    ["Unity warp to The Boyahda Tree (level 125) to be dropped into the middle of the dungeon. From here, run south to the zone line to the Cloister of Storms and touch the Home Point next to it."] = "Usa el Unity warp a The Boyahda Tree (nivel 125) para aparecer en mitad de la mazmorra. Desde ahí, corre al sur hasta el límite de zona del Cloister of Storms y toca el Home Point de al lado.",
    ["Unity warp to Yhoator Jungle (level 122), then walk west into a clearing and south through a tunnel to reach the Outpost at (I-8), which has a Survival Guide."] = "Usa el Unity warp a Yhoator Jungle (nivel 122), camina al oeste hasta un claro y al sur por un túnel hasta el Outpost de (I-8), que tiene una Survival Guide.",
    ["Unity warp to Yuhtunga Jungle (level 119) and ride a chocobo generally northward (although there's a tunnel where you have to go a bit east along the way) to the Kazham zone line at G-5 for the Home Point in Kazham."] = "Usa el Unity warp a Yuhtunga Jungle (nivel 119) y monta un chocobo en dirección norte en general (aunque hay un túnel en el que tienes que ir un poco al este por el camino) hasta el límite de zona de Kazham en G-5, para el Home Point de Kazham.",
    ["Unity warp to the Den of Rancor (level 128). Head straight north through the big room to (H-6), and take the path on the right to go back up to the first level. Once there, take a left at (H-4), enter a big room and take the first exit on the left at (H-6). Go straight ahead, through a large room, to (J-7), where there's a hole. Drop down it and walk northeast to the Home Point outside the Cloister of Tides."] = "Usa el Unity warp a Den of Rancor (nivel 128). Ve recto al norte por la sala grande hasta (H-6) y toma el camino de la derecha para volver a subir al primer nivel. Una vez allí, gira a la izquierda en (H-4), entra en una sala grande y toma la primera salida a la izquierda en (H-6). Sigue recto, por una sala grande, hasta (J-7), donde hay un agujero. Déjate caer por él y camina al noreste hasta el Home Point de fuera del Cloister of Tides.",
    ["Up to 6 can enter, each with their own Vial of dream incense; the limit is 30 minutes. Diabolos Prime uses Drain, Aspir, Sleepga II, Dispelga, Blindga, Noctoshield (Phalanx), Dream Shroud (magic attack and defense up), Camisado, Nether Blast, Ultimate Terror (stat down), Nightmare (sleep plus damage over time) and Ruinous Omen (Astral Flow, HP cut by a random percentage). Floor tiles vanish during the fight, dropping you among the Diremites."] = "Pueden entrar hasta 6, cada uno con su propio Vial of dream incense; el límite es de 30 minutos. Diabolos Prime usa Drain, Aspir, Sleepga II, Dispelga, Blindga, Noctoshield (Phalanx), Dream Shroud (sube ataque y defensa mágicos), Camisado, Nether Blast, Ultimate Terror (baja atributos), Nightmare (sueño más daño continuo) y Ruinous Omen (Astral Flow, HP reducido en un porcentaje aleatorio). Las baldosas del suelo desaparecen durante la pelea y te dejan caer entre los Diremites.",
    ["Up to six people can enter; there's no level cap, buffs wear on entry, and Trusts can be summoned. You receive your reward right after the cutscene that follows the fight."] = "Pueden entrar hasta seis personas; no hay límite de nivel, los buffs se pierden al entrar y se pueden invocar Trusts. Recibes la recompensa justo después de la escena que sigue a la pelea.",
    ["Upon arrival at Navukgo Execution Chamber, trade the Testimony to the Decorative Bronze Gate to begin the battle. Shamarhaan is accompanied by his automaton Valkeng, so prepare for a fight against both of them. The time limit is 10 minutes."] = "Al llegar a la Navukgo Execution Chamber, entrega el Testimony a la Decorative Bronze Gate para comenzar la batalla. Shamarhaan va acompañado de su autómata Valkeng, así que prepárate para luchar contra ambos. El límite de tiempo es de 10 minutos.",
    ["Upon defeating Maat for the last time, speak with him to receive the cutscene and your new Maat's Cap."] = "Al derrotar a Maat por última vez, habla con él para recibir la escena y tu nueva Maat's Cap.",
    ["Upon defeating the battlefield you receive the Whisper of radiance. Examine the Imperial Whitegate in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (L-8/9) for a cutscene."] = "Al derrotar el campo de batalla recibes el Whisper of radiance. Examina la Imperial Whitegate en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (L-8/9) para una escena.",
    ["Uptala in Ve'Lugannon Palace: rifts at (D-5), (G-13) and (M-8)."] = "Uptala en Ve'Lugannon Palace: rifts en (D-5), (G-13) y (M-8).",
    ["Uran-Mafran uses Manafont repeatedly (clearing debuffs), has heavy fast cast and regain, casts Meteor, Comet, Impact and AoE enfeebles, resists Silence, and self-skillchains Black Halo into tier VI magic bursts for 10,000+. Wear DT gear; Trust tanks won't survive the bursts. The win still counts if you die."] = "Uran-Mafran usa Manafont repetidamente (quitándose los debuffs), tiene mucho fast cast y regain, lanza Meteor, Comet, Impact y debilitamientos de área, resiste Silence y se hace skillchains con Black Halo seguidos de magic bursts de nivel VI de más de 10,000. Lleva equipo de DT; los Trusts tanque no aguantan los bursts. La victoria cuenta aunque mueras.",
    ["Urbiolaine in Southern San d'Oria (G-10)"] = "Urbiolaine en Southern San d'Oria (G-10)",
    ["Use 15 or more imprimaturs on completed Coalition Assignments. Higher Adoulin fame lowers the requirement; finishing quests such as I'm on a Boat helps."] = "Usa 15 o más imprimaturs en Coalition Assignments completadas. Más fama de Adoulin reduce el requisito; terminar quests como I'm on a Boat ayuda.",
    ["Use 200 Imperial Standing to travel to the staging point, or use an Assault tag to enter Nyzul Isle Investigation and reach Alzadaal Undersea Ruins."] = "Usa 200 Imperial Standing para viajar al staging point, o usa un Assault tag para entrar en Nyzul Isle Investigation y llegar a Alzadaal Undersea Ruins.",
    ["Use Hatchets on Logging Points around (F-7), (F-10), (J-6) and (J/K-10/11) until you get the key item Length of Jugner Ivy (likely but not certain; with a full inventory the game has to give you the key item). Return to the Overgrown Mushrooms for another cutscene."] = "Usa Hatchets en los Logging Points de alrededor de (F-7), (F-10), (J-6) y (J/K-10/11) hasta conseguir el key item Length of Jugner Ivy (probable pero no seguro; con el inventario lleno el juego tiene que darte el key item). Vuelve a los Overgrown Mushrooms para otra escena.",
    ["Use Lower Delkfutt's Tower HP Warp #1"] = "Usa el warp al Home Point #1 de Lower Delkfutt's Tower",
    ["Use Mistmelts when Ouryu takes flight."] = "Usa Mistmelts cuando Ouryu eche a volar.",
    ["Use Prism Powder while traveling through areas guarded by True Sight Hippogryphs."] = "Usa Prism Powder mientras viajas por zonas vigiladas por True Sight Hippogryphs.",
    ["Use Scavenge at the pool until you get the Old Earring; it can take more than one try."] = "Usa Scavenge en el estanque hasta conseguir el Old Earring; puede llevar más de un intento.",
    ["Use Shu'Meyo Salt during the battle to extend the time available when needed, then return to Cid (H-8) after all three paths are complete."] = "Usa Shu'Meyo Salt durante la batalla para ampliar el tiempo disponible cuando haga falta, luego vuelve con Cid (H-8) cuando los tres caminos estén completos.",
    ["Use Sneak and Invisible (or Silent Oil and Prism Powder) before the big room: the Gefryst detect magic, the worms detect sound, and the rabbits and snolls detect sight."] = "Usa Sneak e Invisible (o Silent Oil y Prism Powder) antes de la sala grande: los Gefryst detectan magia, los gusanos sonido, y los conejos y snolls vista.",
    ["Use Sneak and Invisible past the Bats and Bombs: left at the first intersection, right at the next, to the ??? in the lava flow around (H-7) on Map 1. Buff up (Barfira helps) and trade it the Adaman Ore."] = "Usa Sneak e Invisible para pasar los murciélagos y las bombas: izquierda en el primer cruce, derecha en el siguiente, hasta la ??? en el flujo de lava alrededor de (H-7) en el mapa 1. Poténciate (Barfira ayuda) y entrégale el Adaman Ore.",
    ["Use Sneak and Invisible while traveling through the aqueducts."] = "Usa Sneak e Invisible mientras avanzas por los acueductos.",
    ["Use Sneak and go down to the ??? at the foot of the cliff, directly below. Examining it spawns three level 68 NM ghosts: Dervo's Ghost, Gizerl's Ghost and Gordov's Ghost. You can pull Gordov's Ghost and wait for the others to leave, or defeat all three."] = "Usa Sneak y baja hasta la ??? al pie del acantilado, justo debajo. Examinarla hace aparecer tres NMs fantasma de nivel 68: Dervo's Ghost, Gizerl's Ghost y Gordov's Ghost. Puedes atraer a Gordov's Ghost y esperar a que los otros se vayan, o derrotar a los tres.",
    ["Use Sneak, go to (E-7/8) and speak with Couchatorage by the Sewer Lid to drop down to Map 2 (pick up the Survival Guide nearby if this is your first visit). Follow the right wall until you zone into West Ronfaure at (E-8); the ??? is right in front of you. Shortcuts once unlocked: Unity Warp (level 122) to Bostaunieux Oubliette or the West Ronfaure Proto-Waypoint."] = "Usa Sneak, ve a (E-7/8) y habla con Couchatorage junto a la Sewer Lid para bajar al mapa 2 (coge la Survival Guide cercana si es tu primera visita). Sigue la pared derecha hasta salir a West Ronfaure en (E-8); la ??? está justo delante de ti. Atajos una vez desbloqueados: Unity Warp (nivel 122) a Bostaunieux Oubliette o el Proto-Waypoint de West Ronfaure.",
    ["Use Upper Delkfutt's Tower HP Warp #1"] = "Usa el warp al Home Point #1 de Upper Delkfutt's Tower",
    ["Use a Ratstail Explosive on explosive wall (G-8/9)."] = "Usa un Ratstail Explosive en la explosive wall (G-8/9).",
    ["Use a Ratstail Explosive on explosive wall (H/I-9)."] = "Usa un Ratstail Explosive en la explosive wall (H/I-9).",
    ["Use a Ratstail Explosive on southeast explosive wall (I-9)."] = "Usa un Ratstail Explosive en la explosive wall sureste (I-9).",
    ["Use a Unity Concord warp to the Temple of Uggalepih (level 125), or walk: enter from Yhoator Jungle (J-12), go south at (J-7), north at (H-9) and north again at (G-7) to come back out into Yhoator Jungle, then head left and re-enter the Temple at (H-11), careful not to fall off the ledge."] = "Usa un warp de Unity Concord al Temple of Uggalepih (nivel 125), o camina: entra desde Yhoator Jungle (J-12), ve al sur en (J-7), al norte en (H-9) y de nuevo al norte en (G-7) para salir otra vez a Yhoator Jungle, luego ve a la izquierda y vuelve a entrar en el Temple por (H-11), con cuidado de no caer de la cornisa.",
    ["Use another Ratstail Explosive on explosive wall (H-8)."] = "Usa otro Ratstail Explosive en la explosive wall (H-8).",
    ["Use enough imprimaturs and earn Adoulin fame. 15 imprimaturs used plus fame level 2 (quests such as I'm on a Boat, Western Waypoints Ho!, Eastern Waypoints Ho! and The Old Man and the Harpoon) is enough."] = "Usa suficientes imprimaturs y gana fama de Adoulin. Con 15 imprimaturs usados y fama de nivel 2 (quests como I'm on a Boat, Western Waypoints Ho!, Eastern Waypoints Ho! y The Old Man and the Harpoon) basta.",
    ["Use the (I-7) Bhaflau Thickets entrance to Aydeewa Subterrane (not the Survival Guide entrance) and find the ??? at (H-8) after sliding down the ramp. Trade the Colorful Hair for a cutscene."] = "Usa la entrada (I-7) de Bhaflau Thickets a Aydeewa Subterrane (no la entrada de la Survival Guide) y encuentra la ??? en (H-8) tras deslizarte por la rampa. Entrega el Colorful Hair para una escena.",
    ["Use the Chaosbringer to slay 100 more enemies. If you discarded your Chaosbringer, take the boat from Palborough Mines to Zeruhn Mines to receive a new one from Zeid; this resets the blade, so you will have to kill a total of 200 monsters with it to complete the quest."] = "Usa el Chaosbringer para matar 100 enemigos más. Si descartaste tu Chaosbringer, toma el barco de Palborough Mines a Zeruhn Mines para recibir uno nuevo de Zeid; esto reinicia la hoja, así que tendrás que matar un total de 200 monstruos con él para completar la quest.",
    ["Use the Garlaige Key to enter the Incinerator room at (I-7) on map 3. The quest Rubbish Day also sends you there, so it is recommended to do both at the same time."] = "Usa la Garlaige Key para entrar en la sala del Incinerator en (I-7) del mapa 3. La quest Rubbish Day también te envía allí, así que se recomienda hacer ambas a la vez.",
    ["Use the Memory Receptacle to reach the fifth floor."] = "Usa el Memory Receptacle para llegar al quinto piso.",
    ["Use the Memory Receptacle to reach the fourth floor."] = "Usa el Memory Receptacle para llegar al cuarto piso.",
    ["Use the Paintbrush of souls on the empty Picture frame to open the door to the Den of Rancor. Faster: Den of Rancor Home Point #2; from Home Point #1, go to point A (I-5) on map 2 to reach map 1. The Unity Warp to Den of Rancor (level 128) skips the Paintbrush."] = "Usa el Paintbrush of souls en el Picture frame vacío para abrir la puerta a Den of Rancor. Más rápido: el Home Point #2 de Den of Rancor; desde el Home Point #1, ve al punto A (I-5) del mapa 2 para llegar al mapa 1. El Unity Warp a Den of Rancor (nivel 128) evita el Paintbrush.",
    ["Use the Runic Portal to return to Aht Urhgan Whitegate."] = "Usa el Runic Portal para volver a Aht Urhgan Whitegate.",
    ["Use the Sahagin Key on the Ornamental Door (J-11) (only one party member needs a key)."] = "Usa la Sahagin Key en la Ornamental Door (J-11) (solo un miembro del grupo necesita llave).",
    ["Use the Spatial Displacement to progress through the area."] = "Usa el Spatial Displacement para avanzar por la zona.",
    ["Use the geyser to go up the ledge"] = "Usa el géiser para subir a la cornisa",
    ["Use the handles in front of the door to activate the trap door on purpose and fall down it."] = "Usa las manijas frente a la puerta para activar a propósito la trampilla y caer por ella.",
    ["Use the key on a chest inside to receive the key item Torn-out pages."] = "Usa la llave en un cofre del interior para recibir el key item Torn-out pages.",
    ["Use the key to open a chest in the zone to receive a Guiding bell."] = "Usa la llave para abrir un cofre de la zona y recibir una Guiding bell.",
    ["Use the key to open a chest inside the castle to receive a Beast Collar."] = "Usa la llave para abrir un cofre dentro del castillo y recibir un Beast Collar.",
    ["Use the red portals in Ru'Aun Gardens to reach the five La'Loff Amphitheater battlefields."] = "Usa los portales rojos de Ru'Aun Gardens para llegar a los cinco campos de batalla del La'Loff Amphitheater.",
    ["Use the sparkling blue ???, not the white one."] = "Usa la ??? azul brillante, no la blanca.",
    ["Use the transporter at (G-4) to return to the second map."] = "Usa el transportador en (G-4) para volver al segundo mapa.",
    ["Use the weight device at (G-8) and reach the ??? at (H-8) in front of the mural."] = "Usa el dispositivo de peso en (G-8) y llega a la ??? en (H-8) frente al mural.",
    ["Valaineral for tanking and annihilating low-level enemies with Uriel Blade."] = "Valaineral para tanquear y arrasar enemigos de nivel bajo con Uriel Blade.",
    ["Valkurm Dunes at (I-9) (This is the one I recommended touching earlier. In case you used another, I'm listing it here too.)"] = "Valkurm Dunes en (I-9) (Es el que recomendé tocar antes. Por si usaste otro, también lo pongo aquí.)",
    ["Valkurm Dunes has a tunnel starting at (C-6) and heading south that isn't shown on the map. Going through it will eventually put you at the zone line to Gustav Tunnel, which has a Survival Guide right at the entrance. (This tunnel connects to Cape Teriggan.)"] = "Valkurm Dunes tiene un túnel que empieza en (C-6) y va al sur que no aparece en el mapa. Cruzarlo acabará dejándote en el límite de zona de Gustav Tunnel, que tiene una Survival Guide justo en la entrada. (Este túnel conecta con Cape Teriggan.)",
    ["Venture down take the right fork. Past the Ladon and Greater Cockatrice you will see Kuftal Delver and further in are the Machairodus."] = "Baja y toma el ramal derecho. Pasados los Ladon y las Greater Cockatrice verás los Kuftal Delver, y más adentro están los Machairodus.",
    ["Visit Cavernous Maw (E-4) in La Theine Plateau, Cavernous Maw (I-12) in Konschtat Highlands, or Cavernous Maw (H-12) in Tahrongi Canyon."] = "Visita el Cavernous Maw (E-4) en La Theine Plateau, el Cavernous Maw (I-12) en Konschtat Highlands o el Cavernous Maw (H-12) en Tahrongi Canyon.",
    ["Visit Cavernous Maw (J-10) in South Gustaberg, Cavernous Maw (H-8) in Xarcabard, or Cavernous Maw (G-6) in North Gustaberg."] = "Visita el Cavernous Maw (J-10) en South Gustaberg, el Cavernous Maw (H-8) en Xarcabard o el Cavernous Maw (G-6) en North Gustaberg.",
    ["Visit Cavernous Maw (J-8) in Jugner Forest, Cavernous Maw (I-9) in Valkurm Dunes, or Cavernous Maw (F-7) in Buburimu Peninsula."] = "Visita el Cavernous Maw (J-8) en Jugner Forest, el Cavernous Maw (I-9) en Valkurm Dunes o el Cavernous Maw (F-7) en Buburimu Peninsula.",
    ["Visit Paul (H-5), Biggorf (H-10) and Wilhelmina (I-9) in Bastok Markets (S), in any order, then return to Gentle Tiger (H-6) for a cutscene."] = "Visita a Paul (H-5), Biggorf (H-10) y Wilhelmina (I-9) en Bastok Markets (S), en cualquier orden, y vuelve con Gentle Tiger (H-6) para una escena.",
    ["Visit at least three of these eight Strange Apparatuses (often behind invisible walls). At each, use its rune three times, then examine the Hazy Rune for that rune's Stone key item: Dangruf Wadi (E-11) Unda, Stone of Unda; Gusgen Mines map 2 (J-5) Flabra, Stone of Flabra; Crawlers' Nest map 3 (K-8) Sulpor, Stone of Sulpor; Ordelle's Caves (E-12) Gelus, Stone of Gelus; Outer Horutoto Ruins map 5 (E-6) Tellus, Stone of Tellus, from the north tower in West Sarutabaruta (the Voidwatch warp lands at the right tower); Garlaige Citadel map 3 (K-8) Tenebrae, Stone of Tenebrae, behind Banishing Gate #2."] = "Visita al menos tres de estos ocho Strange Apparatuses (a menudo tras paredes invisibles). En cada uno, usa su runa tres veces y luego examina la Hazy Rune para obtener el key item Stone de esa runa: Dangruf Wadi (E-11) Unda, Stone of Unda; Gusgen Mines mapa 2 (J-5) Flabra, Stone of Flabra; Crawlers' Nest mapa 3 (K-8) Sulpor, Stone of Sulpor; Ordelle's Caves (E-12) Gelus, Stone of Gelus; Outer Horutoto Ruins mapa 5 (E-6) Tellus, Stone of Tellus, desde la torre norte de West Sarutabaruta (el warp de Voidwatch te deja en la torre correcta); Garlaige Citadel mapa 3 (K-8) Tenebrae, Stone of Tenebrae, tras la Banishing Gate #2.",
    ["Visit the three Halls of Transference and enter Promyvion-Dem, Promyvion-Mea, and Promyvion-Holla in any order."] = "Visita las tres Halls of Transference y entra en Promyvion-Dem, Promyvion-Mea y Promyvion-Holla en cualquier orden.",
    ["Visit the three magicite locations in any order."] = "Visita las tres ubicaciones de magicite en cualquier orden.",
    ["Volker - Speak to Lucius in the Metalworks at (I-9)."] = "Volker: habla con Lucius en Metalworks en (I-9).",
    ["Volker, Zeid, Valli, Oshasha and Romaa Mihgo help; you lose only if all five fall. The Shadow Lord swaps between dual-wield (Blighting Blitz can one-shot everyone but Valli) and two-hand stances, dispels with a conal attack (four shadows absorb it), and uses Mighty Strikes and Blood Weapon repeatedly."] = "Volker, Zeid, Valli, Oshasha y Romaa Mihgo ayudan; solo pierdes si caen los cinco. El Shadow Lord alterna entre doble arma (Blighting Blitz puede matar de un golpe a todos menos a Valli) y arma a dos manos, disipa con un ataque en cono (cuatro sombras lo absorben) y usa Mighty Strikes y Blood Weapon repetidamente.",
    ["Wait 2 game days and return to Valgeir for the key item Land crab bisque."] = "Espera 2 días de juego y vuelve con Valgeir para obtener el key item Land crab bisque.",
    ["Wait 8 Earth hours after completing Expertise. Speak with Rycharde in Mhaura (H-8), upstairs in the Sailors' Stay, and accept his request."] = "Espera 8 horas reales tras completar Expertise. Habla con Rycharde en Mhaura (H-8), arriba en el Sailors' Stay, y acepta su encargo.",
    ["Wait 8 Vana'diel days after completing His Name Is Valgeir to begin this quest. Speak with Take in Mhaura (I-8), inside the Sailor's Stay. She wants you to bring back one of Valgeir's dishes from Selbina."] = "Espera 8 días de Vana'diel tras completar His Name Is Valgeir para empezar esta quest. Habla con Take en Mhaura (I-8), dentro del Sailor's Stay. Quiere que le traigas uno de los platos de Valgeir de Selbina.",
    ["Wait a game day (until the clock rolls past 00:00), then speak with Deidogg for your reward."] = "Espera un día de juego (hasta que el reloj pase de las 00:00) y habla con Deidogg para tu recompensa.",
    ["Wait a game day and speak with Fari-Wari to complete the quest and receive 1,000 Imperial Standing and an Imperial Gold Piece."] = "Espera un día de juego y habla con Fari-Wari para completar la quest y recibir 1,000 Imperial Standing y una Imperial Gold Piece.",
    ["Wait a game day and zone at least once, then return to Abquhbah for a cutscene. Choose \"Helping his fellow mercenaries\" to complete the quest. You receive the LC Wildcat badge, access to LC Assaults, and a varying amount of Imperial currency, up to 2 Imperial Gold Pieces."] = "Espera un día de juego y cambia de zona al menos una vez, luego vuelve con Abquhbah para una escena. Elige \"Helping his fellow mercenaries\" para completar la quest. Recibes el LC Wildcat badge, acceso a los LC Assaults y una cantidad variable de moneda Imperial, hasta 2 Imperial Gold Pieces.",
    ["Wait a game day and zone, then speak with Naja Salaheem again."] = "Espera un día de juego, cambia de zona y vuelve a hablar con Naja Salaheem.",
    ["Wait for the next game day and zone."] = "Espera al siguiente día de juego y cambia de zona.",
    ["Wait for the next game day, zone, and speak with Amaura again for the key item Bottle of treant tonic. If you're on the quest To Cure a Cough, you may need to talk to her more than once."] = "Espera al siguiente día de juego, cambia de zona y vuelve a hablar con Amaura para obtener el key item Bottle of treant tonic. Si estás en la quest To Cure a Cough, puede que tengas que hablar con ella más de una vez.",
    ["Wait on the bridge and speak with Quemaricond (H-7) to receive the Royal Knights' Davoi Report."] = "Espera en el puente y habla con Quemaricond (H-7) para recibir el Royal Knights' Davoi Report.",
    ["Wait one Earth minute after the previous mission."] = "Espera un minuto real tras la misión anterior.",
    ["Wait one Earth minute, then leave the Chateau into Northern San d'Oria for a cutscene that completes the mission."] = "Espera un minuto real y sal del Chateau hacia Northern San d'Oria para una escena que completa la misión.",
    ["Wait one Earth minute, then speak with Kerutoto again; she gives the ribbon back. If you can take on Waking Dreams, you have to accept the Diabolos fight before she moves on."] = "Espera un minuto real y vuelve a hablar con Kerutoto; te devuelve la cinta. Si puedes aceptar Waking Dreams, tienes que aceptar la pelea con Diabolos antes de que continúe.",
    ["Wait one Vana'diel day after Fire in the Hole, then enter Bastok Markets (S) from North Gustaberg (S) for a cutscene. You must have received the Elixir from Blatherix after Burden of Suspicion."] = "Espera un día de Vana'diel tras Fire in the Hole y luego entra en Bastok Markets (S) desde North Gustaberg (S) para una escena. Debes haber recibido el Elixir de Blatherix tras Burden of Suspicion.",
    ["Wait one Vana'diel day after Gifts of the Griffon."] = "Espera un día de Vana'diel tras Gifts of the Griffon.",
    ["Wait one Vana'diel day after In a Haze of Glory, then change zones."] = "Espera un día de Vana'diel tras In a Haze of Glory y luego cambia de zona.",
    ["Wait one Vana'diel day after Wrath of the Griffon, then change zones and speak with Rholont (E-7) in Southern San d'Oria (S)."] = "Espera un día de Vana'diel tras Wrath of the Griffon, luego cambia de zona y habla con Rholont (E-7) en Southern San d'Oria (S).",
    ["Wait one Vana'diel day and change zones."] = "Espera un día de Vana'diel y cambia de zona.",
    ["Wait one Vana'diel day and return to the Optistery to receive the Scroll of Retrace."] = "Espera un día de Vana'diel y vuelve al Optistery para recibir el Scroll of Retrace.",
    ["Wait one Vana'diel day."] = "Espera un día de Vana'diel.",
    ["Wait one game day after Curilla Unleashed. Meanwhile, get a Doll Gizmo for the next mission: Auction House (Others > Misc. 1), or 100% from the Manipulator patrolling the big room on Temple of Uggalepih Map 2 at (I-10)/(J-10) (15-minute respawn; Proto-Waypoint is closest)."] = "Espera un día de juego tras Curilla Unleashed. Mientras tanto, consigue un Doll Gizmo para la misión siguiente: Auction House (Others > Misc. 1), o al 100% del Manipulator que patrulla la sala grande del mapa 2 del Temple of Uggalepih en (I-10)/(J-10) (reaparece cada 15 minutos; el Proto-Waypoint es el más cercano).",
    ["Wait one game day and zone after completing the previous quest. Speak with Hiwon-Biwon in Windurst Walls (K-8), then with Shantotto (K-8)."] = "Espera un día de juego y cambia de zona tras completar la quest anterior. Habla con Hiwon-Biwon en Windurst Walls (K-8) y luego con Shantotto (K-8).",
    ["Wait one in-game day since completing Beginnings and re-zone into Aht Urhgan Whitegate if you have not already. You need to be a Blue Mage of level 50 or higher."] = "Espera un día de juego tras completar Beginnings y vuelve a cambiar de zona a Aht Urhgan Whitegate si aún no lo has hecho. Debes ser Blue Mage de nivel 50 o superior.",
    ["Wait one minute, then speak to Ceraulian again (you may need to zone). Speaking with Miaux after this gives bonus dialogue."] = "Espera un minuto y vuelve a hablar con Ceraulian (puede que tengas que cambiar de zona). Hablar después con Miaux da diálogo extra.",
    ["Wait until 0:00 to 3:00 game time. At any other time the tree says nothing is out of the ordinary; during those hours you get the message \"A frost deposit at the base of the tree twinkles in the starlight.\""] = "Espera de 0:00 a 3:00 hora del juego. A cualquier otra hora el árbol no dice nada fuera de lo normal; durante esas horas recibes el mensaje \"A frost deposit at the base of the tree twinkles in the starlight.\"",
    ["Wait until after Japanese midnight."] = "Espera hasta después de la medianoche japonesa.",
    ["Wait until everyone in your party is in Lufaise Meadows before speaking with Travonce; anyone not there cannot take part. The level cap for the escort is 45, Trust magic cannot be used, and uncapped helpers cannot cast on the capped players or on the monsters Travonce fishes up."] = "Espera a que todo tu grupo esté en Lufaise Meadows antes de hablar con Travonce; quien no esté allí no puede participar. El límite de nivel de la escolta es 45, no se puede usar Trust magic, y los ayudantes sin límite de nivel no pueden lanzar hechizos a los jugadores limitados ni a los monstruos que pesca Travonce.",
    ["Wait until midnight (JST), then speak with Mamaulabion once more to receive the Evoker's Ring."] = "Espera hasta medianoche (JST) y habla de nuevo con Mamaulabion para recibir el Evoker's Ring.",
    ["Wait until one Earth minute has passed and speak with Mulaujeant again to be given the Sublime statue of the Goddess."] = "Espera a que pase un minuto terrestre y habla otra vez con Mulaujeant para que te dé la Sublime statue of the Goddess.",
    ["Wait until the next Vana'diel day after Undying Light."] = "Espera al siguiente día de Vana'diel después de Undying Light.",
    ["Wait until the next Vana'diel day after the previous mission if necessary."] = "Si hace falta, espera al siguiente día de Vana'diel tras la misión anterior.",
    ["Wait until the next Vana'diel day after the previous mission."] = "Espera al siguiente día de Vana'diel tras la misión anterior.",
    ["Wait until the next Vana'diel day and speak with Kocco Ehllek (H-8) again to receive the reward."] = "Espera al siguiente día de Vana'diel y habla de nuevo con Kocco Ehllek (H-8) para recibir la recompensa.",
    ["Wait until the next Vana'diel day before continuing."] = "Espera al siguiente día de Vana'diel antes de continuar.",
    ["Wait until the next Vana'diel day."] = "Espera al siguiente día de Vana'diel.",
    ["Wait until the next game day after For Whom the Bell Tolls. With Geomancer as your main job, speak with Sylvie at the Western Adoulin Waterfront (I-5), Waypoint #9. After this you can be on any job. Flagging the quest lets you commission the other three Geomancer Artifact pieces from Wescolina in Western Adoulin (H-7)."] = "Espera al siguiente día de juego tras For Whom the Bell Tolls. Con Geomancer como job principal, habla con Sylvie en el Waterfront de Western Adoulin (I-5), Waypoint #9. Después de esto puedes ir con cualquier job. Activar la quest te permite encargar las otras tres piezas de Artifact de Geomancer a Wescolina en Western Adoulin (H-7).",
    ["Wait until the next game day after The Bloodline of Zacariah. With Geomancer as your main job, speak with Sylvie at the Western Adoulin Waterfront (I-5), Waypoint #9. After this you can be on any job."] = "Espera al siguiente día de juego tras The Bloodline of Zacariah. Con Geomancer como job principal, habla con Sylvie en el Waterfront de Western Adoulin (I-5), Waypoint #9. Después de esto puedes ir con cualquier job.",
    ["Wait until the next game day after The Watergarden Coliseum."] = "Espera al siguiente día de juego tras The Watergarden Coliseum.",
    ["Wait until the next game day after the cutscene at the castle gates."] = "Espera al siguiente día de juego tras la escena en las puertas del castillo.",
    ["Wait until the next game day and examine the Inconspicuous Barrel again to complete the quest and receive the Runeist Trousers."] = "Espera al siguiente día de juego y examina de nuevo el Inconspicuous Barrel para completar la quest y recibir los Runeist Trousers.",
    ["Wait until the next game day and speak with Faulpie again to receive a Goblin Cutting and the recipe for a Goblin Coif. A lost cutting can be replaced for 100,000 gil."] = "Espera al siguiente día de juego y habla de nuevo con Faulpie para recibir un Goblin Cutting y la receta de un Goblin Coif. Un patrón perdido se puede reponer por 100,000 gil.",
    ["Wait until the next game day and speak with Faulpie again to receive an Orc Cutting and the recipe for an Orc Helm."] = "Espera al siguiente día de juego y habla de nuevo con Faulpie para recibir un Orc Cutting y la receta de un Orc Helm.",
    ["Wait until the next game day and speak with Peshi Yohnts again to receive Quadav Parts and the recipe for a Quadav Barbut."] = "Espera al siguiente día de juego y habla de nuevo con Peshi Yohnts para recibir Quadav Parts y la receta de un Quadav Barbut.",
    ["Wait until the next game day and speak with Ponono again for the Yagudo Cutting. Synthesize a Yagudo Headgear (Clothcraft 80, Leathercraft 50, Bonecraft 55, Earth Crystal): Yagudo Cutting, Bugard Tusk, Cockatrice Skin, Wool Thread, 2 Yagudo Feathers and 2 Black Pearls."] = "Espera al siguiente día de juego y habla de nuevo con Ponono para obtener el Yagudo Cutting. Sintetiza un Yagudo Headgear (Clothcraft 80, Leathercraft 50, Bonecraft 55, Earth Crystal): Yagudo Cutting, Bugard Tusk, Cockatrice Skin, Wool Thread, 2 Yagudo Feathers y 2 Black Pearls.",
    ["Wait until the next game day, then speak with Ghatsad again to receive your new automaton."] = "Espera al siguiente día de juego y habla de nuevo con Ghatsad para recibir tu nuevo autómata.",
    ["Wait until the next in-game day after completing Storms of Fate to activate this quest. If you reset your memories, this wait does not apply."] = "Espera hasta el siguiente día de juego tras completar Storms of Fate para activar esta quest. Si reseteas tus memorias, esta espera no se aplica.",
    ["Wait until the required transition has passed before continuing."] = "Espera a que pase la transición requerida antes de continuar.",
    ["Wait up to 1 minute after completing Behind the Smile. Talk with Enaremand in Tavnazian Safehold (J-7)."] = "Espera hasta 1 minuto tras completar Behind the Smile. Habla con Enaremand en Tavnazian Safehold (J-7).",
    ["Wajaom Woodlands/Bhaflau Thickets - levels 54-55 - Getting here requires completing Aht Urhgan Mission 2, but it's definitely worth it."] = "Wajaom Woodlands/Bhaflau Thickets - niveles 54-55 - Llegar aquí requiere completar la Aht Urhgan Mission 2, pero merece la pena.",
    ["Wajaom Woodlands/Bhaflau Thickets - levels 55-60 - Still Lesser Colibri. Love those birds."] = "Wajaom Woodlands/Bhaflau Thickets - niveles 55-60 - Siguen siendo los Lesser Colibri. Me encantan esos pájaros.",
    ["Walk beneath the roofed stall at (I-11) to trigger a cutscene."] = "Camina bajo el puesto con techo en (I-11) para activar una escena.",
    ["Walk downstairs to the pillar at (J-8) for a cutscene."] = "Baja las escaleras hasta el pilar en (J-8) para una escena.",
    ["Walk forward and examine Qe'lov Gate in Upper Delkfutt's Tower to enter the battlefield."] = "Avanza y examina la Qe'lov Gate en Upper Delkfutt's Tower para entrar en el campo de batalla.",
    ["Walk from Western Adoulin into Ceizak Battlegrounds for a cutscene. Don't use a waypoint."] = "Sal caminando de Western Adoulin a Ceizak Battlegrounds para una escena. No uses un waypoint.",
    ["Walk into Zeruhn Mines, directly connected to Bastok Mines, and grab the Guide right there. Kind of a weird place to put a Survival Guide, honestly. But heck, I use it."] = "Entra caminando en Zeruhn Mines, conectada directamente con Bastok Mines, y coge la Guide de allí mismo. Sinceramente, es un sitio raro para poner una Survival Guide. Pero bueno, yo la uso.",
    ["Walk into present-day Southern San d'Oria from East Ronfaure for a cutscene."] = "Entra caminando en la Southern San d'Oria del presente desde East Ronfaure para una escena.",
    ["Walk into the Palace in Ru'Lude Gardens for the cutscene in which you receive the key item Note written by Esha'ntarl. It is a different cutscene from the one that ended Storms of Fate, which does not give a key item."] = "Entra en el Palace de Ru'Lude Gardens para la escena en la que recibes el key item Note written by Esha'ntarl. Es una escena distinta de la que terminó Storms of Fate, que no da key item.",
    ["Walk out of the Bay back to Buburimu Peninsula, head up the ramp from the beach you're currently on, and then go to the other beach at (K-7). There's a cave in the north cliff face that leads to the Labyrinth of Onzozo, which has a Survival Guide at its entrance. (There's also a Unity warp to Onzozo, but it drops you off deep in the zone with level 60 mobs and you're already here. No point being stupid about it all.)"] = "Sal de la bahía a Buburimu Peninsula, sube la rampa desde la playa en la que estás y ve a la otra playa en (K-7). Hay una cueva en el acantilado norte que lleva a Labyrinth of Onzozo, que tiene una Survival Guide en la entrada. (También hay un Unity warp a Onzozo, pero te deja muy adentro de la zona con monstruos de nivel 60, y ya estás aquí. No tiene sentido complicarse.)",
    ["Walk south to the pond around (J-8)."] = "Camina al sur hasta el estanque, cerca de (J-8).",
    ["Walk to (I-11), down the ramp beside the ferry, for a cutscene to obtain the key item Letter from Bernahn."] = "Camina hasta (I-11), por la rampa junto al ferry, para una escena y obtener el key item Letter from Bernahn.",
    ["Walk to Transcendental Radiance."] = "Camina hasta la Transcendental Radiance.",
    ["Walk to the small circular room at (I-8) with the altar in it; watch for the Orcish Warlord that roams the area, which sees through Sneak and Invisible. After clearing the Orcs, examine the altar to spawn Bugaboo."] = "Camina hasta la pequeña sala circular de (I-8) con el altar; vigila al Orcish Warlord que patrulla la zona, que ve a través de Sneak e Invisible. Tras limpiar los Orcs, examina el altar para hacer aparecer a Bugaboo.",
    ["Walk towards the crates at (F-9)."] = "Camina hacia las cajas en (F-9).",
    ["Walking: leave Norg south on foot to Sea Serpent Grotto and follow the tunnel south to the dead end by a torch at (H-6). Open the hidden (blank-named) door, go left to (J-5), then right to the one-way drop at (K-7). Hug the left wall past the Ornamented Door (J-10) to the big room at (K-11)."] = "A pie: sal de Norg hacia el sur hasta Sea Serpent Grotto y sigue el túnel al sur hasta el callejón sin salida junto a una antorcha en (H-6). Abre la puerta oculta (sin nombre), ve a la izquierda hasta (J-5) y luego a la derecha hasta la caída de un solo sentido de (K-7). Pégate a la pared izquierda pasando la Ornamented Door (J-10) hasta la sala grande de (K-11).",
    ["Warning: Trust magic cannot be used in the final battle at the Full Moon Fountain."] = "Advertencia: la Trust magic no se puede usar en la batalla final de la Full Moon Fountain.",
    ["Warp Ring has an eight second cooldown, so the makes sure you wait long enough before you try to use it. Ring1 is the left ring slot and ring2 is the right ring. (If you look at your character's equipment window, you'll see why - they're in that left-to-right order and labelled.)"] = "El Warp Ring tiene una recarga de ocho segundos, así que la espera asegura que aguardas lo suficiente antes de intentar usarlo. Ring1 es la ranura del anillo izquierdo y ring2 la del derecho. (Si miras la ventana de equipo de tu personaje verás por qué: están en ese orden de izquierda a derecha y etiquetadas.)",
    ["Warp to Ethereal Ingress #5 and run west along the path. Watch for True Sight Hippogryphs."] = "Teletranspórtate al Ethereal Ingress #5 y corre al oeste por el camino. Cuidado con los Hippogryphs con True Sight.",
    ["Warp to HP #1. Use Sneak and Invisible then enter the big room."] = "Teletranspórtate al Home Point #1. Usa Sneak e Invisible y entra en la sala grande.",
    ["Warp to The Garden of Ru'Hmet Home Point #1 and pass through the Cermet Portal to the main elevator."] = "Teletranspórtate al Home Point #1 de The Garden of Ru'Hmet y cruza el Cermet Portal hasta el ascensor principal.",
    ["Warp to Windurst Walls Home Point #3 and speak with Shantotto (K-7) at her manor (K-7) for a cutscene."] = "Teletranspórtate al Home Point #3 de Windurst Walls y habla con Shantotto (K-7) en su mansión (K-7) para una escena.",
    ["Warp to the Norg HP or Survival Guide (they're in the same place), then walk out into Sea Serpent Grotto. Walk forward and through the door in the wall, then hug the left wall until you reach a Survival Guide at M-3, right before the tunnel's exit."] = "Teletranspórtate al HP o a la Survival Guide de Norg (están en el mismo sitio) y sal caminando a Sea Serpent Grotto. Avanza y cruza la puerta de la pared, luego pégate a la pared izquierda hasta llegar a una Survival Guide en M-3, justo antes de la salida del túnel.",
    ["Watch out Eschan Snapweeds and Wasps Aggro and link pull and camp and Portal #4"] = "Cuidado: los Eschan Snapweeds y Wasps atacan y se enlazan; atráelos y acampa en el Portal #4",
    ["Watch out for Ose and Narasimha"] = "Cuidado con Ose y Narasimha",
    ["Watch out for the level 139-142 Apex monsters (true sound) and go around them. To go back down a floor, use an empty receptacle platform."] = "Cuidado con los monstruos Apex de nivel 139-142 (true sound) y rodéalos. Para bajar un piso, usa una plataforma de receptáculo vacía.",
    ["Watch out for the other aggro:"] = "Cuidado con lo demás que ataca:",
    ["Watch out the Coeurls aggro and link and if you kill enough may pop an NM that will wipe your party."] = "Cuidado: los Coeurls atacan y se enlazan, y si matas suficientes puede aparecer un NM que acabará con tu grupo.",
    ["Watch out: the Eschan Corse and Eschan Sorceror have some aggro range to them and the Eschan Vultures will link up, best strategy is to pull and camp closer by portal #4."] = "Cuidado: el Eschan Corse y el Eschan Sorceror atacan desde cierta distancia y los Eschan Vultures se enlazan; lo mejor es atraerlos y acampar cerca del portal #4.",
    ["Watch the cutscene that starts after the fight."] = "Mira la escena que empieza tras la pelea.",
    ["Water route: enter Ordelle's Caves at La Theine Plateau (F-7) (or the Survival Guide), go east to exit B at (I-6) onto map 1, down to (G-8), east into the south tunnel (exit D) at (H-9), up the stairs and south to the second hole at the (H-11)/(H-12) border and drop down. Go east into tunnel E (map 3), south from (I-6) to (H-9) and west out to La Theine Plateau; the headstone is at the end of the valley at (G-11). The La Theine Geomagnetic Fount is on a ledge right there."] = "Ruta de agua: entra en Ordelle's Caves por La Theine Plateau (F-7) (o con la Survival Guide), ve al este a la salida B de (I-6) hacia el mapa 1, baja hasta (G-8), al este al túnel sur (salida D) en (H-9), sube las escaleras y ve al sur hasta el segundo agujero en el límite de (H-11)/(H-12) y déjate caer. Ve al este por el túnel E (mapa 3), al sur desde (I-6) hasta (H-9) y al oeste para salir a La Theine Plateau; la lápida está al final del valle en (G-11). La Geomagnetic Fount de La Theine está en una cornisa justo allí.",
    ["Waypoint in, drop down the vine (south) at (L-8)."] = "Entra por Waypoint y baja por la enredadera (sur) en (L-8).",
    ["Weapons Sound Magic"] = "Weapons: sonido, magia",
    ["Weapons can sometimes be broken with critical-hit weapon skills and critical hits."] = "A veces se pueden romper las armas con weapon skills críticas y golpes críticos.",
    ["Wear an accepted body piece (the same list as Guests of the Empire) plus any gloves, leg armor and boots. Accepted body pieces include: Adaman Cuirass, Aketon, Amir Korazin, Arhat's Gi, Barone Corazza, Black Cloak, Black Cotehardie, Blessed Bliaut, Bloody Aketon, Blue Cotehardie, Brigandine, Byrnie, Cardinal Vest, Chasuble, Dragon Harness, Dusk Jerkin, Errant Houppelande, Hachiman Domaru, Haubergeon, Hauberk, Holy Breastplate, Homam Corazza, Igqira Weskit, Jaridah Peti, Justaucorps, Nashira Manteel, Noble's Tunic, Plastron, Pahluwan Khazagand, Rasetsu Samue, Scorpion Harness, Sha'ir Manteel, Sipahi Jawshan, Vermillion Cloak and Yigit Gomlek."] = "Lleva una pieza de cuerpo aceptada (la misma lista que en Guests of the Empire) más guantes, piernas y botas cualesquiera. Piezas de cuerpo aceptadas: Adaman Cuirass, Aketon, Amir Korazin, Arhat's Gi, Barone Corazza, Black Cloak, Black Cotehardie, Blessed Bliaut, Bloody Aketon, Blue Cotehardie, Brigandine, Byrnie, Cardinal Vest, Chasuble, Dragon Harness, Dusk Jerkin, Errant Houppelande, Hachiman Domaru, Haubergeon, Hauberk, Holy Breastplate, Homam Corazza, Igqira Weskit, Jaridah Peti, Justaucorps, Nashira Manteel, Noble's Tunic, Plastron, Pahluwan Khazagand, Rasetsu Samue, Scorpion Harness, Sha'ir Manteel, Sipahi Jawshan, Vermillion Cloak y Yigit Gomlek.",
    ["Wear an accepted body piece plus any gloves, leg armor and boots (they don't have to match). Multi-slot gear doesn't count for the other slots. Accepted body pieces include: Adaman Cuirass, Aketon, Amir Korazin, Arhat's Gi, Barone Corazza, Black Cloak, Black Cotehardie, Blessed Bliaut, Bloody Aketon, Blue Cotehardie, Brigandine, Byrnie, Cardinal Vest, Chasuble, Dragon Harness, Dusk Jerkin, Errant Houppelande, Hachiman Domaru, Haubergeon, Hauberk, Holy Breastplate, Homam Corazza, Igqira Weskit, Jaridah Peti, Justaucorps, Nashira Manteel, Noble's Tunic, Plastron, Pahluwan Khazagand, Rasetsu Samue, Scorpion Harness, Sha'ir Manteel, Sipahi Jawshan, Vermillion Cloak and Yigit Gomlek. Keep it: Imperial Coronation needs the same."] = "Lleva una pieza de cuerpo aceptada más guantes, piernas y botas cualesquiera (no tienen que combinar). El equipo que ocupa varias ranuras no cuenta para las demás. Piezas de cuerpo aceptadas: Adaman Cuirass, Aketon, Amir Korazin, Arhat's Gi, Barone Corazza, Black Cloak, Black Cotehardie, Blessed Bliaut, Bloody Aketon, Blue Cotehardie, Brigandine, Byrnie, Cardinal Vest, Chasuble, Dragon Harness, Dusk Jerkin, Errant Houppelande, Hachiman Domaru, Haubergeon, Hauberk, Holy Breastplate, Homam Corazza, Igqira Weskit, Jaridah Peti, Justaucorps, Nashira Manteel, Noble's Tunic, Plastron, Pahluwan Khazagand, Rasetsu Samue, Scorpion Harness, Sha'ir Manteel, Sipahi Jawshan, Vermillion Cloak y Yigit Gomlek. Guárdala: Imperial Coronation necesita lo mismo.",
    ["Wear both pieces of equipment. Only some jobs can wear both items at the same time."] = "Ponte ambas piezas de equipo. Solo algunos trabajos pueden llevar ambos objetos a la vez.",
    ["Wearing Tsoo's Headgear, zone out to the south of the Altar Room and back in for a cutscene and a Gold Beastcoin. You receive the title Yagudo Initiate."] = "Llevando el Tsoo's Headgear, sal de la Altar Room por el sur y vuelve a entrar para una escena y una Gold Beastcoin. Recibes el título Yagudo Initiate.",
    ["Welcome to Jeuno"] = "Bienvenido a Jeuno",
    ["Welcome to Jeuno! Near where you entered, there's a Home Point. The other end of the zone has another Home Point, a Mog House entrance, and sets of stairs connecting all four of Jeuno's zones and Qufim Island, where you will shortly be leveling. Along with two Home Points in the Upper/Lower/Port Jeuno, there's also four and a Survival Guide in Ru'Lude Gardens."] = "¡Bienvenido a Jeuno! Cerca de donde has entrado hay un Home Point. En el otro extremo de la zona hay otro Home Point, una entrada a la Mog House y escaleras que conectan las cuatro zonas de Jeuno y Qufim Island, donde pronto subirás de nivel. Además de los dos Home Points de Upper/Lower/Port Jeuno, hay cuatro y una Survival Guide en Ru'Lude Gardens.",
    ["Werebats are at G-8. There are Hounds at (G-7). (Map 2)"] = "Los Werebats están en G-8. Hay Hounds en (G-7). (mapa 2)",
    ["West and South: 31-35"] = "Oeste y sur: 31-35",
    ["Western Altepa Desert connects to Rabao at (K-5)/(L-5). Rabao's an actual town! It has two Home Points and a Survival Guide. Use the Nomad Moogle or put some more stuff up on the AH while you're here if you need to."] = "Western Altepa Desert conecta con Rabao en (K-5)/(L-5). ¡Rabao es un pueblo de verdad! Tiene dos Home Points y una Survival Guide. Usa el Nomad Moogle o pon más cosas en la AH mientras estás aquí si lo necesitas.",
    ["When Maat gives up, you receive the title Maat Masher and a Scroll of Instant Warp."] = "Cuando Maat se rinde, recibes el título Maat Masher y un Scroll of Instant Warp.",
    ["When asked what to drink, choose either Chai or coffee. Do not choose \"I'll pass, thanks.\". When choosing a cup, select the cup with the suspicious vapor; a wrong pick means trying again the next game day (no need to trade the items again)."] = "Cuando te pregunte qué beber, elige Chai o café. No elijas \"I'll pass, thanks.\". Al elegir taza, escoge la que tiene un vapor sospechoso; si fallas, tendrás que volver a intentarlo al día de juego siguiente (no hace falta volver a entregar los objetos).",
    ["When either reaches 50%, she rages: she can't drop below 1% until it ends, and the other comes over to skillchain on your target. If you wipe after that, it doesn't repeat on a retry without leaving."] = "Cuando cualquiera de las dos llega al 50%, entra en cólera: no puede bajar del 1% hasta que termina, y la otra se acerca para hacer un skillchain sobre tu objetivo. Si caéis todos después de eso, no se repite al reintentar sin salir.",
    ["When every Opo-opo has received its item, you receive the Opo-opo Crown and the title King of the Opo-opos."] = "Cuando todos los Opo-opos han recibido su objeto, recibes el Opo-opo Crown y el título King of the Opo-opos.",
    ["When he returns from his trip after one Earth minute, your Mog Safe holds 70 items."] = "Cuando vuelve de su viaje tras un minuto real, tu Mog Safe tiene capacidad para 70 objetos.",
    ["When he returns from his trip after one Earth minute, your Mog Safe holds 80 items."] = "Cuando vuelve de su viaje tras un minuto real, tu Mog Safe tiene capacidad para 80 objetos.",
    ["When it comes to earning raw gil, an item's purchase price in Sparks is determined by its sell price in gil. Most sellable items have the same Sparks:gil ratio of about 1:10. This means you can spend Sparks on almost any piece of gear (except the level 99 Rare/EX stuff, which CANNOT be sold), then sell it to a NPC for 10 times as much gil as you spent in Sparks. Thanks to bots that did this 24/7/365, Sparks got capped - you can \"only\" exchange 100,000 total Sparks per week, resetting on Sundays, for a total of about one million free gil every week. The highest-price sellable item is the level 75 Acheron Shield, if you want to burn your Sparks at maximum speed. It's on the last page (3rd page) of the level 71-98 section, and is the second item from the bottom of the list."] = "En cuanto a ganar gil en bruto, el precio de compra de un objeto en Sparks depende de su precio de venta en gil. La mayoría de los objetos vendibles tienen la misma proporción Sparks:gil de aproximadamente 1:10. Esto significa que puedes gastar Sparks en casi cualquier pieza de equipo (salvo lo Rare/EX de nivel 99, que NO se puede vender) y luego vendérsela a un NPC por 10 veces más gil del que gastaste en Sparks. Por culpa de los bots que hacían esto 24/7/365, los Sparks se limitaron: \"solo\" puedes cambiar 100,000 Sparks en total por semana, con reinicio el domingo, para un total de aproximadamente un millón de gil gratis cada semana. El objeto vendible más caro es el Acheron Shield de nivel 75, si quieres quemar tus Sparks a la máxima velocidad. Está en la última página (la 3.ª) de la sección de nivel 71-98, y es el segundo objeto empezando por abajo.",
    ["When it succeeds, you can become a Rune Fencer and receive the Sowilo Claymore. Keep the sword: Forging New Bonds needs it, or an Elixir instead."] = "Cuando salga bien, podrás ser Rune Fencer y recibirás la Sowilo Claymore. Guarda la espada: Forging New Bonds la necesita, o un Elixir en su lugar.",
    ["When it's feeling like the experience gain is slowing down, pop inside Lower Delkfutt's Tower - getting a cutscene to start the Chains of Promathia Missions - and hit the Survival Guide here while continuing to kill everything in sight until level 30."] = "Cuando notes que la experiencia se ralentiza, entra en Lower Delkfutt's Tower (verás una escena que empieza las misiones de Chains of Promathia) y toca la Survival Guide de aquí mientras sigues matando todo lo que veas hasta nivel 30.",
    ["When prompted, choose \"I wasn't talking to you, squirt.\" Then enter Dangruf Wadi for a short cutscene (if you arrive by Survival Guide, zone out and back in to get it)."] = "Cuando se te pregunte, elige \"I wasn't talking to you, squirt.\" Luego entra en Dangruf Wadi para una escena corta (si llegas con la Survival Guide, sal y vuelve a entrar para verla).",
    ["When the cutscene ends, trade her the Silver Ingot to complete the quest and receive 2,200 gil."] = "Cuando termina la escena, entrégale el Silver Ingot para completar la quest y recibir 2,200 gil.",
    ["When the cutscene ends, trade him the Cinnamon to complete the quest and receive a Cotton Headband."] = "Cuando termina la escena, entrégale la Cinnamon para completar la quest y recibir un Cotton Headband.",
    ["When the cutscene is over, you are returned to Aht Urhgan Whitegate and able to change to Blue Mage. You receive the key item Mark of Zahak, and the item you brought is still in your inventory."] = "Cuando termina la escena, vuelves a Aht Urhgan Whitegate y puedes cambiar a Blue Mage. Recibes el key item Mark of Zahak, y el objeto que llevaste sigue en tu inventario.",
    ["When the pool at (F-5) is examined, the NM Dabotz's Ghost spawns: a Black Mage that casts Tornado and other black magic and uses Curse often. Take Sneak off first; he spawns in the water and you can't reach him unless he aggros you."] = "Al examinar el estanque en (F-5) aparece el NM Dabotz's Ghost: un Black Mage que lanza Tornado y otra magia negra y usa Curse a menudo. Quítate Sneak antes; aparece en el agua y no puedes alcanzarlo a menos que te ataque.",
    ["When you enter a main city zone for the first time after reaching level 5, you will be prompted to begin Rhapsodies of Vana'diel, a Mission line that ties together all the other story Missions and provides incredibly valuable permanent character boosts. Many players choose to progress this Mission line as quickly as possible to gain all the quality of life benefits from it, such as reduced teleportation fees between Home Points, permanent percentage-based Experience Points bonuses, more Trust party slots, and much more. Other players prefer to postpone progression in this Mission line, as it does tie together stories that you may not be familiar with yet, and introduces some characters earlier than you may normally meet them. The decision is yours on which path to follow. Note that if you defer the Mission line, the game will direct you to the Tales' Beginnings floating book should you wish to resume the Mission at any time, and it will be marked on your map."] = "Cuando entres por primera vez en una zona de ciudad principal tras llegar a nivel 5, se te ofrecerá empezar Rhapsodies of Vana'diel, una serie de Missions que une todas las demás Missions de la historia y da mejoras permanentes muy valiosas al personaje. Muchos jugadores eligen avanzar esta serie lo antes posible para obtener todas sus ventajas de comodidad, como teletransportes más baratos entre Home Points, bonificaciones permanentes en porcentaje de Experience Points, más huecos de Trust en el grupo y mucho más. Otros prefieren posponerla, ya que une historias que quizá aún no conozcas y presenta a algunos personajes antes de lo que los conocerías normalmente. La decisión es tuya. Ten en cuenta que, si pospones la serie, el juego te indicará el libro flotante Tales' Beginnings por si quieres retomar la Mission en cualquier momento, y estará marcado en el mapa.",
    ["When you get the message that all hostiles are cleared, talk to Pesoso near the third room to leave. If it doesn't come, go back to the first room: enemies from the third room wander toward it over time."] = "Cuando recibas el mensaje de que todos los enemigos han sido eliminados, habla con Pesoso cerca de la tercera sala para salir. Si no llega, vuelve a la primera sala: los enemigos de la tercera se desplazan hacia ella con el tiempo.",
    ["When you're ready, wait a game day and speak with Laila to perform. The audience is 3 children, 2 young adults and 2 older people; focus on Jigs and Waltzes so at least 5 of the 7 keep watching. If you fail, zone and wait a game day to try again."] = "Cuando estés listo, espera un día de juego y habla con Laila para actuar. El público son 3 niños, 2 jóvenes adultos y 2 personas mayores; céntrate en Jigs y Waltzes para que al menos 5 de los 7 sigan mirando. Si fallas, cambia de zona y espera un día de juego para volver a intentarlo.",
    ["When your Moogle returns from his trip after one Earth minute (without ever leaving your Mog House), he gives you a Mog Safe that holds 60 items and you receive the title Mog's Kind Master."] = "Cuando tu Moogle vuelve de su viaje tras un minuto terrestre (sin salir nunca de tu Mog House), te da un Mog Safe que guarda 60 objetos y recibes el título Mog's Kind Master.",
    ["Where Messengers Gather: travel to Southern San d'Oria and speak with Hinaree (B-6), then zone into Port San d'Oria and speak with Chasalvige (L-6) in Northern San d'Oria."] = "Where Messengers Gather: viaja a Southern San d'Oria y habla con Hinaree (B-6), luego entra en Port San d'Oria y habla con Chasalvige (L-6) en Northern San d'Oria.",
    ["Where they live in Sea Serpent Grotto: open area: Bigclaw, Brook/Riparian/Rivulet Sahagin, Royal Leech, Undead Bats, Grotto Pugil. Silver Beastcoin door: Sea Bonze. Mythril Beastcoin door: Blubber Eyes, Bog/Marsh/Swamp Sahagin, Rock Crab, Razorjaw Pugil, Sahagin Parasite. Gold Beastcoin door (Unity Warp level 125 puts you past it): Coastal/Delta/Lagoon/Shore Sahagin, Devil Manta, Dire Bat, Mousse, Robber Crab."] = "Dónde viven en Sea Serpent Grotto: zona abierta: Bigclaw, Brook/Riparian/Rivulet Sahagin, Royal Leech, Undead Bats, Grotto Pugil. Puerta de Silver Beastcoin: Sea Bonze. Puerta de Mythril Beastcoin: Blubber Eyes, Bog/Marsh/Swamp Sahagin, Rock Crab, Razorjaw Pugil, Sahagin Parasite. Puerta de Gold Beastcoin (el Unity Warp de nivel 125 te deja tras ella): Coastal/Delta/Lagoon/Shore Sahagin, Devil Manta, Dire Bat, Mousse, Robber Crab.",
    ["Whichever coin you pick, correct or not, you receive a Shelling Piece."] = "Elijas la moneda que elijas, correcta o no, recibes una Shelling Piece.",
    ["Whichever way you completed the previous section, once you have the Rolanberry, travel to Bastok Markets (S) one more time and speak with young Offa, then return to Bastok Markets and speak with Offa there to complete the quest and obtain the Withered Berry."] = "Hayas completado la sección anterior por el camino que sea, cuando tengas la Rolanberry viaja una vez más a Bastok Markets (S) y habla con el joven Offa, luego vuelve a Bastok Markets y habla allí con Offa para completar la quest y obtener la Withered Berry.",
    ["While on Corsair at level 50 or higher, head to the Shararat Teahouse in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-12) for a cutscene and the key item Life float. This quest requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Como Corsair de nivel 50 o superior, ve a la Shararat Teahouse de Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-12) para una escena y el key item Life float. Esta quest requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["While the quest Ode to the Serpents is active, speak with Gaweesh in Al Zahbi (G-8). You may only get the cutscenes when General Najelith is in Al Zahbi."] = "Mientras la quest Ode to the Serpents esté activa, habla con Gaweesh en Al Zahbi (G-8). Solo ves las escenas cuando General Najelith está en Al Zahbi.",
    ["While the quest Ode to the Serpents is active, speak with Talhaal in Al Zahbi (H-6). You may only get the cutscenes when General Zazarg is in Al Zahbi."] = "Mientras la quest Ode to the Serpents esté activa, habla con Talhaal en Al Zahbi (H-6). Solo ves las escenas cuando General Zazarg está en Al Zahbi.",
    ["While the two-hour ability is active, speak with Erlene (J-8) again."] = "Mientras la habilidad de dos horas esté activa, habla de nuevo con Erlene (J-8).",
    ["While you are on Summoner as your main job, examine the House of the Hero in Windurst Walls (Home Point #1) to speak with Carbuncle. You must be level 40 or higher and have the Rise of the Zilart pack."] = "Mientras tengas Summoner como trabajo principal, examina la House of the Hero en Windurst Walls (Home Point #1) para hablar con Carbuncle. Debes ser nivel 40 o superior y tener el pack Rise of the Zilart.",
    ["While you could stumble around at random, I'd recommend using each zone page's map to see possible spawn locations. It's not inherently stated in all zone's maps, but the blue squares represent Treasure Chests while the reddish/purplish squares represent Treasure Coffers. Knowing all this, it's simply a matter of checking each possible spawn location one-by-one until you find your prize."] = "Aunque podrías ir dando tumbos al azar, recomiendo usar el mapa de la página de cada zona para ver los posibles puntos de aparición. No lo indican todos los mapas, pero los cuadros azules son Treasure Chests y los rojizos/morados son Treasure Coffers. Sabiendo esto, solo es cuestión de revisar cada punto posible uno por uno hasta encontrar tu premio.",
    ["While you wait, farm a Punch Bug for the next mission."] = "Mientras esperas, farmea un Punch Bug para la misión siguiente.",
    ["While you wait, get another Ephramadian gold coin from Jazaraat's Headstone in Caedarva Mire (E-10) (Home Point or Nashmau's west exit); the next mission needs it."] = "Mientras esperas, consigue otra Ephramadian gold coin de la Jazaraat's Headstone de Caedarva Mire (E-10) (Home Point o la salida oeste de Nashmau); la misión siguiente la necesita.",
    ["While you're doing Mission 2-3, you will have to go into two beastmen-controlled dungeon-esque areas near the cities."] = "Mientras haces la Mission 2-3, tendrás que entrar en dos zonas tipo mazmorra controladas por hombres bestia cerca de las ciudades.",
    ["While you're here, continue north, then west to reach the zone line to Xarcabard. Head west to the outpost and touch another Survival Guide."] = "Ya que estás aquí, sigue al norte y luego al oeste hasta el límite de zona de Xarcabard. Ve al oeste hasta el puesto avanzado y toca otra Survival Guide.",
    ["While you're in the progress of doing Mission 2-3, talk to two specific NPCs for two new trusts:"] = "Mientras haces la Mission 2-3, habla con dos NPCs concretos para dos trusts nuevos:",
    ["While you're making a macro, you might also want to make a Warp Ring macro:"] = "Ya que estás haciendo macros, quizá también quieras una macro para el Warp Ring:",
    ["Win 3 rounds of Boom or Bust."] = "Gana 3 rondas de Boom or Bust.",
    ["Win the battle to complete the quest and receive 10,000 gil."] = "Gana la batalla para completar la quest y recibir 10,000 gil.",
    ["Win the battlefield again and return to the Blank Target for a new earring."] = "Gana de nuevo el campo de batalla y vuelve al Blank Target para un nuevo pendiente.",
    ["Windower users: to have a macro directly input a Windower command, use /console before the command. For example, \"/console mh\" would be the same as typing \"mh\" in the Windower Console, which is the command to tell MyHome to use Warp Ring. You can replace the Warp Ring macro above with that single line."] = "Usuarios de Windower: para que una macro introduzca directamente un comando de Windower, pon /console delante del comando. Por ejemplo, \"/console mh\" sería lo mismo que escribir \"mh\" en la consola de Windower, que es el comando para que MyHome use el Warp Ring. Puedes sustituir la macro del Warp Ring de arriba por esa única línea.",
    ["Windows > Shared"] = "Windows > Shared",
    ["Windurst"] = "Windurst",
    ["Windurst First:"] = "Windurst First:",
    ["Windurst Mission 1-1"] = "Windurst Mission 1-1",
    ["Windurst Mission 1-3 is inside Giddeus."] = "La Windurst Mission 1-3 es dentro de Giddeus.",
    ["Windurst Mission 2-1 players: You're going northeast from East Sarutabaruta..."] = "Jugadores de la Windurst Mission 2-1: vas al noreste desde East Sarutabaruta...",
    ["Windurst Mission 2-3"] = "Windurst Mission 2-3",
    ["Windurst Mission 3-1"] = "Windurst Mission 3-1",
    ["Windurst Mission 3-2 (skippable)"] = "Windurst Mission 3-2 (se puede saltar)",
    ["Windurst Mission 3-3"] = "Windurst Mission 3-3",
    ["Windurst Mission 4-1"] = "Windurst Mission 4-1",
    ["Windurst Mission 5-1"] = "Windurst Mission 5-1",
    ["Windurst Mission 5-2"] = "Windurst Mission 5-2",
    ["Windurst Path: enter Windurst Waters and speak with Ohbiru-Dohbiru (J-9), then speak with Yoran-Oran (E-5) and Kyume-Romeh (F-10)."] = "Camino de Windurst: entra en Windurst Waters y habla con Ohbiru-Dohbiru (J-9), luego con Yoran-Oran (E-5) y Kyume-Romeh (F-10).",
    ["Windurst first: travel to Port Windurst and speak with Melek at (F-6) inside the Bastokan Consulate."] = "Primero Windurst: viaja a Port Windurst y habla con Melek en (F-6), dentro del Bastokan Consulate.",
    ["Windurst: Windurst Waters (F-5), Windurst Walls (C-6), Port Windurst (B-5), or Windurst Woods (J-10)."] = "Windurst: Windurst Waters (F-5), Windurst Walls (C-6), Port Windurst (B-5) o Windurst Woods (J-10).",
    ["Windurst: complete Knot Quite There and A Manifest Problem."] = "Windurst: completa Knot Quite There y A Manifest Problem.",
    ["Windurst: give the letter to Miah Riyuh in Windurst Waters [S] (H-9) and complete Snake on the Plains, then The Tigress Stirs and The Tigress Strikes."] = "Windurst: entrega la carta a Miah Riyuh en Windurst Waters [S] (H-9) y completa Snake on the Plains, luego The Tigress Stirs y The Tigress Strikes.",
    ["Windurst: smartest-looking Mithra child = Koko Lihzeh (Windurst Waters, K-6); something snappy to hook customers = Naiko-Paneiko (Waters, C-11); \"strange little poppet\" = Kerutoto (Waters, J-8); magic doll upgrades = Koru-Moru (Windurst Walls, E-7); sick of being left out = Shanruru (Port Windurst, H-5); \"hats suck\" = Boizo-Naizo (Windurst Woods, H-10); another tasty frog = Sola Jaab (Woods, K-10); rolanberry souvenirs = Kupipi (Heavens Tower)."] = "Windurst: la niña Mithra con aspecto más listo = Koko Lihzeh (Windurst Waters, K-6); algo pegadizo para atraer clientes = Naiko-Paneiko (Waters, C-11); \"strange little poppet\" = Kerutoto (Waters, J-8); mejoras de muñecos mágicos = Koru-Moru (Windurst Walls, E-7); harta de que la dejen de lado = Shanruru (Port Windurst, H-5); \"hats suck\" = Boizo-Naizo (Windurst Woods, H-10); otra rana sabrosa = Sola Jaab (Woods, K-10); recuerdos de rolanberry = Kupipi (Heavens Tower).",
    ["Winning completes the quest, raises your level limit to 75 and earns the title Grimoire Bearer. If you have already completed New Worlds Await or a later limit break, you do not need this quest for the level limit."] = "Ganar completa la quest, sube tu límite de nivel a 75 y te da el título Grimoire Bearer. Si ya completaste New Worlds Await o un limit break posterior, no necesitas esta quest para el límite de nivel.",
    ["Winning gives a 10-minute cutscene. If you lose, wait for the next game day and examine the Conflux again for another Primal glow."] = "Ganar da una escena de 10 minutos. Si pierdes, espera al siguiente día de juego y examina de nuevo la Conflux para obtener otro Primal glow.",
    ["Winning gives a cutscene and puts you in Al'Taieu."] = "Ganar da una escena y te deja en Al'Taieu.",
    ["Winning gives a cutscene and the Jeunoan Flag. If your inventory is full, get it later from the ??? on the barrels just north of the entrance."] = "Ganar da una escena y la Jeunoan Flag. Si tienes el inventario lleno, consíguela después de la ??? sobre los barriles justo al norte de la entrada.",
    ["Winning gives a cutscene and the key item Crystal dowser."] = "Ganar da una escena y el key item Crystal dowser.",
    ["Winning gives a cutscene that completes the mission. If you fail, get another key item from Naja Salaheem."] = "Ganar da una escena que completa la misión. Si fallas, consigue otro key item de Naja Salaheem.",
    ["Winning gives a final cutscene and returns you to the Hall of the Gods. If you wipe, wait to be ejected: he aggroes anywhere in the battlefield."] = "Ganar da una última escena y te devuelve a Hall of the Gods. Si caéis todos, espera a que te expulsen: ataca en cualquier punto del campo de batalla.",
    ["Winning gives the key item Letter from Werei."] = "Ganar da el key item Letter from Werei.",
    ["Winning plays a cutscene that completes the mission."] = "Ganar reproduce una escena que completa la misión.",
    ["Winning plays another cutscene and gives the Awakened crystallized psyche."] = "Ganar reproduce otra escena y da el Awakened crystallized psyche.",
    ["Winning puts you at the Dilapidated Gate in Lufaise Meadows for a cutscene and the Ducal Guard's Ring."] = "Ganar te deja en la Dilapidated Gate de Lufaise Meadows para una escena y el Ducal Guard's Ring.",
    ["Witchetty Grub/Prim Pika/Goblin Headsman/Goblin Healer/Goblin Brigand/Goblin Bladesmith/Goblin Bushwhacker/Trimmer/Natty Gibbon"] = "Witchetty Grub/Prim Pika/Goblin Headsman/Goblin Healer/Goblin Brigand/Goblin Bladesmith/Goblin Bushwhacker/Trimmer/Natty Gibbon",
    ["With 100 kills done, go to Beadeaux and zone in for a cutscene that completes the quest. You can now become a Dark Knight."] = "Con las 100 muertes hechas, ve a Beadeaux y entra en la zona para una escena que completa la quest. Ya puedes ser Dark Knight.",
    ["With Blue Mage as your main job, speak to the Immortal who oversees Assault at each of the five staging points (not Nyzul Isle): Nareema at Azouph Isle (Brand of the Stoneserpent), Nahshib at Dvucca Isle (Brand of the Galeserpent), Daswil at the Mamool Ja Staging Point (Brand of the Skyserpent), Waudeen at Halvung (Brand of the Flameserpent) and Meyaada at Ilrusi Atoll (Brand of the Springserpent). The key items are permanent."] = "Con Blue Mage como job principal, habla con el Immortal que supervisa Assault en cada uno de los cinco staging points (no Nyzul Isle): Nareema en Azouph Isle (Brand of the Stoneserpent), Nahshib en Dvucca Isle (Brand of the Galeserpent), Daswil en el Mamool Ja Staging Point (Brand of the Skyserpent), Waudeen en Halvung (Brand of the Flameserpent) y Meyaada en Ilrusi Atoll (Brand of the Springserpent). Los key items son permanentes.",
    ["With Geomancer as your main job, level 66 or higher, speak with Sylvie in Western Adoulin at the Waterfront (I-5), Waypoint #9. You also need to be on Geomancer to spawn the NM. You don't need this quest for the level cap if you've already completed New Worlds Await or later."] = "Con Geomancer como job principal, de nivel 66 o superior, habla con Sylvie en Western Adoulin, en el Waterfront (I-5), Waypoint #9. También necesitas ser Geomancer para hacer aparecer al NM. No necesitas esta quest para el límite de nivel si ya completaste New Worlds Await o posteriores.",
    ["With Rune Fencer as your main job, level 66 or higher, speak with Octavien in Eastern Adoulin (I-8) to receive the key item Ephemeral Endeavor. You don't need this quest for the level cap if you've already completed New Worlds Await or later."] = "Con Rune Fencer como job principal, de nivel 66 o superior, habla con Octavien en Eastern Adoulin (I-8) para recibir el key item Ephemeral Endeavor. No necesitas esta quest para el límite de nivel si ya completaste New Worlds Await o posteriores.",
    ["With Signet on, you also get Crystals as drops from defeating enemies."] = "Con Signet activo, también consigues Crystals como drop al derrotar enemigos.",
    ["With Silent Oil, enter the Grotto, go south into the first large room and take the south-west tunnel, continue south to the Ornamented Door at (J-10), unlock it with the Sahagin Key and cross the bridge to the south; the ??? is at (H-6)."] = "Con Silent Oil, entra en la Grotto, ve al sur a la primera sala grande y toma el túnel suroeste, sigue al sur hasta la Ornamented Door de (J-10), ábrela con la Sahagin Key y cruza el puente hacia el sur; la ??? está en (H-6).",
    ["With a free inventory slot, speak with Gentle Tiger (H-6) and answer: \"..the ventilation shaft.\", \"..the senator did not light the lantern.\" and \"..he was distracted.\""] = "Con un hueco libre en el inventario, habla con Gentle Tiger (H-6) y responde: \"..the ventilation shaft.\", \"..the senator did not light the lantern.\" y \"..he was distracted.\"",
    ["With all five bugs planted, examine Regal Pawprints (H-10) under the large broken tree branch near the tower (not at the tower's base)."] = "Con los cinco bichos colocados, examina las Regal Pawprints (H-10) bajo la gran rama rota cerca de la torre (no en la base de la torre).",
    ["With all four key items, approach the Castle Adoulin gates in Eastern Adoulin, where Ploh Trishbahk (K-9) stands, for a cutscene."] = "Con los cuatro key items, acércate a las puertas de Castle Adoulin en Eastern Adoulin, donde está Ploh Trishbahk (K-9), para una escena.",
    ["With all four, you're told to return to Cait Sith and the next mission starts."] = "Con los cuatro, se te dice que vuelvas con Cait Sith y empieza la misión siguiente.",
    ["With all six key items, go to the Full Moon Fountain (the Toraimarai Canal Home Point is fastest) for a cutscene and the final battle (up to 18 players). The key items are kept if you lose and used up when you win."] = "Con los seis key items, ve a la Full Moon Fountain (el Home Point de Toraimarai Canal es lo más rápido) para una escena y la batalla final (hasta 18 jugadores). Los key items se conservan si pierdes y se gastan si ganas.",
    ["With all three pieces, examine the second door (H-10) to spawn two Doll NMs, Nio-Hum and Nio-A (about 6,500 HP each, can't be slept, aggressive to magic). Use Sneak before spawning them to pull one at a time."] = "Con las tres piezas, examina la segunda puerta (H-10) para hacer aparecer dos NMs Doll, Nio-Hum y Nio-A (unos 6,500 HP cada uno, no se pueden dormir, atacan a la magia). Usa Sneak antes de hacerlos aparecer para atraerlos de uno en uno.",
    ["With at least three counterseals, examine Trodden Snow (H-7) on Qufim Island (H-7) for a cutscene. Gil reward: 3 seals 3,000; 4 seals 10,000; 5 seals 30,000; 6 seals 50,000."] = "Con al menos tres contrasellos, examina a Trodden Snow (H-7) en Qufim Island (H-7) para una escena. Recompensa en gil: 3 sellos 3,000; 4 sellos 10,000; 5 sellos 30,000; 6 sellos 50,000.",
    ["With both brands, ascend twice from the central elevator to the third floor."] = "Con ambas marcas, sube dos veces desde el ascensor central hasta el tercer piso.",
    ["With keys instead: one person trades a Coral Crest Key to the small keyhole and, right after the click, someone trades the Sealion Crest Key to the large one. The Coral Crest Key breaks, and if the timing is missed you need another."] = "Con llaves: una persona entrega una Coral Crest Key a la cerradura pequeña y, justo tras el clic, otra entrega la Sealion Crest Key a la grande. La Coral Crest Key se rompe, y si falla la sincronización necesitas otra.",
    ["With no Naakual crests, walk the whole way from the start of Outer Ra'Kaznar, by the Augural Conveyor and the Kamihr Drifts exit."] = "Sin emblemas de Naakual, recorre todo el camino desde el inicio de Outer Ra'Kaznar, junto al Augural Conveyor y la salida a Kamihr Drifts.",
    ["With the Axe of Trials equipped in your main hand, fight enemies rated Extremely Easy Prey or higher and use weapon skills or close skillchains to accumulate 300 Trial Points: 7 points for a level 1 skillchain, 9 for level 2 and 11 for level 3. Your elemental resistances are listed underneath your equipped gear grid."] = "Con el Axe of Trials equipado en la mano principal, pelea contra enemigos de nivel Extremely Easy Prey o superior y usa weapon skills o skillchains cercanas para acumular 300 Trial Points: 7 puntos por una skillchain de nivel 1, 9 por una de nivel 2 y 11 por una de nivel 3. Tus resistencias elementales aparecen debajo de la cuadrícula de equipo.",
    ["With the Gun of Trials equipped in your main hand, fight enemies rated Extremely Easy Prey or higher and use weapon skills or close skillchains to accumulate 300 Trial Points: 7 points for a level 1 skillchain, 9 for level 2 and 11 for level 3. Your elemental resistances are listed underneath your equipped gear grid."] = "Con la Gun of Trials equipada en la mano principal, pelea contra enemigos de nivel Extremely Easy Prey o superior y usa weapon skills o skillchains cercanas para acumular 300 Trial Points: 7 puntos por una skillchain de nivel 1, 9 por una de nivel 2 y 11 por una de nivel 3. Tus resistencias elementales aparecen debajo de la cuadrícula de equipo.",
    ["With the Knuckles of Trials equipped in your main hand, fight enemies rated Extremely Easy Prey or higher and use weapon skills or close skillchains to accumulate 300 Trial Points."] = "Con los Knuckles of Trials equipados en la mano principal, pelea contra enemigos de nivel Extremely Easy Prey o superior y usa weapon skills o skillchains cercanas para acumular 300 Trial Points.",
    ["With the Moon bauble key item, interact with the fountain to enter the battlefield. Up to 6 party members can enter, each needs their own Moon bauble, and the time limit is 30 minutes."] = "Con el key item Moon bauble, interactúa con la fountain para entrar en el campo de batalla. Pueden entrar hasta 6 miembros del grupo, cada uno necesita su propia Moon bauble, y el límite de tiempo es de 30 minutos.",
    ["With the Sapara of Trials equipped in your main hand, fight enemies rated Extremely Easy Prey or higher and use weapon skills or close skillchains to accumulate 300 Trial Points."] = "Con el Sapara of Trials equipado en la mano principal, pelea contra enemigos de nivel Extremely Easy Prey o superior y usa weapon skills o skillchains cercanas para acumular 300 Trial Points.",
    ["With the Scythe of Trials equipped in your main hand, fight enemies rated Extremely Easy Prey or higher and use weapon skills or close skillchains to accumulate 300 Trial Points."] = "Con la Scythe of Trials equipada en la mano principal, pelea contra enemigos de nivel Extremely Easy Prey o superior y usa weapon skills o skillchains cercanas para acumular 300 Trial Points.",
    ["With the Sword of Trials equipped in your main hand, fight enemies rated Extremely Easy Prey or higher and use weapon skills or close skillchains to accumulate 300 Trial Points."] = "Con la Sword of Trials equipada en la mano principal, pelea contra enemigos de nivel Extremely Easy Prey o superior y usa weapon skills o skillchains cercanas para acumular 300 Trial Points.",
    ["With the Tonberry key (Zilart) you can reset your Tonberry Hate at any time: use it on the secret door at (F-11) on map 1 of the Temple of Uggalepih, where the Tonberry Priest resets your Tonberry Hate in exchange for a gil penance."] = "Con la Tonberry key (Zilart) puedes reiniciar tu Tonberry Hate cuando quieras: úsala en la puerta secreta de (F-11) del mapa 1 del Temple of Uggalepih, donde el Tonberry Priest reinicia tu Tonberry Hate a cambio de una penitencia en gil.",
    ["With the cap, Goblins and Hognosed Bats aggro you, and Stink Bats link to Hognosed Bats. Head east through the puddle and follow the path south to a large room at (G-7). Keep to its west wall going south, and before the next tunnel turn left towards the middle of the map."] = "Con el límite de nivel, los Goblins y los Hognosed Bats te atacan, y los Stink Bats se enlazan con los Hognosed Bats. Ve al este cruzando el charco y sigue el camino al sur hasta una sala grande en (G-7). Mantente junto a su pared oeste hacia el sur y, antes del siguiente túnel, gira a la izquierda hacia el centro del mapa.",
    ["With the key item Biyaada's letter, go to Al Zahbi and speak with Gaweesh (G-8) and Talhaal (H-6)."] = "Con el key item Biyaada's letter, ve a Al Zahbi y habla con Gaweesh (G-8) y Talhaal (H-6).",
    ["With the pass, enter Pso'Xja at (H-8) and follow the single path to the central room. Each colored wall you pass zones you and removes buffs, so only bother with Sneak and Invisible."] = "Con el pase, entra en Pso'Xja por (H-8) y sigue el único camino hasta la sala central. Cada muro de color que cruzas te cambia de zona y te quita los buffs, así que limítate a Sneak e Invisible.",
    ["Without the Home Point, bring Silent Oil, Prism Powder and an Ice Cluster and enter Ifrit's Cauldron from Yhoator Jungle (I-5/6), arriving on map 1. Go north at the first junction, trade the Ice Cluster to the Flame Spout at (H-6/I-6), continue west through transition A to the large circular room (map 2), go south along the ledge and take drop P at (I-7/8) to map 7. Take transition M to the south-east onto map 6; the ??? is in the middle of the bridge to the north. Clear the bats and the bomb first if needed."] = "Sin el Home Point, lleva Silent Oil, Prism Powder y un Ice Cluster y entra en Ifrit's Cauldron desde Yhoator Jungle (I-5/6), llegando al mapa 1. Ve al norte en el primer cruce, entrega el Ice Cluster al Flame Spout de (H-6/I-6), sigue al oeste por la transición A hasta la gran sala circular (mapa 2), ve al sur por la cornisa y toma la caída P de (I-7/8) al mapa 7. Toma la transición M al sureste hacia el mapa 6; la ??? está en el centro del puente del norte. Despeja antes los murciélagos y la bomba si hace falta.",
    ["Worker Crawler/Death Jacket/Maze Lizard"] = "Worker Crawler/Death Jacket/Maze Lizard",
    ["Xarcabard at (H-8)"] = "Xarcabard en (H-8)",
    ["Yagudo crest: you need the Yagudo torch, and lower-level players should bring Reraise. In Castle Oztroja you need three passwords for the 4th floor trap door; they change at the start of each game day, and guessing from the Brass Statue's list can be quicker than collecting them."] = "Yagudo crest: necesitas la Yagudo torch, y los jugadores de nivel más bajo deberían llevar Reraise. En Castle Oztroja necesitas tres contraseñas para la trampilla del 4.º piso; cambian al inicio de cada día de juego, y adivinar a partir de la lista de la Brass Statue puede ser más rápido que reunirlas.",
    ["Yagudo/Mandragora/Birds/Goblins/Crawler/Dhalmel/Bees"] = "Yagudo/Mandragora/Birds/Goblins/Crawler/Dhalmel/Bees",
    ["Yes, Really"] = "Sí, de verdad",
    ["Yhoator Jungle - levels 45-50 - warp to the Ifrit's Cauldron Survival Guide, then walk back out and kill everything in sight."] = "Yhoator Jungle - niveles 45-50 - teletranspórtate a la Survival Guide de Ifrit's Cauldron, sal caminando y mata todo lo que veas.",
    ["Yonolala in Windurst Woods (J-10)"] = "Yonolala en Windurst Woods (J-10)",
    ["You also receive a link=Cipher: Valaineral, which you can trade to your city's Trust NPC to obtain the spell that summons Valaineral. In order to trade the Cipher, select the NPC, open your main menu, and select Trade. You may then place the Cipher in the Trade Window and complete the trade."] = "También recibes un link=Cipher: Valaineral, que puedes entregar al NPC de Trust de tu ciudad para obtener el hechizo que invoca a Valaineral. Para entregar el Cipher, selecciona al NPC, abre el menú principal y elige Trade. Luego coloca el Cipher en la ventana de intercambio y completa la entrega.",
    ["You are able to switch Unities once a week. No regrets!"] = "Puedes cambiar de Unity una vez por semana. ¡Sin remordimientos!",
    ["You are asked to experience 7 kinds of weather. With the Carbuncle's Ruby in your inventory, zone into an outdoor field area while that weather is active to get a short cutscene for each color. You cannot just idle in a zone, Scholar Storm spells don't count, and only Original and Rise of the Zilart field areas work (as a rule of thumb, if you can't use a mount there it won't count). The Weather Forecast NPCs show the current and next 2 game days."] = "Se te pide experimentar 7 tipos de clima. Con el Carbuncle's Ruby en el inventario, entra en una zona exterior mientras esté activo ese clima para ver una escena corta por cada color. No basta con quedarse quieto en una zona, los hechizos Storm de Scholar no cuentan, y solo sirven las zonas exteriores originales y de Rise of the Zilart (como regla general, si no puedes usar montura allí no cuenta). Los NPCs Weather Forecast muestran el día de juego actual y los 2 siguientes.",
    ["You are directed to head to the secret entrance to Wajaom Woodlands, at (G-10)/(H-10) of Aht Urhgan Whitegate. Upon zoning, you receive another cutscene."] = "Te dirigen a la entrada secreta de Wajaom Woodlands, en (G-10)/(H-10) de Aht Urhgan Whitegate. Al cambiar de zona, ves otra escena.",
    ["You are not provided with the Kindred's Seals and need to get them yourself. Check your inventory and the Port Jeuno NPCs Shemo and Shami (Status, Currencies, Kindred's Seals Stored), as you may already have enough seals."] = "No te dan los Kindred's Seals y tienes que conseguirlos tú. Revisa tu inventario y a los NPCs de Port Jeuno Shemo y Shami (Status, Currencies, Kindred's Seals Stored), ya que puede que ya tengas suficientes.",
    ["You are placed on a Chocobo and must ride to the destination. If you dismount, the quest ends in failure."] = "Te montan en un Chocobo y debes cabalgar hasta el destino. Si desmontas, la quest termina en fracaso.",
    ["You are sent to Desuetia - Empyreal Paradox and the mission completes when you arrive."] = "Te envían a Desuetia - Empyreal Paradox y la misión se completa al llegar.",
    ["You arrive in Witchfire Glen in Grauberg [S] automatically after the previous cutscene."] = "Llegas automáticamente a Witchfire Glen, en Grauberg [S], tras la escena anterior.",
    ["You can also buy a Mog Sack from the Artisan Moogle in Ru'Lude Gardens at (I-9) for 9,980 gil. This is another bag, the same size as your Inventory (talk to the Moogle again every time you finish a Gobbiebag to have it expand the Sack to match), that works just like every other inventory."] = "También puedes comprar un Mog Sack al Artisan Moogle de Ru'Lude Gardens en (I-9) por 9,980 gil. Es otra bolsa, del mismo tamaño que tu Inventory (vuelve a hablar con el Moogle cada vez que termines un Gobbiebag para que amplíe el Sack a juego), que funciona igual que cualquier otro inventario.",
    ["You can buy a Nest Chest Key from the Curio Vendor Moogle for 2,500 gil if you have the key item Rhapsody in White, from completing Rhapsodies of Vana'diel Mission 1-6."] = "Puedes comprar una Nest Chest Key al Curio Vendor Moogle por 2,500 gil si tienes el key item Rhapsody in White, que se obtiene al completar la Rhapsodies of Vana'diel Mission 1-6.",
    ["You can certainly do the Rank 4 missions earlier than level 56, but here's the clever part:"] = "Desde luego puedes hacer las misiones de rango 4 antes de nivel 56, pero aquí está el truco:",
    ["You can easily and quickly level here from 80 to 90 here with mobs and individual training pages, with EXP rings activated. This method can be used for grinding 10 to 12 levels very quickly before you go to the next level area."] = "Aquí puedes subir del 80 al 90 con facilidad y rapidez con los monstruos y las individual training pages, con los anillos de EXP activados. Este método sirve para subir de 10 a 12 niveles muy rápido antes de ir a la siguiente zona.",
    ["You can free up inventory space by depositing the rest with an Ephemeral Moogle. Trade the Moogle any amount of Crystals and it will store them for you until you talk to it to get them back."] = "Puedes liberar espacio del inventario dejando el resto a un Ephemeral Moogle. Entrégale cualquier cantidad de Crystals y te los guardará hasta que hables con él para recuperarlos.",
    ["You can get the Mini tuning fork again from Castilchat at any time and repeat the fight, but he will no longer teleport you to the Cloister."] = "Puedes volver a obtener el Mini tuning fork de Castilchat en cualquier momento y repetir el combate, pero ya no te teletransportará al Cloister.",
    ["You can get the Mini tuning fork again from Ferrol at any point and repeat the fight, but he will no longer teleport you to the Cloister."] = "Puedes volver a obtener el Mini tuning fork de Ferrol en cualquier momento y repetir el combate, pero ya no te teletransportará al Cloister.",
    ["You can now buy Wildskeeper Reive key items from Dimmian in Eastern Adoulin (E-6)."] = "Ya puedes comprar key items de Wildskeeper Reive a Dimmian en Eastern Adoulin (E-6).",
    ["You can obtain the Atma of Echoes after clearing the scenario."] = "Puedes obtener el Atma of Echoes tras completar el escenario.",
    ["You can only work on this quest after you have obtained an Airship Pass, as completing it requires a trip on the airship. You need Bastok fame level 3."] = "Solo puedes hacer esta quest tras obtener un Airship Pass, ya que completarla requiere un viaje en airship. Necesitas el nivel 3 de fama de Bastok.",
    ["You can repeat the quest after the next Conquest Tally."] = "Puedes repetir la quest tras el siguiente Conquest Tally.",
    ["You can repeat the quest as often as you like."] = "Puedes repetir la quest tantas veces como quieras.",
    ["You can repeat this quest as often as you like."] = "Puedes repetir esta quest tantas veces como quieras.",
    ["You can repeat this quest once per Conquest Tally."] = "Puedes repetir esta quest una vez por Conquest Tally.",
    ["You can repeat this quest once per Earth day."] = "Puedes repetir esta quest una vez por día terrestre.",
    ["You can repeat this quest once per Earth day: after completing it, speak with Leepe-Hoppe again for another Moon bauble, without collecting the whispers again."] = "Puedes repetir esta quest una vez por día terrestre: tras completarla, habla de nuevo con Leepe-Hoppe para otra Moon bauble, sin reunir los whispers otra vez.",
    ["You can return to Waoud and ask him to \"gaze away\" at your fate to get a cutscene. This is necessary for the next quest."] = "Puedes volver con Waoud y pedirle \"gaze away\" a tu destino para obtener una escena. Es necesario para la siguiente quest.",
    ["You can similarly start any or all of A Crystalline Prophecy, A Moogle Kupo d'Etat, and A Shantotto Ascension."] = "Del mismo modo, puedes empezar cualquiera o todas de A Crystalline Prophecy, A Moogle Kupo d'Etat y A Shantotto Ascension.",
    ["You can skip this quest by purchasing the key item PFC Wildcat badge from a Curio Vendor Moogle once you meet the 25 Mercenary Rank points requirement and have the key item Rhapsody in Azure from Rhapsodies of Vana'diel."] = "Puedes saltarte esta quest comprando el key item PFC Wildcat badge a un Curio Vendor Moogle cuando cumplas el requisito de 25 puntos de Mercenary Rank y tengas el key item Rhapsody in Azure de Rhapsodies of Vana'diel.",
    ["You can start the Seekers of Adoulin Missions by talking to Darcia in the Chamber of Commerce in Lower Jeuno at (H-7). Once you get to Western Adoulin proper (mission 1-5), talk to an NPC named Task Delegator (closest one is right next to you at Western Adoulin E-8) to begin accruing imprimaturs a rate of one per 6 hours real-life time. The cap is 15, so you'll want to burn some every few days to slowly work towards completing every Coalition Assignment. Since you're not level 99 yet, use them on the Couriers' Coalition (teleport to a Waypoint out in Ceizak Battlegrounds, which you can safely unlock with a mount, and then interact with a NPC) or the Inventors' Coalition (if you have gil, you can even buy items off the AH!) rather than the others, which require more work or even combat."] = "Puedes empezar las Missions de Seekers of Adoulin hablando con Darcia en la Chamber of Commerce de Lower Jeuno en (H-7). Cuando llegues a Western Adoulin propiamente dicho (misión 1-5), habla con un NPC llamado Task Delegator (el más cercano está justo a tu lado en Western Adoulin E-8) para empezar a acumular imprimaturs a razón de uno cada 6 horas reales. El máximo es 15, así que conviene gastar algunos cada pocos días para ir completando poco a poco todas las Coalition Assignments. Como aún no eres nivel 99, úsalos en la Couriers' Coalition (teletranspórtate a un Waypoint de Ceizak Battlegrounds, que puedes desbloquear sin peligro en montura, e interactúa con un NPC) o en la Inventors' Coalition (si tienes gil, ¡incluso puedes comprar los objetos en la AH!) en lugar de las demás, que requieren más trabajo o incluso combate.",
    ["You can talk to the local Sparks Merchant to purchase equipment for Sparks (ignore the non-equipment items until you're 99, if ever - they're all very overpriced.)"] = "Puedes hablar con el vendedor de Sparks de tu ciudad para comprar equipo con Sparks (ignora lo que no sea equipo hasta el 99, si es que alguna vez: todo está carísimo.)",
    ["You can technically start the Wings of the Goddess missions now, but the first fight wants you to be level 75+. That said, there's four Home Points and twenty Survival Guides in the past if you truly desire."] = "Técnicamente puedes empezar ya las misiones de Wings of the Goddess, pero la primera pelea pide nivel 75+. Dicho esto, en el pasado hay cuatro Home Points y veinte Survival Guides si de verdad te apetece.",
    ["You can trade the Sutlac back to Hadahda if you prefer an Imperial Bronze Piece."] = "Puedes devolver el Sutlac a Hadahda si prefieres una Imperial Bronze Piece.",
    ["You can't save progress on this mission: if you wipe without Reraise or have to quit, you start over. At level 99 the escort takes 30-40 minutes solo. This is your last chance to progress Rhapsodies of Vana'diel until after Dawn."] = "No puedes guardar el progreso de esta misión: si caéis todos sin Reraise o tienes que salir, empiezas de nuevo. A nivel 99 la escolta lleva 30-40 minutos en solitario. Es tu última oportunidad de avanzar en Rhapsodies of Vana'diel hasta después de Dawn.",
    ["You cannot start this quest if you have another Weapon Skill quest active or if you are on the quest Cid's Secret. You need level 71 and the Rise of the Zilart pack."] = "No puedes empezar esta quest si tienes otra quest de Weapon Skill activa o si estás en la quest Cid's Secret. Necesitas nivel 71 y el pack Rise of the Zilart.",
    ["You cannot start this quest if you have another Weapon Skill quest active; return to the person who gave it and quit it first."] = "No puedes empezar esta quest si tienes otra quest de Weapon Skill activa; vuelve con quien te la dio y abandónala primero.",
    ["You cannot start this quest if you have another Weapon Skill quest active; return to the person who gave it and quit it first. Speak with Jakoh Wahcondalo in Kazham (J-9) to receive the Dagger of Trials."] = "No puedes empezar esta quest si tienes otra quest de Weapon Skill activa; vuelve con quien te la dio y abandónala primero. Habla con Jakoh Wahcondalo en Kazham (J-9) para recibir la Dagger of Trials.",
    ["You cannot start this quest if you have another Weapon Skill quest active; return to the person who gave it and quit it first. You need Axe skill 240 or higher and level 71."] = "No puedes empezar esta quest si tienes otra quest de Weapon Skill activa; vuelve con quien te la dio y abandónala primero. Necesitas habilidad de Axe 240 o superior y nivel 71.",
    ["You cannot start this quest if you have another Weapon Skill quest active; return to the person who gave it and quit it first. You need Great Axe skill 240 or higher, level 71, and the Rise of the Zilart pack."] = "No puedes empezar esta quest si tienes otra quest de Weapon Skill activa; vuelve con quien te la dio y abandónala primero. Necesitas habilidad de Great Axe 240 o superior, nivel 71 y el pack Rise of the Zilart.",
    ["You cannot start this quest if you have another Weapon Skill quest active; return to the person who gave it and quit it first. You need Great Sword skill 250 or higher and level 71."] = "No puedes empezar esta quest si tienes otra quest de Weapon Skill activa; vuelve con quien te la dio y abandónala primero. Necesitas habilidad de Great Sword 250 o superior y nivel 71.",
    ["You cannot start this quest if you have another Weapon Skill quest active; return to the person who gave it and quit it first. You need Scythe skill 240 or higher and level 71."] = "No puedes empezar esta quest si tienes otra quest de Weapon Skill activa; vuelve con quien te la dio y abandónala primero. Necesitas habilidad de Scythe 240 o superior y nivel 71.",
    ["You cannot start this quest if you have another Weapon Skill quest active; return to the person who gave it and quit it first. You need a Ninja of level 71 and Katana skill 250 or higher, and the Rise of the Zilart pack."] = "No puedes empezar esta quest si tienes otra quest de Weapon Skill activa; vuelve con quien te la dio y abandónala primero. Necesitas un Ninja de nivel 71 y habilidad de Katana de 250 o superior, y el pack Rise of the Zilart.",
    ["You cannot start this quest if you have another Weapon Skill quest active; return to the person who gave it and quit it first. You need level 71, and the Rise of the Zilart pack."] = "No puedes empezar esta quest si tienes otra quest de Weapon Skill activa; vuelve con quien te la dio y abandónala primero. Necesitas nivel 71 y el pack Rise of the Zilart.",
    ["You cannot start this quest if you have another Weapon Skill quest active; return to the person who gave it and quit it first. You need to be level 71 with a base Great Katana skill of 250 or higher."] = "No puedes empezar esta quest si tienes otra quest de Weapon Skill activa; vuelve con quien te la dio y abandónala primero. Debes ser nivel 71 con una habilidad base de Great Katana de 250 o superior.",
    ["You cannot start this quest while another Weapon Skill quest is active; return to the person who gave it and quit it first. It requires Staff skill 230 or higher and level 71."] = "No puedes empezar esta quest mientras otra quest de Weapon Skill esté activa; vuelve con quien te la dio y abandónala primero. Requiere habilidad de Staff 230 o superior y nivel 71.",
    ["You cannot start this quest while another Weapon Skill quest is active; return to the person who gave it and quit it first. You need Archery skill 250 or higher, level 71, and the Rise of the Zilart pack."] = "No puedes empezar esta quest mientras otra quest de Weapon Skill esté activa; vuelve con quien te la dio y abandónala primero. Necesitas habilidad de Archery 250 o superior, nivel 71 y el pack Rise of the Zilart.",
    ["You cannot start this quest while another Weapon Skill quest is active; return to the person who gave it and quit it first. You need Club skill 230 or higher, level 71 and the Rise of the Zilart pack, and your main job must be WAR, MNK, WHM, BLM, PLD, SMN, BLU, SCH or GEO."] = "No puedes empezar esta quest mientras otra quest de Weapon Skill esté activa; vuelve con quien te la dio y abandónala primero. Necesitas habilidad de Club 230 o superior, nivel 71 y el pack Rise of the Zilart, y tu trabajo principal debe ser WAR, MNK, WHM, BLM, PLD, SMN, BLU, SCH o GEO.",
    ["You cannot start this quest while another Weapon Skill quest is active; return to the person who gave it and quit it first. You need Polearm skill 240 or higher, level 71 and the Rise of the Zilart pack."] = "No puedes empezar esta quest si tienes otra quest de Weapon Skill activa; vuelve con quien te la dio y abandónala primero. Necesitas habilidad de Polearm 240 o superior, nivel 71 y el pack Rise of the Zilart.",
    ["You don't need to zone before the next quest, Full Speed Ahead!, but Mapitoto won't acknowledge you without the Map of the Jeuno area (Rusese, M&P Market in Upper Jeuno (H-6), 600 gil)."] = "No hace falta cambiar de zona antes de la siguiente quest, Full Speed Ahead!, pero Mapitoto no te hará caso sin el Map of the Jeuno area (Rusese, M&P Market en Upper Jeuno (H-6), 600 gil).",
    ["You drop into a courtyard; the ??? is on the first platform to the north. A True-Sight Yagudo High Priest usually stands right on it: wait for it to move, or let a Trust tank hold it while you examine the ??? and warp out."] = "Caes a un patio; la ??? está en la primera plataforma al norte. Un Yagudo High Priest con True-Sight suele estar justo encima: espera a que se mueva, o deja que un Trust tanque lo sujete mientras examinas la ??? y te teletransportas fuera.",
    ["You enter Abyssea - Empyreal Paradox automatically and get a cutscene. The Wyrm God starts right after."] = "Entras automáticamente en Abyssea - Empyreal Paradox y ves una escena. The Wyrm God empieza justo después.",
    ["You enter on the east side of the map, in the room at (I-8), which is also where the Rune of Release appears."] = "Entras por el lado este del mapa, en la sala de (I-8), que es también donde aparece la Rune of Release.",
    ["You fail if Ken spots you at any time, and he sees a long way. He attacks every unclaimed monster in sight and can't be stopped, and is in danger after 3-4 fights, so keep him alive from out of his sight. After each kill he snaps back to his path, often turning round, so don't stand behind him curing."] = "Fallas si Ken te ve en cualquier momento, y ve desde muy lejos. Ataca a todo monstruo libre que vea y no se le puede detener, y corre peligro tras 3-4 peleas, así que mantenlo con vida fuera de su vista. Tras cada muerte vuelve de golpe a su camino, a menudo dándose la vuelta, así que no te quedes detrás curándolo.",
    ["You fight Balamor and three Dullahan alongside Arciela. The Regicidal Dullahan always targets Arciela, and the battle is lost if she falls. Balamor and his two Sycophants share hate. Only Balamor has to be beaten; he surrenders around 20%. Trusts are allowed."] = "Luchas contra Balamor y tres Dullahan junto a Arciela. El Regicidal Dullahan siempre ataca a Arciela, y la batalla se pierde si cae. Balamor y sus dos Sycophants comparten el odio. Solo hay que vencer a Balamor; se rinde hacia el 20%. Se permiten Trusts.",
    ["You fight The Keeper (SCH/BLM, the toughest; kill it last), Mistdagger (NIN) and The Briars (a Galka WAR and an Elvaan RDM/BLM). They run to random targets to use weapon skills, so expect skillchains on your party. Trusts are allowed."] = "Luchas contra The Keeper (SCH/BLM, la más dura; mátala la última), Mistdagger (NIN) y The Briars (un Galka WAR y un Elvaan RDM/BLM). Corren hacia objetivos al azar para usar weapon skills, así que espera skillchains sobre tu grupo. Se permiten Trusts.",
    ["You get a Cactuar key. Redeem the key at the red treasure coffer in Tenshodo Headquarters, Lower Jeuno (J-8)."] = "Recibes una Cactuar key. Canjéala en el cofre rojo del cuartel del Tenshodo, Lower Jeuno (J-8).",
    ["You get a Chocobo key. Redeem the key at the red treasure coffer in Tenshodo Headquarters, Lower Jeuno (J-8)."] = "Recibes una Chocobo key. Canjéala en el cofre rojo del cuartel del Tenshodo, Lower Jeuno (J-8).",
    ["You get a Tonberry key. Redeem the key at the red treasure coffer in Tenshodo Headquarters, Lower Jeuno (J-8)."] = "Recibes una Tonberry key. Canjéala en el cofre rojo del cuartel del Tenshodo, Lower Jeuno (J-8).",
    ["You get a cutscene on entering Arrapago Reef."] = "Al entrar en Arrapago Reef ves una escena.",
    ["You get the Amber Key when the battle ends. Redeem it at the red coffer in Tenshodo HQ, Lower Jeuno (J-8)."] = "Recibes la Amber Key al terminar la batalla. Canjéala en el cofre rojo del cuartel del Tenshodo, Lower Jeuno (J-8).",
    ["You get the Gauntlet Challenge Kupon."] = "Recibes el Gauntlet Challenge Kupon.",
    ["You get the Ivory Key after the cutscene. Redeem it at the red coffer in Tenshodo HQ, Lower Jeuno (J-8)."] = "Recibes la Ivory Key tras la escena. Canjéala en el cofre rojo del cuartel del Tenshodo, Lower Jeuno (J-8).",
    ["You get the Vial of Chaos's blood. Return to Heroes' Gambit (J-9) for the final cutscene and choose a ring. You can defer the choice; a dropped ring can be replaced free once per conquest tally (zone first if you dropped it in Xarcabard)."] = "Recibes el Vial of Chaos's blood. Vuelve al Heroes' Gambit (J-9) para la última escena y elige un anillo. Puedes aplazar la elección; un anillo tirado se puede reponer gratis una vez por conquest tally (cambia de zona antes si lo tiraste en Xarcabard).",
    ["You have 30 minutes to complete the quest."] = "Tienes 30 minutos para completar la quest.",
    ["You have 30 minutes, up to 6 players, each with their own letter key item; there's no level cap, but Trusts can't be used. Shikaree X is BST/NIN with a rabbit pet (resists sleep but not bind or gravity; if it dies first, X summons another), and Shikaree Y is DRK/MNK, and Shikaree Z is DRG/WHM with a wyvern that resists sleep. The Shikaree are hard to sleep, it doesn't last, and they build TP fast and skillchain with each other."] = "Tienes 30 minutos, hasta 6 jugadores, cada uno con su propio key item de carta; no hay límite de nivel, pero no se pueden usar Trusts. Shikaree X es BST/NIN con un conejo de mascota (resiste el sueño pero no bind ni gravity; si muere primero, X invoca otro), Shikaree Y es DRK/MNK y Shikaree Z es DRG/WHM con un wyvern que resiste el sueño. A los Shikaree cuesta dormirlos, el sueño dura poco, y acumulan TP rápido y hacen skillchains entre ellos.",
    ["You have 30 minutes, up to 6 players, each with their own letter key item; there's no level cap, but Trusts can't be used. Shikaree X is BST/NIN with a rabbit pet (resists sleep but not bind or gravity; if it dies first, X summons another), and Shikaree Y is DRK/MNK. The Shikaree are hard to sleep, it doesn't last, and they build TP fast and skillchain with each other."] = "Tienes 30 minutos, hasta 6 jugadores, cada uno con su propio key item de carta; no hay límite de nivel, pero no se pueden usar Trusts. Shikaree X es BST/NIN con un conejo de mascota (resiste el sueño pero no bind ni gravity; si muere primero, X invoca otro), y Shikaree Y es DRK/MNK. A los Shikaree cuesta dormirlos, el sueño dura poco, y acumulan TP rápido y hacen skillchains entre ellos.",
    ["You have 30 minutes. Escort Wanzo-Unzozo until he stops on his own, then speak with him to receive the key item Completion certificate. If he vanishes before you speak with him, you do not get the key item and must do the quest again."] = "Tienes 30 minutos. Escolta a Wanzo-Unzozo hasta que se detenga por sí solo y luego habla con él para recibir el key item Completion certificate. Si desaparece antes de que hables con él, no obtienes el key item y debes repetir la quest.",
    ["You have to zone after completing Welcome to Bastok. You must be level 31 or higher. Speak with Powhatan in Port Bastok (E-6) to start the quest."] = "Debes cambiar de zona tras completar Welcome to Bastok. Debes ser nivel 31 o superior. Habla con Powhatan en Port Bastok (E-6) para empezar la quest.",
    ["You know the latent is broken when the elemental resistances listed in the Sapara of Trials description have disappeared from the elemental resistances in the equipment window."] = "Sabrás que el latent está roto cuando las resistencias elementales indicadas en la descripción del Sapara of Trials hayan desaparecido de las resistencias elementales de la ventana de equipo.",
    ["You know the latent is broken when the elemental resistances listed in the Scythe of Trials description have disappeared from the elemental resistances in the equipment window."] = "Sabrás que el latent está roto cuando las resistencias elementales indicadas en la descripción de la Scythe of Trials hayan desaparecido de las resistencias elementales de la ventana de equipo.",
    ["You may additionally speak with Ailbeche, Exoroche and Vemalpeau for more quest-related dialogue. Vemalpeau takes your Knight's confession key item."] = "Además puedes hablar con Ailbeche, Exoroche y Vemalpeau para más diálogo de la quest. Vemalpeau se queda tu key item Knight's confession.",
    ["You may already be familiar with Treasure Chests in some dungeons, but it's important to know that these are different from Treasure Coffers. Each chest type uses a different type of key, so make doubly sure you are picking up the right key when hunting these coffers."] = "Puede que ya conozcas los Treasure Chests de algunas mazmorras, pero es importante saber que son distintos de los Treasure Coffers. Cada tipo de cofre usa un tipo de llave distinto, así que asegúrate bien de coger la llave correcta cuando busques estos cofres.",
    ["You may also keep the whisper to meet the requirements of the quest The Moonlit Path."] = "También puedes conservar el whisper para cumplir los requisitos de la quest The Moonlit Path.",
    ["You may also keep the whisper to meet the requirements of the quest The Moonlit Path. Do not turn in the quest if you want to complete The Moonlit Path."] = "También puedes conservar el whisper para cumplir los requisitos de la quest The Moonlit Path. No entregues la quest si quieres completar The Moonlit Path.",
    ["You may need to be on Wings of the Goddess Mission 8 (In the Name of the Father) or later. If the quests Champion of the Dawn and A Forbidden Reunion are flagged, finish them first. Without Wings of the Goddess you continue to Uncertain Destinations; with it, to Ganged Up On."] = "Puede que tengas que estar en la Wings of the Goddess Mission 8 (In the Name of the Father) o más allá. Si están activas las quests Champion of the Dawn y A Forbidden Reunion, termínalas primero. Sin Wings of the Goddess sigues a Uncertain Destinations; con ella, a Ganged Up On.",
    ["You may prepare for the upcoming battle and, whenever you are ready, trade Dodmos the tuning fork to be transported to the arena."] = "Puedes prepararte para el combate y, cuando estés listo, entrega el tuning fork a Dodmos para que te transporte a la arena.",
    ["You may prepare for the upcoming battle and, whenever you are ready, trade Lacia the tuning fork to be transported to the arena."] = "Puedes prepararte para el combate y, cuando estés listo, entrega el tuning fork a Lacia para que te transporte a la arena.",
    ["You may prepare for the upcoming battle and, whenever you are ready, trade Rahi Fohlatti the tuning fork to be transported to the arena."] = "Puedes prepararte para el combate y, cuando estés listo, entrega el tuning fork a Rahi Fohlatti para que te transporte a la arena.",
    ["You may re-obtain the Mini Tuning Fork from Dodmos at any point if you want to repeat the fight, but he will no longer teleport you to the Cloister. Try to fight Ifrit on Watersday and do not fight him on Firesday."] = "Puedes volver a conseguir el Mini Tuning Fork de Dodmos en cualquier momento si quieres repetir el combate, pero él ya no te teletransportará a la Cloister. Intenta luchar contra Ifrit en Watersday y no luches contra él en Firesday.",
    ["You may re-obtain the Mini Tuning Fork from Lacia at any point if you want to repeat the fight, but she will no longer teleport you to the Cloister."] = "Puedes volver a conseguir el Mini Tuning Fork de Lacia en cualquier momento si quieres repetir el combate, pero ella ya no te teletransportará a la Cloister.",
    ["You may re-obtain the Mini Tuning Fork from Rahi Fohlatti at any point if you want to repeat the fight, but she will no longer teleport you to the Cloister."] = "Puedes volver a conseguir el Mini Tuning Fork de Rahi Fohlatti en cualquier momento si quieres repetir el combate, pero ella ya no te teletransportará a la Cloister.",
    ["You may re-obtain the Mini Tuning Fork from Verctissa at any point if you want to repeat the fight, but she will no longer teleport you to the Cloister."] = "Puedes volver a conseguir el Mini Tuning Fork de Verctissa en cualquier momento si quieres repetir el combate, pero ella ya no te teletransportará a la Cloister.",
    ["You must already have signed up with the Woodworking Guild: speak to the Guild Master, Cheupirudaux, in Northern San d'Oria (F-3)."] = "Debes haberte inscrito ya en el Woodworking Guild: habla con el Guild Master, Cheupirudaux, en Northern San d'Oria (F-3).",
    ["You must be a Summoner of level 20 or higher. Speak with Castilchat in Northern San d'Oria (E-7) to begin the quest and obtain a Mini tuning fork of ice."] = "Debes ser Summoner de nivel 20 o superior. Habla con Castilchat en Northern San d'Oria (E-7) para empezar la quest y obtener un Mini tuning fork of ice.",
    ["You must be a Summoner of level 20 or higher. Speak with Ferrol in Port Bastok (I-8) to begin the quest and obtain a Mini tuning fork of earth."] = "Debes ser Summoner de nivel 20 o superior. Habla con Ferrol en Port Bastok (I-8) para empezar la quest y obtener un Mini tuning fork of earth.",
    ["You must be in Seekers of Adoulin's Behind the Sluices, at least past entering the sluice. Enter Rala Waterways from Western Adoulin (F-5) (Adoulin Waterfront waypoint)."] = "Debes estar en Behind the Sluices de Seekers of Adoulin, al menos tras haber entrado en la compuerta. Entra en Rala Waterways desde Western Adoulin (F-5) (waypoint de Adoulin Waterfront).",
    ["You must be level 10 or higher. First, zone at (C-7) in Northern San d'Oria."] = "Debes ser nivel 10 o superior. Primero, cambia de zona en (C-7) de Northern San d'Oria.",
    ["You must be level 5 or higher on any job."] = "Debes ser nivel 5 o superior con cualquier trabajo.",
    ["You must complete Storms of Fate to trigger this quest, and you need the key item Whisper of the Wyrmking."] = "Debes completar Storms of Fate para activar esta quest, y necesitas el key item Whisper of the Wyrmking.",
    ["You must first have Zilart Mission 5, Headstone Pilgrimage, active or complete, and have the Rise of the Zilart pack. The Opo-opos are not happy that you stole their \"red treasure\"."] = "Debes tener primero la Zilart Mission 5, Headstone Pilgrimage, activa o completada, y tener el pack Rise of the Zilart. Los Opo-opos no están contentos de que les robaras su \"red treasure\".",
    ["You must first have completed Zilart Mission 7 and have the Rise of the Zilart pack."] = "Primero debes haber completado la Zilart Mission 7 y tener el pack Rise of the Zilart.",
    ["You must hand out all 15 flyers or the quest won't complete. If you lose some, trade Regine 10 gil per flyer (one per trade), or buy them at the Auction House."] = "Debes repartir los 15 folletos o la quest no se completará. Si pierdes alguno, entrega a Regine 10 gil por folleto (uno por entrega) o cómpralos en la Auction House.",
    ["You must have Zilart Mission 5, Headstone Pilgrimage, activated (or already completed), and have the Rise of the Zilart pack. Is there any way to soothe the spirits that wander about Cape Teriggan? Perhaps a Rain Lily."] = "Debes tener la Zilart Mission 5, Headstone Pilgrimage, activada (o ya completada), y tener el pack Rise of the Zilart. ¿Hay alguna forma de calmar a los espíritus que vagan por Cape Teriggan? Quizá una Rain Lily.",
    ["You must have completed Indomitable Spirit and have the Ebisu Fishing Rod, and you must have fished up 100 different fish. After Fisherman's Heart, Katsunaga in Mhaura (H-9) can tell you how many you have caught. You also need the Rise of the Zilart, Chains of Promathia, Treasures of Aht Urhgan, Wings of the Goddess, Seekers of Adoulin and Scars of Abyssea packs."] = "Debes haber completado Indomitable Spirit y tener la Ebisu Fishing Rod, y haber pescado 100 peces distintos. Tras Fisherman's Heart, Katsunaga en Mhaura (H-9) te puede decir cuántos has pescado. También necesitas los packs de Rise of the Zilart, Chains of Promathia, Treasures of Aht Urhgan, Wings of the Goddess, Seekers of Adoulin y Scars of Abyssea.",
    ["You must have completed Voidwatch Ops: Border Crossing and started Zilart Mission 14, Ark Angels."] = "Debes haber completado Voidwatch Ops: Border Crossing y empezado la Zilart Mission 14, Ark Angels.",
    ["You must have completed Zilart Mission 4, The Temple of Uggalepih."] = "Debes haber completado la Zilart Mission 4, The Temple of Uggalepih.",
    ["You must have progressed through Promathia Mission 3-2."] = "Debes haber avanzado hasta la Promathia Mission 3-2.",
    ["You must have the Damp Scroll in your inventory when you speak with Shivivi in Norg (J-8) to begin the quest."] = "Debes tener la Damp Scroll en tu inventario cuando hables con Shivivi en Norg (J-8) para empezar la quest.",
    ["You must have the Map of the Quicksand Caves; the Goblin marks the stone spots on it."] = "Debes tener el Map of the Quicksand Caves; el Goblin marca en él los puntos de las piedras.",
    ["You must have zoned once after finishing Forever to Hold to receive this quest."] = "Debes haber cambiado de zona una vez tras terminar Forever to Hold para recibir esta quest.",
    ["You must receive Cipher: Selh'teus to continue. If you didn't, get it from the Mystic Retriever in Empyreal Paradox."] = "Debes recibir Cipher: Selh'teus para continuar. Si no lo recibiste, consíguelo del Mystic Retriever de Empyreal Paradox.",
    ["You must receive Cipher: Tenzen II to finish. If your inventory was full, get it from the Mystic Retriever at the palace entrance."] = "Debes recibir Cipher: Tenzen II para terminar. Si tenías el inventario lleno, consíguelo del Mystic Retriever de la entrada del palacio.",
    ["You must wait until the next game day after completing The Talekeeper's Truth before you can activate this quest. You must be a Warrior of level 50 or higher."] = "Debes esperar al siguiente día de juego tras completar The Talekeeper's Truth antes de poder activar esta quest. Debes ser Warrior de nivel 50 o superior.",
    ["You must zone after completing A Greeting Cardian before you start this quest."] = "Debes cambiar de zona tras completar A Greeting Cardian antes de empezar esta quest.",
    ["You must zone after completing As Thick as Thieves before you start this quest."] = "Debes cambiar de zona tras completar As Thick as Thieves antes de empezar esta quest.",
    ["You must zone after completing Chasing Tales before you can start this quest."] = "Debes cambiar de zona tras completar Chasing Tales antes de poder empezar esta quest.",
    ["You must zone after completing Delivering the Goods before Ulamaal gives you this quest. Speak with Ulamaal in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-12) to begin the quest. This quest requires the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack. The leader of the Epicureans has been missing since saying he was going to the port."] = "Debes cambiar de zona tras completar Delivering the Goods antes de que Ulamaal te dé esta quest. Habla con Ulamaal en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-12) para empezar la quest. Esta quest requiere el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan. El líder de los Epicureans lleva desaparecido desde que dijo que iba al puerto.",
    ["You must zone after completing Fire and Brimstone before you start this quest."] = "Debes cambiar de zona tras completar Fire and Brimstone antes de empezar esta quest.",
    ["You must zone after completing Food for Thought before you can start this quest."] = "Debes cambiar de zona tras completar Food for Thought antes de poder empezar esta quest.",
    ["You must zone after completing Gullible's Travels before you can flag this quest. You need Kazham fame level 7 and the Rise of the Zilart pack. Magriffon has spent all of his (your?) money to save a maiden in distress."] = "Debes cambiar de zona tras completar Gullible's Travels antes de poder activar esta quest. Necesitas el nivel 7 de fama de Kazham y el pack Rise of the Zilart. Magriffon ha gastado todo su dinero (¿tuyo?) para salvar a una doncella en apuros.",
    ["You must zone after completing Making Headlines before you start this quest."] = "Debes cambiar de zona tras completar Making Headlines antes de empezar esta quest.",
    ["You must zone after completing Omens to start this quest; if you do not zone and get a divination from Waoud, you will have to wait for the next game day. You need the Treasures of Aht Urhgan pack."] = "Debes cambiar de zona tras completar Omens para empezar esta quest; si no cambias de zona y pides una adivinación a Waoud, tendrás que esperar al siguiente día de juego. Necesitas el pack Treasures of Aht Urhgan.",
    ["You must zone after completing Sin Hunting before you start this quest."] = "Debes cambiar de zona tras completar Sin Hunting antes de empezar esta quest.",
    ["You must zone after completing The Sacred Katana to begin this quest. Speak with Jaucribaix in Norg (K-8). You need to be a Samurai of level 50 or higher and have the Rise of the Zilart pack. A ritual is needed to send the souls of those who died in a long-ago war to their proper resting place."] = "Debes cambiar de zona tras completar The Sacred Katana para empezar esta quest. Habla con Jaucribaix en Norg (K-8). Debes ser Samurai de nivel 50 o superior y tener el pack Rise of the Zilart. Se necesita un ritual para enviar a su lugar de descanso a las almas de los muertos en una guerra de hace mucho.",
    ["You must zone after completing Yomi Okuri to begin this quest. Speak with Jaucribaix in Norg (K-8). You need to be a Samurai of level 50 or higher and have the Rise of the Zilart pack. At the close of the Great War, Gilgamesh's father trapped a terrible spirit within a helm, and that helm has been stolen."] = "Debes cambiar de zona tras completar Yomi Okuri para empezar esta quest. Habla con Jaucribaix en Norg (K-8). Debes ser Samurai de nivel 50 o superior y tener el pack Rise of the Zilart. Al final de la Great War, el padre de Gilgamesh encerró a un espíritu terrible en un yelmo, y ese yelmo ha sido robado.",
    ["You must zone after completing the previous quest. Speak with Shantotto in Windurst Walls (K-7): answer \"Ask if you're worthy\" and then \"Whatchu talkin' 'bout Shantotto?\" (\"Yes mommy\" gives you the title Total Loser)."] = "Debes cambiar de zona tras completar la quest anterior. Habla con Shantotto en Windurst Walls (K-7): responde \"Ask if you're worthy\" y luego \"Whatchu talkin' 'bout Shantotto?\" (\"Yes mommy\" te da el título Total Loser).",
    ["You must zone after completing the previous quest. This quest cannot be started while Windurst Mission 9-2 or the quest The Kind Cardian is open."] = "Debes cambiar de zona tras completar la quest anterior. Esta quest no se puede empezar mientras la Windurst Mission 9-2 o la quest The Kind Cardian estén abiertas.",
    ["You must zone after the previous quest, The Wayward Automaton, in order to start this quest. Speak with Iruki-Waraki in Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-9) as a Puppetmaster of level 50 or higher. You discover that he is trying to get his automaton back and has formed a plan, and he gives you a shopping list of items. From here on you can be on any job."] = "Debes cambiar de zona tras la quest anterior, The Wayward Automaton, para empezar esta quest. Habla con Iruki-Waraki en Aht Urhgan Whitegate (K-9) como Puppetmaster de nivel 50 o superior. Descubres que intenta recuperar su autómata y ha ideado un plan, y te da una lista de la compra. A partir de aquí puedes ir con cualquier trabajo.",
    ["You must zone again if you have not done so since receiving the Bouncer Club."] = "Debes cambiar de zona de nuevo si no lo has hecho desde que recibiste el Bouncer Club.",
    ["You need Bastok fame level 3 and to have completed Father Figure. Obtain a Cinnamon from the Auction House or, if you have the Kazham Airship Pass, from the port shop in Kazham. You can reach the vendor without being on the airship side: take the Survival Guide or Home Point to Kazham and buy Cinnamon from Ghemi Sinterilo."] = "Necesitas el nivel 3 de fama de Bastok y haber completado Father Figure. Obtén una Cinnamon en la Auction House o, si tienes el Kazham Airship Pass, en la tienda del puerto de Kazham. Puedes llegar al vendedor sin estar en el lado de la airship: toma la Survival Guide o el Home Point a Kazham y compra Cinnamon a Ghemi Sinterilo.",
    ["You need Scavenge (Ranger main or subjob). In Castle Oztroja, pull the correct handle and go through the Brass Door at (I-8) on map 1. On map 2, get the day's four-lever password at (I-10) (or try combinations) and open the Brass Door at (G-8). Upstairs on map 3, go to the leech pool at (H-9)."] = "Necesitas Scavenge (Ranger como job principal o support). En Castle Oztroja, tira de la palanca correcta y cruza la Brass Door de (I-8) en el mapa 1. En el mapa 2, consigue la contraseña de cuatro palancas del día en (I-10) (o prueba combinaciones) y abre la Brass Door de (G-8). Arriba, en el mapa 3, ve al estanque de sanguijuelas de (H-9).",
    ["You need Windurst fame level 6 (Kazham uses the fame of Windurst). Speak with Soun Abralah in Kazham (H-9). He needs a piece of wood from the Firebloom Tree that will not burn, even in the inferno of Ifrit's Cauldron."] = "Necesitas fama de Windurst nivel 6 (Kazham usa la fama de Windurst). Habla con Soun Abralah en Kazham (H-9). Necesita un trozo de madera del Firebloom Tree que no arda, ni siquiera en el infierno de Ifrit's Cauldron.",
    ["You need a Broken Lu Shang's Rod, which you can get by breaking your own Lu Shang's Fishing Rod or buying a broken one. You need the Rise of the Zilart pack."] = "Necesitas una Broken Lu Shang's Rod, que puedes conseguir rompiendo tu propia Lu Shang's Fishing Rod o comprando una rota. Necesitas el pack Rise of the Zilart.",
    ["You need a Fishing skill of at least 20 (gear included). Speak with Katsunaga on the waterfront in Mhaura (H-9)."] = "Necesitas al menos 20 de skill de Fishing (equipo incluido). Habla con Katsunaga en el muelle de Mhaura (H-9).",
    ["You need a Lu Shang's Fishing Rod (it can be bought; The Rivalry is not required) and to have completed the Records of Eminence objective First Step Forward."] = "Necesitas una Lu Shang's Fishing Rod (se puede comprar; no hace falta The Rivalry) y haber completado el objetivo de Records of Eminence First Step Forward.",
    ["You need a job at level 30 or higher and Wings of the Goddess. Speak with Laila in Upper Jeuno (G-7) (Home Point #1 is close) and answer \"I surely do.\" and then \"Never!\". She asks for a Stardust pebble."] = "Necesitas un job de nivel 30 o superior y Wings of the Goddess. Habla con Laila en Upper Jeuno (G-7) (el Home Point #1 está cerca) y responde \"I surely do.\" y luego \"Never!\". Te pide un Stardust pebble.",
    ["You need access to Phomiuna Aqueducts or the Sacrarium (each needs different Chains of Promathia progress). In either, find a ??? on a bookshelf for the key item Tavnazian cookbook; it moves to the next room about every 10 minutes."] = "Necesitas acceso a Phomiuna Aqueducts o al Sacrarium (cada uno requiere un progreso distinto en Chains of Promathia). En cualquiera de los dos, busca una ??? en una estantería para obtener el key item Tavnazian cookbook; se mueve a la sala siguiente cada 10 minutos aproximadamente.",
    ["You need an airship pass. Speak with Swift in Kazham (H-7) and accept the quest."] = "Necesitas un pase de aeronave. Habla con Swift en Kazham (H-7) y acepta la quest.",
    ["You need at least one Unlit Lantern, dropped by Tonberry Maledictors. Four players with four lanterns is easiest, but all four lamps at the altar must be lit, and you can solo it by making four trips; the altar stays lit for a good while."] = "Necesitas al menos una Unlit Lantern, que sueltan los Tonberry Maledictors. Lo más fácil es que cuatro jugadores lleven cuatro farolillos, pero las cuatro lámparas del altar deben estar encendidas, y puedes hacerlo en solitario con cuatro viajes; el altar se mantiene encendido un buen rato.",
    ["You need the Watercrafting and Climbing survival skills to reach Yorcia Weald from Cirdas Caverns."] = "Necesitas las survival skills de Watercrafting y Climbing para llegar a Yorcia Weald desde Cirdas Caverns.",
    ["You need the scent from Even More Gullible's Travels. This scent repulses all Mithra in Kazham, but it is required to start The Opo-opo and I, so if you plan to do that quest, do not wash it off before you start it. You need the Rise of the Zilart pack."] = "Necesitas el olor de Even More Gullible's Travels. Este olor repele a todos los Mithra de Kazham, pero es necesario para empezar The Opo-opo and I, así que si piensas hacer esa quest, no te lo quites antes de empezarla. Necesitas el pack Rise of the Zilart.",
    ["You need to be a Corsair of level 66 or higher and have a Corsair's Testimony, from Merrow Icedancer, Merrow Kabukidancer, Merrow Chantress or Lamia Fatedealer enemies. Two Merrow Icedancers are easy to reach at Arrapago Reef (F-8), map 2, via the Runic Portal to the Ilrusi Atoll Staging Point. Set the Records of Eminence objective Tutorial > Level Cap Increase > Level Cap Increase: 75 (COR) first."] = "Necesitas ser Corsair de nivel 66 o superior y tener un Corsair's Testimony, de los enemigos Merrow Icedancer, Merrow Kabukidancer, Merrow Chantress o Lamia Fatedealer. Hay dos Merrow Icedancers fáciles de alcanzar en Arrapago Reef (F-8), mapa 2, por el Runic Portal al Ilrusi Atoll Staging Point. Fija antes el objetivo de Records of Eminence Tutorial > Level Cap Increase > Level Cap Increase: 75 (COR).",
    ["You need to be a Scholar of level 66 or higher, and must have completed Seeing Blood-red and waited until the next game day."] = "Necesitas ser Scholar de nivel 66 o superior, y haber completado Seeing Blood-red y esperado al siguiente día de juego.",
    ["You need to be a Summoner of level 20 or higher and have Other fame level 2. Speak with Lacia in Mhaura (I-9) to begin the quest and obtain a Mini Tuning Fork of Lightning."] = "Debes ser Summoner de nivel 20 o superior y tener el nivel 2 de fama de Other. Habla con Lacia en Mhaura (I-9) para empezar la quest y obtener un Mini Tuning Fork of Lightning.",
    ["You need to be a Summoner of level 20 or higher, Kazham fame level 2 and the Rise of the Zilart pack. Speak with Dodmos in Kazham (J-9) to begin the quest and obtain a Mini Tuning Fork of Fire."] = "Debes ser Summoner de nivel 20 o superior, tener el nivel 2 de fama de Kazham y el pack Rise of the Zilart. Habla con Dodmos en Kazham (J-9) para empezar la quest y obtener un Mini Tuning Fork of Fire.",
    ["You need to be a Summoner of level 20 or higher, Outlands fame level 2 and the Rise of the Zilart pack. Speak with Verctissa in Norg (H-9) to begin the quest and obtain a Mini Tuning Fork of Water."] = "Debes ser Summoner de nivel 20 o superior, tener el nivel 2 de fama de Outlands y el pack Rise of the Zilart. Habla con Verctissa en Norg (H-9) para empezar la quest y obtener un Mini Tuning Fork of Water.",
    ["You need to be a Summoner, Rabao fame level 2 and have the Rise of the Zilart pack. Speak with Rahi Fohlatti in Rabao (G-9) to begin the quest and obtain a Mini Tuning Fork of Wind."] = "Debes ser Summoner, tener el nivel 2 de fama de Rabao y el pack Rise of the Zilart. Habla con Rahi Fohlatti en Rabao (G-9) para empezar la quest y obtener un Mini Tuning Fork of Wind.",
    ["You need to be level 30 or higher. Examine the Door: Merchant's House on the second floor in Lower Jeuno (G-11), above the chocobo stables."] = "Debes ser nivel 30 o superior. Examina la Door: Merchant's House en el segundo piso de Lower Jeuno (G-11), encima de los establos de chocobos.",
    ["You need to be level 30 or higher. Speak with Bki Tbujhja in Lower Jeuno (H-8), inside the Merry Minstrel."] = "Debes ser nivel 30 o superior. Habla con Bki Tbujhja en Lower Jeuno (H-8), dentro del Merry Minstrel.",
    ["You need to be level 30 or higher. Speak with Mertaire in the Merry Minstrel's Meadhouse in Lower Jeuno (I-8)."] = "Necesitas nivel 30 o superior. Habla con Mertaire en el Merry Minstrel's Meadhouse de Lower Jeuno (I-8).",
    ["You need to be level 60 or higher. Enter Oldton Movalpolos through the far eastern entrance in North Gustaberg (K-6) for a cutscene that starts the quest. This is not the entrance by the Survival Guide. If you turn it down, you cannot start it again until the next Conquest tally."] = "Necesitas ser de nivel 60 o superior. Entra en Oldton Movalpolos por la entrada del extremo este de North Gustaberg (K-6) para una escena que empieza la quest. No es la entrada junto a la Survival Guide. Si la rechazas, no podrás volver a empezarla hasta el siguiente Conquest tally.",
    ["You need to be level 60 or higher. Enter the Monastic Cavern through the (G-7) entrance in Davoi for a cutscene that starts the quest. If you turn it down, you cannot start it again until the next Conquest tally."] = "Necesitas ser de nivel 60 o superior. Entra en el Monastic Cavern por la entrada de (G-7) en Davoi para una escena que empieza la quest. Si la rechazas, no podrás volver a empezarla hasta el siguiente Conquest tally.",
    ["You need to be level 60 or higher. In Beadeaux, enter the Qulun Dome at (H-7), on the left after first going underground, for a cutscene that starts the quest. If you turn it down, you cannot start it again until the next Conquest tally."] = "Necesitas ser de nivel 60 o superior. En Beadeaux, entra en Qulun Dome por (H-7), a la izquierda tras bajar por primera vez al subsuelo, para una escena que empieza la quest. Si la rechazas, no podrás volver a empezarla hasta el siguiente Conquest tally.",
    ["You need to be level 66 or higher. Speak with Shamarhaan, the Puppetmaster standing near the fountain in Bastok Markets (F-9), as a Puppetmaster to begin the quest."] = "Debes ser nivel 66 o superior. Habla con Shamarhaan, el Puppetmaster que está junto a la fuente en Bastok Markets (F-9), siendo Puppetmaster, para empezar la quest.",
    ["You need to be level 75 or higher and have an Adventurer's Certificate. Speak with Owain in the Tavnazian Safehold (H-6), at Home Point #1, for a cutscene."] = "Necesitas ser de nivel 75 o superior y tener un Adventurer's Certificate. Habla con Owain en Tavnazian Safehold (H-6), en el Home Point #1, para una escena.",
    ["You need to be level 75 or higher. No other Voidwatch progress is needed to start this series."] = "Necesitas ser de nivel 75 o superior. No hace falta ningún otro progreso de Voidwatch para empezar esta serie.",
    ["You need to be on or past the Chains of Promathia mission Flames for the Dead. Speak with Buffalostalker Dodzbraz in Uleguerand Range (F-9), just southeast of the Unity warp level 128. He is an Orc who despises snolls."] = "Debes estar en la misión de Chains of Promathia Flames for the Dead o más allá. Habla con Buffalostalker Dodzbraz en Uleguerand Range (F-9), justo al sureste del warp de Unity de nivel 128. Es un Orc que detesta a los snolls.",
    ["You need to be on the Chains of Promathia mission Head Wind. Speak with Anguenet in Carpenters' Landing (J-10), right next to the Survival Guide, and choose the fourth option, Newtpool, to begin the quest."] = "Debes estar en la misión de Chains of Promathia Head Wind. Habla con Anguenet en Carpenters' Landing (J-10), justo al lado de la Survival Guide, y elige la cuarta opción, Newtpool, para empezar la quest.",
    ["You need to break the latent on the Dagger of Trials before completing the rest of the quest. You know you have enough points when the latent breaks and the weapon's elemental resistances disappear from your active resistances (the colored dots below the gear grid)."] = "Necesitas romper el latent de la Dagger of Trials antes de completar el resto de la quest. Sabrás que tienes puntos suficientes cuando el latent se rompa y las resistencias elementales del arma desaparezcan de tus resistencias activas (los puntos de colores bajo la cuadrícula de equipo).",
    ["You need to break the latent on the Kodachi of Trials. With it equipped in your main hand, fight experience-yielding monsters (Incredibly Easy Prey or higher) and perform Weapon Skills or close skillchains to accumulate 300 Trial Points. A weapon skill with no skillchain gives 5 points and a level 1 skillchain gives 7."] = "Necesitas romper el latent del Kodachi of Trials. Con él equipado en la mano principal, lucha contra monstruos que den experiencia (Incredibly Easy Prey o superior) y haz Weapon Skills o cierra skillchains para acumular 300 Trial Points. Un weapon skill sin skillchain da 5 puntos y una skillchain de nivel 1 da 7.",
    ["You need to break the latent on the Tachi of Trials. With it equipped in your main hand, fight experience-yielding monsters (Incredibly Easy Prey or higher) and perform Weapon Skills or close skillchains to accumulate 300 Trial Points."] = "Necesitas romper el latent de la Tachi of Trials. Con ella equipada en la mano principal, lucha contra monstruos que den experiencia (Incredibly Easy Prey o superior) y haz Weapon Skills o cierra skillchains para acumular 300 Trial Points.",
    ["You need to have completed Chains of Promathia Mission 3-2. Speak with Taillegeas in Ru'Lude Gardens (I-7) to begin the quest."] = "Debes haber completado Chains of Promathia Mission 3-2. Habla con Taillegeas en Ru'Lude Gardens (I-7) para empezar la quest.",
    ["You need to have completed Chasing Dreams and Promathia Mission 2-5, Ancient Vows. Speak with Zoriboh in Rabao (F-6) to begin the quest and receive the key item Care Package."] = "Debes haber completado Chasing Dreams y la Promathia Mission 2-5, Ancient Vows. Habla con Zoriboh en Rabao (F-6) para empezar la quest y recibir el key item Care Package.",
    ["You need to have completed Rise of the Zilart Mission 17 and Chains of Promathia Mission 8-4. You must zone and wait until the next game day after completing the previous quest."] = "Debes haber completado Rise of the Zilart Mission 17 y Chains of Promathia Mission 8-4. Debes cambiar de zona y esperar hasta el siguiente día de juego tras completar la quest anterior.",
    ["You need to have completed ten or more Records of Eminence objectives."] = "Necesitas haber completado diez o más objetivos de Records of Eminence.",
    ["You need to have finished Under the Sea to get this quest. Speak with Oswald in Selbina (I-9). He wants to order something nutritious to cheer his girlfriend up a bit, and asks you for the special ingredient, a Danceshroom."] = "Debes haber terminado Under the Sea para conseguir esta quest. Habla con Oswald en Selbina (I-9). Quiere encargar algo nutritivo para animar a su novia, y te pide el ingrediente especial, una Danceshroom.",
    ["You need to have reached Treasures of Aht Urhgan Mission 12, Royal Puppeteer, to go past this mission."] = "Necesitas haber llegado a la Treasures of Aht Urhgan Mission 12, Royal Puppeteer, para pasar de esta misión.",
    ["You need to wait 8 real-life hours (8 game days) after completing Way of the Cook before this quest is offered. Speak with Rycharde in Mhaura (I-8). He wants you to get him an ingredient called a puffball."] = "Debes esperar 8 horas reales (8 días de juego) tras completar Way of the Cook antes de que se ofrezca esta quest. Habla con Rycharde en Mhaura (I-8). Quiere que le consigas un ingrediente llamado puffball.",
    ["You need to wait 8 real-life hours after completing Rycharde the Chef before this quest is offered. Speak with Rycharde in Mhaura to begin it. He needs your help finding some ingredients: a beehive chip and some dhalmel meat."] = "Debes esperar 8 horas reales tras completar Rycharde the Chef antes de que se ofrezca esta quest. Habla con Rycharde en Mhaura para empezarla. Necesita ayuda para encontrar unos ingredientes: un beehive chip y algo de dhalmel meat.",
    ["You need to wait 8 real-life hours after completing The Clue before this quest is offered. Speak with Rycharde in Mhaura (I-8), who asks you to take Mhauran couscous to Valgeir in Selbina."] = "Debes esperar 8 horas reales tras completar The Clue antes de que se ofrezca esta quest. Habla con Rycharde en Mhaura (I-8), que te pide que lleves Mhauran couscous a Valgeir en Selbina.",
    ["You need to wait two, possibly three game days after completing Unending Chase before this quest is offered. Speak with Rycharde in Mhaura (I-8). He gives you an Aragoneu pizza to deliver to his father, Valgeir, in Selbina."] = "Debes esperar dos, posiblemente tres días de juego tras completar Unending Chase antes de que se ofrezca esta quest. Habla con Rycharde en Mhaura (I-8). Te da una Aragoneu pizza para entregar a su padre, Valgeir, en Selbina.",
    ["You need your Adventuring Fellow at its level cap of 50 with a familiarity of 35, and must have finished Mirror, Mirror or A Pose by Any Other Name. With your Signal Pearl or Tactics Pearl equipped, speak with Diederik in Selbina (G-10) for a cutscene."] = "Necesitas a tu Adventuring Fellow en su límite de nivel 50 con una familiaridad de 35, y haber terminado Mirror, Mirror o A Pose by Any Other Name. Con tu Signal Pearl o Tactics Pearl equipada, habla con Diederik en Selbina (G-10) para una escena.",
    ["You no longer have to be on Corsair for the rest of this quest. You are asked to fish up a Hydrogauge."] = "Ya no tienes que ser Corsair para el resto de esta quest. Te piden pescar un Hydrogauge.",
    ["You obtain the key item Orcish dried food after trading the key."] = "Obtienes el key item Orcish dried food tras entregar la llave.",
    ["You only have 7 Auction House slots, so you can only sell 7 stacks of Crystals at once."] = "Solo tienes 7 huecos en la Auction House, así que solo puedes vender 7 montones de Crystals a la vez.",
    ["You receive Cipher: Arciela II and can view all Seekers of Adoulin cutscenes."] = "Recibes Cipher: Arciela II y puedes ver todas las escenas de Seekers of Adoulin.",
    ["You receive Rhapsody in Fuchsia. If you get the Geomagnetron here, it is already attuned: just speak with Darcia in Lower Jeuno for the Adoulinian charter permit."] = "Recibes Rhapsody in Fuchsia. Si recibes el Geomagnetron aquí, ya está sintonizado: solo habla con Darcia en Lower Jeuno para obtener el Adoulinian charter permit.",
    ["You receive Rhapsody in White: +30% experience and limit points, double skill-up rate, a fifth Trust, 80% cheaper Home Points, cheaper Survival Guides and Fields of Valor buffs, and extra Curio Vendor Moogle stock."] = "Recibes Rhapsody in White: +30% de experiencia y limit points, el doble de subidas de skill, un quinto Trust, Home Points un 80% más baratos, Survival Guides y buffs de Fields of Valor más baratos, y más existencias en los Curio Vendor Moogles.",
    ["You receive a cutscene and the Ninja Hakama, and the quest is complete. You can repeat the quest."] = "Recibes una escena y la Ninja Hakama, y la quest se completa. Puedes repetir la quest.",
    ["You receive the 10,000 gil back at the end of the quest. Trading Magriffon the 10,000 gil continues this specific quest even if other quests that involve giving Magriffon gil are active."] = "Recibes de vuelta los 10,000 gil al final de la quest. Entregar a Magriffon los 10,000 gil continúa esta quest concreta aunque haya otras quests activas que impliquen darle gil a Magriffon.",
    ["You receive the Bat Earring and the title Guider of Souls to the Sanctuary."] = "Recibes el Bat Earring y el título Guider of Souls to the Sanctuary.",
    ["You receive the Soul siphon. Don't warp away: the next mission is back at the Crawling Cave. If you lose, get a new Aureate ball of fur from the Crawling Cave (F-11)."] = "Recibes el Soul siphon. No te teletransportes: la misión siguiente es de vuelta en la Crawling Cave. Si pierdes, consigue un nuevo Aureate ball of fur de la Crawling Cave (F-11).",
    ["You receive the body armor and can repeat the quest as often as you like."] = "Recibes la armadura de cuerpo y puedes repetir la quest tantas veces como quieras.",
    ["You receive the key item Signed envelope."] = "Recibes el key item Signed envelope.",
    ["You return to Beaucedine Glacier afterwards."] = "Después vuelves a Beaucedine Glacier.",
    ["You should now be in a watchtower in West Ronfaure, and Vilatroire should be up ahead after zoning in (H-5). Speak with him to activate the quest."] = "Ya deberías estar en una torre de vigilancia de West Ronfaure, y Vilatroire debería estar delante al entrar en la zona (H-5). Habla con él para activar la quest.",
    ["You shouldn't have any trouble with these at this level. Mission 3-2 is skippable."] = "A este nivel no deberías tener problemas con ellas. La Mission 3-2 se puede saltar.",
    ["You went to the end of the beastman areas near the two cities you didn't start in for Mission 2-3. However, you may not have explored to the end of your starting city's area (Palborough Mines, Yughott Grotto [attached to Ghelsba Outpost], and Giddeus), which also has a Home Point."] = "Para la Mission 2-3 fuiste al final de las zonas de hombres bestia cerca de las dos ciudades en las que no empezaste. Sin embargo, puede que no exploraras hasta el final la zona de tu ciudad inicial (Palborough Mines, Yughott Grotto [junto a Ghelsba Outpost] y Giddeus), que también tiene un Home Point.",
    ["You will begin to find level 10+ monsters once you hit the second zone on your journey, so you can continue to kill appropriate targets appropriately and gain more levels."] = "Empezarás a encontrar monstruos de nivel 10+ al llegar a la segunda zona del viaje, así que puedes seguir matando objetivos adecuados y ganando niveles.",
    ["You will have to make it at some point though so it isn't time lost."] = "De todos modos tendrás que hacerlo en algún momento, así que no es tiempo perdido.",
    ["You will know the latent is broken when its bonus stats disappear on un-equipping and re-equipping the Kodachi of Trials; the elemental resistances also disappear from your stats."] = "Sabrás que el latent está roto cuando sus bonificaciones desaparezcan al desequipar y volver a equipar el Kodachi of Trials; las resistencias elementales también desaparecen de tus estadísticas.",
    ["You will know the latent is broken when the elemental resistances listed in the description of the Tachi of Trials have disappeared from the elemental resistances in the equipment window."] = "Sabrás que el latent está roto cuando las resistencias elementales indicadas en la descripción de la Tachi of Trials hayan desaparecido de las resistencias elementales de la ventana de equipo.",
    ["You won't actually need to sit for MP in this section, because leveling up restores you to full HP and MP."] = "En esta sección no tendrás que sentarte a por MP, porque subir de nivel te devuelve el HP y el MP al máximo.",
    ["You won't be able to summon your Unity trust immediately, however: you must earn 5,000 Accolades within one Conquest Tally (one week.)"] = "Sin embargo, no podrás invocar enseguida al trust de tu Unity: debes ganar 5,000 Accolades en un mismo Conquest Tally (una semana).",
    ["You'll be heading back to this friend for new gear while leveling and once weekly to get lots of gil, so keep them in the back of your mind."] = "Volverás a ver a este amigo a por equipo nuevo mientras subes de nivel y una vez por semana a por mucho gil, así que tenlo en mente.",
    ["You'll need Sneak and Invis since the Goblins and Skeletons will still aggro."] = "Necesitarás Sneak e Invis, ya que los Goblins y los Skeletons siguen atacando.",
    ["You'll want to get every Trust eventually to boost Trust stats later on, but for now grab what you can."] = "Acabarás queriendo todos los Trusts para mejorar sus estadísticas más adelante, pero por ahora consigue los que puedas.",
    ["You're moved to Xarcabard. Examine Heroes' Gambit (J-9) again for a cutscene and your gil reward (the Despairing psyche is taken)."] = "Te llevan a Xarcabard. Examina de nuevo el Heroes' Gambit (J-9) para una escena y tu recompensa en gil (se te retira el Despairing psyche).",
    ["You're taken aboard the airship. Examine its door for another cutscene and the battlefield \"One to be Feared\" (45-minute limit; buffs wear off on entering). When one person clicks the door, the whole party is pulled in, so be ready."] = "Te llevan a bordo de la aeronave. Examina su puerta para otra escena y el campo de batalla \"One to be Feared\" (límite de 45 minutos; los buffs se pierden al entrar). Cuando una persona pulsa la puerta, entra todo el grupo, así que estad preparados.",
    ["You've got a few reasonable options and infinite mediocre ones. Since you're starting to punch a little further up, you may want to consider purchasing Jack-o'-Lantern from a Curio Vendor Moogle for +10 accuracy. At 400 gil for 30 minutes of food buff, they can help bridge the gap into a new area without putting a serious dent in your finances. (After completing RoV Mission 1-11, you can buy Pepperoni Slice instead and get attack as well as accuracy.)"] = "Tienes unas pocas opciones razonables e infinitas mediocres. Como empiezas a pegar un poco más arriba, quizá te convenga comprar Jack-o'-Lantern a un Curio Vendor Moogle para tener +10 de precisión. A 400 gil por 30 minutos de buff de comida, ayudan a dar el salto a una zona nueva sin hacer un agujero serio en tus finanzas. (Tras completar la RoV Mission 1-11, puedes comprar Pepperoni Slice en su lugar y tener ataque además de precisión.)",
    ["You, or a player helping you, need the key items Crimson orb, Yagudo torch, Silver bell, Coruscant rosary and Black matinee necklace from Nation Mission 4-1 Magicite; it's worth doing both together. Solo, you need Rank 4 with 4-1 flagged, as Aldo won't give you the Silver bell earlier."] = "Tú, o un jugador que te ayude, necesitáis los key items Crimson orb, Yagudo torch, Silver bell, Coruscant rosary y Black matinee necklace de la Nation Mission 4-1 Magicite; merece la pena hacer ambas a la vez. En solitario necesitas Rank 4 con la 4-1 activada, ya que Aldo no te da la Silver bell antes.",
    ["You, or someone in your alliance, need an Ark Pentasphere: trade an Illuminink and a Parchment to the Qu'Hau Spring in Ro'Maeve (H-6) during a full moon between 18:00 and 06:00. Illuminink drops from Cursed Puppets and Magic Flagons in Ro'Maeve."] = "Tú, o alguien de tu alianza, necesitáis una Ark Pentasphere: entrega un Illuminink y un Parchment a la Qu'Hau Spring de Ro'Maeve (H-6) durante la luna llena entre las 18:00 y las 06:00. El Illuminink lo sueltan los Cursed Puppets y Magic Flagons de Ro'Maeve.",
    ["Your Moogle names a random zone to go chocobo digging in. Bring a stack (or more) of Gysahl Greens."] = "Tu Moogle nombra una zona al azar donde excavar con chocobo. Lleva un montón (o más) de Gysahl Greens.",
    ["Your answers and the day decide which item you're asked for: a Gold Beastcoin, Lynx Meat or a Nyumomo Doll (dropped by Orcs in present-day Batallia Downs; Treasure Hunter helps)."] = "Tus respuestas y el día deciden qué objeto te piden: una Gold Beastcoin, Lynx Meat o un Nyumomo Doll (lo sueltan los Orcs de la Batallia Downs del presente; Treasure Hunter ayuda).",
    ["Your buffs are removed upon entering the battlefield, so summon Trusts after entering."] = "Tus buffs se eliminan al entrar en el campo de batalla, así que invoca a los Trusts tras entrar.",
    ["Your elemental resistances are listed underneath your equipped gear grid. The latent is broken when the elemental resistances of the Knuckles of Trials disappear from them."] = "Tus resistencias elementales aparecen debajo de la cuadrícula de equipo. El latent está roto cuando las resistencias elementales de los Knuckles of Trials desaparecen de ellas.",
    ["Your exact path varies by starting city, but your goal is one of the twin cities of Selbina and Mhaura. (There's a ferry that runs from one city to the other three times every Vana'diel day, or once every 19 minutes and 12 seconds real time, and takes about the same time to make the trip. The correct phrase is actually \"sister cities\", because they're similar and far apart, not geographically neighboring.)"] = "Tu ruta exacta depende de tu ciudad inicial, pero tu destino es una de las ciudades gemelas, Selbina o Mhaura. (Hay un ferry que va de una a otra tres veces cada día de Vana'diel, o una vez cada 19 minutos y 12 segundos reales, y tarda más o menos eso en hacer el viaje. La expresión correcta en realidad es \"ciudades hermanas\", porque se parecen y están lejos, no son vecinas geográficas.)",
    ["Your favorite damage dealer. (If events gave you Shantotto II, use her. Otherwise, pick whoever.)"] = "Tu atacante favorito. (Si los eventos te dieron a Shantotto II, úsala. Si no, el que quieras.)",
    ["Your goal is the Sacrificial Chamber, reached through the Den of Rancor. If you have a lot of Rancor (Tonberry enmity), lower it first with the quest Everyone's Grudge in Norg: the bosses use Everyone's Rancor."] = "Tu objetivo es la Sacrificial Chamber, a la que se llega por Den of Rancor. Si tienes mucho Rancor (enemistad de los Tonberry), redúcelo antes con la quest Everyone's Grudge en Norg: los jefes usan Everyone's Rancor.",
    ["Your reward depends on how fast you finished. If your inventory was full or you already had it, make space and examine Rally Point: Green again."] = "Tu recompensa depende de lo rápido que terminaste. Si tenías el inventario lleno o ya la tenías, haz sitio y examina de nuevo el Rally Point: Green.",
    ["Your reward depends on how quickly you deliver the Chocobo. To San d'Oria: Miratete's Memoirs at 27:00 to 28:36, a Chocobo Ticket at 28:37 to 29:59, Gysahl Greens at 30:00 or more."] = "Tu recompensa depende de lo rápido que entregues el Chocobo. A San d'Oria: Miratete's Memoirs entre 27:00 y 28:36, un Chocobo Ticket entre 28:37 y 29:59, Gysahl Greens a 30:00 o más.",
    ["Your reward is a Moonshade Earring with one augment you choose from each of its two augment sets."] = "Tu recompensa es un Moonshade Earring con un aumento que eliges de cada uno de sus dos conjuntos de aumentos.",
    ["Your support job is locked; Trusts are allowed if you have Rhapsody in Umber. After you climb the stairs, Zurko-Bazurko (under 1,100 HP) attacks. Sverdheid waits in the center of the arena and doesn't attack right away, so you can buff and heal."] = "Tu support job queda bloqueado; se permiten Trusts si tienes Rhapsody in Umber. Tras subir las escaleras te ataca Zurko-Bazurko (menos de 1,100 HP). Sverdheid espera en el centro de la arena y no ataca enseguida, así que puedes potenciarte y curarte.",
    ["Your support job is removed when you enter, so you lose all buffs except food, and your TP. Maat copies your main job with Monk as his support job, including your special ability, and can use all Hand-to-Hand weapon skills. With the key item \"Rhapsody in Umber\" (Rhapsodies of Vana'diel Missions, around level 55) you can call Trusts."] = "Al entrar se te quita el support job, así que pierdes todos los buffs salvo la comida, y tu TP. Maat copia tu job principal con Monk como support job, incluida tu habilidad especial, y puede usar todos los weapon skills de Hand-to-Hand. Con el key item \"Rhapsody in Umber\" (Rhapsodies of Vana'diel Missions, hacia el nivel 55) puedes llamar a Trusts.",
    ["Yuhtunga Jungle - levels 30-34 - Ivory Lizards and Jungle Coeurls at K-8. A little awkward to navigate, but nothing extra-dangerous."] = "Yuhtunga Jungle - niveles 30-34 - Ivory Lizards y Jungle Coeurls en K-8. Algo incómoda de recorrer, pero nada especialmente peligroso.",
    ["Zdei start becoming DC-T instead of EM+ at level 83."] = "Los Zdei pasan de EM+ a DC-T a nivel 83.",
    ["Zeid II (fairly good at dealing damage, and also casts Stun on enemies)"] = "Zeid II (bastante bueno haciendo daño, y además lanza Stun a los enemigos)",
    ["Zone (logging out doesn't count), then trade the item to the Elegant Footprints to complete the mission."] = "Cambia de zona (desconectar no cuenta) y entrega el objeto a las Elegant Footprints para completar la misión.",
    ["Zone after completing A Test of True Love. You need Bastok fame level 6."] = "Cambia de zona tras completar A Test of True Love. Necesitas el nivel 6 de fama de Bastok.",
    ["Zone after completing Class Reunion. Examine the House of the Hero in Windurst Walls while your job is set to Summoner to start the quest."] = "Cambia de zona tras completar Class Reunion. Examina la House of the Hero en Windurst Walls con Summoner como job para empezar la quest.",
    ["Zone after completing Healing the Land to begin this quest."] = "Cambia de zona tras completar Healing the Land para empezar esta quest.",
    ["Zone after completing Love and Ice. You need Bastok fame level 6."] = "Cambia de zona tras completar Love and Ice. Necesitas el nivel 6 de fama de Bastok.",
    ["Zone after completing The Puppet Master. While your main job is Summoner, examine the House of the Hero in Windurst Walls for a cutscene with Carbuncle, who gives you the key item Carbuncle's Tear."] = "Cambia de zona tras completar The Puppet Master. Con Summoner como job principal, examina la House of the Hero en Windurst Walls para una escena con Carbuncle, que te da el key item Carbuncle's Tear.",
    ["Zone after finishing Forging New Bonds. As a Rune Fencer, speak with Octavien in Eastern Adoulin (I-8) for the key item Letter from Octavien."] = "Cambia de zona tras terminar Forging New Bonds. Como Rune Fencer, habla con Octavien en Eastern Adoulin (I-8) para obtener el key item Letter from Octavien.",
    ["Zone after the previous mission, then examine Heroes' Gambit (J-9) in Xarcabard for a cutscene and the Despairing psyche."] = "Cambia de zona tras la misión anterior y examina el Heroes' Gambit (J-9) de Xarcabard para una escena y el Despairing psyche.",
    ["Zone after the previous mission, then speak with Halver (I-9) for a cutscene and the Missive to Altennia."] = "Cambia de zona tras la misión anterior y habla con Halver (I-9) para una escena y el Missive to Altennia.",
    ["Zone and return to Charlaimagnat after one Earth minute for your reward, the Scroll of Teleport-Altep."] = "Cambia de zona y vuelve con Charlaimagnat tras un minuto terrestre por tu recompensa, el Scroll of Teleport-Altep.",
    ["Zone and return to Kohlo-Lakolo to receive your reward."] = "Cambia de zona y vuelve con Kohlo-Lakolo para recibir tu recompensa.",
    ["Zone and speak with Fyi Chalmwoh again to receive your reward, a mannequin matching your race and gender."] = "Cambia de zona y habla de nuevo con Fyi Chalmwoh para recibir tu recompensa, un mannequin que coincide con tu raza y género.",
    ["Zone and then speak with Tehf Kimasnahya once more to receive your reward, the Bibiki Seashell."] = "Cambia de zona y habla una vez más con Tehf Kimasnahya para recibir tu recompensa, el Bibiki Seashell.",
    ["Zone and wait until the next Vana'diel day after completing the battlefield, then talk to Gilgamesh in Norg for a cutscene to complete the quest and receive an earring of your choice."] = "Cambia de zona y espera hasta el siguiente día de Vana'diel tras completar el campo de batalla, luego habla con Gilgamesh en Norg para una escena que completa la quest y recibir un pendiente a tu elección.",
    ["Zone and wait until the next game day after Downward Helix. As a Scholar, speak with Erlene (J-8) in The Eldieme Necropolis (S); from here on any job works."] = "Cambia de zona y espera al siguiente día de juego tras Downward Helix. Como Scholar, habla con Erlene (J-8) en The Eldieme Necropolis (S); a partir de aquí sirve cualquier job.",
    ["Zone and wait until the next game day after On Sabbatical. As a Scholar, speak with Erlene (J-8) in The Eldieme Necropolis (S) for a cutscene."] = "Cambia de zona y espera al siguiente día de juego tras On Sabbatical. Como Scholar, habla con Erlene (J-8) en The Eldieme Necropolis (S) para una escena.",
    ["Zone and wait until the next game day after The Road to Divadom. As a Dancer of level 50 or higher, speak with Laila in Upper Jeuno (G-7) for a cutscene and the key item Wyatt's proposal."] = "Cambia de zona y espera al siguiente día de juego tras The Road to Divadom. Como Dancer de nivel 50 o superior, habla con Laila en Upper Jeuno (G-7) para una escena y el key item Wyatt's proposal.",
    ["Zone and wait until the next game day after The Unfinished Waltz. As a Dancer of level 50 or higher, speak with Laila in Upper Jeuno (G-7)."] = "Cambia de zona y espera al siguiente día de juego tras The Unfinished Waltz. Como Dancer de nivel 50 o superior, habla con Laila en Upper Jeuno (G-7).",
    ["Zone and wait until the next game day."] = "Cambia de zona y espera al siguiente día de juego.",
    ["Zone back into Aht Urhgan Whitegate from Al Zahbi for a cutscene."] = "Vuelve a entrar en Aht Urhgan Whitegate desde Al Zahbi para una escena.",
    ["Zone back into Bastok Markets and return to Michea to receive the key item Mythril hearts."] = "Vuelve a entrar en Bastok Markets y regresa con Michea para recibir el key item Mythril hearts.",
    ["Zone first if you have just completed Chocobilious."] = "Cambia de zona primero si acabas de completar Chocobilious.",
    ["Zone first if you have just completed Early Bird Catches the Bookworm."] = "Cambia de zona primero si acabas de completar Early Bird Catches the Bookworm.",
    ["Zone first if you have just completed Inspector's Gadget!"] = "Cambia de zona primero si acabas de completar Inspector's Gadget!",
    ["Zone first if you have just completed Know One's Onions."] = "Cambia de zona primero si acabas de completar Know One's Onions.",
    ["Zone first if you have just completed Overnight Delivery."] = "Cambia de zona primero si acabas de completar Overnight Delivery.",
    ["Zone first if you have just completed the previous quest."] = "Cambia de zona primero si acabas de completar la quest anterior.",
    ["Zone first if you have just completed the quest Truth, Justice, and the Onion Way!"] = "Cambia de zona primero si acabas de completar la quest Truth, Justice, and the Onion Way!",
    ["Zone from Southern San d'Oria [S] into East Ronfaure [S] for a cutscene. The next mission starts right after."] = "Pasa de Southern San d'Oria [S] a East Ronfaure [S] para una escena. La misión siguiente empieza justo después.",
    ["Zone in and out if you have just completed Blast from the Past."] = "Sal y vuelve a entrar en la zona si acabas de completar Blast from the Past.",
    ["Zone in and out if you have just completed Star Struck."] = "Sal y vuelve a entrar en la zona si acabas de completar Star Struck.",
    ["Zone into Aydeewa Subterrane from the Wajaom Woodlands (I-6) entrance for a cutscene. Leave Whitegate at (H-10), or take the Aydeewa Survival Guide and Escape."] = "Entra en Aydeewa Subterrane por la entrada de Wajaom Woodlands (I-6) para una escena. Sal de Whitegate por (H-10), o toma la Survival Guide de Aydeewa y usa Escape.",
    ["Zone into Beaucedine Glacier [S] for a cutscene: by its Survival Guide, your nation's Campaign Arbiter warp, or through the tunnel at the northwest end of Batallia Downs [S] (E-4)."] = "Entra en Beaucedine Glacier [S] para una escena: con su Survival Guide, con el warp del Campaign Arbiter de tu nación o por el túnel del extremo noroeste de Batallia Downs [S] (E-4).",
    ["Zone into Castle Zvahl Baileys (Survival Guide is quickest) for a cutscene."] = "Entra en Castle Zvahl Baileys (la Survival Guide es lo más rápido) para una escena.",
    ["Zone into Castle Zvahl Baileys and speak to the Shadowy Pillar (J-8) by the zone line. You drop to level 1 with Sneak, Invisible and Deodorize (3-7 minutes; bring Prism Powder and Silent Oil)."] = "Entra en Castle Zvahl Baileys y habla con el Shadowy Pillar (J-8) junto al límite de zona. Bajas a nivel 1 con Sneak, Invisible y Deodorize (3-7 minutos; lleva Prism Powder y Silent Oil).",
    ["Zone into Castle Zvahl Keep and speak to the Ominous Pillar by the zone line. It asks you to find a slacking moogle."] = "Entra en Castle Zvahl Keep y habla con el Ominous Pillar junto al límite de zona. Te pide encontrar a un moogle holgazán.",
    ["Zone into Castle Zvahl Keep and trade the Whine Cellar Key to the Ore Door at (H-7) for a cutscene and the key item Foe Finder Mk. I. Hug the right wall as you enter and go through the iron gate; it is the first Ore Door before the second iron gate."] = "Entra en Castle Zvahl Keep y entrega la Whine Cellar Key a la Ore Door de (H-7) para una escena y el key item Foe Finder Mk. I. Pégate a la pared derecha al entrar y cruza la reja de hierro; es la primera Ore Door antes de la segunda reja.",
    ["Zone into Ceizak Battlegrounds for a cutscene. (Answering \"No?\" about a dozen times gives extra dialogue and a key item, but drops your bond with Arciela to the lowest.)"] = "Entra en Ceizak Battlegrounds para una escena. (Responder \"No?\" una docena de veces da diálogo extra y un key item, pero baja tu vínculo con Arciela al mínimo.)",
    ["Zone into Ceizak Battlegrounds for a cutscene. Your Reisenjima Sanctorium orb becomes a Drained orb."] = "Entra en Ceizak Battlegrounds para una escena. Tu Reisenjima Sanctorium orb se convierte en un Drained orb.",
    ["Zone into Chateau d'Oraguille (Northern San d'Oria Home Point #2 is closest) for a cutscene with King Destin."] = "Entra en Chateau d'Oraguille (el Home Point #2 de Northern San d'Oria es el más cercano) para una escena con King Destin.",
    ["Zone into Chateau d'Oraguille for a cutscene."] = "Entra en Chateau d'Oraguille para una escena.",
    ["Zone into Chateau d'Oraguille."] = "Entra en Chateau d'Oraguille.",
    ["Zone into Crawlers' Nest from Rolanberry Fields. If you get a cutscene with a Hume female NPC named Olavia, you are ready to head out. If you do not, another team may already be on the quest, so wait a while and try zoning in again. You can summon Trusts, but zoning in with an Adventuring Fellow makes the escort NPC disappear."] = "Entra en Crawlers' Nest desde Rolanberry Fields. Si ves una escena con una NPC Hume femenina llamada Olavia, estás listo para salir. Si no, puede que otro equipo ya esté haciendo la quest, así que espera un rato y prueba a entrar otra vez. Puedes invocar Trusts, pero entrar con un Adventuring Fellow hace desaparecer al NPC escoltado.",
    ["Zone into East Ronfaure (S) from Southern San d'Oria (S) on foot for a cutscene."] = "Entra a pie en East Ronfaure (S) desde Southern San d'Oria (S) para una escena.",
    ["Zone into Fei'Yin for a cutscene."] = "Entra en Fei'Yin para una escena.",
    ["Zone into Fei'Yin from Beaucedine Glacier for a cutscene."] = "Entra en Fei'Yin desde Beaucedine Glacier para una escena.",
    ["Zone into Full Moon Fountain (Toraimarai Canal Home Point #1 is closest) for a cutscene that completes the mission."] = "Entra en Full Moon Fountain (el Home Point #1 de Toraimarai Canal es el más cercano) para una escena que completa la misión.",
    ["Zone into Ghelsba Outpost for a cutscene and the key item Orcish infiltration kit (spares from the Clandestine Marking at (I-10)). Domenic in Lower Jeuno (J-7) warps you there for 750 gil after Beyond Infinity; the Fort Ghelsba Survival Guide is right by it, or cast Escape from the Yughott Grotto Home Point."] = "Entra en Ghelsba Outpost para una escena y el key item Orcish infiltration kit (hay repuestos en la Clandestine Marking de (I-10)). Domenic en Lower Jeuno (J-7) te teletransporta allí por 750 gil tras Beyond Infinity; la Survival Guide de Fort Ghelsba está justo al lado, o lanza Escape desde el Home Point de Yughott Grotto.",
    ["Zone into Heavens Tower for a cutscene, then examine the Vestal Chamber door at the top for a cutscene with the Star Sibyl."] = "Entra en Heavens Tower para una escena y luego examina la puerta de la Vestal Chamber en lo alto para una escena con la Star Sibyl.",
    ["Zone into Heavens Tower for a short cutscene, then examine the Vestal Chamber door at the top for Rank 6 and 20,000 gil."] = "Entra en Heavens Tower para una escena corta y luego examina la puerta de la Vestal Chamber en lo alto para Rank 6 y 20,000 gil.",
    ["Zone into Jugner Forest (S) for a cutscene (the Batallia Downs (S) Survival Guide is fastest)."] = "Entra en Jugner Forest (S) para una escena (la Survival Guide de Batallia Downs (S) es lo más rápido).",
    ["Zone into La Vaule [S] from Jugner Forest [S] (G-11) for a cutscene. Fastest is the Jugner Forest [S] Survival Guide right by the entrance (or Recall-Jugner, or the Jugner Forest [S] campaign warp)."] = "Entra en La Vaule [S] desde Jugner Forest [S] (G-11) para una escena. Lo más rápido es la Survival Guide de Jugner Forest [S], justo junto a la entrada (o Recall-Jugner, o el warp de campaña de Jugner Forest [S]).",
    ["Zone into Lower Delkfutt's Tower for a cutscene."] = "Entra en Lower Delkfutt's Tower para una escena.",
    ["Zone into Lower Delkfutt's Tower from Qufim Island (or via the Survival Guide) for a cutscene."] = "Entra en Lower Delkfutt's Tower desde Qufim Island (o con la Survival Guide) para una escena.",
    ["Zone into Lower Delkfutt's Tower from Qufim Island for a cutscene. Warping to the Survival Guide also works; rezone if it doesn't trigger."] = "Entra en Lower Delkfutt's Tower desde Qufim Island para una escena. Teletransportarte a la Survival Guide también sirve; vuelve a entrar si no se activa.",
    ["Zone into Lower Jeuno for the opening cutscene."] = "Entra en Lower Jeuno para la escena inicial.",
    ["Zone into Lufaise Meadows by taking the south exit at (I-6), then head to (H-10). Clear any nearby Orcs, as they will link."] = "Cambia de zona a Lufaise Meadows por la salida sur en (I-6) y ve a (H-10). Despeja los Orcs cercanos, ya que se enlazarán.",
    ["Zone into Mamook from the Mamool Ja Staging Point exit."] = "Entra en Mamook por la salida del Mamool Ja Staging Point.",
    ["Zone into Norg and examine Gilgamesh's Oaken Door (K-8). If you haven't started Rise of the Zilart, its first mission's cutscene plays when you enter Norg."] = "Entra en Norg y examina la Gilgamesh's Oaken Door (K-8). Si no has empezado Rise of the Zilart, la escena de su primera misión se reproduce al entrar en Norg.",
    ["Zone into Northern San d'Oria for a cutscene and the Warlock's Chapeau."] = "Entra en Northern San d'Oria para una escena y el Warlock's Chapeau.",
    ["Zone into Northern San d'Oria for the Rites of Succession."] = "Entra en Northern San d'Oria para los Rites of Succession.",
    ["Zone into Northern San d'Oria."] = "Entra en Northern San d'Oria.",
    ["Zone into Oldton Movalpolos, then travel to Mine Shaft #2716 and face Chekochuk, Movamuq, Swipostik, Trikotrak, and Bugbby."] = "Entra en Oldton Movalpolos, luego viaja a la Mine Shaft #2716 y enfréntate a Chekochuk, Movamuq, Swipostik, Trikotrak y Bugbby.",
    ["Zone into Ordelle's Caves for a cutscene. The Survival Guide and the Voidwatch warp bring you to the same entrance."] = "Entra en Ordelle's Caves para ver una escena. La Survival Guide y el warp de Voidwatch te llevan a la misma entrada.",
    ["Zone into Outer Horutoto Ruins from East Sarutabaruta (H-3) and examine the Magical Gizmo on the platform in front of you (H-6) to start the battle. No Trusts."] = "Entra en Outer Horutoto Ruins desde East Sarutabaruta (H-3) y examina el Magical Gizmo de la plataforma de delante (H-6) para empezar la batalla. Sin Trusts.",
    ["Zone into Palborough Mines from North Gustaberg for a cutscene. The Abyssea - Grauberg Cavernous Maw is closest; Escape from the Palborough Mines Home Point also puts you at the entrance."] = "Entra en Palborough Mines desde North Gustaberg para una escena. El Cavernous Maw de Abyssea - Grauberg es el más cercano; Escape desde el Home Point de Palborough Mines también te deja en la entrada.",
    ["Zone into Quicksand Caves through the Altepa Gate in Western Altepa Desert (I-6)/(I-7) for a cutscene (see the Altepa Gate page if it isn't open)."] = "Entra en Quicksand Caves por la Altepa Gate de Western Altepa Desert (I-6)/(I-7) para una escena (consulta la página de la Altepa Gate si no está abierta).",
    ["Zone into Ru'Aun Gardens to unlock access to Tu'Lia."] = "Entra en Ru'Aun Gardens para desbloquear el acceso a Tu'Lia.",
    ["Zone into Ru'Aun Gardens."] = "Entra en Ru'Aun Gardens.",
    ["Zone into Sauromugue Champaign (S) from Rolanberry Fields (S) for a cutscene."] = "Entra en Sauromugue Champaign (S) desde Rolanberry Fields (S) para una escena.",
    ["Zone into Sealion's Den for a cutscene, then speak with Sueleen to go to Al'Taieu. If you get a cutscene with Sueleen instead (your first return since visiting Al'Taieu), zone back to Tavnazian Safehold and re-enter Sealion's Den for the scene with Prishe."] = "Entra en Sealion's Den para una escena y luego habla con Sueleen para ir a Al'Taieu. Si en su lugar ves una escena con Sueleen (tu primera vuelta desde que visitaste Al'Taieu), vuelve a Tavnazian Safehold y entra de nuevo en Sealion's Den para la escena con Prishe.",
    ["Zone into Southern San d'Oria (S) from East Ronfaure (S); the Survival Guide and telecrystals don't count."] = "Entra en Southern San d'Oria (S) desde East Ronfaure (S); la Survival Guide y los telecrystals no cuentan.",
    ["Zone into Southern San d'Oria for the final epilogue."] = "Entra en Southern San d'Oria para el epílogo final.",
    ["Zone into Wajaom Woodlands from the Whitegate stairwell at (G/H-10), head south and enter the Aydeewa Subterrane at (K-9). Examine the unnamed spot by the pond at (H-7) for a cutscene (the Phlebotomic Slug on the upper step won't aggro)."] = "Entra en Wajaom Woodlands por la escalera de Whitegate en (G/H-10), ve al sur y entra en Aydeewa Subterrane por (K-9). Examina el punto sin nombre junto al estanque en (H-7) para una escena (el Phlebotomic Slug del escalón superior no ataca).",
    ["Zone into Windurst Walls from Windurst Woods or Windurst Waters (not the Mog House or a Home Point) for the final cutscene with Shantotto."] = "Entra en Windurst Walls desde Windurst Woods o Windurst Waters (no desde la Mog House ni un Home Point) para la última escena con Shantotto.",
    ["Zone into Windurst Walls from Windurst Woods or Windurst Waters for a cutscene. Entering any other way (Mog House, Home Point) doesn't trigger it."] = "Entra en Windurst Walls desde Windurst Woods o Windurst Waters para una escena. Entrar de cualquier otra forma (Mog House, Home Point) no la activa.",
    ["Zone into Xarcabard [S] for a cutscene."] = "Entra en Xarcabard [S] para una escena.",
    ["Zone into Xarcabard for a cutscene that hints you to look near Castle Zvahl Baileys (the Castle Zvahl Baileys Survival Guide is closest)."] = "Entra en Xarcabard para una escena que te sugiere buscar cerca de Castle Zvahl Baileys (la Survival Guide de Castle Zvahl Baileys es la más cercana).",
    ["Zone into Xarcabard for a cutscene. The Survival Guide and Teleport-Vahzl both work."] = "Entra en Xarcabard para una escena. Sirven tanto la Survival Guide como Teleport-Vahzl.",
    ["Zone into Zeruhn Mines from Bastok Mines for a cutscene. (Optional: Rasmus at (I-6) and Makarim at (H-11) have extra dialogue.)"] = "Entra en Zeruhn Mines desde Bastok Mines para una escena. (Opcional: Rasmus en (I-6) y Makarim en (H-11) tienen diálogo extra.)",
    ["Zone into any area of San d'Oria, Bastok or Windurst that has a Mog House entrance for a cutscene and the Song of hope."] = "Entra en cualquier zona de San d'Oria, Bastok o Windurst que tenga entrada a la Mog House para una escena y la Song of hope.",
    ["Zone into any of the three starting nations for a cutscene with Iroha."] = "Entra en cualquiera de las tres naciones iniciales para una escena con Iroha.",
    ["Zone into the Hall of the Gods for a cutscene. Fastest: the Ro'Maeve Survival Guide, or the Voidwatch warp to Hall of the Gods. Zoning back in from Ru'Aun Gardens also works. Unity Warp (level 125) puts you at Ro'Maeve's southern entrance."] = "Entra en Hall of the Gods para una escena. Lo más rápido: la Survival Guide de Ro'Maeve, o el warp de Voidwatch a Hall of the Gods. Volver a entrar desde Ru'Aun Gardens también sirve. El Unity Warp (nivel 125) te deja en la entrada sur de Ro'Maeve.",
    ["Zone into the Hazhalm Testing Grounds from Caedarva Mire Map 1 (D-9) for a cutscene. Caedarva Mire Home Point #1 is closest (or Nashmau's west exit)."] = "Entra en Hazhalm Testing Grounds desde el mapa 1 de Caedarva Mire (D-9) para una escena. El Home Point #1 de Caedarva Mire es el más cercano (o la salida oeste de Nashmau).",
    ["Zone into the Spire of Vahzl at (F-8). You can only cross to the Web of Recollections if you got all three flux cutscenes."] = "Entra en la Spire of Vahzl por (F-8). Solo puedes cruzar a la Web of Recollections si viste las tres escenas de flux.",
    ["Zone out and back in again, then speak with Ronan to complete the quest."] = "Sal de la zona y vuelve a entrar, luego habla con Ronan para completar la quest.",
    ["Zone out and back in and wait for the game day to change. Return to both patches of mushrooms between 04:00 and 06:00 game time to harvest young Scourshrooms. You need at least 2 young Scourshrooms to complete the quest."] = "Cambia de zona y vuelve a entrar y espera a que cambie el día de juego. Vuelve a ambas matas de hongos entre las 04:00 y las 06:00 hora del juego para recoger Scourshrooms jóvenes. Necesitas al menos 2 Scourshrooms jóvenes para completar la quest.",
    ["Zone out and back, and speak with Shantotto again. Answer her first question either way, and the second with \"No way! Not on your life!\" (title Tarutaru Murder Suspect)."] = "Sal de la zona y vuelve, y habla de nuevo con Shantotto. Responde a su primera pregunta como quieras, y a la segunda con \"No way! Not on your life!\" (título Tarutaru Murder Suspect).",
    ["Zone out of Heavens Tower first if you have just completed Recollections."] = "Sal primero de Heavens Tower si acabas de completar Recollections.",
    ["Zone out of Heavens Tower first if you have just completed The Three Magi."] = "Sal primero de Heavens Tower si acabas de completar The Three Magi.",
    ["Zone out of Norg, then return to Jaucribaix for your reward, the Myochin Kabuto, and the title Paragon of Samurai Excellence. You can toss the Banishing Charm after completing the quest, as it serves no further purpose."] = "Sal de Norg y vuelve con Jaucribaix por tu recompensa, el Myochin Kabuto, y el título Paragon of Samurai Excellence. Puedes tirar el Banishing Charm al completar la quest, porque ya no sirve de nada.",
    ["Zone out of and back into your Mog House, then wait some time (between 10 and 15 real-world minutes)."] = "Sal de tu Mog House y vuelve a entrar, luego espera un tiempo (entre 10 y 15 minutos reales).",
    ["Zone to West Ronfaure and look for Aaveleon at (G-6)."] = "Cambia de zona a West Ronfaure y busca a Aaveleon en (G-6).",
    ["Zone, then return to Magriffon, who gives you a Treasure map key item."] = "Cambia de zona y vuelve con Magriffon, que te da un key item Treasure map.",
    ["Zoning into Boneyard Gully gives a cutscene and the key item Map of the Attohwa Chasm (if you don't have it)."] = "Entrar en Boneyard Gully da una escena y el key item Map of the Attohwa Chasm (si no lo tienes).",
    ["Zoning resets your count; each kill tells you how many remain."] = "Cambiar de zona reinicia la cuenta; cada muerte te dice cuántos quedan.",
    ["a relative comparison of the monster's evasion and defense to your accuracy and attack."] = "una comparación relativa de la evasión y la defensa del monstruo con tu precisión y tu ataque.",
    ["and finally arrive in Windurst"] = "y por fin llegar a Windurst",
    ["another Trust slot in your party"] = "otro hueco de Trust en tu grupo",
    ["becomes"] = "se convierte en",
    ["blue Seed Afterglow."] = "Seed Afterglow azul.",
    ["cerulean Seed Afterglow."] = "Seed Afterglow cerúleo.",
    ["go back to Selbina"] = "volver a Selbina",
    ["golden Seed Afterglow."] = "Seed Afterglow dorado.",
    ["green Seed Afterglow."] = "Seed Afterglow verde.",
    ["mess with your settings (the option for this is \"Config\")"] = "toquetear la configuración (la opción es \"Config\")",
    ["open your inventory (Ctrl-I also works)"] = "abrir tu inventario (Ctrl-I también funciona)",
    ["orange Seed Afterglow."] = "Seed Afterglow naranja.",
    ["red Seed Afterglow."] = "Seed Afterglow rojo.",
    ["see random information that you need once every ten hours (like \"Profile\" and \"Conquest\")"] = "ver información diversa que necesitas una vez cada diez horas (como \"Profile\" y \"Conquest\")",
    ["show a map (typing \"/map'\" in the chat box and hitting enter also works)"] = "ver un mapa (escribir \"/map'\" en el chat y pulsar Intro también funciona)",
    ["silver Seed Afterglow."] = "Seed Afterglow plateado.",
    ["take the boat to Mhaura"] = "tomar el barco a Mhaura",
    ["the ability to buy Silent Oil and Prism Powder at any Curio Vendor Moogle (a consumable, non-magical, source of Sneak and Invisible for exploration)"] = "la posibilidad de comprar Silent Oil y Prism Powder en cualquier Curio Vendor Moogle (una fuente consumible y no mágica de Sneak e Invisible para explorar)",
    ["the target's level and a comparison to yours"] = "el nivel del objetivo comparado con el tuyo",
    ["trade with NPCs and other players"] = "comerciar con NPCs y otros jugadores",
    ["view and change your equipment (Ctrl-E also works)"] = "ver y cambiar tu equipo (Ctrl-E también funciona)",
    ["walk Mhaura > Buburimu Peninsula > Tahrongi Canyon > East Sarutabaruta"] = "caminar Mhaura > Buburimu Peninsula > Tahrongi Canyon > East Sarutabaruta",
    ["white Seed Afterglow."] = "Seed Afterglow blanco.",
